UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectivetext1` = '瘟疫食屍鬼 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 58;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把暴風城護甲標記交給薩拉‧迪博雷恩。", Objectives AC enUS : "Give Sara Timberlain the Stormwind Armor Marker." ; Wowhead enUS : "Give Sara Timberlain the Stormwind Armor Marker.",  OLD Details : "為了表彰你的智慧和勇敢，我把這個標記給你，用在護甲上應該很不錯。我要你帶著它去找東谷伐木場的薩拉‧迪博雷恩。將標記交給她，她會為你做件合適的護甲。收到護甲之後，將它用在保衛艾爾文森林的大小戰鬥吧，$n。$B$B東谷伐木場就在這哨站的東面，過橋的位置。", Details AC enUS : "For your shrewdness and valor, I have a marker here that is good for one piece of armor.  I want you to take it to Sara Timberlain at the Eastvale Logging Camp.  Give her the marker, and she will fashion the armor for you.  And after you receive it, $N, use it in the defense of Elwynn.$B$BThe Eastvale Logging Camp is beyond Guard Thomas' post to the east." ; Wowhead enUS : "For your shrewdness and valor, I have a marker here that is good for one piece of armor. I want you to take it to Sara Timberlain at the Eastvale Logging Camp. Give her the marker, and she will fashion the armor for you. And after you receive it, $n, use it in the defense of Elwynn.$b$bThe Eastvale Logging Camp is beyond Guard Thomas' post to the east."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把暴風城護甲標記交給薩拉·迪博雷恩。', `Details` = '為了表彰你的智慧和勇敢，我把這個標記給你，用在護甲上應該很不錯。你把它交給東谷伐木場的薩拉·迪博雷恩，她會為你做件合適的護甲。這件護甲在你為保衛艾爾文森林作戰時應該用得到。$b$b東谷伐木場就在衛兵湯瑪斯所在的哨所的東面。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 59;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "幫閃金鎮的威廉‧匹斯特收集8支大蠟燭。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 8 Large Candles to William Pestle in Goldshire." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 8 Large Candles to William Pestle in Goldshire.",  OLD Details : "你好，$g親愛的先生:尊貴的女士;!你有時間嗎?$B$B我和我兄弟在暴風城開了間藥店，我現在正在這一帶收集些大蠟燭，以便提取其中的蠟。你能幫助我嗎?$B$B你可以在狗頭人的身上找到大蠟燭，我聽說在艾爾文森林的礦坑一帶有很多狗頭人...在南邊的法戈第礦坑和東邊的玉石礦坑裡也有不少。我建議你去這兩個礦坑裡看看。", Details AC enUS : "Hello, $ggood sir:my lady;!  Do you have a moment?$B$BMy brother and I run an apothecary in Stormwind, and I'm here to gather large candles for their wax.  Can you help me?$B$BYou can get large candles from kobolds, and I hear rumors that kobolds are infesting the Elwynn mines ... the Fargodeep mine to the south and Jasperlode Mine to the east.  I suggest looking for candles in one of those places." ; Wowhead enUS : "Hello, $ggood sir:my lady! Do you have a moment?$b$bMy brother and I run an apothecary in Stormwind, and I'm here to gather large candles for their wax. Can you help me?$b$bYou can get large candles from kobolds, and I hear rumors that kobolds are infesting the Elwynn mines ... the Fargodeep mine to the south and Jasperlode Mine to the east. I suggest looking for candles in one of those places."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '幫閃金鎮的威廉·匹斯特收集8支大蠟燭。', `Details` = '你好，$g親愛的先生:尊貴的女士!你有時間嗎?$b$b我和我兄弟在暴風城開了間藥店，我現在正在這一帶收集些大蠟燭，以便提取其中的蠟。你能幫助我嗎?$b$b你可以在狗頭人的身上找到大蠟燭，我聽說在艾爾文森林的礦坑一帶有很多狗頭人……在南邊的法戈第礦坑和東邊的玉石礦坑裡也有不少。我建議你去這兩個礦坑裡看看。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 60;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我兄弟摩根正在暴風城等我送蠟燭過去，但我實在忙得抽不開身。如果你願意把這批貨物送過去給他，他會重金酬謝你的。$B$B我已經把蠟燭裝好了，你可以在暴風城貿易區的匹斯特藥劑店找到摩根。", Details AC enUS : "My brother Morgan is waiting in Stormwind for my shipment of candles.  I don't have enough time to make the trip myself, but if you'd like to take him the shipment, he'll pay you well.$B$BI've packed up the candles, and you can find Morgan in our shop, Pestle's Apothecary, in the Stormwind Trade District." ; Wowhead enUS : "My brother Morgan is waiting in Stormwind for my shipment of candles. I don't have enough time to make the trip myself, but if you'd like to take him the shipment, he'll pay you well.$b$bI've packed up the candles, and you can find Morgan in our shop, Pestle's Apothecary, in the Stormwind Trade District."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我兄弟摩根正在暴風城等我送蠟燭過去，但我實在忙得抽不開身。如果你願意把這批貨物送過去給他，他會重金酬謝你的。$b$b我已經把蠟燭裝好了，你可以在暴風城貿易區的匹斯特藥劑店找到摩根。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 61;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "出問題的還不止北郡的礦坑!我接到報告說艾爾文森林的法戈第礦坑已經成了狗頭人的天堂。$B$B去那裡查看一下這些報告是否屬實，然後回來告訴我。法戈第礦坑就在閃金鎮的正南方，斯通菲爾德農場和馬科倫農場之間。", Details AC enUS : "The mine in Northshire isn't the only one with problems!  I have reports that the Fargodeep Mine in Elwynn has also become a haven for Kobolds.$B$BExplore the mine and confirm these reports, then return to me.  The mine is almost due south of Goldshire, between the Stonefield and Maclure homesteads." ; Wowhead enUS : "The mine in Northshire isn't the only one with problems! I have reports that the Fargodeep Mine in Elwynn has also become a haven for Kobolds.$b$bExplore the mine and confirm these reports, then return to me. The mine is almost due south of Goldshire, between the Stonefield and Maclure homesteads."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '出問題的還不止北郡的礦坑!我接到報告說艾爾文森林的法戈第礦坑已經成了狗頭人的天堂。$b$b去那裡查看一下這些報告是否屬實，然後回來告訴我。法戈第礦坑就在閃金鎮的正南方，斯通菲爾德農場和馬科倫農場之間。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 62;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "那群自稱為迪菲亞兄弟會的流寇賊子，將我們這些善良的平民趕離西部荒野，他們一定要為自己的罪行負責!我要求你去打探一下，我們必須知道到底誰是他們的頭兒，還有他們都藏在哪兒。在湖畔鎮的旅館裡有個叫威利的小賊以前欠了我一個人情，你可以找他幫忙。$b$b到艾爾文森林東邊的赤脊山去吧，湖畔鎮就那座山的腳下，到那裡去碰碰運氣。", Details AC enUS : "The band of wretches responsible for driving the good people of Westfall from the land call themselves The Defias Brotherhood.  I need you to infiltrate this clan of thugs.  We need to know who heads up the cartel and where they are hiding out.  In Lakeshire, in the inn, there is a rogue by the name of Wiley who owes me a favor.$b$bTravel to Lakeshire in the Redridge Mountains, east of Elwynn, and find out what you can." ; Wowhead enUS : "The band of wretches responsible for driving the good people of Westfall from the land call themselves The Defias Brotherhood. I need you to infiltrate this clan of thugs. We need to know who heads up the cartel and where they are hiding out. In Lakeshire, in the inn, there is a rogue by the name of Wiley who owes me a favor.$b$bTravel to Lakeshire in the Redridge Mountains, east of Elwynn, and find out what you can."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '那群自稱為迪菲亞兄弟會的流寇賊子將我們這些善良的平民趕離西部荒野，他們一定要為自己的罪行負責!我要求你去打探一下，我們必須知道到底誰是他們的頭兒，還有他們都藏在哪兒。在湖畔鎮的旅館裡有個叫威利的小賊以前欠了我一個人情，你可以找他幫忙。$b$b到艾爾文森林東邊的赤脊山去吧，湖畔鎮就那座山的腳下，到那裡去碰碰運氣。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 65;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "去夜色鎮大廳找到書記員達爾塔。", Objectives AC enUS : "Seek out the Clerk Daltry in the Darkshire Town Hall." ; Wowhead enUS : "Seek out the Clerk Daltry in the Darkshire Town Hall.",  OLD Details : "昨夜，一陣突如其來的不安掠過我的全身，令我感到我的孫女奧利薩正處在巨大的危機中。我用紙牌進行了占卜，“死神”在桌上凝視著我。$b$b在長時間的沉思之後，我找到了這個可怕而神秘的事情的一點線索，有一個名字進入了我的腦中，那就是“斯塔文”。$b$b到城鎮大廳裡去找書記員達爾塔吧，看看你能否得到更多關於這個斯塔文的資訊……我擔心包括你我在內的所有人都有危險。", Details AC enUS : "Last night a horrible disturbance rippled through my veins.  I sensed that my granddaughter, Alyssa, was in great danger.  I consulted the cards and Death stared up at me from the table.$b$bAfter taking a long journey through a dark trance I was able to uncover a clue to this terrifying mystery.  A name came to me, the name of Stalvan.$b$bSeek out the Clerk in the Town Hall and see if you can find out more about this character.  I fear for us all." ; Wowhead enUS : "Last night a horrible disturbance rippled through my veins. I sensed that my granddaughter, Alyssa, was in great danger. I consulted the cards and Death stared up at me from the table.$b$bAfter taking a long journey through a dark trance I was able to uncover a clue to this terrifying mystery. A name came to me, the name of Stalvan.$b$bSeek out the Clerk in the Town Hall and see if you can find out more about this character. I fear for us all."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '去夜色鎮大廳找書記員達特利。', `Details` = '昨夜，一陣突如其來的不安掠過我的全身，我感到我的孫女艾莉莎正處在巨大的危機中。我用紙牌進行占卜，結果「死神」這張牌在桌上凝視著我。$b$b在長時間的沉思之後，我找到了這個可怕而神秘事件的一點線索，有一個名字浮現在我的腦中，那就是「斯塔文」。$b$b到城鎮大廳裡去找書記員達爾塔吧，看看你能否得到更多關於斯塔文的資訊……我擔心包括你我在內的所有人都有危險。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 66;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "[DEPRECATED]斯塔文的傳說", Title AC enUS : "The Legend of Stalvan" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Legend of Stalvan",  OLD Details : "斯塔文?讓我查查鎮裡的記錄。$b$b斯塔文...斯塔文...讓我找找...啊，找到了!這裡有份斯塔文·密斯特曼托的檔案。記錄上最後地址是在月溪鎮的學校裡。哎呀，都是過時的東西了!$b$b朋友，你能幫我個忙嗎?如果你碰巧路過月溪鎮的話，也許能找到一些有關這個傢伙的新消息，別忘了告訴我一聲，好讓我更新檔案。", Details AC enUS : "Stalvan, eh?  Let me check the town registry.$b$bStalvan. . .Stalvan. . .let's see.  Ah, here we go!  I have a record of a Mr. Stalvan Mistmantle.  The last recorded address is the Moonbrook Schoolhouse.  My, talk about outdated!$b$bDo me a favor will you, friend?  If you happen to go out to Moonbrook, let me know if you get any update on this fellow.  I like to keep the records clean." ; Wowhead enUS : "Stalvan, eh? Let me check the town registry.$b$bStalvan. . .Stalvan. . .let's see. Ah, here we go! I have a record of a Mr. Stalvan Mistmantle. The last recorded address is the Moonbrook Schoolhouse. My, talk about outdated!$b$bDo me a favor will you, friend? If you happen to go out to Moonbrook, let me know if you get any update on this fellow. I like to keep the records clean."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '斯塔文的傳說', `Details` = '斯塔文?讓我查查鎮裡的記錄。$b$b斯塔文…斯塔文…讓我找找……啊，找到了!這裡有份斯塔文·密斯特曼托的檔案。記錄上最後地址是在月溪鎮的學校裡。哎呀，都是過時的東西了!$b$b朋友，你能幫我個忙嗎?如果你碰巧路過月溪鎮的話，也許能找到一些有關這個傢伙的新消息，別忘了告訴我一聲，好讓我更新檔案。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 67;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把複滿灰塵的信交給書記員達爾塔。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take the Dusty Unsent Letter to Clerk Daltry." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take the Dusty Unsent Letter to Clerk Daltry.",  OLD Details : "你在舊提箱裡找到了一封複滿灰塵的信。", Details AC enUS : "You find a Dusty Unsent Letter in the old footlocker." ; Wowhead enUS : "You find a Dusty Unsent Letter in the old footlocker."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把覆滿灰塵的信交給書記官達特利。', `Details` = '你在舊手提箱裡找到了一封覆滿灰塵的信。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 68;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "[DEPRECATED]斯塔文的傳說", Title AC enUS : "The Legend of Stalvan" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Legend of Stalvan"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '斯塔文的傳說', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 69;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "從箱子中拿出斯塔文的未寄出的信，把它送到暴風城的運河區。", Objectives AC enUS : "Retrieve Stalvan's Undelivered Letter from the chest and deliver it to the Canal District in Stormwind." ; Wowhead enUS : "Retrieve Stalvan's Undelivered Letter from the chest and deliver it to the Canal District in Stormwind.",  OLD Details : "斯塔文的名字讓我想起點什麼…哦，想起來了！$b$b很多年前的一個雷雨交加的夜晚，有個信差到這兒來過夜避雨。快到午夜12點的時候，他一邊尖叫著一邊從樓上跑下來，蒼白的臉上滿是惶恐的神色，最後他穿著睡衣逃進了瓢潑的大雨中。$b$b由於走得太匆忙，他忘了拿走樓上箱子裡的信，不過後來也沒有再回來取過。喏，這一封是寫給斯塔文的一個住在暴風城運河區的朋友的，你自己拿去看吧。", Details AC enUS : "The name Stalvan rings a bell.  I remember now.$b$bMany years back, on a stormy night, a messenger came in, seeking refuge for the night.  Near the stroke of midnight, the man ran down the stairs screaming, his face pale with fear.  Still wearing his bedclothes, he disappeared into the downpour.$b$bIn his haste he forgot his letters in the chest upstairs.  He never returned for them. One remains from that Stalvan fellow, intended for the Canal District in Stormwind.  Help yourself to it." ; Wowhead enUS : "The name Stalvan rings a bell. I remember now.$b$bMany years back, on a stormy night, a messenger came in, seeking refuge for the night. Near the stroke of midnight, the man ran down the stairs screaming, his face pale with fear. Still wearing his bedclothes, he disappeared into the downpour.$b$bIn his haste he forgot his letters in the chest upstairs. He never returned for them. One remains from that Stalvan fellow, intended for the Canal District in Stormwind. Help yourself to it."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '從箱子中拿走斯塔文未寄出的信，把它送到暴風城的運河區。', `Details` = '斯塔文這個名字讓我想起點什麼…哦，我想起來了!$b$b很多年前的一個雷雨交加的夜晚，有個信差到這兒來借宿。快到午夜12點的時候，他一邊尖叫著一邊從樓上跑下來，蒼白的臉上滿是惶恐的神情，最後他穿著睡衣消失在傾盆的大雨中。$b$b由於走得太匆忙，他忘了拿走樓上箱子裡的信。他後來也沒有再回來拿走。其中一封就是那斯塔文寫給一個住在暴風城運河區的朋友的信，你自己拿去看吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 70;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我父親從前是這幢宅子的管家，在那場大屠殺之後，他費了好大的工夫才把地上的血跡拖乾淨，不過這跟我們要談的事情沒什麼關係。$b$b弗林特雷家的基金早已經用光，現在家裡最後的財產都已經準備要拍賣掉了，那些像禿鷲一樣貪婪的徵稅官！你要是真想找些什麼資料，不妨在這堆垃圾裡找找看，天知道你能找到什麼。", Details AC enUS : "My father was the caretaker of the estate long before I was.  He had to mop the blood up after the massacre.  But that's neither here nor there.$b$bThe last funds of the Flintridge trust have dried up.  Now the last of the family possessions are headed for auction.  Blame the tax vultures.  I guess if you're really itching to learn more you're free to look through this junk.  Who knows what you might find." ; Wowhead enUS : "My father was the caretaker of the estate long before I was. He had to mop the blood up after the massacre. But that's neither here nor there.$b$bThe last funds of the Flintridge trust have dried up. Now the last of the family possessions are headed for auction. Blame the tax vultures. I guess if you're really itching to learn more you're free to look through this junk. Who knows what you might find."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我父親從前是這幢宅子的管家，在那場大屠殺之後，他費了好大的工夫才把地上的血跡清乾淨，不過這跟我們要談的事情沒什麼關係。$b$b弗林特雷家的基金早就用光了，現在家裡最後的財產也都已經準備要拍賣掉了，那些像禿鷹一樣貪婪的徵稅官!你要是真想找些什麼資料，不妨在這堆垃圾裡找找看，天知道你能找到什麼。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 72;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "你找到的這張被撕破的日記書頁給你提供了又一個線索。", Objectives AC enUS : "The Torn Journal page you discovered provides your next clue." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Torn Journal page you discovered provides your next clue.",  OLD Details : "你在箱子裡找到了幾樣東西：一些有黴味的、看上去像是傳家寶的東西，一副家庭肖像畫，一些打獵所得的戰利品和幾本舊書。在箱子底部的一個花瓶下面，你找到了一張被撕破的日記書頁。", Details AC enUS : "Inside the crate you find various objects: musty heirlooms, a family portrait, a few hunting trophies and some old books.  Near the bottom, underneath a ceramic vase, you uncover A Torn Journal Page." ; Wowhead enUS : "Inside the crate you find various objects: musty heirlooms, a family portrait, a few hunting trophies and some old books. Near the bottom, underneath a ceramic vase, you uncover A Torn Journal Page."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '你找到的這張被撕破的日記書頁又提供了你一個線索。', `Details` = '你在木箱裡找到了幾樣東西:一些有霉味的、看起來像是傳家寶的東西，一副家庭肖像畫，一些打獵所得的戰利品和幾本舊書。在木箱底部的一個花瓶下面，你找到了一頁破損的日記。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 74;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我剛搬進來的時候發現樓上的箱子裡有一捆羊皮紙，我想看看那些羊皮紙上寫了什麼，但是我的視力卻讓我只能看到一團迷濛。$B$B幫我這個快瞎了的老人一個忙吧，去檢查一下樓上箱子裡的東西，看看有沒有什麼有關那個斯塔文的資訊。我記得有一頁褪色的日記，你肯定會對它感興趣的。把它拿過來，我會盡力幫助你的。", Details AC enUS : "There was a bundle of parchments in the chest upstairs when I moved into this place.  I looked at them once when I first arrived but I gave up once the fog hazed over my peepers. $b$bDo an old, nearly-blind man a favor and check the chest upstairs for anything that might help you in your quest to discover more about this Stalvan character.  I'm pretty sure there's a faded journal page that might be of interest to you.  Bring it to me and I'll help in anyway I can." ; Wowhead enUS : "There was a bundle of parchments in the chest upstairs when I moved into this place. I looked at them once when I first arrived but I gave up once the fog hazed over my peepers.$b$bDo an old, nearly-blind man a favor and check the chest upstairs for anything that might help you in your quest to discover more about this Stalvan character. I'm pretty sure there's a faded journal page that might be of interest to you. Bring it to me and I'll help in anyway I can."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我剛搬進來的時候發現樓上的箱子裡有一捆羊皮紙，我想看看那些羊皮紙上寫了什麼，但是我的視力卻讓我只能看到一團迷濛。$b$b幫我這個快瞎了的老人一個忙吧，去檢查一下樓上箱子裡的東西，看看有沒有什麼有關那個斯塔文的資訊。我記得有一頁褪色的日記，你肯定會對它感興趣的。把它拿過來，我會盡力幫助你的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 75;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "感謝你，我們現在可以知道法戈第礦坑確實被狗頭人佔據了。現在我們還需要一個人去更遠處的玉石礦坑偵察。$B$B去查看一下玉石礦坑，確定那裡是否有狗頭人。向東沿著大路走，一直走到阿祖拉之塔，然後往北走就會看到山腳下的礦坑。", Details AC enUS : "Thanks to you we know the Fargodeep Mine is infested with kobolds.  Now we need a scout to investigate the more distant Jasperlode Mine.$B$BExplore Jasperlode and confirm any kobold presence.  To reach the mine, travel east along the road until you reach the Tower of Azora.  From the tower, head north and you'll find the mine in the foothills." ; Wowhead enUS : "Thanks to you we know the Fargodeep Mine is infested with kobolds. Now we need a scout to investigate the more distant Jasperlode Mine.$b$bExplore Jasperlode and confirm any kobold presence. To reach the mine, travel east along the road until you reach the Tower of Azora. From the tower, head north and you'll find the mine in the foothills."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '感謝你，我們現在可以知道法戈第礦坑確實被狗頭人佔據了。現在我們還需要一個人去更遠處的玉石礦坑偵察。$b$b去查看一下玉石礦坑，確定那裡是否有狗頭人。向東沿著大路走，一直走到阿祖拉之塔，然後往北走就會看到山腳下的礦坑。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 76;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把褪色的日記書頁帶給暮色森林中夜色鎮的旅店老闆斯密茨。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take the Faded Journal Page to Tavernkeep Smitts at Darkshire in Duskwood." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take the Faded Journal Page to Tavernkeep Smitts at Darkshire in Duskwood.",  OLD Details : "我知道有人可以幫你。我以前領導暴風城衛隊的時候，經常去夜色鎮的血鴉旅店喝酒。那兒的老闆斯密茨對當地的情況瞭若指掌。把這張東西給他，看看他對此有什麼說法。", Details AC enUS : "I know of someone who might be able to assist you.  Back when I was leading the Stormwind Guard, we used to get drinks at the Scarlet Raven Tavern in Darkshire.  The Innkeeper there, Smitts, was quite an expert on the local lore.  Show him this page and see what he has to say about it." ; Wowhead enUS : "I know of someone who might be able to assist you. Back when I was leading the Stormwind Guard, we used to get drinks at the Scarlet Raven Tavern in Darkshire. The Innkeeper there, Smitts, was quite an expert on the local lore. Show him this page and see what he has to say about it."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把褪色的日記內頁帶給旅店老闆史密茲。', `Details` = '我知道有誰可以幫你。我以前帶領暴風城衛隊的時候，經常去夜色鎮的血鴉旅店喝酒。那兒的老闆史密茲對當地的情況瞭若指掌。把這張東西給他，看看他有什麼看法。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 78;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把沾滿泥汙的日記書頁交給指揮官阿勒泰婭·埃伯洛克。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take the muddy page to Commander Ebonlocke." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take the muddy page to Commander Ebonlocke.",  OLD Details : "多年來我一直在追尋這個斯塔文的消息。幾年前那些來訪的貴族被殺之後，我曾和哈迦德一起去調查。我發現了這些沾滿泥汙的紙，但是一直沒有都想到把這上面的筆跡和樹林裡的那個瘋子聯繫在一起。你提供的線索證明了他的罪行。趕快把這個交給指揮官阿勒泰婭·埃伯洛克，告訴她你所發現的一切。", Details AC enUS : "I followed the legend of that Stalvan character for years.  When those visiting nobles were slaughtered a few years back I went with Haggard to investigate.  I found these muddy pages but we were never able to link the handwriting to that crazy man in the woods.  Your trail of evidence proves his guilt.  Take this to Commander Ebonlocke immediately and fill her in on what you've discovered!" ; Wowhead enUS : "I followed the legend of that Stalvan character for years. When those visiting nobles were slaughtered a few years back I went with Haggard to investigate. I found these muddy pages but we were never able to link the handwriting to that crazy man in the woods. Your trail of evidence proves his guilt. Take this to Commander Ebonlocke immediately and fill her in on what you've discovered!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把沾滿淤泥的日記內頁交給指揮官奧瑟·埃伯洛克。', `Details` = '多年來我一直在追尋這個斯塔文的消息。幾年前那些來訪的貴族被殺之後，我曾和哈迦德一起去調查。我發現了這些沾滿淤泥的日記，但是一直沒有辦法把這上面的筆跡和樹林裡的那個瘋子聯在一起。你提供的線索證明了他的罪行。趕快把這個交給指揮官奧瑟·埃伯洛克，告訴她你所發現的一切。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 79;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "優質亞麻製品", Title AC enUS : "Red Linen Goods" ; Wowhead enUS : "Red Linen Goods",  OLD Objectives : "將6個亞麻碎布帶給東谷伐木場的薩拉‧迪博雷恩。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 6 Red Linen Bandanas to Sara Timberlain at the Eastvale Logging Camp." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 6 Red Linen Bandanas to Sara Timberlain at the Eastvale Logging Camp.",  OLD Details : "在艾爾文森林的盜賊身上可以找到一些碎布，這些碎布能讓我拿來做成優質亞麻製品。$B$B給我帶來這些亞麻碎布，我會用它們來做些東西給你。$B$B你在艾爾文森林裡到處都能找到這些不法之徒。", Details AC enUS : "The Defias gang in Northshire wears burlap masks, but the Defias in Elwynn wear linen which I can use to make fine linen goods.$B$BBring me red linen bandanas and I'll use them to fashion something for you.$B$BDefias gang members have camps pocketed throughout Elwynn." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Defias gang in Northshire wears burlap masks, but the Defias in Elwynn wear linen which I can use to make fine linen goods.$b$bBring me red linen bandanas and I'll use them to fashion something for you.$b$bDefias gang members have camps pocketed throughout Elwynn."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '紅色亞麻布', `Objectives` = '帶去6塊紅色亞麻布頭巾給東谷伐木場的薩拉·迪博雷恩。', `Details` = '北郡的迪菲亞盜賊戴的是粗麻布頭巾，而艾爾文森林的迪菲亞盜賊戴的則是亞麻布做的，我可以用這些亞麻布做些不錯的東西。$b$b給我些亞麻布頭巾，我就可以做點什麼給你。$b$b迪菲亞盜賊在整個艾爾文森林地區都有營地。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 83;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把豬肉餡餅帶給馬科倫農場的比利‧馬科倫。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring the Pork Belly Pie to Billy Maclure at the Maclure Vineyards." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the Pork Belly Pie to Billy Maclure at the Maclure Vineyards."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把豬肉餡餅帶給馬科倫農場的比利·馬科倫。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 84;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "和比利‧馬科倫談話。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Billy Maclure." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Billy Maclure.",  OLD Details : "我的項鍊不見了，一定是那個討厭鬼比利‧馬科倫拿走的!他總是像隻老鼠一樣在東邊的馬科倫農場裡竄來竄去。$B$B請把我的項鍊拿回來給我，讓我這可憐的寡婦得到一些安慰吧。", Details AC enUS : "I lost my necklace, and think that guttersnipe Billy Maclure took it!  He's usually scuttling like a rat around the Maclure vineyards east of here. $B$BGet my necklace back for me, and you'll warm an old widow's heart." ; Wowhead enUS : "I lost my necklace, and think that guttersnipe Billy Maclure took it! He's usually scuttling like a rat around the Maclure vineyards east of here.$b$bGet my necklace back for me, and you'll warm an old widow's heart."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '和比利·馬科倫談話。', `Details` = '我的項鍊不見了，一定是那個討厭鬼比利·馬科倫拿走的!他總是像隻老鼠一樣在東邊的馬科倫農場裡竄來竄去。$b$b請把我的項鍊拿回來給我，讓我這可憐的寡婦得到一些安慰吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 85;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "帶4塊大塊野豬肉給斯通菲爾德農場的波尼斯‧斯通菲爾德姑媽。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 4 Chunks of Boar Meat to Auntie Bernice Stonefield at the Stonefield's Farm." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 4 Chunks of Boar Meat to Auntie Bernice Stonefield at the Stonefield's Farm.",  OLD Details : "給我吃點餡餅，也許我就能想起來是誰拿走項鍊了。我知道另一個農場裡的波尼斯老太太做的豬肉餡餅很好吃...$B$B我們的農場周圍有野豬，如果你能找到幾塊大塊野豬肉，再把你要什麼告訴她，她就應該會給你烤一塊餡餅。", Details AC enUS : "Maybe if I got a pie, I could tell you who has that necklace.  And you know, I think that old Bernice lady at that other farm makes great Pork Belly Pies... $B$BMaybe if you gave her some chunks of boar meat from the boars that hang around our farms, and told her what it was for, she'd bake up a pie for you." ; Wowhead enUS : "Maybe if I got a pie, I could tell you who has that necklace. And you know, I think that old Bernice lady at that other farm makes great Pork Belly Pies...$b$bMaybe if you gave her some chunks of boar meat from the boars that hang around our farms, and told her what it was for, she'd bake up a pie for you."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '帶4塊野豬肉給斯通菲爾德農場的波尼斯·斯通菲爾德姑媽。', `Details` = '給我吃點餡餅，也許我就能想起來是誰拿走項鍊了。我知道另一個農場裡的波尼斯老太太做的豬肉餡餅很好吃……$b$b我們的農場周圍有野豬，如果你能給她找幾塊野豬肉，她就應該會給你烤一塊餡餅。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 86;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把波尼斯的項鍊帶給斯通菲爾德農場的波尼斯‧斯通菲爾德。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring Bernice's Necklace to "Auntie" Bernice Stonefield at the Stonefield Farm." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring Bernice's Necklace to "Auntie" Bernice Stonefield at the Stonefield Farm.",  OLD Details : "我在法戈第礦坑旁邊玩的時候，好像不小心弄掉了那條，呃...我是說我看見了老太太的那條項鍊。別問我它怎麼會跑到那兒去...和我沒有關係!$B$B不管怎樣，我看到一個很壯碩，鑲著金牙的狗頭人...撿起項鍊跑到礦坑裡了。找到那個狗頭人你就能找到項鍊!", Details AC enUS : "I was playing near the Fargodeep Mine, and I think I dropped, er...I mean I saw, the old lady's necklace.  Don't ask me how it got there...it wasn't me!$B$BWell anyway, I saw this big, gold-toothed kobold pick up the necklace and run into the mine.  Go find that kobold and you'll find the necklace, I swear!" ; Wowhead enUS : "I was playing near the Fargodeep Mine, and I think I dropped, er...I mean I saw, the old lady's necklace. Don't ask me how it got there...it wasn't me!$b$bWell anyway, I saw this big, gold-toothed kobold pick up the necklace and run into the mine. Go find that kobold and you'll find the necklace, I swear!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把波尼斯的項鍊帶給斯通菲爾德農場的波尼斯·斯通菲爾德。', `Details` = '我在法戈第礦坑旁邊玩的時候，好像不小心弄掉了那條，呃……我是說我看見了老太太的那條項鍊。別問我它怎麼會跑到那兒去……和我沒有關係!$b$b不管怎樣，我看到一個很壯碩，鑲著金牙的狗頭人……撿起項鍊跑到礦坑裡了。你去找那個狗頭人吧，我發誓，你肯定能在他身上找到項鍊的!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 87;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺掉公主，把牠的項圈帶給斯通菲爾德農場的斯通菲爾德媽媽。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill Princess, grab her collar, then bring it back to Ma Stonefield at the Stonefield Farm." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill Princess, grab her collar, then bring it back to Ma Stonefield at the Stonefield Farm.",  OLD Details : "布拉克威爾一家有一頭得過獎的豬，名叫「公主」。這頭母豬巨大無比，還經常偷偷溜到我的農場裡偷吃我的蔬菜!$B$B她又跑來我這裡啦!公主必須死!把牠的項圈帶回來證明你殺了她，我會給你一些獎賞的!$B$B公主就正在我們西瓜田的正中央大吃特吃。幹掉她!", Details AC enUS : "The Brackwells have a prize-winning pig, Princess.  The sow is HUGE, and she got that way from sneaking over here and eating my veggies!$B$BSo before she comes to our fields...Princess must die!  Bring me her collar as proof of the deed and I'll give you something for your time!$B$BPrincess is usually over at the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch, to the east and beyond the Maclure farm.  Get her before she gets hungry and comes back here!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Brackwells have a prize-winning pig, Princess. The sow is HUGE, and she got that way from sneaking over here and eating my veggies!$b$bSo before she comes to our fields...Princess must die! Bring me her collar as proof of the deed and I'll give you something for your time!$b$bPrincess is usually over at the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch, to the east and beyond the Maclure farm. Get her before she gets hungry and comes back here!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺掉公主，把它的項圈帶給斯通菲爾德農場的斯通菲爾德媽媽。', `Details` = '布拉克威爾一家有一頭得過獎的豬，它名叫「公主」。這頭母豬巨大無比，還經常偷偷溜到我的農場裡偷吃我的蔬菜!$b$b在它再次糟蹋了我的農場之前……必須把它給宰了!把它的項圈帶回來證明你殺了它，我會給你一些獎賞的!$b$b公主一般在布萊克威爾南瓜田出沒，那個南瓜田就在東邊，比馬科倫農場還要往東。在它肚子餓了之前殺死她，然後再回來告訴我!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 88;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集10塊狼肋排和暴風城特製調味料，再回夜色鎮去找格魯奧廚師。", Objectives AC enUS : "Gather 10 Lean Wolf Flanks and Stormwind Seasoning Herbs and return to Chef Grual in Darkshire." ; Wowhead enUS : "Gather 10 Lean Wolf Flanks and Stormwind Seasoning Herbs and return to Chef Grual in Darkshire."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '收集10塊狼肋排和1份暴風城特製調味料，再回夜色鎮去找格魯奧廚師。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 90;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "湖畔鎮的廚師布雷納想要5塊硬兀鷹肉，5個巨型血牙豬頭和5份香脆蜘蛛肉。", Objectives AC enUS : "Chef Breanna of Lakeshire wants five pieces of Tough Condor Meat, five Great Goretusk Snouts and five helpings of Crisp Spider Meat." ; Wowhead enUS : "Chef Breanna of Lakeshire wants five pieces of Tough Condor Meat, five Great Goretusk Snouts and five helpings of Crisp Spider Meat.",  OLD Details : "沒什麼能比烹製赤脊山燉肉更讓我高興的事了，但是現在有個小問題。自從獸人們出現之後，我就得沒日沒夜地忙著給暴風城軍隊的整整一個旅供應食物，我的食品櫃早已是空空如也了。如果你能給我找來一些材料的話，我很樂意給你做點好吃的。$b$b只要給我帶來5塊硬兀鷹肉，5個巨型血牙豬頭和5份香脆蜘蛛肉就行了。", Details AC enUS : "Nothing would please me more than to make you some Redridge Goulash. But there's a slight problem. During the recent orc uprising I fed the entire brigade of Stormwind troops. My cupboard is now bare. But if you can provide me with the ingredients, I'd be happy to oblige.$b$bJust bring me five pieces of Tough Condor Meat, five Great Goretusk Snouts and five helpings of Crisp Spider Meat." ; Wowhead enUS : "Nothing would please me more than to make you some Redridge Goulash. But there's a slight problem. During the recent orc uprising I fed the entire brigade of Stormwind troops. My cupboard is now bare. But if you can provide me with the ingredients, I'd be happy to oblige.$b$bJust bring me five pieces of Tough Condor Meat, five Great Goretusk Snouts and five helpings of Crisp Spider Meat."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '湖畔鎮的廚師布雷納想要5塊硬禿鷲肉，5個巨型血牙野豬頭和5份香脆蜘蛛肉。', `Details` = '沒什麼能比烹製赤脊山燉肉更讓我高興的事了，但是現在有個小問題。自從獸人們出現之後，我就得沒日沒夜地忙著給暴風城軍隊的整整一個旅供應食物，我的食品櫃早已是空空如也了。如果你能給我找來一些材料的話，我很樂意給你做點好吃的。$b$b只要給我帶來5塊硬禿鷲肉，5個巨型血牙野豬頭和5份香脆蜘蛛肉就行了。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 92;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我可以告訴你一個小秘密─黑「蟹」蛋糕實際上是用蜘蛛腿做的!我知道這聽起來有點噁心，不過這種蛋糕的味道絕對芳香美味而且是很好的點心!幫我找點黏糊的蜘蛛腿來，我很快就能做好給你。$B$B我聽說結網毒蜘蛛身上很容易拿到這種東西─它們的巢穴就在北邊，在山丘和小河之間。", Details AC enUS : "I'll let you in on a little secret - Dusky "Crab" Cakes are really made from spider legs!  I know it's a bit disgusting, but the cakes have a nice, tangy flavor and make great snacks!  Bring me Gooey Spider Legs and I'll whip you up a few of them.$B$BI hear Venom Web Spiders are a good source - they nest to the north, between the foothills and the river. " ; Wowhead enUS : "I'll let you in on a little secret - Dusky "Crab" Cakes are really made from spider legs! I know it's a bit disgusting, but the cakes have a nice, tangy flavor and make great snacks! Bring me Gooey Spider Legs and I'll whip you up a few of them.$b$bI hear Venom Web Spiders are a good source - they nest to the north, between the foothills and the river."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我可以告訴你一個小秘密─黑「蟹」蛋糕實際上是用蜘蛛腿做的!我知道這聽起來有點噁心，不過這種蛋糕的味道絕對芳香美味而且是很好的點心!幫我找點黏糊的蜘蛛腿來，我很快就能做好給你。$b$b我聽說結網毒蜘蛛身上很容易拿到這種東西─它們的巢穴就在北邊，在山丘和小河之間。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 93;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把阿祖拉的銘文飾品放置到赤脊山伊爾加拉之塔旁邊的獅子雕像身上。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take the Glyph of Azora to the Lion Statue near the Tower of Ilgalar in Redridge." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take the Glyph of Azora to the Lion Statue near the Tower of Ilgalar in Redridge.",  OLD Details : "我的對手莫甘斯是個強大而邪惡的法師，他就住在赤脊山的伊爾加拉之塔里。我已經找到了一種監視他的方法，只要通過阿祖拉之眼，就可以在很遠的地方看到他的一舉一動。$B$B不過要研究他的思想……我還需要進一步的説明。$B$B如果你願意的話，就帶著這個銘文飾品到伊爾加拉之塔去，把它放置在塔旁邊的獅子雕像身上。$B$B完成之後，阿祖拉的銘文飾品就會告訴我們，莫甘斯又在準備什麼邪惡的計畫。", Details AC enUS : "My rival, Morganth, is a vicious mage of great power who lives in the Tower of Ilgalar in Redridge.  I have developed a means of spying on him, the Eye of Azora, and can now view him from afar.$B$BBut to study his thoughts ... I require further aid.$B$BIf you are willing, then take my Glyph of Azora to the Tower of Ilgalar.  Place it upon the Lion Statue near the Tower.$B$BWhen this is done, the power of Azora will grant visions of Morganth's future plans." ; Wowhead enUS : "My rival, Morganth, is a vicious mage of great power who lives in the Tower of Ilgalar in Redridge. I have developed a means of spying on him, the Eye of Azora, and can now view him from afar.$b$bBut to study his thoughts ... I require further aid.$b$bIf you are willing, then take my Glyph of Azora to the Tower of Ilgalar. Place it upon the Lion Statue near the Tower.$b$bWhen this is done, the power of Azora will grant visions of Morganth's future plans."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把阿祖拉雕紋放置到赤脊山伊爾加拉之塔旁邊的獅子雕像身上。', `Details` = '我的對手莫甘斯是個強大而邪惡的法師，他就住在赤脊山的伊爾加拉之塔里。我已經找到了一種監視他的方法，只要通過阿祖拉之眼，就可以在很遠的地方看到他的一舉一動。$b$b不過要研究他的思想……我還需要進一步的幫助。$b$b如果你願意的話，就帶著這個雕紋到伊爾加拉之塔去，把它放置在塔旁邊的獅子雕像身上。$b$b完成之後，阿祖拉雕紋就會告訴我們，莫甘斯又在準備什麼邪惡的計畫。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 94;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我原來在東南部的一座農場裡工作...直到有一天，從逆風小徑來的黑騎兵洗劫了我的農場，趁我不在的時候殺了我的全家!$B$B我回來時發現有個模糊的人影在我家的穀倉附近埋了一件什麼東西，可惜我沒能抓住他。我也不敢在這裡繼續逗留，因為我害怕會有黑騎兵追蹤我。直到現在，我都都不知道那人到底藏了什麼。$B$B如果你能去找出真相，我一定會感激你的。那人埋東西的地方就在我的穀倉附近的一個老樹樁後面。", Details AC enUS : "I used to work one of the farms to the southeast...until Dark Riders from Deadwind Pass descended upon my farm and slaughtered my family when I was away!$B$BWhen I returned I saw a shadowy figure skulking near my barn, burying something.  He fled before I could catch him, and I couldn't linger for I was hot on the heels of the Dark Riders.  So I never discovered what was hidden.$B$BIf you can find what that shadowy figure buried, I would be grateful.  The hiding spot is behind the old stump near my barn." ; Wowhead enUS : "I used to work one of the farms to the southeast...until Dark Riders from Deadwind Pass descended upon my farm and slaughtered my family when I was away!$b$bWhen I returned I saw a shadowy figure skulking near my barn, burying something. He fled before I could catch him, and I couldn't linger for I was hot on the heels of the Dark Riders. So I never discovered what was hidden.$b$bIf you can find what that shadowy figure buried, I would be grateful. The hiding spot is behind the old stump near my barn."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我原來在東南部的一座農場裡工作……直到有一天，從逆風小徑來的黑騎兵洗劫了我的農場，趁我不在的時候殺了我的全家!$b$b我回來時發現有個模糊的人影在我家的穀倉附近埋了一件什麼東西，可惜我沒能抓住他。我也不敢在這裡繼續逗留，因為我害怕會有黑騎兵追蹤我。直到現在，我都都不知道那人到底藏了什麼。$b$b如果你能去找出真相，我一定會感激你的。那人埋東西的地方就在我的穀倉附近的一個老樹樁後面。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 95;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把這個消息告訴指揮官阿勒泰婭·埃伯洛克。", Objectives AC enUS : "Report the news to Commander Ebonlocke." ; Wowhead enUS : "Report the news to Commander Ebonlocke.",  OLD Details : "$N，你趕快去告訴指揮官阿勒泰婭·埃伯洛克，這兩個筆跡完全符合！她的懷疑是正確的！", Details AC enUS : "Let Commander Ebonlocke know immediately that the handwriting matched, $N!  Her suspicions were correct!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Let Commander Ebonlocke know immediately that the handwriting matched, $n! Her suspicions were correct!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把這個消息告訴指揮官埃伯洛克。', `Details` = '$n，趕快回報指揮官埃伯洛克，這兩個筆跡完全符合!她的懷疑是正確的!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 97;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "幹掉斯塔文·密斯特曼托，把他的系列戒指帶給伊瓦夫人看看。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill Stalvan Mistmantle and show Madame Eva his family ring." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill Stalvan Mistmantle and show Madame Eva his family ring.",  OLD Details : "斯塔文·密斯特曼托是個惡貫滿盈的罪犯，很多無辜的人都死在他手中。毫無疑問，他犯下了無數宗罪案，給夜色鎮帶來了又一個威脅。天知道這個惡棍又在策劃什麼邪惡的行動。斯塔文的家就在小鎮北邊，$C，你去把他就地處死吧。$b$b完事以後把他的系列戒指帶給伊瓦夫人作為證明，畢竟是她的預感導致我們揭露了這個可怕的兇手，她為夜色鎮立了一功。", Details AC enUS : "Stalvan Mistmantle led a life of depravity.  Innocent victims died by his hand.  Undoubtedly he is guilty of countless crimes.  Now the lunatic threatens Darkshire.  The Light only knows what sordid acts he is plotting.  Travel to his cottage just north of town, $C, and execute Stalvan, once and for all.$b$bWhen the deed is done, travel to Madame Eva's and show her his family ring.  After all, it was her premonition that led to this gruesome discovery.  But Darkshire is safer because of her." ; Wowhead enUS : "Stalvan Mistmantle led a life of depravity. Innocent victims died by his hand. Undoubtedly he is guilty of countless crimes. Now the lunatic threatens Darkshire. The Light only knows what sordid acts he is plotting. Travel to his cottage just north of town, $c, and execute Stalvan, once and for all.$b$bWhen the deed is done, travel to Madame Eva's and show her his family ring. After all, it was her premonition that led to this gruesome discovery. But Darkshire is safer because of her."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '幹掉斯塔文·密斯特曼托，把他的家族戒指交給艾娃夫人。', `Details` = '斯塔文·密斯特曼托是個惡貫滿盈的罪犯，很多無辜的人都死在他手中。毫無疑問，他犯下了無數宗的罪案，現在這個瘋子威脅到夜色鎮了。天知道這個惡棍又在策劃什麼邪惡的行動。斯塔文的家就在小鎮北邊，$c，為我一勞永逸，去把他就地處死吧。$b$b完成以後把他的家族戒指交給艾娃夫人作為證明，畢竟是她的預感才讓我們發現這個可怕的兇手，因為她夜色鎮才能更安全。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 98;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "帶6副焚木鐐銬給瑟伯切爾的達拉爾·織曦者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 6 Pyrewood Shackles to Dalar Dawnweaver at the Sepulcher." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 6 Pyrewood Shackles to Dalar Dawnweaver at the Sepulcher.",  OLD Details : "在我對阿魯高的魔法越來越瞭解的同時，我對這個蠢貨的鄙視與輕蔑也日益加深。我已經快要完成對他所謂的「拯救行動」研究。$B$B在我瞭解到底是什麼樣的巫術導致了焚木村的奇怪現象之後，我就算是完全瞭解透徹了。白天，那些農民們都是好端端的人。但太陽一下山，他們就變成了月怒狼人。$B$B我需要從阿魯高給他們戴上的附魔鐐銬中汲取一些能量。帶6副焚木鐐銬來給我， $N 。", Details AC enUS : "As my understanding of Arugal's magic grows so does my disdain for the hapless fool.  I am close to completing my research on his so called remedy.$b$bMy knowledge will be complete when I learn what enchantment is causing the strange behavior going on in Pyrewood Village.  By day, the peasants appear to be Human.  But when the sun goes down the townsfolk turn into Moonrage Worgen.$b$bI need to draw energy from the enchanted shackles Arugal cast on them.  Bring to me six enchanted Pyrewood Shackles, $N." ; Wowhead enUS : "As my understanding of Arugal's magic grows so does my disdain for the hapless fool. I am close to completing my research on his so called remedy.$b$bMy knowledge will be complete when I learn what enchantment is causing the strange behavior going on in Pyrewood Village. By day, the peasants appear to be Human. But when the sun goes down the townsfolk turn into Moonrage Worgen.$b$bI need to draw energy from the enchanted shackles Arugal cast on them. Bring to me six enchanted Pyrewood Shackles, $n."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '帶6副焚木鐐銬給瑟伯切爾的達拉爾·道恩維沃爾。', `Details` = '在我對阿魯高的魔法越來越瞭解的同時，我對這個蠢貨的鄙視與輕蔑也日益加深。我已經快要完成對他所謂的「拯救行動」研究。$b$b在我瞭解到底是什麼樣的巫術導致了焚木村的奇怪現象之後，我就算是完全瞭解透徹了。白天，那些農夫們都是好端端的人。但太陽一下山，他們就變成了月怒狼人。$b$b我需要從阿魯高給他們戴上的魔法鐐銬中汲取一些能量。帶6副焚木鐐銬來給我，$n。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 99;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "暴風城已經把我們給遺棄了。一股腐朽與墮落的狂風正肆虐在西部荒野的平原之上。這裡是我的故鄉，我絕對不會背叛那些和我一樣堅持留在這裡的民眾們。我們這些農夫必須站出來，為自己贏得生存的空間。$b$b若你願意接受我們派給你的任務，就去巡視西部荒野的草原吧。找到那些可惡的豺狼人，把它們除掉，這些傢伙似乎與死亡礦坑裡的小賊們有些聯繫。帶八隻豺狼人的爪子回來給我，我會獎勵你的英勇行為的。", Details AC enUS : "Stormwind has abandoned us.  A foul wind of depravity rustles through the plains of Westfall.  This was my homeland and I will not turn my back on the citizens who choose to remain here.  We, the former farmers, shall make our stand.$b$bYour task, should you choose to accept, is to patrol the grasslands of Westfall.  Track down and slay the vile Gnolls that seem to be working in conjunction with the Deadmines thieves. Bring me eight Gnoll Paws and I will reward your bravery." ; Wowhead enUS : "Stormwind has abandoned us. A foul wind of depravity rustles through the plains of Westfall. This was my homeland and I will not turn my back on the citizens who choose to remain here. We, the former farmers, shall make our stand.$b$bYour task, should you choose to accept, is to patrol the grasslands of Westfall. Track down and slay the vile Gnolls that seem to be working in conjunction with the Deadmines thieves. Bring me eight Gnoll Paws and I will reward your bravery."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '暴風城已經把我們給遺棄了。一股腐朽與墮落的狂風正肆虐在西部荒野的平原之上。這裡是我的故鄉，我絕對不會背叛那些和我一樣堅持留在這裡的民眾們。我們這些農夫必須站出來，為自己贏得生存的空間。$b$b若你願意接受我們派給你的任務，就去巡視西部荒野的草原吧。找到那些可惡的狗頭人，把它們除掉，這些傢伙似乎與死亡礦坑裡的小賊們有些聯繫。帶八隻豺狼人的爪子回來給我，我會獎勵你的英勇行為的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 102;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "長明的燈塔", Title AC enUS : "Keeper of the Flame" ; Wowhead enUS : "Keeper of the Flame",  OLD Objectives : "給西部荒野燈塔中的葛瑞森船長帶回5瓶燈油。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 5 Flasks of Oil to Captain Grayson at the Westfall Lighthouse." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 5 Flasks of Oil to Captain Grayson at the Westfall Lighthouse.",  OLD Details : "燈塔管理員一家被殺的那一個晚上實在是太可怕啦！我就那樣無助地看著老瞎眼帶著那群魚人毀了他們全家。但過去的事就讓它過去吧，我現在關心的是無盡之海中那些正把船隻駛近暗礁的水手們的生命。如今，維持著燈塔上火炬不至熄滅的任務就落在我一個人身上了。$b$b從那些收割機器人身上找來5瓶燈油吧，這樣我才能保住火炬上的火種。", Details AC enUS : "The night the Lighthouse Keeper's family died was horrible.  I watched, helpless, as Old Murk-Eye led the attack.  But what's done is done and now my concern is for the lives of the sailors on The Great Sea whose ships come close to the perilous rocks of the coastline.  With no one to keep watch on the flame the responsibility has fallen upon me.$b$bHelp me keep the torch lit by bringing me 5 flasks of oil from the Harvest Monsters." ; Wowhead enUS : "The night the Lighthouse Keeper's family died was horrible. I watched, helpless, as Old Murk-Eye led the attack. But what's done is done and now my concern is for the lives of the sailors on The Great Sea whose ships come close to the perilous rocks of the coastline. With no one to keep watch on the flame the responsibility has fallen upon me.$b$bHelp me keep the torch lit by bringing me 5 flasks of oil from the Harvest Monsters."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '火炬的守護者', `Objectives` = '帶回5瓶燈油給西部荒野燈塔中的葛瑞森船長。', `Details` = '燈塔管理員一家被殺的那一個晚上實在是太可怕啦!我只能眼睜睜地看著老瞎眼帶著那群魚人毀了他們全家，但卻幫不上任何忙。但過去的事就讓它過去吧，我現在關心的是無盡之海中那些正把船隻駛近暗礁水手們的生命。如今，維持著燈塔上火炬不熄滅的任務就落在我一個人身上了。$b$b幫我從那些收割機器人身上找來5瓶燈油吧，這樣我才能讓火炬繼續照亮下去。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 103;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "當我的生命終結在了那片岩石上之後，我根本不知道死後的世界會是怎樣的。那天晚上的燈塔一片漆黑，因為老瞎眼嚇跑了管理員全家。他們本已經逃跑了，但那天晚上他們又回來想要點亮燈塔，結果老瞎眼帶著一群野蠻的魚人突襲了燈塔。這一次，管理員的全家都在我面前無助地死去了……$b$b如果你在海岸邊看到老瞎眼的話，就殺死它，把它的鱗片給我帶回來，我會獎勵你的。", Details AC enUS : "When my life was ended upon the rocks, I had no clue what the afterlife held for me.  The Lighthouse was black that night because Old Murk-Eye had scared the keeper's family off.  They returned and re-lit the flame but Old Murk-Eye coerced the weaker minded murlocs to raid the Lighthouse with him once again.  The second time the family was not so lucky and before my eyes they perished helplessly.$b$bSlay Old Murk-Eye if you see him along the shore and bring me one of his scales and I shall reward you." ; Wowhead enUS : "When my life was ended upon the rocks, I had no clue what the afterlife held for me. The Lighthouse was black that night because Old Murk-Eye had scared the keeper's family off. They returned and re-lit the flame but Old Murk-Eye coerced the weaker minded murlocs to raid the Lighthouse with him once again. The second time the family was not so lucky and before my eyes they perished helplessly.$b$bSlay Old Murk-Eye if you see him along the shore and bring me one of his scales and I shall reward you."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '當我的生命終結在了那片岩石上之後，我根本不知道死後的世界會是怎樣的。那天晚上的燈塔一片漆黑，因為老瞎眼嚇跑了管理員全家。他們後來又回來想要點亮燈塔，但是老瞎眼迫使一群意志薄弱的魚人突襲了燈塔。這一次，管理員全家沒那麼幸運了，他們都在我面前無助地死去。$b$b如果你在海岸邊看到老瞎眼的話，就殺死它，把它的鱗片帶一片回來給我，我會獎勵你的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 104;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把阿拉基的骨匣裂片交給西瘟疫之地亡靈壁壘的高階執行官德靈頓。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring Araj's Phylactery Shard to High Executor Derrington at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring Araj's Phylactery Shard to High Executor Derrington at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",  OLD Details : "啊，進攻安多哈爾並徹底擊敗那個巫妖的時刻終於來臨了!$B$B這個城市的廢墟內就是巫妖 - 『召喚者』阿拉基統治的地方。無數的天譴軍團守護在城中心的廢墟周圍，而他的貼身隨扈守衛更是令人畏懼。你需要帶眾多的盟友前往才可能有機會成功挑戰它。$B$B消滅阿拉基，$n，從它的骨匣裡拿出一塊裂片來，作為你獲勝的證據!", Details AC enUS : "Alas, the time to attack Andorhal and drive out the lich that controls it is upon us!$B$BInside the ruins of the city is where the lich - Araj the Summoner - holds dominion.  He is guarded by numerous Scourge surrounding the remains of city's center, and his personal retinue of guardians attached to him directly is formidable.  You will need numerous allies to even stand a chance of facing him successfully.$B$BDestroy Araj, $N, and bring me a shard from his phylactery as proof!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Alas, the time to attack Andorhal and drive out the lich that controls it is upon us!$b$bInside the ruins of the city is where the lich - Araj the Summoner - holds dominion. He is guarded by numerous Scourge surrounding the remains of city's center, and his personal retinue of guardians attached to him directly is formidable. You will need numerous allies to even stand a chance of facing him successfully.$b$bDestroy Araj, $n, and bring me a shard from his phylactery as proof!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把阿拉基的骨匣裂片交給西瘟疫之地亡靈壁壘的高級執行官德靈頓。', `Details` = '啊，進攻安多哈爾並徹底擊敗那個巫妖的時刻終於來臨了!$b$b這個城市的廢墟內就是巫妖 - 『召喚者』阿拉基統治的地方。無數的天譴軍團守護在城中心的廢墟周圍，而他的貼身隨扈守衛更是令人畏懼。你需要帶眾多的盟友前往才可能有機會成功挑戰它。$b$b消滅阿拉基，$n，從它的骨匣裡拿出一塊裂片來，作為你獲勝的證據!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 105;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "送梅貝爾的情書給湯米‧喬‧斯通菲爾德。", Objectives AC enUS : "Give Maybell's Love Letter to Tommy Joe Stonefield." ; Wowhead enUS : "Give Maybell's Love Letter to Tommy Joe Stonefield.",  OLD Details : "天哪，我太痛苦了!我愛上了湯米‧喬‧斯通菲爾德，但我們兩家卻有著不共戴天的仇恨。所以我不能去見他，可是我無時無刻不在想念那張英俊的臉孔啊!$B$B請你把這封信交給湯米‧喬，他一般會在斯通菲爾德農場西邊的河流附近，他們的農場就在這裡的正西方。", Details AC enUS : "Oh, I'm cursed!  My heart belongs to Tommy Joe Stonefield, but our families are bitter enemies.  So I can't see him, even though my eyes ache to gaze upon that handsome face!$B$BPlease, take this letter and give it to Tommy Joe.  He's usually at the river to the west of the Stonefield Farm, which is due west of here." ; Wowhead enUS : "Oh, I'm cursed! My heart belongs to Tommy Joe Stonefield, but our families are bitter enemies. So I can't see him, even though my eyes ache to gaze upon that handsome face!$b$bPlease, take this letter and give it to Tommy Joe. He's usually at the river to the west of the Stonefield Farm, which is due west of here."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '送梅貝爾的情書給湯米·喬·斯通菲爾德。', `Details` = '天哪，我太痛苦了!我愛上了湯米·喬·斯通菲爾德，但我們兩家卻有著不共戴天的仇恨。所以我不能去見他，可是我無時無刻不在想念那張英俊的臉孔啊!$b$b請你把這封信交給湯米·喬，他一般會在斯通菲爾德農場西邊的河流附近，他們的農場就在這裡的正西方。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 106;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "給威廉‧匹斯特的信", Title AC enUS : "Note to William" ; Wowhead enUS : "Note to William",  OLD Objectives : "把斯通菲爾德老奶奶的字條交給威廉‧匹斯特。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take Gramma Stonefield's Note to William Pestle." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take Gramma Stonefield's Note to William Pestle.",  OLD Details : "我相信威廉‧匹斯特有瓶藥水，可以撮合這兩個年輕人!$B$B把這張字條拿給威廉，他現在正住在閃金鎮的獅王之傲旅店。", Details AC enUS : "I bet William Pestle has a potion to unite our two young lovers!$B$BHere, take this note to William.  He's staying at the Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire." ; Wowhead enUS : "I bet William Pestle has a potion to unite our two young lovers!$b$bHere, take this note to William. He's staying at the Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '給威廉·匹斯特的信', `Objectives` = '把斯通菲爾德老奶奶的字條交給威廉·匹斯特。', `Details` = '我相信威廉·匹斯特有瓶藥水，可以撮合這兩個年輕人!$b$b把這張字條拿給威廉，他現在正住在閃金鎮的獅王之傲旅店。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 107;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "求求你，$n，去和我的奶奶談一談吧。如果要找個能有辦法讓我和梅貝爾在一起的人的話，一定是奶奶。$B$B她就在我們家的屋子裡。", Details AC enUS : "Please, $N, talk with my Gramma.  If anyone can find a way to bring me together with Maybell, she can.$B$BShe's inside our house east of here." ; Wowhead enUS : "Please, $n, talk with my Gramma. If anyone can find a way to bring me together with Maybell, she can.$b$bShe's inside our house east of here."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '求求你，$n，去和我的奶奶談一談吧。如果要找個能有辦法讓我和梅貝爾在一起的人的話，一定是奶奶。$b$b她就在我們家的屋子裡。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 111;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集4片水晶海藻葉，給閃金鎮的威廉‧匹斯特。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 4 Crystal Kelp Fronds to William Pestle in Goldshire." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 4 Crystal Kelp Fronds to William Pestle in Goldshire.",  OLD Details : "我可以為梅貝爾配製一種隱形液，這樣她就可以悄悄溜出馬科倫葡萄園去見湯米‧喬。不過我需要一些水晶海藻來配製這種藥水。$B$B水晶海藻一般生長在海裡...不過有時候魚人也會收集它們。去看看水晶湖附近的魚人身上有沒有海藻，水晶湖就在閃金鎮的東邊。", Details AC enUS : "I can make an invisibility liquor for Maybell, so she can slip away from the Maclure Vineyards and go to Tommy Joe.  But to make the Liquor, I need some crystal kelp.$B$BAlthough the kelp usually grows in the ocean... sometimes murlocs collect it.  See if the murlocs near Crystal Lake have any.  Crystal Lake is just east of Goldshire." ; Wowhead enUS : "I can make an invisibility liquor for Maybell, so she can slip away from the Maclure Vineyards and go to Tommy Joe. But to make the Liquor, I need some crystal kelp.$b$bAlthough the kelp usually grows in the ocean... sometimes murlocs collect it. See if the murlocs near Crystal Lake have any. Crystal Lake is just east of Goldshire."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '收集4片水晶海藻葉，給閃金鎮的威廉·匹斯特。', `Details` = '我可以為梅貝爾配製一種隱形液，這樣她就可以悄悄溜出馬科倫葡萄園去見湯米·喬。不過我需要一些水晶海藻來配製這種藥水。$b$b水晶海藻一般生長在海裡……不過有時候魚人也會收集它們。去看看水晶湖附近的魚人身上有沒有海藻，水晶湖就在閃金鎮的東邊。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 112;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把隱形液交給梅貝爾‧馬科倫。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take the Invisibility Liquor to Maybell Maclure." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take the Invisibility Liquor to Maybell Maclure.",  OLD Details : "把隱形液交給梅貝爾‧馬科倫。它的隱形效果應該可以持續到她見到湯米‧喬。", Details AC enUS : "Take this invisibility liquor to young Maybell.  It should last long enough for her to visit Tommy Joe." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take this invisibility liquor to young Maybell. It should last long enough for her to visit Tommy Joe."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把隱形液交給梅貝爾·馬科倫。', `Details` = '把隱形液交給梅貝爾·馬科倫。它的隱形效果應該可以持續到她見到湯米·喬。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 114;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "黑石氏族的獸人在赤脊山脈的侵略行動得到了暗影施法者的支援，他們帶著一種具有強大黑暗力量的器具—午夜寶珠。這些寶珠對赤脊山脈的防衛者們造成了巨大的傷亡，並迫使我們放棄所有在戰鬥中被這種寶珠污染了的物品。$B$B殺掉這些黑石暗影施法者，把他們身上的午夜寶珠拿回來給我。我會把他們妥善地處理掉，還這世界一片清淨!", Details AC enUS : "The Blackrock orcs enlisted shadowcasters to aid their attacks in Redridge, and they have brought with them devices of dark power--midnight orbs.  These orbs have struck telling blows against Redridge's defenders, and it's imperative we remove the demon-tainted items from the conflict.$B$BFind and deliver to me midnight orbs from slain Blackrock shadowcasters.  I will then have them disposed of, for this world would be a better place without them!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Blackrock orcs enlisted shadowcasters to aid their attacks in Redridge, and they have brought with them devices of dark power--midnight orbs. These orbs have struck telling blows against Redridge's defenders, and it's imperative we remove the demon-tainted items from the conflict.$b$bFind and deliver to me midnight orbs from slain Blackrock shadowcasters. I will then have them disposed of, for this world would be a better place without them!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '黑石氏族的獸人在赤脊山脈的侵略行動得到了暗影施法者的支援，他們帶著一種具有強大黑暗力量的器具—午夜寶珠。這些寶珠對赤脊山脈的防衛者們造成了巨大的傷亡，並迫使我們放棄所有在戰鬥中被這種寶珠污染了的物品。$b$b殺掉這些黑石暗影施法者，把他們身上的午夜寶珠拿回來給我。我會把他們妥善地處理掉，還這世界一片清淨!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 115;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "雷霆啤酒", Title AC enUS : "Thunderbrew Lager" ; Wowhead enUS : "Thunderbrew",  OLD Objectives : "帶5束啤酒花給葛林布茲·雷酒以完成他的特製啤酒。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring Grimbooze Thunderbrew 5 hops to complete his special brew." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring Grimbooze Thunderbrew 5 hops to complete his special brew.",  OLD Details : "快點，朋友，動作要快$b釀出更多的酒來賣$b喝酒的人多吃菜的人少 $b想要釀酒就得要有啤酒花。", Details AC enUS : "Hurry, my friend, move with haste $bIn order for our rich lager to taste $bMore like beer and less like stew, $bHops are needed to make the brew." ; Wowhead enUS : "Hurry, my friend, move with haste$bIn order for our rich lager to taste$bMore like beer and less like stew,$bHops are needed to make the brew."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '雷酒', `Objectives` = '帶5束蛇麻草給葛林布茲·雷酒以完成他的特製啤酒。', `Details` = '快點，朋友，動作要快$b釀出更多的酒來賣$b喝酒的人多吃菜的人少$b想要釀酒就得要有蛇麻草。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 117;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到艾爾文森林把弗納的字條交給閃金鎮的鐵匠阿古斯。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take Verner's Note to Smith Argus at Goldshire in Elwynn Forest." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take Verner's Note to Smith Argus at Goldshire in Elwynn Forest.",  OLD Details : "我用了很多的鐵用來打造暴風城衛兵的裝備，結果沒有足夠的鐵來打馬蹄鐵了!$B$B把這封信帶給閃金鎮的鐵匠阿古斯，信上說明了我現在的情況，並向他要一批馬蹄鐵過來。", Details AC enUS : "I've been using so much iron keeping the Stormwind Guards outfitted, I don't have enough to supply the stable's horses with shoes!$B$BTake this note to Blacksmith Argus in Goldshire.  It explains to him my problem and requests a shipment of horseshoes." ; Wowhead enUS : "I've been using so much iron keeping the Stormwind Guards outfitted, I don't have enough to supply the stable's horses with shoes!$b$bTake this note to Blacksmith Argus in Goldshire. It explains to him my problem and requests a shipment of horseshoes."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把弗納的字條交給閃金鎮的鐵匠阿格斯。', `Details` = '我用了很多的鐵用來打造暴風城衛兵的裝備，結果沒有足夠的鐵來打馬蹄鐵了!$b$b把這封信帶給閃金鎮的鐵匠阿格斯，信上說明了我現在的情況，並向他要一批馬蹄鐵過來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 118;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "回復弗納", Title AC enUS : "Return to Verner" ; Wowhead enUS : "Return to Verner",  OLD Objectives : "回去找赤脊山湖畔鎮的弗納·奧斯古，把鐵匠阿古斯的一箱馬掌交給他。", Objectives AC enUS : "Return to Verner Osgood at Lakeshire in Redridge.  Give him the Crate of Horseshoes." ; Wowhead enUS : "Return to Verner Osgood at Lakeshire in Redridge.  Give him the Crate of Horseshoes.",  OLD Details : "好的，我會給他送去50套馬掌……$B$B就是這些，你看，全部都打包好了，隨時可以出發！告訴弗納，我很高興和他做生意，哦，對了，提醒他看清楚箱子上的標籤！", Details AC enUS : "Ok, I'll give him his 50 horseshoes...$B$BHere they are, all boxed up and ready to go!  Tell Verner it was a pleasure doing business, and be sure he reads the note attached to this crate!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Ok, I'll give him his 50 horseshoes...$b$bHere they are, all boxed up and ready to go! Tell Verner it was a pleasure doing business, and be sure he reads the note attached to this crate!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '回覆弗納', `Objectives` = '回去赤脊山找弗納·奧斯古，把馬蹄鐵交給他。', `Details` = '好，我會給他50套馬蹄鐵……$b$b就在這裡，你看，全部都打包好了，隨時可以帶走!告訴弗納，我很高興和他做生意，哦，對了，提醒他看清楚木箱上的字條!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 119;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將暴風城的馬庫斯·喬納森將軍的回信帶給湖畔鎮的所羅門鎮長。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take General Marcus Jonathan's letter of response to Magistrate Solomon in Lakeshire." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take General Marcus Jonathan's letter of response to Magistrate Solomon in Lakeshire.",  OLD Details : "在我等待著國王陛下的回應時，希望你能把這封信交給所羅門鎮長。$b$b快去吧，$c！", Details AC enUS : "While I wait for a response from the King I want you to carry this letter to Magistrate Solomon. $b$bDismissed, $c!" ; Wowhead enUS : "While I wait for a response from the King I want you to carry this letter to Magistrate Solomon.$b$bDismissed, $c!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將馬庫斯·喬納森將軍的回信帶給湖畔鎮的所羅門鎮長。', `Details` = '在我等待國王陛下的回應時，我希望你能把這封信交給所羅門鎮長。$b$b解散，$c!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 121;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我需要一些黑色幼龍腹部的鱗片來支付從阿古斯那裡買馬掌的錢。如果你能幫我搞到6塊鱗片的話，在付給阿古斯一些以後...我還能用剩下的給你做點好裝備。$B$B黑色幼龍經常在湖畔鎮南方遊蕩，獵殺它們的時候要多加小心。", Details AC enUS : "I need some underbelly scales from black dragon whelps to pay for the shoes Argus sent me from Goldshire.  If you can get 6 of them for me, then I can pay Argus with some... and have enough left to fashion something for you.$B$BBlack dragon whelps are often flying around south of Lakeshire, but they like to wander.  You might have to just keep an eye out and hunt them when you see them." ; Wowhead enUS : "I need some underbelly scales from black dragon whelps to pay for the shoes Argus sent me from Goldshire. If you can get 6 of them for me, then I can pay Argus with some... and have enough left to fashion something for you.$b$bBlack dragon whelps are often flying around south of Lakeshire, but they like to wander. You might have to just keep an eye out and hunt them when you see them."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我需要一些黑色幼龍腹部的鱗片來支付從阿格斯那裡買馬掌的錢。如果你能幫我搞到6塊鱗片的話，在付給阿格斯一些以後……我還能用剩下的給你做點好裝備。$b$b黑色幼龍經常在湖畔鎮南方遊蕩，獵殺它們的時候要多加小心。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 122;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "去艾爾文森林的東谷伐木場找治安官派特森，把收貨人的交易日程表交給他。", Objectives AC enUS : "Go to Marshal Dughan in Goldshire and give him The Collector's Schedule." ; Wowhead enUS : "Go to Marshal Dughan in Goldshire and give him The Collector's Schedule.",  OLD Details : "這是一張日程表，記錄了某個被稱作「收貨人」的人會在某天某時收到從艾爾文森林的礦坑運來的一車黃金。$B$B根據日程表所述，這個收貨人好像就住在艾爾文森林東部的布萊克威爾南瓜田附近。$B$B這似乎很重要。你必須向東谷伐木場的派特森元帥報告。", Details AC enUS : "This note is a schedule with a list of days and times when a person -- described only as "The Collector" -- will receive a shipment of gold from the mines in Elwynn Forest.$B$BFrom the schedule, it looks as if the Collector resides near the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch in eastern Elwynn.$B$BThis sounds important.  You should report it to Marshal Dughan in Goldshire." ; Wowhead enUS : "This note is a schedule with a list of days and times when a person -- described only as "The Collector" -- will receive a shipment of gold from the mines in Elwynn Forest.$b$bFrom the schedule, it looks as if the Collector resides near the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch in eastern Elwynn.$b$bThis sounds important. You should report it to Marshal Dughan in Goldshire."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '去閃金鎮找治安官杜漢，把收貨人的交易日程表交給他。', `Details` = '這是一張日程表，記錄了某個人被稱作「收貨人」的人在某天某時會收到從艾爾文森林的礦坑運來的一車黃金。$b$b根據日程表所述，這個收貨人好像就住在艾爾文森林東部的布萊克威爾南瓜田附近。$b$b這件事非常重要，你必須向閃金鎮的治安官杜漢報告。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 123;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "有一群整天攻城的獸人好像還不夠!最近又來了一群豺狼人蠻卒和秘法師，鬼鬼祟祟地在我的獸欄北邊的山脊上遊蕩，而且還偷我走失的馬...$B$B如果你能把這些豺狼人都除掉的話，我和我的馬都會感謝你的。", Details AC enUS : "As if the attacking orcs weren't enough!  Now I have gnoll brutes and mystics prowling along the ridge north of my stable, taking my horses when they stray...$B$BIf you can get rid of those gnolls, my horses and I would be very grateful." ; Wowhead enUS : "As if the attacking orcs weren't enough! Now I have gnoll brutes and mystics prowling along the ridge north of my stable, taking my horses when they stray...$b$bIf you can get rid of those gnolls, my horses and I would be very grateful.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Redridge Brute slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Redridge Mystic slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '有一群整天攻城的獸人好像還不夠!最近又來了一群豺狼人蠻卒和秘法師，鬼鬼祟祟地在我的馬場北邊的山脊上遊蕩，而且還偷我走失的馬……$b$b如果你能把這些豺狼人都除掉的話，我和我的馬都會感謝你的。', `Objectivetext1` = '赤脊山蠻卒 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '赤脊山秘法師 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 124;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我本來可以在這兒大幹一場的，$n。可是，我的工具還沒運到，由於這個小鎮被包圍了，我們很難得到外面來的補給。我本來託人從閃金鎮把工具用馬車運過來，可是橋被炸斷了，我們只好改用船運，結果那船又被獸人的投石車給打沉了。不過，我運氣不錯，我的工具箱沒壞，只是沉進了湖底。$b$b幫我把工具箱找回來吧，$n，我會付給你相當不錯的酬勞的。", Details AC enUS : "I could really use a hand here, $N.  With the town under siege, it's been hard to get supplies.  My tools were being delivered from Goldshire by wagon but the bridge was blown out.  We put the tools in a boat but the orcs hit it with a catapult.  Just my luck, my toolbox sank right to the bottom of the lake.$b$bRetrieve my toolbox, $N, and I'll make it worth your while." ; Wowhead enUS : "I could really use a hand here, $n. With the town under siege, it's been hard to get supplies. My tools were being delivered from Goldshire by wagon but the bridge was blown out. We put the tools in a boat but the orcs hit it with a catapult. Just my luck, my toolbox sank right to the bottom of the lake.$b$bRetrieve my toolbox, $n, and I'll make it worth your while."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我本來可以在這兒大幹一場的, $n。可是，我的工具還沒運到，由於這個小鎮被包圍了，我們很難得到外面來的補給。我本來託人從閃金鎮把工具用馬車運過來，可是橋被炸斷了，我們只好改用船運，結果那船又被獸人的投石車給打沉了。不過，我運氣不錯，我的工具箱沒壞，只是沉進了湖底。$b$b幫我把工具箱找回來吧，$n，我會付給你相當不錯的酬勞的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 125;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "$n，那些豺狼人還在那裡!我還能聽見他們在湖畔鎮周圍的山區裡打獵時發出的嚎叫聲。其中有一個聲音喊得最響─那是猶勒，他們的頭目。$B$B幹掉猶勒，把牠的手下都給轟走!把牠的爪子給我帶回來。$B$B不過你得小心點，這傢伙能當上他們的頭目自然是有兩把刷子的。猶勒可不是個低能的混血豺狼人的...", Details AC enUS : "$N, the gnolls are still out there.  I can hear their baying as they hunt in the hills above Lakeshire.  And one cry is louder than the rest - Yowler,  their leader.$B$BKill Yowler and send his pack scattering!  Bring me his paw as proof.$B$BAnd be careful, this gnoll is their leader for a reason.  He is no Mongrel..." ; Wowhead enUS : "$n, the gnolls are still out there. I can hear their baying as they hunt in the hills above Lakeshire. And one cry is louder than the rest - Yowler, their leader.$b$bKill Yowler and send his pack scattering! Bring me his paw as proof.$b$bAnd be careful, this gnoll is their leader for a reason. He is no Mongrel..."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '$n，那些豺狼人還在那裡!我還能聽見他們在湖畔鎮周圍的山區裡打獵時發出的嚎叫聲。其中有一個聲音喊得最響─那是猶勒，他們的頭目。$b$b幹掉猶勒，把牠的手下都給轟走!把牠的爪子給我帶回來。$b$b不過你得小心點，這傢伙能當上他們的頭目自然是有兩把刷子的。猶勒可不是個低能的混血豺狼人的……', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 126;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "止水湖之所以出名都是因為它的班點太陽魚。它們總是供不應求...可是我這裡的存貨已經不夠了!$B$B幫我帶回10條魚來，我會好好酬謝你的。哦，如果你不會捕魚的話...可以從魚人那兒搶來!", Details AC enUS : "Lake Everstill is famous for its spotted sunfish.  There's always demand for them...and I'm running low!$B$BBring me a batch of 10 and I'll barter well for them.  If you can't fish yourself, then...maybe you can get them off the murlocs!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Lake Everstill is famous for its spotted sunfish. There's always demand for them...and I'm running low!$b$bBring me a batch of 10 and I'll barter well for them. If you can't fish yourself, then...maybe you can get them off the murlocs!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '止水湖之所以出名都是因為它的班點太陽魚。它們總是供不應求……可是我這裡的存貨已經不夠了!$b$b幫我帶回10條魚來，我會好好酬謝你的。哦，如果你不會捕魚的話……可以從魚人那兒搶來!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 127;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Blackrock Champion slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectivetext1` = '黑石勇士 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 128;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你能幫我一個小忙嗎？我給衛兵派克準備好了午飯，可他正在值勤……他是一個又高又壯的暴風城衛兵。他在外面是能自己保護自己的，可我們這樣的尋常市民可不行，所以我沒法去給他送飯……$B$B所以呢，如果你能幫我把他的午餐帶給他的話，我也會給你提供一份免費的午餐！派克就在通往暮色森林的路上巡邏。", Details AC enUS : "Can you do me a favor?  I've prepared a lunch for Guard Parker, but he's out on patrol...he's a big, strong Stormwind guard who can defend himself, but it's much too dangerous out there for a townsperson like me.$B$BSo if you deliver his lunch for me, then come back here and I'll give you a free lunch!  Parker patrols the stretch of road leading to Duskwood." ; Wowhead enUS : "Can you do me a favor? I've prepared a lunch for Guard Parker, but he's out on patrol...he's a big, strong Stormwind guard who can defend himself, but it's much too dangerous out there for a townsperson like me.$b$bSo if you deliver his lunch for me, then come back here and I'll give you a free lunch! Parker patrols the stretch of road leading to Duskwood."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你能幫我一個小忙嗎?我給衛兵派克準備好了午飯，可是他出去巡邏了……他是一個又高又壯的暴風城衛兵。他在外面是能自己保護自己的，可是像我這樣的尋常市民就不行了，$b$b所以呢，如果你能幫我把他的午餐帶給他的話，我也給你一份免費的午餐!派克就在通往暮色森林的路上巡邏。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 129;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你回去找達希的時候，能替我帶幾朵花給她嗎?你可以在湖畔鎮西邊的草藥店裡買到花。$B$B不過，你去買花的時候...千萬別告訴瑪蒂這花是誰買的，也別說是要送給誰的...", Details AC enUS : "Before you go back to Darcy, can you bring her some flowers for me?  You can get them at the herbalist shop back in Lakeshire, at the west end of town.$B$BBut when you get the flowers...don't tell the herbalist, Martie, whom they're from, or whom they're for..." ; Wowhead enUS : "Before you go back to Darcy, can you bring her some flowers for me? You can get them at the herbalist shop back in Lakeshire, at the west end of town.$b$bBut when you get the flowers...don't tell the herbalist, Martie, whom they're from, or whom they're for..."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你回去找達希的時候，能替我帶幾朵花給她嗎?你可以在湖畔鎮西邊的草藥店裡買到花。$b$b不過，你去買花的時候……千萬別告訴瑪蒂這花是誰買的，也別說是要送給誰的……', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 130;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "這是你要的花。我為你選了水仙，這是我最喜歡的花兒！", Details AC enUS : "Here is your bouquet.  I chose Daffodils for you.  They're my favorite!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Here is your bouquet. I chose Daffodils for you. They're my favorite!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '這是你要的花。我為你選了水仙，這是我最喜歡的花兒!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 131;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將威利的字條交給西部荒野的格里安·斯托曼。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take Wiley's Note to Gryan Stoutmantle in Westfall." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take Wiley's Note to Gryan Stoutmantle in Westfall."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將威利的字條交給西部荒野的格萊恩·斯托曼。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 132;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集7個食屍鬼的肋骨，然後把它們交給亞伯克隆比。", Objectives AC enUS : "Gather 7 Ghoul Ribs and bring them to Abercrombie at his shack." ; Wowhead enUS : "Gather 7 Ghoul Ribs and bring them to Abercrombie at his shack.",  OLD Details : "我住得離鎮子太遠了，根本得不到保護。那些食屍鬼和行屍走肉還沒有把我吃掉簡直是個奇跡！其實昨天還有一群噬骨者來敲擊我房子四周的牆！$B$B我得做個假人，一個用來嚇唬食屍鬼的“稻草人”。我需要食屍鬼的肋骨來製作這個假人。你可以從食腐者、噬骨者、食腦者、腐爛者和瘟疫食屍鬼身上拿到這東西。$B$B給我帶足夠的肋骨來，我就會給你一些獎賞。", Details AC enUS : "I live so far from the protection of town, it's a wonder the ghouls and the walking dead haven't eaten me!  In fact, just yesterday a pack of Bone Chewers was pounding on the walls of my house!$B$BI want to make an effigy - a kind of "scarecrow" for Ghouls.  To do that I need some Ghoul Ribs.  You can get them from Flesh Eaters, Bone Chewers, Brain Eaters, Rotted Ones and Plague Spreaders.$B$BGet the ribs for me, and I will repay you with some coin." ; Wowhead enUS : "I live so far from the protection of town, it's a wonder the ghouls and the walking dead haven't eaten me! In fact, just yesterday a pack of Bone Chewers was pounding on the walls of my house!$b$bI want to make an effigy - a kind of "scarecrow" for Ghouls. To do that I need some Ghoul Ribs. You can get them from Flesh Eaters, Bone Chewers, Brain Eaters, Rotted Ones and Plague Spreaders.$b$bGet the ribs for me, and I will repay you with some coin."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '收集7根食屍鬼的肋骨，然後把它們交給亞伯克隆比。', `Details` = '我住得離鎮上太遠了，根本得不到保護。那些食屍鬼和疆屍沒把我吃掉簡直就是個奇跡!其實昨天還有一群噬骨者來敲擊我的牆壁!$b$b我想要做個假人，一個用來嚇唬食屍鬼的「稻草人」。我需要一些食屍鬼的肋骨來製作這個假人。你可以從食腐者、噬骨者、食腦者、腐爛者和瘟疫食屍鬼身上拿到這東西。$b$b給我帶足夠的肋骨來，我會給你一些獎賞的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 133;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "幾個星期前，我離開家去遠處採草藥，有一群巨魔襲擊了我!我落荒而逃的時候丟棄了一箱珍貴的工具和草藥。$B$B這些巨魔在把我趕跑之後，就大搖大擺地回到了暮色森林南邊的巨魔丘上，我的木箱肯定就在那一帶。$B$B請幫幫我吧，$n，我很需要這個木箱，請你一定要幫我拿回來。", Details AC enUS : "A few weeks ago I was picking herbs far from my house, and a band of ogres attacked me!  I ran, and I was forced to leave behind a crate of precious tools and herbs.$B$BAfter they chased me off, the ogres swaggered back to the ogre mound in southern Duskwood.  I'm sure my crate is somewhere near the mound.$B$BPlease, $N, retrieve this crate for me for I miss it sorely." ; Wowhead enUS : "A few weeks ago I was picking herbs far from my house, and a band of ogres attacked me! I ran, and I was forced to leave behind a crate of precious tools and herbs.$b$bAfter they chased me off, the ogres swaggered back to the ogre mound in southern Duskwood. I'm sure my crate is somewhere near the mound.$b$bPlease, $n, retrieve this crate for me for I miss it sorely."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '幾個星期前，我離開家去遠處採草藥，有一群巨魔襲擊了我!我落荒而逃的時候丟棄了一箱珍貴的工具和草藥。$b$b這些巨魔在把我趕跑之後，就大搖大擺地回到了暮色森林南邊的巨魔丘上，我的木箱肯定就在那一帶。$b$b請幫幫我吧，$n，我很需要這個木箱，請你一定要幫我拿回來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 134;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將威利的便箋交給暴風城的馬迪亞斯·肖爾。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take Wiley's Note to Mathias Shaw in Stormwind." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take Wiley's Note to Mathias Shaw in Stormwind.",  OLD Details : "我現在很想知道威利所提到的“石匠”是個什麼意思，或許這只是一個口誤？石匠公會跟迪菲亞真的有聯繫嗎？或許暴風城軍情七處的首領馬迪亞斯·肖爾會知道真相。把威利的便箋拿給他，看看他對這個越來越大的謎團有什麼想法吧。他就在舊城區的兵營裡。", Details AC enUS : "I wonder what Wiley meant when he mentioned the Stonemasons.  Perhaps that was a slip of tongue.  Could the Defias gang be related to the Stonemasons?  Only one man would know for sure:  Mathias Shaw, head of SI:7. Show him Wiley's Note and see if he has anything to add to this growing mystery. If you have trouble finding Shaw, check the Barracks in Old Town." ; Wowhead enUS : "I wonder what Wiley meant when he mentioned the Stonemasons. Perhaps that was a slip of tongue. Could the Defias gang be related to the Stonemasons? Only one man would know for sure: Mathias Shaw, head of SI:7. Show him Wiley's Note and see if he has anything to add to this growing mystery. If you have trouble finding Shaw, check the Barracks in Old Town."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將威利的字條交給暴風城的馬迪亞斯·肖爾。', `Details` = '我現在很想知道威利所提到的「石匠」是什麼意思，或許這只是一個口誤?石匠公會跟迪菲亞真的有聯繫嗎?原來只有暴風城軍情七處的首領馬迪亞斯·肖爾才知道真相。把威利的字條拿給他，看看他對這個越來越大的謎團有什麼想法吧。如果你找不到他，就去舊城區的兵營看看吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 135;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "桑德斯船長的寶藏", Title AC enUS : "Captain Sanders' Hidden Treasure" ; Wowhead enUS : "Captain Sanders' Hidden Treasure",  OLD Objectives : "找到桑德斯船長的置物箱，在箱子中尋找下一條線索。", Objectives AC enUS : "Find Captain Sanders' footlocker and search it for the next clue." ; Wowhead enUS : "Find Captain Sanders' footlocker and search it for the next clue.",  OLD Details : "如果你讀到這封信的話，那就意味著我，桑德斯船長，已經長眠在深深的水底了。所以，只要按照我的線索去做，我的寶藏就是你的了。$b$b首先你必須要找到我的置物箱，它應該就在西部荒野西邊海岸的某處船隻殘骸旁，如今應該八成都埋在沙裡了。海岸邊有許多處船隻的殘骸，但只有一隻沉船旁有個鏽掉的錨。找到錨你就找到箱子了!在箱子裡面，你可以找到下一條線索。", Details AC enUS : "If ye be readin' this, it means that Ol' Captain Sanders is in a watery grave.  So my treasure is yours now, ye jest need to follow the clues. $b$bFirst ye need to find me footlocker.  It's probably half-buried in sand by now, along the Western Coast of Westfall near the shipwreck.  There be lots of shipwrecks but only one rusty anchor on the coast.  Find that anchor and you'll find me locker!  Look in there for the next clue." ; Wowhead enUS : "If ye be readin' this, it means that Ol' Captain Sanders is in a watery grave. So my treasure is yours now, ye jest need to follow the clues.$b$bFirst ye need to find me footlocker. It's probably half-buried in sand by now, along the Western Coast of Westfall near the shipwreck. There be lots of shipwrecks but only one rusty anchor on the coast. Find that anchor and you'll find me locker! Look in there for the next clue."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '桑德爾船長的寶藏', `Objectives` = '找到桑德爾船長的手提箱，在箱子中尋找下一條線索。', `Details` = '如果你讀到這封信的話，那就意味著我，桑德爾船長，已經長眠在深深的水底了。所以，只要按照我的線索去做，我的寶藏就是你的了。$b$b首先你必須要找到我的手提箱，它應該就在西部荒野西邊海岸的某處船隻殘骸旁，如今應該八成都埋在沙裡了。海岸邊有許多處船隻的殘骸，但只有一隻沉船旁有個鏽掉的錨。找到錨你就找到箱子了!在箱子裡面，你可以找到下一條線索。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 136;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "桑德斯船長的寶藏", Title AC enUS : "Captain Sanders' Hidden Treasure" ; Wowhead enUS : "Captain Sanders' Hidden Treasure",  OLD Objectives : "找到廢棄煙囪旁的舊木桶，在桶裡尋找下一條線索。", Objectives AC enUS : "Find the old barrel near the ruined chimney and search it for your next clue." ; Wowhead enUS : "Find the old barrel near the ruined chimney and search it for your next clue.$b$bProvided item: $b"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '桑德爾船長的寶藏', `Objectives` = '找到廢棄煙囪旁的舊木桶，在桶裡尋找下一條線索。$b$b已提供物品：$b', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 138;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "杉德爾船長的寶藏", Title AC enUS : "Captain Sanders' Hidden Treasure" ; Wowhead enUS : "Captain Sanders' Hidden Treasure",  OLD Objectives : "在風車旁的一個空水罐裡尋找下一條線索。", Objectives AC enUS : "Search the empty jug next to the windmill for the next clue." ; Wowhead enUS : "Search the empty jug next to the windmill for the next clue.$b$bProvided item: $b",  OLD Details : "仔細搜索了木桶了之後，你發現了一小片羊皮紙。上面寫著：現在，從桶這裡轉向北，像烏鴉飛翔一般絕不回頭，一直走到你看見了海邊懸崖上的風車為止。找到那風車旁的一個空水罐。仔細檢查那個水罐，你就可以找到你要找的東西了。", Details AC enUS : "Searching through the barrel you discover another piece of parchment.  This one reads:  Now from this here barrel, face ye North.  Straight as the crow flies, keep ye walkin' till you see the empty jug next to the lone windmill on the sea bluffs.  If ye poke around that jug, ye just might find what you're lookin' for." ; Wowhead enUS : "Searching through the barrel you discover another piece of parchment. This one reads: Now from this here barrel, face ye North. Straight as the crow flies, keep ye walkin' till you see the empty jug next to the lone windmill on the sea bluffs. If ye poke around that jug, ye just might find what you're lookin' for."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '桑德爾船長的寶藏', `Objectives` = '在風車旁的一個空水罐裡尋找下一條線索。$b$b已提供物品：$b', `Details` = '仔細搜索了木桶了之後，你發現了一小片羊皮紙。上面寫著:現在，從桶這裡轉向北，像烏鴉飛翔一般絕不回頭，一直走到你看見了海邊懸崖上的風車為止。找到那風車旁的一個空水罐。仔細檢查那個水罐，你就可以找到你要找的東西了。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 139;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "桑德斯船長的寶藏", Title AC enUS : "Captain Sanders' Hidden Treasure" ; Wowhead enUS : "Captain Sanders' Hidden Treasure",  OLD Objectives : "找到桑德斯船長的箱子並打開它，取得你的獎勵。", Objectives AC enUS : "Locate Captain Sanders' chest and open it for your reward." ; Wowhead enUS : "Locate Captain Sanders' chest and open it for your reward.$b$bProvided item: $b",  OLD Details : "顯然，在這個舊罐子中藏著另一個有關桑德斯的寶藏線索。紙上有幾處墨水已經變得模糊不清，而且泛著一股威士忌的味道，不過你還是能從中辨認出這樣的字跡:看來你找到我的威士忌瓶子了，你離我的寶藏已經很近啦!只要向西走到岸邊，遇到海水以後，繼續走!一直向西游，你就可以找到藏著我的寶箱的那座島啦!", Details AC enUS : "Sure enough, deep within the Old Jug there is another clue to Sanders' treasure.  The ink has run in some places and the paper smells like whiskey but you can make out some of the text:  Now that ye found me ol' whiskey jug, you're almost to the treasure!  Just face West from the bottle and walk down to the shore.  Once ye get to the water, keep going!  Swim straight west till you find the island with me treasure chest!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Sure enough, deep within the Old Jug there is another clue to Sanders' treasure. The ink has run in some places and the paper smells like whiskey but you can make out some of the text: Now that ye found me ol' whiskey jug, you're almost to the treasure! Just face West from the bottle and walk down to the shore. Once ye get to the water, keep going! Swim straight west till you find the island with me treasure chest!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '桑德爾船長的寶藏', `Objectives` = '找到桑德爾船長的箱子並打開它，取得你的獎勵。$b$b已提供物品：$b', `Details` = '顯然，在這個舊罐子中藏著另一個有關桑德爾的寶藏線索。紙上有幾處墨水已經變得模糊不清，而且泛著一股威士忌的味道，不過你還是能從中辨認出這樣的字跡:看來你找到我的威士忌瓶子了，你離我的寶藏已經很近啦!只要向西走到海邊，然後一直向西游，你就可以找到藏著我的寶箱的那座島啦!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 140;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將肖爾的報告交給西部荒野的格裡安·斯托曼。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take Shaw's report to Gryan Stoutmantle in Westfall." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take Shaw's report to Gryan Stoutmantle in Westfall.",  OLD Details : "過去的石匠公會是由一個名叫艾德溫·範克裡夫的人運營著的。第一次獸人戰爭結束後，範克裡夫承接下了在獸人們留下的廢墟上重建暴風城的重任。很顯然，範克裡夫對國王陛下在重建工程完成之後給予他們的待遇非常不滿意。總之，解釋這一大堆具體的事情要花些時間。$b$b我這裡有一份詳細的說明，讓你拿到西部荒野去交給你的雇主。你得馬上把這個給他帶去！", Details AC enUS : "The Stonemasons' Guild was run by a man named Edwin VanCleef.  VanCleef was responsible for rebuilding Stormwind after the orcs razed it in the First War.  Apparently, VanCleef and his men were unhappy with their treatment by the King after the reconstruction was complete.  That just might explain a thing or two.$b$bI have written a more detailed account for your Master in Westfall.  Take this to him at once!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Stonemasons' Guild was run by a man named Edwin VanCleef. VanCleef was responsible for rebuilding Stormwind after the orcs razed it in the First War. Apparently, VanCleef and his men were unhappy with their treatment by the King after the reconstruction was complete. That just might explain a thing or two.$b$bI have written a more detailed account for your Master in Westfall. Take this to him at once!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將肖爾的報告交給西部荒野的格萊恩·斯托曼。', `Details` = '過去的石匠公會是由一個名叫艾德溫·范克里夫的人所經營的。第一次獸人戰爭結束後，范克里夫承接下了在獸人們留下的廢墟上重建暴風城的重任。很顯然的，范克里夫對國王陛下在重建工程完成之後給予他們的待遇非常不滿意。這也許只能解釋其中一些事情。$b$b我已經寫了一份詳細的說明，要讓你拿到西部荒野交給你的老大。趕快拿去給他吧!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 141;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將格里安·斯托曼的回信帶給所羅門鎮長。", Objectives AC enUS : "Return to Magistrate Solomon with Gryan Stoutmantle's response." ; Wowhead enUS : "Return to Magistrate Solomon with Gryan Stoutmantle's response."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將格萊恩·斯托曼的回信帶給所羅門鎮長。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 144;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "送往夜色鎮的信", Title AC enUS : "Messenger to Darkshire" ; Wowhead enUS : "Messenger to Darkshire",  OLD Objectives : "所羅門鎮長要求你給夜色鎮的艾爾羅·埃伯洛克公爵送一封信。", Objectives AC enUS : "Magistrate Solomon wants you to take a letter to Lord Ebonlocke in Darkshire." ; Wowhead enUS : "Magistrate Solomon wants you to take a letter to Lord Ebonlocke in Darkshire.",  OLD Details : "看來我又得有事麻煩你了。我寫一了封信給艾爾羅·埃伯洛克公爵，請求他從他的精銳部隊——暮色森林守夜人——中抽出一些人來協助湖畔鎮的防務。這封信必須馬上呈送給他，而且你在旅途中要多加小心。埃伯洛克公爵是夜色鎮的行政官，那座小鎮就在暮色森林中，小心不要迷路了。", Details AC enUS : "I require your assistance once again.  I have written to Lord Ebonlocke, requesting that he sends his trained guards, the Night Watch, to help with Lakeshire's defense.  It is imperative this message makes it to him swiftly.  You must exercise extreme caution.  Ebonlocke is the mayor of Darkshire, in the heart of Duskwood.  Do not stray from the roads." ; Wowhead enUS : "I require your assistance once again. I have written to Lord Ebonlocke, requesting that he sends his trained guards, the Night Watch, to help with Lakeshire's defense. It is imperative this message makes it to him swiftly. You must exercise extreme caution. Ebonlocke is the mayor of Darkshire, in the heart of Duskwood. Do not stray from the roads."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '送信到夜色鎮', `Objectives` = '所羅門鎮長要求你送一封信給夜色鎮的埃伯洛克領主。', `Details` = '看來我又有事要麻煩你了。我寫了封信給艾羅·埃伯洛克領主，請求他派出他的精銳部隊─暮色森林守夜人─來協助湖畔鎮的防務。這封信必須馬上送去給他，你在旅途中要多加小心。埃伯洛克是夜色鎮的鎮長，那座小鎮就在暮色森林中，不要離開道路的範圍。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 145;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "送往夜色鎮的信", Title AC enUS : "Messenger to Darkshire" ; Wowhead enUS : "Messenger to Darkshire",  OLD Objectives : "將埃伯洛克公爵的回信帶給所羅門鎮長。", Objectives AC enUS : "Return to Magistrate Solomon with Lord Ebonlocke's letter of response." ; Wowhead enUS : "Return to Magistrate Solomon with Lord Ebonlocke's letter of response.",  OLD Details : "如果我不是和所羅門鎮長私交甚密的話，我一定會以為他是個瘋子的。因為暴風城拒絕出兵援助，就讓我們把守夜人部隊派去湖畔鎮？守夜人部隊就是因為這裡被邪惡的魔法所影響才創建起來的。如果我把他們派離這裡的話，恐怕還沒等到他們走出森林，這裡就會被邪惡的勢力徹底吞沒。$b$b把這封回信帶給你在湖畔鎮的主人吧。", Details AC enUS : "If I did not know Magistrate Solomon personally, I would say the man has gone mad.  Send the Night Watch to Lakeshire because Stormwind refuses aid?  The Night Watch was formed because Stormwind left us when this foul magic seeped into the land.  If I sent my Night Watch, this town would be overrun by evil before the guards even reached the forest's edge.$b$bTake this letter of response to your Master in Lakeshire." ; Wowhead enUS : "If I did not know Magistrate Solomon personally, I would say the man has gone mad. Send the Night Watch to Lakeshire because Stormwind refuses aid? The Night Watch was formed because Stormwind left us when this foul magic seeped into the land. If I sent my Night Watch, this town would be overrun by evil before the guards even reached the forest's edge.$b$bTake this letter of response to your Master in Lakeshire."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '送信到夜色鎮', `Objectives` = '將埃伯洛克領主的回信送回去給所羅門鎮長。', `Details` = '如果不是和所羅門鎮長私交甚密的話，我一定會以為他是個瘋子的。因為暴風城拒絕出兵援助，就讓我把守夜人部隊派去湖畔鎮?守夜人部隊就是因為暴風城這片土地被邪惡的魔法入侵時卻遺棄我們，所以才被建立起來的。如果我把他們派離這裡的話，恐怕還沒等到他們走出這片森林，這裡就會被邪惡的勢力徹底吞沒。$b$b把這封回信帶給你在湖畔鎮的主人吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 146;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "找到「收貨人」並殺了他，然後帶著收貨人的戒指回來見治安官派特森。", Objectives AC enUS : "Find and kill "the Collector"  then return to Marshal Dughan with The Collector's Ring." ; Wowhead enUS : "Find and kill "the Collector"  then return to Marshal Dughan with The Collector's Ring.",  OLD Details : "如果這個「收貨人」是私自從我們的礦坑裡開採黃金的話，那麼他就是在偷竊王國的金庫!把他就地正法，然後把他的交易日程表上提到的戒指帶給我。也許這枚戒指能告訴我們這個「收貨人」是在為誰工作...$B$B那張交易日程表上說「收貨人」就藏在布萊克威爾南瓜田裡，你應該到那兒去找他。", Details AC enUS : "If the "Collector" is taking gold from our mines then he's stealing from the kingdom!  Bring the Collector to justice, and bring me the ring mentioned in the pickup schedule you gave me.  It may tell us whom the Collector is working for...$B$BThat Pickup Schedule says the Collector is hiding out at the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch.  You should search for him there." ; Wowhead enUS : "If the "Collector" is taking gold from our mines then he's stealing from the kingdom! Bring the Collector to justice, and bring me the ring mentioned in the pickup schedule you gave me. It may tell us whom the Collector is working for...$b$bThat Pickup Schedule says the Collector is hiding out at the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch. You should search for him there."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '找到「收貨人」並將他殺掉，然後帶著收貨人的戒指回來見治安官杜漢。', `Details` = '如果這個「收貨人」是私自從我們的礦坑裡開採黃金的話，那麼他就是在偷竊王國的金庫!把他就地正法，然後把他的交易日程表上提到的戒指帶給我。也許這枚戒指能告訴我們這個「收貨人」是在為誰工作……$b$b那張交易日程表上說「收貨人」就藏在布萊克威爾南瓜田裡，你應該到那兒去找他。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 147;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "哦，一個可憐的老人家還能做什麼呢?我需要從夜色鎮弄點補給品，不過路途太遙遠，我又太老了...實在是走不動啊。$B$B你能去夜色鎮幫我拿點鬼魂的髮絲回來嗎?你可以向艾娃夫人要這東西，她的家就在夜色鎮的廣場旁。", Details AC enUS : "Oh, what is a poor old man to do?  I need some supplies from Darkshire, but the village is so far away and I am so old and feeble...I would never make the trip.$B$BCan you go to Darkshire and bring me back some Ghost Hair Thread?  You can get it from Madame Eva at her home on the Darkshire square." ; Wowhead enUS : "Oh, what is a poor old man to do? I need some supplies from Darkshire, but the village is so far away and I am so old and feeble...I would never make the trip.$b$bCan you go to Darkshire and bring me back some Ghost Hair Thread? You can get it from Madame Eva at her home on the Darkshire square."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '哦，一個可憐的老人家還能做什麼呢?我需要從夜色鎮弄點補給品，不過路途太遙遠，我又太老了……實在是走不動啊。$b$b你能去夜色鎮幫我拿點鬼魂的髮絲回來嗎?你可以向艾娃夫人要這東西，她的家就在夜色鎮的廣場旁。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 148;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "有個可憐的亡魂叫盲眼瑪麗，她總是在夜色鎮南部山丘上的一間農宅裡出沒。$B$B拿著這把鬼魂之梳，去讓盲眼瑪麗用它梳頭。然後再把梳子拿回來，我可以從上面收集到需要的鬼魂的頭髮。$B$B小心點，那個屋子附近潛伏著一些可怕的東西...", Details AC enUS : "There is a poor, sad spirit, Blind Mary, who haunts an old farm house in the hills south of Darkshire.$B$BHere, take this Spectral Comb and ask Blind Mary to comb her hair.  Then bring back the comb and I will glean from it the Ghost Hair I'll need for the thread.$B$BAnd take care, for dark things now lurk near that house..." ; Wowhead enUS : "There is a poor, sad spirit, Blind Mary, who haunts an old farm house in the hills south of Darkshire.$b$bHere, take this Spectral Comb and ask Blind Mary to comb her hair. Then bring back the comb and I will glean from it the Ghost Hair I'll need for the thread.$b$bAnd take care, for dark things now lurk near that house..."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '有個可憐的亡魂叫盲眼瑪麗，她總是在夜色鎮南部山丘上的一間農宅裡出沒。$b$b拿著這把鬼魂之梳，去讓盲眼瑪麗用它梳頭。然後再把梳子拿回來，我可以從上面收集到需要的鬼魂的頭髮。$b$b小心點，那個屋子附近潛伏著一些可怕的東西……', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 149;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "魚人們開始變成了一個問題。大群的魚人漁民在止水湖沿岸下錨撒網，都快把湖裡的魚撈光了!我們得在他們把湖裡的魚都吃光之前把他們趕走!$B$B去獵殺那些魚人!帶8片魚人的鰭回來給我，我會獎勵你的。", Details AC enUS : "Murlocs are becoming a problem.  Larger groups of the fishmen are dropping anchor along the shores of Lake Everstill and fishing up a storm!  We need them gone before they eat all the fish in the lake!$B$BHunt murlocs!  Bring me eight of their fins and I might have something for you..." ; Wowhead enUS : "Murlocs are becoming a problem. Larger groups of the fishmen are dropping anchor along the shores of Lake Everstill and fishing up a storm! We need them gone before they eat all the fish in the lake!$b$bHunt murlocs! Bring me eight of their fins and I might have something for you..."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '魚人們開始變成了一個問題。大群的魚人漁民在止水湖沿岸下錨撒網，都快把湖裡的魚撈光了!我們得在他們把湖裡的魚都吃光之前把他們趕走!$b$b去獵殺那些魚人!帶8片魚人的鰭回來給我，我會獎勵你的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 150;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "西部荒野的弗娜·法布隆要你帶8捧燕麥給她。", Objectives AC enUS : "Verna Furlbrow in Westfall wants you to bring her 8 Handfuls of Oats." ; Wowhead enUS : "Verna Furlbrow in Westfall wants you to bring her 8 Handfuls of Oats."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '西部荒野的弗娜·法布隆要你帶８捧燕麥給她。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 151;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你或許已經注意到海岸邊有許多船隻的殘骸。無盡之海確實是非常兇險，我們必須保持西部荒野海岸線的淨空，只有這樣水手們才能安全地找到靠港的路線。這些魚人實在是很麻煩，$b$b去殺死7名魚人獵潮者、7名魚人戰士、7名魚人神諭者，還有7名魚人灘行者，完成任務之後到我這裡來領取獎賞。", Details AC enUS : "You probably noticed all of the shipwrecks along the coast.  The Great Sea is treacherous indeed.  The coast of Westfall needs to be kept clear, so that if sailors find their way to our beaches, they are safe.  The Murlocs are trouble though.$b$bKill 7 Tidehunters, 7 Warriors, 7 Oracles and 7 Coastrunners and I will see to it that you are rewarded." ; Wowhead enUS : "You probably noticed all of the shipwrecks along the coast. The Great Sea is treacherous indeed. The coast of Westfall needs to be kept clear, so that if sailors find their way to our beaches, they are safe. The Murlocs are trouble though.$b$bKill 7 Tidehunters, 7 Warriors, 7 Oracles and 7 Coastrunners and I will see to it that you are rewarded.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Murloc Coastrunner slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Murloc Warrior slain",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Murloc Tidehunter slain",  OLD Objectivetext4 : "", Objectivetext4 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Murloc Oracle slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你或許已經注意到海岸邊有許多船隻的殘骸。無盡之海確實是非常凶險，我們必須保持西部荒野海岸線的淨空，只有這樣水手們才能安全地找到靠港的路線。這些魚人實在是很麻煩，$b$b去殺死7名魚人獵潮者、7名魚人戰士、7名魚人神諭者，還有7名魚人灘行者，完成任務之後到我這裡來領取獎賞。', `Objectivetext1` = '灘行魚人 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '魚人戰士 消滅', `Objectivetext3` = '獵潮魚人 消滅', `Objectivetext4` = '魚人神諭者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 152;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把幽靈的梳子拿回去交給夜色鎮的伊瓦夫人。", Objectives AC enUS : "Return the Ghost Hair Comb to Madame Eva in Darkshire." ; Wowhead enUS : "Return the Ghost Hair Comb to Madame Eva in Darkshire.",  OLD Details : "不！！！！！$B$B快把這個梳子拿走！$B$B我是個怪物，不會再有人說我好看了！", Details AC enUS : "NO!!!!!$B$BTake it, take this comb away from me!$B$BI'm a monster, and no one will ever think me lovely again!" ; Wowhead enUS : "NO!!!!!$b$bTake it, take this comb away from me!$b$bI'm a monster, and no one will ever think me lovely again!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把鬼魂的梳子拿回去給夜色鎮的艾娃夫人。', `Details` = '不!!!!!$b$b把它拿走，快把這個梳子拿走!$b$b我是個怪物，不會再有人說我好看了!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 154;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "護送迪菲亞叛徒轉至迪菲亞兄弟會的秘密藏身處。迪菲亞叛徒把你帶到範克裡夫和他的手下的巢穴之後，儘快回去向格裡安·斯托曼彙報相關資訊。", Objectives AC enUS : "Escort the Defias Traitor to the secret hideout of the Defias Brotherhood.  Once the Defias Traitor shows you where VanCleef and his men are hiding out, return to Gryan Stoutmantle with the information." ; Wowhead enUS : "Escort the Defias Traitor to the secret hideout of the Defias Brotherhood.  Once the Defias Traitor shows you where VanCleef and his men are hiding out, return to Gryan Stoutmantle with the information.",  OLD Details : "這麼說，斯托曼就派了你這麼一個蘆柴棒一樣的傢伙來保護我？希望你能行，當然如果你再叫上幾個朋友幫忙就好了。$b$b你知道你要做些什麼吧？我會把你帶到迪菲亞盜賊的巢穴去，而你呢，就得保護好我。當然，你最好離我近點，越近越好。現在全迪菲亞兄弟會的人都想要我的腦袋呢。要是他們看見我和你在一起，一定會來把咱們都宰了的。$b$b等你和你的朋友準備好之後，就來跟我說一聲吧。", Details AC enUS : "So Stoutmantle sends a scrawny $r like you to protect me?  Guess you'll have to do.  Better bring some friends too. $b$bYou know the deal, right?  You watch my back and I'll take you to the Defias hideout.  But you better be close by my side.  The Defias gang wants my head now.  If they see me with you, they'll try to kill me.$b$bLet me know when you and any friends you can round up are ready to go." ; Wowhead enUS : "So Stoutmantle sends a scrawny $r like you to protect me? Guess you'll have to do. Better bring some friends too.$b$bYou know the deal, right? You watch my back and I'll take you to the Defias hideout. But you better be close by my side. The Defias gang wants my head now. If they see me with you, they'll try to kill me.$b$bLet me know when you and any friends you can round up are ready to go."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '護送迪菲亞叛徒前往迪菲亞兄弟會的秘密藏身處。一旦迪菲亞叛徒把你帶到范克里夫和他的手下的藏匿地點之後，儘快回去向格萊恩·斯托曼彙報相關資訊。', `Details` = '這麼說，斯托曼就派了你這麼一個骨瘦如柴的，$r，來保護我?看來你有得努力了，你最好再叫上幾個朋友幫忙比較保險。$b$b你知道你要做些什麼吧?我會帶你到迪菲幫的藏身之地，而你呢，就得好好保護我。當然，你最好離我近一點，越近越好。現在全迪菲亞兄弟會的人都想要我的腦袋呢。要是他們看見我和你在一起，一定會把我給宰了的。$b$b等你和你的朋友如果有準備好的話，就來跟我說一聲吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 155;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集8個腐敗之花，然後交給夜色鎮的旅店老闆史密茲。", Objectives AC enUS : "Gather 8 Rot Blossoms and bring them to Tavernkeep Smitts in Darkshire." ; Wowhead enUS : "Gather 8 Rot Blossoms and bring them to Tavernkeep Smitts in Darkshire.",  OLD Details : "如果你能幫我找些腐敗之花來，我就可以釀造很多殭屍汁。$B$B這種花全長在奇怪的地方，聽說在恐怖骷髏和骷髏魔的頭骨裡可以找到...不過至今我還沒有親眼見過!$B$B烏鴉嶺墓園裡有很多這樣的骷髏，你可以在尋找腐敗之花的時候順便把他們幹掉，夜色鎮的人民會感激你的。", Details AC enUS : "If you bring me some rot blossoms then I can brew you up a batch of zombie juice.$B$BRot blossoms grow in strange places.  In particular, I hear you can find them inside the skulls of Skeletal Horrors and Skeletal Fiends... not that I've gotten close enough to look!$B$BThe Raven Hill Cemetery is lousy with those skeletons.  You may as well get rid of them while you're looking for rot blossoms.  The town of Darkshire would be grateful." ; Wowhead enUS : "If you bring me some rot blossoms then I can brew you up a batch of zombie juice.$b$brot blossoms grow in strange places. In particular, I hear you can find them inside the skulls of Skeletal Horrors and Skeletal Fiends... not that I've gotten close enough to look!$b$bThe Raven Hill Cemetery is lousy with those skeletons. You may as well get rid of them while you're looking for rot blossoms. The town of Darkshire would be grateful."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '收集８個腐敗之花，然後交給夜色鎮的旅店老闆史密茲。', `Details` = '如果你能幫我找些腐敗之花來，我就可以釀造很多殭屍汁。$b$b這種花全長在奇怪的地方，聽說在恐怖骷髏和骷髏魔的頭骨裡可以找到……不過至今我還沒有親眼見過!$b$b烏鴉嶺墓園裡有很多這樣的骷髏，你可以在尋找腐敗之花的時候順便把他們幹掉，夜色鎮的人民會感激你的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 156;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我需要一瓶叫做殭屍汁的飲料。夜色鎮血鴉旅店的老闆史密茲應該有些存貨。$B$B請動作快點，最近晚上寒風刺骨，我得來點殭屍汁，好讓我的血液重新沸騰起來。", Details AC enUS : "I need a bottle of a certain liquor - Zombie Juice.  Tavernkeep Smitts at the Scarlet Raven Tavern in Darkshire should have some.$B$BAnd please hurry, $N.  These nights get cold, and I need that drink to put fire in my veins again!" ; Wowhead enUS : "I need a bottle of a certain liquor - Zombie Juice. Tavernkeep Smitts at the Scarlet Raven Tavern in Darkshire should have some.$b$bAnd please hurry, $n. These nights get cold, and I need that drink to put fire in my veins again!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我需要一瓶叫做殭屍汁的飲料。夜色鎮血鴉旅店的老闆史密茲應該有些存貨。$b$b請動作快點，最近晚上寒風刺骨，我得來點殭屍汁，好讓我的血液重新沸騰起來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 158;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "僵屍酒", Title AC enUS : "Juice Delivery" ; Wowhead enUS : "Juice Delivery",  OLD Objectives : "把僵屍酒交給烏鴉嶺墓地北方小屋裡的亞伯克隆比。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring the Zombie Juice to Abercrombie at his shack." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the Zombie Juice to Abercrombie at his shack.",  OLD Details : "這是你要的僵屍酒……$B$B不過要小心一點，這酒烈得足以把死人給嗆活過來。", Details AC enUS : "Here's your Zombie Juice...$B$B...and be careful with this stuff.  It's strong enough to raise the dead!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Here's your Zombie Juice...$b$b...and be careful with this stuff. It's strong enough to raise the dead!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '送交殭屍汁', `Objectives` = '把殭屍汁交給烏鴉嶺墓園北方小屋裡的亞伯克隆比。', `Details` = '這是你要的殭屍汁……$b$b小心一點，這東西強得足以把死人給弄活過來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 159;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "給鎮長的信", Title AC enUS : "Note to the Mayor" ; Wowhead enUS : "Note to the Mayor",  OLD Objectives : "把亞伯克隆比的信交給夜色鎮的艾爾羅·埃伯洛克鎮長。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring Abercrombie's Letter to Ello Ebonlocke, Mayor of Darkshire." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring Abercrombie's Letter to Ello Ebonlocke, Mayor of Darkshire.",  OLD Details : "請把這封信交給夜色鎮的艾爾羅·埃伯洛克鎮長。$B$B我和他是老朋友了……我敢說，當他讀完信，並且知道了你為我做的事情……他一定會和我一樣高興的！哈哈哈哈！", Details AC enUS : "Take this note to Ello Ebonlocke, the Mayor of Darkshire.$B$BHe and I are old friends...and when he reads it and discovers what you did for me...I'm sure he'll be just as happy as I am!  Hahahaha!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Take this note to Ello Ebonlocke, the Mayor of Darkshire.$b$bHe and I are old friends...and when he reads it and discovers what you did for me...I'm sure he'll be just as happy as I am! Hahahaha!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '給鎮長的字條', `Objectives` = '把亞伯克隆比的信交給夜色鎮的艾羅·埃伯洛克鎮長。', `Details` = '請把這張字條交給夜色鎮的艾羅·埃伯洛克鎮長。$b$b我和他是老朋友了……我敢說，當他讀完信，並且知道了你為我做的事情……他一定會和我一樣高興的!哈哈哈哈!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 160;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "首席工程師辛德維爾要你把怪味粉末交給莫格羅什營地的爆裂物專家阿胥蘭·暗石。", Objectives AC enUS : "Chief Engineer Hinderweir wants you to take the strange smelling powder to Ashlan Stonesmirk, the explosives expert at Dun Modr in the Wetlands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Chief Engineer Hinderweir wants you to take the strange smelling powder to Ashlan Stonesmirk, the explosives expert at Dun Modr in the Wetlands.",  OLD Details : "如果我的懷疑沒錯的話，這是某種火藥粉末。我們應該找個爆破專家來分析一下這到底是什麼東西，才知道我們到底面對的是什麼。$B$B只有一個人能勝任這項工作。阿胥蘭•暗石受命監控東邊莫格羅什要塞裡的巨魔。到那裡去找他，讓他分析一下這物質到底是什麼。", Details AC enUS : "If my suspicions are correct, this is some type of explosive powder.  This must be analyzed by an explosives expert so we know just what we're dealing with here.  Ashlan Stonesmirk was assigned to the regiment guarding Dun Modr and the Thandol Span.  I need you to make a grave and perilous journey, $N.$b$bTravel through the Algaz Gate, follow the road through the Wetlands and seek out Stonesmirk in Dun Modr.  Heed my advice: stick to the roads and stop for nothing!" ; Wowhead enUS : "If my suspicions are correct, this is some type of explosive powder. This must be analyzed by an explosives expert so we know just what we're dealing with here. Ashlan Stonesmirk was assigned to the regiment guarding Dun Modr and the Thandol Span. I need you to make a grave and perilous journey, $n.$b$bTravel through the Algaz Gate, follow the road through the Wetlands and seek out Stonesmirk in Dun Modr. Heed my advice: stick to the roads and stop for nothing!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '首席工程師辛德維爾要你把怪味粉末交給丹莫德的爆裂物專家阿胥蘭·暗石。', `Details` = '如果我的懷疑沒錯的話，這是某種火藥粉末。我們應該找個爆破專家來分析一下這到底是什麼東西，才知道我們到底面對的是什麼。阿胥蘭·暗石就在丹莫德和薩多爾大橋一帶負責那裡的警戒工作，我需要你儘快去找他，這是一段重要而危險的旅程，$n。$b$b穿過奧加茲隘口，沿著穿過潮濕之地的道路一直到丹莫德去找阿胥蘭。記住我的忠告:沿著大路走，不要停下腳步!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 161;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死艾德溫·范克里夫，把他的頭交給格里安·斯托曼。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill Edwin VanCleef and bring his head to Gryan Stoutmantle." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill Edwin VanCleef and bring his head to Gryan Stoutmantle."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死艾德溫·范克里夫，把他的頭交給格萊恩·斯托曼。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 166;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "那時我們正在西部荒野的一個大礦坑中工作，就是那個隱藏在月溪鎮的穀倉底下的礦坑……沒人知道當時那些可惡的 $C 是那從那裡出現的。總之礦道突然坍塌了，我逃了出來……可是其他人……就再也沒聽到過其他人的下落了。$B$B你看起來運氣可能會比我們好一點。如果你能幫我找到我弟弟的話，我會非常感謝你的。他總是戴著他的探險者協會徽章。如果你找不到他的話，那塊徽章至少還能給我帶來一些安慰……", Details AC enUS : "We were deep in a vast mine in Westfall, hidden beneath a barn in Moonbrook. No clue where these stinkin' thieving types came from. Anyway, the mine tunnel collapsed on us. I got out but the others... well... the others haven't been heard from.$b$bYou look like you might have better luck in there. If you could look for my brother, I'd be thankful.  He always carried his Explorers' League Badge. If you can't find him, that badge would at least give me some peace of mind." ; Wowhead enUS : "We were deep in a vast mine in Westfall, hidden beneath a barn in Moonbrook. No clue where these stinkin' thieving types came from. Anyway, the mine tunnel collapsed on us. I got out but the others... well... the others haven't been heard from.$b$bYou look like you might have better luck in there. If you could look for my brother, I'd be thankful. He always carried his Explorers' League Badge. If you can't find him, that badge would at least give me some peace of mind."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '那時我們正在西部荒野的一個大礦坑中工作，就是那個隱藏在月溪鎮的穀倉底下的礦坑……沒人知道當時那些可惡的盜賊是那從那裡出現的。總之礦道突然坍塌了，我逃了出來……可是其他人……就再也沒聽到過其他人的下落了。$b$b你看起來運氣可能會比我們好一點。如果你能幫我找到我弟弟的話，我會非常感謝你的。他總是戴著他的探險者協會徽章。如果你找不到他的話，那塊徽章至少還能給我帶來一些安慰……', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 167;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "懸賞!加塞爾佐格是黑石氏族襲擊石望要塞和多次劫掠湖畔鎮等行動的領導者。$b$b他是個十分危險的傢伙。根據線報，他躲藏在剛剛被他們攻陷的要塞中，謀劃著黑石氏族的下一次劫掠行動。我們必須不惜一切代價把這些在我們的國土上橫行的獸人鎮壓下去。如果有那個勇士能把加塞爾佐格的頭帶到所羅門鎮長面前的話，他將會得到重賞。", Details AC enUS : "Wanted! Gath'Ilzogg, Leader of the Blackrock attacks on Stonewatch Keep and raids against the township of Lakeshire. $b$bGath'Ilzogg is extremely dangerous.  He is reportedly holed up in the recently conquered keep plotting the Blackrock clan's further crimes against humanity.  The orc infestation must be quelled at all costs.  A gracious reward will be given to whatever brave soul can deliver the head of Gath'Ilzogg to Magistrate Solomon." ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted! Gath'Ilzogg, Leader of the Blackrock attacks on Stonewatch Keep and raids against the township of Lakeshire.$b$bGath'Ilzogg is extremely dangerous. He is reportedly holed up in the recently conquered keep plotting the Blackrock clan's further crimes against humanity. The orc infestation must be quelled at all costs. A gracious reward will be given to whatever brave soul can deliver the head of Gath'Ilzogg to Magistrate Solomon."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '懸賞!加塞爾佐格是黑石氏族襲擊石堡和多次劫掠湖畔鎮等行動的領導者。$b$b他是個十分危險的傢伙。根據線報，他躲藏在剛剛被他們攻陷的要塞中，謀劃著黑石氏族的下一次劫掠行動。我們必須不惜一切代價把這些在我們的國土上橫行的獸人鎮壓下去。如果有那個勇士能把加塞爾佐格的頭帶到所羅門鎮長面前的話，他將會得到重賞。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 169;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "巴爾林·霜錘要你去殺死6個石齶穴居怪和6個壯實的石齶穴居怪。", Objectives AC enUS : "Balir Frosthammer wants you to kill 6 Rockjaw Troggs and 6 Burly Rockjaw Troggs." ; Wowhead enUS : "Balir Frosthammer wants you to kill 6 Rockjaw Troggs and 6 Burly Rockjaw Troggs.",  OLD Details : "我希望你是到這裡來助我們一臂之力的， $C 。在上一次穴居怪襲擊之後，我們的人手就明顯不夠了。$B$B我聽說他們現在已經遍佈我們的國土，看來寒脊山谷也不例外。東南部的山區和湖畔已經到處都是穴居怪的身影了。$B$B糟糕的事情還不只是這些，幾天前，他們襲擊並佔領了我們西邊的營地!$B$B我們這兒人手有些不足，小姑娘，我們需要強大的武力幫助我們趕走這些傢伙。", Details AC enUS : "I hope you're here to lend us a hand, $c. After the last trogg attack, we could use all the help we can get.$b$bI hear the buggers have been popping up all across the lands, and it seems Coldridge Valley is no exception. They've been spotted all over the hills to the southeast and near the frozen lake.$b$bAnd that's not all, just a few nights ago, they attacked and overran our camp to the west! $b$bWe're a bit shorthanded here, $g lad : lass;, and we need strong arms to help drive the troggs back." ; Wowhead enUS : "I hope you're here to lend us a hand, $c. After the last trogg attack, we could use all the help we can get.$b$bI hear the buggers have been popping up all across the lands, and it seems Coldridge Valley is no exception. They've been spotted all over the hills to the southeast and near the frozen lake.$b$bAnd that's not all, just a few nights ago, they attacked and overran our camp to the west!$b$bWe're a bit shorthanded here, $glad:lass, and we need strong arms to help drive the troggs back.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Rockjaw Trogg slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Burly Rockjaw Trogg slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '巴爾林·霜錘要你去殺死6個石齶穴居人和6個壯實的石齶怪。', `Details` = '我希望你是到這裡來助我們一臂之力的，$c。在上一次石齶怪襲擊之後，我們的人手就明顯不夠了。$b$b我聽說他們現在已經遍佈我們的國土，看來寒脊山谷也不例外。東南部的山區和湖畔已經到處都是石齶怪的身影了。$b$b糟糕的事情還不只是這些，幾天前，他們襲擊並佔領了我們西邊的營地!$b$b我們這兒人手有些不足，$g小伙子:小姑娘，我們需要強大的武力幫助我們趕走這些傢伙。', `Objectivetext1` = '石齶穴居人 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '壯實的石齶怪 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 170;
