UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '冬天爺爺在這裡！', `Objectives` = '和冬天爺爺談談；他在鐵爐堡燻木牧場商人區旁邊。', `Details` = '冬幕節快樂，我的朋友！你一定要去跟現在正在鐵爐堡的冬天爺爺打個招呼！如果你今年表現的不錯的話，你會在冬幕節那天收到一份很棒的禮物。你一定要告訴冬天爺爺你今年想要什麼！$b$b另外，記得多買些好東西來給那些今年表現得好的人。我們這裡貨物齊全。各種貨物一應俱全——這是燻木牧場精心為您準備的貨物！', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 7023;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "冬天爺爺在這裡!", Title AC enUS : "Great-father Winter is Here!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Great-father Winter is Here!",  OLD Objectives : "和冬天爺爺談談;他在奧格瑪燻木牧場商人區旁邊。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Greatfather Winter; he is located near the Smokywood Pastures vendor area in Orgrimmar." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Greatfather Winter; he is located near the Smokywood Pastures vendor area in Orgrimmar.",  OLD Details : "冬幕節快樂，我的朋友!你一定要去跟現在正在奧格瑪的冬天爺爺打個招呼!如果你今年表現的不錯的話，你會在冬幕節那天收到一份很棒的禮物。你一定要告訴冬天爺爺你今年想要什麼!$B$B另外，記得多買些好東西來給那些今年表現得好的人。我們這裡貨物齊全。各種貨物一應俱全─這是燻木牧場精心為您準備的貨物!", Details AC enUS : "Have a wondrous Winter Veil, friend!  Be sure to say hello to Greatfather Winter, who's currently in Orgrimmar!  If you've been nice this year, you'll receive wondrous treats on the day of the Feast of Winter Veil.  Be sure to tell him what you hope to get this year!$B$BAlso, be sure to stock up on treats to give those who've been nice this year.  We have a great selection to choose from.  Fresh from our farm to your plate - it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Have a wondrous Winter Veil, friend! Be sure to say hello to Greatfather Winter, who's currently in Orgrimmar! If you've been nice this year, you'll receive wondrous treats on the day of the Feast of Winter Veil. Be sure to tell him what you hope to get this year!$b$bAlso, be sure to stock up on treats to give those who've been nice this year. We have a great selection to choose from. Fresh from our farm to your plate - it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '冬天爺爺在這裡！', `Objectives` = '和冬天爺爺談談；他在奧格瑪燻木牧場商人區旁邊。', `Details` = '冬幕節快樂，我的朋友！你一定要去跟現在正在奧格瑪的冬天爺爺打個招呼！如果你今年表現的不錯的話，你會在冬幕節那天收到一份很棒的禮物。你一定要告訴冬天爺爺你今年想要什麼！$b$b另外，記得多買些好東西來給那些今年表現得好的人。我們這裡貨物齊全。各種貨物一應俱全——這是燻木牧場精心為您準備的貨物！', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 7024;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "嘿，你能幫冬天爺爺一個忙嗎，小$g男孩:女孩;？$B$B不用我說你也看得出來，冬天爺爺一天到晚都在這裡忙碌，所以他想吃些東西。要是有幾塊薑餅和一杯搭配的冰牛奶那就太棒了。你是冬天爺爺的朋友吧，可以帶一些給我嗎？", Details AC enUS : "Hey, can you do Greatfather Winter a favor, um, little $g boy : girl;?$B$BNot to needlessly talk about myself in the third person, but Greatfather Winter has been at this all day and he could use a treat himself.  Some gingerbread cookies and ice cold milk to wash them down with would really hit the spot.  Think you could be a friend to the Greatfather and fetch some for me?" ; Wowhead enUS : "Hey, can you do Greatfather Winter a favor, um, little $gboy:girl?$b$bNot to needlessly talk about myself in the third person, but Greatfather Winter has been at this all day and he could use a treat himself. Some gingerbread cookies and ice cold milk to wash them down with would really hit the spot. Think you could be a friend to the Greatfather and fetch some for me?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '嘿，你能幫冬天爺爺一個忙嗎，小$g男孩:女孩?$b$b不用我說你也看得出來，冬天爺爺一天到晚都在這裡忙碌，所以他想吃些東西。一些薑餅搭配一杯冰牛奶將會非常正點 。你是冬天爺爺的朋友吧，可以帶些給我嗎?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 7025;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "那個卑鄙的傢伙...", Title AC enUS : "You're a Mean One..." ; Wowhead enUS : "You're a Mean One...",  OLD Objectives : "打敗躲在希爾斯布萊德丘陵的無草洞裡的「可惡的格林奇」，然後找回被偷走的禮物，並釋放麋鹿梅特森。", Objectives AC enUS : "Locate and return the Stolen Treats to Wulmort Jinglepocket in Ironforge.  It was last thought to be in the possession of the Abominable Greench, found somewhere in the snowy regions of the Alterac Mountains.$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Locate and return the Stolen Treats to Wulmort Jinglepocket in Ironforge.  It was last thought to be in the possession of the Abominable Greench, found somewhere in the snowy regions of the Alterac Mountains.",  OLD Details : "一個叫做「可惡的格林奇」的生物偷走了我們的禮物，$n。但是要小心!他不但兇殘，一旁還有那些綠色小地精助紂為虐!$B$B如果你要對付他的話，可能需要一點幫助。傳言說他把禮物和我們敬愛的麋鹿梅特森藏在希爾斯布萊德丘陵的無草洞裡!在慶祝儀式搞砸、暴風城的小朋友失望前，替我們找出那些禮物，$n!", Details AC enUS : "A c-c-creature called "The Abominable Greench" is the one w-w-who stole our shipment of t-t-treats, $N.  Be c-c-careful though!  He is t-t-the one who turned me into this s-s-snowy mess!$B$BYou're g-g-gonna need some help in f-f-facing him.  I've seen him w-w-wander all around where the y-y-yeti are; he's s-s-surely here s-s-somewhere!  F-f-find the treats $N, take them b-b-back to Smokywood Pastures in Ironforge, and t-t-tell them I n-n-need to be unfrozen!" ; Wowhead enUS : "A c-c-creature called "The Abominable Greench" is the one w-w-who stole our shipment of t-t-treats, $n. Be c-c-careful though! He is t-t-the one who turned me into this s-s-snowy mess!$b$bYou're g-g-gonna need some help in f-f-facing him. I've seen him w-w-wander all around where the y-y-yeti are; he's s-s-surely here s-s-somewhere! F-f-find the treats $n, take them b-b-back to Smokywood Pastures in Ironforge, and t-t-tell them I n-n-need to be unfrozen!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '你是個卑鄙的人……', `Objectives` = '找到並把被偷走的禮品帶給鐵爐堡的烏爾莫特。它被可惡的格林奇拿走了，去奧特蘭克山脈的雪地中去找它。', `Details` = '一個叫做「可惡的格林奇」的生-生-生物偷走了我們的貨-貨-貨物，$n。但是要小-小-小心！就-就-就是他把我變成了一團雪-雪-雪人的！$b$b如果你要-要-要面-面-面對他的話，你可-可-可能需要一點幫助。我看見他總是在雪-雪-雪怪出沒的地方晃-晃-晃悠；他一-一-一定在那-那-那裡！找-找-找到我們的貨物，$n，把貨物帶回-回-回給鐵爐堡的燻木牧場，並告-告-告訴他們我需-需-需要解凍！', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 7043;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "請自由取閱那本「冬幕節」來學習更多關於這個節日的意義。當你看完這本書後，把它送去給雷霆崖的貝恩‧血蹄。", Objectives AC enUS : "Feel free to read the book, "The Feast of Winter Veil", to learn more about the holiday.  When you are finished with the book, deliver it to Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff." ; Wowhead enUS : "Feel free to read the book, "The Feast of Winter Veil", to learn more about the holiday.  When you are finished with the book, deliver it to Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff.",  OLD Details : "來!若你有興趣更了解冬幕節的話，可以閱讀這本書。儘管我認為我們對傳說的認知才是正確的，但是鄉土研究員的身分還是讓我覺得收集這些擁有相同起源的資訊非常有趣。$B$B當你完成了以後，把這本書拿給雷霆崖的貝恩‧血蹄。我知道若聽到有其他人關注著我們族人的傳說，他會感到很有興趣的。", Details AC enUS : "Here - if you are interested in learning more about the Feast of Winter Veil, read this book.  While I think our recognition of the legend is the appropriate one, I'm enough of a student of legends to appreciate the collection of all information into a single source.$B$BWhen you're done, take the book to Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff.  I know for a fact he'd be interested in hearing that others have taken an interest in the lore of our people.  " ; Wowhead enUS : "Here - if you are interested in learning more about the Feast of Winter Veil, read this book. While I think our recognition of the legend is the appropriate one, I'm enough of a student of legends to appreciate the collection of all information into a single source.$b$bWhen you're done, take the book to Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff. I know for a fact he'd be interested in hearing that others have taken an interest in the lore of our people."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '請自由取閱那本「冬幕節」來學習更多關於這個節日的意義。當你看完這本書後，把它送去給雷霆崖的凱恩·血蹄。', `Details` = '這兒 - 若你有興趣對冬幕節了解更多的話，可以閱讀這本書。當我認為我們對於確認這個傳說的行為是適當的同時，我也受夠了學者把珍貴的資訊都搜括到一個地方的行為。$b$b當你完成了以後，把這本書拿給凱恩·血蹄。我知道他若聽到有其他人關注著我們族人的傳說之時，他會感到有興趣的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 7061;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "冬幕節的意義", Title AC enUS : "The Reason for the Season" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Reason for the Season",  OLD Objectives : "跟鐵爐堡的探險者協會的歷史學家卡尼克詢問關於冬幕節的事情。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Historian Karnik at the Explorer's League in Ironforge about the Feast of Winter Veil." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Historian Karnik at the Explorer's League in Ironforge about the Feast of Winter Veil.",  OLD Details : "禮物、點心、獎品...我要說，呸!$B$B那些哥布林玷污了這個季節的真正意義。冬幕節，這是個萬物復甦的時刻，整個大地安靜的覆蓋在冬天爺爺所帶來的薄雪之下，冬天爺爺可不是那個穿著紅色外套的笨蛋!$B$B如果你想要瞭解更多關於冬幕節的事情，就去問問探險者協會的歷史學家卡尼克吧。他肯定會因為有人對禮物不感興趣而是對冬幕節的歷史感興趣而感到驚奇的。", Details AC enUS : "Gifts, treats, presents... bah, I say!$B$BThose goblins pollute the true meaning of this season - the Feast of Winter Veil.  This is a time of renewal; the land slumbers under a blanket of snow brought forth by Greatfather Winter, who is NOT the bumbling fool over there in the red suit!$B$BIf you're interested in learning what the Feast is all about for yourself, ask Historian Karnik at the Explorer's League.  I'm sure he'll be surprised that someone cares about history rather than getting presents." ; Wowhead enUS : "Gifts, treats, presents... bah, I say!$b$bThose goblins pollute the true meaning of this season - the Feast of Winter Veil. This is a time of renewal; the land slumbers under a blanket of snow brought forth by Greatfather Winter, who is NOT the bumbling fool over there in the red suit!$b$bIf you're interested in learning what the Feast is all about for yourself, ask Historian Karnik at the Explorer's League. I'm sure he'll be surprised that someone cares about history rather than getting presents."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '季節的由來', `Objectives` = '跟鐵爐堡的探險者聯盟的史學家卡尼克詢問關於冬幕節的事情。', `Details` = '禮物，款待，獎品……我要說，呸！$b$b那些哥布林玷污了這個季節的真正意義——冬幕節。這是個萬物復甦的時刻，整個大地安靜的覆蓋在冬天爺爺所帶來的薄雪之下，冬天爺爺可不是那個穿著紅色外套的笨蛋！$b$b如果你想要瞭解更多關於冬幕節的事情，就去問問探險者聯盟的史學家卡尼克吧。它肯定會因為有人對禮物不感興趣而是對冬幕節的歷史感興趣而感到驚奇的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 7062;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "請自由翻閱「冬幕節」這本書來學習更多關於這個節日的意義。當你看完這本書後，把它送去給鐵爐堡的穆拉丁‧銅鬚。", Objectives AC enUS : "Feel free to read the book, "The Feast of Winter Veil", to learn more about the holiday.  When you are finished with the book, deliver it to King Magni Bronzebeard in Ironforge." ; Wowhead enUS : "Feel free to read the book, "The Feast of Winter Veil", to learn more about the holiday.  When you are finished with the book, deliver it to King Magni Bronzebeard in Ironforge.",  OLD Details : "拿著，若你有興趣對冬幕節多點了解的話，不妨看看這本書。雖然我也認同冬幕節的各種慶祝和紀念活動，但身為學者的我，還是把關於此傳說的所有故事都集結成了一本書。$B$B等你看完以後，把這本書拿給國王穆拉丁‧銅鬚。我敢說，他一定會很高興知道，還有其他人也對古老的傳說感到興趣。", Details AC enUS : "Here - if you are interested in learning more about the Feast of Winter Veil, read this book.  While I think our recognition of the legend is the appropriate one, I'm enough of a scholar to appreciate the collection of all information into a single source.$B$BWhen you're done, take the book to King Magni Bronzebeard.  I know for a fact he'd be interested in hearing that others have taken an interest in the older legends.  " ; Wowhead enUS : "Here - if you are interested in learning more about the Feast of Winter Veil, read this book. While I think our recognition of the legend is the appropriate one, I'm enough of a scholar to appreciate the collection of all information into a single source.$b$bWhen you're done, take the book to King Magni Bronzebeard. I know for a fact he'd be interested in hearing that others have taken an interest in the older legends."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '請自由取閱那本「冬幕節」的書來學習更多關於這個節日的意義。當你看完這本書後，把它送去給鐵爐堡的國王麥格尼·銅鬚。', `Details` = '拿著 - 若你有興趣對冬幕節多點了解的話，可以閱讀這本書。當我認為我們對於確認這個傳說的行為是適當的同時，我也受夠了學者把珍貴的資訊都搜括到一個地方的行為。$b$b當你看完以後，把這本書拿給國王麥格尼·銅鬚。我知道他若聽到有其他人關注著更老的傳說之時，他會感到興趣的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 7063;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "泰達希爾:卡多雷的重擔", Title AC enUS : "Crown of the Earth" ; Wowhead enUS : "Crown of the Earth",  OLD Objectives : "裝滿紫水晶之瓶。", Objectives AC enUS : "Fill the Amethyst Phial and bring it back to Corithras Moonrage in Dolanaar." ; Wowhead enUS : "Fill the Amethyst Phial and bring it back to Corithras Moonrage in Dolanaar.",  OLD Details : "你現在必須要立刻前往位於神諭之樹枝幹底部的那口月井，就在此處的西北方深處。那是我們的第一個，也是最強大的一口月井，據說井水具有伊露恩能量的純粹精華。$B$B取回一瓶井水帶來給我。當你的任務完成後，我會在達納蘇斯前方的路口與你碰面。", Details AC enUS : "All was not well with Teldrassil, however. Staghelm's carefully made plans for the new World Tree had borne out as he had hoped, but there was one small problem, a problem to which many of the troubles on Teldrassil may be attributed.$b$bHowever, I will not get into that yet. You must visit the last moonwell, to the northwest in the Oracle Glade. Under the boughs of the Oracle Tree lies the first and most powerful of our wells. Retrieve a phial of its water and return to me." ; Wowhead enUS : "All was not well with Teldrassil, however. Staghelm's carefully made plans for the new World Tree had borne out as he had hoped, but there was one small problem, a problem to which many of the troubles on Teldrassil may be attributed.$b$bHowever, I will not get into that yet. You must visit the last moonwell, to the northwest in the Oracle Glade. Under the boughs of the Oracle Tree lies the first and most powerful of our wells. Retrieve a phial of its water and return to me."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '大地之冠', `Objectives` = '用月井的水裝滿紫水晶之瓶，然後把它交給多蘭納爾的科瑞薩斯·月怒。', `Details` = '然而泰達希爾並不是一切都盡如人意。范達爾·鹿盔對於世界之樹的計畫正如他自己所希望的那樣一步步展開了，但是還有一個小問題，這個問題或許會給泰達希爾帶來一些麻煩。$b$b不過我不打算介入此事。你得去一趟最後一口月井，就在這裡西北面的神諭林地裡，就在神諭之樹的樹幹下面，那是我們的第一口也是最強大的一口月井。在那裡灌一瓶水，然後回來向我報告。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 7383;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將奧妮克希亞的頭顱交給暴風城的傑塔瑞斯上將。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take the Head of Onyxia to King Varian Wrynn in Stormwind." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take the Head of Onyxia to King Varian Wrynn in Stormwind.",  OLD Details : "你完成了一項不可能完成的任務。黑龍公主橫屍在你的面前。拿下她的頭顱，把它交給上將，將榮耀獻給國王。", Details AC enUS : "You have accomplished the impossible. The brood mother of the Black Dragonflight lies dead at your feet. Take her head and present it to the King Varian Wrynn." ; Wowhead enUS : "You have accomplished the impossible. The brood mother of the Black Dragonflight lies dead at your feet. Take her head and present it to the King Varian Wrynn."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將奧妮克希亞的頭顱交給暴風城的大領主伯瓦爾·弗塔根。', `Details` = '你完成了一個幾乎不可能完成的任務。黑龍公主已經被你斬殺。拿下她的頭顱，把它交給暴風城的大領主。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 7495;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "到英雄谷去找到瑪丁雷少校，$n。他會在那裡等著你...", Details AC enUS : "Seek out Major Mattingly in the Valley of Heroes, $N. He will be expecting you..." ; Wowhead enUS : "Seek out Major Mattingly in the Valley of Heroes, $n. He will be expecting you..."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '到英雄谷去找到瑪丁雷少校，$n。他會在那裡等著你……', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 7496;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將奈法利安的頭顱交給暴風城的傑塔瑞斯上將。", Objectives AC enUS : "Return the Head of Nefarian to King Varian Wrynn in Stormwind." ; Wowhead enUS : "Return the Head of Nefarian to King Varian Wrynn in Stormwind.",  OLD Details : "以前的感覺又回來了，勝利的喜悅和傷痛的折磨流遍你的身體。在你面前的是奈法利安那顆巨大而布滿創傷的頭顱。勇士，將這顆頭顱交給上將吧。", Details AC enUS : "The old feeling returns. The welcome pangs of victory reverberate throughout your being. Before you lies the monolithic, battle scarred head of Nefarian. Return it to King Varian Wrynn, champion." ; Wowhead enUS : "The old feeling returns. The welcome pangs of victory reverberate throughout your being. Before you lies the monolithic, battle scarred head of Nefarian. Return it to King Varian Wrynn, champion."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將奈法利安的頭顱交給暴風城的大領主伯瓦爾·弗塔根。', `Details` = '以前的感覺又回來了，勝利的喜悅和傷痛的折磨流遍你的身體。在你面前的是奈法利安那顆巨大而佈滿創傷的頭顱。勇士，將這顆頭顱交給你的大領主吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 7781;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "回到暴風城的英雄谷跟石橋元帥談話。", Objectives AC enUS : "Venture to the Valley of Heroes in Stormwind City and speak with Field Marshal Afrasiabi." ; Wowhead enUS : "Venture to the Valley of Heroes in Stormwind City and speak with Field Marshal Stonebridge.",  OLD Details : "到英雄谷去，與石橋元帥談話。", Details AC enUS : "Go to the Valley of Heroes and speak with Field Marshal Afrasiabi." ; Wowhead enUS : "Go to the Valley of Heroes and speak with Field Marshal Stonebridge."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '回到暴風城的英雄谷跟艾法希比元帥談話。', `Details` = '到英雄谷去，與艾法希比元帥談話。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 7782;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將這張免費獎券兌換券交給暗月馬戲團中的吉瓦斯‧葛萊蓋特。", Objectives AC enUS : "Deliver the Free Ticket Voucher to Gelvas Grimgate, located inside the Darkmoon Faire carnival." ; Wowhead enUS : "Deliver the Free Ticket Voucher to Gelvas Grimgate, located inside the Darkmoon Faire carnival.",  OLD Details : "暗月馬戲團來囉!快來快來，體驗刺激的遊戲，贏取絕佳的贈品，占卜你的未來!$B$B如果你現在就行動，你可以用這張兌換券去兌換免費的獎品券，另外還有一本世界知名的暗月冒險者指南喔!這本指南能幫你尋找和辨識旅途中的寶物!$B$B只要把你的兌換券交給馬戲團裡的吉瓦斯‧葛萊蓋特就行了。$B$B馬戲團現在就在艾爾文森林的閃金鎮外頭。", Details AC enUS : "The Darkmoon Faire is coming!  Be sure to experience all the wonders and excitement of it when it comes to town!$B$BIf you act right now, you can redeem this voucher for free prize tickets!  Just hand your voucher to Gelvas Grimgate located inside the carnival.$B$BRight now, the Faire is outside Goldshire, in the Elwynn Forest.  Don't miss out!  Go today!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Darkmoon Faire is coming! Be sure to experience all the wonders and excitement of it when it comes to town!$b$bIf you act right now, you can redeem this voucher for free prize tickets! Just hand your voucher to Gelvas Grimgate located inside the carnival.$b$bRight now, the Faire is outside Goldshire, in the Elwynn Forest. Don't miss out! Go today!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將這張免費獎券兌換券交給暗月馬戲團中的吉瓦斯·葛萊蓋特。', `Details` = '暗月馬戲團來囉!它們進城後，你一定要去體驗所有驚奇與刺激!$b$b如果你現在就行動，你可以用這張禮券去兌換免費的獎品券!只要把你的禮券交給馬戲團裡的吉瓦斯·葛萊蓋特就行了。$b$b現在，馬戲團就在閃金鎮外，在艾爾文森林。千萬別錯過囉!今天就去吧!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 7905;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "前往西瘟疫之地的光明使者烏瑟的墓碑，在墓碑前放下他的祭品。在收穫節結束之前返回鐵爐堡的瓦格納‧巨錘那兒。", Objectives AC enUS : "Travel to Uther's Tomb in Western Plaguelands and use Uther's Tribute at his statue, and then return to Wagner Hammerstrike outside Ironforge before the Harvest Festival is over." ; Wowhead enUS : "Travel to Uther's Tomb in Western Plaguelands and use Uther's Tribute at his statue, and then return to Wagner Hammerstrike outside Ironforge before the Harvest Festival is over.",  OLD Details : "在艾澤拉斯收穫節上，我們對那些無私奉獻英雄們表示感謝，他們其中甚至獻出自己的性命。聯盟曾湧現出很多的英雄，但是沒有誰的光芒能超越光明使者烏瑟。$B$B將這些祭品帶到西瘟疫之地光明使者烏瑟的墓碑那兒，去表達我們的敬意吧。把祭品放在墓碑下，然後回到我們這兒來。收穫節結束之前我會一直在這兒，別浪費時間了，出發吧。", Details AC enUS : "During the Harvest Festival of Azeroth, we give thanks to heroes for the sacrifices - in some cases ultimate sacrifices - they have given on our behalf.  The Alliance acknowledges many heroes, but none weave a more tragic tale than that of Uther Lightbringer.$B$BHelp us honor Uther by taking this offering to his tomb in the Western Plaguelands.  Place it at his statue, and then return to me.  I'll only be here through the end of the festival, so waste no time in giving Uther his tribute." ; Wowhead enUS : "During the Harvest Festival of Azeroth, we give thanks to heroes for the sacrifices - in some cases ultimate sacrifices - they have given on our behalf. The Alliance acknowledges many heroes, but none weave a more tragic tale than that of Uther Lightbringer.$b$bHelp us honor Uther by taking this offering to his tomb in the Western Plaguelands. Place it at his statue, and then return to me. I'll only be here through the end of the festival, so waste no time in giving Uther his tribute."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '前往西瘟疫之地的光明使者烏瑟的墓碑，在墓碑前放下他的祭品。在收穫節結束之前返回鐵爐堡的瓦格納·巨錘那兒。', `Details` = '在艾澤拉斯收穫節上，我們對那些無私奉獻英雄們表示感謝，他們其中甚至獻出自己的性命。聯盟曾湧現出很多的英雄，但是沒有誰的光芒能超越光明使者烏瑟。$b$b將這些祭品帶到西瘟疫之地光明使者烏瑟的墓碑那兒，去表達我們的敬意吧。把祭品放在墓碑下，然後回到我們這兒來。收穫節結束之前我會一直在這兒，別浪費時間了，出發吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8149;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "前往梣谷屠魔峽谷的葛羅‧地獄吼的紀念碑，在紀念碑前放下他的祭品。在收穫節結束之前返回奧格瑪的亞尼‧納沙克那邊。", Objectives AC enUS : "Travel to Grom's Monument in the Demon Fall Canyon of Ashenvale and use Grom's Tribute at the base of the monument.  Return to Javnir Nashak outside Orgrimmar before the Harvest Festival is over." ; Wowhead enUS : "Travel to Grom's Monument in the Demon Fall Canyon of Ashenvale and use Grom's Tribute at the base of the monument.  Return to Javnir Nashak outside Orgrimmar before the Harvest Festival is over.",  OLD Details : "在艾澤拉斯收穫節上，我們對那些無私奉獻英雄們表示感謝，他們其中甚至犧牲自己的生命。部落曾湧現出許多英雄，但是沒有誰的光芒能超越葛羅‧地獄吼。$B$B將這些祭品帶到梣谷屠魔峽谷中的葛羅‧地獄吼的紀念碑那兒，去表達我們的敬意吧。把祭品放在墓碑下，然後回到我們這兒來。收穫節結束之前我會一直在這兒，別浪費時間了，出發吧。", Details AC enUS : "During the Harvest Festival of Azeroth, we give thanks to heroes for the sacrifices - in some cases ultimate sacrifices - they have given on our behalf.  The Horde acknowledges many heroes, but none exemplify strength and sacrifice more than Grom Hellscream.$B$BHelp us honor Grom by taking this offering to his monument in the Demon Fall Canyon of Ashenvale.  Place it at the base, and then return to me.  I'll only be here through the end of the festival, so waste no time in giving Grom his tribute." ; Wowhead enUS : "During the Harvest Festival of Azeroth, we give thanks to heroes for the sacrifices - in some cases ultimate sacrifices - they have given on our behalf. The Horde acknowledges many heroes, but none exemplify strength and sacrifice more than Grom Hellscream.$b$bHelp us honor Grom by taking this offering to his monument in the Demon Fall Canyon of Ashenvale. Place it at the base, and then return to me. I'll only be here through the end of the festival, so waste no time in giving Grom his tribute."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '前往梣谷屠魔峽谷的葛羅·地獄吼的墓碑，在墓碑前放下他的祭品。在收穫節結束之前返回奧格瑪的亞尼·納沙克那兒。', `Details` = '在艾澤拉斯收穫節上，我們對那些無私奉獻英雄們表示感謝，他們其中甚至犧牲自己的生命。部落曾湧現出許多英雄，但是沒有誰的光芒能超越葛羅·地獄吼。$b$b將這些祭品帶到梣谷屠魔峽谷中的葛羅·地獄吼的墓碑那兒，去表達我們的敬意吧。把祭品放在墓碑下，然後回到我們這兒來。收穫節結束之前我會一直在這兒，別浪費時間了，出發吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8150;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "阿拉希盆地的資源!", Title AC enUS : "Arathi Basin Resources!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Arathi Basin Resources!",  OLD Objectives : "獲得阿拉希盆地戰鬥的勝利，獲取一只阿拉希資源木箱，然後向避難谷地的瑪克里爾中士覆命。", Objectives AC enUS : "Win the battle for Arathi Basin, get an Arathi Resource Crate, and return it to Sergeant Maclear at Refuge Pointe." ; Wowhead enUS : "Win the battle for Arathi Basin, get an Arathi Resource Crate, and return it to Sergeant Maclear at Refuge Pointe.",  OLD Details : "我們必須依靠我們的士兵進行戰鬥，所有的士兵都會這麼告訴你的。他們還會告訴你，他們正在使用破爛不堪的裝備，饑腸轆轆地開向戰場!$B$B這就是阿拉希盆地顯得非常重要的原因。金屬，武器，食物，木材─所有我們所需要的東西都可以從那裡獲得。$B$B那就是我需要你發揮作用的地方， $N 。進入阿拉希盆地，比敵人佔據更多的基地，以此來獲得戰鬥的勝利，然後給我帶回一箱資源來。", Details AC enUS : "War must be fought with soldiers, any soldier will tell you.  They'll also say that a battle fought with poor gear or on an empty stomach is lost before it starts!$B$BThat is why Arathi Basin is important.  There are key areas in the basin that hold essential resources.  Metals, weapons, food, lumber - all are needed, and all can be gained there.$B$BThat is what I want from you, $N.  Enter Arathi Basin, win the battle by holding more bases than the enemy, and return to me with a crate of resources." ; Wowhead enUS : "War must be fought with soldiers, any soldier will tell you. They'll also say that a battle fought with poor gear or on an empty stomach is lost before it starts!$b$bThat is why Arathi Basin is important. There are key areas in the basin that hold essential resources. Metals, weapons, food, lumber - all are needed, and all can be gained there.$b$bThat is what I want from you, $n. Enter Arathi Basin, win the battle by holding more bases than the enemy, and return to me with a crate of resources."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '阿拉希盆地的資源！', `Objectives` = '獲得阿拉希盆地戰鬥的勝利，獲取一只阿拉希資源箱，然後向避難谷地的瑪克里爾中士覆命。', `Details` = '我們必須依靠我們的士兵進行戰鬥，所有的士兵都會這麼告訴你的。他們還會告訴你，他們正在使用破爛不堪的裝備，饑腸轆轆地開向戰場！$b$b這就是阿拉希盆地顯得非常重要的原因。金屬，武器，食物，木材——所有我們所需要的東西都可以從那裡獲得。$b$b那就是我需要你發揮作用的地方，$n。進入阿拉希盆地，比敵人佔據更多的基地，以此來獲得戰鬥的勝利，然後給我帶回一箱資源來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8154;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "阿拉希盆地的資源!", Title AC enUS : "Arathi Basin Resources!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Arathi Basin Resources!",  OLD Objectives : "獲得阿拉希盆地戰鬥的勝利，獲取一隻阿拉希資源木箱，然後向避難谷地的瑪克里爾中士覆命。", Objectives AC enUS : "Win the battle for Arathi Basin, get an Arathi Resource Crate, and return it to Sergeant Maclear at Refuge Pointe." ; Wowhead enUS : "Win the battle for Arathi Basin, get an Arathi Resource Crate, and return it to Sergeant Maclear at Refuge Pointe.",  OLD Details : "我們必須依靠我們的士兵進行戰鬥，所有的士兵都會這麼告訴你的。他們還會告訴你，他們正在使用破爛不堪的裝備，饑腸轆轆地開向戰場!$B$B這就是阿拉希盆地顯得非常重要的原因。金屬，武器，食物，木材─所有我們所需要的東西都可以從那裡獲得。$B$B那就是我需要你發揮作用的地方， $N 。進入阿拉希盆地，比敵人佔據更多的基地，以此來獲得戰鬥的勝利，然後給我帶回一箱資源來。", Details AC enUS : "War must be fought with soldiers, any soldier will tell you.  They'll also say that a battle fought with poor gear or on an empty stomach is lost before it starts!$B$BThat is why Arathi Basin is important.  There are key areas in the basin that hold essential resources.  Metals, weapons, food, lumber - all are needed, and all can be gained there.$B$BThat is what I want from you, $N.  Enter Arathi Basin, win the battle by holding more bases than the enemy, and return to me with a crate of resources." ; Wowhead enUS : "War must be fought with soldiers, any soldier will tell you. They'll also say that a battle fought with poor gear or on an empty stomach is lost before it starts!$b$bThat is why Arathi Basin is important. There are key areas in the basin that hold essential resources. Metals, weapons, food, lumber - all are needed, and all can be gained there.$b$bThat is what I want from you, $n. Enter Arathi Basin, win the battle by holding more bases than the enemy, and return to me with a crate of resources."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '阿拉希盆地的資源！', `Objectives` = '獲得阿拉希盆地戰鬥的勝利，獲取一隻阿拉希資源箱，然後向避難谷地的瑪克里爾中士覆命。', `Details` = '我們必須依靠我們的士兵進行戰鬥，所有的士兵都會這麼告訴你的。他們還會告訴你，他們正在使用破爛不堪的裝備，饑腸轆轆地開向戰場！$b$b這就是阿拉希盆地顯得非常重要的原因。金屬，武器，食物，木材——所有我們所需要的東西都可以從那裡獲得。$b$b那就是我需要你發揮作用的地方，$n。進入阿拉希盆地，比敵人佔據更多的基地，以此來獲得戰鬥的勝利，然後給我帶回一箱資源來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8155;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "阿拉希盆地的資源!", Title AC enUS : "Arathi Basin Resources!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Arathi Basin Resources!",  OLD Objectives : "獲得阿拉希盆地戰鬥的勝利，獲取一隻阿拉希資源木箱，然後向避難谷地的瑪克里爾中士覆命。", Objectives AC enUS : "Win the battle for Arathi Basin, get an Arathi Resource Crate, and return it to Sergeant Maclear at Refuge Pointe." ; Wowhead enUS : "Win the battle for Arathi Basin, get an Arathi Resource Crate, and return it to Sergeant Maclear at Refuge Pointe.",  OLD Details : "我們必須依靠我們的士兵進行戰鬥，所有的士兵都會這麼告訴你的。他們還會告訴你，他們正在使用破爛不堪的裝備，饑腸轆轆地開向戰場!$B$B這就是阿拉希盆地顯得非常重要的原因。金屬，武器，食物，木材─所有我們所需要的東西都可以從那裡獲得。$B$B那就是我需要你發揮作用的地方， $N 。進入阿拉希盆地，比敵人佔據更多的基地，以此來獲得戰鬥的勝利，然後給我帶回一箱資源來。", Details AC enUS : "War must be fought with soldiers, any soldier will tell you.  They'll also say that a battle fought with poor gear or on an empty stomach is lost before it starts!$B$BThat is why Arathi Basin is important.  There are key areas in the basin that hold essential resources.  Metals, weapons, food, lumber - all are needed, and all can be gained there.$B$BThat is what I want from you, $N.  Enter Arathi Basin, win the battle by holding more bases than the enemy, and return to me with a crate of resources." ; Wowhead enUS : "War must be fought with soldiers, any soldier will tell you. They'll also say that a battle fought with poor gear or on an empty stomach is lost before it starts!$b$bThat is why Arathi Basin is important. There are key areas in the basin that hold essential resources. Metals, weapons, food, lumber - all are needed, and all can be gained there.$b$bThat is what I want from you, $n. Enter Arathi Basin, win the battle by holding more bases than the enemy, and return to me with a crate of resources."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '阿拉希盆地的資源！', `Objectives` = '獲得阿拉希盆地戰鬥的勝利，獲取一隻阿拉希資源箱，然後向避難谷地的瑪克里爾中士覆命。', `Details` = '我們必須依靠我們的士兵進行戰鬥，所有的士兵都會這麼告訴你的。他們還會告訴你，他們正在使用破爛不堪的裝備，饑腸轆轆地開向戰場！$b$b這就是阿拉希盆地顯得非常重要的原因。金屬，武器，食物，木材——所有我們所需要的東西都可以從那裡獲得。$b$b那就是我需要你發揮作用的地方，$n。進入阿拉希盆地，比敵人佔據更多的基地，以此來獲得戰鬥的勝利，然後給我帶回一箱資源來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8156;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : " $N ，在阿拉希盆地的戰鬥是為了資源和領土而進行的戰鬥。這個地區作戰的關鍵是保證我們軍隊稀有物資和補給的順暢運作。我命令你去攻擊距離我們在阿拉希盆地中的基地最遠的戰略設施。$B$B當農場、礦坑、伐木場或鐵匠舖被敵人佔據時，攻擊這些設施，找到敵人的旌旗，然後把它拔掉!$B$B當你完成了奪回這四個點的任務之後，就回到我這裡來。", Details AC enUS : "$N, the battle for Arathi Basin is a battle for resources and territory.  Key points in the area must be held and operated in order to supply our forces with much needed raw materials and supplies.  I charge you to assault the points farthest from our Arathi Basin base.$B$BAssault the farm, the mine, the lumber mill and the blacksmith when they are controlled by the enemy.  Find the enemy's banner and rip it from its flag post!$B$BWhen you have done this to all four points, return to me." ; Wowhead enUS : "$n, the battle for Arathi Basin is a battle for resources and territory. Key points in the area must be held and operated in order to supply our forces with much needed raw materials and supplies. I charge you to assault the points farthest from our Arathi Basin base.$b$bAssault the farm, the mine, the lumber mill and the blacksmith when they are controlled by the enemy. Find the enemy's banner and rip it from its flag post!$b$bWhen you have done this to all four points, return to me.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Mine Assaulted" ; Wowhead enUS : "Mine Assaulted",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "Lumber Mill Assaulted" ; Wowhead enUS : "Lumber Mill Assaulted",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "Blacksmith Assaulted" ; Wowhead enUS : "Blacksmith Assaulted",  OLD Objectivetext4 : "", Objectivetext4 AC enUS : "Farm Assaulted" ; Wowhead enUS : "Farm Assaulted"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '$n，在阿拉希盆地的戰鬥是為了資源和領土而進行的戰鬥。這個地區作戰的關鍵是保證我們軍隊稀有物資和補給的順暢運作。我命令你去攻擊距離我們在阿拉希盆地中的基地最遠的戰略設施。$b$b當農場、礦坑、伐木場或鐵匠舖被敵人佔據時，攻擊這些設施，找到敵人的旗幟，然後把它拔掉!$b$b當你完成了奪回這四個點的任務之後，就回到我這裡來。', `Objectivetext1` = '突襲礦坑', `Objectivetext2` = '突襲伐木場', `Objectivetext3` = '突襲鐵匠舖', `Objectivetext4` = '突襲農場', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8166;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : " $N ，在阿拉希盆地的戰鬥是為了資源和領土而進行的戰鬥。這個地區作戰的關鍵是保證我們軍隊稀有物資和補給的順暢運作。我命令你去攻擊距離我們在阿拉希盆地中的基地最遠的戰略設施。$B$B當農場、礦坑、伐木場或鐵匠舖被敵人佔據時，攻擊這些設施，找到敵人的旌旗，然後把它拔掉!$B$B當你完成了奪回這四個點的任務之後，就回到我這裡來。", Details AC enUS : "$N, the battle for Arathi Basin is a battle for resources and territory.  Key points in the area must be held and operated in order to supply our forces with much needed raw materials and supplies.  I charge you to assault the points farthest from our Arathi Basin base.$B$BAssault the farm, the mine, the lumber mill and the blacksmith when they are controlled by the enemy.  Find the enemy's banner and rip it from its flag post!$B$BWhen you have done this to all four points, return to me." ; Wowhead enUS : "$n, the battle for Arathi Basin is a battle for resources and territory. Key points in the area must be held and operated in order to supply our forces with much needed raw materials and supplies. I charge you to assault the points farthest from our Arathi Basin base.$b$bAssault the farm, the mine, the lumber mill and the blacksmith when they are controlled by the enemy. Find the enemy's banner and rip it from its flag post!$b$bWhen you have done this to all four points, return to me.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Mine Assaulted" ; Wowhead enUS : "Mine Assaulted",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "Lumber Mill Assaulted" ; Wowhead enUS : "Lumber Mill Assaulted",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "Blacksmith Assaulted" ; Wowhead enUS : "Blacksmith Assaulted",  OLD Objectivetext4 : "", Objectivetext4 AC enUS : "Farm Assaulted" ; Wowhead enUS : "Farm Assaulted"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '$n，在阿拉希盆地的戰鬥是為了資源和領土而進行的戰鬥。這個地區作戰的關鍵是保證我們軍隊稀有物資和補給的順暢運作。我命令你去攻擊距離我們在阿拉希盆地中的基地最遠的戰略設施。$b$b當農場、礦坑、伐木場或鐵匠舖被敵人佔據時，攻擊這些設施，找到敵人的旗幟，然後把它拔掉!$b$b當你完成了奪回這四個點的任務之後，就回到我這裡來。', `Objectivetext1` = '突襲礦坑', `Objectivetext2` = '突襲伐木場', `Objectivetext3` = '突襲鐵匠舖', `Objectivetext4` = '突襲農場', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8167;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : " $N ，在阿拉希盆地的戰鬥是為了資源和領土而進行的戰鬥。這個地區作戰的關鍵是保證我們軍隊稀有物資和補給的順暢運作。我命令你去攻擊距離我們在阿拉希盆地中的基地最遠的戰略設施。$B$B當農場、礦坑、伐木場或鐵匠舖遭敵人佔據時，攻擊這些設施，找到敵人的旌旗，然後把它拔掉!$B$B當你完成了奪回這四個點的任務之後，就回到我這裡來。", Details AC enUS : "$N, the battle for Arathi Basin is a battle for resources and territory.  Key points in the area must be held and operated in order to supply our forces with much needed raw materials and supplies.  I charge you to assault the points farthest from our Arathi Basin base.$B$BAssault the farm, the mine, the lumber mill and the blacksmith when they are controlled by the enemy.  Find the enemy's banner and rip it from its flag post!$B$BWhen you have done this to all four points, return to me." ; Wowhead enUS : "$n, the battle for Arathi Basin is a battle for resources and territory. Key points in the area must be held and operated in order to supply our forces with much needed raw materials and supplies. I charge you to assault the points farthest from our Arathi Basin base.$b$bAssault the farm, the mine, the lumber mill and the blacksmith when they are controlled by the enemy. Find the enemy's banner and rip it from its flag post!$b$bWhen you have done this to all four points, return to me.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Mine Assaulted" ; Wowhead enUS : "Mine Assaulted",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "Lumber Mill Assaulted" ; Wowhead enUS : "Lumber Mill Assaulted",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "Blacksmith Assaulted" ; Wowhead enUS : "Blacksmith Assaulted",  OLD Objectivetext4 : "", Objectivetext4 AC enUS : "Farm Assaulted" ; Wowhead enUS : "Farm Assaulted"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '$n，在阿拉希盆地的戰鬥是為了資源和領土而進行的戰鬥。這個地區作戰的關鍵是保證我們軍隊稀有物資和補給的順暢運作。我命令你去攻擊距離我們在阿拉希盆地中的基地最遠的戰略設施。$b$b當農場、礦坑、伐木場或鐵匠舖遭敵人佔據時，攻擊這些設施，找到敵人的旗幟，然後把它拔掉!$b$b當你完成了奪回這四個點的任務之後，就回到我這裡來。', `Objectivetext1` = '突襲礦坑', `Objectivetext2` = '突襲伐木場', `Objectivetext3` = '突襲鐵匠舖', `Objectivetext4` = '突襲農場', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8168;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "法師的會見", Title AC enUS : "Magecraft" ; Wowhead enUS : "Magecraft",  OLD Objectives : "找到薩納斯，讓他將你傳送到大法師克希雷姆那兒。", Objectives AC enUS : "Seek out Sanath Lim-yo and gain passage to see Archmage Xylem." ; Wowhead enUS : "Seek out Sanath Lim-yo and gain passage to see Archmage Xylem.",  OLD Details : "最近經常有人打聽大法師克希雷姆……他們都跟你差不多。$B$B如果你想要找他的話，就去艾薩拉吧。克希雷姆居住在高高的懸崖頂端，只有他那傲慢的僕人薩納斯能利用傳送術到達那兒。$B$B薩納斯就在崖下紮營。你可以在埃達拉斯廢墟入口處找到通往艾薩拉的大道，在交叉路口往北直走就是了。", Details AC enUS : "Archmage Xylem has been asking around lately... for someone of your experience.$b$bIf you wish to seek him out, you can find him in Azshara.  His tower is built high atop the cliffs, and the only way up is a teleport spell invoked by his arrogant servant, Sanath Lim-yo.$b$bSanath makes camp below his master's tower.  To find him, travel to where Azshara's main road forks at the entrance to the Ruins of Eldarath.  From that spot, head directly north until you reach the cliffs." ; Wowhead enUS : "Archmage Xylem has been asking around lately... for someone of your experience.$b$bIf you wish to seek him out, you can find him in Azshara. His tower is built high atop the cliffs, and the only way up is a teleport spell invoked by his arrogant servant, Sanath Lim-yo.$b$bSanath makes camp below his master's tower. To find him, travel to where Azshara's main road forks at the entrance to the Ruins of Eldarath. From that spot, head directly north until you reach the cliffs."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '法師公會', `Objectives` = '尋找薩納斯並獲得見到大法師克希雷姆的通路。', `Details` = '大法師克希雷姆最近不斷在問起有沒有像你這種經歷的$r。$b$b如果你想要找他可以去艾薩拉。他的塔就在懸崖的頂端，而唯一可以上去的方法就是由他那傲慢的僕從薩納斯所施放的傳送法術。$b$b薩納斯紮營在他的主人的塔下。如果你要找他，先去艾薩拉的主要道路彎向埃達拉斯廢墟的轉角處。從那個地方再往北直走就可以到達懸崖了。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8250;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "魔法的塵埃", Title AC enUS : "Magic Dust" ; Wowhead enUS : "Magic Dust",  OLD Objectives : "為大法師克希雷姆收集10份閃光塵埃。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 10 Glittering Dust to Archmage Xylem." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 10 Glittering Dust to Archmage Xylem.",  OLD Details : "艾薩拉的血精靈正在尋求一種碾磨他們獲得的魔法物品的方法，通過這種方法所獲得的粉末與普通的分解法術所獲得的材料是不同的。$B$B當我派我的學徒去交換這種粉末的時候，血精靈們毫不猶豫地把他幹掉了。因此，他們必須付出代價。$B$B談判結束，$N。找到艾薩拉北部的這些血精靈，然後使用更具“說服力”的方法來獲得他們的那些閃光塵埃。", Details AC enUS : "The blood elves in Azshara have developed a method for pulverizing the magical items they acquire.  This glittering dust they produce differs from the components normally acquired by a disenchantment spell.$b$bWhen I sent my apprentice to trade for the dust, he was killed without hesitation.  For that, they must pay.$b$bThe time for talk is over, $N.  Find the blood elves along the cliffs of Azshara and use more "persuasive" methods to acquire their glittering dust." ; Wowhead enUS : "The blood elves in Azshara have developed a method for pulverizing the magical items they acquire. This glittering dust they produce differs from the components normally acquired by a disenchantment spell.$b$bWhen I sent my apprentice to trade for the dust, he was killed without hesitation. For that, they must pay.$b$bThe time for talk is over, $n. Find the blood elves along the cliffs of Azshara and use more "persuasive" methods to acquire their glittering dust."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '魔法粉末', `Objectives` = '為大法師克希雷姆收集10份閃光粉末。', `Details` = '在艾薩拉的血精靈正在尋求一種研磨他們獲得的魔法物品的方法。這種方法所獲得的粉末與普通的分解法術所獲得的材料是不同的。$b$b當我派我的學徒試圖去交易這種粉末的時候，他被毫不猶豫地幹掉了。因此，他們必須為此付出代價。$b$b談話結束，$n。找到艾薩拉北部的這些血精靈，然後使用更具「說服力」的方法來獲得他們閃光的粉末。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8251;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "納迦的珊瑚", Title AC enUS : "The Siren's Coral" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Siren's Coral",  OLD Objectives : "收集6塊魔化珊瑚，然後把它們交給大法師克希雷姆。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 6 Enchanted Coral and return them to Archmage Xylem." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 6 Enchanted Coral and return them to Archmage Xylem.",  OLD Details : "看看你的四周吧。遺跡和海岸被惡鞭納迦所佔據了。最近，它們開始熟悉這塊土地，並開始接觸產于艾薩拉的稀有材料。$B$B我說的就是魔化珊瑚——不知道為什麼，惡鞭納迦也盯上了它。海灣中的珊瑚已經所剩無幾了，但是它們對於我的研究工作來說是至關重要的。我需要你去從惡鞭海妖那裡搶回一些魔化珊瑚，然後把它們帶給我。", Details AC enUS : "Take a look around you.  The ruins and beaches are overrun with spitelash.  Recently, the wretched creatures have learned to recognize the rare components indigenous to Azshara.$b$bSpecifically, I speak of enchanted coral -- they are drawn to it by reasons unknown to me.  Now there is little coral left in the bay, and it is vital to my research.  I need you to separate some enchanted coral from the spitelash sirens and bring it to me." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take a look around you. The ruins and beaches are overrun with spitelash. Recently, the wretched creatures have learned to recognize the rare components indigenous to Azshara.$b$bSpecifically, I speak of enchanted coral -- they are drawn to it by reasons unknown to me. Now there is little coral left in the bay, and it is vital to my research. I need you to separate some enchanted coral from the spitelash sirens and bring it to me."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '海妖的珊瑚', `Objectives` = '收集6塊附魔珊瑚，然後把它們帶給大法師克希雷姆。', `Details` = '看看你的四周吧。遺跡和海岸被惡鞭納迦所佔據了。最近，它們開始熟悉這塊土地並認識到艾薩拉所擁有的稀有材料。$b$b我說的就是魔化珊瑚─不知道為什麼，惡鞭納迦也盯上了它。海灣中的珊瑚所存無幾，這對於我的研究工作非常重要。我需要你去從惡鞭海妖那裡弄一些附魔珊瑚然後帶給我。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8252;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "毀滅摩弗拉斯", Title AC enUS : "Destroy Morphaz" ; Wowhead enUS : "Destroy Morphaz",  OLD Objectives : "從摩弗拉斯身上取回奧術碎片，然後返回大法師克希雷姆那兒。", Objectives AC enUS : "Retrieve the Arcane Shard from Morphaz and return to Archmage Xylem." ; Wowhead enUS : "Retrieve the Arcane Shard from Morphaz and return to Archmage Xylem.",  OLD Details : "在沉沒的阿塔哈卡神廟深處，有一條名叫摩弗拉斯的綠龍。$B$B數年前我受到他的襲擊，在我組織起有效的防禦之前，他就把我的學徒整個吞了下去。雖然死掉個把學徒對我來說不是很嚴重的事情，但他身上有一塊巨大的、擁有極強能量的奧術碎片。$B$B你必須召集隊友，共同深入神廟。去殺死摩弗拉斯，從這傢伙的胃中取出我的奧術碎片來。", Details AC enUS : "There is a green drake deep in the sunken temple of Atal'Hakkar by the name of Morphaz.$b$bYears ago, he overwhelmed me in a bold ambush and consumed my apprentice whole.  While the loss of an apprentice is not unknown to me, this particular one carried an arcane shard of unsurpassed size and quality.$b$bYou must gather powerful allies and delve into the temple.  Destroy Morphaz and recover the arcane shard from his ageless stomach." ; Wowhead enUS : "There is a green drake deep in the sunken temple of Atal'Hakkar by the name of Morphaz.$b$bYears ago, he overwhelmed me in a bold ambush and consumed my apprentice whole. While the loss of an apprentice is not unknown to me, this particular one carried an arcane shard of unsurpassed size and quality.$b$bYou must gather powerful allies and delve into the temple. Destroy Morphaz and recover the arcane shard from his ageless stomach."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '消滅摩弗拉斯', `Objectives` = '從摩弗拉斯身上取回秘法裂片並返回大法師克希雷姆那兒。', `Details` = '在沉沒的神廟阿塔哈卡深處，有一條名叫摩弗拉斯的綠龍。$b$b數年前我受到他的襲擊，在我有能力組織防禦之前他就殺光了我所有的學徒。我知道有一名學徒已死於非命，他身上有一塊巨大的、擁有無限能量的秘法裂片。$b$b你必須跟盟友共同深入神廟。殺死摩弗拉斯，從這傢伙的胃中取出秘法裂片。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8253;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "塞納裡奧議會的求助", Title AC enUS : "Cenarion Aid" ; Wowhead enUS : "Cenarion Aid",  OLD Objectives : "找到艾薩拉的奧汀克。", Objectives AC enUS : "Seek out Ogtinc in Azshara." ; Wowhead enUS : "Seek out Ogtinc in Azshara.",  OLD Details : "神的道路是幫助那些需要幫助的人。如何去幫助他們，這並不重要；重要的是你為什麼要去幫助他們。$B$B塞納裡奧議會需要你的説明，去和艾薩拉的奧汀克談一談吧，他就住在埃達拉斯廢墟東北部懸崖的頂部。", Details AC enUS : "It is the way of the divine to help those in need.  The how is insignificant -- only the why matters.$b$bThe Cenarion Circle has such a need.  Speak with Ogtinc to lend aid to their plight.  He resides atop the cliffs to the northeast of the Ruins of Eldarath in Azshara." ; Wowhead enUS : "It is the way of the divine to help those in need. The how is insignificant -- only the why matters.$b$bThe Cenarion Circle has such a need. Speak with Ogtinc to lend aid to their plight. He resides atop the cliffs to the northeast of the Ruins of Eldarath in Azshara."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '幫助塞納里奧', `Objectives` = '尋找艾薩拉的奧汀克。', `Details` = '幫助那些需要幫助的人就是神聖之路。如何去幫助這些人不足掛齒－－重要的是為了什麼。$b$b塞納里奧議會需要你的幫助。跟奧汀克談一談並對他們的困境伸出援手。他就住在埃達拉斯廢墟的東北方的懸崖上。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8254;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "苔蹄快步者", Title AC enUS : "Of Coursers We Know" ; Wowhead enUS : "Of Coursers We Know",  OLD Objectives : "收集4份健康的野鹿腺體，把它們交給艾薩拉的奧汀克。奧汀克住在埃達拉斯廢墟東北部懸崖的頂部。", Objectives AC enUS : "Acquire 4 Healthy Courser Glands and bring them to Ogtinc in Azshara.  Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath." ; Wowhead enUS : "Acquire 4 Healthy Courser Glands and bring them to Ogtinc in Azshara.  Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath.",  OLD Details : "艾薩拉的苔蹄快步者是一種曾經居住在費伍德森林的生物，它們對疾病和毒藥免疫，因此沒有被那裡的墮落力量所感染。在它們與生俱來的智慧的指引下，苔蹄快步者簡單地選擇了離開。$B$B雖然我感到非常遺憾，但是我希望你能幫助我去獵捕這些強大的野獸。收集四份健康的野鹿腺體，這是淨化藥膏的第一種成分——我們會利用淨化藥膏來治療費伍德森林。", Details AC enUS : "The mosshoof coursers of Azshara are magnificent animals who once lived in Felwood.  They naturally resist disease and poison, and were unaffected by the corruption there.  In their ancestral wisdom, they simply chose to leave that sickened place.$b$bIt saddens my heart, but I must ask you to hunt these mighty beasts for me.  Gather four courser glands as the first ingredient for a restorative salve -- a salve we will use to heal Felwood." ; Wowhead enUS : "The mosshoof coursers of Azshara are magnificent animals who once lived in Felwood. They naturally resist disease and poison, and were unaffected by the corruption there. In their ancestral wisdom, they simply chose to leave that sickened place.$b$bIt saddens my heart, but I must ask you to hunt these mighty beasts for me. Gather four courser glands as the first ingredient for a restorative salve -- a salve we will use to heal Felwood."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '打獵者', `Objectives` = '收集4份健康的野鹿腺體並把它們帶給艾薩拉的奧汀克。奧汀克住在埃達拉斯廢墟東北部懸崖的頂部。', `Details` = '艾薩拉的苔蹄快步者是一種曾經居住在費伍德森林的偉大生物。它們對疾病和毒藥免疫，因此沒有被那裡的墮落力量所感染。在它們遠古的智慧指引下，苔蹄快步者簡單地選擇了離開。$b$b雖然我感到非常遺憾，但是我希望你能幫助我去獵捕這些強大的野獸。收集4份健康的野鹿腺體，這是淨化藥膏的第一種成分─我們會利用淨化藥膏來治療費伍德森林的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8255;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "亡靈的腐液", Title AC enUS : "The Ichor of Undeath" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Ichor of Undeath",  OLD Objectives : "為艾薩拉的奧汀克帶回一份亡靈腐液。奧汀克住在埃達拉斯廢墟東北部懸崖的頂端。", Objectives AC enUS : "Acquire an Ichor of Undeath for Ogtinc in Azshara.  Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath." ; Wowhead enUS : "Acquire an Ichor of Undeath for Ogtinc in Azshara.  Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath.",  OLD Details : "製作淨化藥膏所需的配方極其簡單：一份有毒的藥劑，兩份治療藥劑。你已經獲得了一份治療藥劑，那麼你得收集一份毒藥。$B$B埃達拉斯廢墟附近徘徊的上層精靈充滿了邪惡的力量，它們經常會生出一些令人作嘔的綠色粘液。這種東西被稱為亡靈腐液。$B$B這種東西的邪惡力量非常強大，因此我只需要你帶給我一份亡靈腐液就行了。", Details AC enUS : "For this restorative salve, you must use a simple formula: one part poison, two parts cure.  You have acquired one cure, now you must gather the poison.$b$bPowerful undead, such as the lingering highborne who wander the Ruins of Eldarath, are sometimes so infused with evil that it coalesces into a sickly greenish goo.  To the living, this substance is known as ichor of undeath.$b$bDue to the potency of this vile element, I require only a single ichor." ; Wowhead enUS : "For this restorative salve, you must use a simple formula: one part poison, two parts cure. You have acquired one cure, now you must gather the poison.$b$bPowerful undead, such as the lingering highborne who wander the Ruins of Eldarath, are sometimes so infused with evil that it coalesces into a sickly greenish goo. To the living, this substance is known as ichor of undeath.$b$bDue to the potency of this vile element, I require only a single ichor."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '亡靈腐液', `Objectives` = '為艾薩拉的奧汀克帶回1份亡靈腐液。奧汀克住在埃達拉斯廢墟東北部懸崖的頂端。', `Details` = '製作淨化藥膏所需的配方極其簡單:一份有毒的藥劑，兩份治療藥劑。你已經獲得了一份治療藥劑，那麼你得收集一份毒藥。$b$b埃達拉斯廢墟附近徘徊的精靈貴族充滿了邪惡，它們經常會生出一些令人作嘔的綠色粘液。這種東西被稱為不死生物腐液。$b$b這種東西邪惡力量非常強大，我只需要你帶給我一份不死生物腐液。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8256;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "轉至沉沒的阿塔哈卡神廟，殺死綠龍摩弗拉斯，將他的血液交給費伍德森林中的格雷塔·苔蹄。沉沒的神廟的入口就在悲傷沼澤中。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill Morphaz in the sunken temple of Atal'Hakkar, and return his blood to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.  The entrance to the sunken temple can be found in the Swamp of Sorrows." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill Morphaz in the sunken temple of Atal'Hakkar, and return his blood to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.  The entrance to the sunken temple can be found in the Swamp of Sorrows.",  OLD Details : "藥劑的最後一種成分就是我以前說的第二種治療藥劑。$B$B據說綠龍摩弗拉斯對任何形式的毒藥和疾病都免疫——這是無數德魯伊用生命換來的資訊。毫無疑問，他的血液符合我們的要求。$B$B在你收集最後一種成分時，塞納裡奧議會的一名信使將帶走你已經收集到的成分。召集你的夥伴，轉至沉沒的阿塔哈卡神廟中的綠龍巢穴吧。將他的血液交給費伍德森林中的格雷塔·苔蹄。", Details AC enUS : "Now the last part, the second cure.$b$bThe green drake Morphaz is known to be immune to all forms of poison and disease -- many druids died to bring us this information.  There is no doubt his blood is potent for our needs.$b$bA courier from the Cenarion Circle will take the parts you have already collected while you gather the last.  Summon your allies and seek out the drake's lair in the sunken temple of Atal'Hakkar.  Bring his blood to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood." ; Wowhead enUS : "Now the last part, the second cure.$b$bThe green drake Morphaz is known to be immune to all forms of poison and disease -- many druids died to bring us this information. There is no doubt his blood is potent for our needs.$b$bA courier from the Cenarion Circle will take the parts you have already collected while you gather the last. Summon your allies and seek out the drake's lair in the sunken temple of Atal'Hakkar. Bring his blood to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '前往沉沒的神廟阿塔哈卡，殺死摩弗拉斯，將他的血液交給費伍德森林中的格雷塔·苔蹄。沉沒的神廟的入口就在悲傷沼澤。', `Details` = '藥劑的最後一種成分是第二種治療劑。$b$b據說綠龍摩弗拉斯對任何形式的毒藥和疾病免疫─無數德魯伊用生命換來了這個資訊。毫無疑問，他的血液符合我們的要求。$b$b在你收集最後一種成分時，塞納里奧議會的一名信使將帶走你已經收集到的成分。召集盟友，前往沉沒的神廟阿塔哈卡中的綠龍巢穴吧。將他的血液帶給費伍德森林中的格雷塔·苔蹄。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8257;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在通靈學院地下室的屍骨儲藏所的中心使用預言水晶球，然後與被召喚出來的幽靈作戰。擊敗這些幽靈之後，死亡騎士達克雷爾才會出現，你的任務就是擊敗他。$B$B把死亡騎士達克雷爾的徽記交給奧格瑞瑪智慧穀的薩格尼。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance.  Doing so will bring forth spirits you must fight.  Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver; defeat him.$B$BBring Darkreaver's Head to Sagorne Creststrider in the Valley of Wisdom, Orgrimmar." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance.  Doing so will bring forth spirits you must fight.  Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver; defeat him.$b$bBring Darkreaver's Head to Sagorne Creststrider in the Valley of Wisdom, Orgrimmar.",  OLD Details : "死亡騎士達克雷爾主宰了通靈學院的屍骨儲藏所。他威脅要扭曲整個靈魂國度來達到他自己的目的，我們必須阻止他！這就是水晶球可以幫助你的地方。$B$B在屍骨儲藏所地下室的中心使用預言水晶球，以此來召喚達克雷爾的爪牙。擊敗這些爪牙，接下來死亡騎士就會出現了。$N，把他的徽記帶給我！只有他的死亡才可以將靈魂國度的局勢扭轉過來！", Details AC enUS : "Death Knight Darkreaver lords over the Great Ossuary in the Scholomance.  He threatens to twist the spirit realm to do his own bidding, and he must be stopped!  This is where the scryer you helped make comes into play.$B$BUse the divination scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement to call forth Darkreaver's spirit minions.  Defeat the spirits and the death knight himself will appear.  $N, bring me his head!  Only his demise will reverse the damage done to the spirit realm!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Death Knight Darkreaver lords over the Great Ossuary in the Scholomance. He threatens to twist the spirit realm to do his own bidding, and he must be stopped! This is where the scryer you helped make comes into play.$b$bUse the divination scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement to call forth Darkreaver's spirit minions. Defeat the spirits and the death knight himself will appear. $n, bring me his head! Only his demise will reverse the damage done to the spirit realm!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '在斯坦索姆地下室的屍骨儲藏所的中心使用預言水晶球。然後你必須與被召喚出來的幽靈作戰。擊敗這些幽靈之後，死亡騎士達克雷爾才會出現，你的任務就是擊敗他。$b$b把死亡騎士達克雷爾的頭顱交給奧格瑪智慧穀的薩格尼。', `Details` = '死亡騎士達克雷爾主宰了通靈學院的屍骨儲藏所。他威脅要扭曲整個靈魂國度來達到他自己的目的，我們必須阻止他!這就是水晶球可以幫助你的地方。$b$b在屍骨儲藏所地下室的中心使用預言水晶球，以此來召喚達克雷爾的靈魂爪牙。擊敗這些靈魂，接下來死亡騎士就會出現了。$n，把他的頭帶給我!只有他的死亡才可以將靈魂國度的局勢扭轉過來!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8258;
