-- AC datas : OLD Details : "", Details AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "How does it feel, $n? How does it feel to crush your enemies and watch their lines break apart? It feels good, doesn't it?$b$bYou should be rewarded for this heroic deed, soldier."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '感覺如何 $n? 摧毀你的敵人，看著他們的防衛線瓦解感覺如何?感覺很好，不是嗎?$b$b你應該為此次英勇行動感到光榮， 士兵。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8272;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "與希利蘇斯塞納裡奧要塞的喚風者梅恩·長角談一談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Talk to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus." ; Wowhead enUS : "Talk to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",  OLD Details : "注意了，聯盟的英雄們！有這樣一個威脅，我們長久以來都沒能將它消除。希利蘇斯地區的蟲穴中傳來的震顫提醒我們，它們的數量正在不斷地增加，它們正在準備更大規模的擴張！$B$B塞納裡奧議會的力量已經聚集在希利蘇斯，要及時地阻止那些異種生物！它們絕不能污染我們的土地！$B$B所有符合條件的勇士都去塞納裡奧要塞向喚風者梅恩·長角報告吧！異種生物必須被徹底消滅！", Details AC enUS : "Attention, heroes of the Alliance!  The silithid menace has been left unchecked for too long.  Unfettered by any real opposition, they've been preparing all this time for a large-scale expansion.  $B$BCenarion Circle forces are gathering in Silithus to take the fight to these wretched creatures and all able-bodied adventurers are hereby called to join us!$B$BDon't wait until it's too late!  Aid us in the defense of Azeroth! Report to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold for specific instructions!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Attention, heroes of the Alliance! The silithid menace has been left unchecked for too long. Unfettered by any real opposition, they've been preparing all this time for a large-scale expansion.$b$bCenarion Circle forces are gathering in Silithus to take the fight to these wretched creatures and all able-bodied adventurers are hereby called to join us!$b$bDon't wait until it's too late! Aid us in the defense of Azeroth! Report to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold for specific instructions!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '和在希利蘇斯塞納里奧城堡裡的喚風者傲角談話。', `Details` = '注意，聯盟的英雄們!異種蠍的威脅已經未經調查很久了。他們被真正的敵方釋放，這些時間都在準備一次大規模的擴張。$b$b塞納里奧議會的軍隊正在希利蘇斯集結以打敗這些可惡的生物，所有健全的冒險者都應該要加入我們!$b$b再等就來不及了!幫助我們防守艾澤拉斯!向塞納里奧城堡的喚風者傲角報告以獲得詳細指示!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8275;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "與希利蘇斯塞納裡奧要塞的喚風者梅恩·長角談一談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Talk to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus." ; Wowhead enUS : "Talk to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",  OLD Details : "注意了，部落的勇士們！有這樣一個威脅，我們長久以來都沒能將它消除。希利蘇斯地區的蟲穴中傳來的震顫提醒我們，它們的數量正在不斷地增加，它們正在準備更大規模的擴張！$B$B塞納裡奧議會的力量已經聚集在希利蘇斯，要及時地阻止那些異種生物！它們絕不能污染我們的土地！$B$B所有符合條件的勇士都去塞納裡奧要塞向喚風者梅恩·長角報告吧！異種生物必須被徹底消滅！", Details AC enUS : "Attention, champions of the Horde!  There's a threat we've left unchallenged for too long.  Tremors in the earth near silithid hives all around Azeroth have alerted us to large movements in their numbers as they prepare for expansion.$B$BCenarion Circle forces are gathering in Silithus to take the fight to the silithid before it's too late!  No more shall they defile our lands!$B$BAll able-bodied combatants are to report to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold!  The silithid shall be vanquished!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Attention, champions of the Horde! There's a threat we've left unchallenged for too long. Tremors in the earth near silithid hives all around Azeroth have alerted us to large movements in their numbers as they prepare for expansion.$b$bCenarion Circle forces are gathering in Silithus to take the fight to the silithid before it's too late! No more shall they defile our lands!$b$bAll able-bodied combatants are to report to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold! The silithid shall be vanquished!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '和在希利蘇斯塞納里奧城堡裡的喚風者傲角談話。', `Details` = '注意，部落的勇士們!有一個威脅已經未受挑戰很久了。他們準備擴張的同時，整個艾澤拉斯異種蠍巢穴附近的地表震動已經大大的改變了我們。$b$b塞納里奧議會軍隊已在希利蘇斯集結，趁來得及之前對希利蘇斯採取行動!他們不能再敗壞我們的土地!$b$b所有健全的戰鬥者都要向塞納里奧議會的喚風者傲角報告!我們要征服異種蠍!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8276;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "希利蘇斯塞納裡奧要塞的比提克斯·斯巴格要求你帶8個石鞭蠍之刺和8個掠沙蜘蛛的牙齒給他。", Objectives AC enUS : "Beetix Ficklespragg at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to gather 8 Stonelash Scorpid Stingers and 8 Sand Skitterer Fangs. Return to her when you have completed the task." ; Wowhead enUS : "Beetix Ficklespragg at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to gather 8 Stonelash Scorpid Stingers and 8 Sand Skitterer Fangs. Return to her when you have completed the task.",  OLD Details : "比提克斯·斯巴格為你效勞！我的堂兄諾格在為塞納裡奧要塞的煉金師進行稀有草藥的採集工作，好吧，至少以前他在這麼做。在他最後一次回來的時候，他的血液中帶著一種強力毒液。$B$B我已經設法減緩毒性發作的時間，但是如果想要完全中和它的話，我就需要這種毒液的原始樣本。$B$B諾格是從北面回來的，因此我想應該是石鞭蠍或者掠沙蜘蛛幹的。帶給我一些尖刺和毒牙，然後我就可以製作解毒劑了。", Details AC enUS : "Beetix Ficklespragg at your service!  My cousin Noggle makes a living gathering rare herbs for Cenarion Hold alchemists.  Or used to, anyway.  He came back from his last trip with a strong poison running though his veins.$B$BI've managed to slow down the venom, but to fully neutralize it I need poison samples from whatever stung him.$B$BNoggle arrived from the north, so I'd bet my shirt stonelash scorpids or sand skitterers did it.  Bring me some stingers and fangs and I'll try to make an antidote for him." ; Wowhead enUS : "Beetix Ficklespragg at your service! My cousin Noggle makes a living gathering rare herbs for Cenarion Hold alchemists. Or used to, anyway. He came back from his last trip with a strong poison running though his veins.$b$bI've managed to slow down the venom, but to fully neutralize it I need poison samples from whatever stung him.$b$bNoggle arrived from the north, so I'd bet my shirt stonelash scorpids or sand skitterers did it. Bring me some stingers and fangs and I'll try to make an antidote for him."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '希利蘇斯的塞納里奧城堡的比提克斯·斯巴格要你去收集8只石鞭蠍刺和8只掠沙蜘蛛毒牙。完成任務後回到她那裡。', `Details` = '比提克斯·斯巴格為你效勞!我的堂兄諾格在為塞納里奧城堡的鍊金師進行稀有草藥的採集工作，好吧，至少以前他在這麼做。在他最後一次回來的時候，他的血液中帶著一種強力毒液。$b$b我已經設法減緩毒性發作的時間，但是如果想要完全中和它的話，我就需要這種毒液的原始樣本。$b$b諾格是從北面回來的，因此我想應該是石鞭蠍或者掠沙蜘蛛幹的。帶給我一些尖刺和毒牙，然後我就可以製作解毒劑了。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8277;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "希利蘇斯塞納裡奧要塞的比提克斯·斯巴格要求你給他帶去3個石鞭巨鉗蠍之刺、3個石鞭掠奪者之刺和3個石行蜘蛛的牙齒。", Objectives AC enUS : "Beetix Ficklespragg at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to gather 3 Stonelash Pincer Stingers, 3 Stonelash Flayer Stingers and 3 Rock Stalker Fangs." ; Wowhead enUS : "Beetix Ficklespragg at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to gather 3 Stonelash Pincer Stingers, 3 Stonelash Flayer Stingers and 3 Rock Stalker Fangs.",  OLD Details : "該死的！解毒劑沒有生效。諾格一定是被南邊的某種毒性更強的生物蜇了。$B$B我需要你去那裡給我帶回更多的樣品，$N。好消息是因為它們的毒性夠強，所以我需要的樣品數量不用那麼多。壞消息是南部各種有毒生物的種類更多，因此我需要各種各樣的樣品。", Details AC enUS : "Blasted!  The antidote didn't work.  Noggle must've been stung by one of the stronger creatures in the far south.$B$BI'm going to need you to go there and get me some more samples, $N.  The good news is that since their poison is stronger I won't require as many.  The bad news is that there are more kinds of poisonous creatures crawling around the southern area so you'll have to draw from more sources." ; Wowhead enUS : "Blasted! The antidote didn't work. Noggle must've been stung by one of the stronger creatures in the far south.$b$bI'm going to need you to go there and get me some more samples, $n. The good news is that since their poison is stronger I won't require as many. The bad news is that there are more kinds of poisonous creatures crawling around the southern area so you'll have to draw from more sources."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '希利蘇斯塞納里奧城堡的比提克斯·斯巴格要你去收集3只石鞭巨鉗蠍刺，3只石鞭撕掠者刺，和3只石行蜘蛛毒牙。', `Details` = '可惡!解毒劑沒有生效。諾格一定是被南邊的某種毒性更強的生物蜇了。$b$b我需要你去那裡給我帶回更多的樣品，$n。好消息是因為它們的毒性夠強，所以我需要的樣品數量不用那麼多。壞消息是南部各種有毒生物的種類更多，因此我需要各種各樣的樣品。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8278;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把暮光詞典的三個章節交給希利蘇斯的隱士奧泰爾。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring the three chapters of the Twilight Lexicon to Hermit Ortell in Silithus.  " ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the three chapters of the Twilight Lexicon to Hermit Ortell in Silithus.",  OLD Details : "暮光之錘對於敢於侵犯他們的人絕不會手軟。他們把我當作野獸一樣進行獵捕。不用說，他們的敵人就是我的朋友！$B$B要破譯這塊石板上的文字，我需要用他們的文字撰寫的書籍來破譯這些秘密的資訊——我需要暮光詞典。這麼重要的工具被他們分成三章，放在了不同的地方！掌管它們的人被稱為暮光守護者，去暮光之錘營地找到他們吧。", Details AC enUS : "The Twilight's Hammer are not kind to those that leave their ranks.  They hunt me to this day like I'm some sort of beast!  Needless to say, an enemy of theirs is a friend of mine!$B$BTo decipher this Tablet I'll need the book used by their scribes to encode secret messages: the Twilight Lexicon.  It's such an important tool that they keep its three chapters in different locations!  The officers entrusted with the Lexicon are known as Twilight Keepers.  Look for them at the Twilight's Hammer camps." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Twilight's Hammer are not kind to those that leave their ranks. They hunt me to this day like I'm some sort of beast! Needless to say, an enemy of theirs is a friend of mine!$b$bTo decipher this Tablet I'll need the book used by their scribes to encode secret messages: the Twilight Lexicon. It's such an important tool that they keep its three chapters in different locations! The officers entrusted with the Lexicon are known as Twilight Keepers. Look for them at the Twilight's Hammer camps."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將暮光詞典的3章帶給希利蘇斯的隱士奧泰爾。', `Details` = '暮光之錘對離開他們軍隊的人並不友善。他們把我當作野獸般的抓來!不用多說!他們的敵人就是我的朋友!$b$b要解讀這塊碑文，我需要他們的抄寫員所使用的那本書來破解秘密的訊息:也就是暮光詞典。那是一個極為重要的工具，所以他們將書本的三章放在不同的地方。負責託管辭典的職員叫暮光守護者，去暮光之錘營地找他們。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8279;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "希利蘇斯塞納裡奧要塞的喚風者梅恩·長角要求你去殺死15只掘泥打擊者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to kill 15 Dredge Strikers." ; Wowhead enUS : "Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to kill 15 Dredge Strikers.",  OLD Details : "塞納裡奧要塞具有相當重要的戰略意義。我確信只要我們可以控制住它，那麼我們對於異種蟲類的勝利必定會實現。另外我們還需要保證我們的物資補給可以及時到位。$B$B對於我們的補給商隊來說，遍地都是的沙蟲比異種蟲類威脅還要大。就在今天早上，一大批晨光麥被掘泥打擊者襲擊並全部損失；我需要你去減少它們的數量，以此來保證我們的物資流通順暢。", Details AC enUS : "Cenarion Hold is a location of utmost strategic importance.  I'm convinced that while we hold it our victory over the silithid is guaranteed.  Provided our influx supplies can be maintained, that is.$B$BDesert worms have proven to be more of a threat to our supply caravans than even the silithid themselves.  Just this morning, a large shipment of morrowgrain was ravaged by a group of dredge strikers.  I need you to thin their numbers to ensure our supplies aren't jeopardized." ; Wowhead enUS : "Cenarion Hold is a location of utmost strategic importance. I'm convinced that while we hold it our victory over the silithid is guaranteed. Provided our influx supplies can be maintained, that is.$b$bDesert worms have proven to be more of a threat to our supply caravans than even the silithid themselves. Just this morning, a large shipment of morrowgrain was ravaged by a group of dredge strikers. I need you to thin their numbers to ensure our supplies aren't jeopardized.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Dredge Striker slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '希利蘇斯的塞納里奧城堡的喚風者傲角要你去殺15個掘泥打擊者。', `Details` = '塞納里奧城堡是最具戰略重要性的據點。我確信如果握有這個地方，我們對異種蠍的勝利就有保障。但前提是我們的物資供應可以維持。$b$b沙漠之蟲已被證實比異種蠍還威脅著我們的供給車隊。就在今天早上，一大批的晨光穀就被一群掘泥打擊者搶劫了。我需要你去削減他們的勢力，以確保我們的物資供給不受威脅。', `Objectivetext1` = '掘泥打擊者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8280;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "希利蘇斯塞納裡奧要塞的喚風者梅恩·長角要求你去殺死20只掘泥摧毀者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to slay 20 Dredge Crushers." ; Wowhead enUS : "Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to slay 20 Dredge Crushers.",  OLD Details : "迄今為止，你的表現很好地證明了你的實力，$N。然而，我們的補給線還沒有完全安全。在解決了掘泥打擊者的問題之後，他們南部的親戚會佔據他們留下的空缺。$B$B你需要擊殺一些掘泥摧毀者，讓它們不敢輕易越雷池一步，我們絕不能視我們的補給線安全為兒戲。", Details AC enUS : "Your performance has been truly exemplary so far, $N.  Our supply lines are not completely safe yet, however.  In the absence of dredge strikers, their larger southern cousins will surely move in to take their place in the north.$B$BYou'll have to kill quite a few dredge crushers to keep them at bay, but we cannot leave the safety of our supply lines to chance.  " ; Wowhead enUS : "Your performance has been truly exemplary so far, $n. Our supply lines are not completely safe yet, however. In the absence of dredge strikers, their larger southern cousins will surely move in to take their place in the north.$b$bYou'll have to kill quite a few dredge crushers to keep them at bay, but we cannot leave the safety of our supply lines to chance.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Dredge Crusher slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '希利蘇斯的塞納里奧城堡的喚風者傲角要你去殺20個掘泥摧毀者。', `Details` = '$n，你的表現到目前為止的確是個典範。但是我們的供給線仍不完全安全。沒有了掘泥打擊者，他們在南方的大批表親會繼續向北移動來替補他們的位子。$b$b你必須殺死一些掘泥摧毀者讓他們留在海灣，但我們不能冒險丟下供給線的安全不管。', `Objectivetext1` = '掘泥摧毀者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8281;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "從希利蘇斯南部山中找到諾格的背包，然後將它交給塞納裡奧要塞中的諾格。", Objectives AC enUS : "Retrieve Noggle's Satchel from the mountains in the south of Silithus and return it to him at Cenarion Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Retrieve Noggle's Satchel from the mountains in the south of Silithus and return it to him at Cenarion Hold.",  OLD Details : "我在哪裡？我的包在哪裡？*氣喘吁吁*我一定是在逃脫那只巨蠍“死亡彎鉤”的時候把它給弄丟了。我在逃命的時候匆匆忙忙就跑進了一個石鞭掠奪者的巢穴。$B$B那個包裡有各種各樣的稀有材料。沒有了它們，我和比提克斯就沒有辦法製造塞納裡奧要塞所需要的藥劑了。我現在太虛弱，已經沒有辦法爬起來了，但是如果你可以把我的材料拿回來，那麼我就可以幫你製作這些藥劑。$B$B我是在南邊山中碰到死亡彎鉤的，就在銅須營地的後面。", Details AC enUS : "Where am I?  Where's my bag? *gasp* I must've lost it while fleeing from Deathclasp, the giant scorpid.  In my rush to escape I walked right into a nest of stonelash flayers.$B$BThe satchel I was carrying had all sorts of rare reagents in it.  Without them, me and Beetix won't be able to make the potions that Cenarion Hold needs.  I'm too weak to get up yet, but I can make it worth your while if you bring back my reagents.$B$BI ran into Deathclasp in the southern mountain range, behind Bronzebeard's camp." ; Wowhead enUS : "Where am I? Where's my bag? *gasp* I must've lost it while fleeing from Deathclasp, the giant scorpid. In my rush to escape I walked right into a nest of stonelash flayers.$b$bThe satchel I was carrying had all sorts of rare reagents in it. Without them, me and Beetix won't be able to make the potions that Cenarion Hold needs. I'm too weak to get up yet, but I can make it worth your while if you bring back my reagents.$b$bI ran into Deathclasp in the southern mountain range, behind Bronzebeard's camp."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '到希利蘇斯南邊山區找回諾格的背包，並回到塞納里奧城堡交還給他。', `Details` = '我在哪裡?我的包包呢?*打嗝* 我一定是在從死亡彎鉤那隻巨蠍那裡逃走的時候弄丟了。我急忙逃亡的時候走進了石鞭撕掠者的巢穴。$b$b我帶的那個包包裡裝著所有種類的稀有試劑。沒有它們，我和比提克斯就不能製作塞納里奧城堡需要的藥劑。我還太虛弱不能起來，但如果你能將我的試劑帶回來，我絕對會讓你感到值得的。$b$b我是在銅鬚營地後面的南方山區遇到死亡彎鉤的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8282;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "通緝：死亡彎鉤", Title AC enUS : "Wanted - Deathclasp, Terror of the Sands" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted - Deathclasp, Terror of the Sands",  OLD Objectives : "將死亡彎鉤的蠍鉗交給衛兵隊長維斯·庫魯茲。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring Deathclasp's Pincer to Vish Kozus, Captain of the Guard." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring Deathclasp's Pincer to Vish Kozus, Captain of the Guard.",  OLD Details : "我們相信，可怕的蠍子“死亡彎鉤”正在南面的山脈一帶活動。對南邊的巡邏士兵和遠征軍而言，她是個極大的威脅。誰能殺掉這個禍害，就將獲得價值不菲的獎勵。你可以向塞納裡奧要塞瞭望塔的衛兵隊長維斯·庫魯茲詢問獎勵事宜。", Details AC enUS : "The terrible scorpid, Deathclasp, is believed to have retreated to the southern mountain range in the presence of increased silithid activity.  She presents a great threat to patrols and expeditions in the southern regions.  Individuals participating in her destruction will be remunerated handsomely.  Inquire with Captain Vish Kozus, at the top of the Cenarion Hold Watchtower, regarding a reward." ; Wowhead enUS : "The terrible scorpid, Deathclasp, is believed to have retreated to the southern mountain range in the presence of increased silithid activity. She presents a great threat to patrols and expeditions in the southern regions. Individuals participating in her destruction will be remunerated handsomely. Inquire with Captain Vish Kozus, at the top of the Cenarion Hold Watchtower, regarding a reward."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '通緝:死亡彎鉤', `Objectives` = '將死亡彎鉤的刺針帶給守衛隊長維斯·庫魯茲。', `Details` = '隨著日益頻繁的異種蠍活動，大家相信恐怖的蠍子死亡彎鉤，已經撤退到南邊的山區了。他對南邊的巡邏兵和探險者來說是個很大的威脅。參予摧毀她的行列將會重重有賞。向塞納里奧城堡，眺望台頂端的維斯·庫魯茲隊長詢問相關事宜。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8283;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "希利蘇斯塞納裡奧要塞的地質學家拉克斯班要你去收集8塊暮光石板碎片。", Objectives AC enUS : "Geologist Larksbane at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to collect 8 Twilight Tablet Fragments." ; Wowhead enUS : "Geologist Larksbane at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to collect 8 Twilight Tablet Fragments.",  OLD Details : "暮光之錘教徒曾在西北方進行發展。如果你現在去那裡，還會發現那個區域到處都是元素生物，四周散落著的木頭碎片和帆布可以幫你找到營地所在的地點。$B$B我從那裡找回了一些粘土石板碎片，但是數量還不足以拼成有用的東西。如果你可以幫我找到其它的石板碎片，我們也許可以找到暮光之錘出現在希利蘇斯的原因。", Details AC enUS : "A camp of Twilight's Hammer cultists once thrived northwest of here.  If you were to venture there now, you'd find the area swarming with elementals and nothing but scattered pieces of wood and canvas to mark the spot where the camp was.$B$BI've recovered a few fragments of a clay tablet from the site, but I have too few of them to piece together anything useful.  See if you can find the remaining tablet fragments so we can shed some light into the Twilight's Hammer presence here in Silithus." ; Wowhead enUS : "A camp of Twilight's Hammer cultists once thrived northwest of here. If you were to venture there now, you'd find the area swarming with elementals and nothing but scattered pieces of wood and canvas to mark the spot where the camp was.$b$bI've recovered a few fragments of a clay tablet from the site, but I have too few of them to piece together anything useful. See if you can find the remaining tablet fragments so we can shed some light into the Twilight's Hammer presence here in Silithus."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '希利蘇斯的塞納里奧城堡的地理學家拉克斯班要你去收集8個暮光石板碎片。', `Details` = '一群暮光之錘祭司曾經在這裡的西北邊繁榮過。如果你是要去那邊冒險，你只會看到一個充斥著元素的區域，有著散落的木頭和標誌營地的帆布碎片。$b$b我從那裡拿回來幾個泥土字板碎片，但是數量實在太少，不能拼湊出什麼有用的東西。看看你能不能找到剩下的石板碎片，我們就能對希利蘇斯的暮光之錘多一些了解。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8284;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把復原的石板帶給希利蘇斯的隱士奧泰爾。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take the restored tablet to Hermit Ortell in Silithus.$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Take the restored tablet to Hermit Ortell in Silithus.",  OLD Details : "傳說有一個前暮光之錘成員奧泰爾離開了這個團體，聽說他現在隱居在南風村。也許你可以在那裡尋求關於破譯這塊石板的幫助。$B$B帶上這塊拼好的石板，找到奧泰爾吧。", Details AC enUS : "There are rumors of a Twilight's Hammer member called Ortell having deserted his sect.  Word has it he hid in the mountains south of Southwind Village, where he lives as a hermit.  Perhaps you can enlist his help in deciphering the tablet.$B$BTake the restored tablet with you and seek out Ortell." ; Wowhead enUS : "There are rumors of a Twilight's Hammer member called Ortell having deserted his sect. Word has it he hid in the mountains south of Southwind Village, where he lives as a hermit. Perhaps you can enlist his help in deciphering the tablet.$b$bTake the restored tablet with you and seek out Ortell."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '帶著修補的石板去找希利蘇斯的隱士奧泰爾。', `Details` = '謠傳暮光之錘有個叫奧泰爾的成員背棄了他的教派。聽說他隱居在南風村南方的山裡。或許你可以獲得他的幫助來解讀石板。$b$b帶著修補的石板去找奧泰爾吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8285;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "轉至塔納利斯的時光之穴尋找諾茲多姆的子嗣，阿納克洛斯。$B$B完成任務後回到希利蘇斯塞納裡奧要塞的流沙守望者巴里斯托爾斯那兒。", Objectives AC enUS : "Venture to the Caverns of Time in Tanaris and find Anachronos, Brood of Nozdormu." ; Wowhead enUS : "Venture to the Caverns of Time in Tanaris and find Anachronos, Brood of Nozdormu.",  OLD Details : "當他出現時，我已經奄奄一息，瀕臨死亡。他對著我受傷的身體呼了一口氣，便耐心地等待著時間的沙礫清理我的傷口。$B$B他說，“如果必須這樣的話，你將永遠活下去。”這樣，我成為了一名守望者。$B$B看那片沙漠，第二場戰爭就要來臨了。你必須找到青銅龍的棲身之所。去時光之穴看看主人回來了沒有。我必須確認這一點才能有所行動。", Details AC enUS : "The embrace of death had all but overcome my being when he intervened. He breathed only once upon my maimed body and then waited patiently for the sands of time to cleanse my wounds.$B$B"Forever you will remain if you must," he said, and with those words I was bound as a Watcher.$B$BLook now to the desert. The second war is upon us. You must seek out the resting place of the Bronze. Venture to the Caverns of Time and see if the master has returned. I must be sure before I am able to proceed." ; Wowhead enUS : "The embrace of death had all but overcome my being when he intervened. He breathed only once upon my maimed body and then waited patiently for the sands of time to cleanse my wounds.$b$b"Forever you will remain if you must," he said, and with those words I was bound as a Watcher.$b$bLook now to the desert. The second war is upon us. You must seek out the resting place of the Bronze. Venture to the Caverns of Time and see if the master has returned. I must be sure before I am able to proceed."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '到塔納利斯的時光之穴尋找諾茲多姆的子嗣安納克羅斯。', `Details` = '死亡的擁抱擁有一切，卻不能在干擾我的時候戰勝我的生命。他只要在我受傷的身體旁邊呼吸一次，然後耐心地等待時間之沙淨化我的傷口。$b$b他說，「只要你堅持，你會永遠存在」，就因為那幾個字我成為了一個守夜人。$b$b現在看看那個沙漠。第二次戰爭就要逼近我們了。你一定要找到銅龍的棲息地。到時光之穴冒險，看看大師是否回來了。我一定要在前進之前確定這點。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8286;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把解密石板碑文交給指揮官瑪爾利斯。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take the Decoded Tablet Parchment to Commander Mar'alith." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take the Decoded Tablet Parchment to Commander Mar'alith.",  OLD Details : "嗯，是這樣的……我這裡有相當有用的資訊！我看到塞納裡奧議會的人來到了希利蘇斯。他們計畫把暮光之錘趕出這個地區，是不是？這很好；$B$B把這塊羊皮紙袋給他們的領袖，指揮官瑪爾利斯。不久之後暮光之錘就會被消滅，然後我就將永遠脫離他們的魔爪！", Details AC enUS : "Ok, here we are... a pretty valuable chunk of information, I must say!  I've seen the Cenarion Circle forces arrive at Silithus.  They plan to drive the Twilight's Hammer out, don't they?  This will help.  $B$BTake this parchment to their leader, Commander Mar'alith.  Soon the Twilight's Hammer will be vanquished and I will be outside their grasp for good!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Ok, here we are... a pretty valuable chunk of information, I must say! I've seen the Cenarion Circle forces arrive at Silithus. They plan to drive the Twilight's Hammer out, don't they? This will help.$b$bTake this parchment to their leader, Commander Mar'alith. Soon the Twilight's Hammer will be vanquished and I will be outside their grasp for good!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將解譯過的碑文羊皮紙交給指揮官瑪爾利斯。', `Details` = '好，就是這個…這真是一個有價值的消息!我看到塞納里奧議會的軍隊到達希利蘇斯。他們打算把暮光之錘趕出去，對吧?這很有幫助。$b$b把這張羊皮紙交給他們的領導者，指揮官瑪爾利斯。很快的，暮光之錘會被擊敗，我就能永遠逃離他們的手掌心了!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8287;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到黑石山中的奈法利安巢穴去，殺死勒什雷爾，並帶回它的徽記。$B$B將勒什雷爾的徽記交給希利蘇斯塞納裡奧要塞的流沙守望者巴里斯托爾斯。", Objectives AC enUS : "Return the Head of the Broodlord Lashlayer to Baristolth of the Shifting Sands at Cenarion Hold in Silithus." ; Wowhead enUS : "Return the Head of the Broodlord Lashlayer to Baristolth of the Shifting Sands at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",  OLD Details : "不能再浪費時間了！我們必須找到一位英雄！完成任務需要一支軍隊，但是必須有一位真正的勇士擔負起統帥整個盟軍的重任。$B$B黑石之王的巢穴中有一頭異常兇猛的野獸：勒什雷爾。他守護著征戰大廳，阻止外人進入奈法利安的聖所。殺死那個邪惡的傢伙，把它的徽記帶給我，然後你就可以開始下一步的旅程了。", Details AC enUS : "There is no time to waste! A hero must be found! The task I give will require an army to complete but only one may rise from the throng of would be champions to take on the burden and responsibility of an ally of the Brood.$B$BWithin the lair of the Lord of Blackrock is a most cruel beast. The Broodlord Lashlayer guards the Halls of Strife, blocking the way into Nefarian's inner sanctum. Slay the foul aberration and return his head to me. Do this and you may begin the next step of your journey." ; Wowhead enUS : "There is no time to waste! A hero must be found! The task I give will require an army to complete but only one may rise from the throng of would be champions to take on the burden and responsibility of an ally of the Brood.$b$bWithin the lair of the Lord of Blackrock is a most cruel beast. The Broodlord Lashlayer guards the Halls of Strife, blocking the way into Nefarian's inner sanctum. Slay the foul aberration and return his head to me. Do this and you may begin the next step of your journey."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '帶著龍領主勒西雷爾的頭顱回到希利蘇斯，到塞納里奧城堡的流沙之地找巴里斯托爾斯。', `Details` = '不要浪費時間了!一定要找到一個英雄!我給的任務需要一個軍隊來完成，但是只有其中一個人會是優勝者，而他將接下身為龍族盟友的重擔和責任。$b$b黑石之王的巢穴裡有一隻最殘暴的野獸。龍領主勒西雷爾守衛著征戰大廳，阻擋通往奈法利安的核心密室之路。殺死那個骯髒的怪物並帶著他的頭顱回來找我。完成之後你就可以展開旅途的下一步驟。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8288;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "進入戰歌峽谷抵禦部落小隊的攻擊，獲得一枚銀翼功勳獎章，然後向銀翼樹林中的哨兵艾蒂亞·輕歌回復。", Objectives AC enUS : "Enter Warsong Gulch and defeat the Horde, obtain a Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor, and return to Sentinel Farsong at the Silverwing Grove." ; Wowhead enUS : "Enter Warsong Gulch and defeat the Horde, obtain a Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor, and return to Sentinel Farsong at the Silverwing Grove.",  OLD Details : "在這個通道的另一端，你會看到一片戰火紛飛的土地，年輕的$c。部落不斷侵入我們神聖的森林，鋸斷這裡的蒼天古樹來建造他們的戰爭機器。$B$B進入戰歌峽谷，幫助銀翼要塞擊敗入侵的部落勢力吧！$B$B完成這個任務，獲得一枚銀翼功勳獎章，我就會獎勵你。", Details AC enUS : "Beyond this tunnel you will find a field of strife and turmoil, young $c. The Horde continue to decimate our sacred forest, cutting down the evergreen foliage to power their machines of war.$B$BEnter Warsong Gulch and defend Silverwing Hold. Push back the invading Horde forces!$B$BDo this, and earn a talisman of merit.  Bring me such a talisman, $N, and I shall reward you." ; Wowhead enUS : "Beyond this tunnel you will find a field of strife and turmoil, young $c. The Horde continue to decimate our sacred forest, cutting down the evergreen foliage to power their machines of war.$b$bEnter Warsong Gulch and defend Silverwing Hold. Push back the invading Horde forces!$b$bDo this, and earn a talisman of merit. Bring me such a talisman, $n, and I shall reward you."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '進入戰歌峽谷並擊敗部落小隊，取得戰歌峽谷榮譽獎章後向銀翼樹林的哨兵艾蒂亞·輕歌回覆。', `Details` = '在這個通道的另一端，你會看到一片戰火紛飛的土地，年輕的$c。部落不斷侵入我們神聖的森林，鋸斷這裡的蒼天古樹來建造他們的戰爭機器。$b$b進入戰歌峽谷，幫助銀翼要塞擊敗入侵的部落勢力吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8290;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "進入戰歌峽谷抵禦部落小隊的攻擊，獲得一枚銀翼功勳獎章，然後向銀翼樹林中的哨兵艾蒂亞·輕歌回復。", Objectives AC enUS : "Enter Warsong Gulch and defeat the Horde, obtain a Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor, and return to Sentinel Farsong at the Silverwing Grove." ; Wowhead enUS : "Enter Warsong Gulch and defeat the Horde, obtain a Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor, and return to Sentinel Farsong at the Silverwing Grove.",  OLD Details : "在這個通道的另一端，你會看到一片戰火紛飛的土地，年輕的$c。部落不斷侵入我們神聖的森林，鋸斷這裡的蒼天古樹來建造他們的戰爭機器。$B$B進入戰歌峽谷，幫助銀翼要塞擊敗入侵的部落勢力吧！$B$B完成這個任務，獲得一枚銀翼功勳獎章，我就會獎勵你。", Details AC enUS : "Beyond this tunnel you will find a field of strife and turmoil, young $c. The Horde continue to decimate our sacred forest, cutting down the evergreen foliage to power their machines of war.$B$BEnter Warsong Gulch and defend Silverwing Hold. Push back the invading Horde forces!$B$BDo this, and earn a talisman of merit.  Bring me such a talisman, $N, and I shall reward you." ; Wowhead enUS : "Beyond this tunnel you will find a field of strife and turmoil, young $c. The Horde continue to decimate our sacred forest, cutting down the evergreen foliage to power their machines of war.$b$bEnter Warsong Gulch and defend Silverwing Hold. Push back the invading Horde forces!$b$bDo this, and earn a talisman of merit. Bring me such a talisman, $n, and I shall reward you."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '進入戰歌峽谷並擊敗部落小隊，取得戰歌峽谷榮譽獎章後向銀翼樹林的哨兵艾蒂亞·輕歌回覆。', `Details` = '在這個通道的另一端，你會看到一片戰火紛飛的土地，年輕的$c。部落不斷侵入我們神聖的森林，鋸斷這裡的蒼天古樹來建造他們的戰爭機器。$b$b進入戰歌峽谷，幫助銀翼要塞擊敗入侵的部落勢力吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8291;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "進入戰歌峽谷擊敗聯盟小隊，獲得一枚戰歌榮譽獎章，然後向莫爾杉營地的沙塔爾·碎顱覆命。", Objectives AC enUS : "Enter Warsong Gulch and defeat the Alliance, gain a Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor, and bring it to Captain Shatterskull at the Mor'shan Base Camp." ; Wowhead enUS : "Enter Warsong Gulch and defeat the Alliance, gain a Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor, and bring it to Captain Shatterskull at the Mor'shan Base Camp.",  OLD Details : "灰谷森林將在強大的部落面前屈服，$r。無論暗夜精靈們說什麼做什麼，都無法阻止我們的推進。卡利姆多屬於部落，誰敢阻止我們拿取屬於我們的東西，誰就要死！$B$B讓你的心中充滿榮耀之光，讓那些膽敢阻止我們的敵人一個個倒下。摧毀銀翼要塞中的哨兵部隊，並拿到一枚戰歌榮譽獎章。把這樣一枚獎章給我拿來，你就可以獲得獎賞。", Details AC enUS : "The wilds of the Ashenvale forest will succumb to the might of the Horde, $r. Nothing the Silverwing say or do can stop our sovereign imperative. Kalimdor belongs to the Horde. How dare they attempt to prevent us from harvesting what is rightfully ours!$B$BLet the pride swell in your chest as you cut down their weak attempts at slowing our progress. Destroy the Silverwing Sentinels, and earn a Warsong mark of honor.  Return to me with such a mark, $N, and you will be rewarded." ; Wowhead enUS : "The wilds of the Ashenvale forest will succumb to the might of the Horde, $r. Nothing the Silverwing say or do can stop our sovereign imperative. Kalimdor belongs to the Horde. How dare they attempt to prevent us from harvesting what is rightfully ours!$b$bLet the pride swell in your chest as you cut down their weak attempts at slowing our progress. Destroy the Silverwing Sentinels, and earn a Warsong mark of honor. Return to me with such a mark, $n, and you will be rewarded."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '進入戰歌峽谷擊敗聯盟小隊，拿到戰歌榮譽獎章後向莫爾杉營地的沙塔爾·碎顱覆命。', `Details` = '梣谷森林將在強大的部落面前屈服，$r。無論夜精靈們說什麼做什麼，都無法阻止我們的推進。卡林多屬於部落，誰敢阻止我們拿取屬於我們的東西，誰就要死！$b$b讓你的心中充滿榮耀之光，讓那些膽敢阻止我們的敵人一個個倒下。摧毀銀翼要塞中的哨兵部隊，並拿到一枚戰歌榮譽獎章。把這樣一枚獎章拿來給我，你就可以獲得獎賞。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8294;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "進入戰歌峽谷擊敗聯盟小隊，獲得一枚戰歌榮譽獎章，然後向莫爾杉營地的沙塔爾·碎顱覆命。", Objectives AC enUS : "Enter Warsong Gulch and defeat the Alliance, gain a Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor, and bring it to Captain Shatterskull at the Mor'shan Base Camp." ; Wowhead enUS : "Enter Warsong Gulch and defeat the Alliance, gain a Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor, and bring it to Captain Shatterskull at the Mor'shan Base Camp.",  OLD Details : "灰谷森林將在強大的部落面前屈服，$r。無論暗夜精靈們說什麼做什麼，都無法阻止我們的推進。卡利姆多屬於部落，誰敢阻止我們拿取屬於我們的東西，誰就要死！$B$B讓你的心中充滿榮耀之光，讓那些膽敢阻止我們的敵人一個個倒下。摧毀銀翼要塞中的哨兵部隊，並拿到一枚戰歌榮譽獎章。把這樣一枚獎章給我拿來，你就可以獲得獎賞。", Details AC enUS : "The wilds of the Ashenvale forest will succumb to the might of the Horde, $r. Nothing the Silverwing say or do can stop our sovereign imperative. Kalimdor belongs to the Horde. How dare they attempt to prevent us from harvesting what is rightfully ours!$B$BLet the pride swell in your chest as you cut down their weak attempts at slowing our progress. Destroy the Silverwing Sentinels, and earn a Warsong mark of honor.  Return to me with such a mark, $N, and you will be rewarded." ; Wowhead enUS : "The wilds of the Ashenvale forest will succumb to the might of the Horde, $r. Nothing the Silverwing say or do can stop our sovereign imperative. Kalimdor belongs to the Horde. How dare they attempt to prevent us from harvesting what is rightfully ours!$b$bLet the pride swell in your chest as you cut down their weak attempts at slowing our progress. Destroy the Silverwing Sentinels, and earn a Warsong mark of honor. Return to me with such a mark, $n, and you will be rewarded."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '進入戰歌峽谷擊敗聯盟小隊，拿到戰歌榮譽獎章後向莫爾杉營地的沙塔爾·碎顱覆命。', `Details` = '梣谷森林將在強大的部落面前屈服，$r。無論夜精靈們說什麼做什麼，都無法阻止我們的推進。卡林多屬於部落，誰敢阻止我們拿取屬於我們的東西，誰就要死！$b$b讓你的心中充滿榮耀之光，讓那些膽敢阻止我們的敵人一個個倒下。摧毀銀翼要塞中的哨兵部隊，並拿到一枚戰歌榮譽獎章。把這樣一枚獎章拿來給我，你就可以獲得獎賞。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8295;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "獲得阿拉希盆地戰鬥的勝利，獲取一隻阿拉希資源箱，然後向避難谷地的瑪克里爾中士覆命。", Objectives AC enUS : "Win the battle for Arathi Basin, get an Arathi Resource Crate, and return it to Sergeant Maclear at Refuge Pointe." ; Wowhead enUS : "Win the battle for Arathi Basin, get an Arathi Resource Crate, and return it to Sergeant Maclear at Refuge Pointe.",  OLD Details : "我們必須依靠我們的士兵進行戰鬥，所有的士兵都會這麼告訴你的。他們還會告訴你，他們正在使用破爛不堪的裝備，饑腸轆轆地開向戰場！$B$B這就是阿拉希盆地顯得非常重要的原因。金屬，武器，食物，木材——所有我們所需要的東西都可以從那裡獲得。$B$B那就是我需要你發揮作用的地方，$N。進入阿拉希盆地，比敵人佔據更多的基地，以此來獲得戰鬥的勝利，然後給我帶回一箱資源來。", Details AC enUS : "War must be fought with soldiers, any soldier will tell you.  They'll also say that a battle fought with poor gear or on an empty stomach is lost before it starts!$B$BThat is why Arathi Basin is important.  There are key areas in the basin that hold essential resources.  Metals, weapons, food, lumber - all are needed, and all can be gained there.$B$BThat is what I want from you, $N.  Enter Arathi Basin, win the battle by holding more bases than the enemy, and return to me with a crate of resources." ; Wowhead enUS : "War must be fought with soldiers, any soldier will tell you. They'll also say that a battle fought with poor gear or on an empty stomach is lost before it starts!$b$bThat is why Arathi Basin is important. There are key areas in the basin that hold essential resources. Metals, weapons, food, lumber - all are needed, and all can be gained there.$b$bThat is what I want from you, $n. Enter Arathi Basin, win the battle by holding more bases than the enemy, and return to me with a crate of resources."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '獲得阿拉希盆地戰鬥的勝利，獲取一個阿拉希資源箱，然後向避難谷地的瑪克里爾中士覆命。', `Details` = '我們必須依靠我們的士兵進行戰鬥，所有的士兵都會這麼告訴你的。他們還會告訴你，他們正在使用破爛不堪的裝備，饑腸轆轆地開向戰場！$b$b這就是阿拉希盆地顯得非常重要的原因。金屬，武器，食物，木材——所有我們所需要的東西都可以從那裡獲得。$b$b那就是我需要你發揮作用的地方，$n。進入阿拉希盆地，比敵人佔據更多的基地，以此來獲得戰鬥的勝利，然後給我帶回1箱資源來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8297;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "阿拉索聯軍正在不惜一切代價進攻阿拉希，並妄圖奪回這個區域。聯盟的各個種族正在全力進軍這塊遙遠的土地，想要將他們的勢力從避難谷地擴張到這裡。我們必須阻止他們，而最好的方式就是奪取他們的資源。$B$B你可以幫助我們，$N。進入阿拉希盆地，那裡遍地都是豐富的礦藏、肥沃的土地和技藝精湛的能工巧匠。佔據並控制你找到的所有基地，贏得戰鬥，然後把你獲得的資源給我拿回來。", Details AC enUS : "The League of Arathor is sparing no expense in their move to retake Arathi.  They, and all the races of the Alliance, now stream to this distant region, intent on expanding their hold from Refuge Pointe.  We must stop them, and the best means to stop them is to take their supplies.$B$BYou can help us, $N.  Enter Arathi Basin, known for its rich mines, fertile land and skilled craftsman.  Capture and control every base you can, win the battle, and return to me with the resources you gain." ; Wowhead enUS : "The League of Arathor is sparing no expense in their move to retake Arathi. They, and all the races of the Alliance, now stream to this distant region, intent on expanding their hold from Refuge Pointe. We must stop them, and the best means to stop them is to take their supplies.$b$bYou can help us, $n. Enter Arathi Basin, known for its rich mines, fertile land and skilled craftsman. Capture and control every base you can, win the battle, and return to me with the resources you gain."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '阿拉索聯軍正在不惜一切代價進攻阿拉希，並妄圖奪回這個區域。聯盟的各個種族正在全力進軍這塊遙遠的土地，想要將他們的勢力從避難谷地擴張到這裡。我們必須阻止他們，而最好的方式就是奪取他們的資源。$b$b你可以幫助我們，$n。進入阿拉希盆地，那裡遍地都是豐富的礦藏、肥沃的土地和技藝精湛的能工巧匠。佔據並控制你找到的所有基地，贏得戰鬥，然後把你獲得的資源給我拿回來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8299;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "希利蘇斯塞納裡奧要塞的流沙守望者巴里斯托爾斯想要你殺死亞什蟲巢、左拉蟲巢和雷戈蟲巢中的異種蟲類。從死去的蟲子屍體上收集異種蠍殼碎片。當你收集到200塊異種蠍殼碎片時，回到巴里斯托爾斯那兒去。$B$B作為一名諾茲多姆的特使，只有你和你的副官可以從異種蟲類的屍體上拾取異種蠍殼碎片。請注意保持你的包裹空間足夠多。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 200 Silithid Carapace Fragments and return to Baristolth." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 200 Silithid Carapace Fragments and return to Baristolth.",  OLD Details : "諾茲多姆的子嗣根本不信任低等種族。雖然你已經向我證明了你的確具備了英雄的潛質，但是現在你還得向我的主人證明這一點。$B$B亞什蟲巢、左拉蟲巢、雷戈蟲巢，這些地方的蟲子們蠢蠢欲動，對我們形成了極大的威脅。殺死這些蟲巢中的異種蟲類，從它們的甲殼上取下碎片。當你獲得足夠多的碎片時，回到我這兒來。", Details AC enUS : "The Brood of Nozdormu are naturally distrusting of the lesser races. While it is true that you have proven to me that you have the potential makings of a hero, the time has come to prove this to my master.$B$BHive'Ashi, Hive'Zora, Hive'Regal: All swarming with activity and all a threat to our existence. Slay silithid at these hives and take from them a fragment of their carapace. When you can carry no more, return to me and I shall strengthen your resolve." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Brood of Nozdormu are naturally distrusting of the lesser races. While it is true that you have proven to me that you have the potential makings of a hero, the time has come to prove this to my master.$b$bHive'Ashi, Hive'Zora, Hive'Regal: All swarming with activity and all a threat to our existence. Slay silithid at these hives and take from them a fragment of their carapace. When you can carry no more, return to me and I shall strengthen your resolve."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '為流沙守望者巴里斯托爾斯收集200塊異種蠍殼碎片。', `Details` = '諾茲多姆的子嗣根本不信任低等種族。雖然你已經向我證明了你的確具備了英雄的潛質，但是現在你還得向我的主人證明這一點。$b$b亞什蟲巢、佐拉蟲巢、雷戈蟲巢，這些地方的蟲子們蠢蠢欲動，對我們形成了極大的威脅。殺死這些蟲巢中的異種蟲類，從它們的甲殼上取下碎片。當你獲得足夠多的碎片時，回到我這兒來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8301;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "希利蘇斯塞納裡奧要塞的流沙守望者巴里斯托爾斯想要你殺死亞什蟲巢、左拉蟲巢和雷戈蟲巢中的異種蟲類。從死去的蟲子屍體上收集異種蠍殼碎片。當你收集到200塊異種蠍殼碎片時，回到巴里斯托爾斯那兒去。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 200 Silithid Carapace Fragments and return to Baristolth." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 200 Silithid Carapace Fragments and return to Baristolth.",  OLD Details : "凡人，明智地選擇你的副官。每當你完成一次任務，你就可以選擇一個新的副官。$B$B我需要更多的異種蠍殼碎片。別浪費時間！", Details AC enUS : "Choose your deputies wisely, mortal. Each time you return with your task complete, a new deputy you will be allowed to choose.$B$BWith that said, I require more of the carapace fragments. Waste no time!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Choose your deputies wisely, mortal. Each time you return with your task complete, a new deputy you will be allowed to choose.$b$bWith that said, I require more of the carapace fragments. Waste no time!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '為流沙守望者巴里斯托爾斯收集200塊異種蠍殼碎片。', `Details` = '凡人，明智地選擇你的副手。每當你完成一次任務，你就可以選擇一個新的副手。$b$b我需要更多的異種蠍殼碎片。別浪費時間!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8302;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "阿納克洛斯", Title AC enUS : "Anachronos" ; Wowhead enUS : "Anachronos",  OLD Objectives : "到塔納利斯的時光之穴去尋找阿納克洛斯。", Objectives AC enUS : "Seek out Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris." ; Wowhead enUS : "Seek out Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris.$b$bProvided item: $b",  OLD Details : "是時候了，$N。$B$B我隱瞞這個秘密已經很久了，我對此深表歉意。敵人無處不在，很可能就在我們眼皮底下。請閱讀這本密典，好好運用我教給你的知識，去尋找我們的主人。", Details AC enUS : "It is time, $N.$B$BI must apologize for keeping so much in secret. Enemies abound, even under our very noses. Please, read from this tome and learn. Take the knowledge I give to you and seek out our master." ; Wowhead enUS : "It is time, $n.$b$bI must apologize for keeping so much in secret. Enemies abound, even under our very noses. Please, read from this tome and learn. Take the knowledge I give to you and seek out our master."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '安納克羅斯', `Objectives` = '去塔納利斯的時光之穴尋找安納克羅斯。$b$b已提供物品：$b', `Details` = '是時候了，$n。$b$b我隱瞞這個秘密已經很久了，我對此深表歉意。敵人無處不在，很可能就在我們眼皮底下。請閱讀這本密典，好好運用我教給你的知識，去尋找我們的主人。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8303;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "親愛的納塔莉亞", Title AC enUS : "Dearest Natalia" ; Wowhead enUS : "Dearest Natalia",  OLD Objectives : "希利蘇斯塞納裡奧要塞的指揮官瑪爾利斯想要你詢問銅須營地的矮人。你可以在塞納裡奧要塞以南找到銅須營地。$B$B一旦你收集到有用的資訊，就回到指揮官瑪爾利斯那兒。", Objectives AC enUS : "Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to question the inhabitants of Bronzebeard's Encampment. You will find Bronzebeard's Encampment south of Cenarion Hold.$B$BOnce you have gathered the requested information, return to Commander Mar'alith." ; Wowhead enUS : "Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to question the inhabitants of Bronzebeard's Encampment. You will find Bronzebeard's Encampment south of Cenarion Hold.$b$bOnce you have gathered the requested information, return to Commander Mar'alith.",  OLD Details : "我親愛的納塔莉亞走失了。$B$B老實說，她失蹤之前好幾周都行為怪異。我不止一次看到她在四下無人時喃喃自語。她堅持說什麼自己是對的，堅持繼續自己的研究。$B$B我最後一次見她的時候，她正朝著南邊的銅須營地走去。$B$B我的兵力非常薄弱，$N。所以我想請你轉至銅須營地，問問那些矮人。", Details AC enUS : "My dear Natalia has gone missing.$B$BTruth be told, she had been acting strangely for weeks leading up to her disappearance. I had caught her talking to herself when no one was around on more than one occasion. She was adamant that everything was ok and that she must be allowed to continue her research.$B$BShe was last seen heading to Bronzebeard's camp to the south.$B$BMy soldiers are spread too thin, $N. I need you to go to Bronzebeard's camp and question those dwarves. " ; Wowhead enUS : "My dear Natalia has gone missing.$b$bTruth be told, she had been acting strangely for weeks leading up to her disappearance. I had caught her talking to herself when no one was around on more than one occasion. She was adamant that everything was ok and that she must be allowed to continue her research.$b$bShe was last seen heading to Bronzebeard's camp to the south.$b$bMy soldiers are spread too thin, $n. I need you to go to Bronzebeard's camp and question those dwarves."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '親愛的娜塔莉雅', `Objectives` = '希利蘇斯，指揮官瑪爾利斯要你去詢問銅鬚營地的矮人居住者。你可以在塞納里奧城堡南邊找到銅鬚營地。$b$b當你收集到需要的資訊再回去找指揮官瑪爾利斯。', `Details` = '我親愛的娜塔莉雅走失了。$b$b老實說，她失蹤之前好幾週都行為怪異。我不止一次看到她在四下無人時喃喃自語。她堅持說什麼自己是對的，堅持繼續自己的研究。$b$b我最後一次見她的時候，她正朝著南邊的銅鬚營地走去。$b$b我的兵力非常薄弱，$n。所以我想請你前往銅鬚營地，問問那些矮人。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8304;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "希利蘇斯時光之穴的阿納克洛斯想要你轉至位於希利蘇斯南部沙漠的甲蟲之台。$B$B當你學習完畢後再回到他那兒去。", Objectives AC enUS : "Locate the Crystalline Tear in Silithus and gaze into its depths." ; Wowhead enUS : "Locate the Crystalline Tear in Silithus and gaze into its depths.",  OLD Details : "你已經知道了故事的一半，現在是瞭解另一半的時候了。我和我的下屬的行事方法大相徑庭。返回希利蘇斯，去甲蟲之台吧。別害怕你所見的事物……別忘記你學到的東西。", Details AC enUS : "In the southern desert of Silithus, near the sacred barrier, exists a single crystalline tear. This tear serves as a symbol of the great losses beset upon us during the War of the Shifting Sands. Locate this tear and gaze into its depths to gain enlightenment.$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "In the southern desert of Silithus, near the sacred barrier, exists a single crystalline tear. This tear serves as a symbol of the great losses beset upon us during the War of the Shifting Sands. Locate this tear and gaze into its depths to gain enlightenment."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '找到希利蘇斯的結晶之淚並注視它的深處。', `Details` = '希利蘇斯的沙漠南方靠近一個神聖的屏障之處藏著一顆結晶之淚。這顆淚象徵著我們在流沙之戰落敗之後的苦悶。找到這顆淚並且深深地注視著它，你就可以獲得啟發。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8305;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "希利蘇斯塞納裡奧要塞的指揮官瑪爾利斯想要你找到他心愛的納塔莉亞。你收集到的資訊表明納塔莉亞·瑪爾利斯可能在南面的雷戈蟲巢。$B$B在你趕往蟲巢之前，記得去銅須營地拜訪一下那兒的矮人，他們或許會給你提些建議。$B$B$N，記住指揮官的話：做你應該做的……", Objectives AC enUS : "Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to find his beloved Natalia. The information that you gathered points to Hive'Regal in the south as being the area in which you may find Mistress Natalia Mar'alith.$B$BDo not forget to visit the dwarves at Bronzebeard's camp before venturing into the hive. They might have some additional work and advice for you.$B$BAnd $N, remember the Commander's words: "Do what you must..."" ; Wowhead enUS : "Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to find his beloved Natalia. The information that you gathered points to Hive'Regal in the south as being the area in which you may find Mistress Natalia Mar'alith.$b$bDo not forget to visit the dwarves at Bronzebeard's camp before venturing into the hive. They might have some additional work and advice for you.$b$bAnd $n, remember the Commander's words: "Do what you must..."",  OLD Details : "我想讓你轉至雷戈蟲巢，看看我心愛的納塔莉亞變成什麼樣了，$N。要單獨完成這項任務並不容易，我建議你帶上幾個朋友。在你動身轉至蟲巢之前，請一定返回營地跟那些矮人談談。他們或許會告訴你對付居住在蟲巢中的異種蟲類的竅門。$B$B$N，如果納塔莉亞真的如他們所說的那樣變得瘋狂……做你應該做的。$B$B<指揮官瑪爾利斯轉過身去。>", Details AC enUS : "I need you to venture into Hive'Regal and find what became of my dearest Natalia, $N. This will be no easy task for you. Before you dive headlong into the maw of madness, make sure that you go back and speak with those dwarves. They might be able to give you some tips on dealing with the silithid that inhabit that hive.$B$BAnd $N, if she truly is as mad as they say... do what you must.$B$B<Commander Mar'alith turns away from you.>$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "I need you to venture into Hive'Regal and find what became of my dearest Natalia, $n. This will be no easy task for you. Before you dive headlong into the maw of madness, make sure that you go back and speak with those dwarves. They might be able to give you some tips on dealing with the silithid that inhabit that hive.$b$bAnd $n, if she truly is as mad as they say... do what you must.$b$b<Commander Mar'alith turns away from you.>"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '希利蘇斯，塞納里奧城堡的指揮官瑪爾利斯要你去找尋他摯愛的娜塔莉雅。你所收集到的資訊指出，南方的雷戈蟲巢就是你可以找到娜塔莉雅·瑪爾利斯夫人的地方。$b$b別忘記在進入蟲巢之前先去拜訪銅鬚營地的矮人。他們可能有一些額外的工作和建議要給你。$b$b還有$n，記得指揮官的話:「做你該做的…」', `Details` = '我想讓你前往雷戈蟲巢，看看我心愛的娜塔莉雅變成什麼樣了，$n。這項任務並不容易，在你前往瘋狂之口前，請一定返回營地跟那些矮人談談。他們或許會告訴你對付居住在蟲巢中的異種蟲類的竅門。$b$b$n，如果娜塔莉雅真的如他們所說的那樣變得瘋狂……做你應該做的。$b$b<指揮官瑪爾利斯轉過身去。>', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8306;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "轉至塞納裡奧要塞以西的暮光之錘營地，調查沙蟲的烹飪方法。", Objectives AC enUS : "Look for information about cooking Sandworm Meat at the Twilight's Hammer camp west of Cenarion Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Look for information about cooking Sandworm Meat at the Twilight's Hammer camp west of Cenarion Hold.",  OLD Details : "要適應沙漠生活並不容易。我思念奧伯丁的小鳥和綠樹，而在希利蘇斯這片乾燥的土地上，可供食用的食物少之又少。我在嘗試著研究沙漠中的草藥，但是草藥的數量並不多。$B$B我曾經看到西邊的那些暮光之錘成員獵殺沙蟲作為食物。沙蟲的味道很苦，不知道他們是怎麼吃下去的……如果你碰巧去他們營地的話，記得仔細觀察，看能不能學到點什麼。", Details AC enUS : "Adapting to life in the desert has been difficult to say the least.  Not only do I miss the birds and trees of Auberdine but our food selection is severely limited by this arid environment.  I'm trying to learn about desert herbs, but there aren't many.$B$BI've seen Twilight's Hammer groups from the camp west of here hunt sandworms for food.  Sandworm meat is so bitter though, I can't imagine how they make it palatable.  Keep your eyes open if you go to their camp and let me know if you learn anything." ; Wowhead enUS : "Adapting to life in the desert has been difficult to say the least. Not only do I miss the birds and trees of Auberdine but our food selection is severely limited by this arid environment. I'm trying to learn about desert herbs, but there aren't many.$b$bI've seen Twilight's Hammer groups from the camp west of here hunt sandworms for food. Sandworm meat is so bitter though, I can't imagine how they make it palatable. Keep your eyes open if you go to their camp and let me know if you learn anything."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '在塞納里奧城堡西方的暮光之錘營地尋找關於烹煮沙蟲肉的資訊。', `Details` = '要適應沙漠生活並不容易。我思念奧伯丁的小鳥和綠樹，而在希利蘇斯這片乾燥的土地上，可供食用的食物少之又少。我在嘗試著研究沙漠中的草藥，但是草藥的數量並不多。$b$b我曾經看到西邊的那些暮光之錘成員獵殺沙蟲作為食物。沙蟲的味道很苦，不知道他們是怎麼吃下去的……如果你碰巧去他們營地的話，記得仔細觀察，看能不能學到點什麼。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8307;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "布萊恩·銅須的信", Title AC enUS : "Brann Bronzebeard's Lost Letter" ; Wowhead enUS : "Brann Bronzebeard's Lost Letter",  OLD Objectives : "將布萊恩·銅須的信件帶往希利蘇斯南部的銅須營地。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take Brann Bronzebeard's Letter to Bronzebeard's Encampment in southern Silithus." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take Brann Bronzebeard's Letter to Bronzebeard's Encampment in southern Silithus.",  OLD Details : "致此信的讀者：$B$B當你讀到這兒時，我可能已經死了，也可能很快就會死去，這很難說。總之，大部分人都已經死掉了。$B$B我已經找到了有關一位元泰坦的資訊。他和一個上古之神展開了一場激戰。是的，上古之神。我還找到通往安其拉的古老隧道。$B$B將這封信帶回我的營地，保證我的猴子有充足的食物和水，記得多抱抱它。$B$B- 布萊恩·銅須，探險特派員$B$B附：注意那些崇拜上古之神的暗夜精靈。", Details AC enUS : "To Whom It May Concern:$B$BIf you're reading this, I'm either dead or soon to be dead. It's hard to say. Most of the crew is dead anyhow.$B$BFound information about a Titan. Great battle between him and an Old God. Yes, a bona fide Old God. Found ancient tunnel leading to Ahn'Qiraj. Taking it.$B$BTake this letter to my old camp. Make sure my monkey is getting adequate food, water, and hugs.$B$B-Brann Bronzebeard, Explorer Extreme$B$BP.S. Watch out for crazy Old God worshipping night elf." ; Wowhead enUS : "To Whom It May Concern:$b$bIf you're reading this, I'm either dead or soon to be dead. It's hard to say. Most of the crew is dead anyhow.$b$bFound information about a Titan. Great battle between him and an Old God. Yes, a bona fide Old God. Found ancient tunnel leading to Ahn'Qiraj. Taking it.$b$bTake this letter to my old camp. Make sure my monkey is getting adequate food, water, and hugs.$b$b-Brann Bronzebeard, Explorer Extreme$b$bP.S. Watch out for crazy Old God worshipping night elf."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '布拉恩·銅鬚遺失的信件', `Objectives` = '將布拉恩·銅鬚的信帶到希利蘇斯南邊的銅鬚營地去。', `Details` = '致此信的讀者:$b$b當你讀到這兒時，我可能已經死了，也可能很快就會死去，這很難說。總之，大部分人都已經死掉了。$b$b我已經找到了有關一位泰坦的資訊。他和一個上古之神展開了一場激戰。是的，上古之神。我還找到通往安其拉的古老隧道。$b$b將這封信帶回我的營地，保證我的猴子有充足的食物和水，記得多抱抱它。$b$b- 布萊恩·銅鬚，探險特派員$b$b附:注意那些崇拜上古之神的夜精靈。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8308;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "追查雕文", Title AC enUS : "Glyph Chasing" ; Wowhead enUS : "Glyph Chasing",  OLD Objectives : "希利蘇斯銅須營地的魯特加爾·雕石想要你轉至亞什蟲巢、左拉蟲巢和雷戈蟲巢，從蟲巢中的雕文水晶上取下拓文。$B$B使用地質學家的抄錄工具包獲取古老雕文的摹本。完成任務後回到魯特加爾·雕石那兒。", Objectives AC enUS : "Rutgar Glyphshaper at Bronzebeard's Encampment in Silithus wants you to venture to Hive'Ashi, Hive'Zora, and Hive'Regal and recover Glyphed Rubbings from the Glyphed Crystals of each hive.$B$BUse the Geologist's Transcription Kit to make a reasonable facsimile of the ancient glyphs. Return to Rutgar Glyphshaper when you complete this task." ; Wowhead enUS : "Rutgar Glyphshaper at Bronzebeard's Encampment in Silithus wants you to venture to Hive'Ashi, Hive'Zora, and Hive'Regal and recover Glyphed Rubbings from the Glyphed Crystals of each hive.$b$bUse the Geologist's Transcription Kit to make a reasonable facsimile of the ancient glyphs. Return to Rutgar Glyphshaper when you complete this task.",  OLD Details : "在我們首次嘗試進攻蟲巢、瑪爾利斯夫人變得瘋瘋癲癲之後，那些蟲巢中就不斷湧出蟲子來！這也許跟那些奇怪的水晶上的雕文有關。$B$B我們必須從三個蟲巢的水晶上取下拓文。如果我們能得到拓文，或許能揭開這種瘋症的謎團。$B$B帶上拓文工具，邀上你的夥伴，轉至蟲巢去吧，$N。取下三座蟲巢中的拓文之後再回到我這兒來。", Details AC enUS : "After our initial foray into the hives and Mistress Mar'alith's subsequent madness the three hives have been spewing out bugs! The increased activity might be tied into the glyphs covering those strange crystals.$B$BWe must get a rubbing from crystals in all three hives. If we can get those rubbings, we might be able to make sense of this madness.$B$BTake this transcription set  and hit those hives, $N. Don't come back until you've gotten copies from each hive." ; Wowhead enUS : "After our initial foray into the hives and Mistress Mar'alith's subsequent madness the three hives have been spewing out bugs! The increased activity might be tied into the glyphs covering those strange crystals.$b$bWe must get a rubbing from crystals in all three hives. If we can get those rubbings, we might be able to make sense of this madness.$b$bTake this transcription set and hit those hives, $n. Don't come back until you've gotten copies from each hive."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '追查雕紋', `Objectives` = '希利蘇斯銅鬚營地的魯特加爾·雕石想要你前往亞什蟲巢、佐拉蟲巢和雷戈蟲巢，從蟲巢中的雕紋水晶上取下拓文。$b$b使用地質學家的抄錄工具包獲取古老雕紋的摹本。完成任務後回到魯特加爾·塑紋者那兒。', `Details` = '在我們首次嘗試進攻蟲巢、瑪爾利斯夫人變得瘋瘋癲癲之後，那些蟲巢中就不斷湧出蟲子來!這也許跟那些奇怪的水晶上的雕紋有關。$b$b我們必須從三個蟲巢的水晶上取下拓文。如果我們能得到拓文，或許能揭開這種瘋症的謎團。$b$b帶上拓文工具，前往蟲巢去吧，$n。取下三座蟲巢中的拓文之後再回到我這兒來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8309;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "破譯密碼", Title AC enUS : "Breaking the Code" ; Wowhead enUS : "Breaking the Code",  OLD Objectives : "希利蘇斯銅須營地的弗蘭卡·石橋想讓你取回一個亞什異種蟲腦、一個左拉異種蟲腦和一個雷戈異種蟲腦。完成任務後回到弗蘭卡那兒。", Objectives AC enUS : "Frankal Stonebridge at Bronzebeard's Encampment in Silithus wants you to recover a Hive'Zora Silithid Brain, Hive'Ashi Silithid Brain, and a Hive'Regal Silithid Brain. Return to Frankal when you have completed this task." ; Wowhead enUS : "Frankal Stonebridge at Bronzebeard's Encampment in Silithus wants you to recover a Hive'Zora Silithid Brain, Hive'Ashi Silithid Brain, and a Hive'Regal Silithid Brain. Return to Frankal when you have completed this task.",  OLD Details : "我得製作一種藥劑，幫助我們解讀拓文以及其拉蟲人和異種蟲的語言！我需要什麼？很高興你能這麼問！我需要腦子！確切地說，我需要居住在蟲巢中的不同種群的異種蟲的腦子。把它們的腦子給我，或許魯特加爾的努力就不會白費。", Details AC enUS : "I think I can formulate an elixir that will allow us to more readily decipher the glyphs and language of the silithid and Qiraji! What do I need? Glad you asked! I need brains! More specifically, a brain from each silithid type that inhabit the hives. Bring me brains and Rutgar's work might not be for naught." ; Wowhead enUS : "I think I can formulate an elixir that will allow us to more readily decipher the glyphs and language of the silithid and Qiraji! What do I need? Glad you asked! I need brains! More specifically, a brain from each silithid type that inhabit the hives. Bring me brains and Rutgar's work might not be for naught."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '破解密碼', `Objectives` = '希利蘇斯銅鬚營地的法蘭克爾·石橋想要你取回一個亞什異種蟲腦、一個佐拉異種蟲腦和一個雷戈異種蟲腦。完成任務後回到法蘭克爾那兒。', `Details` = '我得製作一種藥劑，幫助我們解讀雕紋以及其拉蟲人和異種蟲的語言!我需要什麼?很高興你能這麼問!我需要腦子!確切地說，我需要居住在蟲巢中的不同種群的異種蟲的腦子。把它們的腦子給我，或許魯特加爾的努力就不會白費。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8310;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "賈斯伯的萬鬼節糖果!", Title AC enUS : "Hallow's End Treats for Jesper!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Hallow's End Treats for Jesper!",  OLD Objectives : "和暴風城、鐵爐堡、達納蘇斯的旅店老闆及鐵爐堡的塔瓦斯德‧基瑟爾交談。完成要求的惡作劇來交換他們提供的糖果。$B$B將達納蘇斯杏仁糖、諾姆瑞根橡皮糖、暴風城牛軋糖，和鐵爐堡薄荷糖帶回暴風城前面給賈斯伯。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with the innkeepers of Stormwind, Ironforge, and Darnassus, as well as Talvash del Kissel in Ironforge.  Perform the tricks they ask of you in exchange for the treats they offer.$B$BReturn to Jesper at the Stormwind Orphanage with a Darnassus Marzipan, Gnomeregan Gumdrop, Stormwind Nougat, and Ironforge Mint." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with the innkeepers of Stormwind, Ironforge, and Darnassus, as well as Talvash del Kissel in Ironforge.  Perform the tricks they ask of you in exchange for the treats they offer.$b$bReturn to Jesper at the Stormwind Orphanage with a Darnassus Marzipan, Gnomeregan Gumdrop, Stormwind Nougat, and Ironforge Mint.",  OLD Details : "我沒辦法去玩不給糖就搗蛋。因為死亡之翼的攻擊，監護員南丁格爾願意讓我跑這麼遠都已經很幸運了。$b$b如果你代我去的話，我會用我現有的一些糖果跟你交換!$B$B每座主城的旅店老闆都有為萬鬼節準備糖果，去和他們談話，然後按照他們所要求的做就可以了!另外，鐵爐堡有個叫塔瓦斯德的小地精也在散發糖果。拿到所有的糖果之後，就把它們都帶回來給我吧!", Details AC enUS : "I want to go trick-or-treating, but I can't because I'm sick.  If you go for me, I'd trade you the candy you get for some I already have!  I think you'd like this candy - it makes you turn into things both funny and scary!$B$BEach of the innkeepers in the big cities have candy they give for Hallow's End - talk to them and do the tricks they ask for!  Also, a little gnome named Talvash in Ironforge is handing out candy as well.  When you have all the candy, bring them back to me here!" ; Wowhead enUS : "I want to go trick-or-treating, but I can't because I'm sick. If you go for me, I'd trade you the candy you get for some I already have! I think you'd like this candy - it makes you turn into things both funny and scary!$b$bEach of the innkeepers in the big cities have candy they give for Hallow's End - talk to them and do the tricks they ask for! Also, a little gnome named Talvash in Ironforge is handing out candy as well. When you have all the candy, bring them back to me here!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '史波普的萬鬼節糖果！', `Objectives` = '和暴風城、鐵爐堡、達納蘇斯的旅店老闆們及鐵爐堡的塔瓦斯德·基瑟爾交談。完成要求的惡作劇來交換他們提供的糖果。$b$b帶著達納蘇斯的杏仁糖、諾姆瑞根的橡皮軟糖、暴風城的奶油杏仁花生糖，和鐵爐堡的薄荷糖去找暴風城孤兒院的賈斯伯。', `Details` = '我想要去討萬鬼節糖果，但是我不能去，因為我生病了。如果你可以代我去的話，我會給你一些我已有的糖果！我想你會喜歡這些糖果的……它可以讓你變成又好玩又可怕的東西！$b$b每座主城的旅店老闆都有準備萬鬼節的糖果——你只要和他們交談，然後按照他們所要求的做就可以了！另外，鐵爐堡有個叫塔瓦斯德的小地精也在散發糖果。如果你得到了所有的糖果，就把它們都帶回來給我吧！', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8311;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "史波普的萬鬼節糖果!", Title AC enUS : "Hallow's End Treats for Spoops!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Hallow's End Treats for Spoops!",  OLD Objectives : "和奧格瑪、幽暗城、雷霆崖的旅店老闆及奧格瑪精神谷的卡利‧雷米克交談。完成要求的惡作劇來交換他們提供的糖果。$B$B將雷霆崖杏仁糖、暗矛橡皮糖、奧格瑪牛軋糖和幽暗城薄荷糖帶回羅德隆廢墟給史波普。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with the innkeepers of Orgrimmar, Undercity, and Thunder Bluff, as well as Kali Remik in Sen'jin Village.  Perform the tricks they ask of you in exchange for the treats they offer.$B$BReturn to Spoops at the Orgrimmar Orphanage with a Thunder Bluff Marzipan, Darkspear Gumdrop, Orgrimmar Nougat, and Undercity Mint." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with the innkeepers of Orgrimmar, Undercity, and Thunder Bluff, as well as Kali Remik in Sen'jin Village.  Perform the tricks they ask of you in exchange for the treats they offer.$b$bReturn to Spoops at the Orgrimmar Orphanage with a Thunder Bluff Marzipan, Darkspear Gumdrop, Orgrimmar Nougat, and Undercity Mint.",  OLD Details : "我還想要去玩不給糖就搗蛋，但是我不能去，因為監護員不讓我去。如果你代我去的話，我會用我現有的一些糖果跟你交換!我想你會喜歡這種糖果的...它可以讓你變成又好玩又可怕的東西!$B$B每座主城的旅店老闆都有為萬鬼節準備糖果，去和他們談話，然後按照他們所要求的做就可以了!另外，奧格瑪裡一個名叫卡利‧雷米克的食人妖也在散發糖果。拿到所有的糖果之後，就把它們都帶回來給我吧!", Details AC enUS : "I want to go trick-or-treating, but I can't because I'm sick.  If you go for me, I'd trade you the candy you get for some I already have!  I think you'd like this candy - it makes you turn into things both funny and scary!$B$BEach of the innkeepers in the big cities have candy they give for Hallow's End - talk to them and do the tricks they ask for!  Also, a troll named Kali Remik in Sen'jin Village is handing out candy as well.  When you have all the candy, bring them back to me here!" ; Wowhead enUS : "I want to go trick-or-treating, but I can't because I'm sick. If you go for me, I'd trade you the candy you get for some I already have! I think you'd like this candy - it makes you turn into things both funny and scary!$b$bEach of the innkeepers in the big cities have candy they give for Hallow's End - talk to them and do the tricks they ask for! Also, a troll named Kali Remik in Sen'jin Village is handing out candy as well. When you have all the candy, bring them back to me here!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '賈斯伯的萬鬼節糖果！', `Objectives` = '和奧格瑪、幽暗城、雷霆崖的旅店老闆們及森金村的塔卡利·雷米克交談。完成要求的惡作劇來交換他們提供的糖果。$b$b帶著雷霆崖的杏仁糖、暗矛海灘的橡皮軟糖、奧格瑪的奶油杏仁花生糖，和幽暗城的薄荷糖去找奧格瑪孤兒院的史波普。', `Details` = '我想要去討萬鬼節糖果，但是我不能去，因為我生病了。如果你可以代我去的話，我會給你一些我已有的糖果！我想你會喜歡這些糖果的……它可以讓你變成又好玩又可怕的東西！$b$b每座主城的旅店老闆都有準備萬鬼節的糖果——你只要和他們交談，然後按照他們所要求的做就可以了！另外，森金村的一個名叫卡利·雷米克的食人妖也在散發糖果。如果你得到了所有的糖果，就把它們都帶回來給我吧！', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8312;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將破碎的食譜交給塞納裡奧要塞旅店中的卡蘭德拉斯。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring the Torn Recipe Page to Calandrath at the inn in Cenarion Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the Torn Recipe Page to Calandrath at the inn in Cenarion Hold.",  OLD Details : "雖然你能讀懂沙蟲的烹飪配方，但是裡面提到的草藥和香料你都從未聽說過。卡蘭德拉斯或許對此有些瞭解。", Details AC enUS : "While the recipe for cooking sandworm meat is legible, it contains references to herbs and spices you've never heard of.  Calandrath might have enough knowledge of the plants that grow in the desert to make sense of it.  " ; Wowhead enUS : "While the recipe for cooking sandworm meat is legible, it contains references to herbs and spices you've never heard of. Calandrath might have enough knowledge of the plants that grow in the desert to make sense of it."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將破碎的食譜交給塞納里奧城堡旅店中的卡蘭德拉斯。', `Details` = '雖然你能讀懂沙蟲的烹飪配方，但是裏面提到的草藥和香料你都從未聽說過。卡蘭德拉斯或許對此有些瞭解。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8313;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "揭開秘密", Title AC enUS : "Unraveling the Mystery" ; Wowhead enUS : "Unraveling the Mystery",  OLD Objectives : "銅須營地的魯特加爾·雕石想讓你將雕文水晶棱柱交給希利蘇斯塞納裡奧要塞的地質學家拉克斯班。", Objectives AC enUS : "Rutgar Glyphshaper at Bronzebeard's Encampment wants you to deliver the Glyphed Crystal Prism to Geologist Larksbane at the Cenarion Hold in Silithus." ; Wowhead enUS : "Rutgar Glyphshaper at Bronzebeard's Encampment wants you to deliver the Glyphed Crystal Prism to Geologist Larksbane at the Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",  OLD Details : "我們就快要取得突破了，$N！我們可以通過你取回的拓文在這塊晶華棱柱上重現雕文。很明顯，其拉蟲人和某種未知生物利用這種文字與異種蟲交流資訊。$B$B不幸的是，我們只能從雕文中發現這一點。我們需要設法揭開水晶中隱藏的秘密。$B$B將雕文水晶棱柱交給塞納裡奧要塞的地質學家拉克斯班。她或許能幫上忙。", Details AC enUS : "We're on the verge of a breakthrough, $N! The rubbings you recovered have allowed us to recreate the glyphs on this crystalline prism. They are apparently a means for the Qiraji and other unknown entities to communicate various messages to the silithid.$B$BUnfortunately, that is all we could get out of the glyphs. We need to find a way to unlock the messages hidden within the crystals.$B$BTake the glyphed crystal prism to Geologist Larksbane at Cenarion Hold.  She might be able to help." ; Wowhead enUS : "We're on the verge of a breakthrough, $n! The rubbings you recovered have allowed us to recreate the glyphs on this crystalline prism. They are apparently a means for the Qiraji and other unknown entities to communicate various messages to the silithid.$b$bUnfortunately, that is all we could get out of the glyphs. We need to find a way to unlock the messages hidden within the crystals.$b$bTake the glyphed crystal prism to Geologist Larksbane at Cenarion Hold. She might be able to help."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '解開謎題', `Objectives` = '銅鬚營地的魯特加爾·塑紋者想讓你將雕紋水晶棱柱交給希利蘇斯塞納里奧城堡的地質學家拉克斯班。', `Details` = '我們就快要取得突破了，$n!我們可以通過你取回的拓文在這塊晶華棱柱上重現雕紋。很明顯，其拉蟲人和某種未知生物利用這種文字與異種蟲交流資訊。$b$b不幸的是，我們只能從雕紋中發現這一點。我們需要設法揭開結晶中隱藏的秘密。$b$b將雕紋結晶棱柱交給塞納里奧城堡的地質學家拉克斯班。她或許能幫上忙。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8314;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "召喚", Title AC enUS : "The Calling" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Calling",  OLD Objectives : "希利蘇斯塞納裡奧要塞的地質學家拉克斯班想讓你從其拉蟲人使者那裡取回水晶分解裝置。$B$B你已經奉命將召喚雕文帶往塞納裡奧要塞以南的格拉卡洛之骨處，將它們從沙中引出。一旦其拉蟲人使者露面，就殺死它，獲得水晶分解裝置。成功之後回到地質學家拉克斯班那兒去。$B$B你必須召集一支強大的軍隊來完成這項任務，$N！", Objectives AC enUS : "Geologist Larksbane at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to recover the Crystal Unlocking Mechanism from the Qiraji Emissary.$B$BYou have been instructed to take the Glyphs of Calling to the Bones of Grakkarond, south of Cenarion Hold, and draw them in the sand. Should the Qiraji Emissary appear, slay it and recover the Crystal Unlocking Mechanism. Return to Geologist Larksbane if you succeed.$B$BAssemble an army for this task, $N!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Geologist Larksbane at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to recover the Crystal Unlocking Mechanism from the Qiraji Emissary.$b$bYou have been instructed to take the Glyphs of Calling to the Bones of Grakkarond, south of Cenarion Hold, and draw them in the sand. Should the Qiraji Emissary appear, slay it and recover the Crystal Unlocking Mechanism. Return to Geologist Larksbane if you succeed.$b$bAssemble an army for this task, $n!",  OLD Details : "雕文顯示，一位元其拉蟲人的使者跟三個異種蟲相約在一處龍骨旁見面。關於雕文上方的文字，我只能假設那是某種密碼。這密碼很可能是召喚其拉蟲人使者的關鍵。$B$B我將製作一份雕文密碼的副本，你把它放到格拉卡洛之骨的沙中。如果我沒猜錯的話，主宰會認為可以傳遞新資料了。殺死他們，然後跟其拉蟲人使者作戰。他是揭開水晶之謎的關鍵人物……", Details AC enUS : "The glyphs illustrate an emissary of the Qiraji meeting with three silithid at the bones of a large dragon. Above the glyphs is what I can only assume to be a code of some sort. This code might very well be the key to summoning the emissary.$B$BI will create a copy of the glyph code that you must use in the sand at the Bones of Grakkarond. If I am right, the Overlords will come thinking that new data is ready for transmission. Strike them down and confront the emissary. He holds the key to the crystals..." ; Wowhead enUS : "The glyphs illustrate an emissary of the Qiraji meeting with three silithid at the bones of a large dragon. Above the glyphs is what I can only assume to be a code of some sort. This code might very well be the key to summoning the emissary.$b$bI will create a copy of the glyph code that you must use in the sand at the Bones of Grakkarond. If I am right, the Overlords will come thinking that new data is ready for transmission. Strike them down and confront the emissary. He holds the key to the crystals..."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '呼喚', `Objectives` = '希利蘇斯塞納里奧城堡的地質學家拉克斯班想讓你從其拉蟲人使者那裏取回水晶分解裝置。$b$b你已經奉命將召喚雕紋帶往塞納里奧城堡以南的格拉卡洛之骨處，將它們從沙中引出。一旦其拉蟲人使者露面，就殺死它，獲得水晶分解裝置。成功之後回到地質學家拉克斯班那兒去。$b$b你必須召集一支強大的軍隊來完成這項任務，$n!', `Details` = '雕紋雕紋顯示，一位元其拉蟲人的使者跟三個異種蟲相約在一處龍骨旁見面。關於雕紋上方的文字，我只能假設那是某種密碼。這密碼很可能是召喚其拉蟲人使者的關鍵。$b$b我將製作一份雕紋密碼的副本，你把它放到格拉卡洛之骨的沙中。如果我沒猜錯的話，主宰會認為可以傳遞新資料了。殺死他們，然後跟其拉蟲人使者作戰。他是揭開水晶之謎的關鍵人物……', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8315;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "軍備物資", Title AC enUS : "Armaments of War" ; Wowhead enUS : "Armaments of War"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '軍備之戰', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8316;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "下廚", Title AC enUS : "Kitchen Assistance" ; Wowhead enUS : "Kitchen Assistance",  OLD Objectives : "塞納裡奧要塞的卡蘭德拉斯需要製作10只沙漠肉丸子。", Objectives AC enUS : "Calandrath at Cenarion Hold needs a batch of 10 Smoked Desert Dumplings." ; Wowhead enUS : "Calandrath at Cenarion Hold needs a batch of 10 Smoked Desert Dumplings.",  OLD Details : "這食譜肯定會派上用場的。我得去準備沙漠肉丸子了。我需要你的説明，當然，我是不會讓你白費力氣的。", Details AC enUS : "That recipe sure will come in handy.  I'd better get to work so I can have some smoked desert dumplings ready for today.  I could use a hand in making some, I'll make it worth your while." ; Wowhead enUS : "That recipe sure will come in handy. I'd better get to work so I can have some smoked desert dumplings ready for today. I could use a hand in making some, I'll make it worth your while."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '廚房助手', `Objectives` = '塞納里奧城堡的卡蘭德拉斯需要製作10個沙漠肉丸子的麵團。', `Details` = '這個食譜一定會很簡便。我最好快點去工作才能有煙燻沙漠餃子可吃。幫我一點忙，我保證你值回票價的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8317;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "秘密交流", Title AC enUS : "Secret Communication" ; Wowhead enUS : "Secret Communication",  OLD Objectives : "把10片暮光密文信交給塞納裡奧要塞的鮑爾·蠻鬃。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 10 Encrypted Twilight Texts to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 10 Encrypted Twilight Texts to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold.",  OLD Details : "一些暮光之錘的教徒帶著寫有含糊不清詞句的紙片。我希望你可以弄一些來給我，$c。$B$B我說不清“含糊不清”是什麼概念，總之是含義不清的！他們用這些紙片進行不同團隊之間的秘密交流，如果我們可以找到更多這樣的紙片，那麼他們所能進行的交流就會更少！", Details AC enUS : "Some of the Twilight's Hammer cultists carry around little papers with gibberish written on them.  I want you to bring me a stack of them, $c.$B$BI can't figure out what the gibberish means, but that's not the point!  These papers are how their different groups communicate secretly.  The more texts we take out of circulation, the less they can communicate!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Some of the Twilight's Hammer cultists carry around little papers with gibberish written on them. I want you to bring me a stack of them, $c.$b$bI can't figure out what the gibberish means, but that's not the point! These papers are how their different groups communicate secretly. The more texts we take out of circulation, the less they can communicate!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '秘密通訊', `Objectives` = '帶10張暮光文本給塞納里奧城堡的鮑爾·蠻鬃。', `Details` = '有些暮光之錘祭司帶著寫滿胡言亂語的小紙片四處走動。我要你去幫我帶回一堆紙片，$c。$b$b我不能理解那些胡言亂語的意思，不過那不是重點!這些紙片就是他們不同族群秘密溝通的方式，我們從訊息傳播中拿走越多文字，他們就越無法溝通!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8318;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "暮光密文信", Title AC enUS : "Encrypted Twilight Texts" ; Wowhead enUS : "Encrypted Twilight Texts"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '暮光加密文件', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8319;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "暮光地王", Title AC enUS : "Twilight Geolords" ; Wowhead enUS : "Twilight Geolords",  OLD Objectives : "殺死10個暮光地王，然後向塞納裡奧要塞的霍姆·蠻鬃覆命。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill 10 Twilight Geolords, then return to Huum Wildmane in Cenarion Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill 10 Twilight Geolords, then return to Huum Wildmane in Cenarion Hold.",  OLD Details : "暮光之錘，一群屈服於毀滅力量的教徒，他們在希利蘇斯安營紮寨，日夜舉行奇怪的儀式。我們還不知道他們的計畫是什麼，但是我相信他們正在試圖和那些沙漠中的紅色水晶進行聯繫。$B$B雖然遲早我們會發現他們的秘密，但是眼下，我們需要立即中止他們的威脅。到他們在西邊設立的營地去，找到暮光地王。他們是這些惡棍的首領，也就是你要去擊殺的物件！", Details AC enUS : "The Twilight's Hammer, an insane cult bent on destruction, set up camps in Silithus and perform rituals day and night.  We do not yet know their plans, but we do think they are somehow linked to the pulsing red crystals spread across the desert.$B$BAlthough their mystery may one day be solved, we must first deal with their immediate threat.  Go to their camps to the west and seek out Twilight geolords.  They are the heads of these serpents; that is where we must strike!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Twilight's Hammer, an insane cult bent on destruction, set up camps in Silithus and perform rituals day and night. We do not yet know their plans, but we do think they are somehow linked to the pulsing red crystals spread across the desert.$b$bAlthough their mystery may one day be solved, we must first deal with their immediate threat. Go to their camps to the west and seek out Twilight geolords. They are the heads of these serpents; that is where we must strike!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Twilight Geolord slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '暮光地領主', `Objectives` = '殺死10個暮光地領主, 然後向塞納里奧城堡的胡姆·蠻鬃回報。', `Details` = '暮光之錘，一個傾向毀滅的瘋狂教派，在希利蘇斯建立了據點並且日以繼夜地舉行儀式。我們還不知道他們的計畫為何，但是我們覺得應該與散落在沙漠之中的脈衝紅水晶有些關聯。$b$b雖然有一天可以解開他們的謎團，然而我們必須先處理他們帶來的立即性威脅。到他們的營地去並且找出暮光地領主。他們就是這些毒蛇的首領，也就是我們必須打擊的對象!', `Objectivetext1` = '暮光地領主 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8320;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "邪惡的維拉爾", Title AC enUS : "Vyral the Vile" ; Wowhead enUS : "Vyral the Vile",  OLD Objectives : "把維拉爾的徽記之戒交給塞納裡奧要塞的霍姆·蠻鬃。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring Vyral's Signet Ring to Huum Wildmane in Cenarion Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring Vyral's Signet Ring to Huum Wildmane in Cenarion Hold.",  OLD Details : "我們發現又一個為暮光之錘運作的基地。那裡被稱為暮光小徑，它是一個位於希利蘇斯東北角的洞穴。該地區的首領，邪惡的維拉爾就徘徊在這個洞穴中——他就是你的下一個目標。當你完成這個任務之後，把他的戒指帶回來。$B$B祝你好運，$N。暮光之錘的惡行一定要被阻止。", Details AC enUS : "We have discovered another base of operations for the Twilight's Hammer.  It is called Twilight's Run; it is a cave tucked in the northeast corner of Silithus.  The local leader of the cult, Vyral the Vile, haunts that cave - it is he who you must next defeat.  When you have done this, bring me his signet ring.$B$BFortune to you, $N.  The horrors of Twilight's Run are formidable indeed." ; Wowhead enUS : "We have discovered another base of operations for the Twilight's Hammer. It is called Twilight's Run; it is a cave tucked in the northeast corner of Silithus. The local leader of the cult, Vyral the Vile, haunts that cave - it is he who you must next defeat. When you have done this, bring me his signet ring.$b$bFortune to you, $n. The horrors of Twilight's Run are formidable indeed."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '卑鄙的維拉爾', `Objectives` = '把維拉爾的璽戒帶給塞納里奧城堡的胡姆·蠻鬃。', `Details` = '我們發現了另一個暮光之錘的運作基地。它叫暮光小徑;是個在希利蘇斯東北方角落的洞穴。當地的領導者，卑鄙的維拉爾，都在那個洞穴出沒 - 他就是你下一個一定要擊敗的人。完成之後，把他的璽戒拿來給我。$b$b祝你好運，$n。暮光小徑真的是個很可怕的地方。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8321;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將惡臭雞蛋放到南海鎮旅店主要的釀酒桶子裡。", Objectives AC enUS : "Place the Rotten Eggs in the main brew keg located inside the Southshore Inn." ; Wowhead enUS : "Place the Rotten Eggs in the main brew keg located inside the Southshore Inn.",  OLD Details : "南海鎮的人熱愛他們的麥芽酒，因此他們視南海鎮旅店裡的麥芽酒為寶。現在趁著萬鬼節的混亂，我們可以去毀了他們最新一批的飲品，讓他們好幾個禮拜 - 甚至是好幾個月都沒東西喝！$B$B帶著這些腐爛發臭的雞蛋，把它們放到南海鎮旅店釀酒的桶子裡。你獨自前往一定會引起衝突，所以要提高警覺！$B$B等你給南海鎮的人嘗到難以忘懷的滋味之後，回到慶典這裡找我！", Details AC enUS : "The humans of Southshore love their ale, and as such they prize the ale served at the Southshore Inn.  With the chaos of Hallow's End now upon them, we can use it to ruin their latest batch of beverages for weeks - if not months to come!$B$BTake these rotten eggs and place them in the main brew keg inside the Southshore Inn.  Your presence alone will cause strife, so be prepared to defend yourself!$B$BOnce you've given Southshore a taste they'll not soon forget, return to me here at the festival!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The humans of Southshore love their ale, and as such they prize the ale served at the Southshore Inn. With the chaos of Hallow's End now upon them, we can use it to ruin their latest batch of beverages for weeks - if not months to come!$b$bTake these rotten eggs and place them in the main brew keg inside the Southshore Inn. Your presence alone will cause strife, so be prepared to defend yourself!$b$bOnce you've given Southshore a taste they'll not soon forget, return to me here at the festival!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將腐爛的臭雞蛋放到南海鎮旅店主要的釀酒桶子裡。', `Details` = '南海鎮的人熱愛他們的麥酒，因此他們視南海鎮旅店裡的麥酒為寶。現在趁著萬鬼節的混亂，我們可以去毀了他們最新一批的飲品，讓他們好幾個禮拜 - 甚至是好幾個月都沒東西喝！$b$b帶著這些腐爛發臭的雞蛋，把它們放到南海鎮旅店釀酒的桶子裡。你獨自前往一定會引起衝突，所以要提高警覺！$b$b等你給南海鎮的人嘗到難以忘懷的滋味之後，回到慶典這裡找我！', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8322;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "真正的信徒", Title AC enUS : "True Believers" ; Wowhead enUS : "True Believers",  OLD Objectives : "隱士奧泰爾要你帶回10張暮光密文信。", Objectives AC enUS : "Hermit Ortell wants you to bring him 10 Encrypted Twilight Texts" ; Wowhead enUS : "Hermit Ortell wants you to bring him 10 Encrypted Twilight Texts",  OLD Details : "現在我擁有了暮光詞典，不過我還需要你幫我個小忙。$B$B我拋棄了我以前的組織，但是我還是很懷念他們每個月的時事通訊刊物。$B$B如果你想要笑的話就笑吧，但是在這段離開的日子閱讀《真正的信徒》是我消磨時間的好辦法。$B$B這份讀物中有許多我可以和你分享的資訊。請把任何你從暮光之錘成員身上找到的加過密的文字帶給我。", Details AC enUS : "Now that I have the Twilight Lexicon in my possession, there is a small favor I'd like to ask of you.$B$BMy former organization has a secret encoded bulletin they circulate on a monthly basis.$B$BIf they make any progress searching for me or if they call off the search, word will be published on the True Believer.$B$BAlthough this information is obviously valuable to me, the publication contains other useful information that I can share.  Bring me any encoded texts you find on Twilight's Hammer members." ; Wowhead enUS : "Now that I have the Twilight Lexicon in my possession, there is a small favor I'd like to ask of you.$b$bMy former organization has a secret encoded bulletin they circulate on a monthly basis.$b$bIf they make any progress searching for me or if they call off the search, word will be published on the True Believer.$b$bAlthough this information is obviously valuable to me, the publication contains other useful information that I can share. Bring me any encoded texts you find on Twilight's Hammer members."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '真實信仰者', `Objectives` = '隱士奧泰爾希望你能帶給他10份加密的暮光文件。', `Details` = '現在我擁有暮光詞典了，我想要請你幫我一個小忙。$b$b我過去的組織有一份一個月循環一次的加密文件。$b$b如果他們對我的研究有任何進展或是他們終止了研究，都會在真實信仰者發表。$b$b雖然這個資訊對我來說有很明顯的價值，但是我也能分享這份文件所包含的其他有用訊息。你可以在暮光之錘的成員身上得到這份加密文件，把他帶給我。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8323;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "奪回逐日島", Title AC enUS : "Reclaiming Sunstrider Isle" ; Wowhead enUS : "Reclaiming Sunstrider Isle",  OLD Objectives : "殺死8只法力浮龍。它們位於法師塔和陽臺附近的燃燒水晶周圍。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill 8 Mana Wyrms; they are located close to the Burning Crystals that are adjacent to the tower and gazebo." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill 8 Mana Wyrms; they are located close to the Burning Crystals that are adjacent to the tower and gazebo.",  OLD Details : "你越快開始接受訓練，$N，就對我們大家越有好處。我們已經沒有任何容忍犯錯的餘地了，所以你可要聽仔細。$B$B那些太陽之塔西邊的懸浮著的綠色物體，就是燃燒水晶，它們長期以來給島內供應著能源，而法力浮龍則負責守護著這些水晶。天災軍團對奎爾薩拉斯的入侵大大干擾了我們對這些法力浮龍的魔法控制，導致它們變得不聽調遣。$B$B除了削減它們的數量以外，已經沒有其它的辦法了。去吧，完成之後再回來向我覆命。", Details AC enUS : "The sooner you begin your education, $N, the better for us all.  There is little room for error, so listen closely.$B$BThe Burning Crystals - the green floating objects to the west of the Sunspire here - have long been used to power the isle's experimentations.  The mana wyrms were their guardians, but the Scourge invasion of Quel'Thalas has driven them errant from our lack of magical control over them.$B$BThere is little choice but to thin their numbers for reclamation.  Do this, then return to me." ; Wowhead enUS : "The sooner you begin your education, $n, the better for us all. There is little room for error, so listen closely.$b$bThe Burning Crystals - the green floating objects to the west of the Sunspire here - have long been used to power the isle's experimentations. The mana wyrms were their guardians, but the Scourge invasion of Quel'Thalas has driven them errant from our lack of magical control over them.$b$bThere is little choice but to thin their numbers for reclamation. Do this, then return to me.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Mana Wyrm slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '奪回逐日者之島', `Objectives` = '殺死8隻法力龍鰻;他們就在哨塔與瞭望台旁的燃燒水晶那裡。完成後回到逐日者之島哨塔上的博學者伊羅娜那裡。', `Details` = '你越早開始行動對我們大家越好，$n。沒有空間犯錯，所以聽仔細了。$b$b燃燒水晶 - 那個在日尖塔西方的綠色漂浮物 - 長久以來被用作增強小島的實驗。法力龍鰻是他們的守衛，但奎爾薩拉斯的天譴軍團入侵讓他們誤入歧途，因為我們無法用魔法控制他們。$b$b我們無計可施只能削減他們的數量以重拾小島。快去吧，完成後再回來找我。', `Objectivetext1` = '法力龍鰻 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8325;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "令人遺憾的措施", Title AC enUS : "Unfortunate Measures" ; Wowhead enUS : "Unfortunate Measures",  OLD Objectives : "殺死一些魔泉山貓和魔泉山貓幼崽，並從它們身上收集8個山貓的項圈。完成之後向逐日島的魔導師艾洛娜覆命。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 8 Lynx Collars from slain Springpaw Lynxes and Springpaw Cubs.  Return to Magistrix Erona on Sunstrider Isle when you are done." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 8 Lynx Collars from slain Springpaw Lynxes and Springpaw Cubs.  Return to Magistrix Erona on Sunstrider Isle when you are done.",  OLD Details : "你所做出的努力產生了一些後果，坦率地說，是我不希望看到的後果。燃燒水晶中紊亂的力量給這個島嶼上的生態平衡帶來的破壞遠比我的預料嚴重許多。我想，我們現在必須採取一些令人遺憾的措施來穩定局勢了。$B$B附近的山貓已經受到了水晶魔力的影響，成為了犧牲品，我們不得不清除它們。帶回它們的項圈，$N，這樣我就可以看看是否能給這些項圈附上一定的魔法抗性，幫助它們從瘋狂中恢復過來。", Details AC enUS : "Your effort has made something clear that, honestly, I wish were not true.  The unchecked power of the Burning Crystals has maligned a much larger swath of the isle's natural balance than I thought.  We must now take on more unfortunate measures to reclaim control.$B$BThe nearby lynxes have succumbed to the influence of the crystals, and they must be put down.  Bring their collars, $N, as I may yet be able to fashion a magical restraint to turn some back from being uncontrolled." ; Wowhead enUS : "Your effort has made something clear that, honestly, I wish were not true. The unchecked power of the Burning Crystals has maligned a much larger swath of the isle's natural balance than I thought. We must now take on more unfortunate measures to reclaim control.$b$bThe nearby lynxes have succumbed to the influence of the crystals, and they must be put down. Bring their collars, $n, as I may yet be able to fashion a magical restraint to turn some back from being uncontrolled."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '不幸的手段', `Objectives` = '殺死泉爪山貓和幼年泉爪山貓收集8個山貓項圈。完成後去找逐日者之島的博學者伊羅娜。', `Details` = '你的努力讓一些事情明朗化，老實說，我希望那不是真的。燃燒水晶未經查證的力量已經對島上的自然平衡有了更大的破壞。我們一定要採取更多不幸的措施以重拾控制。$b$b附近的山貓已經向水晶的力量屈服，而他們一定要被消滅。把他們的項圈帶回來，$n，這樣我才能實行魔法抑制以扭轉一點形勢。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8326;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "向蘭薩恩·派雷隆報到", Title AC enUS : "Report to Lanthan Perilon" ; Wowhead enUS : "Report to Lanthan Perilon",  OLD Objectives : "與逐日島的蘭薩恩·派雷隆談一談，他就站在向西去的小路旁。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Lanthan Perilon on Sunstrider Isle; he is standing close to the path running west away from the Sunspire." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Lanthan Perilon on Sunstrider Isle; he is standing close to the path running west away from the Sunspire.",  OLD Details : "你現在可以去向我的助手蘭薩恩·派雷隆報到了。他將會指示你如何進行下一步的工作。我們仍然會留在太陽之塔，繼續想方設法奪回對燃燒水晶的控制，與此同時，你則會去處理法瑟林學院那邊的問題。當你找到蘭薩恩之後，他會把那裡的情況詳細地解釋給你聽。$B$B他就在附近不遠的地方，你只需沿著這條小路向西走，就能找到他。$B$B祝你好運，$N，你一直以來的優秀表現一定會受到獎賞的。", Details AC enUS : "You are to report to my assistant, Lanthan Perilon.  He will instruct you on what needs to be done next.  While we here at the Sunspire will continue to rein in the Burning Crystals, you will be focused on a more pressing matter concerning Falthrien Academy.  Lanthan will explain fully when you speak to him.$B$BSimply walk west of here along the path, and you should see him standing close by.$B$BGood luck, $N - your continued successes shall be rewarded." ; Wowhead enUS : "You are to report to my assistant, Lanthan Perilon. He will instruct you on what needs to be done next. While we here at the Sunspire will continue to rein in the Burning Crystals, you will be focused on a more pressing matter concerning Falthrien Academy. Lanthan will explain fully when you speak to him.$b$bSimply walk west of here along the path, and you should see him standing close by.$b$bGood luck, $n - your continued successes shall be rewarded."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '向蘭深·佩瑞隆回報', `Objectives` = '和逐日者之島的蘭深·佩瑞隆談談;他就在日尖塔往西邊的路上。', `Details` = '你要跟我的助理蘭深·佩瑞隆報告。他會告訴你接下來要做什麼。當我們在日尖塔這裡繼續支配燃燒水晶，你則要致力於一件更緊急的事，與法薩瑞安學院有關。等你和蘭深交談的時候他會詳細地向你描述。$b$b沿著路往西邊走，你就會看到他站在那裡。$b$b祝你好運，$n - 你繼續成功是會得到獎勵的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8327;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "與逐日島太陽之塔內的法師訓練師朱莉亞·射日者談一談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Julia Sunstriker - the Mage class trainer - inside the Sunspire on Sunstrider Isle." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Julia Sunstriker - the Mage class trainer - inside the Sunspire on Sunstrider Isle.",  OLD Details : "既然你已經在你所選擇的職業上有所進步了，我想你一定會希望能夠獲得來自職業訓練師的更多指導。逐日島上有一位名叫朱莉亞·射日者的法師訓練師。去和她談談吧，看看她能教會你些什麼。當然，你得付點學費。$B$B朱莉亞跟逐日島其它訓練師都在太陽之塔的下層。", Details AC enUS : "As you advance within your class, you will want to take advantage of the training that your class trainer can provide you.  For young mages here on Sunstrider Isle, your trainer is Julia Sunstriker.  Speak with Julia and see what training she has available for you.  The things she will teach do have a cost, so bring some coin with you.$B$BJulia - as with all the trainers on Sunstrider Isle - is inside the Sunspire on the lower level." ; Wowhead enUS : "As you advance within your class, you will want to take advantage of the training that your class trainer can provide you. For young mages here on Sunstrider Isle, your trainer is Julia Sunstriker. Speak with Julia and see what training she has available for you. The things she will teach do have a cost, so bring some coin with you.$b$bJulia - as with all the trainers on Sunstrider Isle - is inside the Sunspire on the lower level."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '和茱莉亞·擊日者 - 法師訓練師談談，她就在逐日者之島的日尖塔裡面。', `Details` = '隨著你的職業技能越來越精進，你就要從你的職業訓練師那裡多學一點東西。在逐日者之島，年輕法師的訓練師是茱莉亞·擊日者。和她談談，看看她能提供你什麼訓練。向她學東西是要花錢的，所以帶一點錢在身上。$b$b茱莉亞 - 和所有逐日者之島的訓練師一樣 - 都在日尖塔的較低層。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8328;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "索蘭尼亞的物品", Title AC enUS : "Solanian's Belongings" ; Wowhead enUS : "Solanian's Belongings",  OLD Objectives : "收集護井者索蘭尼亞的占卜寶珠、天災魔法卷軸和日記。它們分別位於逐日島上的池塘邊、噴泉附近以及一塊燃燒水晶旁。找到所有物品後，將它們歸還給太陽之塔上的護井者索蘭尼亞。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect Well Watcher Solanian's Scrying Orb, his Scroll of Scourge Magic, and his Journal.  They are found on Sunstrider Isle by the pond, the fountain, and one of the Burning Crystals.  Return them to the Well Watcher at the Sunspire on Sunstrider Isle when you've collected them all." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect Well Watcher Solanian's Scrying Orb, his Scroll of Scourge Magic, and his Journal.  They are found on Sunstrider Isle by the pond, the fountain, and one of the Burning Crystals.  Return them to the Well Watcher at the Sunspire on Sunstrider Isle when you've collected them all.",  OLD Details : "由於逐日島這段時間以來所發生的混亂和變故，我幾乎完全沒有時間來收回我散落在島上的東西。現在我必須守在這裡觀察太陽之井，所以我想只能拜託你替我收回這些東西了。$B$B我需要我的占卜寶珠，我的天災魔法卷軸，還有我的日記本。來，拿著這個小背包，我的東西實在是太多了，你可以把它們都裝在這裡面帶回來。請一定要把它們帶回來給我，我會給你一點小禮物以表達謝意的——另外，這個小背包你也可以留下！", Details AC enUS : "With all the chaos happening here at the Sunspire, I haven't had a chance to collect my belongings I've left outside at various places on the isle.  I must maintain my vigil over the Sunwell here, so I'll ask you to collect them in my stead.$B$BI need my scrying orb, my scroll of Scourge magic, and my journal.  Use this satchel for some extra space, as my things are rather bulky.  Return them to me and I'll give you a little something - you know, for the effort; you can keep the satchel as well!" ; Wowhead enUS : "With all the chaos happening here at the Sunspire, I haven't had a chance to collect my belongings I've left outside at various places on the isle. I must maintain my vigil over the Sunwell here, so I'll ask you to collect them in my stead.$b$bI need my scrying orb, my scroll of Scourge magic, and my journal. Use this satchel for some extra space, as my things are rather bulky. Return them to me and I'll give you a little something - you know, for the effort; you can keep the satchel as well!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '索蘭尼亞的東西', `Objectives` = '收集看井者索蘭尼亞的占卜寶珠，他的天譴軍團的魔法卷軸和他的日記。你可以在逐日者之島的池塘邊，噴水池邊和某個燃燒水晶那裡找到這些東西。當你收集好了之後，將它們帶到逐日者之島給日尖塔上的看井者。', `Details` = '日尖塔那裡發生了那麼多混亂的事，我沒有時間收好留在島上的東西。我一定要在太陽之井這裡保持警戒，所以我希望你能幫我把東西找回來。$b$b我需要我的占卜寶珠，我的天譴魔法卷軸，還有我的日記。把這個包包帶去增加點空間，我的東西體積都很龐大。把它們拿來給我，我就會給你一個東西 - 你知道，因為你幫了忙;你也可以留著這個包包!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8330;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "奧蕾爾·金葉", Title AC enUS : "Aurel Goldleaf" ; Wowhead enUS : "Aurel Goldleaf",  OLD Objectives : "與塞納裡奧要塞的奧蕾爾·金葉談一談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Aurel Goldleaf in Cenarion Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Aurel Goldleaf in Cenarion Hold.",  OLD Details : "$N，儘管我們盼望著暮光之錘在希利蘇斯行動緩慢……遺憾地是，我們錯了。在對他們發動數次持續的攻擊之後，我們發現一種更為黑暗的力量——深淵議會通過分佈在暮光之錘營地的神秘風石控制著他們。$N，接下來，你要面對的就是深淵議會。$B$B跟塞納裡奧要塞東部的工匠奧蕾爾·金葉談談。她的技能會對你有所幫助。", Details AC enUS : "$N, although we had hoped the Twilight's Hammer's operations in Silithus were slowing... we were, regrettably, mistaken.  Through continued forays against the cult, we have learned that an even darker power, the Abyssal Council, controls the Hammer through the arcane wind stones dotted amongst the cult's camps.  Your next action, $N, will be against the Abyssal Council.$B$BSpeak with the craftsman Aurel Goldleaf, in the eastern section of Cenarion Hold.  Her skill will be needed for this next gambit." ; Wowhead enUS : "$n, although we had hoped the Twilight's Hammer's operations in Silithus were slowing... we were, regrettably, mistaken. Through continued forays against the cult, we have learned that an even darker power, the Abyssal Council, controls the Hammer through the arcane wind stones dotted amongst the cult's camps. Your next action, $n, will be against the Abyssal Council.$b$bSpeak with the craftsman Aurel Goldleaf, in the eastern section of Cenarion Hold. Her skill will be needed for this next gambit."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '奧莉爾·金葉', `Objectives` = '與塞納里奧城堡的奧莉爾·金葉談話。', `Details` = '$n，雖然我們以為暮光之錘在希利蘇斯的運作已停頓下來…但是，我們錯了。隨著對他們連續的襲擊，我們發現有個更黑暗的力量也就是深淵議會，利用教派基地中點綴的秘法風石在控制著暮光之錘。$n，你的下一個任務，就是去對抗深淵議會。$b$b和塞納里奧城堡東邊區域的工匠奧莉爾·金葉談談。我們需要她的手藝。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8331;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "議會的公爵", Title AC enUS : "Dukes of the Council" ; Wowhead enUS : "Dukes of the Council",  OLD Objectives : "把1個大塊魔光碎片和3頂深淵紋章交給塞納利奧要塞的奧蕾爾·金葉。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 1 Large Brilliant Shard and 3 Abyssal Crests to Aurel Goldleaf in Cenarion Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 1 Large Brilliant Shard and 3 Abyssal Crests to Aurel Goldleaf in Cenarion Hold.",  OLD Details : "我們認為應該可能使用一塊風石來伏擊一名深淵議會的公爵。前提是，需要有人通過風石來進行聯繫，並讓公爵確認你是暮光之錘的一名中層人員。$B$B因此我們需要暮光信徒身份勳章的複製品。我可以製作這樣一枚勳章，但是我需要一個大塊魔光碎片，還有深淵聖殿騎士所佩戴的紋章。$B$B把這些帶給我，然後我就可以完成剩下的工作了。", Details AC enUS : "We think it is possible to use a wind stone to ambush a duke of the Abyssal Council.  To do this, however, one must commune through the wind stone, and convince the council you are a middle ranked leader of the Twilight's Hammer.  $B$BSuch a gambit requires a replica of the cult's medallion of station.  I can create the medallion, but I will need a large brilliant shard, and crests worn by the Abyssal Templar.$B$BBring these to me and I will do the rest." ; Wowhead enUS : "We think it is possible to use a wind stone to ambush a duke of the Abyssal Council. To do this, however, one must commune through the wind stone, and convince the council you are a middle ranked leader of the Twilight's Hammer.$b$bSuch a gambit requires a replica of the cult's medallion of station. I can create the medallion, but I will need a large brilliant shard, and crests worn by the Abyssal Templar.$b$bBring these to me and I will do the rest."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '議會公爵', `Objectives` = '帶1大塊魔光裂片和3個深淵紋章給塞納里奧城堡的奧莉爾·金葉。', `Details` = '我們認為應該可能使用一塊風石來伏擊一名深淵議會的公爵。前提是，需要有人通過風石來進行聯繫，並讓公爵確認你是暮光之錘的一名中層人員。$b$b因此我們需要暮光信徒身份勳章的複製品。我可以製作這樣一枚勳章，但是我需要一個大塊魔光裂片，還有深淵聖殿騎士所佩戴的紋章。$b$b把這些帶給我，然後我就可以完成剩下的工作了。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8332;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "攻勢", Title AC enUS : "Aggression" ; Wowhead enUS : "Aggression",  OLD Objectives : "殺死7只樹人嫩苗和7只兇猛的樹人嫩苗，然後向逐日島的蘭薩恩·派雷隆覆命。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill 7 Tenders and 7 Feral Tenders, and then return to Lanthan Perilon on Sunstrider Isle." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill 7 Tenders and 7 Feral Tenders, and then return to Lanthan Perilon on Sunstrider Isle.",  OLD Details : "在派你進入學院之前，我還另外有件任務要你立刻處理。儘管這群兇暴的樹人嫩苗過去曾是我們逐日島上園丁們的好夥伴，可現在它們卻已經失去了控制。你要迅速將它們全部清除。不過你也要小心，失去控制以後，它們已經變得更加具有攻擊性。這樣的情況下，除了殺死它們，我們已經沒有其它辦法來清除這些曾經溫順的僕從了。$B$B向你下達這樣的命令，我感到很難過，但生存的需要大於一切。我以後會為它們哀悼的。", Details AC enUS : "Before sending you to the Academy, I want you on another task that needs to be dealt with immediately.  Once used to aid us in the gardening of Sunstrider Isle, the bestial tenders now have grown out of our control.  Clear them out with due haste, but be warned - their lack of control has made them aggressive.  It is such aggression that forces us to put down these once-gentle servants.$B$BIt doesn't please me to ask you to do such a task, but survival is survival.  I'll mourn later." ; Wowhead enUS : "Before sending you to the Academy, I want you on another task that needs to be dealt with immediately. Once used to aid us in the gardening of Sunstrider Isle, the bestial tenders now have grown out of our control. Clear them out with due haste, but be warned - their lack of control has made them aggressive. It is such aggression that forces us to put down these once-gentle servants.$b$bIt doesn't please me to ask you to do such a task, but survival is survival. I'll mourn later.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Tender slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Feral Tender slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '侵略', `Objectives` = '殺死7個看管者和7個野生看管者，再回到逐日者之島的蘭深·佩瑞隆那裡。', `Details` = '在把你送到學校之前，我要你先立刻解決另一個任務。曾經幫助我們管理逐日者之島園藝的那些人都失控了。儘速處理掉他們，但是記住 - 他們已變得很有侵略性。就是這樣的侵略性讓我們不得不快點消滅這些曾經溫和的僕人們。$b$b我也不願意要你接下這個任務，但是為了生存逼不得已。我會為他們哀悼的。', `Objectivetext1` = '看管者 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '野獸管理者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8334;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "放逐者菲倫德雷", Title AC enUS : "Felendren the Banished" ; Wowhead enUS : "Felendren the Banished",  OLD Objectives : "殺死8只奧術怨靈和2只被污染的奧術怨靈，以及放逐者菲倫德雷，他們位於法瑟林學院。將菲倫德雷的徽記交給逐日島的蘭薩恩·派雷隆。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill 8 Arcane Wraiths and 2 Tainted Arcane Wraiths, as well as Felendren the Banished; they are located in the Falthrien Academy.  Bring Felendren's Head to Lanthan Perilon on Sunstrider Isle." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill 8 Arcane Wraiths and 2 Tainted Arcane Wraiths, as well as Felendren the Banished; they are located in the Falthrien Academy.  Bring Felendren's Head to Lanthan Perilon on Sunstrider Isle.",  OLD Details : "西南方法瑟林學院的頂部住著一個背叛了我們的傢伙。$B$B他名叫菲倫德雷，因為藐視導師與長老們的警告而被放逐出了血精靈的土地。他是我們社會中的一顆毒瘤，如今已經只為滿足其自身貪得無厭的魔癮而活著。他拒絕學習控制魔癮的方法，於是現在成為了一具行屍走肉，成為了一個失心者，並威脅著太陽之塔的安全。$B$B給予他人道的毀滅吧，同時也記得殺死那些被他當作僕從的奧術怨靈。", Details AC enUS : "A betrayer of our people resides atop Falthrien Academy to the southwest.$B$BFelendren is his name, and he was banished from blood elf lands for failing to heed the warnings of our teachers and elders.  He is the worst of our society, as he lives only to feed his insatiable magical addictions.  He refused to learn control; he is a shell of his former self - one of the Wretched - and he is a threat to the Sunspire.$B$BDestroy him and the wraiths he uses as minions." ; Wowhead enUS : "A betrayer of our people resides atop Falthrien Academy to the southwest.$b$bFelendren is his name, and he was banished from blood elf lands for failing to heed the warnings of our teachers and elders. He is the worst of our society, as he lives only to feed his insatiable magical addictions. He refused to learn control; he is a shell of his former self - one of the Wretched - and he is a threat to the Sunspire.$b$bDestroy him and the wraiths he uses as minions.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Arcane Wraith slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Tainted Arcane Wraith slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '被流放的法蘭德倫', `Objectives` = '殺死8個秘法怨靈、2個腐敗的秘法怨靈和被流放的法蘭德倫;他們就在法薩瑞安學院裡面。將法蘭德倫的頭顱帶給逐日者之島的蘭深·佩瑞隆。', `Details` = '我們之中有個背叛者住在西南邊的法薩瑞安學院頂端。$b$b法薩瑞安是他的名字，因為不聽我們的教師與長者的話，被趕出血精靈的土地。他是我們社會的害群之馬，因為他只知道滿足自己的魔法慾望。他不學習控制;是舊時自我的軀殼 - 鄙惡者之中的一員 - 他也是日尖塔的一個威脅。$b$b殺了他和他奴役的秘法怨靈。', `Objectivetext1` = '秘法怨靈 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '腐敗的秘法怨靈 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8335;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "奧術薄片", Title AC enUS : "A Fistful of Slivers" ; Wowhead enUS : "A Fistful of Slivers",  OLD Objectives : "從逐日島上的任意使用魔法的生物身上收集6塊奧術薄片，把它們交給奧術師伊塔納斯。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 6 Arcane Slivers from any creature on the isle that uses mana, and then return to Arcanist Ithanas on Sunstrider Isle." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 6 Arcane Slivers from any creature on the isle that uses mana, and then return to Arcanist Ithanas on Sunstrider Isle.",  OLD Details : "我們失去了對島嶼上許多生物的控制，這真是太糟糕了。這裡曾是一片無比寧靜和諧的地方，最適合學習與研究了。可是現在，我們整天都把時間浪費在防備那些原本是被我們圈養的生物上！$B$B我現在將給你一個難得的機會，你只需要幫我做一些收集工作，我就可以幫你施展一個小魔法做為報酬。你可以在逐日島上所有使用魔法的生物身上找到一種名叫奧術薄片的東西，給我帶一打那玩意回來，完成之後，我會在你身上施放一個小法術，這樣你就能更好地在島上冒險了。", Details AC enUS : "It's a shame that we've lost control of many of the creatures here on the island.  This was once a tranquil place of study and research.  Now it's all we can do to keep from being attacked by our own creations!$B$BI'm going to offer you a chance to receive a magical boon in exchange for some collecting work on your part.  Bring me a stack of arcane slivers that are found on the mana-using creatures of Sunstrider Isle, and I will cast a spell on you that should aid your adventures on the isle." ; Wowhead enUS : "It's a shame that we've lost control of many of the creatures here on the island. This was once a tranquil place of study and research. Now it's all we can do to keep from being attacked by our own creations!$b$bI'm going to offer you a chance to receive a magical boon in exchange for some collecting work on your part. Bring me a stack of arcane slivers that are found on the mana-using creatures of Sunstrider Isle, and I will cast a spell on you that should aid your adventures on the isle."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '一把稜片', `Objectives` = '從島上任何使用法力的生物身上收集6個秘法稜片，再回到逐日者之島的秘法師艾薩納斯那裡。', `Details` = '很遺憾我們失去了島上許多生物的掌控權。這裡曾是適合讀書研究的安寧之地。現在我們只能盡力避免被我們自己的創造物攻擊!$b$b我要提供你一個獲得魔法利益的機會，只要你完成一些收集的工作就好。幫我從逐日者之島上使用魔法的生物那裡帶回來一堆秘法稜片，我就會在你身上施法，對你以後在島上的冒險很有助益。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8336;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "被污染的奧術薄片", Title AC enUS : "Tainted Arcane Sliver" ; Wowhead enUS : "Tainted Arcane Sliver",  OLD Objectives : "將被污染的奧術薄片交給逐日島的太陽之塔露臺上的奧術師赫裡恩。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring the Tainted Arcane Sliver to Arcanist Helion at the gazebo of the Sunspire on Sunstrider Isle." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the Tainted Arcane Sliver to Arcanist Helion at the gazebo of the Sunspire on Sunstrider Isle.",  OLD Details : "你在這只被污染的奧術怨靈的屍體旁發現了一塊古怪的薄片，它已經被魔法結晶化了。這塊薄片與你見過的其它奧術薄片有著明顯的不同，散發著黑暗與邪惡的氣息，正如怨靈一般。只是拿著它，你就感覺到了某種非自然的邪惡預兆。$B$B太陽之塔露臺旁的奧術師赫裡恩或許能對這塊薄片進行一些研究。", Details AC enUS : "You've found an odd sliver of crystallized mana on the corpse of the tainted arcane wraith.  The sliver is different than others you may have seen in that it is as dark and sinister-looking as the wraith you looted it from.  Just holding it gives you a sense of unnatural foreboding.$B$BArcanist Helion at the gazebo of the Sunspire on Sunstrider Isle just might be someone who would have a use for the sliver." ; Wowhead enUS : "You've found an odd sliver of crystallized mana on the corpse of the tainted arcane wraith. The sliver is different than others you may have seen in that it is as dark and sinister-looking as the wraith you looted it from. Just holding it gives you a sense of unnatural foreboding.$b$bArcanist Helion at the gazebo of the Sunspire on Sunstrider Isle just might be someone who would have a use for the sliver."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '腐敗的秘法稜片', `Objectives` = '將腐敗的秘法稜片帶到逐日者之島給日尖塔瞭望台的秘法師海利恩。', `Details` = '你在腐敗的秘法怨靈屍體上找到一個奇怪的晶化法力稜片。這個稜片和其他你看過的很不一樣，它又黑又邪惡的樣子和你拾取的鬼魂一個樣。握著它讓你有一種不自然的不詳預感。$b$b逐日者之島上的日尖塔有個瞭望台，這個稜片可能對裡面的秘法師海利恩有所用途。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8338;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "議會的領主", Title AC enUS : "Lords of the Council" ; Wowhead enUS : "Lords of the Council",  OLD Objectives : "把5個大塊魔光碎片和3個深淵徽記交給塞納裡奧要塞的奧蕾爾·金葉。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 5 Large Brilliant Shards and 3 Abyssal Signets to Aurel Goldleaf in Cenarion Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 5 Large Brilliant Shards and 3 Abyssal Signets to Aurel Goldleaf in Cenarion Hold.",  OLD Details : "深淵議會的高階領主只有通過更大的風石才能召喚出來，而只有最高等級的暮光之錘官員才可以和他們說話。不過……我找到了進一步偽裝你並欺騙深淵領主的方法！$B$B我們要偽造一枚只有他們教派中最高級別的成員才擁有的暮光貴族之戒。如果你可以帶給我大塊魔光碎片和深淵徽記的話，我就可以幫你製作一個。", Details AC enUS : "Lords of the Abyssal Council can only be summoned through the greater wind stones, and only the top ranking members of the Twilight's Council may speak to them.  But... I have found a way to upgrade your disguise and fool the Abyssal Lords!$B$BThe disguise calls for a ring of lordship, worn only by the highest members of the cult.  I will craft one for you if you can bring me large brilliant shards and abyssal signets." ; Wowhead enUS : "Lords of the Abyssal Council can only be summoned through the greater wind stones, and only the top ranking members of the Twilight's Council may speak to them. But... I have found a way to upgrade your disguise and fool the Abyssal Lords!$b$bThe disguise calls for a ring of lordship, worn only by the highest members of the cult. I will craft one for you if you can bring me large brilliant shards and abyssal signets."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '議會領主', `Objectives` = '帶5塊大而豔麗的裂片和3個深淵羽飾給塞納里奧城堡的奧莉爾·金葉。', `Details` = '深淵議會的高階領主只有通過更大的風石才能召喚出來，而只有最高等級的暮光之錘官員才可以和他們說話。不過……我找到了進一步偽裝你並欺騙深淵領主的方法!$b$b我們要偽造一枚只有他們教派中最高級別的成員才擁有的暮光貴族之戒。如果你可以帶給我大塊魔光裂片和深淵徽記的話，我就可以幫你製作一個。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8341;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "與塞納裡奧要塞的奧蕾爾·金葉談一談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Aurel Goldleaf in Cenarion Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Aurel Goldleaf in Cenarion Hold.",  OLD Details : "$N，奧蕾爾·金葉認為她找到了一種召喚並擊敗深淵議會成員的方法！這樣的任務是十分危險的，但是你已經贏得了塞納裡奧議會極大的尊重。如果有人可以完成這項任務，那麼這個人無疑就是你。$B$B祝你好運，$N。當你準備好之後就去和奧蕾爾談談。", Details AC enUS : "$N, Aurel Goldleaf thinks she's found a way to summon and defeat a ruling member of the Abyssal Council!  Such a task will be dangerous, but you have earned great respect amongst the Cenarion Circle.  We know that if anyone can do it, you can.$B$BMay fortune go with you, $N.  Speak with Aurel when you are ready." ; Wowhead enUS : "$n, Aurel Goldleaf thinks she's found a way to summon and defeat a ruling member of the Abyssal Council! Such a task will be dangerous, but you have earned great respect amongst the Cenarion Circle. We know that if anyone can do it, you can.$b$bMay fortune go with you, $n. Speak with Aurel when you are ready."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '與塞納里奧城堡的奧莉爾·金葉談話。', `Details` = '$n，奧莉爾·金葉認為她找到了一種召喚並擊敗深淵議會成員的方法!這樣的任務是十分危險的，但是你已經贏得了塞納里奧議會極大的尊重。如果有人可以完成這項任務，那麼這個人無疑就是你。$b$b祝你好運，$n。當你準備好之後就去和奧莉爾談話。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8343;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "力量之源", Title AC enUS : "Windows to the Source" ; Wowhead enUS : "Windows to the Source",  OLD Objectives : "給逐日島的太陽之塔中的召喚者泰里拉倫帶回4份怨靈精華以及1份被污染的怨靈精華。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 4 Wraith Essences and 1 Tainted Wraith Essence to Summoner Teli'Larien at the Sunspire on Sunstrider Isle." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 4 Wraith Essences and 1 Tainted Wraith Essence to Summoner Teli'Larien at the Sunspire on Sunstrider Isle.",  OLD Details : "記住我說的話，年輕的$n，這座島嶼已經被嚴重污染了，這種污染的威脅比起天災軍團留下的餘孽還要大。$B$B我確信，這片島嶼上應該有真正的惡魔存在。$B$B就在這裡西面的法瑟林學院，滋生著大量的奧術怨靈，它們就是一個能讓我們接觸到惡魔力量之源的視窗。你現在的任務就是給我帶回一些未被污染的怨靈精華，以及一些被污染的怨靈精華。$B$B作為給你的報酬，我會教你如何召喚小鬼，它將成為你所擁有的第一個惡魔僕從。", Details AC enUS : "Heed my words, young one - there is a taint about this island, and it is far more potent than the remnants of the Scourge.$B$BI believe there is a true demonic presence on the isle.$B$BWest of here are the spires of Falthrien Academy.  The arcane wraiths that infest it are a window to the source of demonic power.  You are to bring me the essences of tainted and untainted wraiths.$B$BIn exchange for your obedience, I'll teach you how to summon an imp companion - your first of many as a warlock." ; Wowhead enUS : "Heed my words, young one - there is a taint about this island, and it is far more potent than the remnants of the Scourge.$b$bI believe there is a true demonic presence on the isle.$b$bWest of here are the spires of Falthrien Academy. The arcane wraiths that infest it are a window to the source of demonic power. You are to bring me the essences of tainted and untainted wraiths.$b$bIn exchange for your obedience, I'll teach you how to summon an imp companion - your first of many as a warlock."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '源頭的窗口', `Objectives` = '將4份怨靈精華和1份腐壞的怨靈精華帶到逐日者之島給日尖塔的召喚者泰利拉。', `Details` = '記住我的話，年輕人 – 這座島受到汙染，而且比天譴軍團的殘留力量更有影響力。$b$b我相信這島上有一種真正的惡魔存在。$b$b西方是法薩瑞安學院的尖塔。出沒那裡的秘法怨靈是惡魔力量來源的窗口。你要幫我把腐壞及未腐壞的怨靈精華都帶來。$b$b如果你照做，我會教你如何召喚一個小鬼 – 你身為術士的第一個小鬼。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8344;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "達斯雷瑪的神龕", Title AC enUS : "The Shrine of Dath'Remar" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Shrine of Dath'Remar",  OLD Objectives : "閱讀達斯雷瑪的神龕上的銘文之後，向逐日島太陽之塔上的護井者索蘭尼亞覆命。", Objectives AC enUS : "Read the plaque on the Shrine of Dath'Remar and then return to Well Watcher Solanian at the Sunspire on Sunstrider Isle." ; Wowhead enUS : "Read the plaque on the Shrine of Dath'Remar and then return to Well Watcher Solanian at the Sunspire on Sunstrider Isle.",  OLD Details : "日復一日，我矗立在這裡，觀察著，思索著，等待著。當我極目遠眺著海平線時，有許多人指責我只會緬懷過去的日子，無法自拔。但我仍然堅定地認為，每一位來到這座島嶼的訪客都應紀念那些曾為我們的生存而付出並犧牲一切的人。$B$B達斯雷瑪·逐日者是我們的第一任國王。他領導著我們穿越了大漩渦，從卡利姆多來到這裡。$B$B去西邊尋找他的神龕吧，閱讀了上面的紀念銘文之後再回來找我。", Details AC enUS : "Day after day I stand here, watching, waiting.  I've been accused of dwelling too much on our past, while my eyes look to the horizon.  But it is my firm belief that each visitor to this island should honor those who have sacrificed all so that they may continue to do so.$B$BDath'Remar Sunstrider was our first king.  He led us here from Kalimdor through the Maelstrom.$B$BSeek out his shrine to the west and do not return to me until you have read the plaque upon it in his honor." ; Wowhead enUS : "Day after day I stand here, watching, waiting. I've been accused of dwelling too much on our past, while my eyes look to the horizon. But it is my firm belief that each visitor to this island should honor those who have sacrificed all so that they may continue to do so.$b$bDath'Remar Sunstrider was our first king. He led us here from Kalimdor through the Maelstrom.$b$bSeek out his shrine to the west and do not return to me until you have read the plaque upon it in his honor."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '達斯雷瑪神殿', `Objectives` = '閱讀達斯雷瑪神殿上的銘文再回到逐日者之島找日尖塔的看井者索蘭尼亞。', `Details` = '我日復一日站在這觀看，等待。我曾被指責太過沉溺於過去，當我注視著地平線時。但我堅定的相信，每一個到此拜訪的人都該尊敬那些犧牲所有的人，這樣他們才會持續下去。$b$b逐日者達斯雷瑪是我們第一個王。他帶領著我們自卡林多穿越大漩渦來到這裡。$b$b往西方尋找他的神殿，並閱讀神殿中的銘文後再回來找我。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8345;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "無盡的渴求", Title AC enUS : "Thirst Unending" ; Wowhead enUS : "Thirst Unending",  OLD Objectives : "對一條法力浮龍使用種族特長技能“奧術洪流”，然後向奧術師赫裡恩覆命。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use your Arcane Torrent racial ability on a Mana Wyrm, then return to Arcanist Helion." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use your Arcane Torrent racial ability on a Mana Wyrm, then return to Arcanist Helion.",  OLD Details : "如果說你在逐日島學到的最重要一課是什麼，那無疑就是如何控制你對魔法的渴求了。血精靈對魔法的渴求是一種無止境的渴求，$N，你所吸收的能量必須完全處於你的掌控之中，並且通過奧術洪流將能量釋放出去。如果你失敗了的話，就將變成一個失心者……變成一個在絕望與瘋狂中苟活的癮君子。$B$B去島上尋找一條法力浮龍，對它使用奧術洪流技能吧。學會掌握欲望所生成的力量。當你學會如何釋放這種力量之後，回來找我。", Details AC enUS : "If there is only one lesson you deign to remember from your time on Sunstrider Isle, let it be this - control your thirst for magic.  It is a thirst unending, $N - what you absorb must be controlled and released via Arcane Torrent.  Failure is to become one of the Wretched... hopelessly addicted and insane.$B$BSeek out a mana wyrm and unleash your Arcane Torrent upon it.  Learn to master your power. When you have sufficiently released an Arcane Torrent, return to me." ; Wowhead enUS : "If there is only one lesson you deign to remember from your time on Sunstrider Isle, let it be this - control your thirst for magic. It is a thirst unending, $n - what you absorb must be controlled and released via Arcane Torrent. Failure is to become one of the Wretched... hopelessly addicted and insane.$b$bSeek out a mana wyrm and unleash your Arcane Torrent upon it. Learn to master your power. When you have sufficiently released an Arcane Torrent, return to me.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "釋放奧流之術", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Arcane Torrent unleashed" ; Wowhead enUS : "Mana Tap creature"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '止不了的渴', `Objectives` = '對有法力的生物使用你的法力吸取種族特長6次，再回到秘法師海利恩那裡。', `Details` = '如果你在逐日者之島只能學會一件事，那就學會這件事吧 - 控制你對魔法的渴望。這是止不了的渴，$n - 你一定要透過法力吸取吸收能量才能生存，而你務必要控制自己透過秘法洪流釋放魔法的情況。失敗就會成為失落者其中之一……無助地上癮發狂。$b$b尋找島上有魔法的生物並汲取他們的法力。試著控制你對能量的渴望。當你吸飽足夠的能量後再回來找我。', `Objectivetext1` = '吸取生物法力', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8346;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "幫助信使", Title AC enUS : "Aiding the Outrunners" ; Wowhead enUS : "Aiding the Outrunners",  OLD Objectives : "與逐日島南部橋樑旁的信使奧拉莉恩談一談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Outrunner Alarion near the bridge leading south of Sunstrider Isle." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Outrunner Alarion near the bridge leading south of Sunstrider Isle.",  OLD Details : "魔導師艾洛娜要求你立刻轉至銀月城，以協助我們在那裡的收復行動……這也意味著，她承認你已經成功地解決了法瑟林學院方面的問題。你沒有讓我們失望，$N。$B$B在你轉至南面的鷹翼廣場的路上，或許你應該停下來和信使奧拉莉恩談談，她就在橋的邊上。$B$B信使們負責這裡與大陸之間的交通運輸工作，鑒於你是這樣的足智多謀，他們或許會需要你的説明。", Details AC enUS : "Magistrix Erona wanted you to head over to Silvermoon City in order to aid our reclamation efforts there... that is, once you had successfully addressed the situation at Falthrien Academy.  You did not disappoint us, $N.$B$BOn your way to Falconwing Square, south of here, you should speak with Outrunner Alarion.  She's not far from the bridge.$B$BThe Outrunners take care of shuttling goods between here and the mainland, and since you've proven to be so resourceful, they could use your assistance." ; Wowhead enUS : "Magistrix Erona wanted you to head over to Silvermoon City in order to aid our reclamation efforts there... that is, once you had successfully addressed the situation at Falthrien Academy. You did not disappoint us, $n.$b$bOn your way to Falconwing Square, south of here, you should speak with Outrunner Alarion. She's not far from the bridge.$b$bThe Outrunners take care of shuttling goods between here and the mainland, and since you've proven to be so resourceful, they could use your assistance."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '幫助先驅者', `Objectives` = '和先驅者艾拉瑞恩談談，她就在往南方逐日者之島的橋附近。', `Details` = '博學者伊羅娜要你前往銀月城幫助我們開墾那裡…當然，前提是你要先成功地解決法薩瑞安學院的情況。你沒有讓我們失望，$n。$b$b在你往南邊獵鷹之翼廣場的路上，你該與先驅者艾拉瑞恩談談。她就在離橋不遠的地方。$b$b先驅者負責處理大陸和這裡的貨物往來，既然你已證明了自己的機智，他們或許需要你的幫助。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8347;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將深淵徽記交給塞納裡奧要塞的霍姆·蠻鬃。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring the Abyssal Signet to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the Abyssal Signet to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold.",  OLD Details : "霍姆告訴我說你知道召喚深淵公爵的方法了！真是件了不起的事兒。$B$B還有什麼能稱得上是了不起的成就呢？打扁這些傢伙。如果你明白我在說什麼，你就該知道這會對他們的屬下帶來多大的衝擊。把他們的徽記帶回來作為證據。", Details AC enUS : "Huum tells me you've figured out how to summon the Abyssal Dukes!  That's quite an accomplishment.$B$BYou know what else would be quite the accomplishment?  Smashing up one of those things really good.  That'll cause an impression on their underlings, if you know what I mean.  Bring back its signet as proof of the deed." ; Wowhead enUS : "Huum tells me you've figured out how to summon the Abyssal Dukes! That's quite an accomplishment.$b$bYou know what else would be quite the accomplishment? Smashing up one of those things really good. That'll cause an impression on their underlings, if you know what I mean. Bring back its signet as proof of the deed."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把深淵徽記帶給塞納里奧城堡的鮑爾·蠻鬃。', `Details` = '胡姆告訴我說你知道召喚深淵公爵的方法了!真是件了不起的事兒。$b$b還有什麼能稱得上是了不起的成就呢?打扁這些傢伙。如果你明白我在說什麼，你就該知道這會對他們的屬下帶來多大的衝擊。把他們的徽記帶回來作為證據。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8348;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "與塞納裡奧要塞的鮑爾·蠻鬃談一談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold.",  OLD Details : "現在你有了勳章，並可以召喚深淵公爵，去和鮑爾·蠻鬃談談吧。他會派你去對付深淵議會。$B$B祝你好運，$N。如果你需要更多的勳章，那麼就來找我吧。", Details AC enUS : "Now that you have a medallion and can summon an Abyssal Duke, speak with Bor Wildmane.  He will set you on a task against the Abyssal Council.$B$BGood luck, $N.  And if you ever need more medallions, return to me." ; Wowhead enUS : "Now that you have a medallion and can summon an Abyssal Duke, speak with Bor Wildmane. He will set you on a task against the Abyssal Council.$b$bGood luck, $n. And if you ever need more medallions, return to me."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '與在塞納里奧城堡的鮑爾·蠻鬃談話。', `Details` = '現在你有了勳章，並可以召喚深淵公爵，去和鮑爾·蠻鬃談談吧。他會派你去對付深淵議會。$b$b祝你好運，$n。如果你需要更多的勳章，那麼就來找我吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8349;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "送信", Title AC enUS : "Completing the Delivery" ; Wowhead enUS : "Completing the Delivery",  OLD Objectives : "將艾洛娜的包裹交給永歌森林鷹翼廣場旅店中的旅店老闆德蘭妮爾。", Objectives AC enUS : "Deliver Erona's Package to Innkeeper Delaniel inside the inn at Falconwing Square in Eversong Woods." ; Wowhead enUS : "Deliver Erona's Package to Innkeeper Delaniel inside the inn at Falconwing Square in Eversong Woods.",  OLD Details : "又一位信使的犧牲……這真是一個悲劇，但早在我們接下這份工作的時候，就已經有犧牲的覺悟了。太陽之塔的魔導師艾洛娜希望我們把這只包裹運送到鷹翼廣場的旅店去，越快越好。$B$B但當前我們缺乏人手，我已經沒有任何同伴可以執行這個任務了。$B$B我不想對你說謊，從這裡通向鷹翼廣場的道路是非常危險的，一但離開黎明之路的安全範圍，就可能隨時遭遇攻擊。你能為我們完成這個任務嗎，$N？", Details AC enUS : "The death of another outrunner is a true tragedy, but it's a risk we all accept when we take the job.  Magistrix Erona at the Sunspire needs to get this package to the inn at Falconwing Square, and she needs it there as soon as possible.$B$BWe're short handed and I don't have anyone else available that can cover for us.$B$BI'm not going to lie to you; the path to Falconwing Square can be extremely dangerous if you leave the safety of Dawning Lane.  Do you feel up to the task, $N?" ; Wowhead enUS : "The death of another outrunner is a true tragedy, but it's a risk we all accept when we take the job. Magistrix Erona at the Sunspire needs to get this package to the inn at Falconwing Square, and she needs it there as soon as possible.$b$bWe're short handed and I don't have anyone else available that can cover for us.$b$bI'm not going to lie to you; the path to Falconwing Square can be extremely dangerous if you leave the safety of Dawning Lane. Do you feel up to the task, $n?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '完成遞送', `Objectives` = '將伊羅娜的包裹送到永歌森林給獵鷹之翼廣場的旅店主人德拉尼歐。', `Details` = '又一個先驅者之死真是悲劇，但當我們接受任務時也接受了風險。日尖塔的博學者伊羅娜需要將這個包裹拿到獵鷹之翼廣場的旅店，並且越快越好。$b$b我們現在人手短缺，沒有人能掩護我們。$b$b我不騙你;如果你離開了安全的黎明小路，通往獵鷹之翼廣場的路會非常危險。你覺得你可以勝任嗎，$n?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8350;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "與鮑爾談話", Title AC enUS : "Bor Wishes to Speak" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bor Wishes to Speak",  OLD Objectives : "與塞納裡奧要塞的鮑爾·蠻鬃談一談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold.",  OLD Details : "現在你可以偽裝成暮光議會的成員了，我想鮑爾·蠻鬃一定想跟你談談。去見他吧，準備接受一項艱巨的任務……", Details AC enUS : "Now that you can disguise yourself as a ruling member of the Twilight Council, I am certain Bor Wildmane will want to speak with you.  Go see him, and prepare yourself for a very difficult mission..." ; Wowhead enUS : "Now that you can disguise yourself as a ruling member of the Twilight Council, I am certain Bor Wildmane will want to speak with you. Go see him, and prepare yourself for a very difficult mission..."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '伯爾想說話', `Objectives` = '與在塞納里奧城堡的鮑爾·蠻鬃談話。', `Details` = '現在你可以偽裝成暮光議會的成員了，我想鮑爾·蠻鬃一定想跟你談談。去見他吧，準備接受一項艱鉅的任務……', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8351;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "議會的節杖", Title AC enUS : "Scepter of the Council" ; Wowhead enUS : "Scepter of the Council",  OLD Objectives : "將一柄深淵節杖交給塞納裡奧要塞的鮑爾·蠻鬃。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring an Abyssal Scepter to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring an Abyssal Scepter to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold.",  OLD Details : "霍姆和我剛才還談起你呢。他說你已經準備好跟深淵領主作戰了！$B$B我必須告訴你，這是一項非常危險的任務。你最好叫上支持人員。我並不是讓你帶上一兩個朋友，你需要的是一支做好充分的戰鬥準備的精英團隊。如果你的朋友跟你一樣出色，你們或許能打敗他！$B$B如果你打敗了深淵領主，和往常一樣，向我出示證據，我就會給你豐厚的獎勵。", Details AC enUS : "Huum and I were just talking about you.  He tells me you're just about ready to try your hand at fighting an Abyssal Lord!$B$BI must tell you this is a very dangerous endeavor.  You'd better bring backup.  And I don't mean one or two of your friends, I'm talking about a top-notch, battle-ready fighting force.  If your friends are as good as you, you might even defeat it!$B$BIf you do - and I'll want evidence, as always - I'll give you a truly great reward." ; Wowhead enUS : "Huum and I were just talking about you. He tells me you're just about ready to try your hand at fighting an Abyssal Lord!$b$bI must tell you this is a very dangerous endeavor. You'd better bring backup. And I don't mean one or two of your friends, I'm talking about a top-notch, battle-ready fighting force. If your friends are as good as you, you might even defeat it!$b$bIf you do - and I'll want evidence, as always - I'll give you a truly great reward."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '議會權杖', `Objectives` = '帶一支深淵權杖給塞納里奧城堡的鮑爾·蠻鬃。', `Details` = '胡姆和我剛才還談起你呢。他說你已經準備好跟深淵領主作戰了!$b$b我必須告訴你，這是一項非常危險的任務。你最好叫上支援人員。我並不是讓你帶上一兩個朋友，你需要的是一支做好充分的戰鬥準備的精英團隊。如果你的朋友跟你一樣出色，你們或許能打敗他!$b$b如果你打敗了深淵領主，和往常一樣，向我出示證據，我就會給你豐厚的獎勵。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8352;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "對旅店老闆火酒模仿小雞的動作並得到一顆鐵爐堡薄荷糖!", Objectives AC enUS : "Do a chicken emote at Innkeeper Firebrew, and in exchange you'll receive an Ironforge Mint!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Do a chicken emote at Innkeeper Firebrew, and in exchange you'll receive an Ironforge Mint!",  OLD Details : "啊，代替小孩玩不給糖就搗蛋是吧?我本來還想說，以四處要糖果的遊戲來講，你的年紀似乎大了點...$B$B好吧，我的糖果是一顆鐵爐堡薄荷糖，你得...你得學小雞咯咯叫!是的，小雞們喜歡薄荷糖...好吧，或許它們不喜歡...但是除非你學小雞叫，否則我不會給你薄荷糖的!$B$B好啦，$c，你到底要不要幹?!想要糖就開始吧!", Details AC enUS : "Ah, trick-or-treating for a sick child, are we?  I was going to say, you're a little old to be rummaging about for candies...$B$BWell, for my treat - an Ironforge Mint - you will need to... cluck like a chicken!  Yes, chickens love mints... well OK, maybe they don't LOVE them... but I won't give you a mint unless you chicken cluck for me!$B$BWell $c, are you up to the challenge or not?!  Time to earn your treat!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Ah, trick-or-treating for a sick child, are we? I was going to say, you're a little old to be rummaging about for candies...$b$bWell, for my treat - an Ironforge Mint - you will need to... cluck like a chicken! Yes, chickens love mints... well OK, maybe they don't LOVE them... but I won't give you a mint unless you chicken cluck for me!$b$bWell $c, are you up to the challenge or not?! Time to earn your treat!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '對旅店老闆火酒模仿小雞的動作並得到一顆鐵爐堡薄荷糖！', `Details` = '啊，跟一個生病的小孩子玩要糖果的惡作劇遊戲是吧？我要說的是，對四處要糖果的遊戲來說，你的年紀似乎大了點……$b$b嗯，我的糖果是一顆鐵爐堡薄荷糖，你得……你得學小雞咯咯叫！是的，小雞們喜歡薄荷糖……好吧，或許它們不喜歡……但是除非你學小雞叫，否則我不會給你薄荷糖的！$b$b好吧，$c，你準備好了沒？！我們開始吧！', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8353;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "對旅店老闆諾曼模仿小雞的動作並得到一顆幽暗城薄荷糖!", Objectives AC enUS : "Do a chicken emote at Innkeeper Norman, and in exchange you'll receive an Undercity Mint!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Do a chicken emote at Innkeeper Norman, and in exchange you'll receive an Undercity Mint!",  OLD Details : "啊，代替小孩玩不給糖就搗蛋是吧?我本來還想說，以四處要糖果的遊戲來講，你的年紀似乎大了點...$B$B好吧，我的糖果是一顆幽暗城薄荷糖，你得...你得學小雞咯咯叫!是的，小雞們喜歡薄荷糖...好吧，或許牠們不喜歡...但是除非你學小雞叫，否則我不會給你薄荷糖的!$B$B好啦，$c，你到底要不要幹?!想要糖就開始吧!", Details AC enUS : "Ah, trick-or-treating for a sick child, are we?  I was going to say, you're a little old to be rummaging about for candies...$B$BWell, for my treat - an Undercity Mint - you will need to... cluck like a chicken!  Yes, chickens love mints... well OK, maybe they don't LOVE them... but I won't give you a mint unless you chicken cluck for me!$B$BWell $c, are you up to the challenge or not?!  Time to earn your treat!$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Ah, trick-or-treating for a sick child, are we? I was going to say, you're a little old to be rummaging about for candies...$b$bWell, for my treat - an Undercity Mint - you will need to... cluck like a chicken! Yes, chickens love mints... well OK, maybe they don't LOVE them... but I won't give you a mint unless you chicken cluck for me!$b$bWell $c, are you up to the challenge or not?! Time to earn your treat!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '對旅店老闆諾曼模仿小雞的動作並得到一顆幽暗城薄荷糖！', `Details` = '啊，跟一個生病的小孩子玩要糖果的惡作劇遊戲是吧？我要說的是，對四處要糖果的遊戲來說，你的年紀似乎大了點……$b$b嗯，我的糖果是一顆幽暗城薄荷糖，你得……你得學小雞咯咯叫！是的，小雞們喜歡薄荷糖……好吧，或許它們不喜歡……但是除非你學小雞叫，否則我不會給你薄荷糖的！$b$b好吧，$c，你準備好了沒？！我們開始吧！', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8354;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "對塔瓦斯德‧基瑟爾做出火車的聲音，並交換你應得的諾姆瑞根橡皮糖!", Objectives AC enUS : "Do a train emote at Talvash del Kissel, and in exchange you'll receive a Gnomeregan Gumdrop!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Do a train emote at Talvash del Kissel, and in exchange you'll receive a Gnomeregan Gumdrop!",  OLD Details : "有人來玩不給糖就搗蛋了!哈哈!$B$B好吧，儘管你做的是為小孩收集糖果的高尚事兒，我還是不能讓你輕易過關。我有一顆諾姆瑞根橡皮糖要送給那個孩子...如果你願意模仿火車聲音的話!哈哈，是的，這就是你要搗的蛋!你要拿到橡皮糖，就得模仿火車的聲音!$B$B恰嘎-恰嘎，$C!", Details AC enUS : "A trick-or-treater!  Huzzah!$B$BWell now, even though you're doing something noble and collecting candies for a sick child, I can't let you off the hook that easily.  I have a yummy Gnomeregan Gumdrop to give to the sick child... if you make a train noise for me!  Haha, yes, that'll be the trick!  The price of this gumdrop is one train noise!$B$BChugga-chugga, $c!" ; Wowhead enUS : "A trick-or-treater! Huzzah!$b$bWell now, even though you're doing something noble and collecting candies for a sick child, I can't let you off the hook that easily. I have a yummy Gnomeregan Gumdrop to give to the sick child... if you make a train noise for me! Haha, yes, that'll be the trick! The price of this gumdrop is one train noise!$b$bChugga-chugga, $c!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '對塔瓦斯德·基瑟爾做出火車的聲音，並交換你應得的諾姆瑞根橡皮軟糖！', `Details` = '要糖果的惡作劇遊戲！哈哈！$b$b即使你正在做什麼高尚的事兒，比如為生病的小孩收集糖果之類的，我也不會輕易放過你。我有一顆諾姆瑞根橡皮糖要送給那個生病的孩子……如果你願意模仿火車聲音的話！哈哈，是的，這就是惡作劇！你要拿到水果糖，就得模仿火車的聲音！$b$b哢哢－嗚嗚，$c！', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8355;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "對旅店老闆奧里森作展示肌肉的動作，並交換你應得的暴風城牛軋糖!", Objectives AC enUS : "Do a flex emote at Innkeeper Allison, and in exchange you'll receive Stormwind Nougat!$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Do a flex emote at Innkeeper Allison, and in exchange you'll receive Stormwind Nougat!",  OLD Details : "你...你的打扮真有趣。即使你有副好心腸，代替一個小孩子玩不給糖就搗蛋的遊戲，我恐怕還是得要求你搗個蛋來給我看看!$B$B讓我想想...你穿的這身衣服...讓你看起來很壯...那你得炫耀一下自己的肌肉!是的，就是現在，炫耀你的肌肉吧，強壯的$g猛男:壯女;$c!$B$B你必須炫耀肌肉，這樣我才會給你美味的暴風城杏仁糖。這可是很棒的萬鬼節的糖果。", Details AC enUS : "That's an... interesting costume you have on.  Even though you're being nice and helping a sick child trick-or-treat this year, I'm afraid I'm going to have to ask you perform a trick for me!$B$BLet's see... you look so strong and buff in that... costume... let's see you flex!  Yes, go on now and flex for me, strong $g man : woman;!$B$BWhen and only when you flex, I'll give you some tasty Stormwind Nougat.  It's a great Hallow's End treat." ; Wowhead enUS : "That's an... interesting costume you have on. Even though you're being nice and helping a sick child trick-or-treat this year, I'm afraid I'm going to have to ask you perform a trick for me!$b$bLet's see... you look so strong and buff in that... costume... let's see you flex! Yes, go on now and flex for me, strong $gman:woman!$b$bWhen and only when you flex, I'll give you some tasty Stormwind Nougat. It's a great Hallow's End treat.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "展示肌肉給旅店老闆奧裡森看", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Flex for Innkeeper Allison" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flex for Innkeeper Allison"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '對旅店老闆奧里森作展示肌肉的動作，並交換你應得的暴風城奶油杏仁花生糖！', `Details` = '你……你的裝束真有趣。即使你心眼好，在陪一個生病的小孩子玩要糖果的惡作劇遊戲，恐怕我還是得要求你做點什麼！$b$b讓我想想……你穿的衣服……看起來非常奇怪……你得炫耀自己的肌肉！是的，就是現在，炫耀你的肌肉吧，強壯的$g男:女$c！$b$b你必須炫耀肌肉，這樣我才會給你美味的暴風城杏仁糖。這可是萬聖節的糖果。', `Objectivetext1` = '展示肌肉給旅店老闆奧里森看', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8356;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "對旅店老闆塞琳尼跳舞，並交換你應得的達納蘇斯杏仁糖!", Objectives AC enUS : "Do a dance emote at Innkeeper Saelienne, and in exchange you'll receive Darnassus Marzipan!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Do a dance emote at Innkeeper Saelienne, and in exchange you'll receive Darnassus Marzipan!",  OLD Details : "儘管你只是在代表一個小孩子玩不給糖就搗蛋的遊戲，你還是得搗個蛋才能換取糖果!傳統習俗可不能被破壞，對吧...$B$B以時價計算的話，我想一顆杏仁糖的代價就是你得跳支舞!是的，讓我看看你的舞技!跳起來吧，那樣我就會給你美味的杏仁糖!", Details AC enUS : "Even though you're trick-or-treating for a sick child, you still need to perform a trick for the treat!  We can't very well change the tradition, now can we...$B$BI believe the cost of a piece of marzipan nowadays is to bust out and DANCE!  That's right, let me see your moves!  Dance for me, and I'll give you some tasty marzipan!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Even though you're trick-or-treating for a sick child, you still need to perform a trick for the treat! We can't very well change the tradition, now can we...$b$bI believe the cost of a piece of marzipan nowadays is to bust out and DANCE! That's right, let me see your moves! Dance for me, and I'll give you some tasty marzipan!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '對旅店老闆塞琳尼跳舞，並交換你應得的達納蘇斯杏仁糖！', `Details` = '即使你在陪一個生病的小孩子玩要糖果的惡作劇遊戲，你也要做點什麼來換取糖果！傳統習俗可不能被破壞……$b$b我想一顆糖果的代價就是你得跳支舞！是的，讓我們看看你的舞姿！跳舞吧，我會給你美味的奶糖的！', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8357;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "對卡利·雷米克做出火車的聲音，並交換你應得的暗矛橡皮糖!", Objectives AC enUS : "Do a train emote at Kali Remik, and in exchange you'll receive a Darkspear Gumdrop!$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Do a train emote at Kali Remik, and in exchange you'll receive a Darkspear Gumdrop!",  OLD Details : "有人來玩不給糖就搗蛋了!好耶，老兄!$B$B好吧，儘管你做的是為小孩收集糖果的高尚事兒，我還是不能讓你輕易過關。我有一顆好吃的暗矛橡皮糖要送給那個孩子...如果你願意模仿火車聲音的話!哈哈，是的，這就是你要搗的蛋!你要拿到橡皮糖，就得模仿火車的聲音!$B$B恰嘎-恰嘎，$C!", Details AC enUS : "A trick-or-treater!  Yeah mon!$B$BWell now, even though you're doing something noble and collecting candies for a sick child, I can't let you off the hook that easily.  I have a yummy Darkspear Gumdrop to give to the sick child... if you make a train noise for me!  Haha, yes, that'll be the trick!  The price of this gumdrop is one train noise!$B$BChugga-chugga, $c!$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "A trick-or-treater! Yeah mon!$b$bWell now, even though you're doing something noble and collecting candies for a sick child, I can't let you off the hook that easily. I have a yummy Darkspear Gumdrop to give to the sick child... if you make a train noise for me! Haha, yes, that'll be the trick! The price of this gumdrop is one train noise!$b$bChugga-chugga, $c!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '對卡利·雷米克做出火車的聲音，並交換你應得的暗矛橡皮軟糖！', `Details` = '要糖果的惡作劇遊戲！哈哈！$b$b即使你正在做什麼高尚的事兒，比如為生病的小孩收集糖果之類的，我也不會輕易放過你。我有一顆暗矛橡皮糖要送給那個生病的孩子……如果你願意模仿火車聲音的話！哈哈，是的，這就是惡作劇！你要拿到水果糖，就得模仿火車的聲音！$b$b哢哢－嗚嗚，$c！', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8358;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "對旅店老闆格雷什卡作展示肌肉的動作，並交換你應得的奧格瑪牛軋糖!", Objectives AC enUS : "Do a flex emote at Innkeeper Gryshka, and in exchange you'll receive Orgrimmar Nougat!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Do a flex emote at Innkeeper Gryshka, and in exchange you'll receive Orgrimmar Nougat!",  OLD Details : "你...你的打扮真有趣。即使你有副好心腸，代替一個小孩子玩不給糖就搗蛋的遊戲，我恐怕還是得要求你搗個蛋來給我看看!$B$B讓我想想...你穿的這身衣服...讓你看起來很壯...那你得炫耀一下自己的肌肉!是的，就是現在，炫耀你的肌肉吧，強壯的$g猛男:壯女;$c!$B$B你必須炫耀肌肉，這樣我才會給你美味的奧格瑪牛軋糖。這可是很棒的萬鬼節糖果。", Details AC enUS : "That's an... interesting costume you have on.  Even though you're being nice and helping a sick child trick-or-treat this year, I'm afraid I'm going to have to ask you perform a trick for me!$B$BLet's see... you look so strong and buff in that... costume... let's see you flex!  Yes, go on now and flex for me, strong $g man : woman;!$B$BWhen and only when you flex, I'll give you some tasty Orgrimmar Nougat.  It's a great Hallow's End treat.$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "That's an... interesting costume you have on. Even though you're being nice and helping a sick child trick-or-treat this year, I'm afraid I'm going to have to ask you perform a trick for me!$b$bLet's see... you look so strong and buff in that... costume... let's see you flex! Yes, go on now and flex for me, strong $gman:woman!$b$bWhen and only when you flex, I'll give you some tasty Orgrimmar Nougat. It's a great Hallow's End treat.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "展示肌肉給旅店老闆格雷什卡看", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Flex for Innkeeper Gryshka" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flex for Innkeeper Gryshka"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '對旅店老闆格雷什卡作展示肌肉的動作，並交換你應得的奧格瑪奶油杏仁花生糖！', `Details` = '你……你的裝束真有趣。即使你心眼好，在陪一個生病的小孩子玩要糖果的惡作劇遊戲，恐怕我還是得要求你做點什麼！$b$b讓我想想……你穿的衣服……看起來非常奇怪……你得炫耀自己的肌肉！是的，就是現在，炫耀你的肌肉吧，強壯的$g男:女$c！$b$b你必須炫耀肌肉，這樣我才會給你美味的奧格瑪軟糖。這可是萬聖節的糖果。', `Objectivetext1` = '向旅店老闆格雷什卡炫耀肌肉', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8359;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "對旅店老闆帕拉跳舞，並交換你應得的雷霆崖杏仁糖!", Objectives AC enUS : "Do a dance emote at Innkeeper Pala, and in exchange you'll receive Thunder Bluff Marzipan!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Do a dance emote at Innkeeper Pala, and in exchange you'll receive Thunder Bluff Marzipan!",  OLD Details : "儘管你只是在代表一個小孩子玩不給糖就搗蛋的遊戲，你還是得搗個蛋才能換取糖果!傳統習俗可不能被破壞，對吧...$B$B以時價計算的話，我想一顆杏仁糖的代價就是你得跳支舞!是的，讓我看看你的舞技!跳起來吧，那樣我就會給你美味的杏仁糖!", Details AC enUS : "Even though you're trick-or-treating for a sick child, you still need to perform a trick for the treat!  We can't very well change the tradition, now can we...$B$BI believe the cost of a piece of marzipan nowadays is to bust out and DANCE!  That's right, let me see your moves!  Dance for me, and I'll give you some tasty marzipan!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Even though you're trick-or-treating for a sick child, you still need to perform a trick for the treat! We can't very well change the tradition, now can we...$b$bI believe the cost of a piece of marzipan nowadays is to bust out and DANCE! That's right, let me see your moves! Dance for me, and I'll give you some tasty marzipan!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '對旅店老闆帕拉跳舞，並交換你應得的雷霆崖杏仁糖！', `Details` = '即使你在陪一個生病的小孩子玩要糖果的惡作劇遊戲，你也要做點什麼來換取糖果！傳統習俗可不能被破壞……$b$b我想一顆糖果的代價就是你得跳支舞！是的，讓我們看看你的舞姿！跳舞吧，我會給你美味的奶糖的！', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8360;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "希利蘇斯塞納裡奧要塞的鮑爾·蠻鬃要求你擊敗一名深淵聖殿騎士，並將一個深淵紋章帶回來作為證明。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bor Wildmane at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to destroy an Abyssal Templar and bring him an Abyssal Crest as proof of the deed." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bor Wildmane at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to destroy an Abyssal Templar and bring him an Abyssal Crest as proof of the deed.",  OLD Details : "我們見過暮光之錘的信徒舉行儀式召喚強大的元素生物。我們不知道這些生物是他們崇拜的物件還是他們準備通過這些生物來和更加強大的力量進行溝通。有一件事是可以肯定的：他們聽從這些元素生物的命令。$B$B我需要你找到一名深淵聖殿騎士，然後擊敗他！擒賊先擒王，當你完成任務之後把證明帶回來。", Details AC enUS : "We've seen the Twilight's Hammer cultists performing rituals to summon powerful elemental nobles.  We don't know if these are the beings the cultists worship or if they act as intermediaries to even more powerful forces.  One thing is for sure: they are receiving orders from these elementals.$B$BI want you to find a way to contact an Abyssal Templar and give it a proper beating!  Nothing throws the troops in disarray like taking out the chain of command.  Bring back proof while you're at it." ; Wowhead enUS : "We've seen the Twilight's Hammer cultists performing rituals to summon powerful elemental nobles. We don't know if these are the beings the cultists worship or if they act as intermediaries to even more powerful forces. One thing is for sure: they are receiving orders from these elementals.$b$bI want you to find a way to contact an Abyssal Templar and give it a proper beating! Nothing throws the troops in disarray like taking out the chain of command. Bring back proof while you're at it."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '在希利蘇斯塞納里奧城堡的鮑爾·蠻鬃希望你能摧毀深淵聖殿騎士並且將深淵紋章作為行動證明帶回去給他。', `Details` = '我們見過暮光之錘的信徒舉行儀式召喚強大的元素生物。我們不知道這些生物是他們崇拜的物件還是他們準備通過這些生物來和更加強大的力量進行溝通。有一件事是可以肯定的:他們聽從這些元素生物的命令。$b$b我需要你找到一名深淵聖殿騎士，然後擊敗他!擒賊先擒王，當你完成任務之後把證明帶回來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8361;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "海盜的帽子！", Title AC enUS : "Pirate Hats Ahoy!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Pirate Hats Ahoy!",  OLD Objectives : "塔納利斯熱砂港的傲慢的店主要你去幫他收集20頂南海海盜帽。", Objectives AC enUS : "Haughty Modiste wants you to collect 20 Southsea Pirate Hats and return them to her at Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris." ; Wowhead enUS : "Haughty Modiste wants you to collect 20 Southsea Pirate Hats and return them to her at Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris.",  OLD Details : "你是公司派來幫忙的？我相信你可以的。聽好了，$c。就如你所知的那樣，我是艾澤拉斯上層社會最頂極服飾的提供者。皇帝和皇后，酋長和他們部落所稱的皇后，他們所有的穿著都由我親自推薦。他們可是為此付出了大價錢，而且他們確實得到了最好的服飾。$B$B接下來就是你該做的。你應該去落帆海灣，無論你用什麼辦法，都要去弄到儘量多的海盜的帽子。你認為你可以完成這個任務嗎？", Details AC enUS : "You're the help the Cartel sent? I suppose you'll do. Listen carefully $c. As you know, I am a procurer of fashionable apparel for the elite of Azerothian society.  Kings and Queens, Warchiefs and, well whatever the Horde calls their queens, all wear what I choose is in style.  And they pay through the nose for it, which is the best part.$B$BSo here's what's going to happen. You head down to Lost Rigger Cove and acquire a lot of pirate hats by whatever means. Do you think you can handle that?" ; Wowhead enUS : "You're the help the Cartel sent? I suppose you'll do. Listen carefully $c. As you know, I am a procurer of fashionable apparel for the elite of Azerothian society. Kings and Queens, Warchiefs and, well whatever the Horde calls their queens, all wear what I choose is in style. And they pay through the nose for it, which is the best part.$b$bSo here's what's going to happen. You head down to Lost Rigger Cove and acquire a lot of pirate hats by whatever means. Do you think you can handle that?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '海賊的帽子!', `Objectives` = '塔納利斯熱砂港的傲慢的店主要你去幫他收集20頂南海海賊帽。', `Details` = '你是公司派來幫忙的?我相信你可以的。聽好了，$c。就如你所知的那樣，我是艾澤拉斯上層社會最頂極服飾的提供者。皇帝和皇后，酋長和他們部落所稱的皇后，他們所有的穿著都由我親自推薦。他們可是為此付出了大價錢，而且他們確實得到了最好的服飾。$b$b接下來就是你該做的。你應該去落帆海灣，無論你用什麼辦法，都要去弄到儘量多的海賊的帽子。你認為你可以完成這個任務嗎?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8365;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "塔納利斯熱砂港的安全主管吉羅姆·比格維茲要你去幹掉10個南海海盜、10個南海劫掠者、10個南海碼頭工人和10個南海流氓。", Objectives AC enUS : "Security Chief Bilgewhizzle of Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris wants you to kill 10 Southsea Pirates, 10 Southsea Freebooters, 10 Southsea Dock Workers and 10 Southsea Swashbucklers." ; Wowhead enUS : "Security Chief Bilgewhizzle of Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris wants you to kill 10 Southsea Pirates, 10 Southsea Freebooters, 10 Southsea Dock Workers and 10 Southsea Swashbucklers.",  OLD Details : "啊！他們想要我完成一個不可能完成的任務！$B$B熱砂港想要我給南海海盜一些教訓。問題是我不能同時在兩個地方；我必須待在這裡守護和平。$B$B最近，那些海盜似乎忘記了熱砂港給他們的保護費。所以我希望你可以代表我去給他們洗洗腦子。$B$B你可以在這裡南邊不遠的落帆海灣找到他們。謝謝你，$N，我欠你的人情！", Details AC enUS : "Argh! They want the impossible from me!$B$BThe Steamwheedle Cartel wants me to teach the Southsea pirates a lesson.  The problem is that I can't be in two places at once; I need to stay here to keep the peace.$B$BOf late, the pirates have been disregarding the protection money that the cartel regularly forks over. So I'd like to temporarily deputize you to go down there and show them what for.$B$BYou'll find them at Lost Rigger Cove, which is not too far to the south.  Thanks $N, I'll owe you one!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Argh! They want the impossible from me!$b$bThe Steamwheedle Cartel wants me to teach the Southsea pirates a lesson. The problem is that I can't be in two places at once; I need to stay here to keep the peace.$b$bOf late, the pirates have been disregarding the protection money that the cartel regularly forks over. So I'd like to temporarily deputize you to go down there and show them what for.$b$bYou'll find them at Lost Rigger Cove, which is not too far to the south. Thanks $n, I'll owe you one!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Southsea Pirate slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Southsea Freebooter slain",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Southsea Dock Worker slain",  OLD Objectivetext4 : "", Objectivetext4 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Southsea Swashbuckler slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '塔納利斯熱砂港的安全主管比格維茲要你去幹掉10個南海海賊、10個南海劫掠者、10個南海碼頭工人和10個南海劍客。', `Details` = '啊!他們想要我完成一個不可能完成的任務!$b$b熱砂企業想要我給南海海賊一些教訓。問題是我不能同時在兩個地方;我必須待在這裏守護和平。$b$b最近，那些海賊似乎忘記了熱砂企業給他們的保護費。所以我希望你可以代表我去給他們洗洗腦子。$b$b你可以在這裏南邊不遠的落帆海灣找到他們。謝謝你，$n，我欠你的人情!', `Objectivetext1` = '南海海賊 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '南海劫掠者 消滅', `Objectivetext3` = '南海碼頭工人 消滅', `Objectivetext4` = '南海劍客 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8366;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在每個戰場上都取得1枚榮譽獎章，並將它們交給任意部落主城或沙塔斯城中的部落戰爭使者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring a Mark of Honor from each battleground to a Horde Warbringer in any Horde capital city or Shattrath." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring a Mark of Honor from each battleground to a Horde Warbringer in any Horde capital city or Shattrath.",  OLD Details : "與聯盟作戰是為部落效勞的莫大榮耀！那些在各條戰線上和聯盟作戰的士兵是我們最偉大的成員。我們要消滅我們的對手，而不是僅僅進行小規模的遭遇戰，我們要打精心準備的大戰。$B$B去每一條戰線上消滅聯盟吧！為了榮耀！為了部落！", Details AC enUS : "Serving the Horde in one of the great battles against the Alliance is a source of great honor!  The few however, that have served the Horde in ALL of our active battlefronts are our truly great fighters.  We shall vanquish our opponents, not by fighting isolated skirmishes, but by waging a well-coordinated war.$B$BGo forth and crush the Alliance on every front!  For Honor!  For the Horde!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Serving the Horde in one of the great battles against the Alliance is a source of great honor! The few however, that have served the Horde in ALL of our active battlefronts are our truly great fighters. We shall vanquish our opponents, not by fighting isolated skirmishes, but by waging a well-coordinated war.$b$bGo forth and crush the Alliance on every front! For Honor! For the Horde!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把1枚奧特蘭克山谷榮譽獎章，1枚阿拉希盆地榮譽獎章，1枚戰歌峽谷榮譽獎章和1枚暴風之眼榮譽獎章交給任何一座部落主城或撒塔斯的部落戰爭使者。', `Details` = '與聯盟作戰是為部落效勞的莫大榮耀!那些在各條戰線上和聯盟作戰的士兵是我們最偉大的成員。我們要消滅我們的對手，而不是僅僅進行小規模的遭遇戰，我們要打精心準備的大戰。$b$b去阿拉希盆地、奧特蘭克山谷、暴風之眼和戰歌峽谷消滅聯盟吧!為了榮耀!為了部落!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8367;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "峽谷中的戰鬥", Title AC enUS : "Battle of Warsong Gulch" ; Wowhead enUS : "Battle of Warsong Gulch",  OLD Details : "我們在戰歌峽谷對銀翼哨兵展開攻勢，這一戰役至關重要。聯盟以保護這片不屬於他們的森林為由，妄圖從部落手中奪取我們最大的伐木場。$B$B別讓他們的妄想成為事實，$N！為了部落，證明你的價值！成功之後再回到我這兒來。", Details AC enUS : "The battle in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels is of great importance.  Under the guise of protecting a forest that doesn't belong to them, the Alliance seeks to deny the Horde one of our largest sources for lumber.$B$BDo not let this happen, $N!  Come back to me with proof of serving the Horde in a worthy manner!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The battle in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels is of great importance. Under the guise of protecting a forest that doesn't belong to them, the Alliance seeks to deny the Horde one of our largest sources for lumber.$b$bDo not let this happen, $n! Come back to me with proof of serving the Horde in a worthy manner!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '峽谷之戰', `Details` = '我們在戰歌峽谷對銀翼哨兵展開攻勢，這一戰役至關重要。聯盟以保護這片不屬於他們的森林為由，妄圖從部落手中奪取我們最大的伐木場。$b$b別讓他們的妄想成為事實，$n！為了部落，證明你的價值！成功之後再回到我這兒來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8368;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把1枚奧特蘭克山谷榮譽獎章交給戰場外的部落戰爭使者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 3 Alterac Valley Marks of Honor to a Horde Warbringer outside the battlegrounds." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 3 Alterac Valley Marks of Honor to a Horde Warbringer outside the battlegrounds.",  OLD Details : "聽好了，$N。不管你以前聽說奧特蘭克山谷的戰鬥進行得怎麼樣，只有一件事情是真的：雷矛探險隊侵入了霜狼的領地。如果有一天我們可以讓聯盟從容地侵佔部落的領地，那麼我將會在那一天蒙羞自殺。出發吧，幹掉入侵者！", Details AC enUS : "Listen up, $N.  No matter what you might have heard about the battle raging in Alterac Valley, one thing remains true: the Stormpike Expedition invaded Frostwolf Territory.  The day we allow the Alliance to invade Horde lands without a forceful response is the day I hang up my axe and live the rest of my life in shame.  Go forth and expel the invaders!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Listen up, $n. No matter what you might have heard about the battle raging in Alterac Valley, one thing remains true: the Stormpike Expedition invaded Frostwolf Territory. The day we allow the Alliance to invade Horde lands without a forceful response is the day I hang up my axe and live the rest of my life in shame. Go forth and expel the invaders!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把3枚奧特蘭克山谷榮譽獎章交給戰場外的部落戰爭使者。', `Details` = '聽好了，$n。不管你以前聽說奧特蘭克山谷的戰鬥進行得怎麼樣，只有一件事情是真的：雷矛探險隊侵入了霜狼的領地。如果有一天我們可以讓聯盟從容地侵佔部落的領地，那麼我將會在那一天蒙羞自殺。出發吧，幹掉入侵者！', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8369;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我們和聯盟的衝突已經上升為一場真正的戰爭，不久之後戰爭就將全面打響。$B$B對於阿拉希盆地的爭奪就是一個很好的開戰理由。要麼就是聯盟佔據它，並用其對付我們；或者就是我們佔據它，然後用來對付聯盟。幫助污染者保持這場資源競賽上的優勢吧，$N！", Details AC enUS : "Our conflict with the Alliance has escalated to a true war.  No longer are false pretenses to enter into battle used or expected by either side at this point.$B$BThe battle for the Arathi Basin is one of resources, plain and simple.  Either the Alliance gets the resources and uses them against us or we get them and use them to keep our war efforts going.  Help the Defilers maintain the flow of resources we need, $N!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Our conflict with the Alliance has escalated to a true war. No longer are false pretenses to enter into battle used or expected by either side at this point.$b$bThe battle for the Arathi Basin is one of resources, plain and simple. Either the Alliance gets the resources and uses them against us or we get them and use them to keep our war efforts going. Help the Defilers maintain the flow of resources we need, $n!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我們和聯盟的衝突已經上升為一場真正的戰爭，不久之後戰爭就將全面打響。$b$b對於阿拉希盆地的爭奪就是一個很好的開戰理由。要麼就是聯盟佔據它，並用其對付我們；或者就是我們佔據它，然後用來對付聯盟。幫助污染者保持這場資源競賽上的優勢吧，$n！', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8370;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在每個戰場上都取得1枚榮譽獎章，並將它們交給任意聯盟主城、達拉然或沙塔斯城中的聯盟準將。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring a Mark of Honor from each battleground to an Alliance Brigadier General in any Alliance Capital City, Dalaran or Shattrath." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring a Mark of Honor from each battleground to an Alliance Brigadier General in any Alliance Capital City, Dalaran or Shattrath.",  OLD Details : "我們並不是在獨自與部落交戰，$g小夥子:小姑娘;。$B$B如果我們可以取得勝利，那麼我們就可以使用部落的資源來在其它的戰場上對抗他們。反之，如果我們輸掉了這場戰爭，那麼在其它的戰場上，部落將會佔有優勢。$B$B聯盟需要更多你這種身經百戰、意志堅定的老兵！$N，當你在所有戰場上都與部落交戰之後再回到我這裡。", Details AC enUS : "We're not fighting isolated battles against the Horde anymore, $g lad:lass;.$B$BVictory in one front means denying the Horde resources they'd use against us in a different battle.  By the same token, abandoning any given battle could give the advantage to our opponent somewhere else around the world.$B$BThe Alliance is in need of more combatants with this sort of worldly understanding... truly seasoned veterans!  $N, come back to me after you've served against the Horde at all of our active battlegrounds." ; Wowhead enUS : "We're not fighting isolated battles against the Horde anymore, $glad:lass.$b$bVictory in one front means denying the Horde resources they'd use against us in a different battle. By the same token, abandoning any given battle could give the advantage to our opponent somewhere else around the world.$b$bThe Alliance is in need of more combatants with this sort of worldly understanding... truly seasoned veterans! $n, come back to me after you've served against the Horde at all of our active battlegrounds."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把1枚奧特蘭克山谷榮譽獎章，1枚阿拉希盆地榮譽獎章，1枚戰歌峽谷榮譽獎章和1枚暴風之眼榮譽獎章交給任何一座聯盟主城或撒塔斯的聯盟准將。', `Details` = '我們不再是獨自與部落交戰，$g小夥子:小姑娘。$b$b如果我們可以取得勝利，那麼我們就可以使用部落的資源來在其他的戰場上對抗他們。反之，如果我們輸掉了這場戰爭，那麼在其他的戰場上，部落將會佔有優勢。$b$b聯盟需要更多你這種身經百戰…意志堅定的老兵!$n，當你在所有戰場上都與部落交戰之後再回到我這裏。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8371;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將3枚戰歌峽谷榮譽獎章交給戰場外的聯盟準將。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 3 Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor to an Alliance Brigadier General outside the battlegrounds." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 3 Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor to an Alliance Brigadier General outside the battlegrounds.",  OLD Details : "銀翼哨兵正在和戰歌前鋒部隊爭奪這片森林。當然，銀翼哨兵保護森林的原因並非只有熱愛大自然這條理由。$B$B灰谷的森林對我們來說是一層天然的戰略屏障，可以抵抗大規模的進攻。如果沒有這片森林的話，阿斯特蘭納很快就會完全暴露在貧瘠之地的攻擊部隊面前。你願意參加對抗戰歌前鋒的戰鬥嗎？為了聯盟！", Details AC enUS : "The Silverwing Sentinels are at war with the Warsong Outriders due to the destruction the Orcs are causing to the forest.  There are, however, more reasons to defend this particular forest than plain love for nature.$B$BThe forest forms a strategic barrier that makes Ashenvale defendable against a large-scale attack.  Without it, Astranaar would last a day or two before being annexed to the Barrens.$B$BDo your part in fighting the Warsong Outriders, $N!  For the Alliance!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Silverwing Sentinels are at war with the Warsong Outriders due to the destruction the Orcs are causing to the forest. There are, however, more reasons to defend this particular forest than plain love for nature.$b$bThe forest forms a strategic barrier that makes Ashenvale defendable against a large-scale attack. Without it, Astranaar would last a day or two before being annexed to the Barrens.$b$bDo your part in fighting the Warsong Outriders, $n! For the Alliance!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將3枚戰歌峽谷榮譽獎章交給戰場外的聯盟准將。', `Details` = '銀翼哨兵正在和戰歌偵查騎兵爭奪這片森林。當然，銀翼哨兵保護森林的原因並非只有熱愛大自然這條理由。$b$b梣谷的森林對我們來說是一層天然的戰略屏障，可以抵抗大規模的進攻。如果沒有這片森林的話，阿斯特蘭納很快就會完全暴露在貧瘠之地的攻擊部隊面前。你願意參加對抗戰歌前鋒的戰鬥嗎？為了聯盟！', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8372;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "使用臭氣彈清潔器來把散落在南海鎮的亡靈臭氣彈處理掉。當任務完成之後，回到南海鎮的哈特曼中士那裡。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use a Stink Bomb Cleaner to remove any Forsaken Stink Bomb that's been dropped on Southshore.  Return to Sergeant Hartman in Southshore when you're done." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use a Stink Bomb Cleaner to remove any Forsaken Stink Bomb that's been dropped on Southshore.  Return to Sergeant Hartman in Southshore when you're done.",  OLD Details : "我對萬聖節最憎恨的一點就是被遺忘者用在南海鎮的臭氣彈。誰知道這些節日慶祝用的東西會搞得這樣臭氣熏天……$B$B在萬聖節期間，使用這個清潔器來把部落的雜碎們丟在村莊裡的臭氣彈處理掉吧。它使用了松木的力量來消除那些難聞的味道。$B$B你是否願意加入清潔南海鎮的行列？我會用萬聖節禮物來作為回報的。", Details AC enUS : "The thing I hate the most about Hallow's End are the stink bombs the Forsaken use on Southshore.  Who knew that celebrating liberation would have to involve such a smelly mess?$B$BDuring Hallow's End, use this cleaner to remove any nasty stink bombs the Horde may drop here in the village.  It uses the power of pine to fight funky smells.$B$BDo your part to keep Southshore clean, and I'll give you some Hallow's End treats I'm sure you'll enjoy.  We have a deal?" ; Wowhead enUS : "The thing I hate the most about Hallow's End are the stink bombs the Forsaken use on Southshore. Who knew that celebrating liberation would have to involve such a smelly mess?$b$bDuring Hallow's End, use this cleaner to remove any nasty stink bombs the Horde may drop here in the village. It uses the power of pine to fight funky smells.$b$bDo your part to keep Southshore clean, and I'll give you some Hallow's End treats I'm sure you'll enjoy. We have a deal?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '使用臭彈清潔器來把散落在南海鎮的被遺忘者臭彈處理掉。當任務完成之後，回到南海鎮的哈特曼中士那裏。', `Details` = '我對萬鬼節最憎恨的一點就是被遺忘者用在南海鎮的臭彈。誰知道這些節日慶祝用的東西會搞得這樣臭氣薰天……$b$b在萬鬼節期間，使用這個清潔器來把部落的雜碎們丟在村莊裏的臭彈處理掉吧。它使用了松木的力量來消除那些難聞的味道。$b$b你是否願意加入清潔南海鎮的行列？我會用萬鬼節禮物來作為回報的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8373;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將3枚阿拉希盆地榮譽獎章交給戰場外的聯盟準將。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 3 Arathi Basin Marks of Honor to an Alliance Brigadier General outside the battlegrounds." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 3 Arathi Basin Marks of Honor to an Alliance Brigadier General outside the battlegrounds.",  OLD Details : "要取得戰爭的勝利，我們要做的並不僅僅是簡單地打敗敵人，勝利的關鍵往往取決於雙方的戰爭資源。$B$B阿拉希盆地蘊藏著大量物資，部落和聯盟都想搶先奪取這些資源。$B$B如果聯盟獲勝，我們的軍隊將獲得大量的劍和矛。如果部落獲勝，這些武器也一樣會被造出來，只不過是由部落的士兵拿在手裡，指著我們！去幫助阿拉希盆地的聯盟吧，$N。", Details AC enUS : "Winning a war is about more than just outsmarting and outfighting your opponent.  Victory often comes down to simply producing more than your enemy.$B$BWhat we have in Arathi Basin is a sizeable supply of resources for whichever side manages to claim it first.$B$BIf the Alliance comes out victorious, it'll mean more swords and pikes for our troops.  If the Horde were to win, those swords and pikes would still get made, they'd just be pointed at us!  Now is the time to help the Alliance in Arathi Basin, $N." ; Wowhead enUS : "Winning a war is about more than just outsmarting and outfighting your opponent. Victory often comes down to simply producing more than your enemy.$b$bWhat we have in Arathi Basin is a sizeable supply of resources for whichever side manages to claim it first.$b$bIf the Alliance comes out victorious, it'll mean more swords and pikes for our troops. If the Horde were to win, those swords and pikes would still get made, they'd just be pointed at us! Now is the time to help the Alliance in Arathi Basin, $n."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將3枚阿拉希盆地榮譽獎章交給戰場外的聯盟准將。', `Details` = '要取得戰爭的勝利，我們要做的並不僅僅是簡單地打敗敵人，勝利的關鍵往往取決於雙方的戰爭資源。$b$b阿拉希盆地蘊藏著大量物資，部落和聯盟都想搶先奪取這些資源。$b$b如果聯盟獲勝，我們的軍隊將獲得大量的劍和矛。如果部落獲勝，這些武器也一樣會被造出來，只不過是由部落的士兵拿在手裏，指著我們!去協助阿拉希盆地的聯盟吧，$n。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8374;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把3枚奧特蘭克山谷榮譽獎章交給戰場外的聯盟準將。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 3 Alterac Valley Marks of Honor to an Alliance Brigadier General outside the battlegrounds." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 3 Alterac Valley Marks of Honor to an Alliance Brigadier General outside the battlegrounds.",  OLD Details : "不要搞錯了，$N。部落認為奧特蘭克山谷是霜狼氏族的領地，這種看法是很正確的。$B$B你看，雷矛探險隊來這裡是為了和平地搜索礦石和遺跡，而霜狼對此的反應卻極其粗暴和不文明，這是聯盟所沒有預想到的。$B$B讓我們為那些被偷襲的勇敢的矮人默哀吧。現在出發，$C，參加奧特蘭克山谷的大戰。為了聯盟！", Details AC enUS : "Make no mistake about it, $N.  The Horde is quite right when they say Alterac Valley is Frostwolf Territory.$B$BYou see, the Stormpike Expedition arrived as peaceful visitors to the area in search of ore and relics.  The Frostwolves reacted with the most brutal and uncivilized act of aggression the Alliance has experienced.$B$BLet us never forget the brave dwarves that perished in that cowardly unannounced attack.  Go now, $c, do your part in the battle for Alterac Valley.  For the Alliance!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Make no mistake about it, $n. The Horde is quite right when they say Alterac Valley is Frostwolf Territory.$b$bYou see, the Stormpike Expedition arrived as peaceful visitors to the area in search of ore and relics. The Frostwolves reacted with the most brutal and uncivilized act of aggression the Alliance has experienced.$b$bLet us never forget the brave dwarves that perished in that cowardly unannounced attack. Go now, $c, do your part in the battle for Alterac Valley. For the Alliance!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把3枚奧特蘭克山谷榮譽獎章交給戰場外的聯盟准將。', `Details` = '不要搞錯了，$n。部落認為奧特蘭克山谷是霜狼氏族的領地，這種看法是很正確的。$b$b你看，雷矛探險隊來這裏是為了和平地搜索礦石和遺跡，而霜狼對此的反應卻極其粗暴和不文明，這是聯盟所沒有預想到的。$b$b讓我們為那些被偷襲的勇敢的矮人默哀吧。現在出發，$c，參加奧特蘭克山谷的大戰。為了聯盟！', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8375;
