-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將3枚戰歌峽谷榮譽獎章交給戰場外的聯盟準將。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 3 Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor to an Alliance Brigadier General outside the battlegrounds." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 3 Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor to an Alliance Brigadier General outside the battlegrounds.",  OLD Details : "銀翼哨兵正在和戰歌前鋒部隊爭奪這片森林。當然，銀翼哨兵保護森林的原因並非只有熱愛大自然這條理由。$B$B灰谷的森林對我們來說是一層天然的戰略屏障，可以抵抗大規模的進攻。如果沒有這片森林的話，阿斯特蘭納很快就會完全暴露在貧瘠之地的攻擊部隊面前。你願意參加對抗戰歌前鋒的戰鬥嗎？為了聯盟！", Details AC enUS : "The Silverwing Sentinels are at war with the Warsong Outriders due to the destruction the Orcs are causing to the forest.  There are, however, more reasons to defend this particular forest than plain love for nature.$B$BThe forest forms a strategic barrier that makes Ashenvale defendable against a large-scale attack.  Without it, Astranaar would last a day or two before being annexed to the Barrens.$B$BDo your part in fighting the Warsong Outriders, $N!  For the Alliance!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Silverwing Sentinels are at war with the Warsong Outriders due to the destruction the Orcs are causing to the forest. There are, however, more reasons to defend this particular forest than plain love for nature.$b$bThe forest forms a strategic barrier that makes Ashenvale defendable against a large-scale attack. Without it, Astranaar would last a day or two before being annexed to the Barrens.$b$bDo your part in fighting the Warsong Outriders, $n! For the Alliance!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將3枚戰歌峽谷榮譽獎章交給戰場外的聯盟准將。', `Details` = '銀翼哨兵正在和戰歌偵查騎兵爭奪這片森林。當然，銀翼哨兵保護森林的原因並非只有熱愛大自然這條理由。$b$b梣谷的森林對我們來說是一層天然的戰略屏障，可以抵抗大規模的進攻。如果沒有這片森林的話，阿斯特蘭納很快就會完全暴露在貧瘠之地的攻擊部隊面前。你願意參加對抗戰歌前鋒的戰鬥嗎？為了聯盟！', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8403;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "向提瑞斯法林地的黑暗召喚者雅恩卡覆命。", Objectives AC enUS : "Return to Darkcaller Yanka at the Wickerman Festival in Tirisfal Glade." ; Wowhead enUS : "Return to Darkcaller Yanka at the Wickerman Festival in Tirisfal Glade.",  OLD Details : "腐爛的蛋已經被放進了桶裡。以後南海鎮旅館出產的酒肯定都是次品了！$B$B你現在應該回提瑞斯法林地向黑暗召喚者雅恩卡報告你的成功。", Details AC enUS : "The rotten eggs have been successfully placed inside the keg.  Future batches of ale from the Southshore Inn are sure to be ruined!$B$BYou should now report back to Darkcaller Yanka at the Wickerman Festival in Tirisfal Glade and report your success." ; Wowhead enUS : "The rotten eggs have been successfully placed inside the keg. Future batches of ale from the Southshore Inn are sure to be ruined!$b$bYou should now report back to Darkcaller Yanka at the Wickerman Festival in Tirisfal Glade and report your success."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '到提里斯法林地的稻草人節找黑暗召喚者雅恩卡覆命。', `Details` = '腐爛的蛋已經被放進了桶裡。以後南海鎮旅館出產的酒肯定都是次品了！$b$b你現在應該回提里斯法林地向黑暗召喚者雅恩卡報告你的成功。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8409;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "元素掌握", Title AC enUS : "Elemental Mastery" ; Wowhead enUS : "Elemental Mastery",  OLD Objectives : "為捕風者巴斯拉收集一份空氣樣本、一份火元素樣本、一份土元素樣本和一份水元素樣本。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect a sample of air, fire, earth and water for Bath'rah the Windwatcher." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect a sample of air, fire, earth and water for Bath'rah the Windwatcher.",  OLD Details : "捕風者巴斯拉需要你這樣充滿智慧的薩滿祭司。他要你帶上每種元素的樣本，證明你已準備就緒。$B$B你可以沿著塔倫米爾以東的河流往北走，巴斯拉就居住在沿途的一處廢墟中。", Details AC enUS : "Bath'rah the Windwatcher has sent out a summons for a shaman of your wisdom.  He requests you bring a sample of each of the elements to show you are ready.$b$bTo find Bath'rah, go to the river east of Tarren Mill.  Follow the river north until you come across the ruins where Bath'rah resides." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bath'rah the Windwatcher has sent out a summons for a shaman of your wisdom. He requests you bring a sample of each of the elements to show you are ready.$b$bTo find Bath'rah, go to the river east of Tarren Mill. Follow the river north until you come across the ruins where Bath'rah resides."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '元素專精', `Objectives` = '為『觀風者』巴斯拉收集一份空氣樣本、一份火元素樣本、一份土元素樣本和一份水元素樣本。', `Details` = '『觀風者』巴斯拉需要你這樣充滿智慧的薩滿。他要你帶上每種元素的樣本，證明你已準備就緒。$b$b你可以沿著塔倫米爾以東的河流往北走，巴斯拉就居住在沿途的一處廢墟中。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8410;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "歡迎。把元素交給我，然後我們再談談。$B$B火焰，空氣，水，還有大地。把它們交給我，然後我才能相信你。", Details AC enUS : "Welcome, $c.  You bring me the elements and then we do the talkin'.$b$bThe fire, the air, the water, and the earth I be needin' before I trust ya, mon.  I gots to know you be knowledgeable." ; Wowhead enUS : "Welcome, $c. You bring me the elements and then we do the talkin'.$b$bThe fire, the air, the water, and the earth I be needin' before I trust ya, mon. I gots to know you be knowledgeable."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '歡迎。把元素交給我，然後我們談談。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8411;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將靈魂圖騰所需的材料交給捕風者巴斯拉。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring the pieces for the spirit totem to Bath'rah the Windwatcher." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the pieces for the spirit totem to Bath'rah the Windwatcher.",  OLD Details : "這地方的元素靈魂不再歡迎我了。$B$B我們都熟悉圖騰，現在我需要靈魂圖騰來保護自己。它由四種元素和一些更原始、更接近自然的材料構成。$B$B你可以去西瘟疫之地獲取熊爪和蜘蛛的眼球，另外有時食腐的鳥類也會掉落這兩種東西中的任何一種，這取決於它們上一頓吃了什麼東西……去吧，$N。", Details AC enUS : "The elemental spirits of this place don't be likin' me any more.$b$bYou know about the totems more than any, and I be needin' a spirit totem to protect me.  We already got the elements, now we need somethin' more with more nature.  More primal.$b$bIn the Western Plaguelands you can kill bears for claws and spiders for their eyes.  The carrion birds eat everything, so they might have either one." ; Wowhead enUS : "The elemental spirits of this place don't be likin' me any more.$b$bYou know about the totems more than any, and I be needin' a spirit totem to protect me. We already got the elements, now we need somethin' more with more nature. More primal.$b$bIn the Western Plaguelands you can kill bears for claws and spiders for their eyes. The carrion birds eat everything, so they might have either one."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將靈魂圖騰所需的材料交給『觀風者』巴斯拉。', `Details` = '這地方的元素之靈不再歡迎我了。$b$b你比任何人都懂圖騰，現在我需要靈魂圖騰來保護自己。我們已經有了元素，現在我們需要更多更原始、更接近自然的材料。$b$b你可以去西瘟疫之地獲取熊爪和蜘蛛的眼球，另外有時食腐的鳥類什麼都吃，所以它們身上可能也有那些東西。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8412;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "巫毒羽毛", Title AC enUS : "Da Voodoo" ; Wowhead enUS : "Da Voodoo",  OLD Objectives : "將巫毒羽毛交給捕風者巴斯拉。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring the voodoo feathers to Bath'rah the Windwatcher." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the voodoo feathers to Bath'rah the Windwatcher.",  OLD Details : "靈魂圖騰還不夠。我們還需要一些巫毒魔法來讓它發揮效力。$B$B沉沒的神廟中的巨魔身上有巫毒羽毛。去殺掉加什爾、米杉、祖羅、胡庫、祖羅爾和洛若爾。這樣我們就能擁有一個真正的、具有魔法力量的靈魂圖騰了。", Details AC enUS : "The spirit totem just isn't enough.  We be needin' some voodoo magic to make it work jus' right.$b$bThe trolls in the sunken temple have feathers strong with voodoo magics.  Go there and kill Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro.  Then we have magic enough for a real spirit totem." ; Wowhead enUS : "The spirit totem just isn't enough. We be needin' some voodoo magic to make it work jus' right.$b$bThe trolls in the sunken temple have feathers strong with voodoo magics. Go there and kill Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro. Then we have magic enough for a real spirit totem."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '巫毒之術', `Objectives` = '將巫毒羽毛交給『觀風者』巴斯拉。', `Details` = '靈魂圖騰還不夠。我們還需要一些巫毒魔法來讓它發揮效力。$b$b沉沒的神廟中的食人妖身上有巫毒羽毛。去殺掉加什爾、米杉、祖羅、胡庫、祖羅爾和洛若爾。這樣我們就能擁有靈魂圖騰所需的魔法了。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8413;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集20個爪牙的天災石，並將它們交給西瘟疫之地的高階牧師賽爾鄧尼斯。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 20 Minion's Scourgestones and bring them to High Priest Thel'danis in the Western Plaguelands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 20 Minion's Scourgestones and bring them to High Priest Thel'danis in the Western Plaguelands.",  OLD Details : "你好，$C。在這片荒無人煙的土地上，像你這樣的十字軍是受到歡迎的。$B$B我們需要借助你神聖的力量來消滅這裡無窮無盡的亡靈。更重要的是，我們想讓你收集大量的天災石，將它們交給高階牧師賽爾鄧尼斯。賽爾鄧尼斯就在距離此地不遠的悔恨嶺守護烏瑟爾之墓。$B$B只有佩戴銀色黎明委任徽章的人可以找到天災石，如果你沒有徽章的話，就去跟軍官普爾哈特談談吧。", Details AC enUS : "Greetings, $c.  Crusaders like you are a welcome sight in these desolate reaches.$b$bYour holy strength is needed to help fight the endless undead here.  We need you to collect a large number of scourgestones and bring them to High Priest Thel'danis.  The high priest can be found guarding Uther's Tomb in Sorrow Hill, not far from here.$b$bOnly one with an Argent Dawn Commission can hope to find scourgestones, so speak to Officer Pureheart if you haven't already." ; Wowhead enUS : "Greetings, $c. Crusaders like you are a welcome sight in these desolate reaches.$b$bYour holy strength is needed to help fight the endless undead here. We need you to collect a large number of scourgestones and bring them to High Priest Thel'danis. The high priest can be found guarding Uther's Tomb in Sorrow Hill, not far from here.$b$bOnly one with an Argent Dawn Commission can hope to find scourgestones, so speak to Officer Pureheart if you haven't already."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '收集20個爪牙的天譴石並將它們交給西瘟疫之地的高階牧師賽爾鄧尼斯。', `Details` = '你好，$c。在這片荒無人煙的土地上，像你這樣的十字軍是受到歡迎的。$b$b我們需要借助你神聖的力量來消滅這裡無窮無盡的不死生物。更重要的是，我們需要你收集大量的天譴石，將它們交給高階牧師賽爾鄧尼斯。賽爾鄧尼斯就在距離此地不遠的悔恨嶺守護烏瑟之墓。$b$b只有佩戴銀色黎明委任徽章的人可以找到天譴石，如果你沒有徽章的話，就去跟軍官普爾哈特談談吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8414;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "冰風崗", Title AC enUS : "Chillwind Camp" ; Wowhead enUS : "Chillwind Camp",  OLD Objectives : "與冰風崗的指揮官阿什拉姆·瓦羅菲斯特談一談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak to Commander Ashlam Valorfist at Chillwind Camp." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak to Commander Ashlam Valorfist at Chillwind Camp.",  OLD Details : "指揮官阿什拉姆·瓦羅菲斯特需要你這樣純潔和勇敢的聖騎士，$N。你可以在西瘟疫之地南部的冰風崗找到他。以聖光的名義，去幫助他吧！", Details AC enUS : "Commander Ashlam Valorfist has sent out a call for a paladin of your purity and valor, $n.  You can find him at Chillwind Camp in the southern part of the Western Plaguelands.  Seek him and aid in his cause for the Light!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Commander Ashlam Valorfist has sent out a call for a paladin of your purity and valor, $n. You can find him at Chillwind Camp in the southern part of the Western Plaguelands. Seek him and aid in his cause for the Light!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '冰風營地', `Objectives` = '與冰風營地的指揮官阿胥拉姆·瓦羅菲斯特談一談。', `Details` = '指揮官阿胥拉姆·瓦羅菲斯特需要你這樣純潔和勇敢的聖騎士，$n。你可以在西瘟疫之地南方的冰風營地找到他。以聖光的名義，去協助他吧!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8415;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "惰性天災石", Title AC enUS : "Inert Scourgestones" ; Wowhead enUS : "Inert Scourgestones",  OLD Objectives : "將惰性天災石交給冰風崗的指揮官阿什拉姆·瓦羅菲斯特。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring the Inert Scourgestone to Commander Ashlan Valorfist in Chillwind Point." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the Inert Scourgestone to Commander Ashlan Valorfist in Chillwind Point.",  OLD Details : "天災石上的邪惡力量已經被清除了，$N。$B$B我瞭解指揮官阿什拉姆的計畫，他還需要一塊惰性天災石。把惰性天災石帶給他，或許我們就能以正義之火消滅亡靈天災。", Details AC enUS : "The evil has been purged from the stones, $n.$b$bI am aware of Commander Ashlam's plans, and he will require only a single inert stone.  Bring it to him so we may bathe the Scourge in righteous fire." ; Wowhead enUS : "The evil has been purged from the stones, $n.$b$bI am aware of Commander Ashlam's plans, and he will require only a single inert stone. Bring it to him so we may bathe the Scourge in righteous fire."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '惰性天譴石', `Objectives` = '將惰性天譴石交給冰風崗的指揮官阿胥拉姆·瓦羅菲斯特。', `Details` = '天譴石上的邪惡力量已經被清除了，$n。$b$b我瞭解指揮官阿胥拉姆的計劃，他還需要一塊惰性天譴石。把惰性天譴石帶給他，或許我們就能以正義之火消滅天譴軍團。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8416;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "轉至沉沒的神廟，從巨魔守護者們身上取得琥珀巫毒羽毛、藍色巫毒羽毛和綠色巫毒羽毛。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect Amber, Blue, and Green Voodoo Feathers from the trolls of Sunken Temple." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect Amber, Blue, and Green Voodoo Feathers from the trolls of Sunken Temple.",  OLD Details : "現在我們必須把惰性天災石組合起來，製造一件可以擊潰亡靈的武器。這不是一件輕鬆的任務，$n。只有沉沒的神廟中的那些巨魔身上攜帶著的魔法才擁有這種力量，正所謂以毒攻毒。。$B$B我需要沉沒的神廟裡那些巨魔的巫毒羽毛。加什爾、米杉、祖羅、胡庫、祖羅爾和洛若爾會掉落巫毒羽毛。不要為他們感到難過……他們是極端邪惡的存在。", Details AC enUS : "Now we must combine the inert scourgestones and create a weapon to shatter the ranks of undead.  This is no trivial task, $n.  Only the trolls of the sunken temple carry the kind of rare magic able to turn the evil of something against itself.$b$bIn the temple, the trolls are known as Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro.  Do not feel remorse for their corrupt souls... they are not without evil." ; Wowhead enUS : "Now we must combine the inert scourgestones and create a weapon to shatter the ranks of undead. This is no trivial task, $n. Only the trolls of the sunken temple carry the kind of rare magic able to turn the evil of something against itself.$b$bIn the temple, the trolls are known as Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro. Do not feel remorse for their corrupt souls... they are not without evil."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將巫毒羽毛帶給阿什拉姆·瓦羅菲斯特。', `Details` = '現在我們必須把惰性天譴石組合起來，製造一件可以擊潰不死族的武器。這不是一件輕鬆的任務，$n。只有沉沒的神廟裡的食人妖擁有那種罕見的魔法可以讓惡魔自行毀滅。$b$b在神廟裡，有幾個叫加什爾、米杉、祖羅、胡庫、祖羅爾和洛若爾的食人妖。不要為他們感到難過……他們是極端邪惡的存在。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8418;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將一塊惡魔布交給費伍德森林的伊普斯。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring a piece of felcloth to Impsy in Felwood." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring a piece of felcloth to Impsy in Felwood.",  OLD Details : "$N，費伍德森林有個名叫伊普斯的小鬼讓你去見他。這聽上去有些奇怪，因為他讓你帶上一塊惡魔布作為忠實的象徵。既然你已經是個強大的術士了，那我想不用說你也知道費伍德的薩特身上有時會帶著惡魔布吧？$B$B你可以在血毒瀑布以北找到伊普斯，我聽說這個季節血毒瀑布非常漂亮。", Details AC enUS : "$n, an imp in Felwood by the name of Impsy has requested your presence.  It is somewhat strange, as he has asked that you bring a piece of felcloth as a sign of good faith.  Considering the power you already wield as a warlock, I can only assume you know the satyrs of Felwood carry this felcloth.$b$bYou can find Impsy just north of the Bloodvenom Falls, which I've heard is quite lovely this time of year." ; Wowhead enUS : "$n, an imp in Felwood by the name of Impsy has requested your presence. It is somewhat strange, as he has asked that you bring a piece of felcloth as a sign of good faith. Considering the power you already wield as a warlock, I can only assume you know the satyrs of Felwood carry this felcloth.$b$bYou can find Impsy just north of the Bloodvenom Falls, which I've heard is quite lovely this time of year."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將1塊惡魔布交給費伍德森林的伊普斯。', `Details` = '$n，費伍德森林有個名叫伊普斯的小鬼要你去見他。這聽起來有點奇怪，因為他要你帶一塊惡魔布作為忠實的象徵。既然你已經是個強大的術士了，我想不用我說你也知道費伍德的薩特身上有時會帶著惡魔布吧？$b$b你可以在血毒瀑布以北找到伊普斯，我聽說這個季節血毒瀑布非常漂亮。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8419;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將一塊惡魔布交給費伍德森林的伊普斯。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring a piece of felcloth to Impsy in Felwood." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring a piece of felcloth to Impsy in Felwood.",  OLD Details : "或許一個小鬼說這話有些奇怪，但是我希望擁有自己的寵物。尼比把我當作寵物，我卻沒有寵物，這不公平！$B$B事實上，我並不需要什麼活物。如果你能給我一塊惡魔布的話，我就能製造一個寵物。這周圍的薩特身上經常帶著惡魔布，所以你可以去跟他們打打交道，你覺得如何？", Details AC enUS : "Maybe this sounds strange coming from an imp, but I'd like a pet of my own.  I really would.  It's just not fair that Niby gets me and I get nothing!$b$bIn fact, it doesn't even need to be a living pet.  I'd need something to start making it with, like some felcloth.  The satyrs here in Felwood sometimes have felcloth, so you'd just have to kill enough of them until you find some.  That doesn't sound so bad, does it?" ; Wowhead enUS : "Maybe this sounds strange coming from an imp, but I'd like a pet of my own. I really would. It's just not fair that Niby gets me and I get nothing!$b$bIn fact, it doesn't even need to be a living pet. I'd need something to start making it with, like some felcloth. The satyrs here in Felwood sometimes have felcloth, so you'd just have to kill enough of them until you find some. That doesn't sound so bad, does it?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將1塊惡魔布交給費伍德森林的伊普斯。', `Details` = '或許一個小鬼說這話有些奇怪，但是我希望擁有自己的寵物。尼比把我當作寵物，我卻沒有寵物，這不公平!$b$b事實上，我並不需要什麼活的寵物。如果你能給我一塊惡魔布的話，我就能製造一個寵物。這周圍的薩特身上經常帶著惡魔布，所以你可以去跟他們打打交道，你覺得如何?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8420;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我已經有惡魔布啦，現在我可以開始製造*我的*寵物了。$B$B但是我還需要一些東西來製造寵物的眼睛。你能不能幫我從鐵樹上剝些腐爛的木頭來？這樣我才能雕刻出可愛的眼睛。我還需要血毒精華，讓我的寵物具有惡魔的氣息。被污染的軟泥怪具有這種精華，他們就在我們附近出沒。", Details AC enUS : "Now that I have my felcloth, I can really begin making *my* pet.$b$bIt's going to need some eyes though.  Perhaps you could rip some rotting wood from the irontree folk for me, so I can carve out some lovely eyes.  They're up north in the Irontree Woods.$b$bI'll also need some bloodvenom essence to give it that new demon smell.  The tainted oozes carry the essence, and they hang out right here near Niby and me." ; Wowhead enUS : "Now that I have my felcloth, I can really begin making *my* pet.$b$bIt's going to need some eyes though. Perhaps you could rip some rotting wood from the irontree folk for me, so I can carve out some lovely eyes. They're up north in the Irontree Woods.$b$bI'll also need some bloodvenom essence to give it that new demon smell. The tainted oozes carry the essence, and they hang out right here near Niby and me."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我已經有惡魔布啦，現在我可以開始製造*我的*寵物了。$b$b但是我還需要一些東西來製造寵物的眼睛。你能不能幫我從鐵樹上剝些腐爛的木頭來？這樣我才能雕刻出可愛的眼睛。我還需要血毒精華，讓我的寵物具有惡魔的氣息。被污染的軟泥怪具有這種精華，他們就在我們附近出沒。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8421;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到沉沒的神廟去，從巨魔們身上獲得6支巫毒羽毛。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring a total of 6 Voodoo Feathers from the trolls in sunken temple." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring a total of 6 Voodoo Feathers from the trolls in sunken temple.",  OLD Details : "我的寵物差不多要製作完成了。現在我需要一些填充物。$B$B我需要沉沒的神廟裡那些巨魔的巫毒羽毛。加什爾、米杉、祖羅、胡庫、祖羅爾和洛若爾會掉落巫毒羽毛。幹掉他們。全部。$B$B這項任務可不簡單，$N，我會送你一些尼比的東西——反正他似乎也用不著。", Details AC enUS : "My pet is almost done.  Now I just need something to stuff it with.$b$bOnly the voodoo feathers from the trolls in the sunken temple will do.  They go by the names Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro.  Kill them.  Kill them all.$b$bThis is no trivial task $n, so I'll make it worth your while by giving you something of Niby's -- he probably doesn't need it anyhow." ; Wowhead enUS : "My pet is almost done. Now I just need something to stuff it with.$b$bOnly the voodoo feathers from the trolls in the sunken temple will do. They go by the names Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro. Kill them. Kill them all.$b$bThis is no trivial task $n, so I'll make it worth your while by giving you something of Niby's -- he probably doesn't need it anyhow."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '到沉沒的神廟去，從食人妖們身上獲取6枝巫毒羽毛。', `Details` = '我的寵物差不多要製作完成了。現在我需要一些填充物。$b$b我需要沉沒的神廟裡那些食人妖的巫毒羽毛。加什爾、米杉、祖羅、胡庫、祖羅爾和洛若爾會掉落巫毒羽毛。把他們全都殺了。$b$b這項任務可不簡單，$n，我會送你一些尼比的東西─反正他似乎也用不著。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8422;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死7頭地獄野豬，然後回到部落英雄的靈魂那兒。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill 7 Helboar in the Blasted Lands and return to the Fallen Hero of the Horde." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill 7 Helboar in the Blasted Lands and return to the Fallen Hero of the Horde.",  OLD Details : "<英雄注視著你。>$B$B毫無疑問，你是一位$C。我要給你一項光榮的任務，但是首先，你必須證明自己的力量。$B$B據說雷克薩檢驗他的戰斧是否鋒利的標準，乃是它能否一下斬殺一頭地獄野豬。現在，我要通過讓你殺死它們來證明你擁有足夠的力量。", Details AC enUS : "<The Hero looks you over.>$b$bYou are a $c, no doubt.  I would ask an honorable task of you, but I must test your strength.$b$bIt is said that Rexxar would measure the sharpness of his blades by killing a helboar with a single, swift strike.  Now I will measure your strength by killing them." ; Wowhead enUS : "<The Hero looks you over.>$b$bYou are a $c, no doubt. I would ask an honorable task of you, but I must test your strength.$b$bIt is said that Rexxar would measure the sharpness of his blades by killing a helboar with a single, swift strike. Now I will measure your strength by killing them.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Helboar slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '在詛咒之地殺死7隻地獄野豬，然後回到部落英雄的靈魂那裡。', `Details` = '<英雄注視著你。>$b$b毫無疑問，你是一位$c。我要給你一項光榮的任務，但是首先，你必須證明自己的力量。$b$b據說雷克薩檢驗他的戰斧是否鋒利的標準，是以它能否一刀斬殺一頭地獄野豬。現在，我要讓你透過殺死它們來證明你擁有足夠的力量。', `Objectivetext1` = '地獄野豬 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8423;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "魔誓者之戰", Title AC enUS : "War on the Shadowsworn" ; Wowhead enUS : "War on the Shadowsworn",  OLD Objectives : "殺死詛咒之地的魔誓者，然後回到部落英雄的靈魂那兒。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slaughter the Shadowsworn in the Blasted Lands and return to the Fallen Hero of the Horde." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slaughter the Shadowsworn in the Blasted Lands and return to the Fallen Hero of the Horde.",  OLD Details : "我的存在本身就是個苦難，魔誓者更是為我帶來了無窮無盡的痛苦，他們的黑暗儀式讓我感到了比死亡還要可怕的苦楚。$B$B現在你可以幫我把痛苦帶給他們。去吧，成為我的憤怒的象徵。", Details AC enUS : "The continued presence of the shadowsworn in the Blasted Lands bring great pain to me.  Their dark rituals and spells cause agony unlike any I felt while alive.$b$bThrough you I can deliver my own message of pain.  Go forth and deliver my wrath." ; Wowhead enUS : "The continued presence of the shadowsworn in the Blasted Lands bring great pain to me. Their dark rituals and spells cause agony unlike any I felt while alive.$b$bThrough you I can deliver my own message of pain. Go forth and deliver my wrath.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Shadowsworn Adept slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Shadowsworn Cultist slain",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Shadowsworn Thug slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '影誓者之戰', `Objectives` = '殺死詛咒之地的影誓祭司，然後回到部落英雄的靈魂那兒。', `Details` = '我的存在本身就是個苦難，影誓者更是為我帶來了無窮無盡的痛苦，他們的黑暗儀式讓我感到了比死亡還要可怕的苦楚。$b$b現在你可以幫我把痛苦帶給他們。去吧，成為我的憤怒的象徵。', `Objectivetext1` = '影誓專家 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '影誓祭司 消滅', `Objectivetext3` = '影誓暴徒 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8424;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將你從沉沒的神廟的巨魔身上得到的巫毒羽毛交給部落英雄的靈魂。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring the Voodoo Feathers from the trolls in the Sunken Temple to the Fallen Hero of the Horde." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the Voodoo Feathers from the trolls in the Sunken Temple to the Fallen Hero of the Horde.",  OLD Details : "你為我帶來一絲平靜。我得給你點什麼作為回報。$B$B我的武器和護甲陪我度過了光輝的歲月，現在它們對我來說都沒什麼用處了。還是送給你吧。$B$B去沉沒的神廟，殺死巨魔守衛加什爾、米杉、祖羅、胡庫、祖羅爾和洛若爾。他們的巫毒羽毛能使我的肉身重現一段時間，足夠給你獎勵了。將巫毒羽毛帶給我吧。", Details AC enUS : "Your honor has brought some peace to me.  It is only right that I offer you something in return.$b$bMy weapons and armor were splendid in life, and yet they are of no use to me now.  They would be better served in your possession.$b$bTravel to the sunken temple and destroy the troll guardians Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro.  They carry magic feathers that can reform my physical body long enough to grant you a reward." ; Wowhead enUS : "Your honor has brought some peace to me. It is only right that I offer you something in return.$b$bMy weapons and armor were splendid in life, and yet they are of no use to me now. They would be better served in your possession.$b$bTravel to the sunken temple and destroy the troll guardians Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro. They carry magic feathers that can reform my physical body long enough to grant you a reward."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將你從沉沒的神廟的食人妖身上得到的巫毒羽毛交給部落英雄的靈魂。', `Details` = '你為我帶來一絲平靜。我得給你點什麼作為回報。$b$b我的武器和護甲陪我度過了光輝的歲月，現在它們對我來說都沒什麼用處了。還是送給你吧。$b$b去沉沒的神廟，殺死食人妖守衛加什爾、米杉、祖羅、胡庫、祖羅爾和洛若爾。他們的巫毒羽毛能使我的肉身重現一段時間，足夠給你獎勵了。將巫毒羽毛帶給我吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8425;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "峽谷中的戰鬥", Title AC enUS : "Battle of Warsong Gulch" ; Wowhead enUS : "Battle of Warsong Gulch",  OLD Details : "我們在戰歌峽谷對銀翼哨兵展開攻勢，這一戰役至關重要。聯盟以保護這片不屬於他們的森林為由，妄圖從部落手中奪取我們最大的伐木場。$B$B別讓他們的妄想成為事實，$N！為了部落，證明你的價值！成功之後再回到我這兒來。", Details AC enUS : "The battle in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels is of great importance.  Under the guise of protecting a forest that doesn't belong to them, the Alliance seeks to deny the Horde one of our largest sources for lumber.$B$BDo not let this happen, $N!  Come back to me with proof of serving the Horde in a worthy manner!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The battle in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels is of great importance. Under the guise of protecting a forest that doesn't belong to them, the Alliance seeks to deny the Horde one of our largest sources for lumber.$b$bDo not let this happen, $n! Come back to me with proof of serving the Horde in a worthy manner!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '峽谷之戰', `Details` = '我們在戰歌峽谷對銀翼哨兵的戰役非常重要。聯盟以保護這片不屬於他們的森林為由，妄圖從部落手中奪取我們最大的伐木場。$b$b別讓他們的妄想成為事實，$n！為了部落，證明你的價值！成功之後再回到我這兒來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8426;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "峽谷中的戰鬥", Title AC enUS : "Battle of Warsong Gulch" ; Wowhead enUS : "Battle of Warsong Gulch",  OLD Details : "我們在戰歌峽谷對銀翼哨兵展開攻勢，這一戰役至關重要。聯盟以保護這片不屬於他們的森林為由，妄圖從部落手中奪取我們最大的伐木場。$B$B別讓他們的妄想成為事實，$N！為了部落，證明你的價值！成功之後再回到我這兒來。", Details AC enUS : "The battle in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels is of great importance.  Under the guise of protecting a forest that doesn't belong to them, the Alliance seeks to deny the Horde one of our largest sources for lumber.$B$BDo not let this happen, $N!  Come back to me with proof of serving the Horde in a worthy manner!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The battle in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels is of great importance. Under the guise of protecting a forest that doesn't belong to them, the Alliance seeks to deny the Horde one of our largest sources for lumber.$b$bDo not let this happen, $n! Come back to me with proof of serving the Horde in a worthy manner!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '峽谷之戰', `Details` = '我們在戰歌峽谷對銀翼哨兵的戰役非常重要。聯盟以保護這片不屬於他們的森林為由，妄圖從部落手中奪取我們最大的伐木場。$b$b別讓他們的妄想成為事實，$n！為了部落，證明你的價值！成功之後再回到我這兒來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8427;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "峽谷中的戰鬥", Title AC enUS : "Battle of Warsong Gulch" ; Wowhead enUS : "Battle of Warsong Gulch",  OLD Objectives : "棒極了！你在戰歌峽谷保衛戰中表現突出！願你的英雄事蹟在我們的土地上流傳開來。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 3 Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor to a Horde Warbringer outside the battlegrounds." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 3 Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor to a Horde Warbringer outside the battlegrounds.",  OLD Details : "我們在戰歌峽谷對銀翼哨兵展開攻勢，這一戰役至關重要。聯盟以保護這片不屬於他們的森林為由，妄圖從部落手中奪取我們最大的伐木場。$B$B別讓他們的妄想成為事實，$N！為了部落，證明你的價值！成功之後再回到我這兒來。", Details AC enUS : "The battle in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels is of great importance.  Under the guise of protecting a forest that doesn't belong to them, the Alliance seeks to deny the Horde one of our largest sources for lumber.$B$BDo not let this happen, $N!  Come back to me with proof of serving the Horde in a worthy manner!$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "The battle in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels is of great importance. Under the guise of protecting a forest that doesn't belong to them, the Alliance seeks to deny the Horde one of our largest sources for lumber.$b$bDo not let this happen, $n! Come back to me with proof of serving the Horde in a worthy manner!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '峽谷之戰', `Objectives` = '將3枚戰歌榮譽獎章交給戰場外的部落戰爭使者。', `Details` = '我們在戰歌峽谷對銀翼哨兵的戰役非常重要。聯盟以保護這片不屬於他們的森林為由，妄圖從部落手中奪取我們最大的伐木場。$b$b別讓他們的妄想成為事實，$n！為了部落，證明你的價值！成功之後再回到我這兒來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8428;
