-- AC datas : OLD Details : "", Details AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "This present looks like it has been shaken a few times. The tag on it reads:$b$bTo a very special $r $c."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '這個禮物看起來好像已經被稍微搖晃過了幾次。上面的標籤寫著：$b$b給最特別的$r$c。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8788;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "節日英雄", Title AC enUS : "The Hero of the Day" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Hero of the Day",  OLD Details : "聽好...我不應該告訴你這件事情的內容，但既然你是今日的英雄...$B$B每年的這個時候到處都有新鮮的冬青，但是都沒法保存太久。我們有一台保存的機器，能為冬青永遠保鮮!我們用它來點綴節日...在夏天的時候還可以賺取利潤!$B$B我會讓你使用保存機，但你一定要是個大師級的廚師才行。你需要一些石中鹽和兩個，三個，喔五個好了，五個金幣。我會幫你弄到一批好貨的。", Details AC enUS : "Listen... I'm not really supposed to be telling you this, but since you're the hero of the day and all...$B$BThere's fresh holly everywhere this time of the year, but it never lasts.  We've got a machine that preserves holly - it never goes bad!  We use it to spice up the holiday... and profits during the summer!$B$BI'll let you use the preserver, but only if you're a master cook.  You'll need some deeprock salt and two, three, oh let's say five gold.  It'll net you a nice batch that's yours to keep." ; Wowhead enUS : "Listen... I'm not really supposed to be telling you this, but since you're the hero of the day and all...$b$bThere's fresh holly everywhere this time of the year, but it never lasts. We've got a machine that preserves holly - it never goes bad! We use it to spice up the holiday... and profits during the summer!$b$bI'll let you use the preserver, but only if you're a master cook. You'll need some deeprock salt and two, three, oh let's say five gold. It'll net you a nice batch that's yours to keep."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '大英雄！', `Details` = '聽好…我可以不告訴你的，但是既然你是今日的英雄…$b$b每年的這個時候到處都有新鮮的冬青，但是它們都不能保久。我們有一個保存冬青的機器 – 它會永遠保鮮！我們用它來點綴節日…在夏天的時候還可以賺取利潤！$b$b我會讓你使用保存機，但你一定要是個大師級的廚師才行。你需要一些石中鹽和兩個，三個，喔五個好了，五個金幣。我會幫你弄到一批好貨的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8799;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "", Details AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "The note on this present reads:$b$bTo $n,$b$bIn hoping this will help you spread warm tidings and holiday cheer to all of Azeroth.$b$bFrom Greatfather Winter"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '這個禮物上的便條紙寫著：$b$b給$n，$b$b希望這個禮物可以幫助你將溫暖及節日的喜悅散播到整個艾澤拉斯大陸。$b$b冬天爺爺敬贈', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8803;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "和冬天爺爺談談;他在鐵爐堡燻木牧場商人區旁邊。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Greatfather Winter. He is located near the Smokywood Pastures vendor area in Ironforge." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Greatfather Winter. He is located near the Smokywood Pastures vendor area in Ironforge.",  OLD Details : "我聽說冬天爺爺 - 在燻木牧場的慷慨支持下 - 已經把要給所有人的禮物放在鐵爐堡的樹下。真希望我也能去，但是我必須看管這台PX-238冬幕歡樂製造器。$b$b不過你一定得去看看。我相信冬天爺爺已經準備好印有你名字的禮物了。", Details AC enUS : "I hear Greatfather Winter - with the generous support of Smokeywood Pastures - has put presents for everyone under the tree in Ironforge. I wish I could go, but I've got to look after the PX-238 Winter Wondervolt.$b$bBut you should definitely check it out. I'm sure Greatfather Winter has some presents with your name on them." ; Wowhead enUS : "I hear Greatfather Winter - with the generous support of Smokeywood Pastures - has put presents for everyone under the tree in Ironforge. I wish I could go, but I've got to look after the PX-238 Winter Wondervolt.$b$bBut you should definitely check it out. I'm sure Greatfather Winter has some presents with your name on them."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '和冬天爺爺談談；他在鐵爐堡燻木牧場商人區旁邊。', `Details` = '我聽說冬天爺爺－在燻木牧場的慷慨支持下－已經把要給所有人的禮物放在鐵爐堡的樹下。真希望我也能去，但是我必須看管這台PX-238冬幕歡樂製造器。$b$b不過你一定得去看看。我相信冬天爺爺已經準備好印著你名字的禮物了。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8827;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我聽說冬天爺爺 - 在燻木牧場的慷慨支持下 - 已經把要給所有人的禮物放在奧格瑪的樹下。真希望我也能去，但是我必須看管這台PX-238冬幕歡樂製造器。$b$b不過你一定得去看看。我相信冬天爺爺已經準備好印有你名字的禮物了。", Details AC enUS : "I hear Great-father Winter - with the generous support of Smokeywood Pastures - has put presents for everyone under the tree in Orgrimmar. I wish I could go, but I've got to look after the PX-238 Winter Wondervolt.$b$bBut you should definitely check it out. I'm sure Great-father Winter has some presents with your name on them." ; Wowhead enUS : "I hear Great-father Winter - with the generous support of Smokeywood Pastures - has put presents for everyone under the tree in Orgrimmar. I wish I could go, but I've got to look after the PX-238 Winter Wondervolt.$b$bBut you should definitely check it out. I'm sure Great-father Winter has some presents with your name on them."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我聽說冬天爺爺－在燻木牧場的慷慨支持下－已經把要給所有人的禮物放在奧格瑪的樹下。真希望我也能去，但是我必須看管這台PX-238冬幕歡樂製造器。$b$b不過你一定得去看看。我相信冬天爺爺已經準備好印有你名字的禮物了。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8828;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "新年慶典!", Title AC enUS : "New Year Celebrations!" ; Wowhead enUS : "New Year Celebrations!",  OLD Details : "雷霆崖正在舉辦新年的慶典！那裡整天提供免費的飲料，晚上他們還會舉辦煙火表演！$B$B應該會很不錯的…但是藏寶海灣今天晚上也有個宴會，我敢說那一定更棒！$B$B總之，雷霆崖的旅店老闆帕拉需要燻木牧場的補給品才能應付需求量龐大的慶典。你能幫我送過去嗎？$B$B謝謝你，$n！旅店老闆帕拉就在通往獵人高地橋邊的旅店裡面。", Details AC enUS : "Thunder Bluff is holding a celebration for the new year!  All day you'll find free booze there, and at night they'll put on a firework show!$B$BIt should be pretty nice... but Booty Bay is also having a party today; I bet it'll be even better!$B$BWell anyway, Innkeeper Pala in Thunder Bluff needs a supply of Smoky Wood Pasture fare to help feed all the party goers.  Can you do me a favor and deliver it!$B$BThanks, $N!  Innkeeper Pala is in the inn near the bridge to Hunter's Rise." ; Wowhead enUS : "Thunder Bluff is holding a celebration for the new year! All day you'll find free booze there, and at night they'll put on a firework show!$b$bIt should be pretty nice... but Booty Bay is also having a party today; I bet it'll be even better!$b$bWell anyway, Innkeeper Pala in Thunder Bluff needs a supply of Smoky Wood Pasture fare to help feed all the party goers. Can you do me a favor and deliver it!$b$bThanks, $n! Innkeeper Pala is in the inn near the bridge to Hunter's Rise."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '新年慶典！', `Details` = '雷霆崖正在舉辦新年的慶典！那裡整天提供免費的飲料，晚上他們還會舉辦煙火表演！$b$b應該會很不錯的……但是藏寶海灣今天晚上也有個宴會；我敢說那一定更棒！$b$b總之，雷霆崖的旅店老闆帕拉需要燻木牧場的補給品才能應付需求量龐大的慶典。你能幫我送過去嗎？$b$b謝謝你，$n！旅店老闆帕拉就在通往獵人高地橋邊的旅店裡面。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8861;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "月光林地的德魯伊每年都會舉辦一次慶典，慶祝我們城市對抗遠古惡魔的偉大勝利。$B$B我們讚美長者的智慧，共享美食盛宴，當然還有...煙火秀!$B$B這些可不是普通的煙火。它們受過伊露恩的祝福，經月火賜予力量，發射它們能提高人民的精神，振奮他們的力量。$B$B你只要捐獻一點東西就能跟我們的商人購買色彩繽紛的煙火。試試這附近的一些發射器吧，$n。", Details AC enUS : "Every year the druids of Moonglade hold a celebration of our city's great triumph over an ancient evil.$B$BWe celebrate the wisdom of our elders, share in magnificent feasts and of course... shoot fireworks!$B$BFor a small donation you can purchase colorful rockets from our vendor.  Try using some of the launchers around here, $N." ; Wowhead enUS : "Every year the druids of Moonglade hold a celebration of our city's great triumph over an ancient evil.$b$bWe celebrate the wisdom of our elders, share in magnificent feasts and of course... shoot fireworks!$b$bFor a small donation you can purchase colorful rockets from our vendor. Try using some of the launchers around here, $n.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "點燃春節煙花", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Lunar Fireworks Fired" ; Wowhead enUS : "Lunar Fireworks Fired",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "點燃新年煙火束", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "Lunar Fireworks Cluster Fired" ; Wowhead enUS : "Lunar Fireworks Cluster Fired"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '月光林地的德魯伊每年都會舉辦一次慶典，慶祝我們城市對抗遠古惡魔的偉大勝利。$b$b我們讚美長者的智慧，共享美食盛宴，當然還有…煙火秀！$b$b，這些可不是普通的煙火。它們受過伊露恩的祝福，經月火賜予力量，發射它們能提高人民的精神，振奮他們的力量。$b$b你只要捐獻一點東西就能跟我們的商人購買色彩繽紛的煙火。試試這附近的一些發射器吧，$n。', `Objectivetext1` = '點燃新年煙火。', `Objectivetext2` = '點燃新年煙火束。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8867;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "召喚年獸，擊敗牠並獲得伊露恩的祝福。再回到永夜港找瓦拉達爾‧星歌。", Objectives AC enUS : "Summon Omen, defeat him and gain Elune's Blessing.  Return to Valadar Starsong in Nighthaven" ; Wowhead enUS : "Summon Omen, defeat him and gain Elune's Blessing.  Return to Valadar Starsong in Nighthaven",  OLD Details : "年獸曾是這個世界的英雄。一隻有著極大力量和運氣的狼，在年獸屈服於惡魔魔法前，他都在先祖之戰的英雄身邊一起作戰。和他的盟友反目成仇後，他的怒火席捲了整個艾澤拉斯，所到之處充滿死亡和恐懼。$B$B最後終於在月光林地這裡被擊敗了，年獸現在沉睡在月神湖水中。但是每年新年，在慶典之中，他就會開始蠢蠢欲動...$B$B找些朋友，$n，召喚年獸並擊敗他。贏得伊露恩的祝福!", Details AC enUS : "The beast Omen was once a hero of this world.  A wolf of great strength and fortune, Omen fought beside the heroes of the War of the Ancients until he succumbed to demonic magics.  Turning against his allies, he raged across Azeroth and carried death and terror in his wake.$B$BFinally defeated here, in Moonglade, Omen now sleeps among the silt of Lake Elune'ara.  But each new year, during the festival, he stirs...$B$BGather cohorts, $N, and summon and defeat the beast Omen.  Earn the blessing of Elune!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The beast Omen was once a hero of this world. A wolf of great strength and fortune, Omen fought beside the heroes of the War of the Ancients until he succumbed to demonic magics. Turning against his allies, he raged across Azeroth and carried death and terror in his wake.$b$bFinally defeated here, in Moonglade, Omen now sleeps among the silt of Lake Elune'ara. But each new year, during the festival, he stirs...$b$bGather cohorts, $n, and summon and defeat the beast Omen. Earn the blessing of Elune!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '召喚年獸，擊敗他並獲得伊露恩的祝福。再回到永夜港找瓦拉達爾·星歌。', `Details` = '年獸曾是這個世界的英雄。一隻有著極大力量和運氣的狼，在年獸屈服於惡魔魔法前，他都在先祖之戰的英雄身邊一起作戰。和他的盟友反目成仇後，他的怒火席捲了整個艾澤拉斯，所到之處充滿死亡和恐懼。$b$b最後終於在月光林地這裡被擊敗了，年獸現在沉睡在月神湖水中。但是每年新年，在慶典之中，他就會開始蠢蠢欲動…$b$b找些朋友，$n，召喚年獸並擊敗他。贏得伊露恩的祝福!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8868;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "新年將至，$n!塞納里奧議會邀請艾澤拉斯大陸的居民，一同參加新年的慶祝活動。在這特有的城市有一個標示著神聖月光之環的地方，你可以在那兒找到新年預告者。她會告訴你更多關於節慶的訊息。", Details AC enUS : "It's that time of the year, $N!  The Cenarion Circle invites all denizens of Azeroth to partake in our celebration of the Lunar Festival.  You will find the Lunar Festival Harbinger in this very city at a location marked by a blessed circle of moonlight.  She can tell you more about the holiday." ; Wowhead enUS : "It's that time of the year, $n! The Cenarion Circle invites all denizens of Azeroth to partake in our celebration of the Lunar Festival. You will find the Lunar Festival Harbinger in this very city at a location marked by a blessed circle of moonlight. She can tell you more about the holiday."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '新年將至，$n！塞納里奧議會邀請艾澤拉斯大陸的居民，一同參加新年的慶祝活動。在這特有的城市有一個標示著神聖月光之環的地方，你可以在那兒找到新年預告者。她會告訴你更多關於節慶的訊息。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8870;
