-- AC datas : OLD Title : "瓦拉達爾‧星歌", Title AC enUS : "Valadar Starsong" ; Wowhead enUS : "Valadar Starsong",  OLD Objectives : "在月光中使用你的新年邀請卡前往月光林地。到達後和永夜港的瓦拉達爾‧星歌交談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use your Lunar Festival Invitation in the moonlight to travel to Moonglade. Speak with Valadar Starsong in Nighthaven when you arrive." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use your Lunar Festival Invitation in the moonlight to travel to Moonglade. Speak with Valadar Starsong in Nighthaven when you arrive.",  OLD Details : "既然你有新年邀請卡，你就能前往月光林地!你會在那裡看到許多狂歡者，瓦拉達爾‧星歌和他的姐姐法莉爾‧星歌在永夜港裡等著所有想積極參與慶祝活動的人。$B$B通過較強的月光前往月光林地並和瓦拉達爾‧星歌談談;看看你能在新年裡得到什麼禮物!", Details AC enUS : "Now that you have your Lunar Festival invitation, you may travel to Moonglade!  There you will find many revelers, and in the village of Nighthaven Valadar Starsong and his sister Fariel await those eager to participate in the celebration.$B$BTravel to Moonglade through the greater moonlight and speak with Valadar Starsong; see what prizes you might gain during the festival!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Now that you have your Lunar Festival invitation, you may travel to Moonglade! There you will find many revelers, and in the village of Nighthaven Valadar Starsong and his sister Fariel await those eager to participate in the celebration.$b$bTravel to Moonglade through the greater moonlight and speak with Valadar Starsong; see what prizes you might gain during the festival!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '瓦拉達爾·星歌', `Objectives` = '在月光中使用你的新年邀請卡前往月光林地。到達後和永夜港的瓦拉達爾·星歌交談。', `Details` = '既然你有新年邀請卡，你就能前往月光林地！你會在那裡看到許多狂歡者，瓦拉達爾·星歌和他的姊姊法莉爾·星歌在永夜港裡等著所有想積極參與慶祝活動的人。$b$b通過較強的月光前往月光林地並和瓦拉達爾·星歌談談；看看你能在新年裡得到什麼禮物！', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8883;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "魚頭，魚頭...", Title AC enUS : "Fish Heads, Fish Heads..." ; Wowhead enUS : "Fish Heads, Fish Heads...",  OLD Objectives : "收集8個厲鱗魚人頭顱。將它們帶到永歌森林裡俯瞰著寧靜海岸的懸崖給海斯維利‧桑凱。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 8 Grimscale Murloc Heads.  Return them to Hathvelion Sungaze in the Eversong Woods on the bluff overlooking the Tranquil Shore." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 8 Grimscale Murloc Heads.  Return them to Hathvelion Sungaze in the Eversong Woods on the bluff overlooking the Tranquil Shore.",  OLD Details : "你好，$c。看看海岸邊，你看到了什麼？沒錯，我們的海灘…我們的寧靜海岸，充斥著可惡的魚人。$B$B我們不容許他們這樣的毀壞！$B$B我有個任務要給你。只要你覺得可以接受的話，我要他們的頭！看看我們能不能大量削減他們的數量，讓他們知難而退，回到原本黑暗的深淵！", Details AC enUS : "Greetings, $c.  Take a look toward the shore; what do you see?  That's right, our beach... our Tranquil Shore, has been infested with the malignancy known as the murloc.$B$BThis blight will not stand!$B$BI have a task for you.  If you feel that you're up to it, I would have their heads!  Let us see if we can put a dent in their numbers so large that, if they have any sense at all, they will return to the murky depths from which they sprang!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Greetings, $c. Take a look toward the shore; what do you see? That's right, our beach... our Tranquil Shore, has been infested with the malignancy known as the murloc.$b$bThis blight will not stand!$b$bI have a task for you. If you feel that you're up to it, I would have their heads! Let us see if we can put a dent in their numbers so large that, if they have any sense at all, they will return to the murky depths from which they sprang!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '魚頭，魚頭……', `Objectives` = '收集8個厲鱗魚人頭顱。將它們帶到永歌森林裡俯瞰著寧靜海岸的懸崖給海斯維利·桑凱。', `Details` = '你好，$c。看看海岸邊;你看到了什麼?沒錯，我們的海灘…….我們的寧靜海岸，充斥著可惡的魚人。$b$b我們不容許他們這樣的毀壞!$b$b我有個任務要給你。只要你覺得可以接受的話，我要他們的頭!看看我們能不能大量削減他們的數量，讓他們知難而退，回到原本黑暗的深淵!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8884;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "從厲鱗首領麻木的爪子中取回魔鉤的戒指，交給在永歌森林裡俯瞰寧靜海岸的懸崖上的海斯維利‧桑凱。", Objectives AC enUS : "Retrieve the Ring of Mmmrrrggglll from the Grimscale chieftain's dead clutches.  Return it to Hathvelion Sungaze in the Eversong Woods on the bluff overlooking the Tranquil Shore." ; Wowhead enUS : "Retrieve the Ring of Mmmrrrggglll from the Grimscale chieftain's dead clutches.  Return it to Hathvelion Sungaze in the Eversong Woods on the bluff overlooking the Tranquil Shore.",  OLD Details : "厲鱗魚人並沒有被你的努力給嚇跑。但是，我想我知道什麼才會讓他們知難而退，還會給我帶來一些個人的報酬。$B$B他們有一個自稱魔鉤的魚人首領。他會在金色湖岸南邊的海岸閒晃。這隻野獸曾經殺過我一個夥伴，現在竟公然戴著他的戒指，簡直就是一種藐視與嘲笑。$B$B殺了魔鉤，把我朋友的戒指帶回來給我。然後我們就會看到這些怪物受驚嚇的樣子!", Details AC enUS : "The Grimscale murlocs have not been scared off by your efforts. But, I think I know what will send them packing, as well as get me some personal retribution.$B$BThey have a murloc chieftain that calls itself Mmmrrrggglll. It wanders the Golden Strand south of the river inlet. The beast once slew a compatriot of mine, and now wears his ring in open defiance and mockery.$B$BSlay Mmmrrrggglll, and bring back my friend's ring. Then we shall see these monsters cowed!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Grimscale murlocs have not been scared off by your efforts. But, I think I know what will send them packing, as well as get me some personal retribution.$b$bThey have a murloc chieftain that calls itself Mmmrrrggglll. It wanders the Golden Strand south of the river inlet. The beast once slew a compatriot of mine, and now wears his ring in open defiance and mockery.$b$bSlay Mmmrrrggglll, and bring back my friend's ring. Then we shall see these monsters cowed!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '從厲鱗首領麻木的爪子中取回魔鉤的戒指，交給在永歌森林裡俯瞰寧靜海岸的懸崖上的海斯維利·桑凱。', `Details` = '厲鱗魚人並沒有被你的努力給嚇跑。但是，我想我知道什麼才會讓他們知難而退，還會給我帶來一些個人的報酬。$b$b他們有一個自稱魔鉤的魚人首領。他會在金色湖岸南邊的海岸閒晃。這隻野獸曾經殺過我一個伙伴，現在竟公然戴著他的戒指，簡直就是一種藐視與嘲笑。$b$b殺了魔鉤，把我朋友的戒指帶回來給我。然後我們就會看到這些怪物受驚嚇的樣子!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8885;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "喔，還好有你，$c！那些黏乎乎的厲鱗魚人搶走了我的貨物！惡癮者把我那一丁點的魔法物品偷走已經夠糟了，這些魚人竟然還偷走剩下的！這個地方怎麼搞的？$B$B你可以幫我奪回我的貨物嗎？我不奢望你把它們全追回來，但如果你能幫我，我會非常感激。那群厲鱗魚人的小茅屋就在金色湖岸的泊地西方和南方，我確定！", Details AC enUS : "Thank goodness for you, $c! Those slimy Grimscale murlocs have pirated away my cargo! It's bad enough that the Wretched have stolen what little magical goods I had, but the murlocs took the rest! What has this land come to?$B$BCould you retrieve my cargo? I can't expect that you'd be able to get all of it back, but I'll be grateful for any of it at this point. It was the Grimscale murlocs in the huts, just to the west and south of the anchorage on the Golden Strand, I'm sure of it!$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Thank goodness for you, $c! Those slimy Grimscale murlocs have pirated away my cargo! It's bad enough that the Wretched have stolen what little magical goods I had, but the murlocs took the rest! What has this land come to?$b$bCould you retrieve my cargo? I can't expect that you'd be able to get all of it back, but I'll be grateful for any of it at this point. It was the Grimscale murlocs in the huts, just to the west and south of the anchorage on the Golden Strand, I'm sure of it!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '喔，還好有你，$c!那些黏乎乎的厲鱗魚人搶走了我的貨物!鄙惡者把我那一丁點的魔法物品偷走已經夠糟了，這些魚人竟然還偷走剩下的!這個地方怎麼搞的?$b$b你可以幫我奪回我的貨物嗎?我不奢望你把它們全追回來，但如果你能幫我，我會非常感激。那群厲鱗魚人的小茅屋就在金色湖岸的泊地西方和南方，我確定!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8886;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "真有趣…你發現的是一個防水的皮管，裡面裝著好幾張紙。看上面的記號，這些紙是航海方針，每張上面都有一樣的簽名，凱利山德拉船長。$B$B你聽說日帆泊地東邊附近有一個小小的防禦營地。或許船長就在那裡？", Details AC enUS : "Interesting... what you have found here is a water-proofed, leather tube containing a number of sheets of parchment. By the markings upon them, the pages are clearly navigation rutters, and each bears the signature of one Captain Kelisendra.$B$BYou've heard of a small, defended camp just east of the nearby Sunsail Anchorage. Maybe the captain is there?" ; Wowhead enUS : "Interesting... what you have found here is a water-proofed, leather tube containing a number of sheets of parchment. By the markings upon them, the pages are clearly navigation rutters, and each bears the signature of one Captain Kelisendra.$b$bYou've heard of a small, defended camp just east of the nearby Sunsail Anchorage. Maybe the captain is there?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '真有趣.....你發現的是一個防水的皮管，裡面裝著好幾張紙。看上面的記號，這些紙是航海方針，每張上面都有一樣的簽名，凱利山德拉船長。$b$b你聽說日帆泊地東邊附近有一個小小的防禦營地。或許船長就在那裡?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8887;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "$C，請聽聽我的困難。因為某些原因，我不方便深入詳談，我決定關閉我設立在附近的學院。幾天前，我派了一個學生，學徒羅勒塞拉斯，去那裡進行這個任務。從此就再也沒有聽到她的消息了。$B$B你願意前往暮萎尖塔看看她的狀況如何，確定她安然無恙嗎？你可以沿著遠行者居所外的小徑往北走，然後在岔路右轉，就能找到那座塔。", Details AC enUS : "$C, hear my request. For reasons that I cannot go into now, I decided to shut down my nearby school. A few days ago, I sent one of my pupils, Apprentice Loralthalis, there with this very task. I have not heard back from her since.$B$BWill you go to Duskwither Spire and check in on her, to make sure that she is well? You'll find it by heading north on the path out of Farstrider Retreat, then go to the right when the road branches." ; Wowhead enUS : "$c, hear my request. For reasons that I cannot go into now, I decided to shut down my nearby school. A few days ago, I sent one of my pupils, Apprentice Loralthalis, there with this very task. I have not heard back from her since.$b$bWill you go to Duskwither Spire and check in on her, to make sure that she is well? You'll find it by heading north on the path out of Farstrider Retreat, then go to the right when the road branches."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '$c，聽好了。因為某些原因我現在不能進去，我決定關閉我附近的尖塔。幾天前，我派了一個學生，學徒羅勒塞拉斯，去那裡進行這個任務。從此就再也沒有聽到她的消息了。$b$b你可以進入暮萎尖塔看看她的狀況如何，確定她安然無恙嗎?你可以沿著遠行者居所外的小徑往北走，就能找到那座塔，然後在岔路右轉。$b$b謝謝你。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8888;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "如你所知，博學者暮萎派我來這裡關閉供應尖塔的能源。有三個開關，分別在塔裡不同的地方。$B$B不幸的是，我來得太晚了，暮萎尖塔已經爬滿了奇怪的魔法生物。在我沒有專業技術可以完成這個任務時，像你這樣的$c，一定可以輕易的辦到吧？", Details AC enUS : "As you may know, Magister Duskwither sent me back here to shut down the power sources that feed the Spire. There are three of them, each located in a different place inside.$B$BUnfortunately, I appear to be too late, and Duskwither Spire has been overrun with strange, magical creatures. While I haven't the expertise to accomplish this task, surely a $c, such as yourself, could do so easily?" ; Wowhead enUS : "As you may know, Magister Duskwither sent me back here to shut down the power sources that feed the Spire. There are three of them, each located in a different place inside.$b$bUnfortunately, I appear to be too late, and Duskwither Spire has been overrun with strange, magical creatures. While I haven't the expertise to accomplish this task, surely a $c, such as yourself, could do so easily?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '如你所知，博學者暮萎派我來這裡關閉供應尖塔的能源。有三個開關，分別在塔裡不同的地方。$b$b不幸的是，我來的太晚了，暮萎尖塔已經爬滿了奇怪的魔法生物。在我沒有專業技術可以完成這個任務時，像你這樣的$c，一定可以輕易的辦到吧?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8889;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "$n，我想請你幫我最後一個忙。你可以將這裡發現的東西轉達給遠行者居所的博學者暮萎嗎？讓他知道我很好，但確定他知道有些學徒已經成為惡癮者的一員。$B$B謝謝你的幫忙！", Details AC enUS : "$N, I have one last favor to ask of you. Would you please relay what's transpired here to Magister Duskwither, back at the Farstrider Retreat? Let him know that I am well, but make certain that he is aware that some of the apprentices have become Wretched.$B$BThank you for your help!" ; Wowhead enUS : "$n, I have one last favor to ask of you. Would you please relay what's transpired here to Magister Duskwither, back at the Farstrider Retreat? Let him know that I am well, but make certain that he is aware that some of the apprentices have become Wretched.$b$bThank you for your help!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '$n，我想請你幫我最後一個忙。你可以將這裡發現的東西轉達給遠行者居所的博學者暮萎嗎?讓他知道我很好，但確定他知道有些學徒已經成為鄙惡者的一員。$b$b謝謝你的幫忙!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8890;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死5名惡癮者暴徒和5名惡癮者流氓並向永歌森林的遊俠迪哥里恩回報。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill 5 Wretched Thugs and 5 Wretched Hooligans and report to Ranger Degolien in Eversong Woods." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill 5 Wretched Thugs and 5 Wretched Hooligans and report to Ranger Degolien in Eversong Woods.",  OLD Details : "日帆泊地已經快被惡癮者那些敗類給淹沒了。只要我們一有援軍就要殺它們個片甲不留，$n。$B$B同時你可以幫我們給他們一點顏色瞧瞧。前往那裡讓他們知道我們不是好欺負的。", Details AC enUS : "Sunsail Anchorage has been overrun by Wretched scum.  As soon as we manage to get reinforcements to the area we'll show those thugs who's boss, $N.$B$BIn the meantime you can help by showing them a bit of discipline.  Go in there and show them we are not to be trifled with.  You will find Sunsail Anchorage just to the west of Fairbreeze Village." ; Wowhead enUS : "Sunsail Anchorage has been overrun by Wretched scum. As soon as we manage to get reinforcements to the area we'll show those thugs who's boss, $n.$b$bIn the meantime you can help by showing them a bit of discipline. Go in there and show them we are not to be trifled with. You will find Sunsail Anchorage just to the west of Fairbreeze Village.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wretched Thug slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wretched Hooligan slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死5名鄙惡者暴徒和5名鄙惡者流氓並向永歌森林的遊俠迪哥里恩回報。', `Details` = '日帆泊地已經快被鄙惡者那些敗類給淹沒了。只要我們一有援軍就要殺它們個片甲不留，$n。$b$b同時你可以幫我們給他們一點顏色瞧瞧。前往那裡讓他們知道我們不是好欺負的。', `Objectivetext1` = '鄙惡者暴徒 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '鄙惡者流氓 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8892;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死6隻法力毒蛇和6隻艾德惡魔再回到永歌森林向暮萎營地的地面守衛者威利坦回報。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill 6 Mana Serpents and 6 Ether Fiends and return to Groundskeeper Wyllithen at Duskwither Grounds in Eversong Woods." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill 6 Mana Serpents and 6 Ether Fiends and return to Groundskeeper Wyllithen at Duskwither Grounds in Eversong Woods.",  OLD Details : "真是可怕，我告訴你！塔裡有奇怪的事發生，博學者和他的學徒紛紛逃跑，然後就是像你知道的那樣，整個地上充斥著這些魔法怪物！而誰告訴了威利坦？沒有人，你知道嗎！$B$B$C，你一定要幫我清理這些鬼東西…有他們四處亂跑我無法維護土地整潔！", Details AC enUS : "It's horrible, I tell you! Strange things happening in the spire, the magister and his apprentices run off, and then the next thing that you know, the whole grounds are overrun with these magical beasties! And who told Wyllithen? No one, that's who!$B$B$C, you've got to help me clear some of these things out... I cannot maintain the grounds while these 'anomalies' are running amok!" ; Wowhead enUS : "It's horrible, I tell you! Strange things happening in the spire, the magister and his apprentices run off, and then the next thing that you know, the whole grounds are overrun with these magical beasties! And who told Wyllithen? No one, that's who!$b$b$c, you've got to help me clear some of these things out... I cannot maintain the grounds while these 'anomalies' are running amok!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Mana Serpent slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Ether Fiend slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死6隻法力毒蛇和6隻艾德惡魔再回到永歌森林向暗木營地的地面守衛者威利坦回報。', `Details` = '真是可怕，我告訴你!塔裡有奇怪的事發生，博學者和他的學徒紛紛逃跑，然後就是像你知道的那樣，整個地上充斥著這些魔法怪物!而誰告訴了威利坦?沒有人，你知道嗎!$b$b$c，你一定要幫我清理這些鬼東西…….有他們四處亂跑我無法維護土地整潔!', `Objectivetext1` = '法力毒蛇 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '艾德惡魔 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8894;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將無記號的信件帶到永歌森林交給北部聖所的地脈看守者凱丹尼斯。", Objectives AC enUS : "Deliver the Unmarked Letter to Ley-Keeper Caidanis at the North Sanctum in Eversong Woods." ; Wowhead enUS : "Deliver the Unmarked Letter to Ley-Keeper Caidanis at the North Sanctum in Eversong Woods.",  OLD Details : "很高興知道你至少有點能力，$n。既然你如此想證明自己，我會給你另一個任務。$B$B這是給地脈看守者凱丹尼斯的信，他是負責維修北部聖所的秘法師。往獵鷹之翼廣場的西南方走你就會找到他。他是個很重要的人物，所以我希望你不要跟他講些無關緊要的瑣事。", Details AC enUS : "I'm pleased to discover that you're at least somewhat competent, $N.  I'll give you another task since you seem so eager to prove yourself.$B$BThis is a letter to Ley-Keeper Caidanis, the arcanist in charge of the upkeep of the North Sanctum.  Go southwest of Falconwing Square  and you will find him.  He is a very important person, so I hope you don't bother him too much with trivial chatter." ; Wowhead enUS : "I'm pleased to discover that you're at least somewhat competent, $n. I'll give you another task since you seem so eager to prove yourself.$b$bThis is a letter to Ley-Keeper Caidanis, the arcanist in charge of the upkeep of the North Sanctum. Go southwest of Falconwing Square and you will find him. He is a very important person, so I hope you don't bother him too much with trivial chatter."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將無記號的信件帶到永歌森林交給北部聖所的牧地看守者凱丹尼斯。', `Details` = '很高興知道你至少有點能力，$n。既然你如此想證明自己，我會給你另一個任務。$b$b這是給牧地看守者凱丹尼斯的信，他是負責維修北部聖所的秘法師。往獵鷹之翼廣場的西南方走你就會找到他。他是個很重要的人物，所以我希望你不要跟他講些無關緊要的瑣事。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8895;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將完美無瑕的信件遞給克萊拉‧迪恩，她在暴風城的銀行外面。", Objectives AC enUS : "Deliver the Immaculate Letter to Colara Dean outside the bank in Stormwind." ; Wowhead enUS : "Deliver the Immaculate Letter to Colara Dean outside the bank in Stormwind."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將完美無暇的信件遞給克萊拉·迪恩，她在暴風城的銀行外面。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8899;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將微皺的筆記送給幽暗城銀行旁的艾妮亞‧ 海頓。", Objectives AC enUS : "Deliver the Slightly Creased Note to Elenia Haydon near the bank in the Undercity." ; Wowhead enUS : "Deliver the Slightly Creased Note to Elenia Haydon near the bank in the Undercity."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將微皺的筆記送給幽暗城銀行旁的艾妮亞· 海頓。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8900;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將深情書寫的信送給幽暗城銀行附近的艾妮亞‧海頓。", Objectives AC enUS : "Deliver the Lovingly Composed Letter to Elenia Haydon near the bank in the Undercity." ; Wowhead enUS : "Deliver the Lovingly Composed Letter to Elenia Haydon near the bank in the Undercity.",  OLD Details : "很久以前，我就和我的青梅竹馬艾妮亞訂下婚約。我已經很多年都不再想她了，但是最近，她又會不時的佔據我的腦海。$b$b或許，即使一切都過去了，每個人的生命中都還有點空間可以容納愛。$b$b我相信她也一定變了。你可以幫我把這封信送給她嗎?我太緊張了，不敢親自拿給她。", Details AC enUS : "A lifetime ago, I was betrothed to marry Elenia, my childhood sweetheart. It's been years since I thought about her last, but of late, she frequently occupies my thoughts.$b$bPerhaps, even with everything that has passed, there can be some room in each other's lives for our love.$b$bI'm sure she has changed, also. Can you deliver this letter to her for me? I am too nervous to give it in person." ; Wowhead enUS : "A lifetime ago, I was betrothed to marry Elenia, my childhood sweetheart. It's been years since I thought about her last, but of late, she frequently occupies my thoughts.$b$bPerhaps, even with everything that has passed, there can be some room in each other's lives for our love.$b$bI'm sure she has changed, also. Can you deliver this letter to her for me? I am too nervous to give it in person."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將深情書寫的信送給幽暗城銀行附近的艾妮亞·海頓。', `Details` = '很久以前，我就和我的青梅竹馬艾妮亞訂下婚約。我已經很多年都不再想她了，但是最近，她又會不時的佔據我的腦海。$b$b或許，即使一切都過去了，每個人的生命中都還有點空間可以容納愛。$b$b我相信她也一定變了。你可以幫我把這封信送給她嗎？我太緊張了，不敢親自拿給她。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8902;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "取得一張暴風城守衛的卡片並帶給暴風城的艾里斯坦‧莫塔。", Objectives AC enUS : "Get a Stormwind Guard's Card and return it to Aristan Mottar in Stormwind." ; Wowhead enUS : "Get a Stormwind Guard's Card and return it to Aristan Mottar in Stormwind.",  OLD Details : "這種像傳染病的愛有些不對勁。這樣不太好，是個眼中釘，而且最糟的是，這對聯盟本身的安全來說也是個威脅。$b$b你想想:要是守衛也感染了這種奇怪的病怎麼辦？我們一定要想個辦法。$b$b找到暴風城裡的一名守衛，看看他們是否已經得到了這愚蠢的病。", Details AC enUS : "There's something unnatural about this epidemic of love. It's not proper, it's an eyesore, and at worst, it could be a threat to the safety of the Alliance itself.$b$bJust think: what if the guards have been taken in by this strange affliction? Something must be done.$b$bGo to one of the guards here in Stormwind and see if they've been caught up in this foolishness." ; Wowhead enUS : "There's something unnatural about this epidemic of love. It's not proper, it's an eyesore, and at worst, it could be a threat to the safety of the Alliance itself.$b$bJust think: what if the guards have been taken in by this strange affliction? Something must be done.$b$bGo to one of the guards here in Stormwind and see if they've been caught up in this foolishness."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '取得一張暴風城守衛的卡片並帶給暴風城的艾里斯坦·莫塔。', `Details` = '這種像傳染病的愛有些不對勁。這樣不太好，是個眼中釘，而且最糟的是，這對所有聯盟的人來說都是個威脅。$b$b你想想：要是守衛也感染了這種奇怪的病怎麼辦？我們一定要想個辦法。$b$b找到暴風城裡的一名守衛，看看他們是否已經得到了這愚蠢的病。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8903;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "取得一張守衛發黴的卡片並帶給幽暗城的芬斯塔德‧阿吉歐。", Objectives AC enUS : "Get a Guardian's Moldy Card and bring it to Fenstad Argyle in the Undercity." ; Wowhead enUS : "Get a Guardian's Moldy Card and bring it to Fenstad Argyle in the Undercity."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '取得一張守衛者的發霉卡片並帶給幽暗城的芬斯塔德·阿吉歐。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8904;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "帶1個古龍水瓶和1個香水瓶給幽暗城鍊金區的藥劑師金格。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 1 Cologne Bottle and 1 Perfume Bottle to Apothecary Zinge in the Undercity's Apothecarium." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 1 Cologne Bottle and 1 Perfume Bottle to Apothecary Zinge in the Undercity's Apothecarium.",  OLD Details : "我想我知道造成最近這種情況的原因。你有沒有在運河上聞過新的香水味?新上市的古龍水和香水?$b$b我們的思想已經被一些邪惡的鍊金術給混亂了。$b$b只有一個方法可以確定 - 帶一瓶古龍水和香水給我的朋友，藥劑師金格。皇家藥劑師學會會找出真相的。$b$b你回來後我會補償你購買香水的錢。", Details AC enUS : "I believe I know the cause of this recent behavior. Have you smelled the new fragrance on the wind, over the stink of the canals? The new colognes and perfumes that have come into fashion?$b$bOur thinking has been clouded by some foul alchemy.$b$bThere is only one way to be sure - bring a bottle of cologne and perfume to my friend, Apothecary Zinge. The Royal Apothecary Society will find the truth.$b$b I will reimburse you for their purchase when you return." ; Wowhead enUS : "I believe I know the cause of this recent behavior. Have you smelled the new fragrance on the wind, over the stink of the canals? The new colognes and perfumes that have come into fashion?$b$bOur thinking has been clouded by some foul alchemy.$b$bThere is only one way to be sure - bring a bottle of cologne and perfume to my friend, Apothecary Zinge. The Royal Apothecary Society will find the truth.$b$bI will reimburse you for their purchase when you return."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '帶1個古龍水瓶和1個香水瓶給幽暗城煉金區的藥劑師金格。', `Details` = '我想我知道造成最近這種情況的原因。你有沒有在運河上聞過新的香水味？新上市的古龍水和香水？$b$b我們的思想已經被一些邪惡的煉金術給混亂了。$b$b只有一個方法可以確定 - 帶一瓶古龍水和香水給我的朋友，藥劑師金格。皇家藥劑學會會找出真相的。$b$b你回來後我會補償你購買香水的錢。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8979;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "前往幽暗城的法師區，到裁縫師的店裡和瑪拉‧瑞尼克談談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Mara Rennick at the tailor's shop in the Undercity's Magic Quarter." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Mara Rennick at the tailor's shop in the Undercity's Magic Quarter.",  OLD Details : "我的產品有什麼問題嗎?嗯，我從沒看過這麼多人都如此想得到一個東西。$b$b我是跟一個叫瑪拉‧瑞尼克的商人購買我的補給的。她是鎮上新來的。$b$b她提到有一些東西要送到法師區的裁縫師那裡。", Details AC enUS : "Something's wrong with my product? Well, I've never seen so many people wanting something so badly.$b$bI bought my supply from a merchant named Mara Rennick. She's new in town.$b$bShe mentioned she had some goods she had to deliver to the tailor in the Magic Quarter." ; Wowhead enUS : "Something's wrong with my product? Well, I've never seen so many people wanting something so badly.$b$bI bought my supply from a merchant named Mara Rennick. She's new in town.$b$bShe mentioned she had some goods she had to deliver to the tailor in the Magic Quarter."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '前往幽暗城的法師區，到裁縫師的店裡和瑪拉·瑞尼克談談。', `Details` = '我的產品有什麼問題嗎？嗯，我從沒看過這麼多人都如此想得到一個東西。$b$b我是跟一個叫瑪拉·瑞尼克的商人購買我的補給。她是鎮上新來的。$b$b她提到有一些東西要送到法師區的裁縫師那裡。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8983;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "越過拉文霍德莊園，找到希爾斯布萊德丘陵上的藥劑師史塔弗隆‧雷倫。", Objectives AC enUS : "Find Apothecary Staffron Lerent in the Hillsbrad Foothills past Ravenholdt Manor." ; Wowhead enUS : "Find Apothecary Staffron Lerent in the Hillsbrad Foothills past Ravenholdt Manor.",  OLD Details : "聽好，盜賊藥劑師的行為並不是我所擔心的。如果他正暗中破壞我們的努力，就讓我第一個指引你正確的方向。$b$b如果他是無辜的，那他也沒什麼好怕的，對嗎?$b$b我這些東西是跟藥劑師史塔弗隆‧雷倫買的。他正在希爾斯布萊德丘陵越過拉文霍德莊園的隱密區域工作。老實跟你說，我覺得他有點怪怪的。", Details AC enUS : "Look, the actions of a rogue apothecary are not my concern. If he's undermining our efforts, then let me be the first to point you in the right direction.$b$bIf he's innocent, then he's got nothing to hide, right?$b$bI purchased the goods from Apothecary Staffron Lerent. He's working in a secluded area past Ravenholdt Manor in the hills over Hillsbrad. To be honest with you, I thought he was a little odd." ; Wowhead enUS : "Look, the actions of a rogue apothecary are not my concern. If he's undermining our efforts, then let me be the first to point you in the right direction.$b$bIf he's innocent, then he's got nothing to hide, right?$b$bI purchased the goods from Apothecary Staffron Lerent. He's working in a secluded area past Ravenholdt Manor in the hills over Hillsbrad. To be honest with you, I thought he was a little odd."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '越過拉文霍德莊園，找到希爾斯布萊德丘陵上的藥劑師史塔弗隆·雷倫。', `Details` = '聽好，盜賊藥劑師的行為並不是我所擔心的。如果他正暗中破壞我們的努力，就讓我第一個指引你正確的方向。$b$b如果他是無辜的，那他也沒什麼好怕的，對嗎？$b$b我這些東西是跟藥劑師史塔弗隆·雷倫買的。他正在希爾斯布萊德丘陵越過拉文霍德莊園的隱密區域工作。老實跟你說，我覺得他有點怪怪的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 8984;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到暴風城運河邊和「最好的線團」那家店的艾佛特‧索里山姆談談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Evert Sorisam at The Finest Thread along Stormwind's Canals." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Evert Sorisam at The Finest Thread along Stormwind's Canals.",  OLD Details : "古龍水發生什麼事了嗎?有可能。我從沒見過有這麼多人都爭相搶購一項商品。$b$b聽著，如果它有什麼問題，我也想知道。我跟一個叫艾佛特‧索里山姆的商人買了補給品。他是鎮上新來的。他提到有一些物品要送到「最好的線團」那家店。", Details AC enUS : "Something funny about the cologne? It's possible. I've never seen so many people after one product like this.$b$bLook, if there's something wrong with it, I want to know, too. I bought my supply from a merchant named Evert Sorisam. He's new in town.$b$bHe mentioned he had some goods he was going to deliver to The Finest Thread." ; Wowhead enUS : "Something funny about the cologne? It's possible. I've never seen so many people after one product like this.$b$bLook, if there's something wrong with it, I want to know, too. I bought my supply from a merchant named Evert Sorisam. He's new in town.$b$bHe mentioned he had some goods he was going to deliver to The Finest Thread."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '到暴風城運河邊和「最好的線團」那家店的艾佛特·索里山姆談談。', `Details` = '古龍水發生什麼事了嗎？有可能。我從沒見過有這麼多人都爭相搶購一項商品。$b$b聽著，如果它有什麼問題，我也想知道。我跟一個叫艾佛特·索里山姆的商人買了補給品。他是鎮上新來的。他提到有一些物品要送到「最好的線團」那家店。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9027;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "找到在希爾斯布萊德丘陵，拉文霍德莊園後方的藥劑師史塔弗隆‧雷倫。", Objectives AC enUS : "Find Apothecary Staffron Lerent in the Hillsbrad Foothills behind Ravenholdt Manor." ; Wowhead enUS : "Find Apothecary Staffron Lerent in the Hillsbrad Foothills behind Ravenholdt Manor.",  OLD Details : "什麼?叛國罪?不，不，我向你保證，我完全沒有惡意。$b$b難道我想幫助那些人減輕痛苦的求愛儀式也有錯嗎?拜託，那不是犯罪。$b$b為了證明我沒有惡意，我甚至可以告訴你我的貨源是誰。$b$b是一個叫史塔弗隆‧雷倫的人運給我的，他是個藥劑師。我從沒跟他講過話。$b$b我們的哥布林經紀人說他在希爾斯布萊德丘陵越過神秘的拉文霍德莊園工作。希望你有那個運氣能找到他。", Details AC enUS : "What? Treason? No, no. I assure you, my intentions are completely harmless.$b$bIs it so wrong to help those who wish to ease the painful ritual of courtship? Come, that is no crime.$b$bAnd to prove that I mean no harm, I will even tell you my source.$b$bThey were shipped to me by a Staffron Lerent, an apothecary of some sort. I never spoke with him.$b$bOur goblin middle man said that he worked in the foothills over Hillsbrad past that mysterious Ravenholdt Manor. I wish you luck in finding him." ; Wowhead enUS : "What? Treason? No, no. I assure you, my intentions are completely harmless.$b$bIs it so wrong to help those who wish to ease the painful ritual of courtship? Come, that is no crime.$b$bAnd to prove that I mean no harm, I will even tell you my source.$b$bThey were shipped to me by a Staffron Lerent, an apothecary of some sort. I never spoke with him.$b$bOur goblin middle man said that he worked in the foothills over Hillsbrad past that mysterious Ravenholdt Manor. I wish you luck in finding him."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '找到在希爾斯布萊德丘陵，拉文霍德莊園後方的藥劑師史塔弗隆·雷倫。', `Details` = '什麼？叛國罪？不，不，我向你保證，我完全沒有惡意。$b$b難道我想幫助那些人減輕痛苦的求愛儀式也有錯嗎？拜託，那不是犯罪。$b$b為了證明我沒有惡意，我甚至可以告訴你我的貨源是誰。$b$b是一個叫史塔弗隆·雷倫的人運給我的，他是個藥劑師。我從沒跟他講過話。$b$b我們的哥布林經紀人說他在希爾斯布萊德丘陵越過神秘的拉文霍德莊園工作。希望你有那個運氣能找到他。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9028;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "嘿，就是你!你一定要幫我，拜託!$B$B我的同伴學徒和我遭到惡癮者的攻擊!由於他們對魔法瘋狂的渴望，拿走了所有可以得手的東西:法力水晶，魔杖，魔法書...所有的東西!$B$B美勒杜跑去追他們了，我得留在這裡看守他們沒拿走的東西。沿著路往下走，看看你能不能幫他一把。", Details AC enUS : "You, there!  You must help me, please!$B$BA fellow apprentice and I were attacked by the Wretched!  In their mad hunger for magic, they took everything they could get their hands on: mana crystals, wands, spellbooks... everything!$B$BMeledor gave chase after them; I had to stay behind and look after what they didn't take.  Continue down the road and see if you can lend him a hand." ; Wowhead enUS : "You, there! You must help me, please!$b$bA fellow apprentice and I were attacked by the Wretched! In their mad hunger for magic, they took everything they could get their hands on: mana crystals, wands, spellbooks... everything!$b$bMeledor gave chase after them; I had to stay behind and look after what they didn't take. Continue down the road and see if you can lend him a hand."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '嘿，就是你!你一定要幫我，拜託!$b$b我的同伴學徒和我遭到鄙惡者的攻擊!由於他們對魔法瘋狂的渴望，拿走了所有可以得手的東西:法力水晶，魔杖，魔法書……所有的東西!$b$b美勒杜跑去追他們了，我得留在這裡看守他們沒拿走的東西。沿著路往下走，看看你能不能幫他一把。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9035;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "浸濕的書頁", Title AC enUS : "Soaked Pages" ; Wowhead enUS : "Soaked Pages",  OLD Details : "那些可惡的惡癮者有人撐腰當然比較囂張。但我們先不要擔心那個。我要先找到我講師的元素魔典。$B$B我非常確定我看到他們其中一個懦夫把它扔進河裡，但我也無法指出正確的位置。如果你找到它的話我會給你一點獎勵的。", Details AC enUS : "Those blasted Wretched sure can run fast at the sight of someone who'll stand up to them.  But let's not worry about that now.  I need to find my instructor's elemental grimoire.$B$BI'm certain I saw one of those cowards throw it into the river but I cannot seem to be able to locate it.  I could use another set of eyes.  I'll throw in a bit of coin if you spot it." ; Wowhead enUS : "Those blasted Wretched sure can run fast at the sight of someone who'll stand up to them. But let's not worry about that now. I need to find my instructor's elemental grimoire.$b$bI'm certain I saw one of those cowards throw it into the river but I cannot seem to be able to locate it. I could use another set of eyes. I'll throw in a bit of coin if you spot it."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '浸溼的書頁', `Details` = '那些可惡的鄙惡者有人撐腰當然比較囂張。但我們先不要擔心那個。我要先找到我講師的元素魔典。$b$b我非常確定我看到他們其中一個懦夫把它扔進河裡，但我也無法指出正確的位置。如果你找到它的話我會給你一點獎勵的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9062;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "安西歐如果知道他的書被毀了一定會大發雷霆。我有一個小建議;別擔心，我會讓你很值得的。$B$B把這本書帶給他，不要告訴他這件意外。如果他問起，就跟他說你不小心把書掉進池塘了。他沒有管你的權利，所以他也不能把你怎樣。$B$B安西歐都在靜語池講課，就在銀月城的東南方。你會為了我們這麼做吧？我會好好獎勵你的！", Details AC enUS : "Antheol is going to fly off his rocker when he finds out his book is ruined.  I've got a little proposal for you; don't worry, I'll make it worth your while.$B$BTake this book to him and tell him nothing of this incident.  If he asks, just tell him you dropped the book into a puddle.  He has no direct authority over you, so there's not much he can do.$B$BAntheol delivers his lectures at Stillwhisper Pond, southeast of Silvermoon.  You'll do this for us, right?  I'll reward you handsomely for this favor!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Antheol is going to fly off his rocker when he finds out his book is ruined. I've got a little proposal for you; don't worry, I'll make it worth your while.$b$bTake this book to him and tell him nothing of this incident. If he asks, just tell him you dropped the book into a puddle. He has no direct authority over you, so there's not much he can do.$b$bAntheol delivers his lectures at Stillwhisper Pond, southeast of Silvermoon. You'll do this for us, right? I'll reward you handsomely for this favor!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '安西歐如果知道他的書被毀了一定會大發雷霆。我有一個小建議;別擔心，我會讓你很值得的。$b$b把這本書帶給他，不要告訴他這件意外。如果他問起，就跟他說你不小心把書掉進池塘了。他沒有管你的權利，所以他也不能把你怎樣。$b$b安西歐都在靜語池講課，就在銀月城的東南方。你會為了我們這麼做吧?我會好好獎勵你的!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9064;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我希望你今天學了有價值的一課，$n。永遠別相信別人會為你說謊。$B$B現在我要你回到我那兩個愚蠢的學生那裡，用這個魔杖教訓他們。我的魔法告訴我只要沿著這條路往西，你就會在死亡之痕的另一邊找到他們了。$B$B完成後再回到我這裡。我會給你一點小獎勵。", Details AC enUS : "I hope you learn a valuable lesson today, $N.  Never trust someone else to lie for you.$B$BNow I want you to go back to my two dimwitted students and discipline them using this wand.  My magic tells me that you'll find them along the road to the west on the other side of the Dead Scar.$B$BCome back to me after you've done this.  I'll give you a small reward for your troubles." ; Wowhead enUS : "I hope you learn a valuable lesson today, $n. Never trust someone else to lie for you.$b$bNow I want you to go back to my two dimwitted students and discipline them using this wand. My magic tells me that you'll find them along the road to the west on the other side of the Dead Scar.$b$bCome back to me after you've done this. I'll give you a small reward for your troubles.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "懲罰學徒美勒杜", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Apprentice Meledor Disciplined" ; Wowhead enUS : "Apprentice Meledor Disciplined",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "懲罰學徒瑞倫", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "Apprentice Ralen Disciplined" ; Wowhead enUS : "Apprentice Ralen Disciplined"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我希望你今天學了有價值的一課，$n。永遠別相信別人會為你說謊。$b$b現在我要你回到我那兩個愚蠢的學生那裡，用這個魔杖教訓他們。我的魔法告訴我只要沿著這條路往西，你就會在死亡之痕的另一邊找到他們了。$b$b完成後再回到我這裡。我會給你一點小獎勵。', `Objectivetext1` = '學徒美勒杜受到了懲罰', `Objectivetext2` = '學徒瑞倫受到了懲罰', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9066;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我喜歡辦派對...只是稍微慶祝一下奎爾薩拉斯的壯麗!$B$B不過我現在缺少人力...我需要你去收集更多的派對物資。$B$B去銀月城的酒莊管理人日觸那裡幫我帶回來一瓶陽光下的特殊美酒，到遠行者居所和莎嵐尼‧初光拿一些美味的泉爪開胃菜。然後你可以在晴風村的海利斯‧晨行者那裡拿回我的煙火。$B$B動作快一點!", Details AC enUS : "I like to throw parties... just a little something to celebrate the magnificence that is Quel'Thalas!$B$BBut, I'm in a bit of a bind.  I need you to gather up more party supplies.$B$BFrom Vinemaster Suntouched at the Silvermoon City inn, bring me a bottle of Suntouched Special Reserve.  From Zalene Firstlight at Farstrider Retreat acquire more of those delicious Springpaw Appetizers.  And you can pick up my delivery of fireworks from Halis Dawnstrider at Fairbreeze Village.$B$BBe quick about it!" ; Wowhead enUS : "I like to throw parties... just a little something to celebrate the magnificence that is Quel'Thalas!$b$bBut, I'm in a bit of a bind. I need you to gather up more party supplies.$b$bFrom Vinemaster Suntouched at the Silvermoon City inn, bring me a bottle of Suntouched Special Reserve. From Zalene Firstlight at Farstrider Retreat acquire more of those delicious Springpaw Appetizers. And you can pick up my delivery of fireworks from Halis Dawnstrider at Fairbreeze Village.$b$bBe quick about it!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我喜歡辦派對……只是稍微慶祝一下奎爾薩拉斯的壯麗!$b$b不過我現在缺少人力……我需要你去收集更多的派對物資。$b$b去銀月城的植物大師·日觸那裡幫我帶回來一瓶陽光下的特殊美酒，到遠行者居所和莎嵐尼·初光拿一些美味的泉爪開胃菜。然後你可以在晴風村的海利斯·晨行者那裡拿回我的煙火。$b$b動作快一點!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9067;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "惡癮者頭目", Title AC enUS : "Wretched Ringleader" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wretched Ringleader",  OLD Objectives : "把阿德倫的頭顱帶給永歌森林日帆船廠附近的微蘭德絲‧白晨。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring Aldaron's Head to Velendris Whitemorn near Sunsail Anchorage in Eversong Woods." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring Aldaron's Head to Velendris Whitemorn near Sunsail Anchorage in Eversong Woods.",  OLD Details : "惡癮者在狼吞虎嚥邪惡魔法的時候非常懈怠，他們根本不知道我們已取回我們的軍備。但是我們也不能總是期望他們保持懈怠。現在就是採取果斷攻擊的時候。讓我們先以他們的首領阿德倫為先例。有人看見他在船廠旁那棟建築物的頂樓。幫我把他的頭帶來，我會好好地獎勵你。", Details AC enUS : "The Wretched are so oblivious, gorging on foul magic, that they haven't realized we've recovered most of our weapons.  We can't expect them to remain in their stupor, though.  Now is the time for a decisive attack.  Let us make an example of their leader, Aldaron.  He was spotted on the top floor of the building by the anchorage.  Bring me his head; I'll reward you suitably." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Wretched are so oblivious, gorging on foul magic, that they haven't realized we've recovered most of our weapons. We can't expect them to remain in their stupor, though. Now is the time for a decisive attack. Let us make an example of their leader, Aldaron. He was spotted on the top floor of the building by the anchorage. Bring me his head; I'll reward you suitably."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '鄙惡者頭目', `Objectives` = '把阿德倫的頭顱帶給永歌森林日帆船廠附近的微蘭德絲·白晨。', `Details` = '鄙惡者在狼吞虎嚥邪惡魔法的時候非常懈怠，他們根本不知道我們已取回我們的軍備。但是我們也不能總是期望他們保持懈怠。現在就是採取果斷攻擊的時候。讓我們先以他們的首領阿德倫為先例。有人看見他在船廠旁那棟建築物的頂樓。幫我把他的頭帶來，我會好好地獎勵你。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9076;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到永歌森林和西部聖所的地脈看守者維蘭妮雅談談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak to Ley-Keeper Velania at the West Sanctum in Eversong Woods." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak to Ley-Keeper Velania at the West Sanctum in Eversong Woods.",  OLD Details : "既然你在這裡，$n，我有一個忙想請你幫。地脈看守者維蘭妮雅的學徒先前來這裡尋求協助。西部聖所那邊顯然出了些問題，但是我又忙於招待我們…最可愛的…矮人訪客。你可以幫我個忙嗎？西部聖所的位置就在這裡的西南邊。", Details AC enUS : "Since you're here, $N, I've a favor to ask you.  Ley-Keeper Velania's apprentice dropped by earlier to ask for assistance.  Apparently there's some malfunction happening at the West Sanctum.  I've been a bit busy entertaining our... most pleasant... dwarven guest.  See if you can give her a hand.  You'll find the West Sanctum southwest of here." ; Wowhead enUS : "Since you're here, $n, I've a favor to ask you. Ley-Keeper Velania's apprentice dropped by earlier to ask for assistance. Apparently there's some malfunction happening at the West Sanctum. I've been a bit busy entertaining our... most pleasant... dwarven guest. See if you can give her a hand. You'll find the West Sanctum southwest of here."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '到永歌森林和西部聖所的牧地看守者維蘭妮雅談談。', `Details` = '既然你在這裡，$n，我有一個忙想請你幫。牧地看守者維蘭妮雅的學徒先前來這裡尋求協助。明顯地在西部聖所有些錯誤運作發生。我又忙於招待我們的……最可愛的……矮人客人。你可以幫我個忙嗎?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9119;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將克爾蘇加德的護符匣帶往東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take the Phylactery of Kel'Thuzad to Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take the Phylactery of Kel'Thuzad to Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",  OLD Details : "骨匣是納克薩瑪斯主人所留下來全部的遺物。你最好是摧毀骨匣以防巫妖再次形成。幸好，你很少聽信內心的理智。$B$B聖光之願的某人會為此給予你極大的獎勵。誰在乎科爾蘇加德再生至全能力量?", Details AC enUS : "The phylactery is all that remains of the master of Naxxramas. Your better judgment dictates that you destroy the phylactery, preventing the lich from ever reforming. Thankfully, you seldom listen to that internal voice of reason.$B$BSomeone at Light's Hope will pay you hugely for this artifact. Who cares if Kel'Thuzad regenerates to full power?" ; Wowhead enUS : "The phylactery is all that remains of the master of Naxxramas. Your better judgment dictates that you destroy the phylactery, preventing the lich from ever reforming. Thankfully, you seldom listen to that internal voice of reason.$b$bSomeone at Light's Hope will pay you hugely for this artifact. Who cares if Kel'Thuzad regenerates to full power?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將科爾蘇加德的骨匣帶到東瘟疫之地的聖光之願禮拜堂。', `Details` = '骨匣是納克薩瑪斯主人所留下來全部的遺物。你最好是摧毀骨匣以防巫妖再次形成。幸好，你很少聽信內心的理智。$b$b聖光之願的某人會為此給予你極大的獎勵。誰在乎科爾蘇加德再生至全能力量?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9120;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "恐怖之城，納克薩瑪斯", Title AC enUS : "The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas",  OLD Objectives : "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的大法師安吉拉·杜薩圖斯需要5塊奧術水晶、2塊連結水晶、1個正義寶珠和60金幣。你在銀色黎明中的聲望必須達到尊敬。", Objectives AC enUS : "Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 5 Arcane Crystals, 2 Nexus Crystals, 1 Righteous Orb and 60 gold pieces. You must also be Honored with the Argent Dawn.$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 5 Arcane Crystals, 2 Nexus Crystals, 1 Righteous Orb and 60 gold pieces. You must also be Honored with the Argent Dawn.",  OLD Details : "病木林深處就是納克薩瑪斯的宮殿入口。那兒的符文傳送門被魔法結界籠罩，一般人是根本進不去的，不過現在不一樣了。$B$B我們已經想出了破除結界的方法——奧術遮罩。我對肯瑞托古老的咒語進行了一些修改，使它具備了破除納克薩瑪斯結界的能力。但是你在銀色黎明的聲望還不高，$N，因此你需要支付一大筆錢。或者當你的聲望達到崇敬或是崇拜時再來找我，我會給你打折的。", Details AC enUS : "In the thick of Plaguewood lies the entrance to the dread citadel of Naxxramas. Previously, all attempts to enter had been stymied by the magical wards placed upon the rune portal. That is, until now.$B$BWe have devised a way to gain entry via arcane cloaking - an old cantrip of the Kirin Tor with a few modifications of my own. Since your dedication to the cause of the Dawn is somewhat lacking, $N, the price will be high. You may decline and choose to return when you are revered or exalted for a discount." ; Wowhead enUS : "In the thick of Plaguewood lies the entrance to the dread citadel of Naxxramas. Previously, all attempts to enter had been stymied by the magical wards placed upon the rune portal. That is, until now.$b$bWe have devised a way to gain entry via arcane cloaking - an old cantrip of the Kirin Tor with a few modifications of my own. Since your dedication to the cause of the Dawn is somewhat lacking, $n, the price will be high. You may decline and choose to return when you are revered or exalted for a discount.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Argent Dawn"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '可怕的堡壘 - 納克薩瑪斯', `Objectives` = '東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的大法師安琪拉·多桑杜需要5個秘法水晶，2個聯結水晶，1個正義寶珠和60金。你一定要在銀色黎明達到尊敬聲望。', `Details` = '在濃密的病木林裡有個入口通往納克薩瑪斯的可怕堡壘。以前，任何想嘗試進入的人都被符文傳送門外的魔法守衛擋下來。直到現在。$b$b我們設計了一個方法，透過一個永久的秘法掩護 - 肯瑞托的古老咒語加上一些我自己做的修改。說到這，那個披風是要錢的。由於你對銀色黎明的貢獻稍嫌不足，$n;價格會不低。你可以選擇達到崇敬或崇拜後再來換取折扣。', `Objectivetext1` = '銀色黎明', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9121;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "地穴追獵者護甲的材料……", Title AC enUS : "Cryptstalker Armor Doesn't Make Itself..." ; Wowhead enUS : "Cryptstalker Armor Doesn't Make Itself...",  OLD Details : "你想賺到這些亮閃閃的玩意兒嗎？$B$B<雷奧普德舉起一枚十字軍徽記。>$B$B我有點小麻煩，或許你能幫得上忙，$N。瞧，我會為那些敢於進入納克薩瑪斯宮殿的勇士們製作地穴追獵者套裝。雖然他們能為我提供所需的主要材料，但是我還需要地穴魔的碎塊。把一組碎塊交給我，我會送你一枚十字軍徽記作為獎勵的，這東西在軍需官那兒大有用處。", Details AC enUS : "How would you like to earn yourself one of these shiny coins?$B$B<Leopold holds up an insignia of the Crusade.>$B$BI've got a little problem that you might be able to help me with, $N. You see, I make Cryptstalker armor for those daft enough to venture into Naxxramas. While they supply me with the core material requirements for the armor, I always run out of the crypt fiend parts. Bring me back a bundle of parts and I'll pay you with an insignia - usable at the quartermaster." ; Wowhead enUS : "How would you like to earn yourself one of these shiny coins?$b$b<Leopold holds up an insignia of the Crusade.>$b$bI've got a little problem that you might be able to help me with, $n. You see, I make Cryptstalker armor for those daft enough to venture into Naxxramas. While they supply me with the core material requirements for the armor, I always run out of the crypt fiend parts. Bring me back a bundle of parts and I'll pay you with an insignia - usable at the quartermaster."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '地穴行者護甲的零件……', `Details` = '想不想自己賺一些閃亮的錢幣啊?$b$b<里歐波拿著一枚十字軍的徽記。>$b$b我有一個小麻煩你或許能幫我，$n。你知道，我為那些夠愚笨想進入納克薩瑪斯的人製作地穴行者護甲。雖然他們會給我製作護甲需要的熔核材料，我還是缺少地穴惡魔部位。幫我帶一束回來，我就會給你一枚徽記 - 可以在軍需官那裡使用。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9124;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "骨鐮的材料", Title AC enUS : "Bonescythe Digs" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bonescythe Digs",  OLD Details : "打造胡裡奧的骨鐮護甲需要大量白骨碎片。雖然那些勇敢的傢伙們已經從納克薩瑪斯的宮殿中為我取回了重要材料，但是我還需要白骨碎片。$B$B你覺得怎麼樣？想接受這項任務，順便殺些天災士兵嗎？這可是件雙贏的好事兒。", Details AC enUS : "Don Julio's Bonescythe armor pattern requires bone fragments - a lot of bone fragments. While those crazy enough to venture into Naxxramas provide me with enough of the core materials to make the armor, I'm always looking for more Scourge bone fragments.$B$BSo what do you think? Interested in getting your hands dirty and destroying some Scourge at the same time? It's a win-win situation." ; Wowhead enUS : "Don Julio's Bonescythe armor pattern requires bone fragments - a lot of bone fragments. While those crazy enough to venture into Naxxramas provide me with enough of the core materials to make the armor, I'm always looking for more Scourge bone fragments.$b$bSo what do you think? Interested in getting your hands dirty and destroying some Scourge at the same time? It's a win-win situation."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '骨鐮掘鏟', `Details` = '胡力歐的骨鐮護甲樣式需要骨頭碎片 - 大量的骨頭碎片。雖然那些瘋狂的人會冒險進入納克薩瑪斯為我帶來足夠的熔核材料製作護甲，但我總是在尋找更多的天譴軍團骨頭碎片。$b$b你覺得怎麼樣?有興趣捲起袖子殺幾個天譴軍團的人嗎?這是個雙贏的情勢。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9126;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "元素交易", Title AC enUS : "The Elemental Equation" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Elemental Equation",  OLD Objectives : "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的大法師安吉拉·杜薩圖斯要30個元素之核。", Objectives AC enUS : "Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 30 Core of Elements.$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 30 Core of Elements.",  OLD Details : "冒險者，你好啊！你對這兒的工作感興趣嗎？如果你替我做事的話，我會給你這些徽記作為報酬的。你可以用它們在軍需官那裡購買各種物品。$B$B我只需要元素之核，越多越好！$B$B你在整個艾澤拉斯世界都可以找到形狀尺寸各異的元素之核。", Details AC enUS : "Greetings, adventurer! Are you interested in some work? I pay those under my employ with insignias. These insignias can be used at the Quartermaster to purchase items of power.$B$BAll I need you to do is bring me as many core of elements as you can carry. The more the better!$B$BYou'll find them on elementals of varying shapes and sizes that exist across our world." ; Wowhead enUS : "Greetings, adventurer! Are you interested in some work? I pay those under my employ with insignias. These insignias can be used at the Quartermaster to purchase items of power.$b$bAll I need you to do is bring me as many core of elements as you can carry. The more the better!$b$bYou'll find them on elementals of varying shapes and sizes that exist across our world."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '元素方程式', `Objectives` = '東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的大法師安琪拉·多桑杜要30個元素之核。', `Details` = '你好冒險者!你有興趣接一些工作嗎?我付徽記給我底下工作的人。這些徽記可以在軍需官那裡購買能量的物品。$b$b我要你做的就是盡可能給我帶來元素之核。越多越好!$b$b你會在我們世界中不同形狀大小的元素上找到它們。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9128;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將珊希歐的提貨單交給晴風村裡的飛行師明曦。", Objectives AC enUS : "Deliver Quartermaster Lymel's Bill of Lading to Skymaster Sunwing in Tranquillien." ; Wowhead enUS : "Deliver Quartermaster Lymel's Bill of Lading to Skymaster Sunwing in Tranquillien.",  OLD Details : "歡迎，志願者!我們現在物資稍嫌短缺，但銀月城已允諾給予我們物資上的援助。這就是你派上用場的地方了。$B$B我要你帶著這個提貨單去找飛行師明曦。他會給你進一步的指示，告訴你如何快速到達銀月城。", Details AC enUS : "Welcome volunteer!  We're running low on supplies here, but the blood elves have promised us materiel assistance.  That's where you come in.$B$BTake this bill of lading over to Skymaster Sunwing. He'll have further instructions for you on how best to get up to Silvermoon City." ; Wowhead enUS : "Welcome volunteer! We're running low on supplies here, but the blood elves have promised us materiel assistance. That's where you come in.$b$bTake this bill of lading over to Skymaster Sunwing. He'll have further instructions for you on how best to get up to Silvermoon City."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把軍需官里莫的提貨單送到安寧地的飛行師·日翼那裡。', `Details` = '歡迎志願者!我們現在物資稍嫌短缺，但血精靈已允諾給我們物資上的援助。那是你剛剛走進來的地方。$b$b我要你帶著這個提貨單去找飛行師·日翼。他會給你進一步的指示，告訴你如何快速到達銀月城。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9130;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "無畏護甲的材料", Title AC enUS : "Binding the Dreadnaught" ; Wowhead enUS : "Binding the Dreadnaught",  OLD Details : "你有見過無畏套裝嗎，$C？噢，你當然沒有見過。你還是個$G小夥子:姑娘;，孩子。讓我來告訴你吧，無畏套裝是一套象徵著榮耀的護甲。$B$B你或許會問，這跟你有什麼關係呢？我要說的是，如果你有黑鐵碎片的話，我會很樂意統統買下的。$B$B我需要這些碎片為勇士們打造無畏套裝。把碎片給我，你會得到報酬的。", Details AC enUS : "Have you ever seen Dreadnaught armor, $c? No, of course you haven't. You're still a $g boy:girl; - a tyke. Let me tell you, it is glorious.$B$BYou're probably asking yourself what any of this has to do with you, right? I'll tell you what, scrub; I need Dark Iron scraps and I'm willing to pay to get my hands on as many as possible.$B$BI need the scraps to put together sets of Dreadnaught for our champions. Bring me scraps and get paid." ; Wowhead enUS : "Have you ever seen Dreadnaught armor, $c? No, of course you haven't. You're still a $gboy:girl - a tyke. Let me tell you, it is glorious.$b$bYou're probably asking yourself what any of this has to do with you, right? I'll tell you what, scrub; I need Dark Iron scraps and I'm willing to pay to get my hands on as many as possible.$b$bI need the scraps to put together sets of Dreadnaught for our champions. Bring me scraps and get paid."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '訂做無畏護甲', `Details` = '你有看過無畏護甲嗎，$c?沒有，你當然沒看過。你還是個$g小男孩:小女孩 - 一個小頑童。讓我告訴你，它超棒的。$b$b你大概在問你自己這和你有什麼關係，對吧?我跟你說，蠢蛋;我需要黑鐵碎塊，我願意付錢，碎塊越多越好。$b$b我需要碎塊為我們的戰士組成無畏套裝。幫我帶碎塊來就能拿錢。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9131;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "飛回銀月城並將珊希歐的提貨單交給銀月城的賽詩倫‧蒼曦。", Objectives AC enUS : "Purchase a flight to Silvermoon City and deliver Quartermaster Lymel's Bill of Lading to Sathren Azuredawn in Silvermoon City." ; Wowhead enUS : "Purchase a flight to Silvermoon City and deliver Quartermaster Lymel's Bill of Lading to Sathren Azuredawn in Silvermoon City.",  OLD Details : "$C，你只要付一點點錢給我，我就可以讓你坐在這種極佳的野獸身上快速地翱翔空中。而且這比在這邊走路要安全多了，我向你保證!$B$B等你到了銀月城，去找商店街的賽詩倫‧蒼曦。$B$B等你決定好要在空中飛翔後再和我談談。", Details AC enUS : "$C, for a very modest amount of coin, I can send you swiftly flying through the air on one of these magnificent beasts.  And, it's safer than walking there, I can assure you!$B$BWhen you arrive in Silvermoon City, seek out Sathren Azuredawn in the Bazaar.$B$BSpeak with me once more when you've decided you're ready to brave the skies." ; Wowhead enUS : "$c, for a very modest amount of coin, I can send you swiftly flying through the air on one of these magnificent beasts. And, it's safer than walking there, I can assure you!$b$bWhen you arrive in Silvermoon City, seek out Sathren Azuredawn in the Bazaar.$b$bSpeak with me once more when you've decided you're ready to brave the skies."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '飛回銀月城並將軍需官里莫的提貨單交給銀月城的賽詩倫·藍晨。', `Details` = '$c，你只要付一點點錢給我，我就可以讓你坐在這種極佳的野獸身上快速地翱翔空中。而且這比在這邊走路要安全多了，我向你保證!$b$b等你到了銀月城，去找商店街的賽詩倫·藍晨。$b$b等你決定好要在空中飛翔後再和我談談。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9133;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "女飛行師薄暮", Title AC enUS : "Skymistress Gloaming" ; Wowhead enUS : "Skymistress Gloaming",  OLD Objectives : "將珊希歐的貨物帶給銀月城牧羊人之門外的女飛行師薄暮。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring Quartermaster Lymel's Goods to Skymistress Gloaming just outside Silvermoon City's Shepherd's Gate." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring Quartermaster Lymel's Goods to Skymistress Gloaming just outside Silvermoon City's Shepherd's Gate.",  OLD Details : "嗯，你看起來不像有台運貨車或馱獸的樣子，所以我最好只讓你帶回能負擔的量就好了。如果你已經和晴風村的飛行師明曦談過話，那你就要盡快飛回去把這個送給珊希歐。$B$B把這些貨物送給銀月城牧羊人之門外的女飛行師薄暮做最後的檢驗。", Details AC enUS : "It doesn't look as if you have a cart or a beast of burden with you, so I'd better send you back only with what you can carry.  If you've spoken with Skymaster Sunwing at Tranquillien, then you should get this to Quartermaster Lymel as soon as possible by flying back.$B$BTake these goods for final inspection to Skymistress Gloaming just outside Silvermoon City's Shepherd's Gate." ; Wowhead enUS : "It doesn't look as if you have a cart or a beast of burden with you, so I'd better send you back only with what you can carry. If you've spoken with Skymaster Sunwing at Tranquillien, then you should get this to Quartermaster Lymel as soon as possible by flying back.$b$bTake these goods for final inspection to Skymistress Gloaming just outside Silvermoon City's Shepherd's Gate."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '女飛行師·薄暮', `Objectives` = '將軍需官里莫的物品帶給銀月城牧羊人之門外的女飛行師·薄暮。', `Details` = '嗯，你看起來不像有台運貨車或馱獸的樣子，所以我只讓你帶回能裝載的量好了。如果你已經和安寧地的飛行師·日翼談過了，那你就要盡快飛回去把這個送給軍需官里莫。$b$b把這些貨物送給銀月城牧羊人之門外的女飛行師·薄暮做最後的檢驗。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9134;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "回去找珊希歐", Title AC enUS : "Return to Quartermaster Lymel" ; Wowhead enUS : "Return to Quartermaster Lymel",  OLD Objectives : "使用飛行服務回到永歌森林的飛行師明曦，並將珊希歐貨物送到珊希歐那裡。", Objectives AC enUS : "Purchase a flight back to Tranquillien in the Ghostlands and deliver Quartermaster Lymel's Goods to Quartermaster Lymel at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Purchase a flight back to Tranquillien in the Ghostlands and deliver Quartermaster Lymel's Goods to Quartermaster Lymel at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",  OLD Details : "我已經全部都檢查過了。$B$B所以問題是，你和晴風村的飛行師明曦談過了嗎?如果是，事情就很簡單，付點小旅費，快點飛回那裡。$B$B等你準備好了再跟我說。", Details AC enUS : "It all checks out as far as I can tell.  Seems to me that the Forsaken have put their backs to the wall for us and we owe them, even if they are all ugly and rotting.$B$BSo, the question is, have you already spoken to Skymaster Sunwing in Tranquillien?  If so, then this can be as simple as you paying the small fare and quickly flying back.$B$BLet me know when you're ready." ; Wowhead enUS : "It all checks out as far as I can tell. Seems to me that the Forsaken have put their backs to the wall for us and we owe them, even if they are all ugly and rotting.$b$bSo, the question is, have you already spoken to Skymaster Sunwing in Tranquillien? If so, then this can be as simple as you paying the small fare and quickly flying back.$b$bLet me know when you're ready."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '回到軍需官里莫那裡', `Objectives` = '飛回鬼魂之地的安寧地，將軍需官里莫的貨物帶回鬼魂之地交給安寧地的軍需官里莫。', `Details` = '我已經全部都檢查過了。在我看來被遺忘者已經為我們做好一切的準備了，即使他們全都又醜又腐敗，我們還是欠他們一份人情。$b$b所以問題是，你和安寧地的飛行師·日翼談過了嗎?如果是，那麼你就付了錢，快點飛回那裡。$b$b等你準備好再讓我知道。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9135;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我為進入夢幻步行者納克薩瑪斯的勇敢英雄製作一種特殊的護甲。他們能提供我大部份製作的材料，但我總是在尋找能夠從我們世界的野性植物群取得野性藻葉的人。$B$B你可能覺得這個任務過於簡單，但沒有藻葉也不能製作護甲。$B$B我還有一個獨特的身分能夠讓你選擇支柱我資金的黎明或十字軍徽記。", Details AC enUS : "I make a special type of armor for the brave heroes that enter Naxxramas known as Dreamwalker. They are able to provide me with most of the materials I require but I am always looking for those able to retrieve savage fronds from the flora of our world.$B$BYou may think of this job as beneath you, but without the fronds, the armor could not be made.$B$BI am also in a unique position to pay you with an insignia of your choice as both the Dawn and the Crusade supply me with funds.$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "I make a special type of armor for the brave heroes that enter Naxxramas known as Dreamwalker. They are able to provide me with most of the materials I require but I am always looking for those able to retrieve savage fronds from the flora of our world.$b$bYou may think of this job as beneath you, but without the fronds, the armor could not be made.$b$bI am also in a unique position to pay you with an insignia of your choice as both the Dawn and the Crusade supply me with funds."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我為進入夢幻步行者納克薩瑪斯的勇敢英雄製作一種特殊的護甲。他們能提供我大部份製作的材料，但我總是在尋找能夠從我們世界的野性植物群取得野性藻葉的人。$b$b你可能覺得這個任務過於簡單，但沒有藻葉也不能製作護甲。$b$b我還有一個獨特的身分能夠讓你選擇支柱我資金的黎明或十字軍徽記。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9136;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我們被包圍了，$c。外圍的村子都被天譴軍團碾平了。$B$B你必須立刻朝東北方前往日冠村並對付奈幽蟲族的天譴勢力。你千萬不能放過它們，它們長得就像蜘蛛一樣的怪物。$B$B沒有時間可以浪費了…一定要收復奎爾薩拉斯！", Details AC enUS : "We're surrounded here, $c.  The outlying villages have all been overrun by the Scourge!$B$BYou must head northeast to Suncrown Village immediately and deal with the Nerubian Scourge menace.  You can't miss them - they're spider-like creatures.$B$BThere's no time to waste.... Quel'Thalas must be reclaimed!" ; Wowhead enUS : "We're surrounded here, $c. The outlying villages have all been overrun by the Scourge!$b$bYou must head northeast to Suncrown Village immediately and deal with the Nerubian Scourge menace. You can't miss them - they're spider-like creatures.$b$bThere's no time to waste.... Quel'Thalas must be reclaimed!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Nerubis Guard slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我們全都圍繞在這裡，$c。邊遠的村子都被天譴軍團侵犯了。$b$b你必需立刻朝東北方前往日冠村並對付奈幽蟲族的天譴勢力。你千萬不能放過它們 - 它們長得就像蜘蛛一樣的怪物。$b$b沒有時間可以浪費了……一定要收復奎爾薩拉斯!', `Objectivetext1` = '奈幽碧斯守衛 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9138;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我們已經有了一次成功的經驗，但是，還有兩個村子也需要對付!$B$B金霧村是我們下一個目標。它在西北邊，過去由住在那裡的高等精靈鬼魂接管。很可怕，我知道，但這些是對抗天譴軍團的策略。$B$B前往那裡擊敗鬼魂和怨靈，$c。順著西邊的路走出安寧地到達那裡。", Details AC enUS : "We've had one success, but there are two more villages that must be reclaimed!$B$BGoldenmist Village is our next target. It lies to the northwest, and has been taken by the ghosts of the high elves that used to live there. Gruesome, I know, but these are apparently the sorts of tactics that the Scourge like to employ.$B$BGo and defeat these ghosts and wraiths, $c. Take the west road out of Tranquillien to get there." ; Wowhead enUS : "We've had one success, but there are two more villages that must be reclaimed!$b$bGoldenmist Village is our next target. It lies to the northwest, and has been taken by the ghosts of the high elves that used to live there. Gruesome, I know, but these are apparently the sorts of tactics that the Scourge like to employ.$b$bGo and defeat these ghosts and wraiths, $c. Take the west road out of Tranquillien to get there.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Quel'dorei Ghost slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Quel'dorei Wraith slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我們已經有了一次成功的經驗，但是，還有兩個村子也需要對付!$b$b金霧村是我們下一個目標。它在西北邊，過去由住在那裡的高等精靈鬼魂接管。很可怕，我知道，但這些是對抗天譴軍團的策略。$b$b前往那裡擊敗鬼魂和怨靈，$c。順著西邊的路走出安寧地到達那裡。', `Objectivetext1` = '奎爾多雷鬼魂 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '奎爾多雷怨靈 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9139;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "$n，最後一場對抗鬼魂之地村莊的戰役就要來臨。西南邊的風行者村已被一支更強大的天譴軍團突擊兵、鬼怪和怪獸接管了。我需要你再次帶領我們的防禦先鋒去削弱他們的勢力。$B$B但是附近太陽聖所的博學者提出了特別的要求;他們要研究這些天譴軍團的遺物以找出有效的方法來擊敗他們。$B$B祝你好運!", Details AC enUS : "$N, the final battle against the Ghostlands villages is upon you. Windrunner Village to the southwest has been overrun by a large force of the more powerful Scourge shocktroopers; shades and gargoyles. You will be the spearpoint of our offensive by thinning out their numbers.$B$BThe magisters at the nearby Sanctum of the Sun have made a special request this time; they want the remains from these Scourge to study in hopes of finding creative ways of fighting them.$B$BGood hunting!" ; Wowhead enUS : "$n, the final battle against the Ghostlands villages is upon you. Windrunner Village to the southwest has been overrun by a large force of the more powerful Scourge shocktroopers; shades and gargoyles. You will be the spearpoint of our offensive by thinning out their numbers.$b$bThe magisters at the nearby Sanctum of the Sun have made a special request this time; they want the remains from these Scourge to study in hopes of finding creative ways of fighting them.$b$bGood hunting!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '$n，最後一場對抗鬼魂之地村莊的戰役就要來臨。西南邊的風行者村已被一支更強大的天譴軍團突擊兵、鬼怪和怪獸接管了。我需要你再次帶領我們的防禦先鋒去削弱他們的勢力。$b$b但是附近太陽聖所的博學者提出了特別的要求;他們要研究這些天譴軍團的遺物以找出有效的方法來擊敗他們。$b$b祝你好運!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9140;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你想要一份令狀?什麼?你一出現我就要把一份高詢問度的工作令交給你?我不這麼認為，笨蛋。全世界的工匠都爭相搶著前線這裡的工作，你必須向我證明你願意為理想流血流汗。幫我帶來勇氣勳章我們再談。$B$B只有一個方法能讓你骯髒的小蠢手得到勳章 - 大開殺戒!", Details AC enUS : "You want a writ? What? Do you expect me to hand you a highly sought after work order just for showing up? I think not, scrub. Crafters from around the world bid for jobs here at the front lines.$B$BIf you want a work order, you'll have to show me that you're willing to bleed for the cause. Bring me a valor token and we'll talk.$B$BAnd there's only one way to get your grubby little scrub mitts on those - get to killin'." ; Wowhead enUS : "You want a writ? What? Do you expect me to hand you a highly sought after work order just for showing up? I think not, scrub. Crafters from around the world bid for jobs here at the front lines.$b$bIf you want a work order, you'll have to show me that you're willing to bleed for the cause. Bring me a valor token and we'll talk.$b$bAnd there's only one way to get your grubby little scrub mitts on those - get to killin'."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你想要一份令狀?什麼?你一出現我就要把一份高詢問度的工作令交給你?我不這麼認為，笨蛋。全世界的工匠都爭相搶著前線這裡的工作，你必須向我證明你願意為理想流血流汗。幫我帶來勇氣勳章我們再談。$b$b只有一個方法能讓你骯髒的小蠢手得到勳章 - 大開殺戒!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9141;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "中尉沒有先評估狀況就直接派我們上戰場與湖那邊的食人妖作戰，我們的部隊被他的愚蠢害慘了！你聽到我說什麼了嗎，湯瑪索？你這個白痴！$B$B你會幫我們吧，$c？ 這些食人妖仍然需要處理一下，而我必須留在這保護這傢伙 -- 我想他已經瘋了。$B$B只要往東走到湖的另一邊進入札布索拉。我要復仇…帶一些他們的耳朵回來給我，這樣我就可以做一條漂亮的項鍊了。", Details AC enUS : "The lieutenant here rushed us into battle with the trolls across the lake instead of scouting the situation first. We were decimated by his stupidity! You hear me Tomathren? You're an idiot!$B$BWill you help us, $c? Those trolls still need to be dealt with. I need to stay here and nursemaid him -- I think he's lost his mind.$B$BJust head east to the other side of the lake into Zeb'Sora. I want revenge... bring me their ears so that I can fashion a nice necklace!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The lieutenant here rushed us into battle with the trolls across the lake instead of scouting the situation first. We were decimated by his stupidity! You hear me Tomathren? You're an idiot!$b$bWill you help us, $c? Those trolls still need to be dealt with. I need to stay here and nursemaid him -- I think he's lost his mind.$b$bJust head east to the other side of the lake into Zeb'Sora. I want revenge... bring me their ears so that I can fashion a nice necklace!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '中尉沒有先評估狀況就直接派我們上戰場與湖那邊的食人妖作戰，我們的部隊被他的愚蠢害慘了!你聽到我說什麼了嗎，湯瑪索?你這個白痴!$b$b你會幫我們吧，$c? 這些食人妖仍然需要處理一下，而我必須留在這保護這傢伙 -- 我想他已經瘋了。$b$b只要往東走到湖的另一邊進入札布索拉。我要復仇……帶一些他們的耳朵回來給我，這樣我就可以做一條漂亮的項鍊了。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9143;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我的姪子幾天前被派到鬼魂之地去。他從沒提過關於任務的事，只有說是極機密的類型。$B$B他之後再也沒回來，我擔心最糟的事會發生，$c。一個失蹤的信差對冷酷無情的銀月城博學者來說可能不算什麼，但他的父母將他托付給我。他就像是我自己的孩子一樣。拜託，$n，可以幫忙找找他嗎？", Details AC enUS : "My nephew was sent into the Ghostlands a few days ago.  He never mentioned anything about his task, except that it was of an extremely secret nature.$B$BHe never returned and I fear for the worst, $c.  A missing messenger might not mean much to the callous magisters of Silvermoon, but he's like a son to me.  Please, $N, will you look for him?" ; Wowhead enUS : "My nephew was sent into the Ghostlands a few days ago. He never mentioned anything about his task, except that it was of an extremely secret nature.$b$bHe never returned and I fear for the worst, $c. A missing messenger might not mean much to the callous magisters of Silvermoon, but he's like a son to me. Please, $n, will you look for him?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我的姪子幾天前被派到鬼魂之地去。他從沒提過關於任務的事，只有說是極機密的類型。$b$b他之後再也沒回來，我擔心最糟的事會發生，$n。一個失蹤的信差對冷酷無情的銀月城博學者來說可能不算什麼，但他的父母將他托付給我。他就像是我自己的孩子一樣。拜託，$n，可以幫忙找找他嗎?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9144;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "$C，我不能枯坐在這裡等待高階執行官或阿莉法娜奧絲夫人接見我!這可不能等!$B$B我們要到艾蘭達之湖東北邊對付札布索拉的影松食人妖。但是中尉沒有處理好這次的攻擊使我們失去了很多遠行者。接著之後他就一蹶不振了。遊俠瓦拉娜派我來這裡，而遊俠沙里莎則是被派往旅行者營地尋求協助。$B$B請找到他們，$c。瓦拉娜傷的很重而中尉一點用處都沒有。", Details AC enUS : "$C, I can't just sit here waiting for an audience with the high executor or Dame Auriferous! This cannot wait!$B$BWe were dealing with the Shadowpine trolls of Zeb'Sora to the northeast across Lake Elrendar. But the lieutenant mishandled the attack and we lost a lot of Farstriders. Then he just fell to pieces afterward.  Ranger Valanna sent me here, and Ranger Salissa to the Farstrider Enclave for help.$B$BPlease find them, $c. Valanna was badly injured and the lieutenant's useless." ; Wowhead enUS : "$c, I can't just sit here waiting for an audience with the high executor or Dame Auriferous! This cannot wait!$b$bWe were dealing with the Shadowpine trolls of Zeb'Sora to the northeast across Lake Elrendar. But the lieutenant mishandled the attack and we lost a lot of Farstriders. Then he just fell to pieces afterward. Ranger Valanna sent me here, and Ranger Salissa to the Farstrider Enclave for help.$b$bPlease find them, $c. Valanna was badly injured and the lieutenant's useless."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '$c，我不能枯坐在這裡等待高級執行官或阿莉法娜奧絲夫人接見我!這可不能等!$b$b我們要到艾蘭達之湖東北邊對付札布索拉的影松食人妖。但是中尉沒有處理好這次的攻擊使我們失去了很多遠行者。接著之後他就一蹶不振了。遊俠瓦拉娜派我來這裡，而遊俠沙里莎則是被派往遠行者營地尋求協助。$b$b請找到他們，$c。瓦拉娜傷的很重而中尉一點用處都沒有。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9145;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到鬼魂之地的艾蘭達之湖南邊，和旅行者營地的希里歐斯隊長談談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Captain Helios at the Farstrider Enclave on the southern shore of Lake Elrendar in the Ghostlands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Captain Helios at the Farstrider Enclave on the southern shore of Lake Elrendar in the Ghostlands.",  OLD Details : "$c，我要請你幫最後一個忙。以防萬一遊俠沙里莎沒辦法回到湖南邊的旅行者營地，我要你去那裡幫忙。$B$B和希里歐斯隊長談談，讓他知道這裡發生了什麼事。我相信他會盡快派支援回來。", Details AC enUS : "I need one last favor of you, $c.  Just in case Ranger Salissa didn't make it back to Farstrider Enclave on the south edge of the lake, I need you to go there and get help.$B$BJust check in with Captain Helios and let him know what's happened here.  I'm sure he'll send help back as soon as he can." ; Wowhead enUS : "I need one last favor of you, $c. Just in case Ranger Salissa didn't make it back to Farstrider Enclave on the south edge of the lake, I need you to go there and get help.$b$bJust check in with Captain Helios and let him know what's happened here. I'm sure he'll send help back as soon as he can."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '到鬼魂之地的艾蘭達之湖南邊，和遠行者營地的希里歐斯隊長談談。', `Details` = '$c，我要請你幫最後一個忙。以防萬一遊俠沙里莎沒辦法回到湖南邊的遠行者營地，我要你去那裡幫忙。$b$b和希里歐斯隊長談談，讓他知道這裡發生了什麼事。我相信他會盡快派支援回來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9146;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你在這站著做什麼？你看不出來這個小男孩需要立刻治療嗎？看他的樣子，瘟疫已然開始蔓延到他整個身體。幾分鐘後就連像我這樣的藥劑大師都無法拯救他。$B$B小河南邊的動物全都流著感染瘟疫的血液。到橋的另一邊捕獵感染瘟疫的野獸。幫我帶來足夠的瘟疫血液樣本，我就能提煉出血清救這血精靈一命。快！", Details AC enUS : "What are you standing around for?  Can't you see this boy needs immediate attention?  By the looks of it, the plague is beginning to take over his body.  Within minutes not even a master apothecary like me will be able to save him.$B$BThe animals south of the river all carry the plague in their blood.  Go across the bridge and hunt the plagued beasts there.  Bring me enough plagued blood samples and I'll distill a serum capable of saving this blood elf.  Hurry!" ; Wowhead enUS : "What are you standing around for? Can't you see this boy needs immediate attention? By the looks of it, the plague is beginning to take over his body. Within minutes not even a master apothecary like me will be able to save him.$b$bThe animals south of the river all carry the plague in their blood. Go across the bridge and hunt the plagued beasts there. Bring me enough plagued blood samples and I'll distill a serum capable of saving this blood elf. Hurry!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你在這站著做什麼?你看不出來這個小男孩需要立刻被治療嗎?看他的樣子，瘟疫已然開始蔓延到他整個身體。幾分鐘後就連像我這樣的大藥劑師都無法拯救他。$b$b小河南邊的動物全都流著感染瘟疫的血液。到橋的另一邊捕獵感染瘟疫的野獸。幫我帶來足夠的瘟疫血液樣本，我就能提煉出血清救這血精靈一命。快!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9147;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我...我太虛弱了沒辦法繼續。我身上有一封來自攝政王塞隆的緊急警告信，拿著這個包裹。你一定要將它交給安寧地的秘法師范德隆。$B$B沿著這條路往南走你會看到一個村莊。快去...找到范德隆...", Details AC enUS : "I... I'm too weak to continue.  I carry a dire warning from Regent Lord Theron, in the form of a letter.  You'll have to deliver it for me.$B$BTake it to Arcanist Vandril in Tranquillien.  You'll find the town further to the south along this road.  Go there and... find Vandril..." ; Wowhead enUS : "I... I'm too weak to continue. I carry a dire warning from Regent Lord Theron, in the form of a letter. You'll have to deliver it for me.$b$bTake it to Arcanist Vandril in Tranquillien. You'll find the town further to the south along this road. Go there and... find Vandril..."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我……我太虛弱了沒辦法繼續。我身上有一封來自地區統治者塞隆的緊急警告信，拿著這個包裹。你一定要將它交給安寧地的秘法師范德隆。$b$b沿著這條路往南走你會看到一個村莊。快去……找到范德隆……', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9148;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "為了找出對付瘟疫的解藥我們必須了解它是如何感染不同的生物，從最複雜的生物形態到最低等的物種都要研究。$B$B自從那些魚人能夠像我們一樣，在成為不死一族後卻還能保留自我的意志時我便開始研究他們。到底是什麼讓這些低等的雜種如此特別？我必須要查出來，$n。$B$B前往西北方並幫我帶來他們的脊椎，這樣我才能研究一下他們骨髓裡累積的瘟疫病毒。天知道他們的小骨頭裡藏了什麼秘密。", Details AC enUS : "To find a cure for the plague we need to understand how it affects different creatures, from the most complex life forms to the lowliest subspecies.$B$BI've come here to study the murlocs since, like us, they've retained free will in undeath.  What makes these lowly mongrels so special?  I need to find out, $N!$B$BTravel northwest and bring me their spines so that I may study the accumulation of plague in their marrow.  Who knows what secrets their little bones hold?" ; Wowhead enUS : "To find a cure for the plague we need to understand how it affects different creatures, from the most complex life forms to the lowliest subspecies.$b$bI've come here to study the murlocs since, like us, they've retained free will in undeath. What makes these lowly mongrels so special? I need to find out, $n!$b$bTravel northwest and bring me their spines so that I may study the accumulation of plague in their marrow. Who knows what secrets their little bones hold?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '瘟疫以不同的方式感染不同的生物。它影響動物生理機能的方式看來和影響人類或精靈的方式沒有什麼不同。$b$b我想研究一下感染瘟疫的鬼魂之地海岸，那裡有一群魚人。前往西北方並幫我帶來他們的脊椎，這樣我才能研究一下他們骨髓裡累積的瘟疫病毒。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9149;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你相信嗎？我們擁有一座真正在東南方運作的秘法聖所:太陽聖所。各有專精的重要博學者都來共襄盛舉。$B$B當然他們都已經忘了明月聖所。明月聖所遺留下來的東西並不多，而且它提升了奇異生物的能量。$B$B不過，我不是一個會浪費好資源的人。前去明月聖所，看看你能不能從生物身上找到晶化的精華。", Details AC enUS : "Can you believe it?  We have an actual functioning arcane sanctum up and running southeast of here: the Sanctum of the Sun.  All manner of important magisters have come to take part in running it.$B$BOf course they've all forgotten about the Sanctum of the Moon.  Not much remains of it and its energies have given rise to bizarre creatures.$B$BI'm not one to let good resources go to waste, however.  Go to the Sanctum of the Moon and see if you can recover the crystallized essences from the creatures there." ; Wowhead enUS : "Can you believe it? We have an actual functioning arcane sanctum up and running southeast of here: the Sanctum of the Sun. All manner of important magisters have come to take part in running it.$b$bOf course they've all forgotten about the Sanctum of the Moon. Not much remains of it and its energies have given rise to bizarre creatures.$b$bI'm not one to let good resources go to waste, however. Go to the Sanctum of the Moon and see if you can recover the crystallized essences from the creatures there."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你相信嗎?我們擁有一座真正在東南方運作的秘法聖所:太陽聖所。各有專精的重要博學者都來共襄盛舉。$b$b當然他們都已經忘了明月聖所。明月聖所遺留下來的東西並不多，而且它提升了奇異生物的能量。$b$b不過，我不是一個會浪費好資源的人。前去明月聖所，看看你能不能從生物身上找到晶化的精華。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9150;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你已證明你對安寧地的忠誠，並協助我們抵抗天譴軍團的威脅。我們有一些強大的博學者已經從銀月城趕來協助我們進攻敵人的據點。$B$B他們已經在南方重建了秘法聖所，且將附近區域的天譴軍團勢力趕走。他們計畫進攻死亡之域，達克汗的堡壘。你最好趕快加入他們，$n。我相信他們會善用像你一樣經驗豐富的$c。", Details AC enUS : "You've proven your loyalty to Tranquillien and have helped us defend it against the threat of the Scourge.  Some of our most powerful magisters have come from Silvermoon to help us take the fight to the enemy's doorstep.$B$BThey've rebuilt the arcane sanctum to the south and have driven the Scourge away from the surrounding area.  They plan to launch an offensive into Deatholme, Dar'Khan's stronghold.  You would do well to join them, $N.  I'm sure they can make use of a seasoned $c like yourself." ; Wowhead enUS : "You've proven your loyalty to Tranquillien and have helped us defend it against the threat of the Scourge. Some of our most powerful magisters have come from Silvermoon to help us take the fight to the enemy's doorstep.$b$bThey've rebuilt the arcane sanctum to the south and have driven the Scourge away from the surrounding area. They plan to launch an offensive into Deatholme, Dar'Khan's stronghold. You would do well to join them, $n. I'm sure they can make use of a seasoned $c like yourself."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你已證明你對安寧地的忠誠，並協助我們抵抗天譴軍團的威脅。我們有一些強大的博學者已經從銀月城趕來協助我們進攻敵人的據點。$b$b他們已經在南方重建了秘法聖所，且將附近區域的天譴軍團勢力趕走。他們計劃進攻死亡之域，達克汗的堡壘。你最好趕快加入他們，$n。我相信他們會善用像你一樣經驗豐富的$c。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9151;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "取回拉提斯‧土柏的貨物並回到鬼魂之地的安寧地交給他。", Objectives AC enUS : "Retrieve Rathis Tomber's Supplies and return it to him at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Retrieve Rathis Tomber's Supplies and return it to him at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",  OLD Details : "如果我連安全地讓我的物資運到這裡都沒有辦法，我要如何提供戰事補給？有人允諾要護送我但他卻從未出現。接著，我得在西邊丟下我的一輛貨車因為我被一群食屍鬼給攻擊！$B$B想幫忙，想讓我的生意開張嗎？沿著西邊的路走出城外通過墓地。在死亡之痕的另一邊有一個岔路。我的貨車就在那山丘後面。", Details AC enUS : "How am I supposed to supply the war effort when I cannot even safely get my supplies here? I was promised an escort that never came. And then, I had to leave one of my carts behind to the west when I was attacked by a band of ghouls!$B$BWant to help out, and get me open for business in the process? Go down the western road out of town and past the graveyard. On the other side of the Dead Scar is a fork in the road. The hill that my cart had to be left on lies just beyond." ; Wowhead enUS : "How am I supposed to supply the war effort when I cannot even safely get my supplies here? I was promised an escort that never came. And then, I had to leave one of my carts behind to the west when I was attacked by a band of ghouls!$b$bWant to help out, and get me open for business in the process? Go down the western road out of town and past the graveyard. On the other side of the Dead Scar is a fork in the road. The hill that my cart had to be left on lies just beyond."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '取回拉提斯·土柏的貨物並回到鬼魂之地的安寧地交給他。', `Details` = '如果我連安全地讓我的物資運到這裡都沒有辦法，我要如何提供戰事補給?有人允諾要護送我但他卻從未出現。接著，我得在西邊丟下我的一輛貨車因為我被一群食屍鬼給攻擊!$b$b想幫忙，想讓我的生意開張嗎?沿著西邊的路走出城外通過墓地。在死亡之痕的另一邊有一個岔路。我的貨車就在那山丘後面。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9152;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "既然你都走了這麼遠，那麼你應該知道死亡之痕的事，還有為何無腦的天譴軍團到今天都還跟隨著阿薩斯在去銀月城的路上創造的摧毀之路。$B$B做點有用的事，削減死亡之痕裡面的天譴軍團數量。如果你能證明自己的能力我就會多幫你說些好話。", Details AC enUS : "If you've made it this far then you probably know about the Dead Scar and how to this day mindless Scourge follow the path of destruction that Arthas created on his way to Silvermoon City.$B$BMake yourself useful and thin down the Scourge's numbers in the Scar.  If you prove to be worth your salt I'll put in a good word for you." ; Wowhead enUS : "If you've made it this far then you probably know about the Dead Scar and how to this day mindless Scourge follow the path of destruction that Arthas created on his way to Silvermoon City.$b$bMake yourself useful and thin down the Scourge's numbers in the Scar. If you prove to be worth your salt I'll put in a good word for you.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Risen Hungerer slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Gangled Cannibal slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '既然你都走了這麼遠，那麼你應該知道死亡之痕的事，還有為何無腦的天譴軍團到今天都還跟隨著阿薩斯在去銀月城的路上創造的摧毀之路。$b$b做點有用的事，削減死亡之痕裡面的天譴軍團數量。如果你能證明自己的能力我就會多幫你說些好話。', `Objectivetext1` = '重生的飢餓者 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '笨拙的食人者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9155;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "懸賞：納克羅和路斯萊恩", Title AC enUS : "Wanted: Knucklerot and Luzran" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: Knucklerot and Luzran"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '懸賞:納克羅和路斯萊恩', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9156;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "帶8個浪鋒勳章給鬼魂之地的傑若尼斯‧白晨。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 8 Wavefront Medallions to Geranis Whitemorn in the Ghostlands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 8 Wavefront Medallions to Geranis Whitemorn in the Ghostlands.",  OLD Details : "日冠村的居民每年都會參加一個儀式讓各個自然之貌都在掌控之中。召喚並奴役一個稱為海之平衡的元素象徵著我們對水元素的統治。但是海之平衡竟突破了我們魔法的邪惡乖僻，衝破它的束縛反過來奴役我們!$B$B參與儀式的人都會佩帶形狀像波浪的勳章。到湖底去尋找這些東西;我們需要這些東西來重建對海之平衡的統治權並再次解放我們的靈魂。", Details AC enUS : "Every year we, the denizens of Suncrown Village, would take part in a ritual to keep the different aspects of nature under our control.  Dominion over the element of water was symbolized by the summoning and enslavement of an elemental named Aquantion.  Through a wicked perversion of our magic, the scoundrel broke his bonds and enslaved us instead!$B$BWe wore medallions shaped like waves during the ritual.  Seek them at the bottom of the lake; we'll need them to free my compatriots' spirits!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Every year we, the denizens of Suncrown Village, would take part in a ritual to keep the different aspects of nature under our control. Dominion over the element of water was symbolized by the summoning and enslavement of an elemental named Aquantion. Through a wicked perversion of our magic, the scoundrel broke his bonds and enslaved us instead!$b$bWe wore medallions shaped like waves during the ritual. Seek them at the bottom of the lake; we'll need them to free my compatriots' spirits!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '帶8個浪鋒勳章給鬼魂之地的傑若尼斯·白晨。', `Details` = '日冠村的居民每年都會參加一個儀式讓各個自然之貌都在掌控之中。召喚並奴役一個稱為海之平衡的元素象徵著我們對水元素的統治。但是海之平衡竟突破了我們魔法的邪惡乖僻，衝破它的束縛反過來奴役我們!$b$b參與儀式的人都會佩帶形狀像波浪的勳章。到湖底去尋找這些東西;我們需要這些東西來重建對海之平衡的統治權並再次解放我們的靈魂。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9157;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "鬼魂之地，旅行者營地的遠行者賽狄娜要你去殺10個鬼爪暗殺者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Farstrider Sedina at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands wants you to slay 10 Ghostclaw Lynxes." ; Wowhead enUS : "Farstrider Sedina at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands wants you to slay 10 Ghostclaw Lynxes.",  OLD Details : "你敢來鬼魂之地已經是展現了你的勇氣，$n。這裡有更多的工作等著完成但勇敢的人總是不多。$B$B如果你有意願幫助我們的事業，我有個吃力不討好的工作要給你。這片土地上的野生生物已遭到瘟疫的感染而我們務必要阻止它散播。獵殺東邊和南邊的鬼爪暗殺者，殺夠了再回來找我。", Details AC enUS : "You show courage coming to the Ghostlands, $N.  There is much work to be done here and not enough brave souls to do it.$B$BI've a thankless task to offer you, should you have the inclination to aid our cause.  The very wildlife in this land has been tainted by the plague and we must stop it from spreading.  Hunt the ghostclaw lynxes to the east and south of here and return when you've slain enough of them." ; Wowhead enUS : "You show courage coming to the Ghostlands, $n. There is much work to be done here and not enough brave souls to do it.$b$bI've a thankless task to offer you, should you have the inclination to aid our cause. The very wildlife in this land has been tainted by the plague and we must stop it from spreading. Hunt the ghostclaw lynxes to the east and south of here and return when you've slain enough of them.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Ghostclaw Lynx slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '鬼魂之地的遠行者·賽狄娜要你去殺10個鬼爪暗殺者。', `Details` = '你敢來鬼魂之地已經是展現了你的勇氣，$n。這裡有更多的工作等著完成但勇敢的人總是不多。$b$b如果你有意願幫助我們的事業，我有個吃力不討好的工作要給你。這片土地上的野生生物已遭到瘟疫的感染而我們務必要阻止它散播。獵殺東邊和南邊的鬼爪暗殺者，殺夠了再回來找我。', `Objectivetext1` = '鬼爪暗殺者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9158;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "鬼魂之地，旅行者營地的遠行者賽狄娜要你去殺死8隻細網潛伏者和10隻吸血迷霧蝙蝠。", Objectives AC enUS : "Farstrider Sedina at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands wants you to slay 8 Spindleweb Lurkers and 10 Vampiric Mistbats." ; Wowhead enUS : "Farstrider Sedina at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands wants you to slay 8 Spindleweb Lurkers and 10 Vampiric Mistbats.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Vampiric Mistbat slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Spindleweb Lurker slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '鬼魂之地，遠行者營地的遠行者·賽狄娜要你去殺死8隻細網潛伏者和10隻吸血迷霧蝙蝠。', `Objectivetext1` = '吸血迷霧蝙蝠 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '細網潛伏者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9159;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "$C，我們的麻煩是一群最近接管附近一座島嶼的夜精靈。他們在舊的高等精靈能量界線連結點，安都拉斯那裡紮了一個小營地，就在西北方。過了死亡之痕有一條泥巴路就通往那裡。$B$B我非常希望你能幫我們前往那裡，調查他們都在做些什麼並殺死越多自負的夜精靈越好。", Details AC enUS : "$C, we are having difficulty with a group of night elves that have recently taken over a nearby island. They've set up a small camp at the old high elf ley-line nexus, An'daroth, to the northwest. There is a dirt path that leads up to it just past the Dead Scar.$B$BI suggest that you lend us your aid by going there, investigating what they are up to, and slaying as many of the conceited night elves as you can." ; Wowhead enUS : "$c, we are having difficulty with a group of night elves that have recently taken over a nearby island. They've set up a small camp at the old high elf ley-line nexus, An'daroth, to the northwest. There is a dirt path that leads up to it just past the Dead Scar.$b$bI suggest that you lend us your aid by going there, investigating what they are up to, and slaying as many of the conceited night elves as you can.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Sentinel Spy slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '$c，我們的麻煩是一群最近接管附近一座島嶼的夜精靈。他們在舊的高等精靈能量界線連結點，安都拉斯那裡紮了一個小營地，就在西北方。過了死亡之痕有一條泥巴路就通往那裡。$b$b我非常希望你能幫我們前往那裡，調查他們都在做些什麼並殺死越多自負的夜精靈越好。', `Objectivetext1` = '崗哨間諜 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9160;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "人們相信達克汗‧崔希爾已經復活在鬼魂之地，要統治天譴軍團的軍隊。達克汗很久前就與天譴軍團結盟...而他現在又是一個活生生的精靈。他大部份的時間都待在東北方的晨星尖塔裡面。他在那裡藏了很多夜，密謀策劃。$B$B搜索哨塔尋求更多情報，$n。搞不好他有日記或記筆記的習慣。我們永遠不知道有用的訊息會在哪裡冒出來。", Details AC enUS : "Dar'Khan Drathir is believed to have returned from the dead to rule over the armies of the Scourge in the Ghostlands.  Dar'Khan aligned himself with the Scourge long ago... yet he was once a living, breathing elf.  Much of his time was spent inside Dawnstar Spire, northeast of here.  He hid there for many nights, scheming against his own. $B$BSearch the tower for more information, $N.  Perhaps he had a journal or kept notes.  One never knows where useful information might present itself." ; Wowhead enUS : "Dar'Khan Drathir is believed to have returned from the dead to rule over the armies of the Scourge in the Ghostlands. Dar'Khan aligned himself with the Scourge long ago... yet he was once a living, breathing elf. Much of his time was spent inside Dawnstar Spire, northeast of here. He hid there for many nights, scheming against his own.$b$bSearch the tower for more information, $n. Perhaps he had a journal or kept notes. One never knows where useful information might present itself."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '人們相信達克汗·崔希爾已經復活在鬼魂之地，要統治天譴軍團的軍隊。達克汗很久前就與天譴軍團結盟……而他現在又是一個活生生的精靈。他大部份的時間都待在東北方的晨星尖塔裡面。他在那裡藏了很多夜，密謀策劃。$b$b搜索哨塔尋求更多情報，$n。搞不好他有日記或記筆記的習慣。我們永遠不知道有用的訊息會在哪裡冒出來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9161;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "帶著達克汗的日記回到旅行者營地找遊俠薇娜。", Objectives AC enUS : "Return to Ranger Vynna at the Farstrider Enclave with Dar'Khan's Journal." ; Wowhead enUS : "Return to Ranger Vynna at the Farstrider Enclave with Dar'Khan's Journal.",  OLD Details : "當你翻閱日記的書頁時一種被監視的不安感排山倒海而來。$B$B其中的內容使人很不安。達克汗的靈魂對他自己的人民是充滿仇恨和蔑視的。他的陰謀和詭計都以詳細的文字記錄在其中。$B$B或許薇娜會發現裡面有些有用的東西。", Details AC enUS : "As you skim through the pages in the journal you're overcome by an unnerving sense of being watched.$B$BThe contents are unsettling.  Dar'Khan's soul was one filled with hatred and contempt for his own people.  The extent of his machinations and plots are all documented in great detail.$B$BPerhaps there is something here that Vynna will find useful." ; Wowhead enUS : "As you skim through the pages in the journal you're overcome by an unnerving sense of being watched.$b$bThe contents are unsettling. Dar'Khan's soul was one filled with hatred and contempt for his own people. The extent of his machinations and plots are all documented in great detail.$b$bPerhaps there is something here that Vynna will find useful."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '帶著達克汗的日記回到遠行者營地找遊俠薇娜。', `Details` = '當你翻閱日記的書頁時一種被監視的不安感排山倒海而來。$b$b其中的內容使人很不安。達克汗的靈魂對他自己的人民是充滿仇恨和蔑視的。他的陰謀和詭計都以詳細的文字記錄在其中。$b$b或許薇娜會發現裡面有些有用的東西。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9162;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "偷取夜精靈的計畫:安都拉斯、夜精靈的計畫:安歐恩和夜精靈的計畫:占卜辛多雷，然後帶回鬼魂之地交給安寧地的阿莉法娜奧絲夫人。", Objectives AC enUS : "Steal the Night Elf Plans: An'daroth, Night Elf Plans: An'owyn and Night Elf Plans: Scrying on the Sin'dorei, and return them to Dame Auriferous at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Steal the Night Elf Plans: An'daroth, Night Elf Plans: An'owyn and Night Elf Plans: Scrying on the Sin'dorei, and return them to Dame Auriferous at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",  OLD Details : "如果我們要搞清楚這些夜精靈到底在做什麼，就要採取更直接的行動，也就是派你到他們的島上尋找你所能發現的任何蛛絲馬跡。$B$B我要你出城，沿著通往薩藍迪斯島的道路朝西邊走，就在岸邊不遠處。前往那裡取回他們放置在島上或船上的計畫書。", Details AC enUS : "Now, the more direct course of action that we are going to take, to figure out what these night elves are really up to, is to have you go to their island and steal any information that you can come by.$B$BI want you to head west down the road out of town to Shalandis Isle, just off the coast. Go there and recover any plans they might have on the island or on their ship." ; Wowhead enUS : "Now, the more direct course of action that we are going to take, to figure out what these night elves are really up to, is to have you go to their island and steal any information that you can come by.$b$bI want you to head west down the road out of town to Shalandis Isle, just off the coast. Go there and recover any plans they might have on the island or on their ship."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '偷取夜精靈的計畫:安都拉斯，夜精靈的計畫:安歐恩和夜精靈的計畫:占卜辛多雷，然後帶回鬼魂之地給安寧地的阿莉法娜奧絲夫人。', `Details` = '$c，如我所說，如果我們要搞清楚這些夜精靈到底在做什麼，就要採取更直接的行動。我的偵察兵告訴我，他們還沒有足夠的軍力或物資可以入侵，而且我們的船隻也沒有接獲夜精靈變換位置的消息。$b$b所以，我要你做的是沿著出城往薩藍迪斯小島的路向西邊走，就在離岸邊不遠的海面。前往那裡取回任何他們在島上或船上的計畫書。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9163;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "帶著珍妮達的恢復藥劑前往死亡之域解救學徒瓦尼司，藥劑師艾尼斯和遊俠維多蘭。然後再回到太陽聖所向秘法師珍妮達領取獎勵。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take Renzithen's Restorative Draught to Deatholme and rescue Apprentice Varnis,  Apothecary Enith and Ranger Vedoran.  Return to Arcanist Janeda at the Sanctum of the Sun for a reward." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take Renzithen's Restorative Draught to Deatholme and rescue Apprentice Varnis,  Apothecary Enith and Ranger Vedoran.  Return to Arcanist Janeda at the Sanctum of the Sun for a reward.",  OLD Details : "啊，是的。我有一種藥膏，可以化解大部分由鍊金引發的恍惚。$B$B副作用包括了混淆，噁心和 - 較罕見的情形 - 暫時的致盲。如果你問我，這全都比天譴軍團打算對那些死亡之域的囚犯做的事要好的多。$B$B祝你好運，$c。你會需要它的。", Details AC enUS : "Ah, yes.  One of my finest creations.  This draught will break most forms of alchemically induced stupor.$B$BSide effects include confusion, nausea and - in rare cases - temporary blindness.  All much preferable to whatever the Scourge plans to do to those prisoners in Deatholme, if you ask me.$B$BBest of luck, brave $c.  You are going to need it." ; Wowhead enUS : "Ah, yes. One of my finest creations. This draught will break most forms of alchemically induced stupor.$b$bSide effects include confusion, nausea and - in rare cases - temporary blindness. All much preferable to whatever the Scourge plans to do to those prisoners in Deatholme, if you ask me.$b$bBest of luck, brave $c. You are going to need it.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "營救藥劑師恩尼斯", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Apothecary Enith Rescued" ; Wowhead enUS : "Apothecary Enith Rescued",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "營救學徒瓦尼斯", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "Apprentice Varnis Rescued" ; Wowhead enUS : "Apprentice Varnis Rescued",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "救出遊俠維多蘭", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Ranger Vedoran Rescued"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '帶著倫澤紳製作的恢復藥劑前往死亡之域解救學徒瓦尼司，藥劑師艾尼斯和遊俠維多蘭。然後再回到太陽聖所向秘法師珍妮達領取獎勵。', `Details` = '啊，是的。我最棒的創作之一。這個藥膏將化解大部分由鍊金引發的恍惚。$b$b副作用包括了混淆，噁心和 - 較罕見的情形 - 暫時的致盲。如果你問我，這全都比天譴軍團打算對那些死亡之域的囚犯做的事要好的多。$b$b祝你好運，$c。你會需要它的。', `Objectivetext1` = '藥劑師艾尼斯獲救', `Objectivetext2` = '學徒瓦尼司獲救', `Objectivetext3` = '遊俠維多蘭獲救', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9164;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "要是沒有那些探險者的幫助，我的商隊肯定難逃此劫！天災士兵突然從黑暗中顯身，攔住了我們的去路。$B$B<衛兵迪迪爾擦了擦眉毛上的汗水。>$B$B現在我們得在這兒等待查博斯元帥。他會在你的通行文書上簽字，之後你就要返回聖光之願禮拜堂找物資官員梅茲。$B$B$N，在查博斯元帥面前說話可得小心點。他是那種一怒起來就會沖過來砍下你的腦袋再吐口痰的傢伙——而且他真的會這麼做……", Details AC enUS : "Without the help of adventurers, my caravan would have never made it! Scourge were coming out of the woodwork to try and stop us from getting here.$B$B<Guard Didier wipes his brow.>$B$BNow we need to wait here for Field Marshal Chambers to arrive. He'll sign your writ of safe passage to take back to Dispatch Commander Metz at Light's Hope Chapel.$B$BAnd $N, watch what you say around Chambers. He's the 'bite off your head and spit down your wind pipe' type of guy - except that he'll actually do it..." ; Wowhead enUS : "Without the help of adventurers, my caravan would have never made it! Scourge were coming out of the woodwork to try and stop us from getting here.$b$b<Guard Didier wipes his brow.>$b$bNow we need to wait here for Field Marshal Chambers to arrive. He'll sign your writ of safe passage to take back to Dispatch Commander Metz at Light's Hope Chapel.$b$bAnd $n, watch what you say around Chambers. He's the 'bite off your head and spit down your wind pipe' type of guy - except that he'll actually do it..."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '如果沒有冒險者的幫忙，我的商隊絕不可能成功!天譴軍團已經停下他們的木工活，想阻止我們進入那裡。$b$b<守衛迪笛兒擦了擦他的額頭。>$b$b現在我們要在這裡等待戰場元帥錢柏到達。他會簽署你的安全之路令狀讓你帶回聖光之願禮拜堂的發送指揮官梅茲那裡。$b$b還有$n，在錢柏面前講話可要小心。他是那種會咬斷你的頭刺穿你氣管的人 - 只是他不一定會這麼做……', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9165;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你必須幫我把發現的夜精靈計畫送去安泰拉斯。它的位置就在此地的東邊，日牧山峰的南側斜坡，在太陽聖所的東北方。博學者塞拉斯特在那裡進行地脈節點能量的研究。把夜精靈的計劃交給他，他應該會更清楚那些夜精靈打算要做什麼。", Details AC enUS : "You must deliver the recovered night elf plans to An'telas for me. It is to the east, on the southern slopes of Sungraze Peak, just to the northeast of the Sanctum of the Sun.$B$BMagister Sylastor is there conducting ongoing studies into the ley-line nexus energy for potential use in our fight against the Scourge. Have him look at these plans to shed some light on what it is that these night elves are up to." ; Wowhead enUS : "You must deliver the recovered night elf plans to An'telas for me. It is to the east, on the southern slopes of Sungraze Peak, just to the northeast of the Sanctum of the Sun.$b$bMagister Sylastor is there conducting ongoing studies into the ley-line nexus energy for potential use in our fight against the Scourge. Have him look at these plans to shed some light on what it is that these night elves are up to."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '$n，我想請你替我去安泰拉斯一趟。我要你帶著你在薩藍迪斯小島發現的夜精靈計畫一起去。$b$b安泰拉斯在東邊，就在日傷山峰的南邊斜坡上，太陽聖所的東北方。博學者塞拉斯特在那裡進行能量界線連結能量的研究。他可能會讓我們更清楚那些夜精靈在做些什麼。$b$b請照他的話去做。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9166;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死死亡之域的達克汗‧崔希爾並把他的頭顱帶回鬼魂之地給太陽聖所的博學者坎德立斯。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay Dar'Khan Drathir inside Deatholme and bring his head to Magister Kaendris at the Sanctum of the Sun in the Ghostlands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay Dar'Khan Drathir inside Deatholme and bring his head to Magister Kaendris at the Sanctum of the Sun in the Ghostlands.",  OLD Details : "我們在鬼魂之地所做的一切都是為了一個目標，那就是奪回所有我們應有的。天譴軍團掌控該區域的重要據點夠久了。$B$B復仇的時刻來臨了，$n。謝謝你和新盟友，被遺忘者的幫忙，我們很快就能復仇成功了。$B$B想偷取太陽之井能量的人都得死。前往死亡之域，天譴軍團堡壘南方的死亡之痕。幫我把達克汗的頭顱帶來，你的作為會千古流芳!", Details AC enUS : "Everything we've done in the Ghostlands has been done with the goal of taking back what is rightfully ours.  The Scourge have maintained their chokehold on the region for far too long.$B$BThe time has come for payback, $N.  Thanks to your help and the help of our new allies, the Forsaken, vengeance will soon be ours.$B$BHe who sought to steal the power of the Sunwell must die.  Go to Deatholme, the Scourge stronghold south of the Dead Scar.  Bring me Dar'Khan's head and your deeds will go down in history!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Everything we've done in the Ghostlands has been done with the goal of taking back what is rightfully ours. The Scourge have maintained their chokehold on the region for far too long.$b$bThe time has come for payback, $n. Thanks to your help and the help of our new allies, the Forsaken, vengeance will soon be ours.$b$bHe who sought to steal the power of the Sunwell must die. Go to Deatholme, the Scourge stronghold south of the Dead Scar. Bring me Dar'Khan's head and your deeds will go down in history!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死死亡之域的達克汗·崔希爾並把他的頭顱帶回鬼魂之地給太陽聖所的博學者坎德立斯。', `Details` = '我們在鬼魂之地所做的一切都是為了一個目標，那就是奪回所有我們應有的。天譴軍團掌控該區域的重要據點夠久了。$b$b復仇的時刻來臨了，$n。謝謝你和新盟友，被遺忘者的幫忙，我們很快就能復仇成功了。$b$b想偷取太陽之井能量的人都得死。前往死亡之域，天譴軍團堡壘南方的死亡之痕。幫我把達克汗的頭顱帶來，你的作為會千古流芳!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9167;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Eye of Dar'Khan slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectivetext1` = '達克汗之眼 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9168;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "他們的月水晶是占卜儀器 - 他們要監視我們!就我所知安都拉斯無法提供他們所需的能量，但正南方的安歐恩則絕對可以!$B$B從這些計畫中我對他們的寶珠有了基本的認識;足以關閉它們。它們被鎖上了所以才能被關閉。你一定要前往安歐恩從其中一個夜精靈手中拿到控制寶珠，再使用在月水晶上才能阻止夜精靈的計畫!$B$B快，$c!", Details AC enUS : "Their moon crystals are scrying devices -- they're going to spy on us! I know that An'daroth can't provide enough power for that, but An'owyn, directly to the south, most definitely can!$B$BFrom the plans I now have a basic knowledge of how these moon crystals work; enough to shut them down. They're keyed so that they can be turned off. You must go to An'owyn, retrieve the controlling orb from one of the night elves and then use it on the moon crystal to stop them from enacting their plan!$B$BHurry, $c!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Their moon crystals are scrying devices -- they're going to spy on us! I know that An'daroth can't provide enough power for that, but An'owyn, directly to the south, most definitely can!$b$bFrom the plans I now have a basic knowledge of how these moon crystals work; enough to shut them down. They're keyed so that they can be turned off. You must go to An'owyn, retrieve the controlling orb from one of the night elves and then use it on the moon crystal to stop them from enacting their plan!$b$bHurry, $c!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "關閉夜精靈月水晶", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Night Elf Moon Crystal Deactivated" ; Wowhead enUS : "Night Elf Moon Crystal Deactivated"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '他們的月水晶是占卜儀器 - 他們要監視我們!就我所知安都拉斯無法提供他們所需的能量，但正南方的安歐恩則絕對可以!$b$b從這些計畫中我對他們的寶珠有了基本的認識;足以關閉它們。它們被鎖上了所以才能被關閉。你一定要前往安歐恩從其中一個夜精靈手中拿到控制寶珠，再使用在月水晶上才能阻止夜精靈的計畫!$b$b快，$c!', `Objectivetext1` = '已關閉夜精靈月水晶', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9169;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "可憎的達克汗，已在天譴軍團間重拾了強大的力量。他的副官們率領大批的不死族軍隊對抗我們日益減少的子民。$B$B黑衣瑪蘇霏爾，『欺詐者』裘萊恩，『放血者』伯格斯，『墮落者』米爾多藍。記好這幾個傢伙的名字，因為他們的地位在鬼魂之地這些領導者當中僅次於達克汗。只要殺死他們，那些無腦的天譴軍團就會陷入一片混亂。", Details AC enUS : "The odious traitor, Dar'Khan, has risen to great power among the ranks of the Scourge.  His lieutenants command vast armies of undead against our dwindling numbers.$B$BMasophet the Black, Jurion the Deceiver, Borgoth the Bloodletter, Mirdoran the Fallen.  Learn these names well for in the Ghostlands these Scourge leaders are second only to Dar'Khan himself.  Slay them and their mindless armies will be thrown into disarray." ; Wowhead enUS : "The odious traitor, Dar'Khan, has risen to great power among the ranks of the Scourge. His lieutenants command vast armies of undead against our dwindling numbers.$b$bMasophet the Black, Jurion the Deceiver, Borgoth the Bloodletter, Mirdoran the Fallen. Learn these names well for in the Ghostlands these Scourge leaders are second only to Dar'Khan himself. Slay them and their mindless armies will be thrown into disarray.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Mirdoran the Fallen slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Borgoth the Bloodletter slain",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Jurion the Deceiver slain",  OLD Objectivetext4 : "", Objectivetext4 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Masophet the Black slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '可憎的達克汗，已在天譴軍團間重拾了強大的力量。他的副官們率領大批的不死族軍隊對抗我們日益減少的子民。$b$b黑衣瑪蘇霏爾，『欺詐者』裘萊恩，『放血者』伯格斯，『墮落者』米爾多藍。記好這幾個傢伙的名字，因為他們的地位在鬼魂之地這些領導者當中僅次於達克汗。只要殺死他們，那些無腦的天譴軍團就會陷入一片混亂。', `Objectivetext1` = '『墮落者』米爾多藍 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '『放血者』伯格斯 消滅', `Objectivetext3` = '『欺詐者』裘萊恩 消滅', `Objectivetext4` = '黑衣瑪蘇霏爾 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9170;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "這實在是令人無法忍受！我在這裡沒有一點材料可以使用！夫人要我從銀月城過來;她需要適合她身分地位的料理。不是嗎？但是我來到這裡卻找不到食物。你一定要到外面去，$c，帶回新鮮的食材讓我有東西可做。$B$B阿莉法娜奧絲夫人喜歡吃香香脆脆的食物。死亡之痕另一邊的西南方有大量的細網潛伏者。很噁心，我知道，但那就是我們需要的材料。", Details AC enUS : "This is intolerable!  I have nothing to work with here! Milady asks me to come from Silvermoon City; she deserves cuisine as befits her station.  No?  But I get here and there is no food.  You must go out, $c, and bring back fresh kills so that I have something to prepare.$B$BDame Auriferous prefers a crunchy texture to her food.  There are plenty of spindleweb lurkers to the southwest on the other side of the Dead Scar.  Disgusting, I know, but that's what we have to work with." ; Wowhead enUS : "This is intolerable! I have nothing to work with here! Milady asks me to come from Silvermoon City; she deserves cuisine as befits her station. No? But I get here and there is no food. You must go out, $c, and bring back fresh kills so that I have something to prepare.$b$bDame Auriferous prefers a crunchy texture to her food. There are plenty of spindleweb lurkers to the southwest on the other side of the Dead Scar. Disgusting, I know, but that's what we have to work with."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '這實在是令人無法忍受!我在這裡沒有一點材料可以使用!夫人要我從銀月城過來;她需要適合她身份地位的料理。不是嗎?但是我來到這裡卻找不到食物。你一定要到外面去，$c，帶回新鮮的食材讓我有東西可做。$b$b阿莉法娜奧絲夫人喜歡吃香香脆脆的食物。死亡之痕另一邊的西南方有大量的細網潛伏者。很噁心，我知道，但那就是我們需要的材料。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9171;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "太陽聖所的博學者有了被遺忘者的幫助後，已經在分析天譴軍團的弱點上有了極大的進展。博學者坎德立斯會知道要拿這些資訊做什麼。$B$B太陽聖所就在這邊的西南方。你要加快腳步，$n。達克汗是個狡猾的敵人，監視著我們的每個動作!", Details AC enUS : "The magisters at the Sanctum of the Sun have made great progress in analyzing the Scourge's weaknesses with the aid of the Forsaken.  Magister Kaendris will know what to do with this information.$B$BYou'll find the Sanctum of the Sun southwest of here.  You must hurry, $N.  Dar'Khan is a cunning enemy and watches our every move!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The magisters at the Sanctum of the Sun have made great progress in analyzing the Scourge's weaknesses with the aid of the Forsaken. Magister Kaendris will know what to do with this information.$b$bYou'll find the Sanctum of the Sun southwest of here. You must hurry, $n. Dar'Khan is a cunning enemy and watches our every move!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '太陽聖所的博學者有了被遺忘者的幫助後，已經在分析天譴軍團的弱點上有了極大的進展。博學者坎德立斯會知道要拿這些資訊做什麼。$b$b太陽聖所就在這邊的西南方。你要加快腳步，$n。達克汗是個狡猾的敵人，監視著我們的每個動作!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9172;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "$C，我要你奪回風行者之塔!$B$B這是一項榮譽，真的。風行者塔是被遺忘者女王和前遊俠將軍，希瓦娜斯‧風行者女士原本的家。但現在已被天譴軍團侵擾。$B$B想要到那裡就往南一直走到岔路口。往右邊的岔路進去，過了死亡之痕後繼續往西南方。你絕對不會錯過它的。", Details AC enUS : "$C, I want you to reclaim Windrunner Spire!$B$BIt's an honor, really. Windrunner Spire is the original home of Lady Sylvanas Windrunner, queen of the Forsaken and former ranger-general of the elves. But now it's been overrun by the mindless Scourge.$B$BTo get there take the road south until it branches. Take the right fork and after crossing the Dead Scar continue southwest. You can't miss it." ; Wowhead enUS : "$c, I want you to reclaim Windrunner Spire!$b$bIt's an honor, really. Windrunner Spire is the original home of Lady Sylvanas Windrunner, queen of the Forsaken and former ranger-general of the elves. But now it's been overrun by the mindless Scourge.$b$bTo get there take the road south until it branches. Take the right fork and after crossing the Dead Scar continue southwest. You can't miss it.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Deatholme Acolyte slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Fallen Ranger slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '$c，我要你奪回風行者之塔!$b$b這是一項榮譽，真的。風行者塔是被遺忘者女王，希瓦娜斯·風行者原本的家。但現在已被天譴軍團侵擾。$b$b想要到那裡就往南一直走到岔路口。往右邊的岔路進去，過了死亡之痕後繼續往西南方。你絕對不會錯過它的。', `Objectivetext1` = '死亡之域侍僧 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '遊俠靈魂 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9173;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "傑若尼斯‧白晨要你游到日冠村東邊的湖底並在潮汐專精祭壇使用一堆勳章。召喚並殺死一個叫海之平衡的元素再回到傑若尼斯那裡。", Objectives AC enUS : "Geranis Whitemorn wants you to swim to the bottom of the lake east of Suncrown Village and use the Bundle of Medallions on the Altar of Tidal Mastery.  Summon and slay the elemental known as Aquantion and return to Geranis." ; Wowhead enUS : "Geranis Whitemorn wants you to swim to the bottom of the lake east of Suncrown Village and use the Bundle of Medallions on the Altar of Tidal Mastery.  Summon and slay the elemental known as Aquantion and return to Geranis.",  OLD Details : "那個固執的元素在反叛我們那天結束了許多人的生命。藉著召集卑微的魚人來破壞我們的祭儀，他推翻了我們的魔法並將它轉而與我們作對。$B$B讓他知道我們復仇的渴望絲毫沒有削減!帶著這些勳章並把它們放在湖底的潮汐專精祭壇裡。海之平衡會立刻回應你們的召喚!$B$B小心點，$r!沒有我們的魔法控制他，他的憤怒會變的非常放肆。摧毀海之平衡我們才能安息!", Details AC enUS : "That willful elemental ended many lives that fateful day when he revolted against us.  By calling to the lowly murloc to sabotage our rites he subverted our magic and turned it against us.$B$BShow him our thirst for vengeance has not waned!  Take these medallions and lay them at the Altar of Tidal Mastery at the bottom of the lake.  Aquantion shall immediately answer your summons!$B$BBeware, $r!  Without our magic controlling him, his wrath will be unrestrained.  Destroy Aquantion so we may rest!" ; Wowhead enUS : "That willful elemental ended many lives that fateful day when he revolted against us. By calling to the lowly murloc to sabotage our rites he subverted our magic and turned it against us.$b$bShow him our thirst for vengeance has not waned! Take these medallions and lay them at the Altar of Tidal Mastery at the bottom of the lake. Aquantion shall immediately answer your summons!$b$bBeware, $r! Without our magic controlling him, his wrath will be unrestrained. Destroy Aquantion so we may rest!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Aquantion slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '傑若尼斯·白晨要你游到日冠村東邊的湖底並在潮汐專精聖壇使用一堆勳章。召喚並殺死一個叫海之平衡的元素再回到傑若尼斯那裡。', `Details` = '那個固執的元素在反叛我們那天結束了許多人的生命。藉著召集卑微的魚人來破壞我們的祭儀，他推翻了我們的魔法並將它轉而與我們作對。$b$b讓他知道我們復仇的渴望絲毫沒有削減!帶著這些勳章並把它們放在湖底的潮汐專精聖壇裡。海之平衡會立刻回應你們的召喚!$b$b小心點，$r!沒有我們的魔法控制他，他的憤怒會變的非常放肆。摧毀海之平衡我們才能安息!', `Objectivetext1` = '海之平衡 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9174;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "項鍊閃著光，這件出眾的珠寶似乎不受鬼魂之地籠罩的陰鬱影響。依照上面的銘文和你發現它的地點，它一定是希瓦娜斯‧風行者丟失的財產！$B$B或許把它先送到安寧地的高階執行官瑪弗倫會是最好的辦法？他好像是這附近最高階的被遺忘者，一定知道該如何處置它。", Details AC enUS : "The necklace shimmers, a remarkable piece of jewelry that doesn't seem to succumb to the gloom that permeates the Ghostlands. Given the inscription, and where you found it, it must be the lost property of Lady Sylvanas Windrunner herself!$B$BPerhaps it would be best to first take it to High Executor Mavren at Tranquillien? He seems to be the highest ranking Forsaken in the area and is sure to know what to do with it." ; Wowhead enUS : "The necklace shimmers, a remarkable piece of jewelry that doesn't seem to succumb to the gloom that permeates the Ghostlands. Given the inscription, and where you found it, it must be the lost property of Lady Sylvanas Windrunner herself!$b$bPerhaps it would be best to first take it to High Executor Mavren at Tranquillien? He seems to be the highest ranking Forsaken in the area and is sure to know what to do with it."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '項鍊閃著光，這件出眾的珠寶似乎不受鬼魂之地籠罩的陰鬱影響。依照上面的銘文和你發現它的地點，它一定是希瓦娜斯·風行者丟失的財產!$b$b或許把它先送到安寧地的高階執行官瑪弗倫會是最好的辦法?他好像是這附近最高階的被遺忘者，一定知道該如何處置它。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9175;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "根據這本日記，達克汗向天譴軍團允諾了兩樣強大的精靈手工藝品:聖光之石和火焰之石。這兩樣東西都注入了太陽之井的魔法能量，而且已協調至具有對抗天譴軍團的保護力量。$B$B水晶之前被傳送至哀嚎通靈塔和血色通靈塔現在的所在位置，就在死亡之痕中間。如果它們仍然在那裡，我們就必須取得它們。它們的能量對我們抵抗敵人的侵略非常有用。", Details AC enUS : "According to this journal, Dar'Khan promised the Scourge two powerful elven artifacts: the stone of light and the stone of flame.  These were imbued with the magical energies of the Sunwell and attuned to have warding powers against the Scourge.$B$BThe crystals were to be transported to where the Howling Ziggurat and the Bleeding Ziggurat now stand, in the middle of the Dead Scar.  If they're still held there, we need to recover them.  Their power will be greatly useful in our struggle against the enemy." ; Wowhead enUS : "According to this journal, Dar'Khan promised the Scourge two powerful elven artifacts: the stone of light and the stone of flame. These were imbued with the magical energies of the Sunwell and attuned to have warding powers against the Scourge.$b$bThe crystals were to be transported to where the Howling Ziggurat and the Bleeding Ziggurat now stand, in the middle of the Dead Scar. If they're still held there, we need to recover them. Their power will be greatly useful in our struggle against the enemy."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '根據這本日記，達克汗向天譴軍團允諾了兩樣強大的精靈手工藝品:聖光之石和火焰之石。這兩樣東西都注入了太陽之井的魔法能量，而且已協調至具有對抗天譴軍團的保護力量。$b$b水晶之前被傳送至哀嚎通靈塔和血色通靈塔現在的所在位置，就在死亡之痕中間。如果它們仍然在那裡，我們就必須取得它們。它們的能量對我們抵抗敵人的侵略非常有用。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9176;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將女士的項鍊帶給幽暗城皇家區的希瓦娜斯‧風行者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take The Lady's Necklace to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner at the Royal Quarter in Undercity." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take The Lady's Necklace to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner at the Royal Quarter in Undercity.",  OLD Details : "這還真特別!這應該就是希瓦娜斯‧風行者的姐姐，艾蘭里亞送的禮物吧!$B$B你一定要立刻把它帶到幽暗城給她。希瓦娜斯‧風行者就在皇家區宮廷裡。$B$B要到那裡，你要去銀月城的日怒尖塔，使用聖所的傳送寶珠到幽暗城。到了那裡，乘坐升降梯進入城裡。查閱地圖可以找到皇家區。", Details AC enUS : "This is quite extraordinary! It appears to be a gift to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner from her sister, Alleria!$B$BYou must take it to her in the Undercity at once! The lady holds court in the Royal Quarter.$B$BTo get there, use the orb of translocation in the Inner Sanctum of Sunfury Spire in Silvermoon City to cross over to the Undercity.  Once there, take the elevator ride down into the city proper. Use your maps if you need help finding the Royal Quarter." ; Wowhead enUS : "This is quite extraordinary! It appears to be a gift to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner from her sister, Alleria!$b$bYou must take it to her in the Undercity at once! The lady holds court in the Royal Quarter.$b$bTo get there, use the orb of translocation in the Inner Sanctum of Sunfury Spire in Silvermoon City to cross over to the Undercity. Once there, take the elevator ride down into the city proper. Use your maps if you need help finding the Royal Quarter."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將女士的項鍊帶給幽暗城皇家區的希瓦娜斯·風行者。', `Details` = '這還真特別!這應該就是希瓦娜斯·風行者的姊姊，艾蘭里亞送的禮物吧!$b$b你一定要立刻把它帶到幽暗城給她。希瓦娜斯·風行者就在皇家區宮廷裡。$b$b要到那裡，你要去銀月城的日怒尖塔，使用內聖所的傳送寶珠到幽暗城。到了那裡，乘坐電梯進入城裡。查閱地圖可以找到皇家區。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9177;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "工匠文書 - 緻密平衡石", Title AC enUS : "Craftsman's Writ - Dense Weightstone" ; Wowhead enUS : "Craftsman's Writ - Dense Weightstone",  OLD Objectives : "將120個緻密平衡石和工匠文書 - 緻密平衡石交給東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的馬隊管理器布魯斯·石錘。", Objectives AC enUS : "Deliver 120 Dense Weightstones and the Craftsman's Writ - Dense Weightstone - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Deliver 120 Dense Weightstones and the Craftsman's Writ - Dense Weightstone - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",  OLD Details : "工匠文書的持有者在完成訂單後可以挑選一枚徽記作為獎勵。$B$B訂單BS-091：$B$B120個緻密平衡石。$B$B所有的成品應送到東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的馬隊管理器布魯斯·石錘處。$B$B物品若有任何損壞，訂單無效。$B$B銀色黎明物資官員梅茲", Details AC enUS : "The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.$B$BWork Order BS-091:$B$B120 Dense Weightstones.$B$BAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.$B$BContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.$B$B-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn" ; Wowhead enUS : "The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.$b$bWork Order BS-091:$b$b120 Dense Weightstones.$b$bAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.$b$bContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.$b$b-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '工匠令狀 - 緻密平衡石', `Objectives` = '將120個緻密平衡石和工匠令狀 - 緻密平衡石 - 帶到東瘟疫之地給聖光之願禮拜堂的軍需籌備官石漢 。', `Details` = '這張令狀的持有人在完成訂定的工作後會以徽記的形式得到獎賞。$b$b工作令BS-091:$b$b120個緻密平衡石。$b$b所有完成的工作令都要送到東瘟疫之地給聖光之願禮拜堂的軍需籌備官石漢。$b$b一旦契約遭到損壞或篡改一律視為無效。$b$b-發送指揮官梅茲，銀色黎明', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9178;
