-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死8個黑掌豺狼人，6個黑掌覓食者和4個黑掌薩滿，再回到鬼魂之地的安寧地找亡靈哨兵瑪塔堤斯。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay 8 Blackpaw Gnolls, 6 Blackpaw Scavengers and 4 Blackpaw Shaman, and return to Deathstalker Maltendis at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay 8 Blackpaw Gnolls, 6 Blackpaw Scavengers and 4 Blackpaw Shaman, and return to Deathstalker Maltendis at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",  OLD Details : "這些麻煩的報告永無止境地紛至沓來，$c。這裡又是另一個，顯然西南邊的光底礦坑已被一群自稱黑掌的豺狼人佔據。我不需要提醒你那些礦坑對我們在鬼魂之地的戰役而言是多麼重要的戰略性資產吧!$B$B踏上城外往南的路，沿著岔路往右走。走過右邊的通靈塔就就會看到西邊有一條短短的泥土小路。沿著它走。$B$B礦石是我們的!", Details AC enUS : "The Underlight Mines to the southwest have been overrun by a clan of gnolls calling themselves the Blackpaw. I don't need to remind you how important those mines are to us as a strategic asset in our ongoing campaign here in the Ghostlands!$B$BTake the south road out of town and follow the fork to the right. Just past the ziggurat on the right there will be a short dirt path to the west. Follow it.$B$BThe ore must flow!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Underlight Mines to the southwest have been overrun by a clan of gnolls calling themselves the Blackpaw. I don't need to remind you how important those mines are to us as a strategic asset in our ongoing campaign here in the Ghostlands!$b$bTake the south road out of town and follow the fork to the right. Just past the ziggurat on the right there will be a short dirt path to the west. Follow it.$b$bThe ore must flow!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Blackpaw Gnoll slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Blackpaw Scavenger slain",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Blackpaw Shaman slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死8個黑掌豺狼人，6個黑掌覓食者和4個黑掌薩滿，再回到鬼魂之地的安寧地找亡靈守衛瑪塔堤斯。', `Details` = '這些麻煩的報告永無止盡的紛至沓來，$c。這裡又是另一個，顯然西南邊的光底礦坑已被一群自稱黑掌的豺狼人佔據。我不需要提醒你那些礦坑對我們在鬼魂之地的戰役而言是多麼重要的戰略性資產吧!$b$b踏上城外往南的路，沿著岔路往右走。走過右邊的通靈塔就就會看到西邊有一條短短的泥土小路。沿著它走。$b$b礦石是我們的!', `Objectivetext1` = '黑掌豺狼人 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '黑掌覓食者 消滅', `Objectivetext3` = '黑掌薩滿 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9192;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "調查阿曼尼地下墓穴並燒毀10個屍化食人妖遺體再回到鬼魂之地的旅行者營地找遊俠薇娜。", Objectives AC enUS : "Investigate the Amani Catacombs and burn 10 Mummified Troll Remains, then return to Advisor Valwyn at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Investigate the Amani Catacombs and burn 10 Mummified Troll Remains, then return to Advisor Valwyn at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",  OLD Details : "$C，我們有情報指出，日牧山峰阿曼尼地下墓穴裡的食人妖已起死回生。我需要你去調查那座地下墓穴，並且將所有尚未復活的遺體放火燒掉，以免讓更多不死怪物復生。$B$B前往那裡最快的路線，就是從營地西北邊走出去，然後你就會抵達墓穴西邊入口的附近。", Details AC enUS : "$C, our sources tell us that the trolls buried in the Amani Catacombs inside Sungraze Peak have been rising from the dead. Dame Auriferous would have you investigate these catacombs and put to the torch any of the unanimated remains you come across so as to prevent any more of these creatures from rising.$B$BThe fastest way there is to head north out of town and then take the first fork to the right. This will put you on the north side of the peak, so look to the south for the entrance." ; Wowhead enUS : "$c, our sources tell us that the trolls buried in the Amani Catacombs inside Sungraze Peak have been rising from the dead. Dame Auriferous would have you investigate these catacombs and put to the torch any of the unanimated remains you come across so as to prevent any more of these creatures from rising.$b$bThe fastest way there is to head north out of town and then take the first fork to the right. This will put you on the north side of the peak, so look to the south for the entrance.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "燒毀屍化食人妖遺體", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Mummified Troll Remains Burned" ; Wowhead enUS : "Mummified Troll Remains Burned"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '調查阿曼尼地下墓穴並燒毀10個屍化食人妖遺體再回到鬼魂之地的安寧地找諫言者法溫。', `Details` = '$c，我們的消息指出在日傷山峰阿曼尼地下墓穴裡的食人妖已起死回生。阿莉法娜奧絲夫人要你去調查這些地下墓穴並將所有未復活的遺體放火燒了，以免更多這些生物興起。$b$b到達那裡最快的方法就是往北走出城，在第一個岔路右轉。你就會到達山峰的北邊，再向南邊找尋入口。', `Objectivetext1` = '屍化食人妖遺體燒毀', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9193;
