-- AC datas : OLD Title : "工匠文書 - 電鰻", Title AC enUS : "Craftsman's Writ - Lightning Eel" ; Wowhead enUS : "Craftsman's Writ - Lightning Eel",  OLD Objectives : "將30條電鰻和工匠文書 - 電鰻交給東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的馬隊管理器布魯斯·石錘。", Objectives AC enUS : "Deliver 30 Lightning Eel and the Craftsman's Writ - Lightning Eel - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Deliver 30 Lightning Eel and the Craftsman's Writ - Lightning Eel - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",  OLD Details : "工匠文書的持有者在完成訂單後可以挑選一枚徽記作為獎勵。$B$B訂單FS-9：$B$B30條電鰻。$B$B所有的成品應送到東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的馬隊管理器布魯斯·石錘處。$B$B物品若有任何損壞，訂單無效。$B$B銀色黎明物資官員梅茲", Details AC enUS : "The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.$B$BWork Order FS-9:$B$B30 Lightning Eel.$B$BAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.$B$BContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.$B$B-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn" ; Wowhead enUS : "The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.$b$bWork Order FS-9:$b$b30 Lightning Eel.$b$bAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.$b$bContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.$b$b-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '工匠令狀 - 電鰻', `Objectives` = '將30隻電鰻和工匠令狀 - 電鰻 - 帶到東瘟疫之地給聖光之願禮拜堂的軍需籌備官石漢 。', `Details` = '這張令狀的持有人在完成訂定的工作後會以徽記的形式得到獎賞。$b$b工作令FS-9:$b$b30隻電鰻。$b$b所有完成的工作令都要送到東瘟疫之地給聖光之願禮拜堂的軍需籌備官石漢。$b$b一旦契約遭到損壞或篡改一律視為無效。$b$b-發送指揮官梅茲，銀色黎明', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9206;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我從太陽聖所被派來這裡收集一些樣本，但是豺狼人卻橫行於這個地方！要是我不快點將那些樣本帶回去給博學者，我就要人頭落地了。$c，說不定你可以幫幫我？$B$B你可以在這裡的錫礦和銅礦的礦脈中找到樣本，然後豺狼人也會攜帶在身上。等你收集到足夠的數量，請將它們交給太陽聖所的博學者奎壘司提斯。就在此處的正東方，過了死亡之痕，在日牧山峰的南邊。", Details AC enUS : "I was sent here from the Sanctum of the Sun to collect some ore samples, but the gnolls have overrun the place! It's going to be my head on a platter if I don't get those samples to the magister soon. Maybe you could help, $c?$B$BYou can find the ore in the tin and copper veins here, and the gnolls are carrying it around, too. When you have enough, take it to Magister Quallestis at the Sanctum of the Sun directly to the east. Go across the Dead Scar and you'll find the sanctum just south of Sungraze Peak." ; Wowhead enUS : "I was sent here from the Sanctum of the Sun to collect some ore samples, but the gnolls have overrun the place! It's going to be my head on a platter if I don't get those samples to the magister soon. Maybe you could help, $c?$b$bYou can find the ore in the tin and copper veins here, and the gnolls are carrying it around, too. When you have enough, take it to Magister Quallestis at the Sanctum of the Sun directly to the east. Go across the Dead Scar and you'll find the sanctum just south of Sungraze Peak."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我從太陽聖所被派來這裡收集一些光底礦物樣本，但是豺狼人已經橫行於這個地方了!如果我不快點將那些樣本交給博學者，我就要人頭落地了。或許你可以幫我，$c?$b$b你可以在礦物節點找到樣本，而豺狼人身上也有攜帶它們。等你收集到足夠的數量請將它們交給太陽聖所的博學者奎壘司提斯。就在東邊，過了死亡之痕，日傷山峰的南邊。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9207;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "啊，冰霜守護者 。冰霜守護者是一層薄薄的魔法屏障，只要附魔在護具上就可以產生額外的冰霜防護效果，在與冰霜系的怪物纏鬥時額外的好用。$B$B不過只要是我 ，施怒者麥特斯，所製造的東西，它都有它應有的價格而這個價格可是無法討價還價的。有興趣嗎?", Details AC enUS : "Ah, the Ice Guard. It is a thin sheen of protective magic that covers certain pieces of equipment. Those that do battle with creatures of frost and ice will gain increased protection from their attacks by using the Ice Guard.$B$BAs with all things the Wrathcaster creates, there is a price - a price that I will not lower, regardless of how much you whimper. Interested?" ; Wowhead enUS : "Ah, the Ice Guard. It is a thin sheen of protective magic that covers certain pieces of equipment. Those that do battle with creatures of frost and ice will gain increased protection from their attacks by using the Ice Guard.$b$bAs with all things the Wrathcaster creates, there is a price - a price that I will not lower, regardless of how much you whimper. Interested?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '啊，冰霜守護者 。冰霜守護者是一層薄薄的魔法屏障，只要附魔在護具上就可以產生額外的冰霜防護效果，在與冰霜系的怪物纏鬥時額外的好用。$b$b不過只要是我 ，施怒者麥特斯，所製造的東西，它都有它應有的價格而這個價格可是無法討價還價的。有興趣嗎?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9211;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "護送遊俠莉拉薩回到鬼魂之地的旅行者營地找希里歐斯隊長。", Objectives AC enUS : "Escort Ranger Lilatha to Captain Helios at Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Escort Ranger Lilatha to Captain Helios at Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands.",  OLD Details : "這些食人妖襲擊我還把我關在這籠子裡。我想他們打算犧牲我!救我出去!$B$B籠子上的鎖看起來不是很複雜...只是我從裡面沒辦法打開。如果你讓我離開這裡並護送我回到旅行者營地，我相信希里歐斯隊長一定會獎勵你，而且我也一定會感激你!", Details AC enUS : "These trolls ambushed me and have been keeping me in this cage.  I think they're planning to sacrifice me!  Help me get out of here!$B$BThe lock on the cage isn't that complex... I just can't get to it from this side.  Please escort me back to the Farstrider Enclave.  I'm sure Captain Helios will reward you, and you'll have my undying gratitude!" ; Wowhead enUS : "These trolls ambushed me and have been keeping me in this cage. I think they're planning to sacrifice me! Help me get out of here!$b$bThe lock on the cage isn't that complex... I just can't get to it from this side. Please escort me back to the Farstrider Enclave. I'm sure Captain Helios will reward you, and you'll have my undying gratitude!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '護送遊俠莉娜薩回到鬼魂之地的遠行者營地找希里歐斯隊長。', `Details` = '這些食人妖襲擊我還把我關在這籠子裡。我想他們打算犧牲我!救我出去!$b$b籠子上的鎖看起來不是很複雜……只是我從裡面沒辦法打開。如果你讓我離開這裡並護送我回到遠行者營地，我相信希里歐斯隊長一定會獎勵你，而且我也一定會感激你!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9212;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "這真是天才的傑作阿!就像冰霜守衛者一樣，暗影守衛者可以附魔在護具上產生額外的暗影防護效果。但別高興的太早，暗影守護者也跟冰霜守護者一樣需要一筆不小的收費。$B$B<麥特斯貪婪的伸出手。>$B$B有興趣嗎?", Details AC enUS : "A creation of genius! Much like the Ice Guard, the Shadow Guard employs a thin sheen of protective magic that covers certain pieces of equipment. And like the Ice Guard, the Shadow Guard is going to cost you a good amount of money.$B$B<Mataus holds his hand out and rubs his fingers together.>$B$BInterested?" ; Wowhead enUS : "A creation of genius! Much like the Ice Guard, the Shadow Guard employs a thin sheen of protective magic that covers certain pieces of equipment. And like the Ice Guard, the Shadow Guard is going to cost you a good amount of money.$b$b<Mataus holds his hand out and rubs his fingers together.>$b$bInterested?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '這真是天才的傑作阿!就像冰霜守衛者一樣，暗影守衛者可以附魔在護具上產生額外的暗影防護效果。但別高興的太早，暗影守護者也跟冰霜守護者一樣需要一筆不小的收費。$b$b<麥特斯貪婪的伸出手>$b$b有興趣嗎?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9213;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集3個獵頭者之斧、3個暗影施法者之錘、3個馭貓者之爪和3個妖術師之棍，並且回到鬼魂之地的旅行者營地交給希里歐斯隊長。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 3 Headhunter Axes, 3 Shadowcaster Maces, 3 Catlord Claws and 3 Hexxer Staves. Return them to Captain Helios at Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 3 Headhunter Axes, 3 Shadowcaster Maces, 3 Catlord Claws and 3 Hexxer Staves. Return them to Captain Helios at Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands.",  OLD Details : "$C，我要你盡可能的殺死影松食人妖，越多越好。我們需要大幅削弱他們的實力，如此才能將我們的目標轉移對付死亡之域。既然你要去對付他們，乾脆幫我取回他們的武器。最好不要浪費這些武器，我們還可以拿來對抗天譴軍團。$B$B猛力地攻擊他們的營地吧，就在東邊的札布泰拉和南邊的札布諾瓦。", Details AC enUS : "$C, I want you to kill as many Shadowpine trolls as you can. We need their numbers greatly reduced before we can shift our attention toward Deatholme. And while you're at it, we might as well kill two birds with one stone, so bring me back a load of their weapons. Better that they not go to waste, and we can use them in the fight against the Scourge.$B$BHit their camps hard to the east and the south at Zeb'Tela and Zeb'Nowa." ; Wowhead enUS : "$c, I want you to kill as many Shadowpine trolls as you can. We need their numbers greatly reduced before we can shift our attention toward Deatholme. And while you're at it, we might as well kill two birds with one stone, so bring me back a load of their weapons. Better that they not go to waste, and we can use them in the fight against the Scourge.$b$bHit their camps hard to the east and the south at Zeb'Tela and Zeb'Nowa."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '收集3個獵頭者之斧、3個暗影施法者之錘、3個馭貓者之爪和3個妖術師之棍，並且回到鬼魂之地的遠行者營地交給希里歐斯隊長。', `Details` = '$c，我要你盡可能的殺死影松食人妖，越多越好。我們需要大幅削弱他們的實力，如此才能將我們的目標轉移對付死亡之域。既然你要去對付他們，乾脆幫我取回他們的武器。最好不要浪費這些武器，我們還可以拿來對抗天譴軍團。$b$b猛力地攻擊他們的營地吧，就在東邊的札布泰拉和南邊的札布諾瓦。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9214;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將『邪惡者』卡爾喀旭的頭顱帶到鬼魂之地交給旅行者營地的希里歐斯隊長。", Objectives AC enUS : "Return the Head of Kel'gash the Wicked to Captain Helios at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Return the Head of Kel'gash the Wicked to Captain Helios at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands.",  OLD Details : "懸賞:把影松食人妖的頭目，『邪惡者』卡爾喀旭的頭顱帶給希里歐斯隊長。不准發問。據說卡爾喀旭住在札布諾瓦南邊。$B$B$B$B獎勵:有，但不預付!", Details AC enUS : "WANTED: Bring the head of Kel'gash the Wicked, chieftain of the Shadowpine trolls, to Captain Helios. No questions asked. Kel'gash is known to dwell somewhere to the south in Zeb'Nowa.$B$B$B$BREWARD: Yes, but no advances!" ; Wowhead enUS : "WANTED: Bring the head of Kel'gash the Wicked, chieftain of the Shadowpine trolls, to Captain Helios. No questions asked. Kel'gash is known to dwell somewhere to the south in Zeb'Nowa.$b$b$b$bREWARD: Yes, but no advances!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將『邪惡者』卡爾喀旭的頭顱帶到鬼魂之地交給遠行者營地的希里歐斯隊長。', `Details` = '懸賞:把影松食人妖的頭目，『邪惡者』卡爾喀旭的頭顱帶給希里歐斯隊長。不准發問。據說卡爾喀旭住在札布諾瓦南邊。$b$b$b$b獎勵:有，但不預付!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9215;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我聽說阿曼尼食人妖以吃掉敵人的心臟來竊取他們的力量。他們一定對某種事物很熟悉，$n。經過適當的處理，無生命體的心臟能夠製造出強效的菁華。$B$B獵殺在死亡之痕流連的殭屍並將他們的心臟帶來給我。我會讓你見識一下這類能夠運用在身體上的強化以對抗不死生物。", Details AC enUS : "I hear the Amani trolls eat their enemies' hearts to steal their strength.  They might just be on to something, $N.  With the proper treatment, the hearts of the unliving can produce potent elixirs.$B$BHunt down the zombies that roam the Dead Scar and bring me their hearts.  I'll show you the kind of enhancement we can perform to your physical prowess against the undead." ; Wowhead enUS : "I hear the Amani trolls eat their enemies' hearts to steal their strength. They might just be on to something, $n. With the proper treatment, the hearts of the unliving can produce potent elixirs.$b$bHunt down the zombies that roam the Dead Scar and bring me their hearts. I'll show you the kind of enhancement we can perform to your physical prowess against the undead."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我聽說阿曼尼食人妖以吃掉敵人的心臟來竊取他們的力量。他們一定對某種事物很熟悉，$n。經過適當的處理，無生命體的心臟能夠製造出強效的菁華。$b$b獵殺在死亡之痕流連的殭屍並將他們的心臟帶來給我。我會讓你見識一下這類能夠運用在身體上的強化以對抗不死生物。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9216;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "再活化的骷髏體內流著的黑暗力量主要會累積在他們的脊椎裡。我發現了一個方法可以將這股能量注入藥水裡，增強我們的魔法能力對抗不死族。$B$B幫我帶來一些脊骨之塵我就會樂意提供你一個樣本。你會在西邊的死亡之痕找到一堆遊走的骷髏。", Details AC enUS : "The dark energy that flows through the bodies of reanimated skeletons tends to accumulate primarily in their spine.  I've discovered a method of instilling this energy into a potion that boosts our magical abilities against the undead.$B$BBring me some spinal dust and I'll be glad to provide you with a sample.  You'll find an ample number of skeletons wandering the Dead Scar, west of here." ; Wowhead enUS : "The dark energy that flows through the bodies of reanimated skeletons tends to accumulate primarily in their spine. I've discovered a method of instilling this energy into a potion that boosts our magical abilities against the undead.$b$bBring me some spinal dust and I'll be glad to provide you with a sample. You'll find an ample number of skeletons wandering the Dead Scar, west of here."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '復活的骷髏體內流著的黑暗力量主要會累積在他們的脊椎裡。我發現了一個方法可以將這股能量注入藥水裡，增強我們的魔法能力對抗不死族。$b$b幫我帶來一些脊骨之塵我就會樂意提供你一個樣本。你會在西邊的死亡之痕找到一堆遊走的骷髏。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9218;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "如果你想要幫忙的話，此時此地就是最佳良機。$B$B重建太陽聖所，我們早已在敵方權力中心:死亡之域，高舉反抗的消息。$B$B去與這群居住在這個邪惡天譴軍堡壘的不死生物們對戰。", Details AC enUS : "If you seek to aid our cause there is no better place to start than here and no better time to do it than now.$B$BBy rebuilding the Sanctum of the Sun we've raised a banner of defiance in front of our enemy's seat of power: Deatholme.$B$BGo forth and fight the hordes of undead that inhabit the vile Scourge fortress." ; Wowhead enUS : "If you seek to aid our cause there is no better place to start than here and no better time to do it than now.$b$bBy rebuilding the Sanctum of the Sun we've raised a banner of defiance in front of our enemy's seat of power: Deatholme.$b$bGo forth and fight the hordes of undead that inhabit the vile Scourge fortress.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Eye of Dar'Khan slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Nerubis Centurion slain",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wailer slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '如果你想要幫忙的話，此時此地就是最佳良機。$b$b重建太陽聖所，我們早已在敵方權力中心:死亡之域，高舉反抗的消息。$b$b去與這群居住在這個邪惡天譴軍堡壘的不死生物們對戰。', `Objectivetext1` = '達克汗之眼 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '奈幽碧斯百夫長 消滅', `Objectivetext3` = '哀嚎者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9220;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "精良的作戰裝備 - 銀色黎明尊敬", Title AC enUS : "Superior Armaments of Battle - Honored Amongst the Dawn" ; Wowhead enUS : "Superior Armaments of Battle - Honored Amongst the Dawn",  OLD Objectives : "付出20個黎明徽記和20個十字軍徽記就能換取銀色黎明藏寶庫裡的一樣強大的物品", Objectives AC enUS : "For 20 Insignias of the Dawn and 20 Insignias of the Crusade you may choose an item from the Argent Dawn's treasure cache." ; Wowhead enUS : "For 20 Insignias of the Dawn and 20 Insignias of the Crusade you may choose an item from the Argent Dawn's treasure cache.",  OLD Details : "朋友，你好。你想要用銀色黎明徽記或十字軍徽記換取這些物品嗎？$B$B我得提醒你，如果你在銀色黎明的聲望只達到尊敬的話，這筆交易可是要收取很高的附加費用的。我建議你跟銀色黎明創建更高的聲望之後再實施你的計畫。", Details AC enUS : "Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of power?$B$BI must warn you; purchases made at honored reputation with the Dawn come with a fairly prohibitive surcharge. I would advise that you gain a better reputation with the Dawn before moving forward with your plans." ; Wowhead enUS : "Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of power?$b$bI must warn you; purchases made at honored reputation with the Dawn come with a fairly prohibitive surcharge. I would advise that you gain a better reputation with the Dawn before moving forward with your plans."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '精良級軍備之戰-銀色黎明聲望尊敬', `Objectives` = '付出20個黎明徽記和20個十字軍徽記就能換取銀色黎明藏寶庫裡的一樣強大的物品。', `Details` = '你好，朋友。你想要用點黎明徽記或是十字軍徽記來換取一些強大的物品嗎?$b$b不過我必須要警告你，雖然你是的銀色黎明所尊敬的朋友，但是想要購買這些物品還需要一些額外的收費，我建議你去提升更高的聲望後再來考慮這些物品吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9223;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "史詩級的作戰裝備 - 銀色黎明尊敬", Title AC enUS : "Epic Armaments of Battle - Honored Amongst the Dawn" ; Wowhead enUS : "Epic Armaments of Battle - Honored Amongst the Dawn",  OLD Details : "朋友，你好。你想要用銀色黎明徽記或十字軍徽記換取這些物品嗎？$B$B我得提醒你，如果你在銀色黎明的聲望只達到尊敬的話，這筆交易可是要收取很高的附加費用的。我建議你跟銀色黎明創建更高的聲望之後再實施你的計畫。", Details AC enUS : "Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of great power?$B$BI must warn you; purchases made at honored reputation with the Dawn come with an extremely hefty surcharge. I would advise that you gain a better reputation with the Dawn before moving forward with your plans." ; Wowhead enUS : "Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of great power?$b$bI must warn you; purchases made at honored reputation with the Dawn come with an extremely hefty surcharge. I would advise that you gain a better reputation with the Dawn before moving forward with your plans."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '史詩級軍備之戰-銀色黎明聲望尊敬', `Details` = '你好，朋友。你想要用點黎明徽記或是十字軍徽記來換取一些史詩級的物品嗎?$b$b不過我必須要警告你，雖然你是銀色黎明所尊敬的朋友，但是想要購買這些物品可是還須付出一筆非常龐大的額外費用，我建議你去提升更高的聲望後再來考慮這些物品吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9224;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Rotlimb Marauder slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Darkwraith slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectivetext1` = '腐肢掠奪者 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '黑暗怨靈 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9252;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "天譴軍團有增無減的攻擊行動讓我相信，鬼魂之地邊界那裡的某個防禦符文石一定發生故障。$B$B我們用這些古老的石頭來保護我們不受不死族傷害。它們大部分都在太陽之井的攻擊後被摧毀或不見了。$B$B朝著鬼魂之地的方向沿著路往南走，往西邊看就會發現一條小徑。你會在附近的一個符文石看到符文守護者德蘭;他會知道發生了什麼問題。", Details AC enUS : "This increase in Scourge attacks leads me to believe there might be a malfunction at one of the protective runestones at the border with the Ghostlands.$B$BWe used these ancient stones to protect us against the undead.  Most of them were destroyed or lost after the attack on the Sunwell. $B$BFollow the road south, towards the Ghostlands, and look to the west for a small path.  You will find Runewarden Deryan by the runestone nearby; he will know whether anything's wrong." ; Wowhead enUS : "This increase in Scourge attacks leads me to believe there might be a malfunction at one of the protective runestones at the border with the Ghostlands.$b$bWe used these ancient stones to protect us against the undead. Most of them were destroyed or lost after the attack on the Sunwell.$b$bFollow the road south, towards the Ghostlands, and look to the west for a small path. You will find Runewarden Deryan by the runestone nearby; he will know whether anything's wrong."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '天譴軍團有增無減的攻擊行動讓我相信，鬼魂之地邊界那裡的某個防禦符文石一定發生故障。$b$b我們用這些古老的石頭來保護我們不受不死族傷害。它們大部分都在太陽之井的攻擊後被摧毀或不見了。$b$b朝著鬼魂之地的方向沿著路往南走，往西邊看就會發現一條小徑。你會在附近的一個符文石看到符文守護者德蘭;他會知道發生了什麼問題。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9253;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "感謝你的幫忙，$n。當我整頓好這裡的事情時，我想請你幫個忙。我之前的一個學徒捲入了危險的研究調查。她前往了東部聖所，就在死亡之痕中間。$B$B我擔心她的安危。你能不能幫我把她找回來，並說服她找回自己。", Details AC enUS : "Thank you for your help, $N.  While I get things back in order here, I'd like to ask you for a favor.  One of my former apprentices embarked in a very dangerous line of research.  She journeyed to the East Sanctum, in the middle of the Dead Scar.$B$BI worry for her well-being.  See if you can find her and convince her to return to her senses." ; Wowhead enUS : "Thank you for your help, $n. While I get things back in order here, I'd like to ask you for a favor. One of my former apprentices embarked in a very dangerous line of research. She journeyed to the East Sanctum, in the middle of the Dead Scar.$b$bI worry for her well-being. See if you can find her and convince her to return to her senses."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '感謝你的幫忙，$n。當我整頓好這裡的事情時，我想請你幫個忙。我之前的一個學徒捲入了危險的研究調查。她前往了東部聖所，就在死亡之痕中間。$b$b我擔心她的安危。你能不能幫我把她找回來，並說服她找回自己。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9254;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把研究報告帶到永歌森林交給晴風村的博學者蘭德拉‧晨行者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Deliver the Research Notes to Magistrix Landra Dawnstrider at Fairbreeze Village in Eversong Woods." ; Wowhead enUS : "Deliver the Research Notes to Magistrix Landra Dawnstrider at Fairbreeze Village in Eversong Woods.",  OLD Details : "雖然我的研究結果令人沮喪，這份資料還是有可取之處。我要在這份報告被正視之前，先讓博學者檢視一下我的成果。拜託你，把這些報告拿給西邊晴風村的博學者蘭德拉‧晨行者。", Details AC enUS : "As discouraging as my research results are, they still contain valuable data.  I must have a magister review my work before it is taken seriously.  Please, take these notes to Magistrix Landra Dawnstrider at Fairbreeze Village, west of here." ; Wowhead enUS : "As discouraging as my research results are, they still contain valuable data. I must have a magister review my work before it is taken seriously. Please, take these notes to Magistrix Landra Dawnstrider at Fairbreeze Village, west of here."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把研究報告帶到永歌森林交給晴風村的博學者蘭德拉·晨行者。', `Details` = '雖然我的研究結果令人沮喪，這份資料還是有可取之處。我要在這份報告被正視之前，先讓博學者檢視一下我的成果。拜託你，把這些報告拿給西邊晴風村的博學者蘭德拉·晨行者。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9255;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我有另一個任務要給你，$n。遊俠迪哥里恩被派去晴風村找尋更多有關惡癮者攻擊附近船廠的線索。他正尋求增援，可是我們還不能幫忙。去找到他，然後盡你全力去幫助他吧。$B$B沿著獵鷹之翼廣場的道路一直往南走就能找到晴風村了。祝你好運，$n。", Details AC enUS : "I have another task for you, $N.  Ranger Degolien was sent to Fairbreeze Village to find out more about a Wretched attack on a nearby shipyard.  He has requested reinforcements which we cannot yet provide.  Seek him out and grant him whatever aid you can.$B$BFairbreeze Village can be reached by following the road out of Falconwing Square all the way towards the south.  Good luck, $N." ; Wowhead enUS : "I have another task for you, $n. Ranger Degolien was sent to Fairbreeze Village to find out more about a Wretched attack on a nearby shipyard. He has requested reinforcements which we cannot yet provide. Seek him out and grant him whatever aid you can.$b$bFairbreeze Village can be reached by following the road out of Falconwing Square all the way towards the south. Good luck, $n."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我有另一個任務要給你，$n。遊俠迪哥里恩被派去晴風村找尋更多有關鄙惡者攻擊附近船廠的線索。他正尋求增援，可是我們還不能幫忙。去找到他，然後盡你全力去幫助他吧。$b$b沿著內精靈之門這條路一直往南走就能找到晴風村了。祝你好運，$n。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9256;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "去烈焰邊境附近找拉瑞安娜‧河風，位置就在永歌森林的西南方。", Objectives AC enUS : "Find Larianna Riverwind near the Scorched Grove in the southwest of Eversong Woods." ; Wowhead enUS : "Find Larianna Riverwind near the Scorched Grove in the southwest of Eversong Woods.",  OLD Details : "天譴軍團的污土持續進攻新的區域。為此，我們在鬼魂之地邊界建造了防護符石，以防止污染繼續蔓延。$B$B某次天譴軍團的攻擊行動中，他們摧毀了西邊的符石，迫使我們必須燒掉四周的土地來遏止污穢擴散。我的姐妹，拉瑞安娜‧河風，看管著烈焰邊境。去找她，她可能有工作要給你。", Details AC enUS : "A foul taint in the soil precedes the expansion of the Scourge into a new area.  The protective runestones along the border with the Ghostlands have warded the land against this taint in the past.$B$BThe westernmost runestone was destroyed during a Scourge attack, which forced us to burn the ground around it to prevent the taint from spreading.$B$BMy sister, Larianna Riverwind, watches over the Scorched Grove.  Go find her; she might have some work for you." ; Wowhead enUS : "A foul taint in the soil precedes the expansion of the Scourge into a new area. The protective runestones along the border with the Ghostlands have warded the land against this taint in the past.$b$bThe westernmost runestone was destroyed during a Scourge attack, which forced us to burn the ground around it to prevent the taint from spreading.$b$bMy sister, Larianna Riverwind, watches over the Scorched Grove. Go find her; she might have some work for you."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '去烈焰邊境附近找拉瑞安娜·河風，位置就在永歌森林的西南方。', `Details` = '天譴軍團的污土持續進攻新的區域。為此，我們在鬼魂之地邊界建造了防護符石，以防止污染繼續蔓延。$b$b某次天譴軍團的攻擊行動中，他們摧毀了西邊的符石，迫使我們必須燒掉四周的土地來遏止污穢擴散。我的姐妹，拉瑞安娜·河風，看管著烈焰邊境。去找她，她可能有工作要給你。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9258;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "鬼魂之地，旅行者營地的遊俠克羅南，要你去附近的湖裡殺死8個復仇的亡魂和8個貪婪的亡魂。", Objectives AC enUS : "Ranger Krenn'an, at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands, wants you to kill 8 Vengeful Apparitions and 8 Ravening Apparitions in the nearby lake." ; Wowhead enUS : "Ranger Krenn'an, at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands, wants you to kill 8 Vengeful Apparitions and 8 Ravening Apparitions in the nearby lake.",  OLD Details : "就我有印象以來北邊的湖就充斥著我祖先的靈魂，$n。那些可憐的鬼魂都是在一場悲慘的意外中溺死在湖底的受害者。$B$B事情的來龍去脈我已忘得差不多了，但是他們揮之不去的哭喊聲一直提醒著我他們的詛咒。$B$B如果你能勝任這個任務，我要你去湖那裡結束他們的苦難，$n。我和他們都會感謝你的...我保證。", Details AC enUS : "The lake to the north has been haunted by the ghosts of my ancestors for as long as I can remember, $N.  The poor souls were victims of a tragic incident in which scores of them drowned at the bottom of the lake.$B$BThe details of the event are mostly forgotten, but their haunting cries serve as a constant reminder of their curse.$B$BIf you're up to the task, I want you to go to the lake and put an end to their suffering, $N.  You will have my gratitude as well as theirs... I'm sure." ; Wowhead enUS : "The lake to the north has been haunted by the ghosts of my ancestors for as long as I can remember, $n. The poor souls were victims of a tragic incident in which scores of them drowned at the bottom of the lake.$b$bThe details of the event are mostly forgotten, but their haunting cries serve as a constant reminder of their curse.$b$bIf you're up to the task, I want you to go to the lake and put an end to their suffering, $n. You will have my gratitude as well as theirs... I'm sure.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Ravening Apparition slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Vengeful Apparition slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '鬼魂之地，遠行者營地的遊俠克羅南，要你去附近的湖裡殺死8個復仇的亡魂和8個貪婪的亡魂。', `Details` = '就我有印象以來北邊的湖就充斥著我祖先的靈魂，$n。那些可憐的鬼魂都是在一場悲慘的意外中溺死在湖底的受害者。$b$b事情的來龍去脈我已忘得差不多了，但是他們揮之不去的哭喊聲一直提醒著我他們的詛咒。$b$b如果你能勝任這個任務，我要你去湖那裡結束他們的苦難，$n。我和他們都會感謝你的……我保證。', `Objectivetext1` = '貪婪的亡魂 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '復仇的亡魂 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9274;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到札布諾瓦營地在食人妖的食物裡下毒，再回到鬼魂之地的旅行者營地，將剩下的藥劑師之毒交給藥劑師范衲斯特。", Objectives AC enUS : "Poison the Troll foodstuff at the camps in Zeb'Nowa and then return to Apothecary Venustus at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Poison the Troll foodstuff at the camps in Zeb'Nowa and then return to Apothecary Venustus at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands.",  OLD Details : "讓我先自我介紹。我是皇家藥劑師學會的藥劑師范衲斯特。我是來幫助遠行者解決他們的食人妖麻煩。我想我有辦法解決這個問題。$B$B我手上有一堆強而有力的毒藥。食人妖也是活的生物，他們也要吃。如果我們把他們的食物加入我的毒藥…那麼，我相信結果會非常有趣。$B$B你願意幫助我們擺脫南邊札布諾瓦的影松食人妖嗎？", Details AC enUS : "I'm on loan to the Farstriders in an attempt to help with their troll difficulties. I believe that I have a solution to their problem.$B$BAt my disposal are a number of potent poisons. The trolls, as you know, are living creatures and therefore must eat. If we combine my poison with their food... well, I'm sure that the results will be entertaining!$B$BCare to help rid us of the Shadowpine trolls at Zeb'Nowa to the south? The camp straddles both the north and south sides of the road to Zul'Aman." ; Wowhead enUS : "I'm on loan to the Farstriders in an attempt to help with their troll difficulties. I believe that I have a solution to their problem.$b$bAt my disposal are a number of potent poisons. The trolls, as you know, are living creatures and therefore must eat. If we combine my poison with their food... well, I'm sure that the results will be entertaining!$b$bCare to help rid us of the Shadowpine trolls at Zeb'Nowa to the south? The camp straddles both the north and south sides of the road to Zul'Aman."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '到札布諾瓦營地在食人妖的食物裡下毒，再回到鬼魂之地的遠行者營地，將剩下的藥劑師之毒交給藥劑師范衲斯特。', `Details` = '讓我先自我介紹。我是皇家藥劑師學會的藥劑師范衲斯特。我是來幫助遠行者解決他們的食人妖麻煩。我想我有辦法解決這個問題。$b$b我手上有一堆強而有力的毒藥。食人妖也是活的生物，他們也要吃。如果我們把他們的食物加入我的毒藥……那麼，我相信結果會非常有趣。$b$b你願意幫助我們擺脫南邊札布諾瓦的影松食人妖嗎?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9275;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死8名影松暗影施法者和8名影松獵頭者，再回到鬼魂之地找旅行者營地的遠行者索安娜。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill 8 Shadowpine Shadowcasters and 8 Shadowpine Headhunters, and return to Farstrider Solanna at Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill 8 Shadowpine Shadowcasters and 8 Shadowpine Headhunters, and return to Farstrider Solanna at Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands.",  OLD Details : "我很高興你來這裡幫忙，$c。我們的資源已經減少許多，所以你的幫忙對我們而言是相當珍貴的。隊長已派我追查當地影松食人妖營地的騷擾事件。我們的策略就是讓他們失去平衡直到有天能一舉殲滅他們。$B$B到那時候，我們就需要所有能找到的志願者，這樣那些影松食人妖的數量才不會增加。$B$B你覺得你能前往東方的札布泰拉給他們點顏色瞧瞧嗎？", Details AC enUS : "Our resources are spread pretty thin here, $c, so your help is going to be invaluable.  The captain has tasked me with overseeing the harassment of the local Shadowpine troll camps. We have a policy of keeping them off balance until the day when we can launch a brutal offensive to wipe them out.$B$BUntil then, we need all of the volunteers that we can get so that those Shadowpine troll numbers are decreased.$B$BThink you could head east to Zeb'Tela and hurt them a little?" ; Wowhead enUS : "Our resources are spread pretty thin here, $c, so your help is going to be invaluable. The captain has tasked me with overseeing the harassment of the local Shadowpine troll camps. We have a policy of keeping them off balance until the day when we can launch a brutal offensive to wipe them out.$b$bUntil then, we need all of the volunteers that we can get so that those Shadowpine troll numbers are decreased.$b$bThink you could head east to Zeb'Tela and hurt them a little?",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Shadowpine Shadowcaster slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Shadowpine Headhunter slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死8名影松暗影施法者和8名影松獵頭者，再回到鬼魂之地找遠行者營地的遠行者索安娜。', `Details` = '我很高興你來這裡幫忙，$c。我們的資源已經減少許多，所以你的幫忙對我們而言是相當珍貴的。隊長已派我追查當地影松食人妖營地的騷擾事件。我們的策略就是讓他們失去平衡直到有天能一舉殲滅他們。$b$b到那時候，我們就需要所有能找到的志願者，這樣那些影松食人妖的數量才不會增加。$b$b你覺得你能前往東方的札布泰拉給他們點顏色瞧瞧嗎?', `Objectivetext1` = '影松暗影施法者 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '影松獵頭者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9276;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死10名影松馭貓者和10名影松妖術師，再回到鬼魂之地找旅行者營地的遠行者索安娜。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill 10 Shadowpine Catlords and 10 Shadowpine Hexxers, and return to Farstrider Solanna at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill 10 Shadowpine Catlords and 10 Shadowpine Hexxers, and return to Farstrider Solanna at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands.",  OLD Details : "是來點比較有挑戰性任務的時候了。南邊的札布諾瓦是較強大的影松食人妖的家。為了持續將食人妖的數量削減至最小，我要派你去那裡攻擊他們，不論你用什麼手段。$B$B你覺得這方法如何，$n？準備好對付更多的食人妖了嗎？", Details AC enUS : "Time for something a little more challenging. Zeb'Nowa, to the south, is where the more powerful Shadowpine trolls make their home. In our continuing effort to keep the troll numbers to a minimum I'm dispatching you to go down there and assail them by whatever means you have at your disposal.$B$BWhat do you say, $N? Ready to deal with some more trolls?" ; Wowhead enUS : "Time for something a little more challenging. Zeb'Nowa, to the south, is where the more powerful Shadowpine trolls make their home. In our continuing effort to keep the troll numbers to a minimum I'm dispatching you to go down there and assail them by whatever means you have at your disposal.$b$bWhat do you say, $n? Ready to deal with some more trolls?",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Shadowpine Catlord slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Shadowpine Hexxer slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死10名影松馭貓者和10名影松妖術師，再回到鬼魂之地找遠行者營地的遠行者索安娜。', `Details` = '是來點比較有挑戰性任務的時候了。南邊的札布諾瓦是較強大的影松食人妖的家。為了持續將食人妖的數量削減至最小，我要派你去那裡攻擊他們，不論你用什麼手段。$b$b你覺得這方法如何，$n?準備好對付更多的食人妖了嗎?', `Objectivetext1` = '影松馭貓者 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '影松妖術師 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9277;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "博學者坎德立斯派我來這清除任何有敵意的野生生物。等這個區域安全了，博學者打算把這裡變成對抗天譴軍團的前哨。$B$B如果要我說當學生時學到的一件事就是負起責任 - 尤其是悠關性命的事!$B$B如果你有興趣，我要你去殺死西邊和南邊的巨型細網蜘蛛和鬼爪劫毀者，我會給你豐厚的報酬。", Details AC enUS : "Magister Kaendris sent me down here to clear the area of any hostile wildlife.  Once this area is secured, the magisters plan to turn it into some sort of advance outpost against the Scourge.$B$BNow if there's one thing I've learned as an apprentice it's to delegate responsibility - especially in matters that endanger one's life!$B$BIf you're interested, I'll pay you well to kill the greater spindlewebs and ghostclaw ravagers to the west and south of here." ; Wowhead enUS : "Magister Kaendris sent me down here to clear the area of any hostile wildlife. Once this area is secured, the magisters plan to turn it into some sort of advance outpost against the Scourge.$b$bNow if there's one thing I've learned as an apprentice it's to delegate responsibility - especially in matters that endanger one's life!$b$bIf you're interested, I'll pay you well to kill the greater spindlewebs and ghostclaw ravagers to the west and south of here.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Greater Spindleweb slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Ghostclaw Ravager slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '博學者坎德立斯派我來這清除任何有敵意的野生生物。等這個區域安全了，博學者打算把這裡變成對抗天譴軍團的前哨。$b$b如果要我說當學生時學到的一件事就是負起責任 - 尤其是悠關性命的事!$b$b如果你有興趣，我要你去殺死西邊和南邊的巨型細網蜘蛛和鬼爪劫毀者，我會給你豐厚的報酬。', `Objectivetext1` = '巨型細網蜘蛛 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '鬼爪劫毀者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9281;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "旅行者營地", Title AC enUS : "The Farstrider Enclave" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Farstrider Enclave",  OLD Objectives : "太陽聖所的博學者坎德立斯要你去鬼魂之地和旅行者營地的遊俠薇娜談談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Magister Kaendris, at the Sanctum of the Sun, wants you to talk to Ranger Vynna at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Magister Kaendris, at the Sanctum of the Sun, wants you to talk to Ranger Vynna at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands.",  OLD Details : "博學者和遠行者永遠都不會有意見一致的時候，$n。不過，說到達克汗，我們全都同意一定要想出個辦法來擊敗他和他的軍團。$B$B東北邊的旅行者營地有個叫薇娜的遊俠，她對我們的敵人有了一些重要的發現。和她談談看是否你能幫得上忙。", Details AC enUS : "Magisters and Farstriders may not see eye to eye all the time, $N.  When it comes to Dar'Khan, however, we're all in agreement that a way must be found to defeat him and his legions.$B$BRanger Vynna, at the Farstrider Enclave northeast of here, has come across important information regarding our enemy.  Speak to her and see if you can be of assistance.  " ; Wowhead enUS : "Magisters and Farstriders may not see eye to eye all the time, $n. When it comes to Dar'Khan, however, we're all in agreement that a way must be found to defeat him and his legions.$b$bRanger Vynna, at the Farstrider Enclave northeast of here, has come across important information regarding our enemy. Speak to her and see if you can be of assistance."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '遠行者營地', `Objectives` = '太陽聖所的博學者坎德立斯要你去鬼魂之地和遠行者營地的遊俠薇娜談談。', `Details` = '博學者和遠行者永遠都不會有意見一致的時候，$n。不過，說到達克汗，我們全都同意一定要想出個辦法來擊敗他和他的軍團。$b$b東北邊的遠行者營地有個叫薇娜的遊俠，她對我們的敵人有了一些重要的發現。和她談談看是否你能幫得上忙。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9282;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "附近的湖已受到其中一塊船用能量水晶的污染。許多安曼谷的植物和動物也都因此產生突變。$B$B我有個方法可以治療湖泊，但我需要突變的鞭笞者樣本來做分析。他們就在西邊的安曼牧場裡。$B$B你能幫我嗎， $C ?", Details AC enUS : "The nearby lake has been contaminated by one of the ship's power crystals.  Many of the plants and animals of Ammen Vale have been mutated because of this.$B$BI have a theory on how to heal the lake, but I must have samples from the mutated lashers for analysis.  They can be found to the west in the Ammen Fields.$B$BWill you help me, $c?" ; Wowhead enUS : "The nearby lake has been contaminated by one of the ship's power crystals. Many of the plants and animals of Ammen Vale have been mutated because of this.$b$bI have a theory on how to heal the lake, but I must have samples from the mutated lashers for analysis. They can be found to the west in the Ammen Fields.$b$bWill you help me, $c?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '附近的湖已受到其中一塊船用能量水晶的污染。許多安曼谷的植物和動物也都因此產生突變。$b$b我有個方法可以治療湖泊，但我需要突變的鞭笞者樣本來做分析。他們就在西邊的安曼牧場裡。$b$b你能幫我嗎，$c?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9293;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "感謝老天爺，我想它產生作用了!我會給你一個藥劑讓你散播在南邊的銀線湖裡。它會中和掉散落在這附近的放射性船用能量水晶所產生的影響。$B$B游到那裡並散播我的中和劑。別擔心，你不會因為待太久而被輻射影響的。", Details AC enUS : "Thank goodness, I think it'll work!  I have an agent for you to spread at Silverline Lake to the south.  It will neutralize the effects of the irradiated ship's power crystal that fell there.$B$BSwim out and scatter the neutralizing agent near it.  Don't worry, you won't be exposed long enough to become irradiated." ; Wowhead enUS : "Thank goodness, I think it'll work! I have an agent for you to spread at Silverline Lake to the south. It will neutralize the effects of the irradiated ship's power crystal that fell there.$b$bSwim out and scatter the neutralizing agent near it. Don't worry, you won't be exposed long enough to become irradiated.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Disperse the Neutralizing Agent" ; Wowhead enUS : "Disperse the Neutralizing Agent"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '感謝老天爺，我想它產生作用了!我會給你一個藥劑讓你散播在南邊的銀線湖裡。它會中和掉散落在這附近的放射性船用能量水晶所產生的影響。$b$b游到那裡並散播我的中和劑。別擔心，你不會因為待太久而被幅射影響的。', `Objectivetext1` = '散播中和劑', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9294;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "薩那需要我們的幫忙來搶救艾克索達的部份區域。泰瑞茲準備了一份疫苗可以用在奈斯特灌木林梟獸身上，大部分需要搶救的地區都有他們的蹤跡。$B$B只要靠近未注射的梟獸再使用水晶就可以了。不幸的是，你必須殺了其他的生物。你可以在東南邊的奈斯特灌木林和奈斯特山丘找到他們。", Details AC enUS : "Zhanaa needs our help to salvage parts from the Exodar.  Taerix prepared an inoculum that can be given to the Nestlewood owlkin that live in the area of a lot of the salvage.$B$BJust get close to the unaffected ones and use the crystal on them.  Unfortunately, you'll have to kill the others.  You'll find the owlkin at Nestlewood Thicket and Nestlewood Hills to the southeast." ; Wowhead enUS : "Zhanaa needs our help to salvage parts from the Exodar. Taerix prepared an inoculum that can be given to the Nestlewood owlkin that live in the area of a lot of the salvage.$b$bJust get close to the unaffected ones and use the crystal on them. Unfortunately, you'll have to kill the others. You'll find the owlkin at Nestlewood Thicket and Nestlewood Hills to the southeast.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Nestlewood Owlkin inoculated" ; Wowhead enUS : "Nestlewood Owlkin inoculated"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '薩那需要我們的幫忙來搶救艾克索達的部份區域。泰瑞茲準備了一份疫苗可以用在奈斯特灌木林梟獸身上，大部分需要搶救的地區都有他們的蹤跡。$b$b只要靠近未注射的梟獸再使用水晶就可以了。不幸的是，你必須殺了其他的生物。你可以在東南邊的奈斯特灌木林和奈斯特山丘找到他們。', `Objectivetext1` = '奈斯特灌木林梟獸注射成功', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9303;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我們已設法找到在失事中損壞的全像攝影發射器。如果我們能修好它，那麼我們就有機會找到安曼谷外的其他生還者。$B$B我們知道鄰近區域有些船上的儀器可以拿來做為備用零件，不過當地的梟獸早已搶先我們一步偷走它們。$B$B $N ，我們要你前往南邊的奈斯特灌木林和山丘，找到那些備用零件!", Details AC enUS : "We managed to recover a damaged holographic emitter from the crash. If we repair it, we'll have a chance to find other survivors outside of Ammen Vale.$B$BThere were devices from the ship that could be salvaged for spare parts in the area, but the local owlkin carried them off before we could get to them. $B$B$N, you must go south to Nestlewood Thicket and Hills to find the spare parts." ; Wowhead enUS : "We managed to recover a damaged holographic emitter from the crash. If we repair it, we'll have a chance to find other survivors outside of Ammen Vale.$b$bThere were devices from the ship that could be salvaged for spare parts in the area, but the local owlkin carried them off before we could get to them.$b$b$n, you must go south to Nestlewood Thicket and Hills to find the spare parts."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我們已設法找到在失事中損壞的全像攝影發射器。如果我們能修好它，那麼我們就有機會找到安曼谷外的其他生還者。$b$b我們知道鄰近區域有些船上的儀器可以拿來做為備用零件，不過當地的梟獸早已搶先我們一步偷走它們。$b$b$n，我們要你前往南邊的奈斯特灌木林和山丘，找到那些備用零件!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9305;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我們手上有幾個不同來源的證據指出暗影山脊有不尋常的活動正在進行中。$B$B這很麻煩;我們以為先前進行的偵察任務已經做得很徹底了。有一個斥候尚未跟我回報。$B$B $C ，我要你前往西南方到銀線湖的另一邊，找到托蘭，看他為什麼被耽擱了。", Details AC enUS : "We now have several separate confirmations of unusual activity up on the Shadow Ridge.$B$BThis is disturbing; we thought that the scouting missions already undertaken had been thorough. One of my scouts hasn't reported back yet.$B$B$C, I need you to head southwest to the other side of Silverline Lake and find Tolaan, and see what has delayed him." ; Wowhead enUS : "We now have several separate confirmations of unusual activity up on the Shadow Ridge.$b$bThis is disturbing; we thought that the scouting missions already undertaken had been thorough. One of my scouts hasn't reported back yet.$b$b$c, I need you to head southwest to the other side of Silverline Lake and find Tolaan, and see what has delayed him."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我們手上有幾個不同來源的證據指出暗影山脊有不尋常的活動正在進行中。$b$b這很麻煩;我們以為先前進行的偵察任務已經做得很徹底了。有一個斥候尚未跟我回報。$b$b$c，我要你前往西南方到銀線湖的另一邊，找到托蘭，看他為什麼被耽擱了。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9309;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我有一個計畫。我們一定要殺了他們的領導者。他們沒有了主人，或許會撤退重建勢力。我們只要爭取時間直到修復完成。$B$B然後復仇者艾德一定會知道這件事。殺了勘測員，再回去告訴他我們發現了什麼。", Details AC enUS : "I have a plan. We must kill their leader. Without their master, perhaps they will retreat to regroup. We just need to buy time until the repairs are completed.$b$bThen Vindicator Aldar must know of this. Kill the surveyor, then return and tell him what we've found." ; Wowhead enUS : "I have a plan. We must kill their leader. Without their master, perhaps they will retreat to regroup. We just need to buy time until the repairs are completed.$b$bThen Vindicator Aldar must know of this. Kill the surveyor, then return and tell him what we've found."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我有一個計劃。我們一定要殺了他們的領導者。他們沒有了主人，或許會撤退重建勢力。我們只要爭取時間直到修復完成。$b$b然後復仇者艾德一定會知道這件事。殺了勘測員，再回去告訴他我們發現了什麼。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9311;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : " $N ，你去外面調查暗影山脊時，薩那已經在這裡展開關於全像攝影發射器的研究。你應該會想和她談談。", Details AC enUS : "$N, while you were out investigating the Shadow Ridge, Zhanaa here has been going on about the holographic emitter.  You might want to speak with her." ; Wowhead enUS : "$n, while you were out investigating the Shadow Ridge, Zhanaa here has been going on about the holographic emitter. You might want to speak with her."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '$n，你去外面調查暗影山脊時，薩那已經在這裡展開關於全像攝影發射器的研究。你應該會想和她談談。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9312;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "謝天謝地，$n，你一定要立刻到藍色守望和戴伏恩談談!$B$B有一條路通往這小島的西邊。沿著它走並穿過水晶河川到達島的較大區域。再沿著路走你就會來到藍色守望。$B$B看看你能否說服他們給我們一些補給和援助。我們會盡量跟上你。$B$B謝謝你，沒有你我們辦不到這些的!", Details AC enUS : "By all that is good, $N, you must go at once to this Azure Watch and speak with Dyvuun!$B$BThere is a path that leads west off of this tiny isle.  Follow it and cross the Crystalbrook River to arrive on the larger part of the isle.  Continue to follow the path and you should find Azure Watch.$B$BSee if you can convince them to send us some aid and supplies.  The rest of us will follow when we can.$B$BThank you, we wouldn't have made it without you!" ; Wowhead enUS : "By all that is good, $n, you must go at once to this Azure Watch and speak with Dyvuun!$b$bThere is a path that leads west off of this tiny isle. Follow it and cross the Crystalbrook River to arrive on the larger part of the isle. Continue to follow the path and you should find Azure Watch.$b$bSee if you can convince them to send us some aid and supplies. The rest of us will follow when we can.$b$bThank you, we wouldn't have made it without you!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '謝天謝地，$n，你一定要立刻到藍色守望和戴伏恩談談!$b$b有一條路通往這小島的西邊。沿著它走並穿過水晶河川到達島的較大區域。再沿著路走你就會來到藍色守望。$b$b看看你能否說服他們給我們一些補給和援助。我們會盡量跟上你。$b$b謝謝你，沒有你我們辦不到這些的!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9313;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "$C！有一群突變的野獸撲向我，害我的腿受了傷。$B$B我們收到薩那的命令後就從藍色守望出發派去進行偵察任務。拜託你，代替我去和照顧者查倫談談好嗎？她需要知道會有多少人前去藍色守望。越過水晶河川再沿著路走，你就可以到達藍色守望。$B$B記得請她給你一個地方休息。", Details AC enUS : "$C! A couple mutated beasts jumped me and my leg is injured.$B$BI was sent on a scouting mission from Azure Watch after we received word from Zhanaa. Please, could you go speak with Caregiver Chellan in my stead? She needs to know how many people to expect in Azure Watch. Just cross the Crystalbrook River here and continue following the road until you get to Azure Watch.$B$BBe sure to ask her for a place for yourself to stay in." ; Wowhead enUS : "$c! A couple mutated beasts jumped me and my leg is injured.$b$bI was sent on a scouting mission from Azure Watch after we received word from Zhanaa. Please, could you go speak with Caregiver Chellan in my stead? She needs to know how many people to expect in Azure Watch. Just cross the Crystalbrook River here and continue following the road until you get to Azure Watch.$b$bBe sure to ask her for a place for yourself to stay in."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '$c!有一群突變的野獸撲向我，害我的腿受了傷。$b$b我們收到薩那的命令後就從藍色守望出發派去進行偵察任務。拜託你，代替我去和照顧者查倫談談好嗎?她需要知道會有多少人前去藍色守望。越過水晶河川再沿著路走，你就可以到達藍色守望。$b$b記得請她給你一個地方休息。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9314;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "靠近一點，我快...死了。$B$B我被派來這裡...殺這些奈幽蟲族，但是范德隆不...知道他們有個領導者。$B$B<垂死的血精靈咳出了大量的鮮血。>$B$B你一定要找到...並殺死安羅科舒頓。找人幫忙。她在日冠村...附近遊蕩。", Details AC enUS : "Come closer, I am ... dying.$B$BI was sent here ... to slay these Nerubians, but Vandril didn't ... know that they have a leader.$B$B<The dying blood elf coughs up a good amount of blood.>$B$BYou must find and ... slay Anok'suten.  Get help.  She wanders around ... Suncrown Village." ; Wowhead enUS : "Come closer, I am ... dying.$b$bI was sent here ... to slay these Nerubians, but Vandril didn't ... know that they have a leader.$b$b<The dying blood elf coughs up a good amount of blood.>$b$bYou must find and ... slay Anok'suten. Get help. She wanders around ... Suncrown Village.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Anok'suten slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '靠近一點，我快……死了。$b$b我被派來這裡……殺這些奈幽蟲族，但是范德隆不……知道他們有個領導者。$b$b<垂死的血精靈咳出了大量的鮮血。>$b$b你一定要找到……並殺死安羅科舒頓。找人幫忙。她在日冠村……附近遊蕩。', `Objectivetext1` = '安羅科舒頓 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9315;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "找到並觸碰位在黑石塔，厄運之槌，通靈學院，和斯坦索姆的篝火。", Objectives AC enUS : "Find and touch the bonfires located within Blackrock Spire, Dire Maul, Scholomance, and Stratholme, then return to the Festival Flamekeeper." ; Wowhead enUS : "Find and touch the bonfires located within Blackrock Spire, Dire Maul, Scholomance, and Stratholme, then return to the Festival Flamekeeper.",  OLD Details : "我們不是唯一慶祝這個節日的人，$n。所有的生物，所有的文化，都被這火焰所感動。就連在最黑暗的地方，也點著這些火焰。$b$b如果你想親自看看它們就到深處去。找到在斯坦索姆，通靈學院，厄運之槌，和黑石塔大廳燃燒的篝火;我會等著你回來。", Details AC enUS : "We are not the only ones who celebrate this holiday, $n. All creatures, all cultures, are touched by the flame. Even in the darkest places, the fires are being lit.$b$bIf you wish to see them for yourself, travel into the depths. Seek out the bonfires burning within Stratholme, Scholomance, among the ogres of Dire Maul, and the halls of Blackrock Spire itself; I will await your return." ; Wowhead enUS : "We are not the only ones who celebrate this holiday, $n. All creatures, all cultures, are touched by the flame. Even in the darkest places, the fires are being lit.$b$bIf you wish to see them for yourself, travel into the depths. Seek out the bonfires burning within Stratholme, Scholomance, among the ogres of Dire Maul, and the halls of Blackrock Spire itself; I will await your return.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of Dire Maul",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of Blackrock Spire",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of Stratholme",  OLD Objectivetext4 : "", Objectivetext4 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of the Scholomance"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '找到並觸碰位在黑石塔，厄運之槌，通靈學院，和斯坦索姆的營火。', `Details` = '我們不是唯一慶祝這個節日的人，$n。所有的生物，所有的文化，都被這火焰所感動。就連在最黑暗的地方，也點著這些火焰。$b$b如果你想親自看看它們就到深處去。找到在斯坦索姆，通靈學院，厄運之槌，和黑石塔大廳燃燒的營火;我會等著你回來。', `Objectivetext1` = '營火 - 厄運之槌', `Objectivetext2` = '營火 - 黑石塔', `Objectivetext3` = '營火 - 斯坦索姆', `Objectivetext4` = '營火 - 通靈學院', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9319;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "艾澤拉斯到處都在慶祝仲夏火焰節慶，而卡林多這塊多變的土地也不例外。你看起來很適合旅行 - 或許已經安排好一個旅程了。$b$b如果你沒有看過世界各處猛烈的藍色火焰就不算真的體驗了仲夏。主持者們在冷颼颼的西冬泉谷，艾薩拉東北邊，希利蘇斯荒原的勇士之墓附近，和通往繁茂安戈洛的入口都點燃了火焰。等你的旅行完成了再回來。", Details AC enUS : "The Midsummer Fire Festival is celebrated everywhere in Azeroth, and the diverse land of Kalimdor is no exception. You look fit to travel -- perhaps a journey is in order.$b$bMidsummer cannot be truly appreciated unless you've seen the blistering blue fires abroad. The celebrants have lit fires in chilly western Winterspring, northeastern Azshara, near Valor's Rest in the wastes of Silithus, and by the entrance to lush Un'Goro. Return once your journey is complete." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Midsummer Fire Festival is celebrated everywhere in Azeroth, and the diverse land of Kalimdor is no exception. You look fit to travel -- perhaps a journey is in order.$b$bMidsummer cannot be truly appreciated unless you've seen the blistering blue fires abroad. The celebrants have lit fires in chilly western Winterspring, northeastern Azshara, near Valor's Rest in the wastes of Silithus, and by the entrance to lush Un'Goro. Return once your journey is complete.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of Azshara",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of Silithus",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of Un'Goro",  OLD Objectivetext4 : "", Objectivetext4 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of Winterspring"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '艾澤拉斯到處都在慶祝仲夏火焰節慶，而卡林多這塊多變的土地也不例外。你看起來很適合旅行 - 或許已經安排好一個旅程了。$b$b如果你沒有看過世界各處猛烈的藍色火焰就不算真的體驗了仲夏。主持者們在冷颼颼的西冬泉谷，艾薩拉東北邊，希利蘇斯荒地的勇士之墓附近，和通往繁茂安戈洛的入口都點燃了火焰。等你的旅行完成了再回來。', `Objectivetext1` = '營火 - 艾薩拉', `Objectivetext2` = '營火 - 希利蘇斯', `Objectivetext3` = '營火 - 安戈洛', `Objectivetext4` = '營火 - 冬泉谷', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9322;
