-- AC datas : OLD Details : "這個從幽暗城廢墟偷出來的火焰，讓你感到很溫暖。這股新的力量對你而言很陌生，但博學大師或許知道更多...", Details AC enUS : "This flame, stolen from the ruins above the Undercity, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Loremaster might know more..." ; Wowhead enUS : "This flame, stolen from the ruins above the Undercity, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Loremaster might know more..."
