-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我知道這聽起來很奇怪，但被遺忘者竟來這裡幫忙。你應該和他們的領導者高階執行官瑪弗倫談談。他就在城西邊的塔裡。$B$B還有，$c，等你和他談完後再來找我;我有些緊急的事要立刻處理!", Details AC enUS : "I know it seems strange, but these Forsaken are here to help. You should speak with their leader, High Executor Mavren. He's in the tower on the west side of town.$B$BAnd, $c, when you're done talking with him return to me; I have something dire that needs to be dealt with immediately!" ; Wowhead enUS : "I know it seems strange, but these Forsaken are here to help. You should speak with their leader, High Executor Mavren. He's in the tower on the west side of town.$b$bAnd, $c, when you're done talking with him return to me; I have something dire that needs to be dealt with immediately!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我知道這聽起來很奇怪，但被遺忘者竟來這裡幫忙。你應該和他們的領導者高階執行官瑪弗倫談談。他就在城西邊的塔裡。$b$b還有，$c，等你和他談完後再來找我;我有些緊急的事要立刻處理!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9327;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把達克汗的頭顱帶給銀月城的洛索瑪‧塞隆。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take Dar'Khan's Head to Lor'themar Theron in Silvermoon City." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take Dar'Khan's Head to Lor'themar Theron in Silvermoon City.",  OLD Details : "這是我們種族歷史中新的一章，$n。我們將會奪回我們的領土，並且鞏固和希瓦娜斯及其盟友的關係。$B$B把背叛者的頭顱帶給銀月城的攝政王，洛索瑪‧塞隆。他會非常渴望聽到這個消息。", Details AC enUS : "This is the beginning of a new chapter in the history of our race, $N.  Our lands will be reclaimed and we shall cement our bond with Sylvanas and her allies.$B$BTake the traitor's head to Regent Lord Lor'themar Theron in Silvermoon City.  He'll be eager to hear the news." ; Wowhead enUS : "This is the beginning of a new chapter in the history of our race, $n. Our lands will be reclaimed and we shall cement our bond with Sylvanas and her allies.$b$bTake the traitor's head to Regent Lord Lor'themar Theron in Silvermoon City. He'll be eager to hear the news."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把達克汗的頭顱帶給銀月城的洛索瑪·塞隆。', `Details` = '這是我們種族歷史中新的一章，$n。我們將會奪回我們的領土，並且鞏固和希瓦娜斯及其盟友的關係。$b$b把背叛者的頭顱帶給銀月城的地區統治者，洛索瑪·塞隆。他會非常渴望聽到這個消息。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9328;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我知道這聽起來很奇怪，但被遺忘者竟來這裡幫忙。你應該和他們的領導者高階執行官瑪弗倫談談。他就在城西邊的塔裡。$B$B還有，$c，等你和他談完後再來找我;我有些緊急的事要立刻處理!", Details AC enUS : "I know it seems strange, but the Forsaken are here to help. You should speak with their leader, High Executor Mavren.  He's in the tower on the west side of town.$B$BAnd, $c, when you're done talking with him return to me; I have something dire that needs to be dealt with immediately!" ; Wowhead enUS : "I know it seems strange, but the Forsaken are here to help. You should speak with their leader, High Executor Mavren. He's in the tower on the west side of town.$b$bAnd, $c, when you're done talking with him return to me; I have something dire that needs to be dealt with immediately!"
