-- AC datas : OLD Title : "偷取鐵爐堡之焰", Title AC enUS : "Stealing Ironforge's Flame" ; Wowhead enUS : "Stealing Ironforge's Flame",  OLD Objectives : "將鐵爐堡之焰交給節慶故事使者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Return the Flame of Ironforge to the Festival Talespinner." ; Wowhead enUS : "Return the Flame of Ironforge to the Festival Talespinner.",  OLD Details : "這個從鐵爐堡中心偷出來的火焰，讓你感到很溫暖。這股新的力量對你而言很陌生，但故事使者或許知道更多...", Details AC enUS : "This flame, stolen from the heart of Ironforge itself, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Talespinner might know more..." ; Wowhead enUS : "This flame, stolen from the heart of Ironforge itself, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Talespinner might know more..."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '偷取鐵爐堡之火', `Objectives` = '將鐵爐堡之火帶給節慶故事使者。', `Details` = '這個從鐵爐堡中心偷出來的火焰，讓你感到很溫暖。這股新的力量對你而言很陌生，但故事使者或許知道更多……', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9331;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "偷取達納蘇斯之焰", Title AC enUS : "Stealing Darnassus's Flame" ; Wowhead enUS : "Stealing Darnassus's Flame",  OLD Objectives : "將達納蘇斯之焰交給節慶故事使者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Return the Flame of Darnassus to the Festival Talespinner." ; Wowhead enUS : "Return the Flame of Darnassus to the Festival Talespinner.",  OLD Details : "這個從泰達希爾陸地偷出來的火焰，讓你感到很溫暖。這股新的力量對你而言很陌生，但故事使者或許知道更多...", Details AC enUS : "This flame, stolen from the shores of Teldrassil, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Talespinner might know more..." ; Wowhead enUS : "This flame, stolen from the shores of Teldrassil, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Talespinner might know more..."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '偷取達納蘇斯之火', `Objectives` = '將達納蘇斯之火帶給節慶故事使者。', `Details` = '這個從泰達希爾陸地偷出來的火焰，讓你感到很溫暖。這股新的力量對你而言很陌生，但故事使者或許知道更多……', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9332;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "除了惡癮者不斷帶來的威脅外，我還要處理各種謊報目睹夜精靈的狀況。$B$B雖然大部份的報告都是沒有根據的，但是，最近有個事件確實需要進一步的調查。西部聖所是我們的主要能量來源，不過它卻嚴重失常了，而且有很多傳言說那是達納蘇斯的人破壞的。$B$B前往那裡對付任何可疑人物，然後向看守聖所的地脈看守者維蘭妮雅回報。", Details AC enUS : "Besides the constant threat that the Wretched represent, I also have to deal with all kind of fictitious reports of night elf sightings.$B$BThough most reports are unfounded, one recent incident demands further investigation.  The West Sanctum, one of our primary energy sources, has suffered a terrible malfunction and rumors of Darnassian sabotage are rampant.$B$BTravel there and deal with anyone that looks suspicious.  Report back to Ley-Keeper Velania, who watches over the sanctum." ; Wowhead enUS : "Besides the constant threat that the Wretched represent, I also have to deal with all kind of fictitious reports of night elf sightings.$b$bThough most reports are unfounded, one recent incident demands further investigation. The West Sanctum, one of our primary energy sources, has suffered a terrible malfunction and rumors of Darnassian sabotage are rampant.$b$bTravel there and deal with anyone that looks suspicious. Report back to Ley-Keeper Velania, who watches over the sanctum."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '除了鄙惡者不斷帶來的威脅外，我還要處理各種謊報目睹夜精靈的狀況。$b$b雖然大部份的報導都是沒有根據的，但是，最近有個事件需要進一步的調查。我們的主要能量來源之一，西部聖所，而且關於達納蘇斯破壞的傳言一直很猖獗。$b$b前往那裡對付任何可疑的人。再向看守聖所的牧地看守者維蘭妮雅回報。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9352;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "別以為這個村子的安全是與生俱來的。我們被東邊的天譴軍團和西邊的惡癮者包圍。$B$B遊俠塞瑞保護我們的邊界，不讓死亡之痕湧入的不死族侵擾我們。沿著出城後往東邊的路走，看看你能否幫她一把。", Details AC enUS : "Don't take the safety of this village for granted.  We're under siege by the Scourge on the east and the Wretched to the west.$B$BRanger Sareyn keeps our borders safe from the undead that pour in from the Dead Scar.  Follow the road eastwards out of town and see if you can lend her a hand." ; Wowhead enUS : "Don't take the safety of this village for granted. We're under siege by the Scourge on the east and the Wretched to the west.$b$bRanger Sareyn keeps our borders safe from the undead that pour in from the Dead Scar. Follow the road eastwards out of town and see if you can lend her a hand."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '別以為這個村子的安全是與生俱來的。我們被東邊的天譴軍團和西邊的鄙惡者包圍。$b$b遊俠塞瑞保護我們的邊界，不讓死亡之痕湧入的不死族侵擾我們。沿著出城後往東邊的路走，看看你能否幫她一把。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9358;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "向永歌森林遠行者營地的曦奔中尉報告。", Objectives AC enUS : "Report to Lieutenant Dawnrunner at the Farstrider Retreat in Eversong Woods." ; Wowhead enUS : "Report to Lieutenant Dawnrunner at the Farstrider Retreat in Eversong Woods.",  OLD Details : "你對壓制惡癮者的幫助是無價的。遠行者在對抗阿曼尼食人妖時如果能有像你這樣的人一定會很有用。$B$B去東北方的遠行者營地和曦奔中尉談談，看看他需要怎樣的幫助。", Details AC enUS : "Your help in subduing the Wretched has been invaluable.  The Farstriders would surely have use for someone like you in their fight against the Amani trolls.$B$BLook for the Farstrider Retreat to the northeast of here, speak to Lieutenant Dawnrunner and see what assistance she might need." ; Wowhead enUS : "Your help in subduing the Wretched has been invaluable. The Farstriders would surely have use for someone like you in their fight against the Amani trolls.$b$bLook for the Farstrider Retreat to the northeast of here, speak to Lieutenant Dawnrunner and see what assistance she might need."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '向永歌森林遠行者營地的晨奔中尉報告。', `Details` = '你對壓制鄙惡者的幫助是無價的。遠行者在對抗阿曼尼食人妖時如果能有像你這樣的人一定會很有用。$b$b去東北方的遠行者營地和晨奔中尉談談，看看他需要怎樣的幫助。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9359;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將阿曼尼攻擊計畫送給遠行者居所的曦奔中尉。", Objectives AC enUS : "Deliver the Amani Invasion Plans to Lieutenant Dawnrunner at Farstrider Retreat." ; Wowhead enUS : "Deliver the Amani Invasion Plans to Lieutenant Dawnrunner at Farstrider Retreat.",  OLD Details : "雖然你不了解這些作戰計畫的語言，你還是能清楚地辨別出一個標記著遠行者居所和晴風村的地圖。$B$B你最好讓遠行者居所的曦奔中尉知道這點。", Details AC enUS : "Though you don't understand the language in these battle plans, you clearly make out a map marking the positions of the Farstrider Retreat and Fairbreeze Village.$B$BYou'd best let Lieutenant Dawnrunner at the Farstrider Retreat know about this." ; Wowhead enUS : "Though you don't understand the language in these battle plans, you clearly make out a map marking the positions of the Farstrider Retreat and Fairbreeze Village.$b$bYou'd best let Lieutenant Dawnrunner at the Farstrider Retreat know about this."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將阿曼尼攻擊計畫送給遠行者居所的晨奔中尉。', `Details` = '雖然你不了解這些作戰計劃的語言，你還是能清楚地辨別出一個標記著遠行者居所和晴風村的地圖。$b$b你最好讓遠行者居所的晨奔中尉知道這點。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9360;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "前往晴風村警告遊俠迪哥里恩關於阿曼尼的計畫。即使祖瑪羅什已死，晴風村還是要準備好對抗食人妖的攻擊。告訴迪哥里恩我們會盡快派遣援軍給他。", Details AC enUS : "Go to Fairbreeze Village and notify Ranger Degolien of the Amani plans.  Even with Zul'Marosh dead, Fairbreeze must prepare for a troll attack.  Tell Degolien I will send him reinforcements as soon as possible." ; Wowhead enUS : "Go to Fairbreeze Village and notify Ranger Degolien of the Amani plans. Even with Zul'Marosh dead, Fairbreeze must prepare for a troll attack. Tell Degolien I will send him reinforcements as soon as possible."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '前往晴風村警告遊俠迪哥里恩關於阿曼尼的計劃。即使祖瑪羅什已死，晴風村還是要準備好對抗食人妖的攻擊。告訴迪哥里恩我們會盡快派遣援軍給他。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9363;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "觸摸暴風城、鐵爐堡和達納蘇斯裡的篝火，再和任何一個節慶博學大師談談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Touch the bonfires within Stormwind, Ironforge, and Darnassus, then speak to a Festival Loremaster within the capital cities." ; Wowhead enUS : "Touch the bonfires within Stormwind, Ironforge, and Darnassus, then speak to a Festival Loremaster within the capital cities.",  OLD Details : "仲夏又來了！$b$b每一年，按照傳統，雀屏中選的篝火管理者要負責看管我們城市裡的篝火。當整個艾澤拉斯都是燃燒的火焰時，我們的火苗一定要是最熱烈、最明亮的，才能恰當地表現出對季節的尊敬。$b$b事實上，我有個任務要給你，如果你不介意的話。我還沒聽說所有主城裡的火焰都燃燒的恰如其分。前往那裡讓火焰為你取取暖 -- 確定它們是燙的！", Details AC enUS : "Midsummer is upon us once again!$b$bEach year, as tradition dictates, Flamekeepers are chosen to tend the bonfires within our capitals. While fires are burning throughout Azeroth, it is imperative that ours be the hottest and brightest, to properly pay homage to the season.$b$bIn fact, I have a task for you, if you don't mind. I've not yet heard if the fires in all capitals are properly burning. Travel there yourself and warm yourself by the fires--make sure they're hot!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Midsummer is upon us once again!$b$bEach year, as tradition dictates, Flamekeepers are chosen to tend the bonfires within our capitals. While fires are burning throughout Azeroth, it is imperative that ours be the hottest and brightest, to properly pay homage to the season.$b$bIn fact, I have a task for you, if you don't mind. I've not yet heard if the fires in all capitals are properly burning. Travel there yourself and warm yourself by the fires--make sure they're hot!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of Stormwind",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of Ironforge",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of Darnassus"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '觸摸暴風城，鐵爐堡和達納蘇斯裡的營火，再和任何一個節慶傳說大師談談。', `Details` = '仲夏又來了!$b$b每一年，按照傳統，雀屏中選的營火管理者要負責看管我們城市裡的營火。當整個艾澤拉斯都是燃燒的火焰時，我們的火苗一定要是最熱烈、最明亮的，才能恰當地表現出對季節的尊敬。$b$b事實上，我有個任務要給你，如果你不介意的話。我還沒聽說所有主城裡的火焰都燃燒的恰如其分。前往那裡讓火焰為你取取暖 -- 確定它們是燙的!', `Objectivetext1` = '營火 - 暴風城', `Objectivetext2` = '營火 - 鐵爐堡', `Objectivetext3` = '營火 - 達納蘇斯', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9367;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "觸摸奧格瑪、雷霆崖和幽暗城裡的篝火，再和任何一個節慶故事使者談談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Touch the bonfires within Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff, and the Undercity, then speak to a Festival Talespinner within the capital cities." ; Wowhead enUS : "Touch the bonfires within Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff, and the Undercity, then speak to a Festival Talespinner within the capital cities.",  OLD Details : "仲夏又來了！$b$b每一年，按照傳統，雀屏中選的篝火管理者要負責看管我們城市裡的篝火。當整個艾澤拉斯都是燃燒的火焰時，我們的火苗一定要是最熱烈、最明亮的，才能恰當地表現出對季節的尊敬。$b$b事實上，我有個任務要給你，如果你不介意的話。我還沒聽說所有主城裡的火焰都燃燒的恰如其分。前往那裡讓火焰為你取取暖 -- 確定它們是燙的！", Details AC enUS : "Midsummer is upon us once again!$b$bEach year, as tradition dictates, Flamekeepers are chosen to tend the bonfires within our capitals. While fires are burning throughout Azeroth, it is imperative that ours be the hottest and brightest, to properly pay homage to the season.$b$bIn fact, I have a task for you, if you don't mind. I've not yet heard if the fires in all capitals are properly burning. Travel there yourself and warm yourself by the fires--make sure they're hot!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Midsummer is upon us once again!$b$bEach year, as tradition dictates, Flamekeepers are chosen to tend the bonfires within our capitals. While fires are burning throughout Azeroth, it is imperative that ours be the hottest and brightest, to properly pay homage to the season.$b$bIn fact, I have a task for you, if you don't mind. I've not yet heard if the fires in all capitals are properly burning. Travel there yourself and warm yourself by the fires--make sure they're hot!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of Orgrimmar",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of Thunder Bluff",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of the Undercity"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '觸摸奧格瑪，雷霆崖和幽暗城裡的營火，再和任何一個節慶故事使者談談。', `Details` = '仲夏又來了!$b$b每一年，按照傳統，雀屏中選的營火管理者要負責看管我們城市裡的營火。當整個艾澤拉斯都是燃燒的火焰時，我們的火苗一定要是最熱烈、最明亮的，才能恰當地表現出對季節的尊敬。$b$b事實上，我有個任務要給你，如果你不介意的話。我還沒聽說所有主城裡的火焰都燃燒的恰如其分。前往那裡讓火焰為你取取暖 -- 確定它們是燙的!', `Objectivetext1` = '營火 - 奧格瑪', `Objectivetext2` = '營火 - 雷霆崖', `Objectivetext3` = '營火 - 幽暗城', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9368;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "從附近的安曼谷飛蛾身上取得6瓶飛蛾血清，再交給安曼谷失事地點的波尼特斯。", Objectives AC enUS : "Acquire 8 Vials of Moth Blood from the nearby Vale Moths and bring them to Proenitus at the Crash Site in Ammen Vale." ; Wowhead enUS : "Acquire 8 Vials of Moth Blood from the nearby Vale Moths and bring them to Proenitus at the Crash Site in Ammen Vale.",  OLD Details : "我們是德萊尼。我們的船失事了，而且由於我們有許多傷者，我們現在最擔心的就是治療水晶的庫存。我們一定要盡快補足水晶!$B$B不幸的是，我們此時唯一的選擇就是從當地的山谷飛蛾身上直接抽取血液。牠們的血液是很合適的替代品。$B$B你可以在溪谷附近的區域找到牠們，不過牠們大多集中在西北方。", Details AC enUS : "We are the draenei.  Our ship crashed and, since we have many wounded, our immediate concern is the depleted state of our healing crystals.  We must replenish them quickly!$B$BUnfortunately, the only way to do this at this point is to extract the blood from the local vale moths.  Their blood will make for a suitable substitute.$B$BThe moths can be found in many places around the vale, but mostly in the northwest." ; Wowhead enUS : "We are the draenei. Our ship crashed and, since we have many wounded, our immediate concern is the depleted state of our healing crystals. We must replenish them quickly!$b$bUnfortunately, the only way to do this at this point is to extract the blood from the local vale moths. Their blood will make for a suitable substitute.$b$bThe moths can be found in many places around the vale, but mostly in the northwest."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '從附近的安曼谷飛蛾身上取得8瓶飛蛾血清，再回到安曼谷失事地點的波尼特斯那裡。', `Details` = '我們是德萊尼。我們的船失事了，而且由於我們有許多傷者，我們現在最擔心的就是治療水晶的耗用情形。我們一定要盡快補足水晶!$b$b不幸的是，我們此時唯一的選擇就是從當地的山谷飛蛾身上直接抽取血液。他們的血液是很合適的替代品。$b$b你可以在溪谷附近的區域找到他們，不過他們大多集中在西北方。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9369;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : " $N ，植物學家泰瑞茲需要你的幫助。你可以在西邊找到她和她的學徒，就在船外面。", Details AC enUS : "$N, Botanist Taerix is in need of your assistance. You'll find her with her apprentices to the west, outside the ship." ; Wowhead enUS : "$n, Botanist Taerix is in need of your assistance. You'll find her with her apprentices to the west, outside the ship."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '$n，植物學家泰瑞茲需要你的幫助。你可以在西邊找到她和她的學徒，就在船外面。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9371;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "探勘梣谷，貧瘠之地，黑海岸，和石爪山脈的篝火，再和節慶火焰管理者談談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Visit the bonfires within Ashenvale, the Barrens, Darkshore, and Stonetalon Mountains, then speak with the Festival Flamekeeper." ; Wowhead enUS : "Visit the bonfires within Ashenvale, the Barrens, Darkshore, and Stonetalon Mountains, then speak with the Festival Flamekeeper.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of Ashenvale",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of the Barrens",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of Darkshore",  OLD Objectivetext4 : "", Objectivetext4 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of Stonetalon"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '探勘梣谷，貧瘠之地，黑海岸，和石爪山脈的營火，再和節慶火焰管理者談談。', `Objectivetext1` = '梣谷之火', `Objectivetext2` = '貧瘠之火', `Objectivetext3` = '黑海岸之火', `Objectivetext4` = '石爪之火', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9388;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "探勘希爾斯布萊德丘陵，銀松森林，西部荒野，和濕地的篝火，再和節慶火焰管理者談談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Visit the bonfires within Hillsbrad Foothills, Silverpine Forest, Westfall, and the Wetlands, then speak with the Festival Flamekeeper." ; Wowhead enUS : "Visit the bonfires within Hillsbrad Foothills, Silverpine Forest, Westfall, and the Wetlands, then speak with the Festival Flamekeeper.",  OLD Details : "仲夏火焰節慶傳統上會在整個土地上點燃無數的火焰。有些人說綠色的火焰是最美的，因為它們是最難維持的而且又有獨特的色澤。為我們的火焰管理者確認它們仍在東部王國燃燒著。它們坐落在濕地的丹莫德附近，銀松森林內的焚木村那裡也有，眺望濕地燈塔的峭壁上，和希爾斯布萊德丘陵廢棄的哨塔旁。", Details AC enUS : "The Midsummer Fire Festival traditionally lights up the land with a myriad of flames. Some argue that the green fires are the finest, as they are the hardest to maintain and have such a distinctive hue.$b$bMake sure they still burn in the Eastern Kingdoms for our Flamekeeper. They sit near Dun Modr in the Wetlands, close to Pyrewood Village within Silverpine Forest, on the cliffs overlooking the lighthouse in Westfall, and by the ruined tower in Hillsbrad Foothills." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Midsummer Fire Festival traditionally lights up the land with a myriad of flames. Some argue that the green fires are the finest, as they are the hardest to maintain and have such a distinctive hue.$b$bMake sure they still burn in the Eastern Kingdoms for our Flamekeeper. They sit near Dun Modr in the Wetlands, close to Pyrewood Village within Silverpine Forest, on the cliffs overlooking the lighthouse in Westfall, and by the ruined tower in Hillsbrad Foothills.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of Hillsbrad",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of Silverpine",  OLD Objectivetext4 : "", Objectivetext4 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame of the Wetlands"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '探勘希爾斯布萊德丘陵，銀松森林，西部荒野，和濕地的營火，再和節慶火焰管理者談談。', `Details` = '仲夏火焰節慶傳統上會在整個土地上點燃無數的火焰。有些人說綠色的火焰是最美的，因為它們是最難維持的而且又有獨特的色澤。為我們的火焰管理者確認它們仍在東部王國燃燒著。它們座落在濕地的丹莫德附近，銀松森林內的焚木村那裡也有，眺望濕地燈塔的峭壁上，和希爾斯布萊德丘陵廢棄的哨塔旁。', `Objectivetext1` = '希爾斯布萊德丘陵之火', `Objectivetext2` = '銀松之火', `Objectivetext4` = '濕地之火', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9389;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "威利坦在哪裡？", Title AC enUS : "Where's Wyllithen?" ; Wowhead enUS : "Where's Wyllithen?",  OLD Objectives : "到永歌森林的暮萎營地尋找地面守衛者威利坦。", Objectives AC enUS : "Find Groundskeeper Wyllithen on the Duskwither Grounds in Eversong Woods." ; Wowhead enUS : "Find Groundskeeper Wyllithen on the Duskwither Grounds in Eversong Woods.",  OLD Details : "暮萎的地面守衛者不見了！一定是博學者和大家離開時忘了叫他一起走了。我知道他還在營地附近，但我不敢自己去找他，有太多魔法生物在那裡閒晃了。$B$B你能幫我去找他嗎，$c，確定他還安然無恙？", Details AC enUS : "The Duskwither groundskeeper has gone missing! Someone must have forgotten to tell him to leave when the magister and everyone else did.  I know that he's still somewhere around here on the grounds, but I dare not go looking for him myself with all of these magical creatures roaming about.$B$BWill you find him for me, $c, and make sure that he's alright?" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Duskwither groundskeeper has gone missing! Someone must have forgotten to tell him to leave when the magister and everyone else did. I know that he's still somewhere around here on the grounds, but I dare not go looking for him myself with all of these magical creatures roaming about.$b$bWill you find him for me, $c, and make sure that he's alright?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '威利坦在哪裡?', `Objectives` = '到永歌森林的暗木營地尋找地面守衛者威利坦。', `Details` = '暗木的地面守衛者不見了!一定是博學者和大家離開時忘了叫他一起走了。我知道他還在營地附近，但我不敢自己去找他，有太多魔法生物在那裡閒晃了。$b$b你能幫我去找他嗎，$c，確定他還安然無恙?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9394;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我發誓如果再讓我收到跟薩瑟里領主的舞會物資相關的請求我就要用火球殺了某人！我看起來像舞會策劃人嗎？！再偷偷告訴你，那個白痴和他的食客們根本就不相信我們這裡正遭受攻擊！$B$B我們有些人正忙著，呃，我不知道，防守奎爾薩拉斯剩下的土地！$C，可以請你前往薩瑟里的避風港看看能不能讓他閉上嘴嗎？那地方就在往西邊的路上。", Details AC enUS : "I swear that I'm going to fireball someone if I get one more request from Lord Saltheril concerning supplies for his party!  Do I look like a party planner?!  Between you and me, that fool and his sycophants are living in denial that we're under attack here!$B$BSome of us are actually busy with, oh, I don't know, defending what's left of Quel'Thalas!  $C, would you please head over to Saltheril's Haven and see if you can shut him up?  It's just down the road to the west." ; Wowhead enUS : "I swear that I'm going to fireball someone if I get one more request from Lord Saltheril concerning supplies for his party! Do I look like a party planner?! Between you and me, that fool and his sycophants are living in denial that we're under attack here!$b$bSome of us are actually busy with, oh, I don't know, defending what's left of Quel'Thalas! $c, would you please head over to Saltheril's Haven and see if you can shut him up? It's just down the road to the west."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我發誓如果再讓我收到跟薩瑟里領主的舞會物資相關的請求我就要用火球殺了某人!我看起來像舞會策劃人嗎?!再偷偷告訴你，那個白痴和他的食客們根本就不相信我們這裡正遭受攻擊!$b$b我們有些人正忙著，呃，我不知道，防守奎爾薩拉斯剩下的土地!$c，可以請你前往薩瑟里的避風港看看能不能讓他閉上嘴嗎?那地方就在往西邊的路上。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9395;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "如果希爾斯布萊德有什麼很棒的事實，那就是那裡註定要活在戰爭的陰影之下。就連像一車的石頭這樣無害的東西都是目標。$B$B通常損失建築材料不是什麼了不起的挫敗，但最近從碧玉礦坑運來的貨物裡包含了一箱我急著要研究的稀有水晶。被遺忘者劫掠者攔截了那輛貨車，並把它開到東北方他們想重建的哨塔那裡。我們一定要立刻奪回那些水晶， $C !", Details AC enUS : "If there's one great truth about Hillsbrad, it's that this region is destined to live under the shadow of war. Even something as innocuous as a cartload of stone is a target.$B$BNormally the loss of building materials is no great setback, but the most recent shipment from the Azurelode mine contained a crate of rare crystals I was eager to study. Forsaken raiders intercepted the cart and drove it northeast to a tower they're attempting to rebuild. It's imperative that we retrieve those crystals, $c!" ; Wowhead enUS : "If there's one great truth about Hillsbrad, it's that this region is destined to live under the shadow of war. Even something as innocuous as a cartload of stone is a target.$b$bNormally the loss of building materials is no great setback, but the most recent shipment from the Azurelode mine contained a crate of rare crystals I was eager to study. Forsaken raiders intercepted the cart and drove it northeast to a tower they're attempting to rebuild. It's imperative that we retrieve those crystals, $c!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '如果希爾斯布萊德有什麼很棒的事實，那就是那裡註定要活在戰爭的陰影之下。就連像一車的石頭這樣無害的東西都是目標。$b$b通常損失建築材料不是什麼了不起的挫敗，但最近從碧玉礦坑運來的貨物裡包含了一箱我急著要研究的稀有水晶。被遺忘者劫掠者攔截了那輛貨車，並把它開到東北方他們想重建的哨塔那裡。我們一定要立刻奪回那些水晶，$c!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9435;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "取得光明使者的印記再帶回西瘟疫之地的亡靈壁壘給梅拉爾·曦刃。", Objectives AC enUS : "Obtain the Mark of the Lightbringer and return it to Mehlar Dawnblade at the Bulwark in the Western Plaguelands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Obtain the Mark of the Lightbringer and return it to Mehlar Dawnblade at the Bulwark in the Western Plaguelands.",  OLD Details : "我曾是烏瑟·光明使者的一個學生，他是白銀之手騎士團的創立者。我看過他如何粗暴地對待阿薩斯王子的訓練。那導致了我的家園，奎爾薩拉斯的毀滅，我把一切都歸因於烏瑟和他的無能!而現在他竟然還有自己光榮的墓碑 - 真是美好。$B$B我的資訊告訴我那些血色笨蛋把他的一個'神聖'的聖物放在他們壁爐谷附近的守衛哨塔頂端。$B$B去西瘟疫之地把它拿回來給我。", Details AC enUS : "I was once a pupil of Uther Lightbringer, founder of the Knights of the Silver Hand. I saw how he mishandled Prince Arthas's training. It led to the destruction of my homeland, Quel'Thalas, and I blame Uther and his incompetence for all of it! And now he has a tomb in his honor - how lovely.$B$BMy sources tell me that the scarlet fools are keeping one of his 'holy' relics atop their guard tower near the gates of Hearthglen.$B$BGo to the Western Plaguelands and retrieve it for me." ; Wowhead enUS : "I was once a pupil of Uther Lightbringer, founder of the Knights of the Silver Hand. I saw how he mishandled Prince Arthas's training. It led to the destruction of my homeland, Quel'Thalas, and I blame Uther and his incompetence for all of it! And now he has a tomb in his honor - how lovely.$b$bMy sources tell me that the scarlet fools are keeping one of his 'holy' relics atop their guard tower near the gates of Hearthglen.$b$bGo to the Western Plaguelands and retrieve it for me."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '取得光明使者記號再帶回西瘟疫之地的亡靈壁壘給瑪拉·曦刃。', `Details` = '我曾是烏瑟·光明使者的一個學生，他是白銀之手騎士團的創立者。我看過他如何粗暴地對待阿薩斯王子的訓練。那導致了我的家園，奎爾薩拉斯的毀滅，我把一切都歸因於烏瑟和他的無能!而現在他竟然還有自己光榮的墓碑 - 真是美好。$b$b我的資訊告訴我那些血色笨蛋把他的一個''神聖''的聖物放在他們壁爐谷附近的守衛哨塔頂端。$b$b去西瘟疫之地把它拿回來給我。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9443;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "非常美味的紅鯛魚!", Title AC enUS : "Red Snapper - Very Tasty!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Red Snapper - Very Tasty!",  OLD Details : "我發現這些水裡充滿了活躍的紅鯛魚，一種非常美味的魚。只要有個捕魚網，我就能抓到足夠的魚來餵飽許多的德萊尼!不幸的是，我最近在河裡捕魚時被一種叫做魚人的生物攻擊，受了點傷無法進行我的工作。我需要幫助!$B$B到東邊的水晶河川捕捉這種魚，記得在成群的紅鯛魚旁使用這個捕魚網。$B$B你說怎麼樣?完成後記得把魚網帶回來。", Details AC enUS : "I've found that these waters are bustling with red snapper, a very tasty fish. With a fishing net, I can catch enough to feed dozens of draenei! Unfortunately, I was recently attacked by a creature known as a murloc while netting in the river and have suffered some injuries that prevent me from doing my job. I need help!$B$BUse this fishing net near schools of red snapper, found in the Crystalbrook river to the east to catch the fish.$B$BWhat do you say? Remember to return the net when you are finished." ; Wowhead enUS : "I've found that these waters are bustling with red snapper, a very tasty fish. With a fishing net, I can catch enough to feed dozens of draenei! Unfortunately, I was recently attacked by a creature known as a murloc while netting in the river and have suffered some injuries that prevent me from doing my job. I need help!$b$bUse this fishing net near schools of red snapper, found in the Crystalbrook river to the east to catch the fish.$b$bWhat do you say? Remember to return the net when you are finished."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '紅鯛魚 - 非常美味!', `Details` = '我發現這些水裡充滿了活躍的紅鯛魚，一種非常美味的魚。只要有個捕魚網，我就能抓到足夠的魚來餵飽許多的德萊尼!不幸的是，我最近在河裡捕魚時被一種叫做魚人的生物攻擊，受了點傷無法進行我的工作。我需要幫忙!$b$b到東邊的水晶河川捕捉這種魚，記得在成群的紅鯛魚旁使用這個捕魚網。$b$b你說怎麼樣?完成後記得把魚網帶回來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9452;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你完成了一件很棒的工作，$n。我們的人民會很感激這次的餽贈。說到這，你可否將這些紅鯛魚送給藍色守望的艾克緹昂呢?$B$B他應該不難找因為他正在等著這批貨。", Details AC enUS : "You did a wonderful job, $N. Our people will be thankful for this bounty. With that said, would you mind taking this haul of red snapper to Acteon at Azure Watch?$B$BHe shouldn't be hard to find as he is awaiting this catch." ; Wowhead enUS : "You did a wonderful job, $n. Our people will be thankful for this bounty. With that said, would you mind taking this haul of red snapper to Acteon at Azure Watch?$b$bHe shouldn't be hard to find as he is awaiting this catch."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你完成了一件很棒的工作，$n。我們的人民會很感激這次的餽贈。說到這，你可否將這些紅鯛魚送給藍色守望的艾克緹昂呢?$b$b他應該不難找因為他正在等著這批貨。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9453;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你將讓自己成名了，$n。要不要試試打獵呢?$B$B從前在德拉諾，我們最厲害的獵人能獵捕一種稱為塔巴克的野獸，類似這裡的牧月成鹿。$B$B如果你認為自己夠德萊尼，就回去野外殺死夠多的成鹿，把你的背包裝滿肉塊。$B$B你可以在藍色守望南邊找到在吃草的他們。小心他們的角!", Details AC enUS : "You're starting to make a name for yourself, $N. How about trying your hand at hunting?$B$BBack on Draenor, our greatest hunters would hunt a beast that resembled the moongraze stag of this region known as a talbuk.$B$BIf you think yourself draenei enough, go out into the wilds and kill enough stags to fill your pack with meat.$B$BYou will find them grazing south of Azure Watch. Watch out for their horns!" ; Wowhead enUS : "You're starting to make a name for yourself, $n. How about trying your hand at hunting?$b$bBack on Draenor, our greatest hunters would hunt a beast that resembled the moongraze stag of this region known as a talbuk.$b$bIf you think yourself draenei enough, go out into the wilds and kill enough stags to fill your pack with meat.$b$bYou will find them grazing south of Azure Watch. Watch out for their horns!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你將讓自己成名了，$n。要不要試試打獵呢?$b$b從前在德拉諾，我們最厲害的獵人能獵捕一種稱為塔巴克的野獸，類似這裡的牧月成鹿。$b$b如果你認為自己夠德萊尼，就回去野外殺死夠多的成鹿，把你的背包裝滿肉塊。$b$b你可以在藍色守望南邊找到在吃草的他們。小心他們的角!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9454;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你在小型夜間潛獵者身上發現的水晶看來是來自艾克索達的。這或許能解釋這區域某些動物不尋常的外表和行為。$B$B帶著水晶回到藍色守望。主教一定會想知道這個發現的。", Details AC enUS : "The crystal you found on the nightstalker runt's body appears to be a piece of the Exodar. This may help explain the unusual appearance and demeanor of some of the animals in this region.$B$BTake the crystal back to Azure Watch. The exarch will surely want to know about this discovery." ; Wowhead enUS : "The crystal you found on the nightstalker runt's body appears to be a piece of the Exodar. This may help explain the unusual appearance and demeanor of some of the animals in this region.$b$bTake the crystal back to Azure Watch. The exarch will surely want to know about this discovery."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你在小型夜間潛伏者身上發現的水晶看來是來自艾克索達的。這或許能解釋這區域某些動物不尋常的外表和行為。$b$b帶著水晶回到藍色守望。主教一定會想知道這個發現的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9455;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "下一步...清除夜間潛獵者", Title AC enUS : "Nightstalker Clean Up, Isle 2..." ; Wowhead enUS : "Nightstalker Clean Up, Isle 2...",  OLD Objectives : "藍色守望的主教米奈奧斯要你殺死8隻被感染的小型夜間潛獵者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Exarch Menelaous at Azure Watch has asked that you slay 8 Infected Nightstalker Runts." ; Wowhead enUS : "Exarch Menelaous at Azure Watch has asked that you slay 8 Infected Nightstalker Runts.",  OLD Details : "我不會為你的發現找任何的理由。這明顯的是我們的錯。我們獲報在東邊的河川裡有粉碎的水晶碎片但卻選擇忽視它的牽連。現在我們不是要坐著哭喊這座島上降臨的悲劇，就是要做點什麼來阻止它擴散。$B$B如果你有興趣的話，我要你回到野外殺死越多被感染的小型夜間潛獵者越好。", Details AC enUS : "I'm not going to make any excuses for what you've found. This is clearly our fault. We had gotten reports of crushed crystal fragments showing up in the river to the east but chose to ignore the implications. Now we can either sit around on this island and cry about the tragedy that has befallen this land or we can do something about it and prevent it from spreading.$B$BIf you've got the stomach for it, I want you to go back into the wilds and kill as many of the infected nightstalkers as you can find." ; Wowhead enUS : "I'm not going to make any excuses for what you've found. This is clearly our fault. We had gotten reports of crushed crystal fragments showing up in the river to the east but chose to ignore the implications. Now we can either sit around on this island and cry about the tragedy that has befallen this land or we can do something about it and prevent it from spreading.$b$bIf you've got the stomach for it, I want you to go back into the wilds and kill as many of the infected nightstalkers as you can find.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Infected Nightstalker Runt slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '下一步……清除夜間潛伏者', `Objectives` = '藍色守望的主教米奈奧斯要你殺死8隻被感染的小型夜間潛伏者。', `Details` = '我不會為你的發現找任何的理由。這明顯的是我們的錯。我們獲報在東邊的河川裡有粉碎的水晶碎片但卻選擇忽視它的牽連。現在我們不是要坐著哭喊這座島上降臨的悲劇，就是要做點什麼來阻止它擴散。$b$b如果你有興趣的話，我要你回到野外殺死越多被感染的小型夜間潛伏者越好。', `Objectivetext1` = '被感染的小型夜間潛獵者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9456;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "藍色守望的隱士‧法禔瑪要你幫她帶來8個根鬚陷捕者藤蔓。", Objectives AC enUS : "Anchorite Fateema at Azure Watch wants you to bring her 8 Root Trapper Vines." ; Wowhead enUS : "Anchorite Fateema at Azure Watch wants you to bring her 8 Root Trapper Vines.",  OLD Details : "我發現島上亂竄的鞭笞者藤蔓裡有一種復原的藥效特性。透過適宜的處理，藤蔓可以做成一種強大的治療藥膏。不幸的是，有那麼多受傷的德萊尼路過藍色守望，我們總是物資不足。$B$B我們嬌弱的客人昨天在水晶河川旁被發現，受了傷又意識不清。如果你可以幫我把藤蔓帶來，我們就能救她。$B$B你可以在藍色守望的南方和東方找到根鬚陷捕者。", Details AC enUS : "I have found that lashers milling about on the island hold restorative medicinal properties in their vines. Through proper treatment, the vines can be broken down into a powerful healing ointment. Unfortunately, with so many injured draenei passing through Azure Watch, we are always in short supply.$B$BOur delicate guest was found injured and unconscious by the Crystalbrook only yesterday. If you bring me vines, we may be able to save her.$B$BYou will find root trappers both south and east of Azure Watch." ; Wowhead enUS : "I have found that lashers milling about on the island hold restorative medicinal properties in their vines. Through proper treatment, the vines can be broken down into a powerful healing ointment. Unfortunately, with so many injured draenei passing through Azure Watch, we are always in short supply.$b$bOur delicate guest was found injured and unconscious by the Crystalbrook only yesterday. If you bring me vines, we may be able to save her.$b$bYou will find root trappers both south and east of Azure Watch."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '藍色守望的隱士·法禔瑪要你幫她帶來8個根鬚捕獸者藤蔓。', `Details` = '我發現島上亂竄的鞭笞者藤蔓裡有一種復原的藥效特性。透過適宜的處理，藤蔓可以做成一種強大的治療藥膏。不幸的是，有那麼多受傷的德萊尼路過藍色守望，我們總是物資不足。$b$b我們嬌弱的客人昨天在水晶河川旁被發現，受了傷又意識不清。如果你可以幫我把藤蔓帶來，我們就能救她。$b$b你可以在藍色守望的南方和東方找到根鬚捕獸者。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9463;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "這女孩為了讓藥膏發揮效用已做了太多努力。或許有別的辦法...$B$B藍謎島森林有許多秘密，其中一個就是一種叫藍色金魚藻的稀有植物，有些人說它是萬靈丹 - 治療所有疾病的解藥。$B$B你可以從它和藍謎島其他植物明顯的對比以及它需要藍色松樹為基底來生長的特性辨視它。動作快!$B$B還有$n，小心那裡的盤根痛擊者因為它們以食用金魚藻維生。", Details AC enUS : "The girl is too far gone for mere ointments to be effective. There may be another way...$B$BThe forest of Azuremyst holds many secrets, one of those being a rare plant known as the azure snapdragon that some claim to be a panacea - a cure all.$B$BYou can identify the plant by its stark contrast to the other plants of Azuremyst and its need to grow at the base of the azure pine trees. Make haste!$B$BAnd $N, be wary of the root threshers of the region as they consume snapdragon for sustenance." ; Wowhead enUS : "The girl is too far gone for mere ointments to be effective. There may be another way...$b$bThe forest of Azuremyst holds many secrets, one of those being a rare plant known as the azure snapdragon that some claim to be a panacea - a cure all.$b$bYou can identify the plant by its stark contrast to the other plants of Azuremyst and its need to grow at the base of the azure pine trees. Make haste!$b$bAnd $n, be wary of the root threshers of the region as they consume snapdragon for sustenance."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '這女孩為了讓藥膏發揮效用已做了太多努力。或許有別的辦法……$b$b藍謎島森林有許多秘密，其中一個就是一種叫藍色金魚藻的稀有植物，有些人說它是萬靈丹 - 治療所有疾病的解藥。$b$b你可以從它和藍謎島其他植物明顯的對比以及它需要藍色松樹為基底來生長的特性辨視它。動作快!$b$b還有$n，小心那裡的盤根痛擊者因為它們以食用金魚藻維生。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9473;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "預言提到了今天:在這座島上，在這個新世界裡，我們的盟友會找到我們。$B$B「我們會被測試。他們會要求我們為我們的父親贖罪...」$B$B那時候，我並不了解他字句背後的意思，但看到這個生物和她對我們的反應，現在一切都逐漸明朗了。我們族人的腐敗被認為是對等的。$B$B前往南方。我們是在那裡找到這個生物的。找到它的族人並告訴他們關於我們族人的事。", Details AC enUS : "The Prophet spoke of this day: That on this island, in this new world, our allies would find us.$B$B"We will be tested. They will ask that we pay for the sins of our fathers..."$B$BAt the time, I did not understand the meaning behind his words, but seeing this creature and her reaction to us, it is now coming into focus. The corruption of our people has been felt even here.$B$BVenture south. It is there that we found this being. Find its kin and tell them of our people." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Prophet spoke of this day: That on this island, in this new world, our allies would find us.$b$b"We will be tested. They will ask that we pay for the sins of our fathers..."$b$bAt the time, I did not understand the meaning behind his words, but seeing this creature and her reaction to us, it is now coming into focus. The corruption of our people has been felt even here.$b$bVenture south. It is there that we found this being. Find its kin and tell them of our people."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '預言提到了今天:在這座島上，在這個新世界裡，我們的盟友會找到我們。$b$b「我們會被測試。他們會要求我們為我們的父親贖罪……」$b$b那時候，我並不了解他字句背後的意思，但看到這個生物和她對我們的反應，現在一切都逐漸明朗了。我們族人的腐敗被認為是對等的。$b$b前往南方。我們是在那裡找到這個生物的。找到它的族人並告訴他們關於我們族人的事。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9505;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "奧迪席斯平臺的艦隊司令‧奧迪席斯要你取回被風險投資公司偷走的航海指南針和航海地圖。", Objectives AC enUS : "Admiral Odesyus at Odesyus' Landing wants you to recover the Nautical Compass and Nautical Map stolen by the Venture Co." ; Wowhead enUS : "Admiral Odesyus at Odesyus' Landing wants you to recover the Nautical Compass and Nautical Map stolen by the Venture Co.",  OLD Details : "我是聯盟海軍指揮的艦隊司令‧奧迪席斯。我們的船被迫停靠在你們島旁是因為碰到了某種族對我們的侵擾。要開口談這件事真尷尬，但哥布林不知怎地躲藏在我的兩艘船上偷渡來此。$B$B昨天夜裡，當大部分船員都在船艙裡睡覺時，我們就遭到突擊了!$B$B更奇怪的是，他們拿走了我們的航海工具就跳船了!$B$B他們消失在東邊的樹叢中。你可以去幫我們找回工具嗎?這對我們而言很重要。", Details AC enUS : "I am Admiral Odesyus of Alliance Naval Command. Our ship was forced to port on your island due to an infestation of sorts. It's embarrassing to even talk about, but goblins somehow managed to stow away in the holds of both of my ships.$B$BLast night, while most of the ship's crew was asleep below deck, they struck!$B$BStranger still, they took our navigation gear and jumped ship!$B$BThey disappeared into the thicket, east of here. Will you go in search of our gear? It will make for a strong gesture." ; Wowhead enUS : "I am Admiral Odesyus of Alliance Naval Command. Our ship was forced to port on your island due to an infestation of sorts. It's embarrassing to even talk about, but goblins somehow managed to stow away in the holds of both of my ships.$b$bLast night, while most of the ship's crew was asleep below deck, they struck!$b$bStranger still, they took our navigation gear and jumped ship!$b$bThey disappeared into the thicket, east of here. Will you go in search of our gear? It will make for a strong gesture."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '奧迪席斯平臺的艦隊司令·奧迪席斯要你取回被風險投資公司偷走的航海指南針和航海地圖。', `Details` = '我是聯盟海軍指揮的艦隊司令·奧迪席斯。我們的船被迫停靠在你們島旁是因為碰到了某種族對我們的侵擾。要開口談這件事真尷尬，但哥布林不知怎地躲藏在我的兩艘船上偷渡來此。$b$b昨天夜裡，當大部分船員都在船艙裡睡覺時，我們就遭到突擊了!$b$b更奇怪的是，他們拿走了我們的航海工具就跳船了!$b$b他們消失在東邊的樹叢中。你可以去幫我們找回工具嗎?這對我們而言很重要。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9506;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "奧迪席斯平臺的『小廚』麥克威醬要你幫他帶來6塊滑膩的爬行蟹肉。", Objectives AC enUS : ""Cookie" McWeaksauce at the Odesyus' Landing wants you to bring him 6 Skittering Crawler Meat.$B" ; Wowhead enUS : ""Cookie" McWeaksauce at the Odesyus' Landing wants you to bring him 6 Skittering Crawler Meat.",  OLD Details : "艦長是對的，你是個聰明的傢伙。也許你可以幫廚師的忙?$B$B要是我再讓船員吃雞肉，我一定會被送到禁閉室的。$B$B我注意到沿著海岸線一路都有爬行者 - 多著呢!幫我帶點爬行者的肉來，我會永遠感激不盡的。$B$B幫改過自新的海賊一個忙吧?", Details AC enUS : "The Admiral be right, ye are a resourceful one. Mayhap ye could help Cookie out?$B$BIf I serve the crew chicken for dinner again, I'll be sent to the brig fer sure.$B$BI noticed that thar be crawlers all along the coastline - lots o' crawlers! Bring me crawler meats and I'll be forever indebted to ya.$B$BHelp a reformed pirate out?" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Admiral be right, ye are a resourceful one. Mayhap ye could help Cookie out?$b$bIf I serve the crew chicken for dinner again, I'll be sent to the brig fer sure.$b$bI noticed that thar be crawlers all along the coastline - lots o' crawlers! Bring me crawler meats and I'll be forever indebted to ya.$b$bHelp a reformed pirate out?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '奧迪席斯平臺的『小廚』麥克威醬要你幫他帶來6塊滑膩的爬行者肉。', `Details` = '艦長是對的，你是個聰明的傢伙。也許你可以幫廚師的忙?$b$b要是我再讓船員吃雞肉，我一定會被送到禁閉室的。$b$b我注意到沿著海岸線一路都有爬行者 - 多著呢!幫我帶點爬行者的肉來，我會永遠感激不盡的。$b$b幫改過自新的海賊一個忙吧?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9512;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "藍謎島，奧迪席斯平臺的女牧師凱玲‧伊丹奈爾要你殺死5個怒鱗部屬、5個怒鱗納迦和5個怒鱗海妖。", Objectives AC enUS : "Priestess Kyleen Il'dinare at Odesyus' Landing on Azuremyst Isle wants you to kill 5 Wrathscale Myrmidons, 5 Wrathscale Naga and 5 Wrathscale Sirens." ; Wowhead enUS : "Priestess Kyleen Il'dinare at Odesyus' Landing on Azuremyst Isle wants you to kill 5 Wrathscale Myrmidons, 5 Wrathscale Naga and 5 Wrathscale Sirens.",  OLD Details : "雖然有些人認為我們現在的處境是不幸的事，但我感覺我們來到這裡是有原因的。命運無形的手把我們推向這個方向。原因會隨著時間而明朗。$B$B西邊是古老的夜精靈城市，現在是個布滿納迦的廢墟。如果納迦污染了我的先祖之地，而我只是閒坐在一旁，那就是我的疏失了。$B$B你已證明你是個能幹的$c了。讓我的族人感到光榮，清除掉廢墟裡他們不歡迎的居民。", Details AC enUS : "While some may look at our current predicament as an unfortunate turn of events, I sense that we are here for a reason. The invisible hand of fate has pushed us in this direction. The reason why will become evident in time.$B$BTo the west lies an ancient night elf city, now in ruin and overrun with naga. It would be remiss of me to sit idly by as the naga tainted my ancestral lands.$B$BYou have shown yourself a capable $c. Honor my people and cleanse the ruins of their unwelcome inhabitants." ; Wowhead enUS : "While some may look at our current predicament as an unfortunate turn of events, I sense that we are here for a reason. The invisible hand of fate has pushed us in this direction. The reason why will become evident in time.$b$bTo the west lies an ancient night elf city, now in ruin and overrun with naga. It would be remiss of me to sit idly by as the naga tainted my ancestral lands.$b$bYou have shown yourself a capable $c. Honor my people and cleanse the ruins of their unwelcome inhabitants."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '藍謎島，奧迪席斯平臺的女牧師凱玲·伊丹奈爾要你殺死5個怒鱗侍從、5個怒鱗納迦和5個怒鱗海妖。', `Details` = '雖然有些人認為我們現在的處境是不幸的事，但我感覺我們來到這裡是有原因的。命運無形的手把我們推向這個方向。原因會隨著時間而明朗。$b$b西邊是古老的夜精靈城市，現在是個佈滿納迦的廢墟。如果納迦汙染了我的先祖之地，而我只是閒坐在一旁，那就是我的疏失了。$b$b你已證明你是個能幹的$c了。讓我的族人感到光榮，清除掉廢墟裡他們不歡迎的居民。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9513;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把符文雕飾石板帶到藍謎島給奧迪席斯平臺的女牧師凱玲‧伊丹奈爾。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take the Rune Covered Tablet to Priestess Kyleen Il'dinare at Odesyus' Landing on Azuremyst Isle.$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Take the Rune Covered Tablet to Priestess Kyleen Il'dinare at Odesyus' Landing on Azuremyst Isle."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把符文雕飾石板帶到藍謎島給奧迪席斯平臺的女牧師凱玲·伊丹奈爾。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9514;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "藍謎島，奧迪席斯平臺的女牧師凱玲‧伊丹奈爾要你殺了督軍司瑞史提斯。", Objectives AC enUS : "Priestess Kyleen Il'dinare at Odesyus' Landing on Azuremyst Isle wants you to kill Warlord Sriss'tiz." ; Wowhead enUS : "Priestess Kyleen Il'dinare at Odesyus' Landing on Azuremyst Isle wants you to kill Warlord Sriss'tiz.",  OLD Details : "納迦入侵會是一場災難，$n。我見過納迦的本事，我不想見到這樣的大災難降臨在任何生物身上。如果要我猜，這個督軍司瑞史提斯會躲在洞穴裡 - 或許是在西邊的海岸上。$B$B找到督軍司瑞史提斯並結束他的統治。", Details AC enUS : "A naga invasion would be disastrous, $N. I've seen what naga can do and I would not want to see such a catastrophe befall any being. If I were to guess, this Warlord Sriss'tiz will be hidden in a cave - probably along the coast to the west.$B$BFind Warlord Sriss'tiz and put an end to his reign." ; Wowhead enUS : "A naga invasion would be disastrous, $n. I've seen what naga can do and I would not want to see such a catastrophe befall any being. If I were to guess, this Warlord Sriss'tiz will be hidden in a cave - probably along the coast to the west.$b$bFind Warlord Sriss'tiz and put an end to his reign.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Warlord Sriss'tiz slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '藍謎島，奧迪席斯平臺的女牧師凱玲·伊丹奈爾要你殺了督軍司瑞史提斯。', `Details` = '納迦入侵會是一場災難，$n。我見過納迦的本事，我不想見到這樣的大災難降臨在任何生物身上。如果要我猜，這個督軍司瑞史提斯會躲在洞穴裡 - 或許是在西邊的海岸上。$b$b找到督軍司瑞史提斯並結束他的統治。', `Objectivetext1` = '督軍司瑞史提斯 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9515;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在冥火嶺、屠魔峽谷和屠魔山裡殺死15個惡魔。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay 6 Mannoroc Lashers, 6 Felguards and 6 Searing Infernals, and then return to Vindicator Vedaar at Forest Song in Ashenvale." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay 6 Mannoroc Lashers, 6 Felguards and 6 Searing Infernals, and then return to Vindicator Vedaar at Forest Song in Ashenvale.",  OLD Details : "我絕不容忍他們活在這世界上!燃燒軍團摧毀了我們的種族，迫使我們到新世界建立新家園。然後他們一次又一次的出現，我們只能一再撤退。$B$B夠了!$B$B在南邊與西邊的冥火嶺、屠魔峽谷和屠魔山裡，有一群燃燒軍團的餘孽。他們是燃燒軍團在久遠之前入侵這世界時遺留下來的。$B$B趁還來得及的時候過去殺光他們!", Details AC enUS : "I will not tolerate their existence on this world!  The Burning Legion all but destroyed our race and we fell back to settle a new home on a new world.  Then they came again.  And we retreated, over and over.$B$BNo more!$B$BThere is a remnant of the Legion to the south in the regions known as Felfire Hill, Demon Fall Canyon and Demon Fall Ridge.  They are what is leftover from a force that once long ago invaded this world.$B$BGo and destroy as many as you can before it is too late!" ; Wowhead enUS : "I will not tolerate their existence on this world! The Burning Legion all but destroyed our race and we fell back to settle a new home on a new world. Then they came again. And we retreated, over and over.$b$bNo more!$b$bThere is a remnant of the Legion to the south in the regions known as Felfire Hill, Demon Fall Canyon and Demon Fall Ridge. They are what is leftover from a force that once long ago invaded this world.$b$bGo and destroy as many as you can before it is too late!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Mannoroc Lasher slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Roaming Felguard slain",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Searing Infernal slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死6個瑪諾洛克鞭笞者，6個惡魔守衛，和6個灼熱的地獄火，再回到梣谷的林歌神殿找復仇者維達。', `Details` = '我不能容忍他們活在這世界上!燃燒軍團摧毀了我們的種族，迫使我們到新世界建立新家園。然後他們又一次一次的出現，我們只能一再撤退。$b$b夠了!$b$b在冥火嶺，屠魔峽谷，和屠魔山南方的區域有一群燃燒軍團的餘孽。他們是過去燃燒軍團入侵這世界時所遺留下來的。$b$b趁還來的及的時候把他們盡量殺光!', `Objectivetext1` = '瑪諾洛克鞭笞者 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '遊蕩的惡魔守衛 消滅', `Objectivetext3` = '灼熱的煉獄火 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9516;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集5塊薩提納爾魔化木材。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 15 pieces of Warsong Lumber and 5 Satyrnaar Fel Wood to Gnarl at Forest Song." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 15 pieces of Warsong Lumber and 5 Satyrnaar Fel Wood to Gnarl at Forest Song.",  OLD Details : "歡迎來到林歌神殿， $C 。你現在看到的帳篷，就是將來會蓋建築物的地方，但這樣的目標需要穩定的建築材料來源。我不能讓我的工人砍伐樹林裡的任何老樹，但我們在南方和西方的鄰居對森林就沒有這樣的敬畏了。$B$B我們將盜取戰歌伐木工砍伐的木材，從西邊的薩特要塞取回一些受汙染的木材。把木頭帶給樹瘤，他會淨化它們以做使用。", Details AC enUS : "Welcome to Forest Song, $c. Where you see tents, there will one day be buildings, but such ambitions require a steady stream of building materials. I cannot bring myself to order our workers to fell any of the ancient trees of this grove, but our neighbors to the south and west have no such reverence for the forest.$B$BWe shall relieve the Warsong loggers of their excess, and reclaim some of the tainted wood from the satyr stronghold to the west. Bring the wood to Gnarl, who will purify it for our use." ; Wowhead enUS : "Welcome to Forest Song, $c. Where you see tents, there will one day be buildings, but such ambitions require a steady stream of building materials. I cannot bring myself to order our workers to fell any of the ancient trees of this grove, but our neighbors to the south and west have no such reverence for the forest.$b$bWe shall relieve the Warsong loggers of their excess, and reclaim some of the tainted wood from the satyr stronghold to the west. Bring the wood to Gnarl, who will purify it for our use."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '帶15塊戰歌林材和5塊薩提納爾地獄木頭給林歌神殿的格納。', `Details` = '歡迎來到林歌神殿，$c。你現在看到的帳篷，就是將來會蓋建築物的地方，但這樣的目標需要穩定的建築材料來源。我不能讓我的工人砍伐樹林裡的任何老樹，但我們在南方和西方的鄰居對森林就沒有這樣的敬畏了。$b$b我們將盜取戰歌伐木工砍伐的木材，從西邊的薩特要塞取回一些受汙染的木材。把木頭帶給格納，他會淨化它們以做使用。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9517;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在戰歌伐木營地殺死監督者高薩克，和任意12個部落。", Objectives AC enUS : "Sentinel Luciel Starwhisper at Forest Song wants you to kill Overseer Gorthak, 2 Warsong Shredders, 5 Horde Deforesters, and 10 Horde Scouts." ; Wowhead enUS : "Sentinel Luciel Starwhisper at Forest Song wants you to kill Overseer Gorthak, 2 Warsong Shredders, 5 Horde Deforesters, and 10 Horde Scouts.",  OLD Details : "戰歌伐木營地是使這片土地陷入備戰狀態的禍端。每當我們阻止他們的運作有所進展時，監督者高薩克就會命令他的伐木工加倍努力!$B$B現在，獸人砍的木材比他們會用到的還多，當他們的刀身砍進新的樹時，那些木頭就留在那裡腐爛!這對我們而言是公然的侮辱， $N ，我們要讓他們知道我們不會讓土地受到更多的毀滅!$B$B去吧，監督者高薩克和他的爪牙死掉之前都不要歇息!", Details AC enUS : "The Warsong Lumber Camp is a blight upon an embattled landscape. Every time we make progress in halting their operations, Overseer Gorthak orders his loggers to redouble their efforts!$B$BNow, the orcs are cutting more wood than they can possibly use, leaving it to rot while their blades bite into fresh trees! This is an affront to all we stand for, $N, and we will show them that we'll not suffer further destruction of our lands!$B$BGo, and do not rest until Overseer Gorthak and his minions are dead!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Warsong Lumber Camp is a blight upon an embattled landscape. Every time we make progress in halting their operations, Overseer Gorthak orders his loggers to redouble their efforts!$b$bNow, the orcs are cutting more wood than they can possibly use, leaving it to rot while their blades bite into fresh trees! This is an affront to all we stand for, $n, and we will show them that we'll not suffer further destruction of our lands!$b$bGo, and do not rest until Overseer Gorthak and his minions are dead!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Overseer Gorthak slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Warsong Shredder slain",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Horde Deforester slain",  OLD Objectivetext4 : "", Objectivetext4 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Horde Scout slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '林歌神殿的哨兵露西歐·星語要你摧毀監督者高薩克，2個戰歌伐木機，5個部落伐木工，和10個部落斥候。', `Details` = '戰歌伐木營地是使這片土地陷入備戰狀態的禍端。每當我們阻止他們的運作有所進展時，監督者高薩克就會命令他的伐木工加倍努力!$b$b現在，獸人砍的木材比他們會用到的還多，當他們的刀身砍進新的樹時，那些木頭就留在那裡腐爛!這對我們而言是公然的侮辱，$n，我們要讓他們知道我們不會讓土地受到更多的毀滅!$b$b去吧，監督者高薩克和他的爪牙死掉之前都不要歇息!', `Objectivetext1` = '監督者高薩克 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '戰歌伐木機 消滅', `Objectivetext3` = '部落伐木工 消滅', `Objectivetext4` = '部落斥候 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9518;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "取得伊露恩酒杯。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring the Chalice of Elune to Kayneth Stillwind at Forest Song." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the Chalice of Elune to Kayneth Stillwind at Forest Song.",  OLD Details : "我們西邊的地方現在叫做薩提納爾，它曾是我的族人建立的重要神殿。那裡面有一個無價的聖物，伊露恩酒杯，是伊露恩的祭司委託神殿守衛保管的。朝聖者曾前往神殿體驗酒杯傳說中的治療能量。$B$B這些故事或許只是無稽之談，但如果它們有任何一點真實性，那個聖物就可能讓受傷的森林恢復過來。我一定要知道真相， $N 。", Details AC enUS : "The area to our west, now called Satyrnaar, was once a prominent shrine built by my people. It housed a priceless relic, the Chalice of Elune, entrusted to the shrine's keepers by the priests of Elune. Pilgrims once traveled to the shrine to experience the healing powers the chalice was rumored to hold.$B$BThese stories might be nothing but old wives' tales, but if there is any truth to them, the relic may hold the key to rejuvenating the wounded forest. I must know, $N." ; Wowhead enUS : "The area to our west, now called Satyrnaar, was once a prominent shrine built by my people. It housed a priceless relic, the Chalice of Elune, entrusted to the shrine's keepers by the priests of Elune. Pilgrims once traveled to the shrine to experience the healing powers the chalice was rumored to hold.$b$bThese stories might be nothing but old wives' tales, but if there is any truth to them, the relic may hold the key to rejuvenating the wounded forest. I must know, $n."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把伊露恩酒杯帶給林歌神殿的凱尼斯·靜風。', `Details` = '我們西邊的地方現在叫做薩提納爾，它曾是我的族人建立的重要神殿。那裡面有一個無價的聖物，伊露恩酒杯，是伊露恩的祭司委託神殿守衛保管的。朝聖者曾前往神殿體驗酒杯傳說中的治療能量。$b$b這些故事或許只是無稽之談，但如果它們有任何一點真實性，那個聖物就可能讓受傷的森林恢復過來。我一定要知道真相，$n。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9519;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將哨兵梅麗瑞亞‧霜影的報告送去梣谷的銀翼樹林給哨兵遠歌。", Objectives AC enUS : "Deliver Sentinel Luciel's report to Sentinel Farsong at Silverwing Grove." ; Wowhead enUS : "Deliver Sentinel Luciel's report to Sentinel Farsong at Silverwing Grove.",  OLD Details : "對抗戰歌伐木營地的戰役不單是從林歌神殿展開， $N 。西南邊的銀翼樹林還有更多的銀翼哨兵，靠近貧瘠之地的邊界。在樹林那，哨兵遠歌指揮我們抵抗那些想摧毀我們土地的人。$B$B我現在把最新的報告送過去給哨兵遠歌已經有點太晚了，而且也猶豫是否要獨自離開林歌神殿。如果你的旅程會經過銀翼樹林附近，你願意幫我遞送報告嗎?", Details AC enUS : "The battle against the Warsong Lumber Camp isn't being waged from Forest Song alone, $N. There's a more substantial Silverwing Sentinel presence at Silverwing Grove to the southwest, near the border with the Barrens. From the grove, Sentinel Farsong directs our efforts against those who would destroy our lands.$B$BI'm a bit late in sending my latest report to Sentinel Farsong, but also hesitant to leave Forest Song unattended. If your travels take you near Silverwing Grove, would you deliver my report?" ; Wowhead enUS : "The battle against the Warsong Lumber Camp isn't being waged from Forest Song alone, $n. There's a more substantial Silverwing Sentinel presence at Silverwing Grove to the southwest, near the border with the Barrens. From the grove, Sentinel Farsong directs our efforts against those who would destroy our lands.$b$bI'm a bit late in sending my latest report to Sentinel Farsong, but also hesitant to leave Forest Song unattended. If your travels take you near Silverwing Grove, would you deliver my report?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將哨兵露西歐·星語的報告送給銀翼樹林的哨兵輕歌。', `Details` = '對抗戰歌伐木營地的戰役不單是從林歌神殿展開，$n。西南邊的銀翼樹林還有更多的銀翼哨兵，靠近貧瘠之地的邊界。在樹林那，哨兵輕歌指揮我們抵抗那些想摧毀我們土地的人。$b$b我現在把最新的報告送過去給哨兵輕歌已經有點太晚了，而且也猶豫是否要獨自離開林歌神殿。如果你的旅程會經過銀翼樹林附近，你願意幫我遞送報告嗎?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9521;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "藍謎島，奧迪席斯平臺的考古學家阿達曼‧鐵心要你幫他帶來8個古代聖物。", Objectives AC enUS : "Archaeologist Adamant Ironheart at Odesyus' Landing on Azuremyst Isle wants you to bring him 8 Ancient Relics." ; Wowhead enUS : "Archaeologist Adamant Ironheart at Odesyus' Landing on Azuremyst Isle wants you to bring him 8 Ancient Relics.",  OLD Details : "女祭司告訴我西邊的廢墟是夜精靈文明唯一遺留下來的產物。那讓我想起我爸爸總是這樣說夜精靈廢墟，「兒子，當你看見夜精靈廢墟時，夜精靈的聖物肯定就在附近。」$B$B如果我不僱用我第一個看到的人去挖出夜精靈聖物給我，那我還算是什麼矮人?現在快去吧!", Details AC enUS : "The priestess tells me that the ruins to the west are what's left of a night elf civilization. That got me thinking about what my pappy used to always say about night elf ruins, "Sonny, whenever you see night elf ruins, night elf relics are sure to be close by."$B$BNow what kind of a dwarf would I be if I didn't hire the first person I saw to go digging up night elf relics for me? Now get going!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The priestess tells me that the ruins to the west are what's left of a night elf civilization. That got me thinking about what my pappy used to always say about night elf ruins, "Sonny, whenever you see night elf ruins, night elf relics are sure to be close by."$b$bNow what kind of a dwarf would I be if I didn't hire the first person I saw to go digging up night elf relics for me? Now get going!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '藍謎島，奧迪席斯平臺的考古學家阿達曼·鐵心要你幫他帶來8個古代聖物。', `Details` = '女祭司告訴我西邊的廢墟是夜精靈文明唯一遺留下來的產物。那讓我想起我爸爸總是這樣說夜精靈廢墟，「兒子，當你看見夜精靈廢墟時，夜精靈的聖物肯定就在附近。」$b$b如果我不僱用我第一個看到的人去挖出夜精靈聖物給我，那我還算是什麼矮人?現在快去吧!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9523;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將8顆樹苗種植在肥沃的土堆裡。", Objectives AC enUS : "Plant 8 Tree Seedlings in the Fertile Dirt Mounds and then return to Gnarl at Forest Song in Ashenvale." ; Wowhead enUS : "Plant 8 Tree Seedlings in the Fertile Dirt Mounds and then return to Gnarl at Forest Song in Ashenvale.",  OLD Details : "小傢伙，西南方有個屬於夜歌森林的區域，在最近被改稱為冥火嶺。看見惡魔佔據著那裡、腐蝕著那塊土地教人十分哀痛。$B$B你能做些什麼來幫忙奪回這片地嗎?$B$B我有一些特別為這種目的保留下來的種子。將它們帶去冥火嶺，種植到肥沃的土堆中。", Details AC enUS : "Little one, to the south is an area of Nightsong Woods that has in recent times come to be called Felfire Hill.  It is very sad to see the demons crawling over it, spreading their corruption.$B$BWould you do something to help take back the land?$B$BI have a number of seeds that I have been saving for such a purpose.  Take them to Felfire Hill and plant them in the fertile dirt mounds." ; Wowhead enUS : "Little one, to the south is an area of Nightsong Woods that has in recent times come to be called Felfire Hill. It is very sad to see the demons crawling over it, spreading their corruption.$b$bWould you do something to help take back the land?$b$bI have a number of seeds that I have been saving for such a purpose. Take them to Felfire Hill and plant them in the fertile dirt mounds.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Tree Seedling Planted" ; Wowhead enUS : "Tree Seedling Planted"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將8顆樹苗種在肥沃的土堆裡，再回到梣谷的林歌神殿找格納。', `Details` = '小傢伙，南方的夜歌森林有一個區域，最近被稱為冥火嶺。糟糕的是，那邊已經被惡魔佔據著，並腐蝕著那塊土地。$b$b你能做些什麼來幫忙奪回這片地嗎?$b$b我有一堆種子就是特別為這樣的目的保留下來的。帶著它們去冥火嶺，將它們種在肥沃的土堆中。', `Objectivetext1` = '樹苗種了下去。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9526;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我們和島上的野獸和平共處了許多年。你可以想像當他們襲取海濱攻擊我們時我有多驚訝。$B$B我拼了命的奮戰但還是輕易地被擊敗。當我因為受到劇烈的一擊而昏了過去時，我祈禱我的家人不會遭殃。$B$B當我醒來時，一切是如此平靜。沙子被血浸濕 - 那是他們的血。他們全都被毀滅了。$B$B我不想報仇，$n。我只想要回我家人的遺體好好埋葬。", Details AC enUS : "We had lived peacefully among the Owlbeasts of this island for many years. You can imagine my surprise when they stormed the beach and attacked us.$B$BI fought tooth and nail but was easily overpowered. As I blacked out from the vicious blows that I had been dealt, I prayed that my family not suffer.$B$BWhen I awoke, all was quiet. The sand was soaked red with blood - their blood. They were devoured whole.$B$BI care not for vengeance, $N. I only ask that their remains be returned to me for proper burial." ; Wowhead enUS : "We had lived peacefully among the Owlbeasts of this island for many years. You can imagine my surprise when they stormed the beach and attacked us.$b$bI fought tooth and nail but was easily overpowered. As I blacked out from the vicious blows that I had been dealt, I prayed that my family not suffer.$b$bWhen I awoke, all was quiet. The sand was soaked red with blood - their blood. They were devoured whole.$b$bI care not for vengeance, $n. I only ask that their remains be returned to me for proper burial."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我們和島上的野獸和平共處了許多年。你可以想像當他們襲取海濱攻擊我們時我有多驚訝。$b$b我拼了命的奮戰但還是輕易地被擊敗。當我因為受到劇烈的一擊而昏了過去時，我祈禱我的家人不會遭殃。$b$b當我醒來時，一切是如此平靜。沙子被血浸濕 - 那是他們的血。他們全都被毀滅了。$b$b我不想報仇，$n。我只想要回我家人的遺體好好埋葬。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9527;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我們家幾個禮拜前遭到島上的魚人和梟獸攻擊。我設法逃了出來但我想我的父母已慘遭毒手了。我不知道現在該怎麼辦，但我一定要試著回到我的家 - 或是說它還沒被摧毀的部份...你會幫我通過森林嗎?", Details AC enUS : "My family was attacked by the murlocs and owlkin of this island several weeks ago. I managed to escape but I think that both my mother and father have been slain. I don't know what I'm going to do now, but I must try and get back to my home - or what's left of it... Will you help me get through the forest?" ; Wowhead enUS : "My family was attacked by the murlocs and owlkin of this island several weeks ago. I managed to escape but I think that both my mother and father have been slain. I don't know what I'm going to do now, but I must try and get back to my home - or what's left of it... Will you help me get through the forest?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我們家幾個禮拜前遭到島上的魚人和梟獸攻擊。我設法逃了出來但我想我的父母已慘遭毒手了。我不知道現在該怎麼辦，但我一定要試著回到我的家 - 或是說它還沒被摧毀的部份……你會幫我通過森林嗎?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9528;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "藍謎島，奧迪席斯平臺的艦隊司令‧奧迪席斯要你幫他帶回中空樹和5堆樹葉。", Objectives AC enUS : "Admiral Odesyus at Odesyus' Landing on Azuremyst Isle wants you to bring him a Hollowed Out Tree and 5 Piles of Leaves." ; Wowhead enUS : "Admiral Odesyus at Odesyus' Landing on Azuremyst Isle wants you to bring him a Hollowed Out Tree and 5 Piles of Leaves.",  OLD Details : "我已經懷疑這件事好一陣子了，但這證明了它是真的。$B$B我們之中有個叛徒。$B$B哥布林留下的計畫裡證明了陰謀的存在。既然我不知道他是誰，我就要你幫助找到叛徒。我的手下沒有一個可信。$B$B如果這要起作用，我就需要一顆挖空的樹和樹葉。搜尋我們北邊伐木工附近的樹。你要自己找到樹葉。看看森林裡有沒有。", Details AC enUS : "I've wondered about this for some time now, but this proves it to be true.$B$BThere is a traitor among us.$B$BThe plans left behind by the goblins document the conspiracy. Since I don't know who it could be, I'm going to need your help in finding the traitor. None of my crew can be trusted.$B$BIf this is going to work, I'm going to need a hollowed out tree and leaves. Search near the loggers north of us for the tree. You'll need to find the leaves by yourself. Check the forest." ; Wowhead enUS : "I've wondered about this for some time now, but this proves it to be true.$b$bThere is a traitor among us.$b$bThe plans left behind by the goblins document the conspiracy. Since I don't know who it could be, I'm going to need your help in finding the traitor. None of my crew can be trusted.$b$bIf this is going to work, I'm going to need a hollowed out tree and leaves. Search near the loggers north of us for the tree. You'll need to find the leaves by yourself. Check the forest."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '藍謎島，奧迪席斯平臺的艦隊司令·奧迪席斯要你幫他帶回中空樹和5堆樹葉。', `Details` = '我已經懷疑這件事好一陣子了，但這證明了它是真的。$b$b我們之中有個叛徒。$b$b哥布林留下的計畫裡證明了陰謀的存在。既然我不知道他是誰，我就要你幫助找到叛徒。我的手下沒有一個可信。$b$b如果這要起作用，我就需要一顆挖空的樹和樹葉。搜尋我們北邊樵木工附近的樹。你要自己找到樹葉。看看森林裡有沒有。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9530;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "藍謎島，奧迪席斯平臺的艦隊司令‧奧迪席斯要你去觀察吉索和背叛者的會議。$B$B等你知道了背叛者的身分就回去找他。", Objectives AC enUS : "Admiral Odesyus at Odesyus' Landing on Azuremyst Isle wants you to observe the meeting that is to take place between Geezle and the traitor.$B$BReturn to him when you know the identity of the traitor." ; Wowhead enUS : "Admiral Odesyus at Odesyus' Landing on Azuremyst Isle wants you to observe the meeting that is to take place between Geezle and the traitor.$b$bReturn to him when you know the identity of the traitor.",  OLD Details : "根據計畫，背叛者和哥布林的領導者，吉索，將要在西部半島上的一個海灣相見。我要你出現在那場會面，$n。$B$B記得那些樹和葉子嗎?你要穿戴上它們!那是完美的偽裝。$B$B去海灣那裡尋找一面納迦旗幟。如果旗子在那，就表示安排了一場會面。當你看到旗幟後就使用偽裝工具，然後等待。最後背叛者會現身。讓密會結束再回來告訴我那背叛者的是誰。帶著那個壞蛋的身分回來找我。", Details AC enUS : "According to the plans, the traitor and the leader of the goblins, Geezle, are to meet at a cove on the western island. I need you to be at that meeting, $N.$B$BRemember the tree and leaves? You're going to wear them! It's a perfect disguise.$B$BGo to the cove and look for a naga flag. If the flag is there, it means a meeting is planned. Use the disguise kit when you see the flag and wait. Eventually the traitor will show up. Let the meeting finish then return to me with the identity of the scoundrel." ; Wowhead enUS : "According to the plans, the traitor and the leader of the goblins, Geezle, are to meet at a cove on the western island. I need you to be at that meeting, $n.$b$bRemember the tree and leaves? You're going to wear them! It's a perfect disguise.$b$bGo to the cove and look for a naga flag. If the flag is there, it means a meeting is planned. Use the disguise kit when you see the flag and wait. Eventually the traitor will show up. Let the meeting finish then return to me with the identity of the scoundrel.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "揭露背叛者", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "The Traitor Uncovered" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Traitor Uncovered"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '藍謎島，奧迪席斯平臺的艦隊司令·奧迪席斯要你去觀察吉索和背叛者的會議。$b$b等你知道了背叛者的身份就回去找他。', `Details` = '根據計畫，背叛者和哥布林的領導者，吉索，將要在西部半島上的一個海灣相見。我要你出現在那場會面，$n。$b$b記得那些樹和葉子嗎?你要穿戴上它們!那是完美的偽裝。$b$b去海灣那裡尋找一面納迦旗幟。如果旗子在那，就表示安排了一場會面。當你看到旗幟後就使用偽裝工具，然後等待。最後背叛者會現身。讓密會結束再回來告訴我那背叛者的是誰。帶著那個壞蛋的身份回來找我。', `Objectivetext1` = '背叛者揭露', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9531;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到林歌神殿和建築師尼莫斯談話。", Objectives AC enUS : "Make your way to Forest Song and speak with Architect Nemos." ; Wowhead enUS : "Make your way to Forest Song and speak with Architect Nemos.",  OLD Details : "在建築師尼莫斯和復仇者維達的監督下，我的族人正在梣谷的東部復興一處老舊的 $R 前哨。$B$B建築的工作不簡單， $N ，因為他們面對的挑戰和敵人很多。我知道建築師尼莫斯和他在林歌神殿的同伴會用得上任何可能的援助，而他也曾請我派任何有興趣的女人過去他那裡。$B$B再次和我談話，我將為你安排快速前往他們那裡的方式。", Details AC enUS : "My people have undertaken an important endeavor in the eastern part of Ashenvale, with support and cooperation from the kaldorei.$B$BUnder the supervision of Architect Nemos and Vindicator Vedaar, they are revitalizing an old night elf outpost. The task of building won't be easy, $N, for the challenges and enemies they face are many. I know Architect Nemos and his compatriots at Forest Song would appreciate any help they can get, and he has asked me to send any interested $g men:women; his way." ; Wowhead enUS : "My people have undertaken an important endeavor in the eastern part of Ashenvale, with support and cooperation from the kaldorei.$b$bUnder the supervision of Architect Nemos and Vindicator Vedaar, they are revitalizing an old night elf outpost. The task of building won't be easy, $n, for the challenges and enemies they face are many. I know Architect Nemos and his compatriots at Forest Song would appreciate any help they can get, and he has asked me to send any interested $gmen:women his way."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '前往林歌神殿和建築師尼莫斯談談。', `Details` = '有卡多雷的支持和合作，我的族人在梣谷東邊了付出了重要的努力。$b$b在建築師尼莫斯和復仇者維達的監督下，他們正在復興一個老舊的夜精靈前哨。建築的工作不簡單，$n，因為他們面對的挑戰和敵人很多。 我知道建築師尼莫斯和他在林歌神殿的同伴會感激任何能獲得的幫忙，而他也請我派任何有興趣的$g男人:女人去他那裡。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9533;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "奧迪席斯平臺的艦隊司令‧奧迪席斯要你從工程師火花‧歐爾滾那裡取回叛徒的信件。", Objectives AC enUS : "Admiral Odesyus at Odesyus' Landing wants you to recover the Traitor's Communication from Engineer "Spark" Overgrind." ; Wowhead enUS : "Admiral Odesyus at Odesyus' Landing wants you to recover the Traitor's Communication from Engineer "Spark" Overgrind.",  OLD Details : "一定要讓火花‧歐爾滾知道什麼叫正義!$B$B我要你去海邊那找到這個騙人的地精。一旦你找到他，就要他抖出所有的事情!$B$B如果連一個聯盟的高階官員都有不忠的行為，誰知道還有多少其他人也墮落了?$B$B還有$n，必要時你可以使用武力...", Details AC enUS : "Spark must be brought to justice!$B$BI need you to go down to the beach and find that deceitful gnome. Once you find him, get whatever information you can out of him!$B$BIf a high ranking official of the Alliance has committed treasonous acts, who knows how many others are corrupt?$B$BAnd $N, use force if you have to...$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Spark must be brought to justice!$b$bI need you to go down to the beach and find that deceitful gnome. Once you find him, get whatever information you can out of him!$b$bIf a high ranking official of the Alliance has committed treasonous acts, who knows how many others are corrupt?$b$bAnd $n, use force if you have to..."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '奧迪席斯平臺的艦隊司令·奧迪席斯要你從工程師火花·歐爾滾那裡取回背叛者的信件。', `Details` = '一定要讓火花·歐爾滾知道什麼叫正義!$b$b我要你去海邊那找到這個騙人的地精。一旦你找到他，就要他抖出所有的事情!$b$b如果連一個聯盟的高階官員都有不忠的行為，誰知道還有多少其他人也墮落了?$b$b還有$n，必要時你可以使用武力……', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9537;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我想我破解了它，$n!$B$B<奧蘭指向圖騰。>$B$B我們所需要知道的靜松熊怪語言都銘刻在他們的圖騰上了。只要知道他們文字符號的基本意義，我們就能研究圖騰並試著和熊怪溝通。$B$B我在羊皮紙上寫下了他們基本的文字符號。研究它並檢驗圖騰。它會引導你至下一個語言圖騰。$B$B等你學會他們的語言之後再回來和阿魯古談談!$r!", Details AC enUS : "I think I've cracked it, $N!$B$B<Aurren points to the totem.>$B$BAll that we need to know about the Stillpine furbolg language is imprinted on their totems. With just a rudimentary understanding of how their symbols work, we can study the totems and learn to communicate with the furbolgs.$B$BI've written down the basics of the symbol matrix on this parchment. Study it and then examine the totem. It should lead you to the next language totem.$B$BSpeak to Arugoo when you return an educated $r!" ; Wowhead enUS : "I think I've cracked it, $n!$b$b<Aurren points to the totem.>$b$bAll that we need to know about the Stillpine furbolg language is imprinted on their totems. With just a rudimentary understanding of how their symbols work, we can study the totems and learn to communicate with the furbolgs.$b$bI've written down the basics of the symbol matrix on this parchment. Study it and then examine the totem. It should lead you to the next language totem.$b$bSpeak to Arugoo when you return an educated $r!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我想我破解了它，$n!$b$b<奧蘭指向圖騰。>$b$b我們所需要知道的靜松熊怪語言都銘刻在他們的圖騰上了。只要知道他們文字符號的基本意義，我們就能研究圖騰並試著和熊怪溝通。$b$b我在羊皮紙上寫下了他們基本的文字符號。研究它並檢驗圖騰。它會引導你至下一個語言圖騰。$b$b等你學會他們的語言之後再回來和阿魯古談談!$r!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9538;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "圖騰裡不再有你無法辨視的象徵了。優兒的圖騰讀起來就像在看你自己的語言一樣。$B$B印記辨識出另一個熊怪巢穴，就在西邊。你可以熟練地解讀圖騰上的語言知道你的目的地是鬚肢村。優兒會引導你，但如果你迷路了，你知道你可以走森林裡往西的古老精靈之路來到達你的目的地。", Details AC enUS : "You no longer see unrecognizable symbology in the totems. The totem of Yor reads to you just as easily as your native tongue.$B$BThe markings identify another furbolg den, due west of here. You are able to expertly decipher the language on the totem and know that your destination is Bristlelimb Village. Yor will guide you but if you get lost, you know that you are able to take the ancient elven road in the forest leading west to reach your destination." ; Wowhead enUS : "You no longer see unrecognizable symbology in the totems. The totem of Yor reads to you just as easily as your native tongue.$b$bThe markings identify another furbolg den, due west of here. You are able to expertly decipher the language on the totem and know that your destination is Bristlelimb Village. Yor will guide you but if you get lost, you know that you are able to take the ancient elven road in the forest leading west to reach your destination."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '圖騰裡不再有你無法辨視的象徵了。優兒的圖騰讀起來就像在看你自己的語言一樣。$b$b印記辨識出另一個熊怪巢穴，就在西邊。你可以熟練地解讀圖騰上的語言知道你的目的地是鬚肢村。優兒會引導你，但如果你迷路了，你知道你可以走森林裡往西的古老精靈之路來到達你的目的地。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9542;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "圖騰上的圖像是描述靜松熊怪及鬚肢熊怪兩族的戰爭。上面的蝕刻顯示鬚肢熊怪對靜松熊怪做了不合理的事。$B$B在這場混亂中，一則預言開始實現:將會出現一位英雄 - 非熊怪族群 -拯救了靜松熊怪。$B$B殺了鬚肢村裡的鬚肢熊怪，取得鑰匙，用這把鑰匙釋放被俘虜的靜松熊怪。完成後回到靜松要塞找阿魯古!", Details AC enUS : "The images on this totem depict a war between the Stillpine and the Bristlelimb furbolg tribes. The etchings show that the Bristlelimb have done unconscionable things to the furbolgs of Stillpine.$B$BAmidst the chaos, a prophecy has begun to unfold: A hero will rise - not of furbolg blood - and save the Stillpine tribe.$B$BSlay Bristlelimb furbolgs at Bristlelimb Village for their keys. Use the keys to free the Stillpine captives. Return to Arugoo of the Stillpine when you have freed them all!$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "The images on this totem depict a war between the Stillpine and the Bristlelimb furbolg tribes. The etchings show that the Bristlelimb have done unconscionable things to the furbolgs of Stillpine.$b$bAmidst the chaos, a prophecy has begun to unfold: A hero will rise - not of furbolg blood - and save the Stillpine tribe.$b$bSlay Bristlelimb furbolgs at Bristlelimb Village for their keys. Use the keys to free the Stillpine captives. Return to Arugoo of the Stillpine when you have freed them all!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '圖騰上的圖像是描述靜松熊怪及鬚肢熊怪兩族的戰爭。上面的蝕刻顯示鬚肢熊怪對靜松熊怪做了不合理的事。$b$b在這場混亂中，一則預言開始實現:將會出現一位英雄 - 非熊怪族群 -拯救了靜松熊怪。$b$b殺了鬚肢村裡的鬚肢熊怪，取得鑰匙，用這把鑰匙釋放被俘虜的靜松熊怪。完成後回到靜松要塞找阿魯古!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9544;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把克羅波的裝備帶回來給克羅波‧維茲班，他藏在海邊的一個龜殼裡面。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring Clopper's Equipment back to Clopper Wizbang, who is hiding in a beached turtle shell." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring Clopper's Equipment back to Clopper Wizbang, who is hiding in a beached turtle shell.",  OLD Details : "噓！小聲一點別讓我被發現。$B$B如果魚人察覺我的存在，實驗就毀了！危機已經逼近到足以毀掉我的研究數據。$B$B我昨天在搜索糧食的時候，他們其中一個一定是晃的太近發現了我的營地。我回來的時候剛好看見兩個魚人拿走一個木箱裝滿了我大部分的裝備！它一定在他們附近的營地之一裡，但我不能冒險現身。你願意幫忙嗎？", Details AC enUS : "Shh! Keep your voice down and don't call attention to me.$B$BIf the murlocs detect my presence, the experiment will be ruined! I've already come perilously close to contaminating my data.$B$BWhile I was foraging yesterday, one of them must've wandered too close and discovered my camp. I returned just in time to see two of them carrying off a crate with most of my equipment! It's bound to be in one of their settlements around here, but I can't risk revealing my presence. Are you willing to help?" ; Wowhead enUS : "Shh! Keep your voice down and don't call attention to me.$b$bIf the murlocs detect my presence, the experiment will be ruined! I've already come perilously close to contaminating my data.$b$bWhile I was foraging yesterday, one of them must've wandered too close and discovered my camp. I returned just in time to see two of them carrying off a crate with most of my equipment! It's bound to be in one of their settlements around here, but I can't risk revealing my presence. Are you willing to help?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把克羅波的裝備帶回來給克羅波·維茲班，他藏在海邊的一個龜殼裡面。', `Details` = '噓!小聲一點別讓我被發現。$b$b如果魚人察覺我的存在，實驗就毀了!危機已經逼近到足以毀掉我的研究數據。$b$b我昨天在搜索糧食的時候，他們其中一個一定是晃的太近發現了我的營地。我回來的時候剛好看見兩個魚人拿走一個木箱裝滿了我大部分的裝備!它一定在他們附近的營地之一裡，但我不能冒險現身。你願意幫忙嗎?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9548;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "帶3個粗糙的魚人塑像和6把粗糙的魚人小刀給克羅波‧維茲班，他藏在海邊的一個龜殼裡面。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 3 Crude Murloc Idols and 6 Crude Murloc Knives to Clopper Wizbang, who is hiding in a beached turtle shell." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 3 Crude Murloc Idols and 6 Crude Murloc Knives to Clopper Wizbang, who is hiding in a beached turtle shell.",  OLD Details : "我對黑沙魚人的觀察和描寫是相當輝煌的，$n，但它們只是開始。我打算帶著黑沙的早期製作技術產物回到鐵爐堡。$B$B問題是黑沙總是帶著這些物品在身上，我不能背著良心去殺他們。如果你願意幫我收集黑沙先知帶著的塑像，和黑沙戰士及巡岸者帶著的粗糙小刀，我不會問你是怎麼弄到它們的。", Details AC enUS : "My observations and writings about the Blacksilt murlocs are quite illuminating, $N, but they are just the beginning. I plan to return to Ironforge with items produced by the Blacksilts' rudimentary crafting skills.$B$BThe problem is that the Blacksilt carry these items with them at all times, and I can't have their blood on my conscience. If you're willing to help me gather the idols carried by Blacksilt seers and crude knives of the Blacksilt warriors and shorestrikers, I won't ask how you came by them." ; Wowhead enUS : "My observations and writings about the Blacksilt murlocs are quite illuminating, $n, but they are just the beginning. I plan to return to Ironforge with items produced by the Blacksilts' rudimentary crafting skills.$b$bThe problem is that the Blacksilt carry these items with them at all times, and I can't have their blood on my conscience. If you're willing to help me gather the idols carried by Blacksilt seers and crude knives of the Blacksilt warriors and shorestrikers, I won't ask how you came by them."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '帶3個粗糙的魚人塑像和6把粗糙的魚人小刀給克羅波·維茲班，他藏在海邊的一個龜殼裡面。', `Details` = '我對黑沙魚人的觀察和描寫是相當輝煌的，$n，但它們只是開始。我打算帶著黑沙的早期製作技術產物回到鐵爐堡。$b$b問題是黑沙總是帶著這些物品在身上，我不能背著良心去殺他們。如果你願意幫我收集黑沙先知帶著的塑像，和黑沙戰士及巡岸者帶著的粗糙小刀，我不會問你是怎麼弄到它們的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9549;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "模糊的地圖？", Title AC enUS : "A Map to Where?" ; Wowhead enUS : "A Map to Where?",  OLD Details : "這個繪畫粗糙的地圖並未透露出任何關於繪圖者的線索，但看來是隻很不穩的手畫的。顫抖的線條和符號描繪出一個有著破損圓柱的小亭子，在一個部分淹沒在水中的哨塔附近。$B$B如果這地圖可信的話，這些廢墟似乎位在島的東邊海岸。你不知道你可以在那邊找到什麼，但這一定十分重要，繪圖者才會記錄下來。", Details AC enUS : "The crudely-drawn map reveals nothing of its maker, but it appears to have been drawn with an unsteady hand. Wavering lines and symbols depict a small pavilion with broken columns located to the west of a partially submerged tower. $B$BIf the map is to be believed, this cluster of ruins appears to be located on the eastern coast of the island. You have no idea what you'll find, but it was important enough for the map's creator to record." ; Wowhead enUS : "The crudely-drawn map reveals nothing of its maker, but it appears to have been drawn with an unsteady hand. Wavering lines and symbols depict a small pavilion with broken columns located to the west of a partially submerged tower.$b$bIf the map is to be believed, this cluster of ruins appears to be located on the eastern coast of the island. You have no idea what you'll find, but it was important enough for the map's creator to record."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '模糊的地圖?', `Details` = '這個繪畫粗糙的地圖並未透露出任何關於繪圖者的線索，但看來是隻很不穩的手畫的。顫抖的線條和符號描繪出一個有著破損圓柱的小亭子，在一個部分淹沒在水中的哨塔附近。$b$b如果這地圖可信的話，這些廢墟似乎位在島的東邊海岸。你不知道你可以在那邊找到什麼，但這一定夠重要繪圖者才會記錄下來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9550;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "沒有辦法閱讀這本書的內容，你思考著誰能幫你從製圖師的潦草字跡中辨別出原著的字句。$B$B想起無數文化中隱士裴薩斯的手工藝品收藏，你懷疑他老練的雙眼是否能幫你解讀這本書的內容。", Details AC enUS : "Lacking the means to read the book's contents, you think about who might be able to help you separate the author's words from the mapmaker's scrawl.$B$BRemembering Anchorite Paetheus's collection of artifacts from countless cultures, you wonder if his experienced eye might be able to help you decipher the book's contents." ; Wowhead enUS : "Lacking the means to read the book's contents, you think about who might be able to help you separate the author's words from the mapmaker's scrawl.$b$bRemembering Anchorite Paetheus's collection of artifacts from countless cultures, you wonder if his experienced eye might be able to help you decipher the book's contents."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '沒有辦法閱讀這本書的內容，你思考著誰能幫你從製圖師的潦草字跡中辨別出原著的字句。$b$b想起無數文化中隱士裴薩斯的手工藝品收藏，你懷疑他老練的雙眼是否能幫你解讀這本書的內容。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9557;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "允諾者，你一定要去北方我族人的家園 - 靜松要塞。你會在那裡遇上最令人怯步的挑戰。$B$B去吧，大酋長靜松在等著你。", Details AC enUS : "Promised one, you must travel north to the home of my people - Stillpine Hold. It is there that you will face your most daunting challenge.$B$BGo now, High Chief Stillpine awaits your arrival." ; Wowhead enUS : "Promised one, you must travel north to the home of my people - Stillpine Hold. It is there that you will face your most daunting challenge.$b$bGo now, High Chief Stillpine awaits your arrival."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '允諾者，你一定要去北方我族人的家園 - 靜松要塞。你會在那裡遇上最令人怯步的挑戰。$b$b去吧，大酋長靜松在等著你。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9559;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "藍謎島靜松要塞的墨爾多要你幫他帶來8塊劫毀者皮。", Objectives AC enUS : "Moordo at Stillpine Hold on Azuremyst Isle wants you to bring him 8 Ravager Hides. " ; Wowhead enUS : "Moordo at Stillpine Hold on Azuremyst Isle wants you to bring him 8 Ravager Hides.",  OLD Details : "我和我哥哥在東邊的樹林裡打獵時遭到奇怪的，像昆蟲一樣的野獸突擊。我們從沒在藍謎島見過這樣的畸型生物!他們會是即將來臨的天啟徵象嗎?你命中注定要阻止的天啟?$B$B如果你真的是允諾者，你就要擊敗那些天啟的生物...把他們的皮革帶來給我。利用它們的皮革，我可以製作強大力量的護甲!$B$B去東邊找到它們，就在路的那一邊。", Details AC enUS : "My brother and I were hunting in the woods to the east when we were ambushed by strange, insect-like beasts. Such aberrations have never before been seen in Azuremyst! Could they be a sign of the coming apocalypse? The apocalypse that YOU are destined to prevent?$B$BIf you truly are the Promised One, you will strike the creatures of the apocalypse down... and bring me their hides. From their hides, I can fashion armor of great power!$B$BFind them to the east, beyond the road." ; Wowhead enUS : "My brother and I were hunting in the woods to the east when we were ambushed by strange, insect-like beasts. Such aberrations have never before been seen in Azuremyst! Could they be a sign of the coming apocalypse? The apocalypse that YOU are destined to prevent?$b$bIf you truly are the Promised One, you will strike the creatures of the apocalypse down... and bring me their hides. From their hides, I can fashion armor of great power!$b$bFind them to the east, beyond the road."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '藍謎島，靜松要塞的墨爾多要你幫他帶來8塊劫毀者皮。', `Details` = '我和我哥哥在東邊的樹林裡打獵時遭到奇怪的，像昆蟲一樣的野獸突擊。我們從沒在藍謎島見過這樣的畸型生物!他們會是即將來臨的天啟徵象嗎?你命中注定要阻止的天啟?$b$b如果你真的是允諾者，你就要擊敗那些天啟的生物……把他們的皮革帶來給我。利用它們的皮革，我可以製作強大力量的護甲!$b$b去東邊找到它們，就在路的那一邊。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9560;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "翻譯已經準備好了，$n。$B$B<隱士裴薩斯指著他翻譯尾段的一塊文字。>$B$B'敵人離我們不遠了。我們聚集了所有的生還者撤退到東方的神廟。這是我們在島上真正掌握的最後一塊土地，生還者也都有默契的認為這裡是我們最後的一站。我已將我最後的一些財產埋在神廟的土裡，希望有人會找到它們並知道這裡發生了什麼事。", Details AC enUS : "The translation is ready now, $N.$B$B<Anchorite Paetheus points out a block of text at the end of his translation.>$B$B'The enemy is nearly upon us. We've gathered up all the survivors and retreated to the temple to the east. It's the last ground we truly hold on the island, and there is a sense among the survivors that we will make our last stand here. I've taken care to bury my last few possessions on the grounds of the temple, with the hope that someone will find them and know what happened here.'" ; Wowhead enUS : "The translation is ready now, $n.$b$b<Anchorite Paetheus points out a block of text at the end of his translation.>$b$b'The enemy is nearly upon us. We've gathered up all the survivors and retreated to the temple to the east. It's the last ground we truly hold on the island, and there is a sense among the survivors that we will make our last stand here. I've taken care to bury my last few possessions on the grounds of the temple, with the hope that someone will find them and know what happened here.'"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '翻譯已經準備好了，$n。$b$b<隱士裴薩斯指著他翻譯尾段的一塊文字。>$b$b''敵人離我們不遠了。我們聚集了所有的生還者撤退到東方的神廟。這是我們在島上真正掌握的最後一塊土地，生還者也都有默契的認為這裡是我們最後的一站。我已將我最後的一些財產埋在神廟的土裡，希望有人會找到它們並知道這裡發生了什麼事。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9561;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "魚人...為何此時?為何此地?", Title AC enUS : "Murlocs... Why Here? Why Now?" ; Wowhead enUS : "Murlocs... Why Here? Why Now?",  OLD Details : "這些日子很黑暗，允諾者。就連魚人都對我們窮追不捨， 一點也不誇張。不幸地，不只我的自尊受挫。$B$B雖然我們和沙鰭魚人的關係一直都很不好，但我們怎麼也沒想到他們會有膽攻擊我們還偷取我們的食物存貨!到西邊的淤塞海岸取回我們被偷的糧食!$B$B還有如果你看見一隻黑皮膚的魚人蹼指間卡著一塊白色的毛皮...", Details AC enUS : "These are dark days, Promised One. Even the murlocs are kicking our tails - literally. Unfortunately, more than just my ego has been bruised.$B$BWhile our relationship with the Siltfin murlocs had always been tenuous, never could we have imagined that they would have the gall to attack us and steal from our food stores! Travel west to the Silting Shore and recover our stolen food-stuffs!$B$BAnd if you see a dark-skinned murloc with a patch of white fur stuck in between his webbed toes... " ; Wowhead enUS : "These are dark days, Promised One. Even the murlocs are kicking our tails - literally. Unfortunately, more than just my ego has been bruised.$b$bWhile our relationship with the Siltfin murlocs had always been tenuous, never could we have imagined that they would have the gall to attack us and steal from our food stores! Travel west to the Silting Shore and recover our stolen food-stuffs!$b$bAnd if you see a dark-skinned murloc with a patch of white fur stuck in between his webbed toes..."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '魚人……為何此時?為何此地?', `Details` = '這些日子很黑暗，允諾者。就連魚人都對我們窮追不捨 - 一點也不誇張。不幸地，不只我的自尊受挫。$b$b雖然我們和沙鰭魚人的關係一直都很不好，但我們怎麼也沒想到他們會有膽攻擊我們還偷取我們的食物存貨!到西邊的淤塞海岸取回我們被偷的糧食!$b$b還有如果你看見一隻黑皮膚的魚人蹼指間卡著一塊白色的毛皮……', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9562;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "身為大酋長，我最擔心的就是靜松要塞的腐敗根源。$B$B為什麼梟獸 - 曾經是我們的盟友 - 會攻擊我們?他們為什麼會居住在靜松要塞?$B$B或許裡面的某個東西會有答案。搜索靜松要塞尋找腐敗源頭的線索。", Details AC enUS : "As High Chief, my immediate concern is the root of the corruption in Stillpine Hold.$B$BWhy did the wildkin - once our allies - attack us? Why have they taken residence in Stillpine Hold?$B$BPerhaps something inside will hold the answer. Search Stillpine Hold for clues as to the source of corruption." ; Wowhead enUS : "As High Chief, my immediate concern is the root of the corruption in Stillpine Hold.$b$bWhy did the wildkin - once our allies - attack us? Why have they taken residence in Stillpine Hold?$b$bPerhaps something inside will hold the answer. Search Stillpine Hold for clues as to the source of corruption."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '身為大酋長，我最擔心的就是靜松要塞的腐敗根源。$b$b為什麼梟獸 - 曾經是我們的盟友 - 會攻擊我們?他們為什麼會居住在靜松要塞?$b$b或許裡面的某個東西會有答案。搜索靜松要塞尋找腐敗源頭的線索。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9565;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "表面上看來，水晶似乎只是艾克索達的一部分。但這水晶出了些可怕的錯誤，它是血紅色的而且迅速地溶解在洞穴的給水系統中。$B$B這或許解釋了藍謎島生物不尋常的侵略性行為。帶著這個消息去找大酋長靜松。", Details AC enUS : "On the surface, the crystal appears to be a piece of the Exodar. Something has gone terribly wrong with this crystal, however, as it is blood red and rapidly dissolving into the water supply of the cave.$B$BThis may explain the unusually aggressive behavior of the creatures in Azuremyst. Return to High Chief Stillpine with this information.$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "On the surface, the crystal appears to be a piece of the Exodar. Something has gone terribly wrong with this crystal, however, as it is blood red and rapidly dissolving into the water supply of the cave.$b$bThis may explain the unusually aggressive behavior of the creatures in Azuremyst. Return to High Chief Stillpine with this information."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '表面上看來，水晶似乎只是艾克索達的一部分。但這水晶出了些可怕的錯誤，它是血紅色的而且迅速地溶解在洞穴的給水系統中。$b$b這或許解釋了藍謎島生物不尋常的侵略性行為。帶著這個消息去找大酋長靜松。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9566;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "在血色守望見到新面孔真好，$c。雖然血精靈是最緊迫的威脅，但還有其他以血謎島為家的邪惡生物。$B$B納茲維斯薩特是特別令人擔心的。他們是骯髒，惡魔的生物，掌握黑暗魔法，以艾克索達失事產生的污染物為食物。$B$B我們一定要阻擋他們，但首先要先了解他們。去西南邊的納茲維恩，從他們奇形怪狀的紀念碑來認識他們。", Details AC enUS : "It's good to see another new face here in Blood Watch, $c. Although the blood elves are the most immediate threat, there are other sinister creatures that call Bloodmyst Isle home.$B$BThe Nazzivus satyr are of particular concern. They are foul, demonic creatures, commanding dark magics and feeding on the corruption created by the Exodar's crash.$B$BWe must hold them in check, but first we must learn more about them. Go southwest to Nazzivian and learn what you can from their grotesque monument." ; Wowhead enUS : "It's good to see another new face here in Blood Watch, $c. Although the blood elves are the most immediate threat, there are other sinister creatures that call Bloodmyst Isle home.$b$bThe Nazzivus satyr are of particular concern. They are foul, demonic creatures, commanding dark magics and feeding on the corruption created by the Exodar's crash.$b$bWe must hold them in check, but first we must learn more about them. Go southwest to Nazzivian and learn what you can from their grotesque monument."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '在血色守望見到新面孔真好，$c。雖然血精靈是最緊迫的威脅，但還有其他以血謎島為家的邪惡生物。$b$b納茲維斯薩特是特別令人擔心的。他們是骯髒，惡魔的生物，掌握黑暗魔法，以艾克索達失事產生的汙染物為食物。$b$b我們一定要阻擋他們，但首先要先了解他們。去西南邊的納茲維恩，從他們奇形怪狀的紀念碑來認識他們。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9567;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死5個艾克薩瑞安巡影者，5個艾克薩瑞安地獄呼喚者，和澤伏瑞斯，再收集5個被污染的水晶交給血色守望的復仇者艾樂希雅。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill 5 Axxarien Shadowstalkers, 5 Axxarien Hellcallers, and Zevrax, then gather 5 Corrupted Crystals and return to Vindicator Aalesia in Blood Watch." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill 5 Axxarien Shadowstalkers, 5 Axxarien Hellcallers, and Zevrax, then gather 5 Corrupted Crystals and return to Vindicator Aalesia in Blood Watch.",  OLD Details : "既然已讓薩特知道了我們的存在，我們就一定要放出消息讓他們知道我們不會容忍燃燒軍團的爛人出現在這些土地。$B$B德萊尼已經躲避燃燒軍團和它的爪牙太久了，$n。他們不管在哪裡找到我們都毫不留情。$B$B我們一定不能讓薩特利用艾克索達的失事，把腐敗的水晶當做武器。去北邊，他們領導者居住的艾克薩瑞安，殺了他，取回他一直在收集的被污染的水晶!", Details AC enUS : "Now that we have made our presence known to the satyr, we must send a message that we will not tolerate the Burning Legion's hounds in these lands.$B$BToo long have the draenei fled in the wake of the Legion and its minions, $N. Wherever they have found us, they have shown no mercy.$B$BWe must not permit the satyr to exploit the Exodar's crash and use the corrupted crystals as weapons. Go north to where their leader resides in Axxarien, destroy him, and recover the corrupted crystals he has been gathering!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Now that we have made our presence known to the satyr, we must send a message that we will not tolerate the Burning Legion's hounds in these lands.$b$bToo long have the draenei fled in the wake of the Legion and its minions, $n. Wherever they have found us, they have shown no mercy.$b$bWe must not permit the satyr to exploit the Exodar's crash and use the corrupted crystals as weapons. Go north to where their leader resides in Axxarien, destroy him, and recover the corrupted crystals he has been gathering!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死5個艾克薩瑞安巡影者，5個艾克薩瑞安地獄呼喚者，和澤伏瑞斯，再收集5個被汙染的水晶交給血色守望的復仇者艾樂希雅。', `Details` = '既然已讓薩特知道了我們的存在，我們就一定要放出消息讓他們知道我們不會容忍燃燒軍團的爛人出現在這些土地。$b$b德萊尼已經躲避燃燒軍團和它的爪牙太久了，$n。他們不管在哪裡找到我們都毫不留情。$b$b我們一定不能讓薩特利用艾克索達的失事，把腐敗的水晶當做武器。去北邊，他們領導者居住的艾克薩瑞安，殺了他，取回他一直在收集的被汙染的水晶!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9569;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "在水晶風暴平息後，一隻神秘的野獸出現在我們村子裡。這隻野獸，克爾肯，是被入侵的梟獸帶來這裡的，他對我們的村子造成許多毀壞。許多靜松的人都為了防禦我們的土地而被殺，還有許多人嘗試制服這隻野獸，從此失去了他們的性命。$B$B在我的幻境中我看見一個人擊敗了克爾肯。那個人一定就是你，$n。你是我們唯一的希望。進入靜松要塞殺死克爾肯。把他的皮革帶回來給我做為證據。", Details AC enUS : "After the crystal storm had subsided, a beast of myth appeared in our village. Brought here by the invading wildkin, this beast, the Kurken, laid waste to our village. Many Stillpine were slain in defense of our lands by this fiend and many have since lost their lives attempting to subdue the beast.$B$BIn my visions, I have seen one defeat the Kurken. The one must be you, $N. You are our only hope. Enter Stillpine Hold and slay the Kurken. Bring me his hide as proof of deed.$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "After the crystal storm had subsided, a beast of myth appeared in our village. Brought here by the invading wildkin, this beast, the Kurken, laid waste to our village. Many Stillpine were slain in defense of our lands by this fiend and many have since lost their lives attempting to subdue the beast.$b$bIn my visions, I have seen one defeat the Kurken. The one must be you, $n. You are our only hope. Enter Stillpine Hold and slay the Kurken. Bring me his hide as proof of deed."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '在水晶風暴平息後，一隻神秘的野獸出現在我們村子裡。這隻野獸，克爾肯，是被入侵的梟獸帶來這裡的，他對我們的村子造成許多毀壞。許多靜松的人都為了防禦我們的土地而被殺，還有許多人嘗試制服這隻野獸，從此失去了他們的性命。$b$b在我的幻境中我看見一個人擊敗了克爾肯。那個人一定就是你，$n。你是我們唯一的希望。進入靜松要塞殺死克爾肯。把他的皮革帶回來給我做為證據。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9570;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我是靜松年少者，靜松遺產的繼承人。如你所見，我的防衛者對靜松要塞裡攻擊我們的瘋狂梟獸設了一個死亡陷阱。我們雖然能阻止他們進到這裡，但我的防衛者卻沒有一人能滲入要塞。如果你可以進到裡面並殺了他們的領導者，那就能給我們機會襲擊!$B$B找到歐沐魯酋長並殺了他。也殺死任何你在裡面遇到的瘋狂梟獸。", Details AC enUS : "I am Stillpine the Younger, heir to the Stillpine legacy. As you can see, my defenders have set up a death trap for the raving wildkin that attack from inside Stillpine Hold. While we are able to hold them off out here, none of my defenders have been able to infiltrate the hold. If you could get inside and slay their leader, it might give us an opportunity to strike!$B$BFind Chieftain Oomooroo and destroy him. Slay any crazed wildkin that you encounter inside as well." ; Wowhead enUS : "I am Stillpine the Younger, heir to the Stillpine legacy. As you can see, my defenders have set up a death trap for the raving wildkin that attack from inside Stillpine Hold. While we are able to hold them off out here, none of my defenders have been able to infiltrate the hold. If you could get inside and slay their leader, it might give us an opportunity to strike!$b$bFind Chieftain Oomooroo and destroy him. Slay any crazed wildkin that you encounter inside as well."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我是靜松年少者，靜松遺產的繼承人。如你所見，我的防衛者對靜松要塞裡攻擊我們的瘋狂梟獸設了一個死亡陷阱。我們雖然能阻止他們進到這裡，但我的防衛者卻沒有一人能滲入要塞。如果你可以進到裡面並殺了他們的領導者，那就能給我們機會襲擊!$b$b找到歐沐魯酋長並殺了他。也殺死任何你在裡面遇到的瘋狂梟獸。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9573;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "血謎島在我們到達之後已經被徹底的改變了。艾克索達的失事讓殘骸散落在整座島上，我想它開始對野生生物產生了負面的影響。$B$B在我確定我的推論之前，我需要更仔細的檢視一番。水晶似乎對樹木的影響最快，所以樹人應該是最容易出現症狀的。如果你幫我從墮落的樹人身上帶回樹皮的樣本，我就能開始我的深入研究。", Details AC enUS : "Bloodmyst Isle was forever changed by our arrival. The Exodar's crash scattered debris all over the islands and I think it's beginning to have an adverse effect on the wildlife.$B$BBefore I can be certain of my conclusion, I'll need to get a closer look. The crystals seem to have affected the trees the fastest, so it seems that the treants would be the most likely to show symptoms. If you bring me samples of bark from corrupted treants, I can begin my in-depth studies." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bloodmyst Isle was forever changed by our arrival. The Exodar's crash scattered debris all over the islands and I think it's beginning to have an adverse effect on the wildlife.$b$bBefore I can be certain of my conclusion, I'll need to get a closer look. The crystals seem to have affected the trees the fastest, so it seems that the treants would be the most likely to show symptoms. If you bring me samples of bark from corrupted treants, I can begin my in-depth studies."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '血謎島在我們到達之後已經被徹底的改變了。艾克索達的失事讓殘骸散落在整座島上，我想它開始對野生生物產生了負面的影響。$b$b在我確定我的推論之前，我需要更仔細的檢視一番。水晶似乎對樹木的影響最快，所以樹人應該是最容易出現症狀的。如果你幫我從墮落的樹人身上帶回樹皮的樣本，我就能開始我的深入研究。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9574;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "檢視這個製作粗糙的墜飾，你發現水晶正輕柔地搏動著。雖然它的光線很微弱，但你幾乎可以感覺水晶散發出一種錯誤的訊息。$B$B你不太確定是什麼支配著酷鰭製作出這樣的墜飾，但這發現實在是太重要無法忽略。你或許該把它拿給血色守望的人看看。", Details AC enUS : "Examining the crudely constructed pendant, you notice the crystal pulsating softly. Though it emits little light, you can almost feel the crystal radiating a sense of wrongness.$B$BYou're not quite sure what might have possessed Cruelfin to create this pendant, but the find is too important to ignore. You should probably show it to someone at Blood Watch." ; Wowhead enUS : "Examining the crudely constructed pendant, you notice the crystal pulsating softly. Though it emits little light, you can almost feel the crystal radiating a sense of wrongness.$b$bYou're not quite sure what might have possessed Cruelfin to create this pendant, but the find is too important to ignore. You should probably show it to someone at Blood Watch."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '檢視這個製作粗糙的墜飾，你發現水晶正輕柔地搏動著。雖然它的光線很微弱，但你幾乎可以感覺水晶散發出一種錯誤的訊息。$b$b你不太確定是什麼支配著酷鰭製作出這樣的墜飾，但這發現實在是太重要無法忽略。你或許該把它拿給血色守望的人看看。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9576;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你常想到你的家人嗎，$n？有許多家庭都坐上了艾克索達，但我很少聽到有人能團圓的。$B$B我自己也在尋找我丈夫高拉恩的消息，他是冬眠核心的技師。那個殘骸在西邊，那裡充滿了血精靈！$B$B我一定要知道高拉恩的下落！就算是他的死訊也比永遠都不知道來的好。我的丈夫會戴著一個和我一樣的墜飾;它們是我姐姐送的禮物。", Details AC enUS : "Do you think often of your family, $N? There were a number of families aboard the Exodar, but I've heard of very few being reunited.$B$BI, myself, am looking for traces of my husband Galaen, who was a technician in the Cryo-Core. The wreckage of it is located to the west, and it's swarming with blood elves!$B$BI must find out what became of Galaen! Even news of his death is better than never knowing. My husband will be wearing a pendant identical to my own; they were a gift from my sister." ; Wowhead enUS : "Do you think often of your family, $n? There were a number of families aboard the Exodar, but I've heard of very few being reunited.$b$bI, myself, am looking for traces of my husband Galaen, who was a technician in the Cryo-Core. The wreckage of it is located to the west, and it's swarming with blood elves!$b$bI must find out what became of Galaen! Even news of his death is better than never knowing. My husband will be wearing a pendant identical to my own; they were a gift from my sister."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你常想到你的家人嗎，$n?有許多家庭都坐上了艾克索達，但我很少聽到有人能團圓的。$b$b我自己也在尋找我丈夫高拉恩的消息，他是冬眠核心的技師。那個殘骸在西邊，那裡充滿了血精靈!$b$b我一定要知道高拉恩的下落!就算是他的死訊也比永遠都不知道來的好。我的丈夫會戴著一個和我一樣的墜飾;它們是我姐姐送的禮物。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9578;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你無法利用莫瑞伊給你的資訊來鑑別高拉恩的屍體，但他的衣服看來被人搜括過而撕裂。$B$B這區域的血精靈會拿走殘骸身上所有有價值的東西，包括高拉恩的寶石護符。$B$B雖然她的丈夫未從失事中生還，你相信莫瑞伊會很感激你從血精靈那裡取回她丈夫的護符。", Details AC enUS : "You have no means of identifying the corpse as Galaen with the information Morae gave you, but the clothing appears to have been torn in search of valuables.$B$BThe blood elves in the area would've claimed anything of value from the wreckage, including Galaen's jeweled amulet.$B$BAlthough her husband did not survive the crash, you believe that Morae would be grateful if you recovered her husband's amulet from the blood elves." ; Wowhead enUS : "You have no means of identifying the corpse as Galaen with the information Morae gave you, but the clothing appears to have been torn in search of valuables.$b$bThe blood elves in the area would've claimed anything of value from the wreckage, including Galaen's jeweled amulet.$b$bAlthough her husband did not survive the crash, you believe that Morae would be grateful if you recovered her husband's amulet from the blood elves."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你無法利用莫瑞伊給你的資訊來鑑別高拉恩的屍體，但他的衣服看來被人搜括過而撕裂。$b$b這區域的血精靈會拿走殘骸身上所有有價值的東西，包括高拉恩的寶石護符。$b$b雖然她的丈夫未從失事中生還，你相信莫瑞伊會很感激你從血精靈那裡取回她丈夫的護符。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9579;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我相信你在血謎島的這段時間也看到了，很少遺物未因我們的到來而改變。我的訓練和經驗讓我知道就算是像這樣的環境產物也可以拿來利用。$B$B資源這麼少，我們一定要依賴我們的足智多謀。我用閒晃在島上的熊肉補充我們的存貨。有適當的處理，我們就能安全的吃熊肉。如果你要去外面晃晃，何不幫忙補充一些存貨呢？", Details AC enUS : "As I'm sure you've seen in your time on Bloodmyst Isle, very little remains unchanged by our arrival. My training and experience has taught me that even the products of an environment like this one can be put to use.$B$BWith so few resources, we must rely on our ingenuity to provide for us. I've been supplementing our stores with meat from the bears that wander this island. With the proper preparation, it can safely be eaten. If you're going to be out in the field, why not help replenish our stocks?" ; Wowhead enUS : "As I'm sure you've seen in your time on Bloodmyst Isle, very little remains unchanged by our arrival. My training and experience has taught me that even the products of an environment like this one can be put to use.$b$bWith so few resources, we must rely on our ingenuity to provide for us. I've been supplementing our stores with meat from the bears that wander this island. With the proper preparation, it can safely be eaten. If you're going to be out in the field, why not help replenish our stocks?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我相信你在血謎島的這段時間也看到了，很少遺物未因我們的到來而改變。我的訓練和經驗讓我知道就算是像這樣的環境產物也可以拿來利用。$b$b資源這麼少，我們一定要依賴我們的足智多謀。我用閒晃在島上的熊肉補充我們的存貨。有適當的處理，我們就能安全的吃熊肉。如果你要去外面晃晃，何不幫忙補充一些存貨呢?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9580;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "歡迎來到血色守望，$c。監督前哨的防禦是我首要關心的事，但我也被艾克索達的領導者指派了很多其他的職務。$B$B問題是在島嶼這樣危險的時候派出大量的研究員是很危險的。我需要某人去島上不同地點收集一連串的水晶樣本。$B$B我需要的第一個樣本一定要來自鎮南方過了橋的地方，劫毀者寄生的船隻殘骸。", Details AC enUS : "Welcome to Blood Watch, $c. Seeing to the defenses of the outpost is my primary concern, but I've also been tasked with a variety of other duties by our leaders at the Exodar.$B$BThe problem is that it's hardly safe to send out large amounts of researchers when the island is this dangerous. I need someone to gather a series of crystal samples from various sites on the island.$B$BThe first sample I need must come from the ravager infested ship debris south of the town and across the bridge." ; Wowhead enUS : "Welcome to Blood Watch, $c. Seeing to the defenses of the outpost is my primary concern, but I've also been tasked with a variety of other duties by our leaders at the Exodar.$b$bThe problem is that it's hardly safe to send out large amounts of researchers when the island is this dangerous. I need someone to gather a series of crystal samples from various sites on the island.$b$bThe first sample I need must come from the ravager infested ship debris south of the town and across the bridge."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '歡迎來到血色守望，$c。監督前哨的防禦是我首要關心的事，但我也被艾克索達的領導者指派了很多其他的職務。$b$b問題是在島嶼這樣危險的時候派出大量的研究員是很危險的。我需要某人去島上不同地點收集一連串的水晶樣本。$b$b我需要的第一個樣本一定要來自鎮南方過了橋的地方，劫毀者寄生的船隻殘骸。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9581;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "既然我們有了基線水晶，我們就需要更多危險區域的樣本來完成這套送到艾克索達的水晶。$B$B下一個樣本一定要來自劍木林的血精靈控制的水晶，就在血色守望的西北邊。我獲悉他們改變並取得水晶用在一些魔法儀器上。看看你能否找到一個未被合併在他們儀器裡的水晶並採下一個樣本。", Details AC enUS : "Now that we have the baseline crystal, we're going to need samples from more dangerous areas of the island to complete the set I'll be sending to the Exodar.$B$BThe next sample must come from the crystals controlled by the blood elves in the Bladewood area to the northwest of Blood Watch. I have heard reports that they alter and harvest the crystals for use in some magical apparatus. See if you can find one that has not yet been incorporated into one of their devices, and mine a sample from it." ; Wowhead enUS : "Now that we have the baseline crystal, we're going to need samples from more dangerous areas of the island to complete the set I'll be sending to the Exodar.$b$bThe next sample must come from the crystals controlled by the blood elves in the Bladewood area to the northwest of Blood Watch. I have heard reports that they alter and harvest the crystals for use in some magical apparatus. See if you can find one that has not yet been incorporated into one of their devices, and mine a sample from it."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '既然我們有了基線水晶，我們就需要更多危險區域的樣本來完成這套送到艾克索達的水晶。$b$b下一個樣本一定要來自劍木林的血精靈控制的水晶，就在血色守望的西北邊。我獲悉他們改變並取得水晶用在一些魔法儀器上。看看你能否找到一個未被合併在他們儀器裡的水晶並採下一個樣本。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9584;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "在我把這些水晶送到艾克索達前還有一個樣本要收集，$n。最後的樣本一定要來自西北邊艾克薩瑞安的薩特要塞。$B$B我不確定這個水晶樣本能說明什麼，但我肯定一定會有一些污染的徵象。記得從水晶上開採下你的裂片，就是看起來像你取得之前樣本的那種水晶，否則我們的研究員就無法做出有根據的對照。", Details AC enUS : "There's just one sample remaining before I can send this set of crystals to the Exodar, $n. The final sample must come from the satyr stronghold of Axxarien to the northwest.$B$BI'm not certain what to expect from this crystal sample, but I'm sure there will be some signs of corruption. Take care to mine your shard from the crystal that looks like the ones you took your previous samples from, or else our researchers cannot make a valid comparison." ; Wowhead enUS : "There's just one sample remaining before I can send this set of crystals to the Exodar, $n. The final sample must come from the satyr stronghold of Axxarien to the northwest.$b$bI'm not certain what to expect from this crystal sample, but I'm sure there will be some signs of corruption. Take care to mine your shard from the crystal that looks like the ones you took your previous samples from, or else our researchers cannot make a valid comparison."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '在我把這些水晶送到艾克索達前還有一個樣本要收集，$n。最後的樣本一定要來自西北邊艾克薩瑞安的薩特要塞。$b$b我不確定這個水晶樣本能說明什麼，但我肯定一定會有一些汙染的徵象。記得從水晶上開採下你的裂片，就是看起來像你取得之前樣本的那種水晶，否則我們的研究員就無法做出有根據的對照。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9585;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "護甲碎塊是由一種好像會吸收光線的深黑色金屬鑄造而成。雖然它不像有附魔的樣子，但它絕對有不對勁的地方。$B$B這種護甲只有一種軍隊會使用：燃燒軍團。燃燒軍團出現在這裡就是因為他們要動員島上的薩特對抗德萊尼。$B$B對當地薩特採取行動，再回到血色守望把這個護甲碎塊拿給復仇者艾樂希雅看。", Details AC enUS : "The armor scrap is forged from a deep black metal that seems to absorb light. Although it doesn't appear to be enchanted, there is an unmistakable sense of wrongness about it.$B$BSuch armor is only used by one force - the Burning Legion. The Legion's presence here can only mean that they're intending to mobilize the island's satyr against the draenei.$B$BTake action against the local satyr, then return to Blood Watch and show this armor scrap to Vindicator Aalesia. " ; Wowhead enUS : "The armor scrap is forged from a deep black metal that seems to absorb light. Although it doesn't appear to be enchanted, there is an unmistakable sense of wrongness about it.$b$bSuch armor is only used by one force - the Burning Legion. The Legion's presence here can only mean that they're intending to mobilize the island's satyr against the draenei.$b$bTake action against the local satyr, then return to Blood Watch and show this armor scrap to Vindicator Aalesia."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '護甲碎塊是由一種好像會吸收光線的深黑色金屬鑄造而成。雖然它不像被附魔的樣子，但它絕對有不對勁的地方。$b$b這種護甲只有一種軍隊會使用 - 燃燒軍團。軍團出現在這裡就是因為他們要動員島上的薩特對抗德萊尼。$b$b對當地薩特採取行動，再回到血色守望把這個護甲碎塊拿給復仇者艾樂希雅看。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9594;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "傳遞不幸的消息...", Title AC enUS : "Deliver Them From Evil..." ; Wowhead enUS : "Deliver Them From Evil...",  OLD Objectives : "將叛徒的信件帶給藍色守望的主教米奈奧斯。", Objectives AC enUS : "Deliver the Traitor's Communication to Exarch Menelaous at Azure Watch." ; Wowhead enUS : "Deliver the Traitor's Communication to Exarch Menelaous at Azure Watch.",  OLD Details : "你一定要將這個消息告訴你的族人，$n。雖然你英勇的行為的確有讓凱爾薩斯和他黑暗主人的計畫慢下來，但攻擊絕對會持續下去。$B$B把叛徒的信件帶給你的領導者。他們一定要親自看看。或許他們能更清楚了解裡面寫的東西。", Details AC enUS : "You must get this information to your people, $N. While your brave acts have certainly slowed down the plans of Kael'thas and his dark master, the attacks will undoubtedly continue.$B$BTake the traitor's communication to your leaders. They must see this for themselves. Perhaps they will be able to better understand some of what was written." ; Wowhead enUS : "You must get this information to your people, $n. While your brave acts have certainly slowed down the plans of Kael'thas and his dark master, the attacks will undoubtedly continue.$b$bTake the traitor's communication to your leaders. They must see this for themselves. Perhaps they will be able to better understand some of what was written."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '傳遞不幸的消息……', `Objectives` = '將背叛者的信件帶給藍色守望的主教米奈奧斯。', `Details` = '你一定要將這個消息告訴你的族人，$n。雖然你英勇的行為的確有讓凱爾薩斯和他黑暗主人的計畫慢下來，但攻擊絕對會持續下去。$b$b把背叛者的信件帶給你的領導者。他們一定要親自看看。或許他們能更清楚了解裡面寫的東西。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9602;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把查倫的清單交給藍色守望的角鷹獸管理員札爾丹。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take Topher's List to Laando, the Hippogryph Master at Blood Watch." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take Topher's List to Laando, the Hippogryph Master at Blood Watch.",  OLD Details : "歡迎來到藍色守望，$c。請不要介意四周的凌亂。把簡單的事情視為理所當然是很容易的，例如建造一間有著完整裝潢和存貨的旅店，直到你被迫無中生有才知道它的困難。$B$B我們拿這個分離艙充當建築物，但沒有適當的家具和急救補給品，這旅店也不過是個美麗的帳篷而已。艾克索達的魯古尼已表示會給我們一個包裹來解決我們最迫切的需要，但我還需要某人幫我把這份清單送給他。", Details AC enUS : "Welcome to Blood Watch, $c. Please excuse the disorder you see around you. It's easy to take simple things for granted, like a fully furnished and stocked inn, until you're forced to build one from nothing.$B$BWe've managed to salvage this pod for a building, but without the proper furnishings and first aid supplies, the inn is little more than a glorified tent. Nurguni at the Exodar has offered to put together a package to help with our most immediate needs, but I need someone to deliver this list to him." ; Wowhead enUS : "Welcome to Blood Watch, $c. Please excuse the disorder you see around you. It's easy to take simple things for granted, like a fully furnished and stocked inn, until you're forced to build one from nothing.$b$bWe've managed to salvage this pod for a building, but without the proper furnishings and first aid supplies, the inn is little more than a glorified tent. Nurguni at the Exodar has offered to put together a package to help with our most immediate needs, but I need someone to deliver this list to him."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把塔伏爾的單子交給血色守望的角鷹獸管理員勒藍度。', `Details` = '歡迎來到血色守望，$c。請不要介意四周的凌亂。把簡單的事情視為理所當然是很容易的，就像建造一間有著完整裝潢和存貨的旅店，直到你被迫無中生有才知道它的困難。$b$b我們已利用這個分離艙做為建築物，但沒有適當的家具和急救補給品，這旅店也不過是個美麗的帳篷而已。艾克索達的魯古尼已表示會給我們一個包裹來解決我們最迫切的需要，但我還需要某人幫我把這個單子送給他。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9603;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "乘在角鷹獸的翅膀上", Title AC enUS : "On the Wings of a Hippogryph" ; Wowhead enUS : "On the Wings of a Hippogryph",  OLD Objectives : "向勒藍度那租借一隻角鷹獸飛往艾克索達。抵達後，將查倫的清單交給那魯之座的魯古尼。", Objectives AC enUS : "Purchase a hippogryph ride to the Exodar from Laando. When you land, take Topher's List to Nurguni in the Seat of the Naaru at the Exodar." ; Wowhead enUS : "Purchase a hippogryph ride to the Exodar from Laando. When you land, take Topher's List to Nurguni in the Seat of the Naaru at the Exodar.",  OLD Details : "只要一點錢，你就能租一隻角鷹獸載你到艾克索達。$B$B搭乘角鷹獸是既快又安全的方式，提供給攜帶重要訊息的人選擇。如果你要乘坐，再跟我說，我會安排的。", Details AC enUS : "For a small fee, you can rent one of my hippogryphs to fly you to the Exodar.$B$BTaking the hippogryph is a faster, not to mention safer, alternative for someone carrying an important message. If you'd like to take a ride, speak to me again and I'll make the arrangements." ; Wowhead enUS : "For a small fee, you can rent one of my hippogryphs to fly you to the Exodar.$b$bTaking the hippogryph is a faster, not to mention safer, alternative for someone carrying an important message. If you'd like to take a ride, speak to me again and I'll make the arrangements."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '飛快的角鷹獸', `Objectives` = '向勒藍度那租借一隻角鷹獸飛往艾克索達，抵達後，將塔伏爾的單子交給那魯之座的魯古尼。', `Details` = '只要一點錢，你就能租一隻角鷹獸載你到艾克索達。$b$b搭乘角鷹獸是既快又安全的方式，提供給攜帶重要訊息的人選擇。如果你要乘坐，再跟我說，我會安排的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9604;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到艾克索達裡的那魯之座去找史丹樊那斯，並乘坐角鷹獸回到藍色守望。", Objectives AC enUS : "Find Stephanos outside the Exodar and purchase a hippogryph ride back to Blood Watch." ; Wowhead enUS : "Find Stephanos outside the Exodar and purchase a hippogryph ride back to Blood Watch.",  OLD Details : "箱子在這，$n。這應該夠查倫經營旅店了。讓她知道有需要的話她可以繼續訂貨。藍色守望急切地需要一個地方來照料傷者及供給旅人住宿。$B$B等你準備好前往藍色守望，就去找艾克索達裡那魯之座的史丹樊那斯。", Details AC enUS : "Here's the box, $N. That should be enough for Topher to get the inn up and running. Let him know that he can keep sending in orders as the need arises. Blood Watch urgently needs a place to care for the wounded and put up any travelers they receive.$B$BWhen you're ready to return to Blood Watch, seek out Stephanos near the gates of the Exodar." ; Wowhead enUS : "Here's the box, $n. That should be enough for Topher to get the inn up and running. Let him know that he can keep sending in orders as the need arises. Blood Watch urgently needs a place to care for the wounded and put up any travelers they receive.$b$bWhen you're ready to return to Blood Watch, seek out Stephanos near the gates of the Exodar."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '到艾克索達外去找史丹樊那斯，並乘坐角鷹獸回到血色守望。', `Details` = '箱子在這，$n。這應該夠塔伏爾經營旅店了。讓他知道有需要的話他可以繼續訂貨。血色守望急切地需要一個地方來照料傷者及供給旅人住宿。$b$b等你準備好前往血色守望，就去找艾克索達入口旁的史丹樊那斯。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9605;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "回去找照顧者查倫", Title AC enUS : "Return to Topher Loaal" ; Wowhead enUS : "Return to Topher Loaal",  OLD Objectives : "與史丹樊那斯租借一隻角鷹獸回到藍色守望。抵達後，將魯古尼的補給送去給照顧者查倫。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Stephanos to purchase a hippogryph ride back to Blood Watch. Once you have arrived, deliver Nurguni's Supplies to Caregiver Topher Loaal." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Stephanos to purchase a hippogryph ride back to Blood Watch. Once you have arrived, deliver Nurguni's Supplies to Caregiver Topher Loaal.",  OLD Details : "如果我沒記錯，藍色守望的角鷹獸管理員是札爾丹。要是你之前已經跟他說過話了，就能從我這租一隻角鷹獸到他那去。$B$B這是個很好的學習:角鷹獸一直接受訓練飛往他們的主要城市，但牠們只能送你前往你所去過的遠方角鷹獸管理員那。$B$B因為你已經去過札爾丹的其中一處鳥點，就能使用這條路線帶著補充品回到藍色守望去。", Details AC enUS : "If I remember correctly, Blood Watch's hippogryph master is Laando.  If you've spoken to him before, then you can take one of my hippogryphs to him.$B$BThat's a good lesson to know: hippogryphs are always trained to fly to their capital city, but they'll only take you to a remote hippogryph master after you've already been there.$B$BSince you arrived on one of Laando's hippogryphs, you can also use that route to return to Blood Watch with the caregiver's supplies." ; Wowhead enUS : "If I remember correctly, Blood Watch's hippogryph master is Laando. If you've spoken to him before, then you can take one of my hippogryphs to him.$b$bThat's a good lesson to know: hippogryphs are always trained to fly to their capital city, but they'll only take you to a remote hippogryph master after you've already been there.$b$bSince you arrived on one of Laando's hippogryphs, you can also use that route to return to Blood Watch with the caregiver's supplies."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '回到塔伏爾·羅歐那裡', `Objectives` = '與史丹樊那斯租借一隻角鷹獸回到血色守望。一旦抵達後，運送魯古尼的補給品給照顧者塔伏爾·羅歐', `Details` = '如果我沒記錯，血色守望的角鷹獸管理員是勒藍度。要是你之前已經跟他說過話了，就能從我這租一隻角鷹獸到他那去。$b$b這是個很好的學習:角鷹獸一直接受訓練飛往他們的主要城市，但它們只能送你前往所在地之外的角鷹獸管理員那。$b$b因為你已經去過勒藍度的其中一處鳥點，就能使用這條路線帶著補充品回到血色守望去。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9606;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "這看起來是一個賞金帳本。你不了解血精靈的語言，但你注意到有一個圖片描繪一個死去的德萊尼，一個微笑的血精靈站在屍體旁，和一個你認為是某種血精靈貨幣的符號。$B$B他們已經對德萊尼發動攻擊了!你一定要通知主教。", Details AC enUS : "This appears to be a bounty ledger. You cannot understand the blood elf language but you note that there is a picture depicting a dead draenei, a smiling blood elf standing over the corpse, and a symbol of what you think is some sort of blood elf currency.$B$BThey've put a hit out on draenei! You must inform the exarch." ; Wowhead enUS : "This appears to be a bounty ledger. You cannot understand the blood elf language but you note that there is a picture depicting a dead draenei, a smiling blood elf standing over the corpse, and a symbol of what you think is some sort of blood elf currency.$b$bThey've put a hit out on draenei! You must inform the exarch."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '這看起來是一個賞金帳本。你不了解血精靈的語言，但你注意到有一個圖片描繪一個死去的德萊尼，一個微笑的血精靈站在屍體旁，和一個你認為是某種血精靈貨幣的符號。$b$b他們已經對德萊尼發動攻擊了!你一定要通知主教。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9616;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "隨著我們在血色守望安置下來，我也派出了調查小組去製作更多可靠的島嶼地圖。大部分的情況來說，他們都會帶著我們需要的資料毫髮未傷的回來，但我派去東邊廢墟的小組卻未向我們回報。$B$B我擔心他們會發生什麼事，但我沒有人手可以接下另一個任務去找他們。找到他們，$n，給予他們任何需要的協助帶回他們的調查資料。", Details AC enUS : "As we've gotten ourselves established here at Blood Watch, I've been sending out survey teams to create more reliable maps of the island. In most cases, they returned unharmed with the data we need, but the team I sent east to the ruins hasn't reported back.$B$BI worry about what might have happened to them, but I can't spare the men to send another mission after them. Find them, $N, and lend them any assistance they require to return with their survey data." ; Wowhead enUS : "As we've gotten ourselves established here at Blood Watch, I've been sending out survey teams to create more reliable maps of the island. In most cases, they returned unharmed with the data we need, but the team I sent east to the ruins hasn't reported back.$b$bI worry about what might have happened to them, but I can't spare the men to send another mission after them. Find them, $n, and lend them any assistance they require to return with their survey data."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '隨著我們在血色守望安置下來，我也派出了調查小組去製作更多可靠的島嶼地圖。大部分的情況來說，他們都會帶著我們需要的資料毫髮未傷的回來，但我派去東邊廢墟的小組卻未向我們回報。$b$b我擔心他們會發生什麼事，但我沒有人手可以接下另一個任務去找他們。找到他們，$n，給予他們任何需要的協助帶回他們的調查資料。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9620;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將來自洛索瑪‧塞隆的信帶到幽暗城，提里斯法林地的被遺忘者首都給希瓦娜斯‧風行者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring the Letter from Lor'themar Theron to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner in Undercity, the Forsaken capital in Tirisfal Glades." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the Letter from Lor'themar Theron to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner in Undercity, the Forsaken capital in Tirisfal Glades.",  OLD Details : "我們潛在的新盟友對我們的能力有些懷疑。被認為連自己家的問題都無法解決那我們對他們而言還有什麼用?$B$B這會改變一切。我們的能力不再會被質疑。我們會以同等的姿態加入部落。$B$B把這封信交給希瓦娜斯，被遺忘者的統治者。她已經和我們站在同一陣線了，但達克汗的死訊對她來說一定還是很悅耳。準備好長途跋涉吧，$n。如果一切進行順利她會送你到奧格瑪的。", Details AC enUS : "There were doubts about our capabilities among our potential new allies.  Of what use could we be to them when perceived as unable to deal with our problems at home?$B$BThis changes everything.  No longer will our power be questioned.  We'll be able to join the Horde as equals.$B$BTake this letter to Sylvanas, ruler of the Forsaken.  She's already on our side but the news of Dar'Khan's death will be music to her ears.  Prepare for a long trip, $N.  If all goes well she will send you to Orgrimmar." ; Wowhead enUS : "There were doubts about our capabilities among our potential new allies. Of what use could we be to them when perceived as unable to deal with our problems at home?$b$bThis changes everything. No longer will our power be questioned. We'll be able to join the Horde as equals.$b$bTake this letter to Sylvanas, ruler of the Forsaken. She's already on our side but the news of Dar'Khan's death will be music to her ears. Prepare for a long trip, $n. If all goes well she will send you to Orgrimmar."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將來自洛索瑪·塞隆的信帶到幽暗城，提里斯法林地的被遺忘者首都給希瓦娜斯·風行者。', `Details` = '我們潛在的新盟友對我們的能力有些懷疑。被認為連自己家的問題都無法解決那我們對他們而言還有什麼用?$b$b這會改變一切。我們的能力不再會被質疑。我們會以同等的姿態加入部落。$b$b把這封信交給希瓦娜斯，被遺忘者的統治者。她已經和我們站在同一陣線了，但達克汗的死訊對她而言沒有影響力。準備好長途跋涉吧，$n。如果一切進行順利她會送你到奧格瑪的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9621;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "要塞保住了，很快的我的族人會回到先祖的家。預言成真了，一個新的繁榮時代就要在靜松展開了。$B$B但我擔心黑暗就在你自己的族人前方逼近。還有問題未被解答 - 預言的幻象未被目睹。$B$B回到你的領導者那裡告訴他們你在這看見了什麼。$B$B還有允諾者，如果你需要靜松的幫助，請隨時開口。", Details AC enUS : "The Hold is saved and soon my people will make their way back to the ancestral home. The prophecy has come to pass and a new age of prosperity begins for the Stillpine.$B$BBut I fear that darkness looms ahead for your own people. There are questions left unanswered - visions of prophecy unseen.$B$BReturn to your leaders and tell them of what you have seen here.$B$BAnd Promised One, should you ever require the aid of Stillpine, you have merely to ask." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Hold is saved and soon my people will make their way back to the ancestral home. The prophecy has come to pass and a new age of prosperity begins for the Stillpine.$b$bBut I fear that darkness looms ahead for your own people. There are questions left unanswered - visions of prophecy unseen.$b$bReturn to your leaders and tell them of what you have seen here.$b$bAnd Promised One, should you ever require the aid of Stillpine, you have merely to ask."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '要塞保住了，很快的我的族人會回到先祖的家。預言成真了，一個新的繁榮時代就要在靜松展開了。$b$b但我擔心黑暗就在你自己的族人前方逼近。還有問題未被解答 - 預言的幻象未被目睹。$b$b回到你的領導者那裡告訴他們你在這看見了什麼。$b$b還有允諾者，如果你需要靜松的幫助，請隨時開口。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9622;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你在我們新家的荒野裡活了下來，並展現你的過人之處。我相信你可以協助那些血謎島前線的戰役了。阿古斯之手會需要像你這樣的$r。$B$B向『獸群管理者』托拉利斯回報。他在艾克索達外面照顧著伊萊克。把這些命令交給他，這樣他就會指示你在血謎島上的新任務。", Details AC enUS : "You have survived the wilds of our new home and shown yourself a cut above the others. I believe that you have come of age to assist those battling on the front lines of Bloodmyst. The Hand of Argus could use a $r like you. $B$BReport to Torallius the Pack Handler. You will find him outside the Exodar, tending to the elekk. Give him these orders so that he may direct you towards your new duties on Bloodmyst." ; Wowhead enUS : "You have survived the wilds of our new home and shown yourself a cut above the others. I believe that you have come of age to assist those battling on the front lines of Bloodmyst. The Hand of Argus could use a $r like you.$b$bReport to Torallius the Pack Handler. You will find him outside the Exodar, tending to the elekk. Give him these orders so that he may direct you towards your new duties on Bloodmyst."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你在我們新家的荒野裡活了下來，並展現你的過人之處。我相信你可以協助那些血謎島前線的戰役了。阿古斯之手會需要像你這樣的$r。$b$b向『獸群管理者』托拉利斯回報。他在艾克索達外面照顧著伊萊克。把這些命令交給他，這樣他就會指示你在血謎島上的新任務。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9623;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我發現了一件很棒的事，$c。在未受污染的島上生長著一種超棒的水果叫沙梨。它們長在樹底下。$B$B我準備用它們來做派，但如果我一不小心，伊萊克就會開始四處遊蕩偷取我的水果。我已採集夠多水果和這些動物分享，但我的儲存量已不夠而我對派的渴望又不斷上揚。你願意幫我收集這些水果讓我做另一批派嗎？我保證會分你的！", Details AC enUS : "I've made a wonderful discovery, $c. On the uncorrupted part of the island grows a remarkable fruit called the sand pear. They're found near the bottoms of the trees.$B$BI've been preparing pies from them, but if I'm not careful, the elekk will start to wander over and steal my fruit. I've taken to gathering enough to share with the animals, but my stores are gone and the craving for pie has returned. Would you be willing to help gather the fruit I need for another batch of pies? I promise I'll share!" ; Wowhead enUS : "I've made a wonderful discovery, $c. On the uncorrupted part of the island grows a remarkable fruit called the sand pear. They're found near the bottoms of the trees.$b$bI've been preparing pies from them, but if I'm not careful, the elekk will start to wander over and steal my fruit. I've taken to gathering enough to share with the animals, but my stores are gone and the craving for pie has returned. Would you be willing to help gather the fruit I need for another batch of pies? I promise I'll share!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我發現了一件很棒的事，$c。在未受汙染的島上生長著一種超棒的水果叫沙梨。它們長在樹底下。$b$b我準備用它們來做派，但如果我一不小心，伊萊克就會開始四處遊蕩偷取我的水果。我已採集夠多水果和這些動物分享，但我的儲存量已不夠而我對派的渴望又不斷上揚。你願意幫我收集這些水果讓我做另一批派嗎?我保證會分你的!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9624;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "他瘋了嗎?委託這樣的事情給一個不知名的年輕$r!$B$B記住這點孩子:你永遠也無法成為一個阿古斯之手的!你沒那個本事!$B$B我想我這次得遷就他了。到血謎島和凱索十字路的渥卡恩談談。沿著往北方的路走，到了岔路時繼續往北走就對了。", Details AC enUS : "Is he crazy? Entrusting something like this to some no-named $r youngling!$B$BJust remember this kid: You'll never make it as a Hand of Argus! You don't have the guts!$B$BI guess I'll have to humor him this time. Speak with Vorkhan at Kessel's Crossing on Bloodmyst Isle. Just follow the road north from here, and when it forks, just keep on going north." ; Wowhead enUS : "Is he crazy? Entrusting something like this to some no-named $r youngling!$b$bJust remember this kid: You'll never make it as a Hand of Argus! You don't have the guts!$b$bI guess I'll have to humor him this time. Speak with Vorkhan at Kessel's Crossing on Bloodmyst Isle. Just follow the road north from here, and when it forks, just keep on going north."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '他瘋了嗎?委託這樣的事情給一個不知名的年輕$r!$b$b記住這點孩子:你永遠也無法成為一個阿古斯之手的!你沒那個本事!$b$b我想我這次得遷就他了。到血謎島和凱索十字路的渥卡恩談談。沿著往北方的路走，到了岔路時繼續往北走就對了。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9625;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "回到銀月城向洛索瑪‧塞隆回報。", Objectives AC enUS : "Return to Silvermoon City and report back to Lor'themar Theron." ; Wowhead enUS : "Return to Silvermoon City and report back to Lor'themar Theron.",  OLD Details : "你的人民被聯盟狠狠的背叛。你已成功擊退達納蘇斯，以及鐵爐堡的間諜。現在你又在家門前擊敗了一個強大的天譴軍團領導者。你的實力已經不容懷疑。 ⏎  ⏎ 現在很明顯的你需要我們，而我們也需要你。回去洛索瑪身邊，轉告他，我清楚的收到他的訊息。 ⏎  ⏎ <薩魯法爾將信在手中揉爛。> ⏎  ⏎ 歡迎來到部落，血精靈。", Details AC enUS : "Your people suffered a great betrayal by the Alliance.  You've succeeded in fending off Darnassian attacks as well as spies from Ironforge.  Now you've defeated a powerful Scourge leader at the footsteps of your home.  Your worthiness is no longer in question.$B$BIt is now apparent that you need us and we need you.  Return to Lor'themar.  Tell him I received his message loud and clear.$B$B<The warchief crushes the letter inside his palm.>$B$BWelcome to the Horde, elf." ; Wowhead enUS : "Your people suffered a great betrayal by the Alliance. You've succeeded in fending off Darnassian attacks as well as spies from Ironforge. Now you've defeated a powerful Scourge leader at the footsteps of your home. Your worthiness is no longer in question.$b$bIt is now apparent that you need us and we need you. Return to Lor'themar. Tell him I received his message loud and clear.$b$b<The warchief crushes the letter inside his palm.>$b$bWelcome to the Horde, elf."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '回到銀月城向洛索瑪·塞隆回報。', `Details` = '你的人民被聯盟狠狠的背叛。你已成功抵擋達納蘇斯和鐵爐堡間諜的攻擊。現在你又在家門前擊敗了一個強大的天譴軍團領導者。你的實力已不再值得懷疑。$b$b現在很明顯的你需要我們而我們也需要你。回到洛索瑪那裡。告訴他我清楚的收到了他的訊息。$b$b<大酋長將信在手中揉爛。>$b$b歡迎來到部落，精靈。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9627;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "現在幫製圖師完成他們的任務已經太遲了，但看來他們收集了通報者米可拉斯想要的資料。儲存他們調查資料的水晶不在他們的背包裡，所以它一定是在怒鱗納迦的手中。$B$B你知道通報者米可拉斯若失去了調查小組會很難過，但他還是會搶救調查資料吧。", Details AC enUS : "It's too late to assist the cartographers in completing their mission, but it appears they collected the data Harbinger Mikolaas was expecting. The crystal storing their survey information was not among their ransacked packs, so it must be in the hands of the Wrathscale naga.$B$BYou know that Harbinger Mikolaas will be saddened by the loss of the survey crew, but would want to salvage the survey data." ; Wowhead enUS : "It's too late to assist the cartographers in completing their mission, but it appears they collected the data Harbinger Mikolaas was expecting. The crystal storing their survey information was not among their ransacked packs, so it must be in the hands of the Wrathscale naga.$b$bYou know that Harbinger Mikolaas will be saddened by the loss of the survey crew, but would want to salvage the survey data."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '現在幫製圖師完成他們的任務已經太遲了，但看來他們收集了通報者米可拉斯想要的資料。儲存他們調查資料的水晶不在他們的背包裡，所以它一定是在怒鱗納迦的手中。$b$b你知道通報者米可拉斯若失去了調查小組會很難過，但他還是會搶救調查資料吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9628;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "西南方海岸上的黑沙魚人是很好奇的生物。在某些方面來說，他們只是敏銳的哨兵，但其他時候，他們又展現了非凡的組織程度。$B$B我對此有一些理論，但直接最近才有真正試探他們的方法。我想出了一個辦法讓我可以追蹤我有興趣的魚人，而不會對他們造成一點傷害或干擾他們自然的行為。如果你願意幫我做標記，我會很樂意酬謝你的協助。", Details AC enUS : "The Blacksilt murlocs on the southwestern coast are curious creatures. In some ways, they act barely sentient, yet in others, they show a remarkable degree of organization.$B$BI have a few theories about that, but no real way to test them until recently. I've devised a method that will allow me to track the murlocs I'm interested in without doing any lasting harm or interfering with their natural behavior. If you're willing to help with the marking, I'll gladly pay you for your assistance." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Blacksilt murlocs on the southwestern coast are curious creatures. In some ways, they act barely sentient, yet in others, they show a remarkable degree of organization.$b$bI have a few theories about that, but no real way to test them until recently. I've devised a method that will allow me to track the murlocs I'm interested in without doing any lasting harm or interfering with their natural behavior. If you're willing to help with the marking, I'll gladly pay you for your assistance."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '西南方海岸上的黑沙魚人是很好奇的生物。在某些方面來說，他們只是敏銳的哨兵，但其他時候，他們又展現了非凡的組織程度。$b$b我對此有一些理論，但直接最近才有真正試探他們的方法。我想出了一個辦法讓我可以追蹤我有興趣的魚人，而不會對他們造成一點傷害或干擾他們自然的行為。如果你願意幫我做標記，我會很樂意酬謝你的協助。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9629;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到藍謎島把介紹信交給女獵人凱拉‧夜弓。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take the Letter of Introduction to Huntress Kella Nightbow in Azuremyst Isle." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take the Letter of Introduction to Huntress Kella Nightbow in Azuremyst Isle.",  OLD Details : "通報者米可拉斯保衛血色守望的工作做的相當不錯，$c，但我們的敵人有許多，而我們的資源卻很少。$B$B敵人很清楚我們的弱點，但你和聯盟軍隊的聯繫卻是他們料想不到的。我準備了一封介紹信給奧伯丁的人民，最近的聯盟殖民地，提出合作對抗我們敵人的建議。帶著它去找艾克索達西邊碼頭附近的女獵人凱拉‧夜弓。", Details AC enUS : "Harbinger Mikolaas has done a commendable job of safeguarding Blood Watch, $c, but our enemies are many and our resources few.$B$BOur weakness is well known to our enemies, but your contact with the forces of the Alliance is something they haven't accounted for. I have prepared a letter of introduction to the people of Auberdine, the closest Alliance settlement, proposing cooperation in the fight against our foes. Take it with you and seek out Huntress Kella Nightbow near the docks west of the Exodar." ; Wowhead enUS : "Harbinger Mikolaas has done a commendable job of safeguarding Blood Watch, $c, but our enemies are many and our resources few.$b$bOur weakness is well known to our enemies, but your contact with the forces of the Alliance is something they haven't accounted for. I have prepared a letter of introduction to the people of Auberdine, the closest Alliance settlement, proposing cooperation in the fight against our foes. Take it with you and seek out Huntress Kella Nightbow near the docks west of the Exodar."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將介紹信交給女獵人凱拉·夜弓。', `Details` = '通報者米可拉斯保衛血色守望的工作做的相當不錯，$c，但我們的敵人有許多，而我們的資源卻很少。$b$b敵人很清楚我們的弱點，但你和聯盟軍隊的聯繫卻是他們料想不到的。我準備了一封介紹信給奧伯丁的人民，最近的聯盟殖民地，提出合作對抗我們敵人的建議。帶著它去找艾克索達西邊碼頭附近的女獵人凱拉·夜弓。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9632;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "如果你在碼頭外等著，你就會看到從黑海岸的奧伯丁來的船抵達。等到它的乘客都下船後，你就能上船。$B$B在一小段旅程之後，船就會在奧伯丁停下，你就能遞送你的訊息了。$B$B你最好將這個交給桑迪斯·織風，我的一個老朋友也是那個鎮上很受尊敬的市民。", Details AC enUS : "If you wait out on the dock, you'll see the boat arriving from the port of Auberdine in Darkshore. Once it has offloaded its passengers, you'll be able to board.$B$BAfter a short journey, the boat will put in at Auberdine and you'll be able to deliver your message.$B$BIt's probably best to take this to Thundris Windweaver, an old friend of mine and a well-respected citizen of the town. " ; Wowhead enUS : "If you wait out on the dock, you'll see the boat arriving from the port of Auberdine in Darkshore. Once it has offloaded its passengers, you'll be able to board.$b$bAfter a short journey, the boat will put in at Auberdine and you'll be able to deliver your message.$b$bIt's probably best to take this to Thundris Windweaver, an old friend of mine and a well-respected citizen of the town."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '如果你在碼頭外等著，你就會看到從黑海岸的奧伯丁來的船抵達。等到它的乘客都下船後，你就能上船。$b$b在一小段旅程之後，船就會在奧伯丁停下，你就能遞送你的訊息了。$b$b你最好將這個交給桑迪斯·織風，我的一個老朋友也是那個鎮上很受尊敬的市民。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9633;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我們在旅途中學到的一件事就是當你將一個世界的野生動物帶到另一個世界時一定要格外小心。當艾克索達失事時，它裝載著各種外域的物種樣本，包括一個叫劫毀者的昆蟲掠食者。$B$B有些樣本不見了，但許多其他的還活著並開始喜歡荒地。如果我們不持續觀察它們，它們會擾亂島上的自然平衡。$b$b你可以在凱索十字路西邊找到這些劫毀者，靠近海岸的地方。", Details AC enUS : "One thing we've learned in our travels is that extreme care must be taken when introducing wildlife from one world to another. When the Exodar crashed, it was carrying specimens of various Outland species, including an insectoid predator called the ravager.$B$BSome of the specimens were lost, but many others survived and took to the wild. If we don't keep them in check, they will upset the natural balance here on the islands.$b$bYou'll find these ravagers to the west of Kessel's Crossing, near the coast." ; Wowhead enUS : "One thing we've learned in our travels is that extreme care must be taken when introducing wildlife from one world to another. When the Exodar crashed, it was carrying specimens of various Outland species, including an insectoid predator called the ravager.$b$bSome of the specimens were lost, but many others survived and took to the wild. If we don't keep them in check, they will upset the natural balance here on the islands.$b$bYou'll find these ravagers to the west of Kessel's Crossing, near the coast.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bloodmyst Hatchling slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我們在旅途中學到的一件事就是當你將一個世界的野生動物帶到另一個世界時一定要格外小心。當艾克索達失事時，它裝載著各種外域的物種樣本，包括一個叫劫毀者的昆蟲掠食者。$b$b有些樣本不見了，但許多其他的還活著並開始喜歡荒地。如果我們不持續觀察它們，它們會擾亂島上的自然平衡。$b$b你可以在凱索十字路西邊找到這些劫毀者，靠近海岸的地方。', `Objectivetext1` = '血謎幼蟲 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9634;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "艾克索達失事的邪惡水晶裂片散落在整個血謎島，污染了水源和景色。$B$B我們甚至開始在動物的肉體裡找到水晶裂片。我已找到一個方法可以淨化裂片，將它們轉變為有用的水晶，所以如果你幫我帶來足夠的裂片，我就會用一個完整的水晶和你交換。目前為止我已在熊，劫毀者，翼蛾，和樹人的身體裡找到裂片，他們都住在島上受污染的地方。", Details AC enUS : "The Exodar's crash scattered pieces of fouled crystals all over Bloodmyst Isle, corrupting the water and the landscape.$B$BWe've even begun finding pieces of the crystals inside the flesh of animals taken for meat. I've uncovered a way to purify the shard and turn them into functional crystals, so if you bring me enough shards, I'll trade one of my completed crystals for them. So far I've found the shards in the bodies of bears, ravagers, flutterers, and treants inhabiting the corrupted part of the island." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Exodar's crash scattered pieces of fouled crystals all over Bloodmyst Isle, corrupting the water and the landscape.$b$bWe've even begun finding pieces of the crystals inside the flesh of animals taken for meat. I've uncovered a way to purify the shard and turn them into functional crystals, so if you bring me enough shards, I'll trade one of my completed crystals for them. So far I've found the shards in the bodies of bears, ravagers, flutterers, and treants inhabiting the corrupted part of the island."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '艾克索達失事的邪惡水晶裂片散落在整個血謎島，汙染了水源和景色。$b$b我們甚至開始在動物的肉體裡找到水晶裂片。我已找到一個方法可以淨化裂片，將它們轉變為有用的水晶，所以如果你幫我帶來足夠的裂片，我就會用一個完整的水晶和你交換。目前為止我已在熊，劫毀者，翼蛾，和樹人的身體裡找到裂片，他們都住在島上受汙染的地方。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9641;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "一個好的護林者會善用所有可利用的資源，$c。就連最奇怪的生物所擁有的特性我們都能利用。$B$B血色守望不斷遭受太陽之鷹的攻擊，我們要尋求各種天然的防禦包括陷阱。鞭笞者多刺的藤蔓很適合建造我想的陷阱。銳利的刺和致命的毒素結合會讓粗心的攻擊者落入陷阱。幫我把突變的蟒藤帶來這樣我就能開始動工。", Details AC enUS : "A good woodsman makes use of every available resource, $c. Even the most bizarre creatures possess attributes we can use to our advantage.$B$BWith Blood Watch under constant assault from the Sunhawks, we're looking to a variety of natural defenses including traps. The lasher's thorny vines are perfectly suited to the construction of the traps I have in mind. The combination of sharp spines and deadly toxin will fell unwary attackers. Bring me the vines of mutated constrictors so that I can begin my work." ; Wowhead enUS : "A good woodsman makes use of every available resource, $c. Even the most bizarre creatures possess attributes we can use to our advantage.$b$bWith Blood Watch under constant assault from the Sunhawks, we're looking to a variety of natural defenses including traps. The lasher's thorny vines are perfectly suited to the construction of the traps I have in mind. The combination of sharp spines and deadly toxin will fell unwary attackers. Bring me the vines of mutated constrictors so that I can begin my work."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '一個好木匠會善用所有可利用的資源，$c。就連最奇怪的生物所擁有的特性我們都能利用。$b$b血色守望不斷遭受太陽之鷹的攻擊，我們要尋求各種天然的防禦包括陷阱。鞭笞者多刺的藤蔓很適合建造我想的陷阱。銳利的刺和致命的毒素結合會讓粗心的攻擊者落入陷阱。幫我把突變的蟒藤帶來這樣我就能開始動工。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9643;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "通報者米可拉斯的命令：懸賞帶著死亡之爪，一隻潛行捕食的熊已死的證據回來的勇敢靈魂。$B$B死亡之爪是極為危險的生物，在血色守望西北方的海岸殺死了一批調查小組。旅人最好都避開那個區域。", Details AC enUS : "By order of Harbinger Mikolaas: A bounty of 18 silver to be paid to the brave soul who returns with proof of the marauding bear Deathclaw's demise.$B$BDeathclaw should be considered extremely dangerous and is responsible for the killing of a survey team on the coast to the northwest of Blood Watch. Travelers are advised to avoid the area." ; Wowhead enUS : "By order of Harbinger Mikolaas: A bounty of 18 silver to be paid to the brave soul who returns with proof of the marauding bear Deathclaw's demise.$b$bDeathclaw should be considered extremely dangerous and is responsible for the killing of a survey team on the coast to the northwest of Blood Watch. Travelers are advised to avoid the area."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '通報者米可拉斯的命令:以18銀懸賞帶著死亡之爪，一隻潛行捕食的熊已死的證據回來的勇敢靈魂。$b$b死亡之爪是極為危險的生物，在血色守望西北方的海岸殺死了一批調查小組。旅人最好都避開那個區域。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9646;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "當我們第一次碰到翼蛾時，他們沒有什麼突變的跡象。隨著污染日益嚴重，飛蛾和其他物種便開始出現受污染的跡象。$B$B現在已經進展到和他們接觸的所有生物幾乎都遭到損害了。他們正在擴大艾克索達失事後散落的水晶裂片所造成的傷害。我們別無選擇只能開始削減他們在血色守望北邊的數量。", Details AC enUS : "When we first encountered flutterers, they showed few signs of mutation. As the corruption got progressively worse, the moths and other species began to show signs of contamination.$B$BIt has progressed to the point where they damage nearly everything they come in contact with. They're amplifying the damage being done by the crystal shards scattered by the Exodar's crash. We have no choice but to begin culling their population in the lands north of Blood Watch." ; Wowhead enUS : "When we first encountered flutterers, they showed few signs of mutation. As the corruption got progressively worse, the moths and other species began to show signs of contamination.$b$bIt has progressed to the point where they damage nearly everything they come in contact with. They're amplifying the damage being done by the crystal shards scattered by the Exodar's crash. We have no choice but to begin culling their population in the lands north of Blood Watch."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '當我們第一次碰到翼蛾時，他們沒有什麼突變的跡象。隨著汙染日益嚴重，飛蛾和其他物種便開始出現受汙染的跡象。$b$b現在已經進展到和他們接觸的所有生物幾乎都遭到損害了。他們正在擴大艾克索達失事後散落的水晶裂片所造成的傷害。我們別無選擇只能開始削減他們在血色守望北邊的數量。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9647;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "馬特龐野生蘑菇", Title AC enUS : "Mac'Aree Mushroom Menagerie" ; Wowhead enUS : "Maatparm Mushroom Menagerie",  OLD Objectives : "血色守望的馬特龐要1個水生惡菌菇，1個血色蘑菇，1個有害的孢子群，和1個魔錐果真菌。", Objectives AC enUS : "Jessera of Mac'Aree at Blood Watch wants 1 Aquatic Stinkhorn, 1 Blood Mushroom, 1 Ruinous Polyspore, and 1 Fel Cone Fungus." ; Wowhead enUS : "Maatparm at Blood Watch wants 1 Aquatic Stinkhorn, 1 Blood Mushroom, 1 Ruinous Polyspore, and 1 Fel Cone Fungus.",  OLD Details : "你知道採集蘑菇比消耗蘑菇更危險嗎?蘑菇採收者置身於許多未知 - 不包括潛在 - 的野生生物危機中。$B$B如果沒有危險會是什麼樣子?我需要收集蘑菇。你會在這些未探勘的荒野中找到四個不同的品種:水生惡菌菇，血色蘑菇，有害的孢子群，和魔錐果真菌。它們都是血謎島上獨特的品種。把它們帶來給我。", Details AC enUS : "Did you know mushroom hunting is far more dangerous than mushroom consumption? Mushroom hunters expose themselves to many unknowns - not including potential wildlife dangers!$B$BWhat would life be without a little danger? I am in need of mushrooms for my collection. Scattered throughout these unexplored wilds you will find four different types: An aquatic stinkhorn, a blood mushroom, a ruinous polyspore, and a fel cone fungus. They are each unique to various regions in Bloodmyst. Bring them to me." ; Wowhead enUS : "Did you know mushroom hunting is far more dangerous than mushroom consumption? Mushroom hunters expose themselves to many unknowns - not including potential wildlife dangers!$b$bWhat would life be without a little danger? I am in need of mushrooms for my collection. Scattered throughout these unexplored wilds you will find four different types: An aquatic stinkhorn, a blood mushroom, a ruinous polyspore, and a fel cone fungus. They are each unique to various regions in Bloodmyst. Bring them to me."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '麥克艾瑞野生蘑菇', `Objectives` = '血色守望的潔希拉·麥克艾瑞要1個水生惡菌菇，1個血色蘑菇，1個有害的孢子群，和1個魔錐果真菌。', `Details` = '你知道採集蘑菇比消耗蘑菇更危險嗎?蘑菇採收者置身於許多未知 - 不包括潛在 - 的野生生物危機中。$b$b如果沒有危險會是什麼樣子?我需要收集蘑菇。你會在這些未探勘的荒野中找到四個不同的品種:水生惡菌菇，血色蘑菇，有害的孢子群，和魔錐果真菌。它們都是血謎島上獨特的品種。把它們帶來給我。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9648;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "血色守望的馬特龐要2個伊瑟拉之淚。", Objectives AC enUS : "Jessera of Mac'Aree at Blood Watch wants 2 Ysera's Tears." ; Wowhead enUS : "Maatparm at Blood Watch wants 2 Ysera's Tears.",  OLD Details : "再見到你真好，$n!你在完成我給你的最後一個任務時真是異常地有效率。或許你對另一個任務有興趣?$B$B東北方有個龍痕島，一種名罕見蘑菇生長在那邊，伊瑟拉之淚 - 以住在那座島上的綠龍軍團為名。我只需要一個蘑菇小樣本，但我一定要警告你島上的居民不歡迎訪客。步步為營。", Details AC enUS : "Good to see you again, $N! You were exceptionally efficient in completing the last task that I offered you. Perhaps you would be interested in another?$B$BTo the northeast lies Wyrmscar Island, home to a rare species of mushroom known as Ysera's tear - named after the green dragonlings that inhabit the island. I only require a small sampling of the mushroom, but I must warn you that the denizens of the island do not welcome visitors. Tread carefully.$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Good to see you again, $n! You were exceptionally efficient in completing the last task that I offered you. Perhaps you would be interested in another?$b$bTo the northeast lies Wyrmscar Island, home to a rare species of mushroom known as Ysera's tear - named after the green dragonlings that inhabit the island. I only require a small sampling of the mushroom, but I must warn you that the denizens of the island do not welcome visitors. Tread carefully."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '血色守望的潔希拉·麥克艾瑞要2個伊瑟拉之淚。', `Details` = '再見到你真好，$n!你在完成我給你的最後一個任務時真是異常地有效率。或許你對另一個任務有興趣?$b$b東北方有個龍痕島，一種名罕見蘑菇生長在那邊，伊瑟拉之淚 - 以住在那座島上的綠龍軍團為名。我只需要一個蘑菇小樣本，但我一定要警告你島上的居民不歡迎訪客。步步為營。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9649;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "凱索十字路的凱索要你去警告靜松要塞的大酋長靜松，藍色守望的主教米奈奧斯，和奧迪席斯平臺的艦隊司令‧奧迪席斯關於血精靈即將發動的攻擊。完成任務後回到凱索那裡。你只有15分鐘。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kessel at Kessel's Crossing wants you to warn High Chief Stillpine at Stillpine Hold, Exarch Menelaous at Azure Watch and Admiral Odesyus at Odesyus' Landing of the imminent blood elf invasion. Return to Kessel when you complete this task. You have 15 minutes. (Be sure to keep it out of water.)" ; Wowhead enUS : "Kessel at Kessel's Crossing wants you to warn High Chief Stillpine at Stillpine Hold, Exarch Menelaous at Azure Watch and Admiral Odesyus at Odesyus' Landing of the imminent blood elf invasion. Return to Kessel when you complete this task. You have 15 minutes. (Be sure to keep it out of water.)",  OLD Details : "你來的正好，$n。這區域的血精靈活動在過去一個禮拜已經加倍了。我們的密探告訴我們自稱為太陽之鷹的血精靈計畫要對藍謎島發動攻擊。我要你去警告一下我們的盟友和同伴。$B$B警告靜松要塞的大酋長靜松，藍色守望的主教米奈奧斯，和奧迪席斯平臺的艦隊司令‧奧迪席斯。$B$B時間緊迫所以我借你我的伊萊克。記得不能讓它碰到水。", Details AC enUS : "You're just in time, $N. Blood elf activity in this area has doubled in the past week. Our agents have informed us that the blood elves that call themselves Sunhawks plan to launch an offensive upon Azuremyst soon. I need you to get a warning out to our allies and compatriots.$B$BWarn High Chief Stillpine at Stillpine Hold, Exarch Menelaous at Azure Watch and Admiral Odesyus at Odesyus' Landing.$B$BTime is of the essence so I am lending you my elekk. Be sure to keep it out of water." ; Wowhead enUS : "You're just in time, $n. Blood elf activity in this area has doubled in the past week. Our agents have informed us that the blood elves that call themselves Sunhawks plan to launch an offensive upon Azuremyst soon. I need you to get a warning out to our allies and compatriots.$b$bWarn High Chief Stillpine at Stillpine Hold, Exarch Menelaous at Azure Watch and Admiral Odesyus at Odesyus' Landing.$b$bTime is of the essence so I am lending you my elekk. Be sure to keep it out of water.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "警告大酋長靜松", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "High Chief Stillpine Warned" ; Wowhead enUS : "High Chief Stillpine Warned",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "警告主教米奈奧斯", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "Exarch Menelaous Warned" ; Wowhead enUS : "Exarch Menelaous Warned"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '凱索十字路的凱索要你去警告靜松要塞的大酋長靜松，藍色守望的主教米奈奧斯，和奧迪席斯平臺的艦隊司令·奧迪席斯關於血精靈即將發動的攻擊。完成任務後回到凱索那裡。你只有15分鐘。', `Details` = '你來的正好，$n。這區域的血精靈活動在過去一個禮拜已經加倍了。我們的密探告訴我們自稱為太陽之鷹的血精靈計畫要對藍謎島發動攻擊。我要你去警告一下我們的盟友和同伴。$b$b警告靜松要塞的大酋長靜松，藍色守望的主教米奈奧斯，和奧迪席斯平臺的艦隊司令·奧迪席斯。$b$b時間緊迫所以我借你我的伊萊克。記得不能讓它碰到水。', `Objectivetext1` = '已警告大酋長靜松', `Objectivetext2` = '已警告主教米奈奧斯', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9663;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "佔領東瘟疫之地的皇冠哨塔，東牆之塔，北地哨塔和病木林哨塔，再回到聖光之願禮拜堂的密使·戈莫克那裡。", Objectives AC enUS : "Capture Crown Guard Tower, Eastwall Tower, Northpass Tower and Plaguewood Tower in the Eastern Plaguelands, then return to Emmisary Gormok at Light's Hope Chapel." ; Wowhead enUS : "Capture Crown Guard Tower, Eastwall Tower, Northpass Tower and Plaguewood Tower in the Eastern Plaguelands, then return to Emmisary Gormok at Light's Hope Chapel.",  OLD Details : "被遺忘者密探揭發了聯盟的秘密計畫，他們要在東瘟疫之地被廢棄的哨塔上建立新基地。$B$B現在要緊的是我們不能讓他們在東部邊界建立重要的據點，所以我們一定要趕走這批聯盟入侵者。我們目前的計畫是把他們可能已攻佔的所有哨塔中趕走，並佔據控制那些哨塔不受進一步的攻擊。", Details AC enUS : "Agents of the Forsaken uncovered an Alliance plot to establish new bases here in the Eastern Plaguelands, at abandoned towers throughout the area.$b$bIt is imperative that we not allow them to establish a significant presence on our eastern borders, and so we must stave off this Alliance incursion. Our current plans are to drive them out of any towers they may have already seized, and occupy those that we have under our control against further attacks." ; Wowhead enUS : "Agents of the Forsaken uncovered an Alliance plot to establish new bases here in the Eastern Plaguelands, at abandoned towers throughout the area.$b$bIt is imperative that we not allow them to establish a significant presence on our eastern borders, and so we must stave off this Alliance incursion. Our current plans are to drive them out of any towers they may have already seized, and occupy those that we have under our control against further attacks.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "奪得皇冠哨塔", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Capture Crown Guard Tower" ; Wowhead enUS : "Capture Crown Guard Tower",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "奪得東牆之塔", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "Capture Eastwall Tower" ; Wowhead enUS : "Capture Eastwall Tower"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '佔領東瘟疫之地的皇冠哨塔，東牆之塔，北地哨塔和病木林哨塔，再回到聖光之願禮拜堂的密使·戈馬克那裡。', `Details` = '被遺忘者密探揭發了聯盟的秘密計畫，他們要在東瘟疫之地被廢棄的哨塔上建立新基地。$b$b現在要緊的是我們不能讓他們在東部邊界建立重要的據點，所以我們一定要趕走這批聯盟入侵者。我們目前的計畫是把他們可能已攻佔的所有哨塔中趕走，並佔據控制那些哨塔不受進一步的攻擊。', `Objectivetext1` = '已奪得皇冠哨塔', `Objectivetext2` = '已奪得東牆之塔', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9665;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "血謎島，凱索十字路的凱索要你殺了怒鱗巢穴的希司領主，並將德萊尼旌旗插入他的屍體。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kessel at Kessel's Crossing on Bloodmyst Isle wants you to kill Lord Xiz at Wrathscale Lair and drive the Draenei Banner through his dead body." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kessel at Kessel's Crossing on Bloodmyst Isle wants you to kill Lord Xiz at Wrathscale Lair and drive the Draenei Banner through his dead body.",  OLD Details : "你有看過毒蛇人嗎?就是自稱納迦的那些人?$B$B<凱索吐了一口口水。>$B$B他們竟敢在三天前趁著夜色的掩護向這營地進軍。你相信那些原始野獸的膽大妄為嗎?$B$B我要你送一個訊息給他們的領導者，$n。東北方的怒鱗巢穴是希司領主的家。找到他，殺了他，把這支旌旗插在他的屍體上。$B$B讓他們知道每當看見我們的旌旗，就是該害怕的時候!", Details AC enUS : "Have you seen the serpent men? The ones that call themselves naga?$B$B<Kessel spits.>$B$BThey dared make an advance upon this camp under cover of darkness only three nights ago. Can you believe the audacity of those primitive beasts?$B$BI need you to deliver a message to their leadership, $N. To the northeast is Wrathscale Lair, home to Lord Xiz. Find him, slay him where he stands and drive this banner through his corpse.$B$BLet them know fear whenever they should see our standard!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Have you seen the serpent men? The ones that call themselves naga?$b$b<Kessel spits.>$b$bThey dared make an advance upon this camp under cover of darkness only three nights ago. Can you believe the audacity of those primitive beasts?$b$bI need you to deliver a message to their leadership, $n. To the northeast is Wrathscale Lair, home to Lord Xiz. Find him, slay him where he stands and drive this banner through his corpse.$b$bLet them know fear whenever they should see our standard!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Lord Xiz slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '血謎島，凱索十字路的凱索要你殺了怒鱗巢穴的希司領主，並將德萊尼旗幟插入他的屍體。', `Details` = '你有看過毒蛇人嗎?就是自稱納迦的那些人?$b$b<凱索吐了一口口水。>$b$b他們竟敢在三天前趁著夜色的掩護向這營地進軍。你相信那些原始野獸的膽大妄為嗎?$b$b我要你送一個訊息給他們的領導者，$n。東北方的怒鱗巢穴是希司領主的家。找到他，殺了他，把這支旗幟插在他的屍體上。$b$b讓他們知道每當看見我們的軍旗，就是該害怕的時候!', `Objectivetext1` = '希司領主 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9666;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "釋放囚禁在籠子裡的靜松公主後與血色守望的靜松大使法薩布談談。$B$B你得殺掉大酋長鬚肢才能得到籠子的鑰匙。", Objectives AC enUS : "Release Princess Stillpine from her cage and then speak with Stillpine Ambassador Frasaboo at Blood Watch.$B$BYou must kill High Chief Bristlelimb for the key that opens the cage." ; Wowhead enUS : "Release Princess Stillpine from her cage and then speak with Stillpine Ambassador Olorg at Blood Watch.$b$bYou must kill High Chief Bristlelimb for the key that opens the cage.",  OLD Details : "救救我，$n!鬚肢熊怪把我抓來並且打算將我獻祭給他們骯髒的神祇!$B$B大酋長鬚肢握有開啟籠子的鑰匙。要逼他現身，你必須殺死邪惡的鬚肢熊怪，位置就在這座營地西邊的兩座鬚肢熊怪營地。如果你殺了夠多熊怪，他就會出來報仇!當他出現的時候，殺了他並拿到鑰匙!$B$B如果你救了我，我的父親會重重答謝你的!", Details AC enUS : "Help me, $N! The Bristlelimb captured me and are planning to sacrifice me to their foul gods!$B$BHigh Chief Bristlelimb holds the key that opens the cage. To force him to appear, you must slaughter the evil Bristlelimb furbolgs that inhabit the enclave, just two camps to the west of this camp. If you kill enough of them, he will surely come for vengeance! When he shows up, kill him and get the key!$B$BMy father will richly reward you if you can save me!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Help me, $n! The Bristlelimb captured me and are planning to sacrifice me to their foul gods!$b$bHigh Chief Bristlelimb holds the key that opens the cage. To force him to appear, you must slaughter the evil Bristlelimb furbolgs that inhabit the enclave, just two camps to the west of this camp. If you kill enough of them, he will surely come for vengeance! When he shows up, kill him and get the key!$b$bMy father will richly reward you if you can save me!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "拯救靜松公主", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Princess Stillpine Saved" ; Wowhead enUS : "Princess Stillpine Saved"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '釋放囚禁在籠子裡的靜松公主後與血色守望的靜松大使歐洛格談談。$b$b你得殺掉大酋長鬚肢才能得到籠子的鑰匙。', `Details` = '救救我，$n!鬚肢熊怪把我抓來並且打算將我獻祭給他們骯髒的神祇!$b$b大酋長鬚肢握有開啟籠子的鑰匙。要逼他現身，你必須殺死邪惡的鬚肢熊怪，位置就在這座營地西邊的兩座鬚肢熊怪營地。如果你殺了夠多熊怪，他就會出來報仇!當他出現的時候，殺了他並拿到鑰匙!$b$b如果你救了我，我的父親會重重答謝你的!', `Objectivetext1` = '已拯救靜松公主', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9667;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "一個阿古斯之手的士兵代表了很多意義:服從，勇敢，智慧，和最重要的，高尚。你或許還沒展現出這些特質，$c。$B$B如果你還對加入阿古斯之手有興趣，就向血色守望的主教阿德密特斯回報吧。他和他的部屬會進一步的以德萊尼士兵的方式訓練你。$B$B還有記住，$n:高尚的人不會永遠都做高尚的事，有時候他們身不由己。$B$B沿著這條路往北走你就可以找到血色守望。", Details AC enUS : "A Hand of Argus soldier is many things: Obedient, brave, intelligent, and above all, honorable. You may yet exhibit some of these traits, $c.$B$BReport to Exarch Admetius at Blood Watch if you are still interested in joining the Hand. He and his subordinates will further train you in the ways of the draenei soldier.$B$BAnd remember this, $N: Honorable people do not always perform honorably. Sometimes they cannot.$B$BYou will find Blood Watch just up this road, to the north." ; Wowhead enUS : "A Hand of Argus soldier is many things: Obedient, brave, intelligent, and above all, honorable. You may yet exhibit some of these traits, $c.$b$bReport to Exarch Admetius at Blood Watch if you are still interested in joining the Hand. He and his subordinates will further train you in the ways of the draenei soldier.$b$bAnd remember this, $n: Honorable people do not always perform honorably. Sometimes they cannot.$b$bYou will find Blood Watch just up this road, to the north."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '一個阿古斯之手的士兵代表了很多意義:服從，勇敢，智慧，和最重要的，高尚。你或許還沒展現出這些特質，$c。$b$b如果你還對加入阿古斯之手有興趣，就向血色守望的主教阿德密特斯回報吧。他和他的部屬會進一步的以德萊尼士兵的方式訓練你。$b$b還有記住，$n:高尚的人不會永遠都做高尚的事，有時候他們身不由己。$b$b沿著這條路往北走你就可以找到血色守望。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9668;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "大概一個禮拜前，當我和我的研究小組在血謎島西邊的荒野探勘時，遭到嗜血的蜘蛛攻擊。水晶污染的效果非常明顯，因為這些蜘蛛體型變得既龐大又極具攻擊性。$B$B我設法逃了出來，但我的組員就沒這麼幸運。我們不能讓同樣的命運降臨在其他人身上。去西邊的琥珀網小徑殺死蜘蛛和他們的女王，沙拉克。", Details AC enUS : "About a week ago, my research team and I were out exploring the western wilds of Bloodmyst when we were attacked by bloodthirsty spiders. The effect of the crystal contamination was clearly evident as these spiders were massive and extremely aggressive.$B$BI managed to escape but my team wasn't so lucky. We must not let the same fate befall others. Go west to the Amberweb Pass and destroy the spiders and their matriarch, Zarakh." ; Wowhead enUS : "About a week ago, my research team and I were out exploring the western wilds of Bloodmyst when we were attacked by bloodthirsty spiders. The effect of the crystal contamination was clearly evident as these spiders were massive and extremely aggressive.$b$bI managed to escape but my team wasn't so lucky. We must not let the same fate befall others. Go west to the Amberweb Pass and destroy the spiders and their matriarch, Zarakh."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '大概一個禮拜前，當我和我的研究小組在血謎島西邊的荒野探勘時，遭到嗜血的蜘蛛攻擊。水晶汙染的效果非常明顯，因為這些蜘蛛體型變得既龐大又極具攻擊性。$b$b我設法逃了出來，但我的組員就沒這麼幸運。我們不能讓同樣的命運降臨在其他人身上。去西邊的琥珀網小徑殺死蜘蛛和他們的女王，沙拉克。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9669;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "他們還活著!或許吧...", Title AC enUS : "They're Alive! Maybe..." ; Wowhead enUS : "They're Alive! Maybe...",  OLD Details : "那真是一場血戰啊，$n。我們被一大群蜘蛛給突襲。他們的祖先用不可思議的速度向我們蜂擁而上並把我們包在繭裡。$B$B在我們被纏住後，她開始在我們附近產卵。我們就要成為她幼蟲的食物了!是食物!$B$B我設法逃了出來，但我沒辦法丟下其他人不管。目前為止我都無法成功接近那裡。你可以伸出援手嗎?$B$B摧毀那些繭!希望我們的隊員還有人活著!", Details AC enUS : "It was a bloody mess, $N. We were ambushed by a large pack of these spiders. Their progenitor descended upon us with incredible speed and wrapped us up in cocoons.$B$BAfter we were webbed, she began to lay eggs near us. We were to be food for her young! FOOD!$B$BI managed to cut my way out and escape but I will not leave the others behind. So far I've been unsuccessful in nearing the pass. Would you lend a hand?$B$BDestroy those cocoons! Hopefully some of our team is still alive!$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "It was a bloody mess, $n. We were ambushed by a large pack of these spiders. Their progenitor descended upon us with incredible speed and wrapped us up in cocoons.$b$bAfter we were webbed, she began to lay eggs near us. We were to be food for her young! FOOD!$b$bI managed to cut my way out and escape but I will not leave the others behind. So far I've been unsuccessful in nearing the pass. Would you lend a hand?$b$bDestroy those cocoons! Hopefully some of our team is still alive!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "釋放遠征隊研究員", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Expedition Researcher Freed" ; Wowhead enUS : "Expedition Researcher Freed"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '他們還活著!或許吧……', `Details` = '那真是一場血戰啊，$n。我們被一大群蜘蛛給突襲。他們的祖先用不可思議的速度向我們蜂擁而上並把我們包在繭裡。$b$b在我們被纏住後，她開始在我們附近產卵。我們就要成為她幼蟲的食物了!是食物!$b$b我設法逃了出來，但我沒辦法丟下其他人不管。目前為止我都無法成功接近那裡。你可以伸出援手嗎?$b$b摧毀那些繭!希望我們的隊員還有人活著!', `Objectivetext1` = '已釋放遠征隊研究員', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9670;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "艦隊司令‧奧迪席斯要你找到隊長艾德華‧漢尼斯並和他談談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Admiral Odesyus has asked that you find and speak with Captain Edward Hanes." ; Wowhead enUS : "Admiral Odesyus has asked that you find and speak with Captain Edward Hanes.",  OLD Details : "親愛的朋友，$B$B我顫抖著手寫下這封信。我希望它能及時送到你手中。$B$B昨天夜裡，「失望」號的船長，艾德華‧漢尼斯出現在我帳篷前面。和20年前因壞血病而死的艾德華‧漢尼斯一模一樣。$B$B這個亡魂告訴我一個讓我的心不停顫抖的故事。一個我要你聽的故事和一個我要你完成的任務。你願意接受嗎?你願意去基地東北方的龍痕島找艾德華嗎?$B$B艦隊司令‧奧迪席斯，$B$B敬上", Details AC enUS : "Dear friend,$B$BMy hand trembles as I ink this letter. I pray that it reaches you in time.$B$BLast night, Edward Hanes, captain of the ship 'Lost Hope', appeared before me in my tent. The same Edward Hanes that died of scurvy 20 years ago.$B$BThis apparition told me a tale that made my heart tremble. A tale that I need you to hear and a mission that I need you to accomplish. Will you do it? Will you seek out Edward on Wyrmscar Island, northeast of your base?$B$BRegards,$B$BAdmiral Odesyus$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Dear friend,$b$bMy hand trembles as I ink this letter. I pray that it reaches you in time.$b$bLast night, Edward Hanes, captain of the ship 'Lost Hope', appeared before me in my tent. The same Edward Hanes that died of scurvy 20 years ago.$b$bThis apparition told me a tale that made my heart tremble. A tale that I need you to hear and a mission that I need you to accomplish. Will you do it? Will you seek out Edward on Wyrmscar Island, northeast of your base?$b$bRegards,$b$bAdmiral Odesyus"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '艦隊司令·奧迪席斯要你找到隊長艾德華·漢尼斯並和他談談。', `Details` = '親愛的朋友，$b$b我顫抖著手寫下這封信。我希望它能及時送到你手中。$b$b昨天夜裡，「失望」號的船長，艾德華·漢尼斯出現在我帳篷前面。和20年前因壞血病而死的艾德華·漢尼斯一模一樣。$b$b這個亡魂告訴我一個讓我的心不停顫抖的故事。一個我要你聽的故事和一個我要你完成的任務。你願意接受嗎?你願意去基地東北方的龍痕島找艾德華嗎?$b$b艦隊司令·奧迪席斯，$b$b敬上', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9672;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "龍痕島的隊長艾德華‧漢尼斯要你殺死10個血咒納迦。", Objectives AC enUS : "Captain Edward Hanes on Wyrmscar Island wants you to kill 10 Bloodcursed Naga.$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Captain Edward Hanes on Wyrmscar Island wants you to kill 10 Bloodcursed Naga.",  OLD Details : "他們說當世界分裂的時候，這座島是最悲情的。數千條夜精靈性命在這裡犧牲而被世人遺忘，原本屬於夜精靈的土地如今興起了為仇恨而生的可怕生物 - 納迦。$B$B他們效忠於他們瘋狂的女王艾薩拉，誓要殺光任何膽敢穿越他們海洋的人。這種情形將會持續數千年，但是現在將要改變。$B$B任務的第一個命令就是解決掉沙洲的血咒納迦。", Details AC enUS : "They say when the world was sundered, this land cried the loudest. It was here that thousands of night elves faded into oblivion and in their place rose terrible creatures of hate - the naga.$B$BObedient to their twisted queen, Azshara, they would destroy all that would dare pass through their sea. It would remain this way for thousands of years - until now.$B$BThe first order of business is to remove the bloodcursed naga from the reef." ; Wowhead enUS : "They say when the world was sundered, this land cried the loudest. It was here that thousands of night elves faded into oblivion and in their place rose terrible creatures of hate - the naga.$b$bObedient to their twisted queen, Azshara, they would destroy all that would dare pass through their sea. It would remain this way for thousands of years - until now.$b$bThe first order of business is to remove the bloodcursed naga from the reef."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '龍痕島的隊長艾德華·漢尼斯要你殺死10個血咒納迦。', `Details` = '他們說當世界分裂的時候，這座島是最悲情的。數千條夜精靈性命在這裡犧牲而被世人遺忘，原本屬於夜精靈的土地如今興起了為仇恨而生的可怕生物 - 納迦。$b$b他們效忠於他們瘋狂的女王艾薩拉，誓要殺光任何膽敢穿越他們海洋的人。這種情形將會持續數千年，但是現在將要改變。$b$b任務的第一個命令就是解決掉沙洲的血咒納迦。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9674;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "與逐日島太陽之塔內的聖騎士訓練師耶泰尼斯·射日者談一談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Jesthenis Sunstriker - the Paladin class trainer - inside the Sunspire on Sunstrider Isle." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Jesthenis Sunstriker - the Paladin class trainer - inside the Sunspire on Sunstrider Isle.",  OLD Details : "既然你已經在你所選擇的職業上有所進步了，我想你一定會希望能夠獲得來自職業訓練師的更多指導。逐日島上有一位名叫耶泰尼斯·射日者的聖騎士訓練師。跟他談談，看看能學到什麼新技能。當然，你得付點學費。$B$B耶泰尼斯跟逐日島其它訓練師都在太陽之塔的下層。", Details AC enUS : "As you advance within your class, you will want to take advantage of the training that your class trainer can provide you.  For young paladins here on Sunstrider Isle, your trainer is Jesthenis Sunstriker. Speak with Jesthenis and see what training he has available for you.  The things he will teach do have a cost, so bring some coin with you.$B$BYour trainer - as with all the trainers on Sunstrider Isle - is inside the Sunspire on the lower level." ; Wowhead enUS : "As you advance within your class, you will want to take advantage of the training that your class trainer can provide you. For young paladins here on Sunstrider Isle, your trainer is Jesthenis Sunstriker. Speak with Jesthenis and see what training he has available for you. The things he will teach do have a cost, so bring some coin with you.$b$bYour trainer - as with all the trainers on Sunstrider Isle - is inside the Sunspire on the lower level."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '和傑斯賽尼斯·擊日者 - 聖騎士職業訓練師 - 談談，他就在逐日者之島的日尖塔裡。', `Details` = '當你在職業中不斷進步，你會想從職業訓練師所能提供你的訓練中獲得助益。對逐日者之島這裡的年輕聖騎士而言，你們的訓練師是傑斯賽尼斯·擊日者。和傑斯賽尼斯談談，看他能提供什麼訓練給你。他的訓練需要收費，所以帶一些錢在身上。$b$b你的訓練師 - 和逐日者之島上所有的訓練師一樣 - 都在日尖塔的較低層。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9676;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "絕望者...", Title AC enUS : "The Hopeless Ones..." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Hopeless Ones...",  OLD Objectives : "龍痕島的隊長艾德華‧漢尼斯要你帶回4個血咒靈魂。", Objectives AC enUS : "Captain Edward Hanes on Wyrmscar Island wants you to recover 4 Bloodcursed Souls." ; Wowhead enUS : "Captain Edward Hanes on Wyrmscar Island wants you to recover 4 Bloodcursed Souls.",  OLD Details : "在沙洲的突出處，比你發現血咒納迦再深入一點的地方，可以找到絕望者:血咒航海者，那些被血咒抓去的鬼魂。$B$B我現在要你做的事，讓人感到不忍心...但他們一定要被消滅並把他們被詛咒的軀殼帶回來給我。$B$B他們的靈魂一定要得到安息。等你完成了我要求的事情再回來找我，我就會給你最後的一個任務。", Details AC enUS : "On a ledge of the reef, deeper than where you found the bloodcursed naga, you will find the hopeless ones: The bloodcursed voyagers, ghosts of those taken by the bloodcurse.$B$BIt is regrettable, what I ask of you now... but they must be destroyed and their cursed shells brought back to me.$B$BTheir souls must be put to rest. Return to me when you have done as asked and I shall give you one final task." ; Wowhead enUS : "On a ledge of the reef, deeper than where you found the bloodcursed naga, you will find the hopeless ones: The bloodcursed voyagers, ghosts of those taken by the bloodcurse.$b$bIt is regrettable, what I ask of you now... but they must be destroyed and their cursed shells brought back to me.$b$bTheir souls must be put to rest. Return to me when you have done as asked and I shall give you one final task."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '絕望者……', `Objectives` = '龍痕島的隊長艾德華·漢尼斯要你帶回4個血咒靈魂。', `Details` = '在沙洲的突出處，比你發現血咒納迦再深入一點的地方，可以找到絕望者:血咒航海者，那些被血咒抓去的鬼魂。$b$b我現在要你做的事，讓人感到不忍心……但他們一定要被消滅並把他們被詛咒的軀殼帶回來給我。$b$b他們的靈魂一定要得到安息。等你完成了我要求的事情再回來找我，我就會給你最後的一個任務。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9682;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "龍痕島的隊長艾德華‧漢尼斯要你摧毀艾薩拉女王雕像並殺了血咒的阿托夫。", Objectives AC enUS : "Captain Edward Hanes on Wyrmscar Island wants you to destroy the Statue of Queen Azshara and kill Atoph the Bloodcursed." ; Wowhead enUS : "Captain Edward Hanes on Wyrmscar Island wants you to destroy the Statue of Queen Azshara and kill Atoph the Bloodcursed.",  OLD Details : "你會在南方找到血咒島。在島的頂端你會找到一座獻給摯愛的納迦女王，艾薩拉的神殿。摧毀那個雕像 - 把它燒毀!這一定會引起阿托夫，血咒領導者的憤怒。$B$B殺了阿托夫再回來找我!", Details AC enUS : "To the south you will find Bloodcurse Isle. Atop the island you will find a shrine dedicated to the beloved queen of the naga, Azshara. Destroy the statue - burn it in effigy! This will surely draw the ire of Atoph, the Bloodcursed leader.$B$BSlay Atoph and return to me!" ; Wowhead enUS : "To the south you will find Bloodcurse Isle. Atop the island you will find a shrine dedicated to the beloved queen of the naga, Azshara. Destroy the statue - burn it in effigy! This will surely draw the ire of Atoph, the Bloodcursed leader.$b$bSlay Atoph and return to me!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Atoph the Bloodcursed slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '龍痕島的隊長艾德華·漢尼斯要你摧毀艾薩拉女王雕像並殺了血咒的阿托夫。', `Details` = '你會在南方找到血咒島。在島的頂端你會找到一座獻給摯愛的納迦女王，艾薩拉的神殿。摧毀那個雕像 - 把它燒毀!這一定會引起阿托夫，血咒領導者的憤怒。$b$b殺了阿托夫再回來找我!', `Objectivetext1` = '血咒的阿托夫 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9683;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "不久以前，區域裡曾經平靜的梟獸出現在島的海岸。他們會一個接一個來偷取陣亡的龍骨。我不知道是什麼讓這些生物這樣苦惱，或是他們為什麼會想要死者的骨頭，但那些後裔的靈魂因為這樣悖理逆天的行為無法安息。$B$B到西邊去，穿過赤紅地帶，你會找到怒羽山脊。進入梟獸營地取回被偷走的龍骨。", Details AC enUS : "Not long ago, the once tranquil owlkin of the region appeared on the shores of this island. One by one they would come to steal the bones of the fallen dragons. I do not know what would cause these creatures such distress or why they would want the bones of the deceased, but the spirits of the brood have grown restless due to this sacrilege.$B$BTo the west, across the Crimson Reach, you will find Ragefeather Ridge. Venture to the owlkin encampments and recover the pilfered dragon bones." ; Wowhead enUS : "Not long ago, the once tranquil owlkin of the region appeared on the shores of this island. One by one they would come to steal the bones of the fallen dragons. I do not know what would cause these creatures such distress or why they would want the bones of the deceased, but the spirits of the brood have grown restless due to this sacrilege.$b$bTo the west, across the Crimson Reach, you will find Ragefeather Ridge. Venture to the owlkin encampments and recover the pilfered dragon bones."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '不久以前，區域裡曾經平靜的梟獸出現在島的海岸。他們會一個接一個來偷取陣亡的龍骨。我不知道是什麼讓這些生物這樣苦惱，或是他們為什麼會想要死者的骨頭，但那些後裔的靈魂因為這樣悖理逆天的行為無法安息。$b$b到西邊去，穿過赤紅地帶，你會找到怒羽山脊。進入梟獸營地取回被偷走的龍骨。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9687;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你在這島上看到的幼龍都是綠龍軍團被激怒的靈魂。就像我一樣，牠們都被束縛在這塊土地上，無法回到牠們在夢境之國的最後安息之地。$B$B取得亡者的骨頭會暫時讓牠們平息下來，但你一定要採取進一步的行動。$B$B解放牠們永恆的束縛。在完成之前我不能離開這裡。牠們一定要被釋放!", Details AC enUS : "The whelps that you see on this island are the agitated spirits of the green dragonflight. Like me, they are bound to the land, unable to ascend to their final resting place in the Dream.$B$BRecovering the bones of the fallen has settled them somewhat but you must take further action.$B$BDestroy their ethereal manifestations. I cannot leave this place until it is done. They must be released!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The whelps that you see on this island are the agitated spirits of the green dragonflight. Like me, they are bound to the land, unable to ascend to their final resting place in the Dream.$b$bRecovering the bones of the fallen has settled them somewhat but you must take further action.$b$bDestroy their ethereal manifestations. I cannot leave this place until it is done. They must be released!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你在這島上看到的幼龍都是綠龍軍團被激怒的靈魂。就像我一樣，他們都被束縛在這塊土地上，無法回到他們在夢境之國的最後安息之地。$b$b取得亡者的骨頭會暫時讓他們平息下來，但你一定要採取進一步的行動。$b$b解放他們永恆的束縛。在完成之前我不能離開這裡。他們一定要被釋放!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9688;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "許多黑龍軍團的成員都在攻擊中被殺了。這些亡魂中有一名死亡之翼的副官，他的靈魂現在還出沒在這個地方。如果你望著天空，你會看見他的鬼靈面容在空中環繞。他的仇恨心太重以致於連死後都還心懷憤恨。$B$B帶著你先前為我收集的骨頭到這座島的山頂上，將它們放在永不熄滅的柴堆裡。此舉會發出一種訊息使瑞索默降下來查看究竟。到時候就殺死他的不死身驅。", Details AC enUS : "Many of the black dragonflight were slain during the attacks. One of them, a lieutenant of Deathwing himself, still haunts this place. If you look to the heavens, you can see his spectral countenance circling the skies. His hatred is so great that he remains even in death.$B$BTake the bones that you gathered for me earlier to the top of the mountain on this island and place them in the ever-burning pyre. This act should signal Razormaw to descend. When he does, slay his undead form." ; Wowhead enUS : "Many of the black dragonflight were slain during the attacks. One of them, a lieutenant of Deathwing himself, still haunts this place. If you look to the heavens, you can see his spectral countenance circling the skies. His hatred is so great that he remains even in death.$b$bTake the bones that you gathered for me earlier to the top of the mountain on this island and place them in the ever-burning pyre. This act should signal Razormaw to descend. When he does, slay his undead form.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Razormaw slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '許多黑龍軍團的成員都在攻擊中被殺了。這些亡魂中有一名死亡之翼的副官，他的靈魂現在還出沒在這個地方。如果你望著天空，你會看見他的鬼靈面容在空中環繞。他的仇恨心太重以致於連死後都還心懷憤恨。$b$b帶著你先前為我收集的骨頭到這座島的山頂上，將它們放在永不熄滅的柴堆裡。此舉會發出一種訊息使瑞索默降下來查看究竟。到時候就殺死他的不死身驅。', `Objectivetext1` = '瑞索默 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9689;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "阿古斯對你而言有什麼意義，$n？你大概和許多德萊尼一樣不知道或不記得我們的家園。我們在那裡和曼那瑞分開：那是薩格拉斯『賦予』我們一族的扭曲惡魔形態，或是如他們所自稱的，埃雷達爾。$B$B埃雷達爾…這個字曾經有它的意義。$B$B<阿德密特斯好像在品嚐這個字一樣。>$B$B真噁心。$B$B不要再浪費時間了。找到復仇者波羅斯展開你的訓練。", Details AC enUS : "What does Argus mean to you, $N? Many draenei probably do not know or remember our home planet. It is there that we split from the man'ari: the twisted demonic reflections of ourselves that were 'gifted' by Sargeras. Or as they call themselves, eredar.$B$BEredar... this word once held meaning.$B$B<Admetius smacks his lips as if to taste the word.>$B$BDisgusting.$B$BLet us not waste anymore time. Find Vindicator Boros to begin your training." ; Wowhead enUS : "What does Argus mean to you, $n? Many draenei probably do not know or remember our home planet. It is there that we split from the man'ari: the twisted demonic reflections of ourselves that were 'gifted' by Sargeras. Or as they call themselves, eredar.$b$bEredar... this word once held meaning.$b$b<Admetius smacks his lips as if to taste the word.>$b$bDisgusting.$b$bLet us not waste anymore time. Find Vindicator Boros to begin your training."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '阿古斯對你而言有什麼意義，$n?你大概和許多德萊尼一樣不知道或不記得我們的家園。我們在那裡和曼那瑞分開:那是薩格拉斯『賦予』我們一族的扭曲惡魔形態，或是如他們所自稱的，埃雷達爾。$b$b埃雷達爾……這個字曾經有它的意義。$b$b<阿德密特斯好像在品嚐這個字一樣。>$b$b真噁心。$b$b不要再浪費時間了。找到復仇者波羅斯展開你的訓練。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9693;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "翻譯...", Title AC enUS : "Translations..." ; Wowhead enUS : "Translations..."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '翻譯……', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9696;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我要你把翻譯的文件親自交給費倫，$n。我不信任那個笨手笨腳的信差。$B$B向預言者解釋血精靈正在從外域接收援軍，他們在艾克索達的德萊尼之中有個間諜。費倫住在艾克索達的聖光地窖。$B$B動作快!", Details AC enUS : "I need you to deliver the translated documents to Velen personally, $N. I don't trust that deranged messenger.$B$BExplain to the Prophet that the blood elves are receiving reinforcements from the Outland and that they have a spy amongst the draenei at the Exodar. Velen resides in the Vault of Lights inside the Exodar.$B$BMake haste!$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "I need you to deliver the translated documents to Velen personally, $n. I don't trust that deranged messenger.$b$bExplain to the Prophet that the blood elves are receiving reinforcements from the Outland and that they have a spy amongst the draenei at the Exodar. Velen resides in the Vault of Lights inside the Exodar.$b$bMake haste!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我要你把翻譯的文件親自交給費倫，$n。我不信任那個笨手笨腳的信差。$b$b向預言者解釋血精靈正在從外域接收援軍，他們在艾克索達的德萊尼之中有個間諜。費倫住在艾克索達的聖光地窖。$b$b動作快!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9698;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "謝謝你及時的送達，$n。你將要成為阿古斯之手優秀的密探之一了。$B$B要是我們能知道他們在血謎島向誰報告那就好了，還有更重要的，太陽之門在什麼地方...他們似乎有重重戒備 - 不管它是在什麼地方。$B$B你有興趣接一些勘察的工作嗎?$B$B如果可以，請帶著這些命令回到復仇者波羅斯那裡。他會給你下一個任務。", Details AC enUS : "I thank you for the timely delivery, $N. You are turning out to be one of the Hand's better agents.$B$BIf only we knew who they reported to in Bloodmyst and more importantly, where this sun portal was... They seem to have it tightly guarded - wherever it may be.$B$BWould you be interested in some reconnaissance work?$B$BIf so, take these orders back to Vindicator Boros. He will give you your next mission." ; Wowhead enUS : "I thank you for the timely delivery, $n. You are turning out to be one of the Hand's better agents.$b$bIf only we knew who they reported to in Bloodmyst and more importantly, where this sun portal was... They seem to have it tightly guarded - wherever it may be.$b$bWould you be interested in some reconnaissance work?$b$bIf so, take these orders back to Vindicator Boros. He will give you your next mission."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '謝謝你及時的送達，$n。你將要成為阿格斯之手優秀的密探之一了。$b$b要是我們能知道他們在血謎島向誰報告那就好了，還有更重要的，太陽之門在什麼地方……他們似乎有重重戒備 - 不管它是在什麼地方。$b$b你有興趣接一些勘察的工作嗎?$b$b如果可以，請帶著這些命令回到復仇者波羅斯那裡。他會給你下一個任務。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9699;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "費倫表示如果血精靈已在這座島和外域間開啟了裂隙，傳送門開啟的地方就會有召喚儀式的殘餘物或異常者出現。你一定要搜索島上有顯現出這些異象的地方。$B$B小心，$n;有些異象是從虛無本身來的生物。如果你發現虛無反常者，就殺了他們!帶著你找到的新資訊回來向我報告。從北邊開始你的搜索，靠近星移活塞的地方。", Details AC enUS : "Velen states that if the blood elves have been opening rifts between this island and the Outland, there will be residue or anomalies left in the areas where the portals have been opened. You must search the island for locations that exhibit or display these anomalies.$B$BBe warned, $N; some of these anomalies will be creatures from the void itself. Should you find void anomalies, slay them! Report back to me with any new information that you may find. Begin your search to the north, near the Warp Piston.$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Velen states that if the blood elves have been opening rifts between this island and the Outland, there will be residue or anomalies left in the areas where the portals have been opened. You must search the island for locations that exhibit or display these anomalies.$b$bBe warned, $n; some of these anomalies will be creatures from the void itself. Should you find void anomalies, slay them! Report back to me with any new information that you may find. Begin your search to the north, near the Warp Piston.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Void Anomaly slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '費倫表示如果血精靈已在這座島和外域間開啟了裂縫，傳送門開啟的地方就會有召喚儀式的殘餘物或異常者出現。你一定要搜索島上有顯現出這些異象的地方。$b$b小心，$n;有些異象是從虛無本身來的生物。如果你發現虛無反常者，就殺了他們!帶著你找到的新資訊回來向我報告。從北邊開始你的搜索，靠近星移活塞的地方。', `Objectivetext1` = '虛無反常者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9700;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我們還有其他人在尋找太陽之門的線索，$n。我要你先專注於手上的工作。$B$B波羅斯收到一則新報告指出有另一個失事地點。我們發現那個失事地點就是艾克索達的冬眠核心。這是覆蓋船艙的支撐區域，就和我們德萊尼從安曼谷爬出來的那個船艙一樣。$B$B這個區域也有醫療補給。前往冬眠核心，就在血色守望正西邊。尋找物資及生還者。", Details AC enUS : "We have others pursuing leads on the sun portals, $N. I need you to focus on the task at hand.$B$BBoros has received new reports of another crash site. What we've since discovered is that the crash site is actually the Exodar's cryo-core. This is a pod holding area that houses pods exactly like the ones we draenei crawled out of in Ammen Vale.$B$BThis area also holds medical supplies. Head to the Cryo-Core, directly west of Blood Watch. Search for supplies and search for survivors.$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "We have others pursuing leads on the sun portals, $n. I need you to focus on the task at hand.$b$bBoros has received new reports of another crash site. What we've since discovered is that the crash site is actually the Exodar's cryo-core. This is a pod holding area that houses pods exactly like the ones we draenei crawled out of in Ammen Vale.$b$bThis area also holds medical supplies. Head to the Cryo-Core, directly west of Blood Watch. Search for supplies and search for survivors."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我們還有其他人在尋找太陽之門的線索，$n。我要你先專注於手上的工作。$b$b波羅斯收到一則新報告指出有另一個失事地點。我們發現那個失事地點就是艾克索達的冬眠核心。這是覆蓋船艙的支撐區域，就和我們德萊尼從安曼谷爬出來的那個船艙一樣。$b$b這個區域也有醫療補給。前往冬眠核心，就在血色守望正西邊。尋找物資及生還者。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9703;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "馬帝斯會被制裁的，$n。我要你找到他，把他帶回三傑議會。$B$B翻遍整座島，務必找到這個混蛋。一旦你找到他，就使用這把信號槍。我的追蹤者看到信號就會前去協助逮捕馬帝斯。抓到他之後再回來找我。", Details AC enUS : "Matis will be brought to justice, $N; and I want you to be the one to find him and bring him back to the Triumvirate.$B$BScour the island for this killer. Should you find him, use this flare gun. When my trackers see the flare, they'll come and assist in capturing Matis. Return to me after he's been captured." ; Wowhead enUS : "Matis will be brought to justice, $n; and I want you to be the one to find him and bring him back to the Triumvirate.$b$bScour the island for this killer. Should you find him, use this flare gun. When my trackers see the flare, they'll come and assist in capturing Matis. Return to me after he's been captured."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '馬帝斯會得到正義的，$n;我要你找到他並把他帶回三頭政治。$b$b搜索島嶼找到這個混蛋。如果你找到他，就使用這把信號槍。我的追蹤者看到閃光就會前去協助逮捕馬帝斯。抓到他後再來找我。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9711;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "多虧了你和你做的努力，我的斥候才能找到太陽之門。精靈讓傳送門的位置保持活動，這樣他們才能瞬間移動它。這是為什麼你調查到的地點是空的。$B$B這個系統的優點也是它最大的缺點。太陽之門由傳送門控制器來穩定。如果我們可以擊敗控制器，我們就能摧毀傳送門。目前太陽之門的位置在西邊，旋繞導航器的南方。找到並摧毀它!", Details AC enUS : "Thanks to you and the work you did, my scouts were able to find the sun gate. The elves keep the portal location mobile so that they can move it at a moment's notice. That's why the site you investigated was empty.$B$BThe strength of such a system is also its greatest weakness. The sun gate is stabilized by portal controllers. If we can take down the controllers, the portal will be ours to destroy. The current sun gate location can be found west of here, south of the Vector Coil. Find it and destroy it!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Thanks to you and the work you did, my scouts were able to find the sun gate. The elves keep the portal location mobile so that they can move it at a moment's notice. That's why the site you investigated was empty.$b$bThe strength of such a system is also its greatest weakness. The sun gate is stabilized by portal controllers. If we can take down the controllers, the portal will be ours to destroy. The current sun gate location can be found west of here, south of the Vector Coil. Find it and destroy it!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '多虧了你和你做的努力，我的斥候才能找到太陽之門。精靈讓傳送門的位置保持活動，這樣他們才能瞬間移動它。這是為什麼你調查到的地點是空的。$b$b這個系統的優點也是它最大的缺點。太陽之門由傳送門控制器來穩定。如果我們可以擊敗控制器，我們就能摧毀傳送門。目前太陽之門的位置在西邊，旋繞導航器的南方。找到並摧毀它!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9740;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "幾天前艾伊森派我的小組去進行一個勘察任務，搜索太陽之門。不用說，我們發現了...$B$B<羅莉指著喬爾力。>$B$B不管那些蠢精靈透過傳送門在傳送什麼，這讓虛無能量不斷被釋放。那個區域到處都是虛無異常者。$B$B我們一定要在他們有機會變成虛無反常者前毀了他們。你可以在西南方靠近太陽之門的地方找到這些生物的發源地。殺了他們，完成後向艾伊森報告。", Details AC enUS : "Aesom sent my squad out on a reconnaissance mission to search for the sun gate a few days ago. Needless to say, we found it...$B$B<Loryi points at Jorli.>$B$BWhatever those fool elves are transporting through that portal is causing void energy to be released. The area is teaming with void critters. $B$BWe must destroy them before they have a chance to grow into void anomalies. You'll find the source of the creatures southwest of here, near the sun gate. Kill them and report back to Aesom when you're done." ; Wowhead enUS : "Aesom sent my squad out on a reconnaissance mission to search for the sun gate a few days ago. Needless to say, we found it...$b$b<Loryi points at Jorli.>$b$bWhatever those fool elves are transporting through that portal is causing void energy to be released. The area is teaming with void critters.$b$bWe must destroy them before they have a chance to grow into void anomalies. You'll find the source of the creatures southwest of here, near the sun gate. Kill them and report back to Aesom when you're done."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '幾天前艾伊森派我的小組去進行一個勘察任務，搜索太陽之門。不用說，我們發現了……$b$b<羅莉指著喬爾力。>$b$b不管那些蠢精靈透過傳送門在傳送什麼，這讓虛無能量不斷被釋放。那個區域到處都是虛無異常者。$b$b我們一定要在他們有機會變成虛無反常者前毀了他們。你可以在西南方靠近太陽之門的地方找到這些生物的發源地。殺了他們，完成後向艾伊森報告。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9741;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "勝利就只差臨門一腳，$n。發現了太陽之門，他們的補給線不久後就會被完全封鎖了。現在是襲擊他們部隊的時候。$B$B你可以在西邊找到許多的太陽之鷹營地。太陽之鷹控火者和太陽之鷹防衛者佔據了大部分的區域。找到他們，殺了他們，再回來找我。", Details AC enUS : "Victory is close at hand, $N. With the discovery of the sun gate, it won't be long until their supply lines are completely closed off. Now is the time to strike at their numbers.$B$BTo the west you will find numerous Sunhawk camps. The Sunhawk pyromancers and defenders occupy the vast majority of the area. Find them, kill them and return to me." ; Wowhead enUS : "Victory is close at hand, $n. With the discovery of the sun gate, it won't be long until their supply lines are completely closed off. Now is the time to strike at their numbers.$b$bTo the west you will find numerous Sunhawk camps. The Sunhawk pyromancers and defenders occupy the vast majority of the area. Find them, kill them and return to me."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '勝利就只差臨門一腳，$n。發現了太陽之門，他們的補給線不久後就會被完全封鎖了。現在是襲擊他們部隊的時候。$b$b你可以在西邊找到許多的太陽之鷹營地。太陽之鷹控火者和太陽之鷹防衛者佔據了大部分的區域。找到他們，殺了他們，再回來找我。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9746;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我們的薩滿聲稱水元素因為水源的污染受到很大的影響。我們知道艾克索達的能量核心位在西邊的山裡。它一定是正滲漏出揮發性的液體到水供給裡!我要你去幫我收集更多資訊。$B$B<艾伊森指向一個瓶子並點點頭。>$B$B你要帶著這個瓶子沿著海邊北方走，直到你到達血謎島的河流匯入海洋的區域。採集那裡的樣本並帶回來給我。", Details AC enUS : "Our shaman claim that the elements of water have become greatly agitated by the pollution of the water source. We know that the Exodar's power core is lodged into the mountain to the west. It must be leaking volatile fluids into the water supply! I need you to get me more information.$B$B<Aesom points to a flask and nods.>$B$BYou are to take this flask and follow the beach north until you reach the area where the rivers of Bloodmyst drain into the ocean. Take a sample from that location and return to me." ; Wowhead enUS : "Our shaman claim that the elements of water have become greatly agitated by the pollution of the water source. We know that the Exodar's power core is lodged into the mountain to the west. It must be leaking volatile fluids into the water supply! I need you to get me more information.$b$b<Aesom points to a flask and nods.>$b$bYou are to take this flask and follow the beach north until you reach the area where the rivers of Bloodmyst drain into the ocean. Take a sample from that location and return to me."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我們的薩滿聲稱水元素因為水源的污染受到很大的影響。我們知道艾克索達的能量核心位在西邊的山裡。它一定是正滲漏出揮發性的液體到水供給裡!我要你去幫我收集更多資訊。$b$b<艾伊森指向一個瓶子並點點頭。>$b$b你要帶著這個瓶子沿著海邊北方走，直到你到達血謎島的河流匯入海洋的區域。採集那裡的樣本並帶回來給我。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9748;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "艦隊司令‧奧迪席斯要你去找隊長艾德華‧漢尼斯並和他談談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Admiral Odesyus has asked that you find and speak with Captain Edward Hanes." ; Wowhead enUS : "Admiral Odesyus has asked that you find and speak with Captain Edward Hanes.",  OLD Details : "昨天夜裡，「失望」號的船長，艾德華‧漢尼斯出現在我帳篷前面。和20年前因壞血病而死的艾德華‧漢尼斯一模一樣。$B$B這個亡魂告訴我了一個讓我的心顫抖的故事。一個我要你聽的故事和一個我要你完成的任務。你會去做嗎?你會去找血色守望東北方的龍痕島找艾德華嗎?", Details AC enUS : "Last night, Edward Hanes, captain of the ship 'Lost Hope', appeared before me in my tent. The same Edward Hanes that died of scurvy 20 years ago.$B$BThis apparition told me a tale that made my heart tremble. A tale that I need you to hear and a mission that I need you to accomplish. Will you do it? Will you seek out Edward on Wyrmscar Island, northeast of Blood Watch?$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Last night, Edward Hanes, captain of the ship 'Lost Hope', appeared before me in my tent. The same Edward Hanes that died of scurvy 20 years ago.$b$bThis apparition told me a tale that made my heart tremble. A tale that I need you to hear and a mission that I need you to accomplish. Will you do it? Will you seek out Edward on Wyrmscar Island, northeast of Blood Watch?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '艦隊司令·奧迪席斯要你去找隊長艾德華·漢尼斯並和他談談。', `Details` = '昨天夜裡，「失望」號的船長，艾德華·漢尼斯出現在我帳篷前面。和20年前因壞血病而死的艾德華·漢尼斯一模一樣。$b$b這個亡魂告訴我了一個讓我的心顫抖的故事。一個我要你聽的故事和一個我要你完成的任務。你會去做嗎?你會去找血色守望東北方的龍痕島找艾德華嗎?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9751;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "我們所知道的事...", Title AC enUS : "What We Know..." ; Wowhead enUS : "What We Know...",  OLD Details : "我們最近幾天了解了很多敵人的事。血精靈由一個叫賽羅娜斯的人領導並密謀要摧毀我們。最後，他們要征服歐蘿絲並重拾對艾克索達的控制。$B$B讚美聖光，我們摧毀了太陽之門，阻止了他們的補給線。不幸的是，他們持續使用旋繞導航器的污染物來毒害大地，使用輻射性落塵的突變物質來利己。$B$B有了這樣的認識，阿德密特斯便想出個計畫。快去找他。", Details AC enUS : "We've learned much of our enemies in recent days. The blood elves are led by a being known as Sironas and plot to destroy us. Ultimately, they seek to enslave O'ros and regain control of the Exodar.$B$BLight be praised, we have stopped their supply line by destroying the sun gate. Unfortunately, they continue to use the contaminant of the Vector Coil to poison the land, using the mutagenic properties of the fallout to their advantage.$B$BWith this knowledge, Admetius has devised a plan. Seek him out." ; Wowhead enUS : "We've learned much of our enemies in recent days. The blood elves are led by a being known as Sironas and plot to destroy us. Ultimately, they seek to enslave O'ros and regain control of the Exodar.$b$bLight be praised, we have stopped their supply line by destroying the sun gate. Unfortunately, they continue to use the contaminant of the Vector Coil to poison the land, using the mutagenic properties of the fallout to their advantage.$b$bWith this knowledge, Admetius has devised a plan. Seek him out."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '我們所知道的事……', `Details` = '我們最近幾天了解了很多敵人的事。血精靈由一個叫賽羅娜斯的人領導並密謀要摧毀我們。最後，他們要征服歐蘿絲並重拾對艾克索達的控制。$b$b讚美聖光，我們摧毀了太陽之門，阻止了他們的補給線。不幸的是，他們持續使用旋繞導航器的污染物來毒害大地，使用幅射性落塵的突變物質來利己。$b$b有了這樣的認識，阿德密特斯便想出個計畫。快去找他。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9753;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "我們不知道的事...", Title AC enUS : "What We Don't Know..." ; Wowhead enUS : "What We Don't Know...",  OLD Details : "我們所做的審問完全失敗了，$n。拷問 - 當然 - 是絕對不考慮的。我們需要的是一個$r做為內應。$B$B我可以對你施放一個法術讓你變成血精靈並調整你的語言。透過一些手段，我們或許可以從被俘虜的密探口中獲得一些訊息。$B$B在這樣的偽裝下，我要你盡可能從囚犯那裡取得資訊。$B$B還有$n，偽裝的時候不可以離開血色守望否則法術就會失效。", Details AC enUS : "Our attempts at interrogation have failed miserably, $N. Torture is - of course - out of the question. What we need is a draenei on the inside.$B$BI can cast a spell upon you that would make you appear blood elf and adjust your language. Through subterfuge, we may be able to get the information we need out of the captured agent.$B$BUnder this guise, I want you to get whatever information you can out of the prisoner.$B$BAnd $N, do not leave Blood Watch while disguised as the spell will fail." ; Wowhead enUS : "Our attempts at interrogation have failed miserably, $n. Torture is - of course - out of the question. What we need is a draenei on the inside.$b$bI can cast a spell upon you that would make you appear blood elf and adjust your language. Through subterfuge, we may be able to get the information we need out of the captured agent.$b$bUnder this guise, I want you to get whatever information you can out of the prisoner.$b$bAnd $n, do not leave Blood Watch while disguised as the spell will fail."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '我們不知道的事……', `Details` = '我們嘗試審問的企圖已悲慘地失敗了，$n。折磨 - 當然 - 是絕對會有的。我們需要的是一個在裡面的德萊尼。$b$b我可以對你施放一個法術讓你變成血精靈並調整你的語言。透過一些藉口，我們或許可以獲得被俘虜的密探的消息。$b$b在這樣的偽裝下，我要你盡可能的從囚犯那裡取得資訊。$b$b還有$n，偽裝的時候不可以離開血色守望否則法術就會失效。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9756;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我的朋友，希望你可以好心的回到秘法師范德隆那裡，我知道他非常渴望派你來鬼魂之地這裡進行你的第一個任務。$B$B我們都靠你了，$n。別讓我們失望。", Details AC enUS : "Now my friend, if you would be so kind as to return to Arcanist Vandril, I know that he is very anxious to send you out on your first mission here in the Ghostlands.$B$BWe're counting on you, $N.  Don't let us down." ; Wowhead enUS : "Now my friend, if you would be so kind as to return to Arcanist Vandril, I know that he is very anxious to send you out on your first mission here in the Ghostlands.$b$bWe're counting on you, $n. Don't let us down."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我的朋友，希望你可以好心的回到秘法師范德隆那裡，我知道他非常渴望派你來鬼魂之地這裡進行你的第一個任務。$b$b我們都靠你了，$n。別讓我們失望。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9758;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在爆破兵勒茍索嘗試摧毀旋繞導航器並殺死賽羅娜斯時跟著他並保護他。完成任務後回到血色守望的主教阿德密特斯那裡。", Objectives AC enUS : "Follow and protect Demolitionist Legoso as he attempts to destroy the Vector Coil and slay Sironas. Return to Exarch Admetius at Blood Watch should you complete the mission." ; Wowhead enUS : "Follow and protect Demolitionist Legoso as he attempts to destroy the Vector Coil and slay Sironas. Return to Exarch Admetius at Blood Watch should you complete the mission.",  OLD Details : "如果你珍惜你的生命就不要接下這個任務。你看到遠處那個從山邊突起的巨大能量核心嗎？任何接下這個重擔的人都需要一路戰鬥到那座山上，在保護我的同時要和太陽之鷹軍隊作戰，而我要切斷那個核心以破壞它。賽羅娜斯也在那裡某處。$B$B如果你就此離去我也不會輕視你的，$n。$B$B但或許你就是那個能摧毀旋繞導航器和擊敗賽羅娜斯的人。那麼，你是嗎？", Details AC enUS : "Don't accept this assignment if you value your life. You see that gigantic power core jutting out of the mountain side over yonder? Whoever takes on this burden will need to fight their way through that mountain, battling an army of Sunhawks while protecting me as I rig the core up for demolition. Sironas the eredar is somewhere up there as well.$B$BI won't think less of you if you just walk away, $N.$B$BBut maybe you're the one - the one to destroy the Vector Coil and take down Sironas. Well, are you?" ; Wowhead enUS : "Don't accept this assignment if you value your life. You see that gigantic power core jutting out of the mountain side over yonder? Whoever takes on this burden will need to fight their way through that mountain, battling an army of Sunhawks while protecting me as I rig the core up for demolition. Sironas the eredar is somewhere up there as well.$b$bI won't think less of you if you just walk away, $n.$b$bBut maybe you're the one - the one to destroy the Vector Coil and take down Sironas. Well, are you?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '在破壞者勒茍索嘗試摧毀旋繞導航器並殺死賽羅娜斯時跟著他並保護他。完成任務後回到血色守望的主教阿德密特斯那裡。', `Details` = '如果你珍惜你的生命就不要接下這個任務。你看到遠處那個從山邊突起的巨大能量核心嗎?任何接下這個重擔的人都需要一路戰鬥到那座山上，在保護我的同時要和太陽之鷹軍隊作戰，而我要切斷那個核心以破壞它。賽羅娜斯也在那裡某處。$b$b如果你就此離去我也不會輕視你的，$n。$b$b但或許你就是那個能摧毀旋繞導航器和擊敗賽羅娜斯的人。那麼，你是嗎?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9759;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我不會要你獨自一人背負著摧毀旋繞導航器和殺死賽羅娜斯的重擔，$n;不過，我想你可以幫忙為其他可能接下這樣危險任務的人清理道路。$B$B踏上血色守望外往北邊的路並沿著它一直走到岔路。到了那裡，選擇左邊的路並一直走到你看見復仇者之陵 - 它會在路的偏西邊一點。科林會在那邊等你。", Details AC enUS : "I would not ask you to single-handedly bear the burden of destroying the Vector Coil and slaying Sironas, $N; however, I believe that you can be of some help in clearing the way for others that might take on such a dangerous assignment.$B$BTake the road going north out of Blood Watch and follow it until you get to the fork. Once there, take the left road and follow it until you see Vindicator's Rest - it will be slightly west of the road itself. Corin will be waiting for you." ; Wowhead enUS : "I would not ask you to single-handedly bear the burden of destroying the Vector Coil and slaying Sironas, $n; however, I believe that you can be of some help in clearing the way for others that might take on such a dangerous assignment.$b$bTake the road going north out of Blood Watch and follow it until you get to the fork. Once there, take the left road and follow it until you see Vindicator's Rest - it will be slightly west of the road itself. Corin will be waiting for you."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我不會要你獨自一人背負著摧毀旋繞導航器和殺死賽羅娜斯的重擔，$n;不過，我想你可以幫忙為其他可能接下這樣危險任務的人清理道路。$b$b踏上血色守望外往北邊的路並沿著它一直走到岔路。到了那裡，選擇左邊的路並一直走到你看見復仇者之陵 - 它會在路的偏西邊一點。科林會在那邊等你。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9760;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "只有最身經百戰、高尚又毫無畏懼的人才會接下於勒茍索的任務。主教不會命令任何一個阿古斯之手的密探接下摧毀旋繞導航器和殺死賽羅娜斯的任務。因為他拒絕讓任何一個德萊尼去送死 - 那些任務無疑是自殺...$B$B<科林嘆氣。>$B$B我的工作是削弱太陽之鷹的防禦。你要殺死旋繞導航器附近的太陽之鷹並為我們的勇士清空道路 - 不管我們的勇士是誰。", Details AC enUS : "Only the most battle hardened, noble and positively fearless of draenei will submit to Legoso's mission. The exarch will not order any agent of the Hand to take on the task of destroying the Vector Coil and dispatching Sironas. He refuses to send any draenei to their death - which is what the mission is: suicide...$B$B<Corin sighs.>$B$BMy job is to soften up the Sunhawk defenses. You are to slay Sunhawks near the Vector Coil and keep the path clear for our champion - whoever that may be." ; Wowhead enUS : "Only the most battle hardened, noble and positively fearless of draenei will submit to Legoso's mission. The exarch will not order any agent of the Hand to take on the task of destroying the Vector Coil and dispatching Sironas. He refuses to send any draenei to their death - which is what the mission is: suicide...$b$b<Corin sighs.>$b$bMy job is to soften up the Sunhawk defenses. You are to slay Sunhawks near the Vector Coil and keep the path clear for our champion - whoever that may be."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '只有最身經百戰，高尚，又毫無畏懼的德萊尼才會接下於勒茍索的任務。主教不會命令任何一個阿格斯之手的密探接下摧毀旋繞導航器和殺死賽羅娜斯的任務。他拒絕讓任何一個德萊尼去送死 - 像是那些自殺般的任務……$b$b<科林嘆氣。>$b$b我的工作是削弱太陽之鷹的防禦。你要殺死旋繞導航器附近的太陽之鷹並為我們的勇士將道路清空 - 不論我們的勇士是誰。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9761;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "再見到你真好，$n。我有個困難你或許可以解決。$B$B我們在太陽之鷹陣線後方的密探回報，看見太陽之鷹士兵傳送一份不尋常的文件。$B$B不幸的是，我們未成功取得一份文件的副本。我要你去那裡嘗試弄到那個文件。我確定如果你施加足夠的壓力，太陽之鷹密探就會供出我們要的資訊。必要時你可以使用武力。", Details AC enUS : "It is good to see you again, $N. I have a quandary that you might be able to solve.$B$BOur agents situated behind Sunhawk lines have reported seeing Sunhawk soldiers parsing an unusual document.$B$BUnfortunately, we have been unsuccessful in acquiring a copy of the document for ourselves. I need you to go out in the field and try to recover the document. I am certain that if you apply enough pressure, a Sunhawk agent will turn over the information we seek. I leave the use of force to your discretion." ; Wowhead enUS : "It is good to see you again, $n. I have a quandary that you might be able to solve.$b$bOur agents situated behind Sunhawk lines have reported seeing Sunhawk soldiers parsing an unusual document.$b$bUnfortunately, we have been unsuccessful in acquiring a copy of the document for ourselves. I need you to go out in the field and try to recover the document. I am certain that if you apply enough pressure, a Sunhawk agent will turn over the information we seek. I leave the use of force to your discretion."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '再見到你真好，$n。我有個困難你或許可以解決。$b$b我們在太陽之鷹陣線後方的密探回報，看見太陽之鷹士兵傳送一份不尋常的文件。$b$b不幸的是，我們未成功取得一份文件的副本。我要你去那裡嘗試弄到那個文件。我確定如果你施加足夠的壓力，太陽之鷹密探就會供出我們要的資訊。必要時你可以使用武力。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9779;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "$n，我有件事想請你幫忙。通常我會自己做這件事，但我現在真的太忙了。$B$B我有個叫齊亞隆的朋友在北邊劍刃山脈的希爾瓦納。他在等我的消息，雖然我想他聽到後不會太高興。$B$B如果你可以幫我傳話給他，我會很感謝你。另外我一定要堅持，這很重要，那就是你不能偷讀這封信。這只能讓齊亞隆知道。", Details AC enUS : "$N, I have a favor to ask of you. Normally, I would do this myself, but my hands are already beyond full.$B$BI have an associate named Kialon at Sylvanaar in the Blade's Edge Mountains to the north. He's expecting to hear from me in the near future, although I suspect he won't like what I have to say.$B$BIf you would deliver my response to him, you would have my gratitude. I must insist, and this is very important, that you not attempt to read the letter. It is for Kialon's eyes alone." ; Wowhead enUS : "$n, I have a favor to ask of you. Normally, I would do this myself, but my hands are already beyond full.$b$bI have an associate named Kialon at Sylvanaar in the Blade's Edge Mountains to the north. He's expecting to hear from me in the near future, although I suspect he won't like what I have to say.$b$bIf you would deliver my response to him, you would have my gratitude. I must insist, and this is very important, that you not attempt to read the letter. It is for Kialon's eyes alone."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '$n，我有件事想請你幫忙。通常我會自己做這件事，但我現在真的太忙了。$b$b我有個叫齊亞隆的朋友在北邊劍刃山脈的希爾瓦納。他在等我的消息，雖然我想他聽到後不會太高興。$b$b如果你可以幫我傳話給他，我會很感謝你。另外我一定要堅持，這很重要，那就是你不能偷讀這封信。這只能讓齊亞隆知道。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9794;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "好像納迦和他們的盟友還不夠多似的，巨魔將他們的觸角延伸到了沼澤區。他們已征服了西北邊大部分區域，那裡已經沒有什麼緩衝之地了。$B$B我們每殺一個人，就會有好幾個人代替他的位子。我不確定如果他們決定發動攻擊，我們還能保住薩布拉金多久。前往北方進入山裡，到的獸人雷霆王村堡壘讓奈克薩爾知道我們的困境。我們歡迎他可提供的任何幫助。", Details AC enUS : "As if the naga and their allies weren't enough, the ogres are extending their reach in the marsh. They've already conquered most of the area to the northwest and there isn't much of a buffer left.$B$BFor each one we kill, several more take their place. I'm not sure how long we'll be able to hold Zabra'jin once they decide to attack. Make your way north into the mountains, to the orcish stronghold of Thunderlord Stronghold and let Nekthar know of our plight. Any help he can spare would be most welcome." ; Wowhead enUS : "As if the naga and their allies weren't enough, the ogres are extending their reach in the marsh. They've already conquered most of the area to the northwest and there isn't much of a buffer left.$b$bFor each one we kill, several more take their place. I'm not sure how long we'll be able to hold Zabra'jin once they decide to attack. Make your way north into the mountains, to the orcish stronghold of Thunderlord Stronghold and let Nekthar know of our plight. Any help he can spare would be most welcome."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '好像納迦和他們的盟友還不夠多似的，巨魔將他們的觸角延伸到了沼澤區。他們已征服了西北邊大部分區域，那裡已經沒有什麼緩衝之地了。$b$b我們每殺一個人，就會有好幾個人代替他的位子。我不確定如果他們決定發動攻擊，我們還能保住薩布拉金多久。前往北方進入山裡，到的獸人雷霆王村堡壘讓奈克薩爾知道我們的困境。我們歡迎他可提供的任何幫助。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9795;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "西邊的安曼牧場是當地主要的鞭笞者繁殖地。因為附近湖泊的地下水污染，植物學家泰瑞茲擔心一旦我們淨化湖泊，鞭笞者將無法再自己重新繁殖。$B$B前往安曼牧場摘一些受污染的花給我，或許我可以看看它們並想個辦法。你可以不尋常的紅色花瓣來辨別它們。", Details AC enUS : "The Ammen Fields to the west are the primary breeding ground of the local lasher population. With the corruption of the water table from the nearby lake, Botanist Taerix is worried that the lashers will not be able to repopulate themselves once we've cleansed the lake.$B$BGo to the Ammen Fields and pick some of the corrupted flowers for me so that I might take a look at them and see what can be done. You should be able to identify them by their uncharacteristic red petals." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Ammen Fields to the west are the primary breeding ground of the local lasher population. With the corruption of the water table from the nearby lake, Botanist Taerix is worried that the lashers will not be able to repopulate themselves once we've cleansed the lake.$b$bGo to the Ammen Fields and pick some of the corrupted flowers for me so that I might take a look at them and see what can be done. You should be able to identify them by their uncharacteristic red petals."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '西邊的安曼牧場是當地主要的鞭笞者繁殖地。因為附近湖泊的地下水污染，植物學家泰瑞茲擔心一旦我們淨化湖泊，鞭笞者將無法再自己重新繁殖。$b$b前往安曼牧場摘一些受污染的花給我，或許我可以看看它們並想個辦法。你可以不尋常的紅色花瓣來辨別它們。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9799;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把達克汗的頭顱交給銀月城的洛索瑪‧塞隆。", Objectives AC enUS : "Take Dar'Khan's Head to Lor'themar Theron in Silvermoon City." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take Dar'Khan's Head to Lor'themar Theron in Silvermoon City.",  OLD Details : "這是我們血精靈歷史中嶄新的一章，$n。你的幫助加強了我們雙方種族的關係，$r。$B$B把背叛者的頭顱帶給銀月城的攝政王，洛索瑪‧塞隆。他等不及想聽到這個消息。", Details AC enUS : "This is the beginning of a new chapter in blood elf history, $N.  You've helped cement the bond between my race and yours, $r.$B$BTake the traitor's head to Regent Lord Lor'themar Theron in Silvermoon City.  He'll be eager to hear the news." ; Wowhead enUS : "This is the beginning of a new chapter in blood elf history, $n. You've helped cement the bond between my race and yours, $r.$b$bTake the traitor's head to Regent Lord Lor'themar Theron in Silvermoon City. He'll be eager to hear the news."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把達克汗的頭顱交給銀月城的洛索瑪·塞隆。', `Details` = '這是我們血精靈歷史中嶄新的一章，$n。你的幫助加強了我們雙方種族的關係，$r。$b$b把背叛者的頭顱帶給銀月城的地區統治者，洛索瑪·塞隆。他等不及想聽到這個消息。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9811;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將來自洛索瑪‧塞隆的信帶到幽暗城，提里斯法林地的被遺忘者首都給希瓦娜斯‧風行者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring the Letter from Lor'themar Theron to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner in Undercity, the Forsaken capital in Tirisfal Glades." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the Letter from Lor'themar Theron to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner in Undercity, the Forsaken capital in Tirisfal Glades.",  OLD Details : "我們潛在的新盟友對我們的能力有些懷疑。被認為連自己家的問題都無法解決那我們對他們而言還有什麼用？$B$B這會改變一切。我們的能力不再會被質疑。我們會以同等的姿態加入部落。$B$B把這封信交給希瓦娜斯，被遺忘者的統治者。她已經和我們站在同一陣線了，但達克汗的死訊對她而言沒有影響力。準備好長途跋涉吧，$n。如果一切進行順利她會送你到奧格瑪的。", Details AC enUS : "There were doubts about our capabilities among our potential new allies.  Of what use could we be to them when perceived as unable to deal with our problems at home?$B$BThis changes everything.  No longer will our power be questioned.  We'll be able to join the Horde as equals.$B$BTake this letter to Sylvanas, ruler of the Forsaken.  She's already on our side but the news of Dar'Khan's death will be music to her ears.  Prepare for a long trip, $N.  If all goes well she will send you to Orgrimmar." ; Wowhead enUS : "There were doubts about our capabilities among our potential new allies. Of what use could we be to them when perceived as unable to deal with our problems at home?$b$bThis changes everything. No longer will our power be questioned. We'll be able to join the Horde as equals.$b$bTake this letter to Sylvanas, ruler of the Forsaken. She's already on our side but the news of Dar'Khan's death will be music to her ears. Prepare for a long trip, $n. If all goes well she will send you to Orgrimmar."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將來自洛索瑪·塞隆的信帶到幽暗城，提里斯法林地的被遺忘者首都給希瓦娜斯·風行者。', `Details` = '我們潛在的新盟友對我們的能力有些懷疑。被認為連自己家的問題都無法解決那我們對他們而言還有什麼用?$b$b這會改變一切。我們的能力不再會被質疑。我們會以同等的姿態加入部落。$b$b把這封信交給希瓦娜斯，被遺忘者的統治者。她已經和我們站在同一陣線了，但達克汗的死訊對她而言沒有影響力。準備好長途跋涉吧，$n。如果一切進行順利她會送你到奧格瑪的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9812;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "對抗天譴軍團的戰役讓我們死傷慘重。每天都有很多人被殺，還有更多人的命運更悲慘。$B$B天譴軍團俘虜人質也是常見的事。和在死亡之域等待他們的比起來死亡會是更好的選擇。他們在可怕的毒藥效果下喪失意志被嚴刑拷打。$B$B安寧地的藥劑師倫澤紳發明了一種解藥;去找他並取得這個恢復藥劑。", Details AC enUS : "The battle against the Scourge is not one without casualties.  Many are slain every day yet many more meet a worse fate.$B$BIt is not uncommon for the Scourge to take prisoners.  Death would be preferable to what awaits them in Deatholme.  They're interrogated and tortured while under the effects of horrible will-breaking poisons.$B$BApothecary Renzithen in Tranquillien has developed a remedy; go to him and retrieve this restorative draught." ; Wowhead enUS : "The battle against the Scourge is not one without casualties. Many are slain every day yet many more meet a worse fate.$b$bIt is not uncommon for the Scourge to take prisoners. Death would be preferable to what awaits them in Deatholme. They're interrogated and tortured while under the effects of horrible will-breaking poisons.$b$bApothecary Renzithen in Tranquillien has developed a remedy; go to him and retrieve this restorative draught."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '對抗天譴軍團的戰役讓我們死傷慘重。每天都有很多人被殺，還有更多人的命運更悲慘。$b$b天譴軍團俘虜人質也是常見的事。和在死亡之域等待他們的比起來死亡會是更好的選擇。他們在可怕的毒藥效果下喪失意志被嚴刑拷打。$b$b安寧地的藥劑師倫澤紳發明了一種解藥;去找他並取得這個恢復藥劑。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 9877;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "探險者協會，那是給地精的東西嗎？", Title AC enUS : "Explorers' League, Is That Something for Gnomes?" ; Wowhead enUS : "Explorers' League, Is That Something for Gnomes?",  OLD Objectives : "在血色守望的北邊海岸上的破舊龜殼處尋找克羅波‧維茲班。", Objectives AC enUS : "Find Clopper Wizbang camped in an old turtle shell on the shore north of Blood Watch." ; Wowhead enUS : "Find Clopper Wizbang camped in an old turtle shell on the shore north of Blood Watch.",  OLD Details : "帶小孩！你相信嗎？$B$B他們把我從前途光明的考古發掘裡叫出來要我去奧迪席斯隊長的遠征隊去照顧一個小地精！$B$B我從未聽說有地精要當勘察員，所以我問了。$B$B看來好像我們現在接受地精了，而這個特別的傢伙受到魚人們的愛戴！$B$B哎，他已經下班了，在島的北方海岸那一個破舊的龜殼處紮營。如果你不相信我就去看看吧！", Details AC enUS : "Babysitting! Would you believe it?$B$BThey pulled me out of a promising dig and sent me along with Captain Odesyus' expedition to babysit that little gnome!$B$BI'd never heard o' a gnome wanting to become a prospector before, so I asked.$B$BSeems we are takin' gnomes now, and this particular one has a fascination with murlocs!$B$BWell, he's gone off and set up shop in an old turtle shell on the northern shore of the island. Go and have a look if you don't believe me!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Babysitting! Would you believe it?$b$bThey pulled me out of a promising dig and sent me along with Captain Odesyus' expedition to babysit that little gnome!$b$bI'd never heard o' a gnome wanting to become a prospector before, so I asked.$b$bSeems we are takin' gnomes now, and this particular one has a fascination with murlocs!$b$bWell, he's gone off and set up shop in an old turtle shell on the northern shore of the island. Go and have a look if you don't believe me!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '探險者協會，那是給地精的東西嗎?', `Objectives` = '在血色守望的北邊海岸上的破舊龜殼處尋找克羅波·維茲班。', `Details` = '帶小孩!你相信嗎?$b$b他們把我從前途光明的考古發掘裡叫出來要我去奧迪席斯隊長的遠征隊去照顧一個小地精!$b$b我從未聽說有地精要當勘察員，所以我問了。$b$b看來好像我們現在接受地精了，而這個特別的傢伙受到魚人們的愛戴!$b$b哎，他已經下班了，在島的北方海岸那一個破舊的龜殼處紮營。如果你不相信我就去看看吧!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10063;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "與阿古斯之手談談", Title AC enUS : "Talk to the Hand" ; Wowhead enUS : "Talk to the Hand",  OLD Details : "阿古斯之手在復仇者之陵建立了一個前方據點，但被血精靈及突變的野生生物在數量上遠遠的超過了。沒有後備的話，他們的前哨將有陷落的危險，而我們則無法監視旋繞導航器週遭的狀況。$B$B到復仇者之陵西北方找斥候喬爾力報到，並提供你的協助，$n。", Details AC enUS : "The Hand of Argus has established a forward base at Vindicator's Rest, but they are sorely outnumbered by both the blood elves and mutated wildlife. Without backup, their outpost is in danger of falling, and we'd have no way to keep an eye on events near the Vector Coil.$B$BReport to Scout Jorli at Vindicator's Rest to the northwest and offer her your assistance, $N." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Hand of Argus has established a forward base at Vindicator's Rest, but they are sorely outnumbered by both the blood elves and mutated wildlife. Without backup, their outpost is in danger of falling, and we'd have no way to keep an eye on events near the Vector Coil.$b$bReport to Scout Jorli at Vindicator's Rest to the northwest and offer her your assistance, $n."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '與阿格斯之手談談', `Details` = '阿古斯之手在復仇者之陵建立了一個前方據點，但被血精靈及突變的野生生物在數量上遠遠的超過了。沒有後備的話，他們的前哨將有陷落的危險，而我們則無法監視旋繞導航器週遭的狀況。$b$b到復仇者之陵西北方找斥候喬爾力報到，並提供你的協助，$n。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10064;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "在我們偵察太陽之鷹及他們的門戶這段期間，我受了許多的傷。斥候羅莉設法幫我止血，並試著想出一個方法將我疏送到血色守望。$B$B問題就在於我們得放棄現在這個位置以確保日後能夠安全的回來。$B$B只要我們一離開這個神聖的地區，我們就會被劫毀者捉住。如果你能幫我們清理掉一些暴怒的劫毀者，也許就能讓我們回程安全些。", Details AC enUS : "During our mission to reconnoiter the Sunhawks and their portal, I sustained a serious wound. Scout Loryi has managed to staunch the bleeding and she's trying to figure out a way to evacuate me to Blood Watch.$B$BThe problem is that we'd have to abandon our position here in order to guarantee a safe return.$B$BAs soon as we leave this consecrated ground, we'll be set upon by ravagers. If you can clear some of the enraged ravagers, it might allow us to make the trip back safely." ; Wowhead enUS : "During our mission to reconnoiter the Sunhawks and their portal, I sustained a serious wound. Scout Loryi has managed to staunch the bleeding and she's trying to figure out a way to evacuate me to Blood Watch.$b$bThe problem is that we'd have to abandon our position here in order to guarantee a safe return.$b$bAs soon as we leave this consecrated ground, we'll be set upon by ravagers. If you can clear some of the enraged ravagers, it might allow us to make the trip back safely.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Enraged Ravager slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '在我們偵察太陽之鷹及他們的門戶這段期間，我受了許多的傷。斥候羅莉設法幫我止血，並試著想出一個方法將我疏送到血色守望。$b$b問題就在於我們得放棄現在這個位置以確保日後能夠安全的回來。$b$b只要我們一離開這個神聖的地區，我們就會被劫毀者捉住。如果你能幫我們清理掉一些暴怒的劫毀者，也許就能讓我們回程安全些。', `Objectivetext1` = '暴怒的劫毀者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10065;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "噢，他們所編織的陷阱", Title AC enUS : "Oh, the Tangled Webs They Weave" ; Wowhead enUS : "Oh, the Tangled Webs They Weave",  OLD Details : "我們不敢放棄我們的哨站，或離開復仇者之陵太遠，$r。接近旋繞導航器的突變生物藉由水晶洩漏的能量而產生了極大的改變。$B$B突變的糾纏者好像獲得了某些程度的知覺。他們已經懂得創造，佈置，及隱藏惡毒的陷阱，能夠捕捉住即使是最細心的戰士。$B$B假如我們繼續否認事實，我們將無法與這些太陽之鷹對抗。去攻擊問題的源頭，$n。", Details AC enUS : "We don't dare abandon our post, or wander too far from Vindicator's Rest, $r. The mutated creatures closest to the Vector Coil have been changed profoundly by energy leaking from the crystals.$B$BThe mutated tanglers appear to have gained a certain degree of sentience. They've learned to create, set, and conceal vicious traps that can ensnare even the most careful warrior.$B$BWe'll never be able to move against the Sunhawks if we're constantly forced to look underfoot. Attack the problem at its source, $N." ; Wowhead enUS : "We don't dare abandon our post, or wander too far from Vindicator's Rest, $r. The mutated creatures closest to the Vector Coil have been changed profoundly by energy leaking from the crystals.$b$bThe mutated tanglers appear to have gained a certain degree of sentience. They've learned to create, set, and conceal vicious traps that can ensnare even the most careful warrior.$b$bWe'll never be able to move against the Sunhawks if we're constantly forced to look underfoot. Attack the problem at its source, $n."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '噢，他們所編織的糾纏的圈套', `Details` = '我們不敢放棄我們的哨站，或離開復仇者之陵太遠，$r。接近旋繞導航器的突變生物藉由水晶洩漏的能量而產生了極大的改變。$b$b突變的糾纏者好像獲得了某些程度的知覺。他們已經懂得創造，佈置，及隱藏惡毒的陷阱，能夠捕捉住即使是最細心的戰士。$b$b假如我們繼續否認事實，我們將無法與這些太陽之鷹對抗。去攻擊問題的源頭，$n。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10066;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺掉6個污濁的水靈後回到復仇者之陵找復仇者科林。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill 6 Fouled Water Spirits and return to Vindicator Corin at Vindicator's Rest." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill 6 Fouled Water Spirits and return to Vindicator Corin at Vindicator's Rest.",  OLD Details : "大部分的生物接觸過水晶的能量後都以同樣的方式墮落:肌肉上有奇怪的記號，強烈的侵略性，以及身體有小片的水晶裂片。然而，位於這裡北方的污濁的水靈似乎整個都晶化了。$B$B我之前從未看過任何生物會這樣晶化的，不過當我們偶然發現後，發現他們特別的危險。我們必須在太陽之鷹將他們當成新的力量來源前除掉他們。", Details AC enUS : "Most of the creatures touched by the crystals' energy have been corrupted in the same ways: strange marks on their flesh, increased aggression, and small crystal shards in their bodies. However, the fouled water spirits north of here appear to be turning entirely to crystal.$B$BI've never seen anything react to the crystals this way before, when we explored the foul pool, they were particularly dangerous. We must get rid of them before the Sunhawks can exploit them as a new source of energy." ; Wowhead enUS : "Most of the creatures touched by the crystals' energy have been corrupted in the same ways: strange marks on their flesh, increased aggression, and small crystal shards in their bodies. However, the fouled water spirits north of here appear to be turning entirely to crystal.$b$bI've never seen anything react to the crystals this way before, when we explored the foul pool, they were particularly dangerous. We must get rid of them before the Sunhawks can exploit them as a new source of energy."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺掉6個污濁的水之靈後回到復仇者之陵找復仇者科林。', `Details` = '大部分的生物接觸過水晶的能量後都以同樣的方式墮落:肌肉上有奇怪的記號，強烈地侵略性，以及身體有小片的水晶裂片。然而，位於這裡北方的污濁的水之靈似乎整個都晶化了。$b$b我之前從未看過任何生物會這樣晶化的，不過當我們偶然發現他們後，發現他們特別的危險。我們必須在太陽之鷹將他們當成新的力量來源前除掉他們。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10067;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "拉瑞安娜‧河風要你在烈焰邊境將老白樹墜飾放置在符文石旁邊。", Objectives AC enUS : "Larianna Riverwind wants you to place Old Whitebark's Pendant by the runestone at the Scorched Grove." ; Wowhead enUS : "Larianna Riverwind wants you to place Old Whitebark's Pendant by the runestone at the Scorched Grove.",  OLD Details : "這個墜飾喚起了不同時期的回憶。一段比較好的時光。$B$B不幸地是，回憶是我現在最不需要的東西。$B$B我要你把這東西埋葬在烈焰邊境的符文石旁邊。那裡就是我第一次遇見樹人長者的地方。讓我老朋友的回憶休息吧。", Details AC enUS : "This pendant brings back memories of a different time.  A better time.$B$BUnfortunately, memories are the last thing I need right now.$B$BI want you to bury this by the runestone in the Scorched Grove.  It was there that I first met the treant elder.  Put my old friend's memory to rest." ; Wowhead enUS : "This pendant brings back memories of a different time. A better time.$b$bUnfortunately, memories are the last thing I need right now.$b$bI want you to bury this by the runestone in the Scorched Grove. It was there that I first met the treant elder. Put my old friend's memory to rest."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '拉瑞安娜·河風要你在烈焰邊境將老白樹墜飾放置在符文石旁邊。', `Details` = '這個墜飾喚起了不同時期的回憶。一段比較好的時光。$b$b不幸地是，回憶是我現在最不需要的東西。$b$b我要你把這東西埋葬在烈焰邊境的符文石旁邊。那裡就是我第一次遇見樹人長者的地方。讓我老朋友的回憶休息吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10166;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "來自艾克索達散發輻射的能量核心一直對這裡的環境造成浩劫。最明顯的效應是，它們附近開始出現一些奇怪的生物。$B$B也許我們能做些事情去幫助他們，但是現在，他們十足的數量已非我們的能力所能處理了。$B$B我要你去削減他們的數量，或許給我一點時間思考，我將有別的辦法對付它們。", Details AC enUS : "The irradiated power cores from the Exodar have been wreaking havoc on the environment here. The most obvious effect has been the appearance of the strange creatures that seem to have sprung up near them.$b$bThere may be something we can do to help them, but now, their sheer numbers are becoming too much for us to handle.$b$bI'd like you to go out and cull their numbers somewhat, and perhaps I'll have another idea after giving it some thought." ; Wowhead enUS : "The irradiated power cores from the Exodar have been wreaking havoc on the environment here. The most obvious effect has been the appearance of the strange creatures that seem to have sprung up near them.$b$bThere may be something we can do to help them, but now, their sheer numbers are becoming too much for us to handle.$b$bI'd like you to go out and cull their numbers somewhat, and perhaps I'll have another idea after giving it some thought.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Volatile Mutation slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '來自艾克索達散發輻射的能量核心一直對這裡的環境造成浩劫。最明顯的效應是，它們附近開始出現一些奇怪的生物。$b$b也許我們能做些事情去幫助他們，但是現在，他們十足的數量已非我們的能力所能處理了。$b$b我要你去削減他們的數量，或許給我一點時間思考，我將有別的辦法對付它們。', `Objectivetext1` = '暴躁突變者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10302;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你必須消滅……血精靈……威脅。查明……他們目的……是甚麼!$B$B他們在我後面的山脊上。", Details AC enUS : "You must eliminate... the blood elf... threat.  Find out... what they're... up to!$B$BThey're on the... ridge behind me." ; Wowhead enUS : "You must eliminate... the blood elf... threat. Find out... what they're... up to!$b$bThey're on the... ridge behind me."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你必須消滅……血精靈……威脅。查明……他們目的……是甚麼!$b$b他們在我後面的山脊上。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10303;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "有了你的幫忙，我們已經可以比想像中還快的找到解決的方法。$B$B我沒有別的工作要交給你。我和我的學徒們可以完成剩下的事情。$B$B你應該去船的另一邊跟復仇者艾德談話。", Details AC enUS : "With your help, we were able to find a solution to our problems faster than I could have hoped.$b$bI don't have any other work for you to do. My apprentices and I can handle the rest.$b$bYou should go speak with Vindicator Aldar on the other side of the ship." ; Wowhead enUS : "With your help, we were able to find a solution to our problems faster than I could have hoped.$b$bI don't have any other work for you to do. My apprentices and I can handle the rest.$b$bYou should go speak with Vindicator Aldar on the other side of the ship."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '有了你的幫忙，我們已經可以比想像中還快的找到解決的方法。$b$b我沒有別的工作要交給你。我和我的學徒們可以完成剩下的事情。$b$b你應該去船的另一邊跟復仇者艾德談話。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10304;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "戰鬥的號角：瘟疫之地！", Title AC enUS : "A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!" ; Wowhead enUS : "A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!",  OLD Details : "大家都聽著！大家都聽著！所有的英雄都應該聆聽這號召的聲音！$B$B暴風城已經發出了備戰的號召!所有勇士都應該拿起武器，一同面對來自東部王國北部地方天譴軍團的威脅!城中傳言四起，東部王國的廢墟中滋生出了新的威脅！它們已經在幽暗城東面的瘟疫之地大量集結，聯盟的安全岌岌可危！所有勇士都應該拿起武器，一同面對來自東部王國北部地方亡靈天災的威脅！城中傳言四起，東部王國的廢墟中滋生出了新的威脅！它們已經在幽暗城東面的瘟疫之地大量集結，聯盟的安全岌岌可危！$B$B聯盟的英雄們-去向指揮官阿胥拉姆·瓦羅菲斯特報到吧，他的大本營就在奧特蘭克山脈北邊的冰風營地！", Details AC enUS : "Hear ye, hear ye!  All heroes are called upon to heed these words!$B$BA call to arms has been issued by the Kingdom of Stormwind!  All able bodied individuals are entreated to take up arms against the dark threat of the Scourge in the northern lands of the Eastern Kingdoms!  Rumors fly of new threats rising from the ruins of the Plaguelands!$B$BHeroes of the realm - seek out Commander Ashlam Valorfist who has set up his base camp in Chillwind Camp, north of the Alterac Mountains!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Hear ye, hear ye! All heroes are called upon to heed these words!$b$bA call to arms has been issued by the Kingdom of Stormwind! All able bodied individuals are entreated to take up arms against the dark threat of the Scourge in the northern lands of the Eastern Kingdoms! Rumors fly of new threats rising from the ruins of the Plaguelands!$b$bHeroes of the realm - seek out Commander Ashlam Valorfist who has set up his base camp in Chillwind Camp, north of the Alterac Mountains!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '戰鬥的號角:瘟疫之地!', `Details` = '大家都聽著!大家都聽著!所有的英雄都應該聆聽這號召的聲音!$b$b暴風城已經發出了備戰的號召!所有勇士都應該拿起武器，一同面對來自東部王國北部地方天譴軍團的威脅!城中傳言四起，東部王國的廢墟中滋生出了新的威脅!它們已經在幽暗城東面的瘟疫之地大量集結，聯盟的安全岌岌可危!$b$b聯盟的英雄們-去向指揮官阿胥拉姆·瓦羅菲斯特報到吧，他的大本營就在奧特蘭克山脈北邊的冰風營地!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10373;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "戰鬥的號角：瘟疫之地！", Title AC enUS : "A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!" ; Wowhead enUS : "A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!",  OLD Objectives : "找到高級執行官德靈頓。他將自己的大本營建在提瑞斯法林地和幽暗城以東的亡靈壁壘。", Objectives AC enUS : "Seek out High Executor Derrington.  His base camp is located at the Bulwark, east of Tirisfal Glade and the Undercity." ; Wowhead enUS : "Seek out High Executor Derrington.  His base camp is located at the Bulwark, east of Tirisfal Glade and the Undercity.",  OLD Details : "部落的英雄們，請聆聽這召喚的聲音——部落召喚你們迅速行動起來！$B$B戰鬥的號角已經吹響，所有勇士都應拿起武器，準備與天災軍團殊死作戰！城中傳言四起，東部王國的廢墟中滋生出了新的威脅！它們已經在幽暗城東面的瘟疫之地大量集結，部落的安全岌岌可危！$B$B部落的英雄們——去向高級執行官德靈頓報到吧，他的大本營就在提瑞斯法林地東部的亡靈壁壘！", Details AC enUS : "Heroes of the realm, hear me - the Horde calls upon you for swift action!$B$BA call to arms has been issued for all able bodied individuals to take up arms against the Scourge!  Rumors fly of new threats rising from the ruins of the Eastern Kingdoms.  They loom to the east of the Undercity, in the northern reaches of the lands now known as the Plaguelands!$B$BHeroes of the realm - seek out High Executor Derrington, who has set up his base camp at the Bulwark, east of Tirisfal Glade!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Heroes of the realm, hear me - the Horde calls upon you for swift action!$b$bA call to arms has been issued for all able bodied individuals to take up arms against the Scourge! Rumors fly of new threats rising from the ruins of the Eastern Kingdoms. They loom to the east of the Undercity, in the northern reaches of the lands now known as the Plaguelands!$b$bHeroes of the realm - seek out High Executor Derrington, who has set up his base camp at the Bulwark, east of Tirisfal Glade!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '戰鬥的號角:瘟疫之地!', `Objectives` = '找到高級執行官德靈頓。他將自己的大本營建在提里斯法林地和幽暗城以東的亡靈壁壘。', `Details` = '部落的英雄們，請聆聽這召喚的聲音-部落召喚你們迅速行動起來!$b$b戰鬥的號角已經吹響，所有勇士都應拿起武器，準備與天譴軍團殊死作戰!城中傳言四起，東部王國的廢墟中滋生出了新的威脅!它們已經在幽暗城東面的瘟疫之地大量集結，部落的安全岌岌可危!$b$b部落的英雄們-去向高級執行官德靈頓報到吧，他的大本營就在提里斯法林地東部的亡靈壁壘!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10374;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺掉12隻森林山貓。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay 12 Grovestalker Lynxes." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay 12 Grovestalker Lynxes.",  OLD Details : "我們已經加快了種植生命之林的速度，但不知為何那裡的山貓失去了控制。$B$B曾經他們的數量很穩定，但現在森林山貓卻開始侵犯希爾瓦納，而且不久前才發生一連串令人不快的事件。$B$B我懷疑是迷霧拉斯的阿拉卡在背後搞鬼，但目前的問題是與山貓本身有關。$B$B我會很感謝要是你肯幫助我們解決這個問題。", Details AC enUS : "We've been growing the Living Grove at an accelerated rate, but somehow the lynxes there have become lost to our control.$B$BWhere once their population was stable, the grovestalker lynxes are now beginning to encroach upon Sylvanaar, and there have been a number of unpleasant incidents of late.$B$BI suspect that the arakkoa of Veil Lashh are somehow behind it, but the immediate issue is with the lynxes themselves.$B$BI would be most grateful if you would help us to deal with this situation." ; Wowhead enUS : "We've been growing the Living Grove at an accelerated rate, but somehow the lynxes there have become lost to our control.$b$bWhere once their population was stable, the grovestalker lynxes are now beginning to encroach upon Sylvanaar, and there have been a number of unpleasant incidents of late.$b$bI suspect that the arakkoa of Veil Lashh are somehow behind it, but the immediate issue is with the lynxes themselves.$b$bI would be most grateful if you would help us to deal with this situation.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Grovestalker Lynx slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '琳娜·月泉要你以最快的速度殺掉12隻森林山貓後回到劍刃山脈的希爾瓦納找她。', `Details` = '我們已經加快了種植生命之林的速度，但不知為何那裡的山貓失去了控制。$b$b曾經他們的數量很穩定，但現在森林山貓卻開始侵犯希爾瓦納，而且不久前才發生一連串令人不快的事件。$b$b我懷疑是迷霧拉斯的阿拉卡在背後搞鬼，但目前的問題是與山貓本身有關。$b$b我會很感謝要是你肯幫助我們解決這個問題。', `Objectivetext1` = '森林山貓 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10455;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集4條雷霆王恐狼尾。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 4 Thunderlord Dire Wolf Tails." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 4 Thunderlord Dire Wolf Tails.",  OLD Details : "這些卑鄙的部落種族已經在東邊落腳了。他們帶來了一大隊可怕的恐狼用來作為坐騎及守衛。$B$B這些守衛已經進犯過這座橋隔開了我們。他們一直在偷襲我們生命之林授粉的關鍵生物，精靈龍。$B$B使用東邊的出口穿越血槌深谷的橋樑到東邊的鋸齒山脊去，並將他們的尾巴帶來作為證明!", Details AC enUS : "The filthy races of the Horde have taken over a settlement to the east.  They've brought with them a large pack of the dire wolves that they prefer to use as mounts and sentries.$B$BThese sentries have been marauding across the bridge that separates us.  They've been stalking our fey drakes, which are critical to the pollination of the Living Grove.$B$BUse the east exit to traverse the bridge over Bloodmaul Ravine that leads to the Jagged Ridge to the east, and bring me their tails as proof!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The filthy races of the Horde have taken over a settlement to the east. They've brought with them a large pack of the dire wolves that they prefer to use as mounts and sentries.$b$bThese sentries have been marauding across the bridge that separates us. They've been stalking our fey drakes, which are critical to the pollination of the Living Grove.$b$bUse the east exit to traverse the bridge over Bloodmaul Ravine that leads to the Jagged Ridge to the east, and bring me their tails as proof!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '琳娜·月泉要你帶給她4根雷霆王恐狼尾。完成後，回到劍刃山脈的希爾瓦納找她。', `Details` = '這些卑鄙的部落種族已經在東邊落腳了。他們帶來了一大隊可怕的恐狼用來作為坐騎及守衛。$b$b這些守衛已經進犯過這座橋隔開了我們。他們一直在偷襲我們生命之林授粉的關鍵生物，精靈龍。$b$b使用東邊的出口穿越血槌深谷的橋樑到東邊的鋸齒山脊去，並將他們的尾巴帶來作為證明!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10456;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在5株果樹幼苗身上使用琳娜的樹枝以召喚今後生命之林的防護者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use Rina's Bough on 5 of the Grove Seedlings to summon forth defenses for the Living Grove." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use Rina's Bough on 5 of the Grove Seedlings to summon forth defenses for the Living Grove.",  OLD Details : "雖然你對於保護我們這裡的新家提供了很大的幫助，但我還是覺得生命之林需要更多的防護。$B$B拜託，帶著這個我施放了自然之力的小樹枝。使用在我栽種的樹叢幼苗身上時，就會出現一股暴風雨加快樹人防衛者的成長速度。$B$B這些樹人是這個樹叢的防禦關鍵，特別是如果你不打算把希爾瓦納當成你長久的家。", Details AC enUS : "Though you've done a great deal of good work in defense of our new home here, I still feel that the Living Grove needs more protection.$B$BPlease, take this small tree bough that I have imbued with the force of nature.  When used upon the seedlings that I have planted out in the grove, it will call down a storm to accelerate the growth of a treant defender.$B$BThese treants are critical to the defense of the grove, especially if you choose not to make Sylvanaar your home for long." ; Wowhead enUS : "Though you've done a great deal of good work in defense of our new home here, I still feel that the Living Grove needs more protection.$b$bPlease, take this small tree bough that I have imbued with the force of nature. When used upon the seedlings that I have planted out in the grove, it will call down a storm to accelerate the growth of a treant defender.$b$bThese treants are critical to the defense of the grove, especially if you choose not to make Sylvanaar your home for long.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "召喚生命之林防衛者", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Living Grove Defenders summoned" ; Wowhead enUS : "Living Grove Defenders summoned"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '在5株果樹幼苗身上使用琳娜的樹枝以召喚今後生命之林的防護者。完成後回到劍刃山脈的希爾瓦納找琳娜·月泉。', `Details` = '雖然你對於保護我們這裡的新家提供了很大的幫助，但我還是覺得生命之林需要更多的防護。$b$b拜託，帶著這個我施放了自然之力的小樹枝。使用在我栽種的樹叢幼苗身上時，就會出現一股暴風雨加快樹人防衛者的成長速度。$b$b這些樹人是這個樹叢的防禦關鍵，特別是如果你不打算把希爾瓦納當成你長久的家。', `Objectivetext1` = '生命之林防衛者召喚', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10457;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺掉12個刃翼放血者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay 12 Bladewing Bloodletters." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay 12 Bladewing Bloodletters.",  OLD Details : "在雷霆王被曼諾洛斯之血轉化成魔獄獸人前他們曾是一個驕傲的獸人氏族。$B$B最近我們從污染下游河谷的巨魔手中重新發現了這個獸人村落。他們在雷霆王氏族遺棄這裡後進駐。$B$B我們要保住這個地方，而我需要你來幫忙。$B$B在鋸齒山脊的南方及西方，那裡有一群放血者已經變成我們的災難。他們不停地繁殖。$B$B殺掉他們並於完成後回來找我。", Details AC enUS : "The Thunderlord were once a proud orc clan before they were transformed into fel orcs through the blood of Mannoroth.$B$BRecently we recovered this orc stronghold from the ogres that infest the ravine below.  They had moved in when the Thunderlord clan abandoned it.$B$BWe will keep this place and I will have your help doing so.$B$BIn the Jagged Ridge to the south and the west, there are bloodletters that have become like a plague upon us.  They eat and breed incessantly.$B$BKill them and then return to me." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Thunderlord were once a proud orc clan before they were transformed into fel orcs through the blood of Mannoroth.$b$bRecently we recovered this orc stronghold from the ogres that infest the ravine below. They had moved in when the Thunderlord clan abandoned it.$b$bWe will keep this place and I will have your help doing so.$b$bIn the Jagged Ridge to the south and the west, there are bloodletters that have become like a plague upon us. They eat and breed incessantly.$b$bKill them and then return to me.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bladewing Bloodletter slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '葛德雷克要你去殺掉12個刃翼血信。完成後回到劍刃山脈的雷霆王村找他。', `Details` = '在雷霆王被曼諾洛斯之血轉化成魔獄獸人前他們曾是一個驕傲的獸人氏族。$b$b最近我們從污染下游河谷的巨魔手中重新發現了這個獸人村落。他們在雷霆王氏族遺棄這裡後進駐。$b$b我們要保住這個地方，而我需要你來幫忙。$b$b在鋸齒山脊的南方及西方，那裡有一群放血者已經變成我們的災難。他們不停地繁殖。$b$b殺掉他們並於完成後回來找我。', `Objectivetext1` = '刃翼血信 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10486;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "取得4份精靈龍粉末。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 4 Dusts of the Fey Drake." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 4 Dusts of the Fey Drake.",  OLD Details : "聯盟最近進駐西邊，使用他們精靈法術在短期內建立一個城鎮及果園。我們得將她們的防禦削弱以防她們不會也生出勇氣來。$B$B我有個方法可以達成目的甚至更好。我要你越過橋到西南方去，經過血槌深谷進去生命之林。$B$B攻擊她們在生命之林的精靈龍防禦並將在它們翅膀中找到的魔法粉塵帶回來給我。", Details AC enUS : "The Alliance has recently moved in to the west, using their elven magics to grow a town and grove in a short matter of time.  We must keep their defenses weak so that they do not also grow a spine.$B$BI have a plan that will do that and more.  I want you to traverse the bridge to the southwest, which crosses over Bloodmaul Ravine and leads into the Living Grove.$B$BAttack their fey drake defenses in the Living Grove and bring back the magical dust that sometimes can be found upon their wings." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Alliance has recently moved in to the west, using their elven magics to grow a town and grove in a short matter of time. We must keep their defenses weak so that they do not also grow a spine.$b$bI have a plan that will do that and more. I want you to traverse the bridge to the southwest, which crosses over Bloodmaul Ravine and leads into the Living Grove.$b$bAttack their fey drake defenses in the Living Grove and bring back the magical dust that sometimes can be found upon their wings."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '葛德雷克要你去取得4份精靈龍粉末。完成後，回到劍刃山脈的雷霆王村找他。', `Details` = '聯盟最近進駐西邊，使用他們精靈法術在短期內建立一個城鎮及果園。我們得將她們的防禦削弱以防她們不會也生出勇氣來。$b$b我有個方法可以達成目的甚至更好。我要你越過橋到西南方去，經過血槌深谷進去生命之林。$b$b攻擊她們在生命之林的精靈龍防禦並將在它們翅膀中找到的魔法粉塵帶回來給我。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10487;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在5隻雷霆王恐狼身上使用葛德雷克的藥膏。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use Gor'drek's Ointment on 5 of the Thunderlord Dire Wolves." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use Gor'drek's Ointment on 5 of the Thunderlord Dire Wolves.",  OLD Details : "有了你帶回的魔法粉塵，我製作了一個魔法藥膏可助於我們本身的防護。$B$B我們的恐狼完美的將坐騎，守衛及朋友集結於一身，但是那些聯盟的人渣在鋸齒山脊那獵殺它們。$B$B$n，我要你將這個藥膏使用在我們那些恐狼朋友身上。下一次聯盟再派他們的獵殺團隊來時就會得到一個野蠻的驚喜。$B$B要小心還是有一些狼可能不喜歡這個藥膏，將會反咬你。", Details AC enUS : "With the magical dust you recovered, I have fashioned a magic ointment that will aid in our own defenses.$B$BOur dire wolves are the perfect combination of mount, sentry and friend, but the Alliance scum have been poaching them in the Jagged Ridge.$B$B$N, I want you to take this ointment and apply it to our dire wolf friends.  The Alliance will get a rude surprise the next time that they send one of their hunting parties.$B$BBe aware though that some of the wolves may not like this, and will turn on you." ; Wowhead enUS : "With the magical dust you recovered, I have fashioned a magic ointment that will aid in our own defenses.$b$bOur dire wolves are the perfect combination of mount, sentry and friend, but the Alliance scum have been poaching them in the Jagged Ridge.$b$b$n, I want you to take this ointment and apply it to our dire wolf friends. The Alliance will get a rude surprise the next time that they send one of their hunting parties.$b$bBe aware though that some of the wolves may not like this, and will turn on you."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '在5隻雷霆王恐狼身上使用葛德雷克的藥膏來強化它們及鋸齒山脊的防禦。完成後回到劍刃山脈的雷霆王村找葛德雷克。', `Details` = '有了你帶回的魔法粉塵，我製作了一個魔法藥膏可助於我們本身的防護。$b$b我們的恐狼完美的將坐騎，守衛及朋友集結於一身，但是那些聯盟的人渣在鋸齒山脊那獵殺它們。$b$b$n，我要你將這個藥膏使用在我們那些恐狼朋友身上。下一次聯盟再派他們的獵殺團隊來時就會得到一個野蠻的驚喜。$b$b要小心還是有一些狼可能不喜歡這個藥膏，將會反咬你。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10488;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "取得斯卓霖普‧深根的樹幹。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect Stronglimb Deeproot's Trunk." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect Stronglimb Deeproot's Trunk.",  OLD Details : "懸賞!$B$B斯卓霖普‧深根，戰爭古樹及希爾瓦納南方的生命之林防衛者領袖。$B$B往西邊過了橋後越過血槌深谷就可以找到他。$B$B將他的樹幹帶回給雷霆王村旅館內的吐查克‧雙爪。", Details AC enUS : "WANTED!$B$BStronglimb Deeproot, ancient of war and chief defender of the Living Grove south of Sylvanaar.$B$BFind him by heading west across the bridge that traverses the Bloodmaul Ravine.$B$BReturn his hewn trunk to Tor'chunk Twoclaws." ; Wowhead enUS : "WANTED!$b$bStronglimb Deeproot, ancient of war and chief defender of the Living Grove south of Sylvanaar.$b$bFind him by heading west across the bridge that traverses the Bloodmaul Ravine.$b$bReturn his hewn trunk to Tor'chunk Twoclaws."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '取得斯卓霖普·深根的樹幹並送到劍刃山脈的雷霆王村給吐查克·雙爪。', `Details` = '懸賞!$b$b斯卓霖普·深根，戰爭古樹及希爾瓦納南方的生命之林防衛者領袖。$b$b往西邊過了橋後越過血槌深谷就可以找到他。$b$b將他的大箱帶回給雷霆王村旅館內的吐查克·雙爪。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10489;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在血槌前哨站殺死30個血槌巨魔。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay any 30 Bloodmaul Ogres at Bloodmaul Outpost." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay any 30 Bloodmaul Ogres at Bloodmaul Outpost.",  OLD Details : "希爾瓦納有一個比雷霆王村的部落還要致命的威脅。$B$B我說的是居住在這些山區中的巨魔。這裡的南邊還有東邊，深谷的底部住著血槌氏族。雖然他們並不是唯一威脅我們的巨魔氏族，他們卻是最靠近我們的一族。$B$B我要你往南穿過生命之林，然後轉向東邊的道路前往他們的前哨站。在血槌前哨站盡可能的殺光那些血槌巨魔。", Details AC enUS : "There is a threat to Sylvanaar far deadlier than the Horde at Thunderlord Stronghold.$B$BI'm speaking of the native ogres of these mountains.  Just to the south and east, down in the ravine, lives the Bloodmaul clan.  While they aren't the only group of ogres that threaten us here, they are the closest.$B$BI would have you head south through the Living Grove, and then go down the path to the east, which leads to their outpost.  Slay as many of the Bloodmaul ogres at Bloodmaul Outpost as you can." ; Wowhead enUS : "There is a threat to Sylvanaar far deadlier than the Horde at Thunderlord Stronghold.$b$bI'm speaking of the native ogres of these mountains. Just to the south and east, down in the ravine, lives the Bloodmaul clan. While they aren't the only group of ogres that threaten us here, they are the closest.$b$bI would have you head south through the Living Grove, and then go down the path to the east, which leads to their outpost. Slay as many of the Bloodmaul ogres at Bloodmaul Outpost as you can."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '指揮官天影要你去血槌前哨站殺死30個血槌巨魔。當你完成這個可怕的任務後，回到劍刃山脈的希爾瓦納向他回報。', `Details` = '希爾瓦納有一個比雷霆王村的部落還要致命的威脅。$b$b我說的是居住在這些山區中的巨魔。這裡的南邊還有東邊，深谷的底部住著血槌氏族。雖然他們並不是唯一威脅我們的巨魔氏族，他們卻是最靠近我們的一族。$b$b我要你往南穿過生命之林，然後轉向東邊的道路前往他們的前哨站。在血槌前哨站盡可能的殺光那些血槌巨魔。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10502;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在劍刃要塞還有劍刃庭園殺死30個劍刃巨魔還有10隻劍刃迅猛龍。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay any 30 Bladespire Ogres and 10 Bladespire Raptors at Bladespire Hold and the Bladespire Grounds." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay any 30 Bladespire Ogres and 10 Bladespire Raptors at Bladespire Hold and the Bladespire Grounds.",  OLD Details : "雷霆王村有一個比希爾瓦納的聯盟還要可怕的威脅。$B$B我說的是居住在這些山區中的巨魔。這裡的西邊，深谷的底部住著劍刃氏族。雖然他們並不是唯一威脅我們的巨魔氏族，他們卻是最靠近我們的一族，當初我們就是打敗他們才佔領這個地方。$B$B往北越過鋸齒山脊，然後順著路往下走，你就會到達他們的要塞。在劍刃要塞還有劍刃庭園盡可能的殺光那些劍刃巨魔還有劍刃迅猛龍。", Details AC enUS : "There is a threat to Thunderlord Stronghold worse than the Alliance at Sylvanaar.$B$BI speak of the ogres of these mountains.  Just to the west, down in the ravine, lies the Bladespire clan.  While they aren't the only ogres, they are the closest and they're the ones that we defeated to take this place.$B$BHead north through the Jagged Ridge, and then down the path, which leads to their hold.  Slay as many of the Bladespire ogres and their raptors as you can at Bladespire Hold and the Bladespire Grounds." ; Wowhead enUS : "There is a threat to Thunderlord Stronghold worse than the Alliance at Sylvanaar.$b$bI speak of the ogres of these mountains. Just to the west, down in the ravine, lies the Bladespire clan. While they aren't the only ogres, they are the closest and they're the ones that we defeated to take this place.$b$bHead north through the Jagged Ridge, and then down the path, which leads to their hold. Slay as many of the Bladespire ogres and their raptors as you can at Bladespire Hold and the Bladespire Grounds.",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bladespire Raptor slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '吐查克·雙爪要求你在劍刃要塞還有劍刃庭園殺死30個劍刃巨魔還有10隻劍刃迅猛龍。任務完成時回到劍刃山脈的雷霆王村向他回報。', `Details` = '雷霆王村有一個比希爾瓦納的聯盟還要可怕的威脅。$b$b我說的是居住在這些山區中的巨魔。這裡的西邊，深谷的底部住著劍刃氏族。雖然他們並不是唯一威脅我們的巨魔氏族，他們卻是最靠近我們的一族，當初我們就是打敗他們才佔領這個地方。$b$b往北越過鋸齒山脊，然後順著路往下走，你就會到達他們的要塞。在劍刃要塞還有劍刃庭園盡可能的殺光那些劍刃巨魔還有劍刃迅猛龍。', `Objectivetext2` = '劍刃迅猛龍 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10503;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在劍刃要塞還有劍刃庭園殺死30個劍刃巨魔。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slayl any 30 Bladespire Ogres in Bladespire Hold and the Bladespire Grounds." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slayl any 30 Bladespire Ogres in Bladespire Hold and the Bladespire Grounds.",  OLD Details : "血槌部族的北邊有一個更嚴重的威脅:劍刃要塞。$B$B這些劍刃巨魔是山區之中最強的部族，受到被稱為弒龍者戈魯爾的古羅還有他的七個兒子所支持。$B$B現在我們已經解決了血槌部族，是時候該轉移目標到他們的競爭對手了。$B$B從血槌要塞往北穿過深谷直到你到達劍刃要塞還有劍刃庭園。盡可能殺光裡頭的劍刃巨魔。", Details AC enUS : "To the north of the Bloodmaul clan lies a threat more grave:  Bladespire Hold.$B$BThe Bladespire ogres are the strongest clan in the mountains, having the favor of the gronn known as Gruul the Dragonkiller, and his seven sons.$B$BNow that we've dealt with winnowing the Bloodmaul, it is time to turn our eye upon their rivals.$B$BFrom Bloodmaul Hold head north through the ravine until you come to Bladespire Hold and the Bladespire Grounds.  Slay as many of the Bladespire ogres therein as you can." ; Wowhead enUS : "To the north of the Bloodmaul clan lies a threat more grave: Bladespire Hold.$b$bThe Bladespire ogres are the strongest clan in the mountains, having the favor of the gronn known as Gruul the Dragonkiller, and his seven sons.$b$bNow that we've dealt with winnowing the Bloodmaul, it is time to turn our eye upon their rivals.$b$bFrom Bloodmaul Hold head north through the ravine until you come to Bladespire Hold and the Bladespire Grounds. Slay as many of the Bladespire ogres therein as you can."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '指揮官天影要你在劍刃要塞還有劍刃庭園殺死30個劍刃巨魔。任務完成時回到劍刃山脈的希爾瓦納向他回報。', `Details` = '血槌氏族的北邊有一個更嚴重的威脅:劍刃要塞。$b$b這些劍刃巨魔是山區之中最強的氏族，受到被稱為弒龍者戈魯爾的古羅還有他的七個兒子所支持。$b$b現在我們已經解決了血槌氏族，是時候該轉移目標到他們的競爭對手了。$b$b從血槌要塞往北穿過深谷直到你到達劍刃要塞還有劍刃庭園。盡可能殺光裡頭的劍刃巨魔。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10504;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在血槌前哨站殺死30個血槌巨魔。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay any 30 Bloodmaul Ogres at Bloodmaul Outpost." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay any 30 Bloodmaul Ogres at Bloodmaul Outpost.",  OLD Details : "在劍刃氏族的南方還有另外一個威脅:血槌前哨站。$B$B雖然血槌巨魔不是這些山區中最強的氏族，不受名為弒龍者戈魯爾的古羅厚愛，不過他們緊接在第二名。$B$B現在我們已經解決掉劍刃氏族，是時候轉移焦點對付他們的對手了。$B$B從劍刃要塞往南經過深谷一直走直到你到達血槌前哨站為止。盡你所能的殺光附近的血槌巨魔。", Details AC enUS : "To the south of the Bladespire clan lies yet another threat:  Bloodmaul Outpost.$B$BWhile the Bloodmaul ogres are not the strongest clan in the mountains, not having the favor of the gronn known as Gruul the Dragonkiller, they run a close second.$B$BNow that we've dealt with winnowing the Bladespire, it is time to turn our eye upon their rivals.$B$BFrom Bladespire Hold head south through the ravine until you come to Bloodmaul Outpost.  Slay as many of the Bloodmaul ogres in the vicinity as you can." ; Wowhead enUS : "To the south of the Bladespire clan lies yet another threat: Bloodmaul Outpost.$b$bWhile the Bloodmaul ogres are not the strongest clan in the mountains, not having the favor of the gronn known as Gruul the Dragonkiller, they run a close second.$b$bNow that we've dealt with winnowing the Bladespire, it is time to turn our eye upon their rivals.$b$bFrom Bladespire Hold head south through the ravine until you come to Bloodmaul Outpost. Slay as many of the Bloodmaul ogres in the vicinity as you can."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '吐查克·雙爪要你在血槌前哨站殺死30個血槌巨魔。任務完成時回到劍刃山脈的雷霆王村向他回報。', `Details` = '在劍刃氏族的南方還有另外一個威脅:血槌前哨站。$b$b雖然血槌巨魔不是這些山區中最強的氏族，不受名為弒龍者戈魯爾的古羅厚愛，不過他們緊接在第二名。$b$b現在我們已經解決掉劍刃氏族，是時候轉移焦點對付他們的對手了。$b$b從劍刃要塞往南經過深谷一直走直到你到達血槌前哨站為止。盡你所能的殺光附近的血槌巨魔。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10505;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在血槌前哨站及血槌深谷，使用琳娜‧月泉的縮小粉末在5隻血槌恐狼身上。", Objectives AC enUS : "Apply Rina's Diminution Powder to 5 of the Bloodmaul Dire Wolves at Bloodmaul Outpost and in Bloodmaul Ravine." ; Wowhead enUS : "Apply Rina's Diminution Powder to 5 of the Bloodmaul Dire Wolves at Bloodmaul Outpost and in Bloodmaul Ravine.",  OLD Details : "因為狼群的減少，部落正在尋找代替品。不幸的是附近剛好有可替代的狼。$B$B在東邊深谷下方的血槌巨魔養了一大群強壯的狼作為他們自己的守衛。我不想派你去殺掉那些恐狼，那麼為何這次我們不做點不同的呢？$B$B我已經由精靈龍的翅膀所自然落下的粉塵中提煉出一種魔法粉末。將它灑在那些恐灰狼的身上使部落對他們失去興趣。", Details AC enUS : "With their wolf pack reduced, the Horde is looking for replacements.  Unfortunately there's another source nearby.$B$BThe Bloodmaul ogres in the ravine below to the east keep a strong pack as their own sentries.  I hated sending you to kill the Thunderlord wolves, so why don't we do something different this time?$B$BI've derived a magic powder from the dust that naturally falls off the wings of our fey drakes.  Sprinkle it on the Bloodmaul dire wolves to make them undesirable to the Horde." ; Wowhead enUS : "With their wolf pack reduced, the Horde is looking for replacements. Unfortunately there's another source nearby.$b$bThe Bloodmaul ogres in the ravine below to the east keep a strong pack as their own sentries. I hated sending you to kill the Thunderlord wolves, so why don't we do something different this time?$b$bI've derived a magic powder from the dust that naturally falls off the wings of our fey drakes. Sprinkle it on the Bloodmaul dire wolves to make them undesirable to the Horde."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '琳娜·月泉要你帶著她的縮小粉末並使用在5隻血槌恐狼身上，你可以在血槌前哨站及血槌深谷找到這些狼群。完成後，回到劍刃山脈的希爾瓦納找她。', `Details` = '因為狼群的減少，部落正在尋找代替品。不幸的是附近剛好有可替代的狼。$b$b在東邊深谷下方的血槌巨魔養了一大群強壯的狼作為他們自己的守衛。我不想派你去殺掉那些恐狼，那麼為何這次我們不做點不同的呢?$b$b我已經由精靈龍的翅膀所自然落下的粉塵中提煉出一種魔法粉末。將它灑在那些恐灰狼的身上使部落對他們失去興趣。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10506;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集5個德萊尼礦坑水晶。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 5 Draenethyst Mine Crystals." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 5 Draenethyst Mine Crystals.",  OLD Details : "看到有人願意幫助這裡真的是太好了!$B$B波爾葛利姆和我是探險者協會的一員，我們到這是要知道我們能從這些山中得到什麼。我們聽過各種不同的傳說，我等不及要紮營開始探險。$B$B有一個東西特別吸引了我的注意力。夜精靈提到東邊深谷下面有個地方叫做德萊尼礦坑。就在血槌前哨站的南方盡頭。我想要那邊土生土長的一些水晶。", Details AC enUS : "Well it's good to see someone who's willing to help out around here!$B$BBorgrim and I are part of the Explorers' League, and we're here to learn what we can of these mountains.  We've heard all sorts of tales, and I can't wait to get settled in and started.$B$BOne thing in particular has caught my attention.  The night elves speak of a place down in the ravine to the east known as the Draenethyst Mine.  It's at the south end of Bloodmaul Outpost.  I'd like some of the crystals that grow naturally therein." ; Wowhead enUS : "Well it's good to see someone who's willing to help out around here!$b$bBorgrim and I are part of the Explorers' League, and we're here to learn what we can of these mountains. We've heard all sorts of tales, and I can't wait to get settled in and started.$b$bOne thing in particular has caught my attention. The night elves speak of a place down in the ravine to the east known as the Draenethyst Mine. It's at the south end of Bloodmaul Outpost. I'd like some of the crystals that grow naturally therein."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '波爾葛利姆·頑錘要你去收集5個德萊尼礦坑水晶然後回到劍刃山脈的希爾瓦納找她。', `Details` = '看到有人願意幫助這裡真的是太好了!$b$b波爾葛利姆和我是探險者協會的一員，我們到這是要知道我們能從這些山中得到什麼。我們聽過各種不同的傳說，我等不及要紮營開始探險。$b$b有一個東西特別吸引了我的注意力。夜精靈提到東邊深谷下面有個地方叫做德萊尼礦坑。就在血槌前哨站的南方盡頭。我想要那邊土生土長的一些水晶。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10510;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集11瓶血槌蠻禁烈酒。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 11 Bloodmaul Brutebane Brew." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 11 Bloodmaul Brutebane Brew.",  OLD Details : "如果我要現在就開始這個假期，那麼我就需要更多的酒。不幸的是，這些精靈們根本不懂發酵的藝術。$B$B我偶然聽到深谷那邊的血槌巨魔有很多的酒。我想要試看看。$B$B幫我個忙吧？往南方出發經過生命之林，接著下了斜坡往東進入血槌前哨站帶幾瓶酒給我？我聽說他們有幾大桶的酒就放在附近而釀酒大師會帶著酒到處提供給所有的巨魔。", Details AC enUS : "If I'm going to start this vacation out right, then I'm going to need more brew.  Unfortunately, the elves know nothing of the fine art of fermentation.$B$BI overheard that the Bloodmaul ogres down in the ravine have plenty.  I'm willing to give it a try.$B$BDo me a favor?  Head south through the Living Grove and then down the ramp to the east into Bloodmaul Outpost and procure me some?  I hear they have big barrels of it laying around and that their brewmasters carry it around to all the other ogres." ; Wowhead enUS : "If I'm going to start this vacation out right, then I'm going to need more brew. Unfortunately, the elves know nothing of the fine art of fermentation.$b$bI overheard that the Bloodmaul ogres down in the ravine have plenty. I'm willing to give it a try.$b$bDo me a favor? Head south through the Living Grove and then down the ramp to the east into Bloodmaul Outpost and procure me some? I hear they have big barrels of it laying around and that their brewmasters carry it around to all the other ogres."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '波爾葛利姆·頑槌要你拿到11瓶血槌蠻禁烈酒給他。一旦你完成後，將這個帶到劍刃山脈的希爾瓦納給他。', `Details` = '如果我要現在就開始這個假期，那麼我就需要更多的酒。不幸的是，這些精靈們根本不懂發酵的藝術。$b$b我偶然聽到深谷那邊的血槌巨魔有很多的酒。我想要試看看。$b$b幫我個忙吧?往南方出發經過生命之林，接著下了斜坡往東進入血槌前哨站帶幾瓶酒給我?我聽說他們有幾大桶的酒就放在附近而釀酒大師會帶著酒到處提供給所有的巨魔。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10511;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "用血槌蠻禁烈酒把5個劍刃巨魔灌醉。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use the Bloodmaul Brutebane Keg in an attempt to get 5 Bladespire Ogres drunk." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use the Bloodmaul Brutebane Keg in an attempt to get 5 Bladespire Ogres drunk.",  OLD Details : "我不會再嚐一口那個難聞的穢物！不過這倒是給了我一個點子。$B$B<波爾葛利姆眼中閃了一下。>$B$B計畫是這樣的。我們知道那些血槌氏族實際上每天都要牛飲這些東西。但我好奇他們的敵人，劍刃巨魔，是怎樣想的？$B$B$n，我要你帶著這些剩下的廢物去看看是否能夠讓這些劍刃巨魔喝醉。你可以從血槌前哨站往北通過深谷的地方找到他們。", Details AC enUS : "I'll not take another sip of that ill-smelling muck!  But it does give me an idea.$B$B<Borgrim gets a twinkle in his eye.>$B$BSo here's the plan.  We know that the Bloodmaul practically live off of this swill.  But I wonder what their enemies, the Bladespire ogres, think of it?$B$B$N, I want you to take the rest of this rubbish and see if you can get the Bladespire ogres tanked.  You can find them by heading north from Bloodmaul Outpost through the ravine." ; Wowhead enUS : "I'll not take another sip of that ill-smelling muck! But it does give me an idea.$b$b<Borgrim gets a twinkle in his eye.>$b$bSo here's the plan. We know that the Bloodmaul practically live off of this swill. But I wonder what their enemies, the Bladespire ogres, think of it?$b$b$n, I want you to take the rest of this rubbish and see if you can get the Bladespire ogres tanked. You can find them by heading north from Bloodmaul Outpost through the ravine.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "灌醉劍刃巨魔", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Bladespire Ogres drunk" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bladespire Ogres drunk"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '帶著這個血槌蠻禁烈酒並試著用來讓5個劍刃巨魔喝醉。如果你成功了，回到劍刃山脈的希爾瓦納找波爾葛利姆。', `Details` = '我不會再嚐一口那個難聞的穢物!不過這倒是給了我一個點子。$b$b<波爾葛利姆眼中閃了一下。>$b$b計畫是這樣的。我們知道那些血槌氏族實際上每天都要牛飲這些東西。但我好奇他們的敵人，劍刃巨魔，是怎樣想的?$b$b$n，我要你帶著這些剩下的廢物去看看是否能夠讓這些劍刃巨魔喝醉。你可以從血槌前哨站往北通過深谷的地方找到他們。', `Objectivetext1` = '喝醉的劍刃巨魔', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10512;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集復仇者瓦黎恩之刃及復仇者瓦黎恩之盾。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect Vindicator Vuuleen's Blade and Vindicator Vuuleen's Shield." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect Vindicator Vuuleen's Blade and Vindicator Vuuleen's Shield.",  OLD Details : "我知道這很怪，但我真的想要待在這個籠子裡。這讓我有絕佳的機會去進行我來這要做的事;收集劍刃氏族的資訊。$B$B我隨時都可以離開，不過我想要取回我的劍跟盾。$B$B他們的兩位領導者擁有我的裝備。卓克嘎姆擁有我的劍而瑪格多克擁有我的盾。$B$B要是你有需要的話，拿著並使用這個來自血槌前哨站的啤酒到南邊去降低他們的防衛並引誘他們兩個，不過要小心他們那些沒喝酒還清醒著的守衛!", Details AC enUS : "I know it's strange, but I do want to stay in this cage.  It gives me the perfect opportunity to do what I came here for; to gather information on the Bladespire.$B$BI can leave at any time, but I would like to have my sword and shield back.$B$BTwo of their leaders have my trappings.  Droggam has my sword and Mugdorg has my shield.$B$BIf you have need, obtain and use the brew from Bloodmaul Outpost to the south to thin out their help and entice those two, but beware their sober guards who don't drink!" ; Wowhead enUS : "I know it's strange, but I do want to stay in this cage. It gives me the perfect opportunity to do what I came here for; to gather information on the Bladespire.$b$bI can leave at any time, but I would like to have my sword and shield back.$b$bTwo of their leaders have my trappings. Droggam has my sword and Mugdorg has my shield.$b$bIf you have need, obtain and use the brew from Bloodmaul Outpost to the south to thin out their help and entice those two, but beware their sober guards who don't drink!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '帶回復仇者瓦黎恩之刃及復仇者瓦黎恩之盾。然後將這兩項物品帶回劍刃山脈的劍刃要塞給復仇者瓦黎恩。', `Details` = '我知道這很怪，但我真的想要待在這個籠子裡。這讓我有絕佳的機會去進行我來這要做的事;收集劍刃氏族的資訊。$b$b我隨時都可以離開，不過我想要取回我的劍跟盾。$b$b他們的兩位領導者擁有我的裝備。卓克嘎姆擁有我的劍而瑪格多克擁有我的盾。$b$b要是你有需要的話，拿著並使用這個來自血槌前哨站的啤酒到南邊去降低他們的防衛並引誘他們兩個，不過要小心他們那些沒喝酒還清醒著的守衛!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10516;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "哥爾迪姆，你的死期到了...", Title AC enUS : "Gorr'Dim, Your Time Has Come..." ; Wowhead enUS : "Gorr'Dim, Your Time Has Come...",  OLD Objectives : "殺掉劍刃要塞巨魔的首領，哥爾迪姆。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay Gorr'Dim, leader of the Bladespire Hold ogres." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay Gorr'Dim, leader of the Bladespire Hold ogres.",  OLD Details : "劍刃要塞的領導者叫哥爾迪姆，相信我…這個名字很適合他。$B$B但我不會低估他的，他畢竟成功提升了自己氏族的地位，現在成為弒龍者戈魯爾最信賴的氏族。如今他們支配著這些山脈。哥爾迪姆隨時都有一位隨扈跟在身邊，其中還有滴酒不沾的防衛者。$B$B為了希爾瓦納的安全，我需要你回去解決他。", Details AC enUS : "The leader of Bladespire Hold is known as Gorr'Dim.  Trust me... the name is appropriate.$B$BStill, I wouldn't underestimate him.  He's crafty enough to have elevated his clan to be the favorite of Gruul the Dragonkiller and they now dominate these mountains.  And Gorr'Dim keeps an entourage about him at all times, including defenders who are sworn not to drink the Bloodmaul brew.$B$BFor the safety of Sylvanaar, I'm asking that you go back in there and deal with him." ; Wowhead enUS : "The leader of Bladespire Hold is known as Gorr'Dim. Trust me... the name is appropriate.$b$bStill, I wouldn't underestimate him. He's crafty enough to have elevated his clan to be the favorite of Gruul the Dragonkiller and they now dominate these mountains. And Gorr'Dim keeps an entourage about him at all times, including defenders who are sworn not to drink the Bloodmaul brew.$b$bFor the safety of Sylvanaar, I'm asking that you go back in there and deal with him.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Gorr'Dim slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '哥爾迪姆，你的死期到了……', `Objectives` = '復仇者瓦黎恩要你去殺掉哥爾迪姆，劍刃要塞巨魔的首領。一旦完成後，回到劍刃山脈的尖石要塞找她。', `Details` = '劍刃要塞的領導者叫哥爾迪姆。相信我……這個名字很適合他。$b$b雖然如此，我不會低估他的。他詭計多端的使他的氏族成為弒龍者戈魯爾的親信，如今他們支配著這些山脈。而且無時無刻都有一位隨扈跟隨在哥爾迪姆身邊，包括發誓不沾血槌酒的防衛者。$b$b為了希爾瓦納的安全，我要你回去那裡解決掉他。', `Objectivetext1` = '哥爾迪姆 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10517;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "插上旌旗", Title AC enUS : "Planting the Banner" ; Wowhead enUS : "Planting the Banner",  OLD Objectives : "在北槌哨塔頂端使用劍刃旌旗來誘引葛恩‧葛羅巴諾斯。然後帶回劍刃氏族旌旗跟葛恩‧葛羅巴諾斯的頭盔。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use the Bladespire Banner atop the Northmaul Tower to lure Gurn Grubnosh.  Collect the Bladespire Clan Banner and the Helm of Gurn Grubnosh." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use the Bladespire Banner atop the Northmaul Tower to lure Gurn Grubnosh.  Collect the Bladespire Clan Banner and the Helm of Gurn Grubnosh.",  OLD Details : "我要你去從他們的一位勇士身上將劍刃旌旗偷來，帶到南方的血槌前哨站去。將旗插在他們的北槌哨塔上。$B$B這樣會激怒血槌氏族，他們會毫不留情的攻擊你。不過這樣也會將他們的敵意集中在劍刃要塞上，進而遠離希爾瓦納。$B$B在你打倒葛恩‧葛羅巴諾斯拿到他的頭盔時就表示你完成任務了。將頭盔帶回希爾瓦納去。$B$B$n，這並不容易。帶一兩個朋友跟你一起去吧。", Details AC enUS : "I want you to steal the Bladespire banner from one of their champions and take it south to Bloodmaul Outpost.  Plant it atop their Northmaul Tower.$B$BThis will infuriate the Bloodmaul and they will attack you relentlessly.  But it will also keep their hatred focused on Bladespire Hold, and away from Sylvanaar.$B$BYou will know you have accomplished the deed when you have defeated Gurn Grubnosh and taken his helm.  Return it to Sylvanaar.$B$B$N, this isn't going to be easy.  Take a  friend or two with you." ; Wowhead enUS : "I want you to steal the Bladespire banner from one of their champions and take it south to Bloodmaul Outpost. Plant it atop their Northmaul Tower.$b$bThis will infuriate the Bloodmaul and they will attack you relentlessly. But it will also keep their hatred focused on Bladespire Hold, and away from Sylvanaar.$b$bYou will know you have accomplished the deed when you have defeated Gurn Grubnosh and taken his helm. Return it to Sylvanaar.$b$b$n, this isn't going to be easy. Take a friend or two with you."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '插上戰旗', `Objectives` = '在北槌哨塔頂端使用劍刃旗幟來誘引葛恩·葛羅巴諾斯。將旗幟跟葛恩·葛羅巴諾斯的頭盔送到劍刃山脈的希爾瓦納給指揮官天影。', `Details` = '我要你去從他們的一位勇士身上將劍刃旗幟偷來，帶到南方的血槌前哨站去。將旗插在他們的北槌哨塔上。$b$b這樣會激怒血槌氏族，他們會毫不留情的攻擊你。不過這樣也會將他們的敵意集中在劍刃要塞上，進而遠離希爾瓦納。$b$b在你打倒葛恩·葛羅巴諾斯拿到他的頭盔時就表示你完成任務了。將頭盔帶回希爾瓦納去。$b$b$n，這並不容易。帶一兩個朋友跟你一起去吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10518;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "協助大德魯伊", Title AC enUS : "Assisting Arch Druid Staghelm" ; Wowhead enUS : "Assisting Arch Druid Staghelm",  OLD Objectives : "與達納蘇斯的大德魯伊范達爾·鹿盔談一談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.",  OLD Details : "打擾一下，$c，如果可能的話，我想佔用你一點時間。$B$B達納蘇斯的塞納裡奧議會希望能找到像你這樣經驗豐富的冒險家來幫助他們進行一項重要的研究項目。雖然我不知道詳細的情況，但是我可以告訴你，正是伊范達爾·鹿盔親自負責這項研究。$B$B要是你感興趣的話，請直接去達納蘇斯的塞納裡奧區找他談談。", Details AC enUS : "Excuse me $c, but I'd like just a moment of your time if possible.$B$BThe Cenarion Circle in Darnassus is looking for seasoned adventurers such as yourself to lend them aid in a vital research project.  While I do not know the specifics, I can inform you that none other than Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm is spearheading this research.$B$BPlease - if you are interested, speak with him directly in the Cenarion Enclave within Darnassus proper." ; Wowhead enUS : "Excuse me $c, but I'd like just a moment of your time if possible.$b$bThe Cenarion Circle in Darnassus is looking for seasoned adventurers such as yourself to lend them aid in a vital research project. While I do not know the specifics, I can inform you that none other than Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm is spearheading this research.$b$bPlease - if you are interested, speak with him directly in the Cenarion Enclave within Darnassus proper."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '協助大德魯伊鹿盔', `Objectives` = '與達納蘇斯的大德魯伊范達爾·鹿盔談話。', `Details` = '打擾一下，$c，如果可能的話，我想佔用你一點時間。$b$b達納蘇斯的塞納里奧議會希望能找到像你這樣經驗豐富的冒險家來幫助他們進行一項重要的研究項目。雖然我不知道詳細的情況，但是我可以告訴你，正是伊范達爾·鹿盔親自負責這項研究。$b$b要是你感興趣的話，請直接去達納蘇斯的塞納里奧區找他談談。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10520;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集雷霆王氏族大鼓，雷霆王氏族之箭以及雷霆王氏族石板。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect the Thunderlord Clan Drum, Thunderlord Clan Arrow and the Thunderlord Clan Tablet." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect the Thunderlord Clan Drum, Thunderlord Clan Arrow and the Thunderlord Clan Tablet.",  OLD Details : "神器上的標記指出它原來是由雷霆王氏族獸人製造的。這些獸人在變成魔獄獸人之前曾住在雷霆王村這。$B$B血錘巨魔曾暫時居住在這個村落直到最近被部落趕走了。你曾經聽說過人們試著尋找其他遺失的神器。你的腦海中浮現關於這些神器的記憶，那是一個鼓、一支箭及一片石板。$B$B到劍刃要塞去找到它們並帶回給洛克嘎‧血握。", Details AC enUS : "The artifact bears markings that indicate its origins as being created by the Thunderlord clan orcs.  These orcs used to live at Thunderlord Stronghold before they were changed into fel orcs.$B$BFor a time the Bladespire ogres inhabited the stronghold until recently when the Horde pushed them out.$B$BYou've heard of other artifacts that were lost.  A drum, an arrow and a tablet come to mind as objects that you know are being sought after.$B$BFind them in Bladespire Hold and return them to Rokgar Bloodgrip." ; Wowhead enUS : "The artifact bears markings that indicate its origins as being created by the Thunderlord clan orcs. These orcs used to live at Thunderlord Stronghold before they were changed into fel orcs.$b$bFor a time the Bladespire ogres inhabited the stronghold until recently when the Horde pushed them out.$b$bYou've heard of other artifacts that were lost. A drum, an arrow and a tablet come to mind as objects that you know are being sought after.$b$bFind them in Bladespire Hold and return them to Rokgar Bloodgrip."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '取回雷霆王氏族大鼓，雷霆王氏族之箭以及雷霆王氏族石板。將它們隨同雷霆王氏族手工藝品一起帶回，交給劍刃山脈雷霆王村的洛克嘎·血握。', `Details` = '神器上的標記指出它原來是由雷霆王氏族獸人製造的。這些獸人在變成魔獄獸人之前曾住在雷霆王村這。$b$b血錘巨魔曾暫時居住在這個村落直到最近被部落趕走了。你曾經聽說過人們試著尋找其他遺失的神器。你的腦海中浮現關於這些神器的記憶，那是一個鼓、一支箭及一片石板。$b$b到劍刃要塞去找到它們並帶回給洛克嘎·血握。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10524;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "使用熾熱之魂碎片將你的靈魂轉化成幻象導覽模式。在你的幻象導覽帶領你找到最後一個雷霆王神器的所在地。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use the Fiery Soul Fragment to transform your spirit into a vision guide, which will reveal the location of the final Thunderlord artifact." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use the Fiery Soul Fragment to transform your spirit into a vision guide, which will reveal the location of the final Thunderlord artifact.",  OLD Details : "$R笨蛋。你差點毀掉這個鼓!$B$B我費盡千辛萬苦來到這裡，直到現在才有所收穫。至少你能夠在別人都失敗，或是更慘的地方成功。$B$B是時候喚出幻象來引領你找到最後一個我一直在找尋的神器。$B$B拿著這個代表我的靈魂的熾熱之魂碎片。用它來將你的身體轉化為火，將你的靈魂變為幻象指引你前往最後發現雷霆王神器的位置。", Details AC enUS : "$R fool.  You almost destroyed the drum!$B$BI've worked too hard to get here, and my hands have been empty up until now.  At least you were able to succeed where the others only met with failure, or worse.$B$BIt is time to evoke a vision that will lead you to the last relic that I have been seeking.$B$BTake this fiery fragment of my soul.  Use it to transform your body into flame and denature your spirit into a vision guide that will shoot forth to reveal the location of the final Thunderlord relic." ; Wowhead enUS : "$r fool. You almost destroyed the drum!$b$bI've worked too hard to get here, and my hands have been empty up until now. At least you were able to succeed where the others only met with failure, or worse.$b$bIt is time to evoke a vision that will lead you to the last relic that I have been seeking.$b$bTake this fiery fragment of my soul. Use it to transform your body into flame and denature your spirit into a vision guide that will shoot forth to reveal the location of the final Thunderlord relic."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '使用熾熱之魂碎片將你的靈魂轉化成幻象導覽模式。在你的幻象導覽帶領你找到最後一個雷霆王神器的所在地後，與雷霆王村的洛克嘎·血握談談。', `Details` = '$r笨蛋。你差點毀掉這個鼓!$b$b我費盡千辛萬苦來到這裡，直到現在才有所收獲。至少你能夠在別人都失敗，或是更慘的地方成功。$b$b是時候喚出幻象來引領你找到最後一個我一直在找尋的神器。$b$b拿著這個代表我的靈魂的熾熱之魂碎片。用它來將你的身體轉化為火，將你的靈魂變為幻象指引你前往最後發現雷霆王神器的位置。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10525;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "取回雷霆之矛。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect the Thunderspike." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect the Thunderspike.",  OLD Details : "如果那個我讓你看見的幻象屬實，那麼你就得往下到河谷以及血槌深谷的南方盡頭。在那你會找到德萊尼礦坑。$B$B到礦坑的後方去，取得雷霆之矛。不用管其他東西!我對於礦坑內的水晶沒有興趣，還有巨魔也是一樣。$B$B一但你拿到這個矛就馬上帶回來這裡給我!$B$B還有，$n，你要非常小心...我可不願去想要是它有任何損傷的話你會發生什麼事。", Details AC enUS : "If the vision that I granted you is true, then you must travel down into the ravine and to the south end of Bloodmaul Ravine.  There you will find the Draenethyst Mine.$B$BJourney to the back of the mine, and retrieve the Thunderspike.  Ignore everything else!  I have no interest in the crystals of the mine, nor the ogres therein.$B$BAs soon as you have the spear return it to me here!$B$BAnd, $N, be very careful with it... I would hate to think what would happen to you should you break it." ; Wowhead enUS : "If the vision that I granted you is true, then you must travel down into the ravine and to the south end of Bloodmaul Ravine. There you will find the Draenethyst Mine.$b$bJourney to the back of the mine, and retrieve the Thunderspike. Ignore everything else! I have no interest in the crystals of the mine, nor the ogres therein.$b$bAs soon as you have the spear return it to me here!$b$bAnd, $n, be very careful with it... I would hate to think what would happen to you should you break it."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '洛克嘎·血握派你去取回雷霆之矛。將它帶回劍刃山脈的雷霆王村給她。', `Details` = '如果那個我讓你看見的幻象屬實，那麼你就得往下到河谷以及血槌深谷的南方盡頭。在那你會找到德萊尼礦坑。$b$b到礦坑的後方去，取得雷霆之矛。不用管其他東西!我對於礦坑內的水晶沒有興趣，還有巨魔也是一樣。$b$b一但你拿到這個矛就馬上帶回來這裡給我!$b$b還有，$n，你要非常小心……我可不願去想要是它有任何損傷的話你會發生什麼事。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10526;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "取得提洽里的水煙筒還有10份血槌蠻禁烈酒。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect T'chali's Hookah and 10 Bloodmaul Brutebane Brews." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect T'chali's Hookah and 10 Bloodmaul Brutebane Brews.",  OLD Details : "提洽里曾經是一個非常友善的食人妖。我來這裡是為了？血槌氏族如何釀造酒。但是如果我這樣做，血槌氏族會埋了提洽里然後讓他的屍體放在這裡腐爛！$B$B最不好的事情是他們偷走了我的水煙筒！$B$B那麼，你想要幫助提洽里嗎？你幫我找回我的水煙筒。提洽里認為偷走它的巨魔往西南方礦坑的礦坑方向去了。$B$B還有當你到那邊的時候，順便撿一些酒！", Details AC enUS : "T'chali used to be a pretty friendly troll.  Me come down here to teach the Bloodmaul how to brew their beer.  But once me do that, the Bloodmaul bury T'chali and leave him here to rot!$B$BThe worst part of it was that they stole me hookah!$B$BSo, you want to help T'chali?  You bring me hookah back.  T'chali think the ogres that stole it headed southwest over by the mine.$B$BAnd while you're in there, pick up some brews, too!" ; Wowhead enUS : "T'chali used to be a pretty friendly troll. Me come down here to teach the Bloodmaul how to brew their beer. But once me do that, the Bloodmaul bury T'chali and leave him here to rot!$b$bThe worst part of it was that they stole me hookah!$b$bSo, you want to help T'chali? You bring me hookah back. T'chali think the ogres that stole it headed southwest over by the mine.$b$bAnd while you're in there, pick up some brews, too!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '取得提洽里的水煙筒還有10份血槌蠻禁烈酒。帶到劍刃山脈交給血槌深谷的巫醫提洽里。', `Details` = '提洽里曾經是一個非常友善的食人妖。我來這裡是為了?血槌氏族如何釀造酒。但是如果我這樣做，血槌氏族會埋了提洽里然後讓他的屍體放在這裡腐爛!$b$b最不好的事情是他們偷走了我的水煙筒!$b$b那麼，你想要幫助提洽里嗎?你幫我找回我的水煙筒。提洽里認為偷走它的巨魔往西南方礦坑的礦坑方向去了。$b$b還有當你到那邊的時候，順便撿一些酒!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10542;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死葛瑞諾克‧巴拓伯恩還有柯爾卡赫。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay Grimnok Battleborn and Korgaah." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay Grimnok Battleborn and Korgaah.",  OLD Details : "提洽里一直在等待著他復仇的時刻!$B$B他們活埋提洽里讓他自生自滅的那天，就是由葛瑞諾克‧巴拓伯恩領導。隔天劍刃氏族的柯爾卡赫到南方發動攻擊的時候踢到提洽里的頭。$B$B我要他們死光光!$B$B你可以在血槌前哨站的南槌哨塔頂端找到葛瑞諾克。柯爾卡赫則在劍刃要塞最北邊的一棟建築物的頂端。柯爾卡赫的身邊有清醒的防衛者，所以你要使用這瓶酒來引誘他離開他們。", Details AC enUS : "T'chali has been waiting for his revenge!$B$BThe day they bury T'chali and leave him to die, it was Grimnok Battleborn that led them.  And the next day it was Korgaah that come south to raid and kick T'chali in the head.$B$BI want them dead!$B$BYou will find Grimnok atop the Southmaul Tower in Bloodmaul Outpost.  You will find Korgaah in the top of a building at the north end of Bladespire Hold.  Korgaah has sober defenders, so use the brew to distract him away from them, because they won't drink." ; Wowhead enUS : "T'chali has been waiting for his revenge!$b$bThe day they bury T'chali and leave him to die, it was Grimnok Battleborn that led them. And the next day it was Korgaah that come south to raid and kick T'chali in the head.$b$bI want them dead!$b$bYou will find Grimnok atop the Southmaul Tower in Bloodmaul Outpost. You will find Korgaah in the top of a building at the north end of Bladespire Hold. Korgaah has sober defenders, so use the brew to distract him away from them, because they won't drink.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Grimnok Battleborn slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Korgaah slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '巫醫提洽里要你殺死最令他痛苦的人，葛瑞諾克·巴拓伯恩還有柯爾卡赫。完成後回到劍刃山脈的血槌深谷找他。', `Details` = '提洽里一直在等待著他復仇的時刻!$b$b他們活埋提洽里讓他自生自滅的那天，就是由葛瑞諾克·巴拓伯恩領導。隔天劍刃氏族的柯爾卡赫到南方發動攻擊的時候踢到提洽里的頭。$b$b我要他們死光光!$b$b你可以在血槌前哨站的南槌哨塔頂端找到葛瑞諾克。柯爾卡赫則在劍刃要塞最北邊的一棟建築物的頂端。柯爾卡赫的身邊有清醒的防衛者，所以你要使用這瓶酒來引誘他離開他們。', `Objectivetext1` = '葛瑞諾克·巴拓伯恩 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '柯爾卡赫 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10543;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "使用邪惡重型神像詛咒5個在劍刃要塞的建築物或者高塔以及血槌前哨站的2個建築物或者高塔。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use the Wicked Strong Fetish to curse 5 buildings or towers in Bladespire Hold and 2 in Bloodmaul Outpost." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use the Wicked Strong Fetish to curse 5 buildings or towers in Bladespire Hold and 2 in Bloodmaul Outpost.",  OLD Details : "提洽里要向所有的巨魔復仇!$B$B提洽里在世的時候曾經是一個法力強大的巫醫。假如你去我的墳墓就可以找到邪惡重型神像。$B$B將神像的魔力灌注在劍刃要塞還有血槌前哨站的建築物以及塔的門口。你對他們下的巫毒將會召喚出一個邪惡的靈魂而你必須擊敗它。如此你就可以詛咒他們的建築物。$B$B但是要注意，假如你嘗試去詛咒一個已經被詛咒的建築物，你將會喚出另一個詛咒的靈魂!", Details AC enUS : "T'chali wants revenge on all of the ogres!$B$BT'chali was a powerful witch doctor in life.  If you reach into me grave you will find a wicked strong fetish.$B$BInvoke the fetish's magic at the entrances to the buildings and towers of both Bladespire Hold and Bloodmaul Outpost.  The voodoo you work will summon an evil spirit that you must defeat.  This in turn will curse that building.$B$BBeware, if you attempt to curse a building that is already cursed, you will call down another cursed spirit!" ; Wowhead enUS : "T'chali wants revenge on all of the ogres!$b$bT'chali was a powerful witch doctor in life. If you reach into me grave you will find a wicked strong fetish.$b$bInvoke the fetish's magic at the entrances to the buildings and towers of both Bladespire Hold and Bloodmaul Outpost. The voodoo you work will summon an evil spirit that you must defeat. This in turn will curse that building.$b$bBeware, if you attempt to curse a building that is already cursed, you will call down another cursed spirit!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "詛咒刀塔要塞的建築物", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Bladespire Hold building cursed" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bladespire Hold building cursed",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "詛咒血槌前哨站建築物", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "Bloodmaul Outpost building cursed" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bloodmaul Outpost building cursed"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '使用邪惡重型神像詛咒5個在劍刃要塞的建築物或者高塔以及血槌前哨站的2個建築物或者高塔。任務完成時回到劍刃山脈的血槌深谷找巫醫提洽里。', `Details` = '提洽里要向所有的巨魔復仇!$b$b提洽里在世的時候曾經是一個法力強大的巫醫。假如你去我的墳墓就可以找到邪惡重型神像。$b$b將神像的魔力灌注在劍刃要塞還有血槌前哨站的建築物以及塔的門口。你對他們下的巫毒將會召喚出一個邪惡的靈魂而你必須擊敗它。如此你就可以詛咒他們的建築物。$b$b但是要注意，假如你嘗試去詛咒一個已經被詛咒的建築物，你將會喚出另一個詛咒的靈魂!', `Objectivetext1` = '已詛咒劍刃要塞建築物', `Objectivetext2` = '已詛咒血槌前哨站建築物', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10544;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "用血槌蠻禁烈酒灌醉5個劍刃巨魔。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use the Bloodmaul Brutebane Keg to get 5 Bladespire Ogres drunk." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use the Bloodmaul Brutebane Keg to get 5 Bladespire Ogres drunk.",  OLD Details : "正如提洽里所說，他幫他的血槌朋友釀造酒。但是他卻沒說背後的原因。$B$B血槌氏族正在面對可怕的困境。劍刃氏族快打垮他們了，而他們需要新的武器來幫助戰鬥。$B$B這個時候提洽里想出了一個很棒的方法。為什麼不釀造一種完美的酒，使這種酒可以提高你們的力量同時又削弱敵人的戰鬥力呢？只不過，提洽里不知道這個方法是否能成功。$B$B所以，你必須把這種酒帶到劍刃要塞看它是否有效用！", Details AC enUS : "As T'chali was saying, he helped out his Bloodmaul friends to make their brew.  But what T'chali did not say was why.$B$BThe Bloodmaul are in dire straits.  The Bladespire clan be crushing them, and they needed a new weapon to help out with their fight.$B$BThat's when T'chali came up with a great idea.  Why not make the perfect brew, one that strengthens you and weakens your enemy?  Only thing is, T'chali does not know if it works.$B$BSo, you gonna take this brew up to Bladespire Hold and see if it works!" ; Wowhead enUS : "As T'chali was saying, he helped out his Bloodmaul friends to make their brew. But what T'chali did not say was why.$b$bThe Bloodmaul are in dire straits. The Bladespire clan be crushing them, and they needed a new weapon to help out with their fight.$b$bThat's when T'chali came up with a great idea. Why not make the perfect brew, one that strengthens you and weakens your enemy? Only thing is, T'chali does not know if it works.$b$bSo, you gonna take this brew up to Bladespire Hold and see if it works!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "灌醉劍刃巨魔", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Bladespire Ogres drunk" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bladespire Ogres drunk"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '提洽里要你使用血槌蠻禁烈酒讓5個劍刃巨魔喝醉。任務完成後回到劍刃山脈的血槌深谷找巫醫提洽里。', `Details` = '正如提洽里所說，他幫他的血槌朋友釀造酒。但是他卻沒說背後的原因。$b$b血槌氏族正在面對可怕的困境。劍刃氏族快打垮他們了，而他們需要新的武器來幫助戰鬥。$b$b這個時候提洽里想出了一個很棒的方法。為什麼不釀造一種完美的酒，使這種酒可以提高你們的力量同時又削弱敵人的戰鬥力呢?只不過，提洽里不知道這個方法是否能成功。$b$b所以，你必須把這種酒帶到劍刃要塞看它是否有效用!', `Objectivetext1` = '劍刃巨魔已喝醉', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10545;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集18根掉落的拉斯汗羽毛。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 18 Plucked Lashh'an Feathers." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 18 Plucked Lashh'an Feathers."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '收集18根掉落的拉斯汗羽毛，然後在迷霧拉斯的樹梢上閱讀拉斯汗書卷。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10555;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在拉斯汗的法陣使用一把羽毛。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use the Fistful of Feathers on the Lashh'an Spell Circle." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use the Fistful of Feathers on the Lashh'an Spell Circle.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "讓達藍艾歐分析卡裡瑞光環", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Have Daranelle analyze the Kaliri aura" ; Wowhead enUS : "Have Daranelle analyze the Kaliri aura"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '在拉斯汗的法陣使用一把羽毛，然後在卡里瑞的精神退去之前回去找希爾瓦納的達藍艾歐。', `Objectivetext1` = '讓達藍艾歐分析卡里瑞光環', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10556;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "跟瑞利‧薩普納伯談話然後使用ZC號。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Rally Zapnabber and use the Zephyrium Capacitorium." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Rally Zapnabber and use the Zephyrium Capacitorium.",  OLD Details : "我製造了一個很棒的裝置，ZC號，我確定他的功能沒有問題，但是...你願意幫我測試它嗎?$B$B傷殘補助金可是很高的喔!$B$B跟我旁邊的雙胞胎兄弟，瑞利談話。祝你好運，$n。測試完畢後回來找我。或者...假如你因為重大傷殘無法回來找我，你的戰友可以來向我回報取得你的報酬。", Details AC enUS : "I built an amazing device, the Zephyrium Capacitorium, and I'm sure it'll work perfectly, but... do you want to help me test it?$B$BThere's plenty of hazard pay!$B$BSpeak with my twin over there, Rally. Good luck, $N. Come back after your experiment.  Or... if that's not possible due to sustained injuries, your next of kin can report to collect your pay." ; Wowhead enUS : "I built an amazing device, the Zephyrium Capacitorium, and I'm sure it'll work perfectly, but... do you want to help me test it?$b$bThere's plenty of hazard pay!$b$bSpeak with my twin over there, Rally. Good luck, $n. Come back after your experiment. Or... if that's not possible due to sustained injuries, your next of kin can report to collect your pay."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '跟瑞利·薩普納伯談話然後使用ZC號。回去托斯利基地找塔利·薩普納伯。', `Details` = '我製造了一個很棒的裝置，ZC號，我確定他的功能沒有問題，但是……你願意幫我測試它嗎?$b$b傷殘補助金可是很高的喔!$b$b跟我旁邊的雙胞胎兄弟，瑞利談話。祝你好運，$n。測試完畢後回來找我。或者……假如你因為重大傷殘無法回來找我，你的戰友可以來向我回報取得你的報酬。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10557;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Sha'tar"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectivetext1` = '薩塔', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10560;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集一個維克尼爾水晶並且在維克尼爾的法力之環幫水晶充能。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect and use a Vekh'nir Crystal at the Vekh'nir Spell Circle to create a Charged Vekh'nir Crystal." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect and use a Vekh'nir Crystal at the Vekh'nir Spell Circle to create a Charged Vekh'nir Crystal."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '收集一個維克尼爾水晶並且在維克尼爾的法力之環使用它，然後把充能維克尼爾水晶交給摩克納薩爾村的德托克。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10565;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我已經打造了四根魔杖，我相信可以加強阿拉卡的水晶力量。將這些魔杖帶到索格瑪領土，然後使用在巨魔奴隸身上。$b$b你必須從該區的阿拉卡身上取得灌能水晶。$b$b當你測試出來哪一根魔杖是最好的，回來找我。", Details AC enUS : "I've fashioned four wands that I believe will enhance the power of the arakkoa's crystals. Take these wands to Trogma's Claim, and try them on the ogre slaves.$b$bYou'll need to find an infused crystal off of the arakkoa in the area.$b$bWhen you figure out which is best, come back to me." ; Wowhead enUS : "I've fashioned four wands that I believe will enhance the power of the arakkoa's crystals. Take these wands to Trogma's Claim, and try them on the ogre slaves.$b$bYou'll need to find an infused crystal off of the arakkoa in the area.$b$bWhen you figure out which is best, come back to me."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我已經打造了四根魔杖，我相信可以加強阿拉卡的水晶力量。將這些魔杖帶到索格瑪領土，然後使用在巨魔奴隸身上。$b$b你必須從該區的阿拉卡身上取得注入能量的水晶。$b$b當你測試出來哪一根魔杖是最好的，回來找我。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10566;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "找到6個魯安歐克之爪，並且使用於魯安歐克神諭者法陣以召喚烏鴉神諭使。殺死它然後取得神諭使墜飾。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 6 Ruuan'ok Claws and use them at the Ruaan'ok Oracle Circle to summon a Harbinger of the Raven. Kill it to collect its Harbinger's Pendant." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 6 Ruuan'ok Claws and use them at the Ruaan'ok Oracle Circle to summon a Harbinger of the Raven. Kill it to collect its Harbinger's Pendant."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '在魯安歐克神諭者法陣找到6個魯安歐克之爪來召喚1個烏鴉神諭使。殺死它然後將神諭使墜飾交給魯安曠野的泰姆昂。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10567;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "這些該死的地精跑去哪裡了？", Title AC enUS : "Where Did Those Darn Gnomes Go?" ; Wowhead enUS : "Where Did Those Darn Gnomes Go?",  OLD Objectives : "到劍刃山脈南邊的鋸齒山脊尋找托斯利還有其他地精的下落。", Objectives AC enUS : "Search the southern area of the Jagged Ridge of the Blade's Edge Mountains for a clue as to the whereabouts of Toshley and the other gnomes." ; Wowhead enUS : "Search the southern area of the Jagged Ridge of the Blade's Edge Mountains for a clue as to the whereabouts of Toshley and the other gnomes.",  OLD Details : "儘管我們在這裡的工作已完成，但是有件事讓我覺得很抱歉:我們迫使托斯利還有他的地精朋友們離開了。$B$B我們沒有選擇;他們的工程技術還有科學實驗在小樹林裡把我們過去所做的努力弄的一團糟。$B$B假如你願意幫我去看看他們後來的情況我會很感激。他們最後的消息是往東方過橋而行。我確定他們後來一定是轉往南方了，遠離雷霆王村。到南方的鋸齒山脊尋找他們移動的線索。", Details AC enUS : "Despite the good that we've done here, I feel bad about one thing: driving Toshley and his gnome friends away.$B$BWe had no choice; they were making a mess of our efforts in the grove with all of their technology and experimentation.$B$BI would appreciate it if you would find out what became of them.  Last we heard, they headed east across the bridge.  I'm certain that they must have turned south, away from Thunderlord Stronghold.$B$BLook for a clue as to their whereabouts in the southern Jagged Ridge." ; Wowhead enUS : "Despite the good that we've done here, I feel bad about one thing: driving Toshley and his gnome friends away.$b$bWe had no choice; they were making a mess of our efforts in the grove with all of their technology and experimentation.$b$bI would appreciate it if you would find out what became of them. Last we heard, they headed east across the bridge. I'm certain that they must have turned south, away from Thunderlord Stronghold.$b$bLook for a clue as to their whereabouts in the southern Jagged Ridge."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '這些該死的地精跑去哪裡了?', `Objectives` = '指揮官天影要求你去劍刃山脈南邊的鋸齒山脊尋找托斯利還有其他地精去向的線索。', `Details` = '儘管我們在這裡的工作已完成，但是有件事讓我覺得很抱歉:我們迫使托斯利還有他的地精朋友們離開了。$b$b我們沒有選擇;他們的工程技術還有科學實驗在小樹林裡把我們過去所做的努力弄的一團糟。$b$b假如你願意幫我去看看他們後來的情況我會很感激。他們最後的消息是往東方過橋而行。我確定他們後來一定是轉往南方了，遠離雷霆王村。到南方的鋸齒山脊尋找他們移動的線索。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10580;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "沿著散落地面的零件痕跡從斜坡上去剃刀山脊。並且到劍刃山脈的托斯利基地找托斯利談談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Follow the trail of spare parts up the ramp to the Razor Ridge. Speak with Toshley at Toshley's Station in the Blade's Edge Mountains." ; Wowhead enUS : "Follow the trail of spare parts up the ramp to the Razor Ridge. Speak with Toshley at Toshley's Station in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",  OLD Details : "很好，我是來警告你在山脊上不會找到任何東西。$B$B千萬不要跟著散落地上的備用零件痕跡走，那會通到托斯利基地的!你不會在那邊找到托斯利還有其他地精的。", Details AC enUS : "VERY WELL, I AM HEREBY WARNING YOU THAT YOU WILL FIND NOTHING UP ON THE RIDGE.$B$BDO NOT FOLLOW THE TRAIL OF SPARE PARTS THAT LEAD TO TOSHLEY'S STATION!  YOU WILL NOT FIND TOSHLEY, NOR ANY OTHER GNOME THERE." ; Wowhead enUS : "VERY WELL, I AM HEREBY WARNING YOU THAT YOU WILL FIND NOTHING UP ON THE RIDGE.$b$bDO NOT FOLLOW THE TRAIL OF SPARE PARTS THAT LEAD TO TOSHLEY'S STATION! YOU WILL NOT FIND TOSHLEY, NOR ANY OTHER GNOME THERE."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '講了一圈，原來R-3D0型機器人已經告訴你跟著散落地面的零件痕跡上斜坡到剃刀山脊，你就會發現地精們在一個叫做托斯利基地的地方。$b$b假如你找的到托斯利的話，跟他談談吧。', `Details` = '很好，我是來警告你在山脊上不會找到任何東西。$b$b千萬不要跟著散落地上的備用零件痕跡走，那會通到托斯利基地的!你不會在那邊找到托斯利還有其他地精的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10581;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "使用原始電磁集電器收集5個電流體。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use the Protovoltaic Magneto Collector to collect 5 Electromentals." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use the Protovoltaic Magneto Collector to collect 5 Electromentals.",  OLD Details : "北邊劍刃崗哨那些愚笨的巨魔一直在襲擊我們的能量轉換器!你要為我把它們追回來，可以這麼說。$B$B毫無疑問的，巨魔巨大、笨拙的手毀壞了轉換器。所以，我要你做的就是從他們那裡釋放能量並在組合的電流體上使用這個原始電磁集電器來裝住它。$B$B你可能會感覺有點疼痛，所以在它被裝在磁力發電機球體裡時你需要「殺掉」它。", Details AC enUS : "Those dumb ogres at the Bladespire Outpost to the north have been raiding our power converters!  And you're going to get them back for me, sort of.$B$BNo doubt, with their big, clumsy hands, the ogres have damaged the converters.  So, what I want you to do is release the energy from them and then use this protovoltaic magneto collector on the resultant electromental to encase it.$B$BIt'll likely be sore with you, so you'll need to 'kill' it while it's contained in the magneto sphere." ; Wowhead enUS : "Those dumb ogres at the Bladespire Outpost to the north have been raiding our power converters! And you're going to get them back for me, sort of.$b$bNo doubt, with their big, clumsy hands, the ogres have damaged the converters. So, what I want you to do is release the energy from them and then use this protovoltaic magneto collector on the resultant electromental to encase it.$b$bIt'll likely be sore with you, so you'll need to 'kill' it while it's contained in the magneto sphere."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '托斯利要你帶著原始電磁集電器去收集5個電流體。任務完成時回去劍刃山脈的托斯利基地找托斯利。', `Details` = '北邊劍刃崗哨那些愚笨的巨魔一直在襲擊我們的能量轉換器!你要為我把它們追回來，可以這麼說。$b$b毫無疑問的，巨魔巨大、笨拙的手毀壞了轉換器。所以，我要你做的就是從他們那裡釋放能量並在組合的電流體上使用這個原始電磁集電器來裝住它。$b$b你可能會感覺有點疼痛，所以在它被裝在磁力發電機球體裡時你需要「殺掉」它。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10584;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "安裝震盪頻率掃瞄器，並且在安裝完畢時同時處在五個重疊的震盪區域之中。", Objectives AC enUS : "Place the Oscillating Frequency Scanners in such a way that when you stand amongst them, you are hit by 5 overlapping Oscillation fields." ; Wowhead enUS : "Place the Oscillating Frequency Scanners in such a way that when you stand amongst them, you are hit by 5 overlapping Oscillation fields.",  OLD Details : "帶著這些掃描器到美聲山脊。當你依照地上的位置裝設它們，你會創造出彼此相疊的掃描區域來讀取水晶的振幅。但是你必須站在五個震動區域的交錯點，這樣一來我才能獲的我所需要的資料。$B$B你的掃描器同時也會與其他人放置的掃描器產生共鳴。$B$B喔對了，在過程中將會產生一個裂隙!我完全不知道會跑出什麼東西來。", Details AC enUS : "Take these scanners to the Singing Ridge.  By dropping them in a pattern on the ground, you will create overlapping fields that will read the amplitude of the crystals.  Stand amidst them in such a way that you're in five oscillation fields and I'll have the information that I need!$B$BYour scanners will even work with those that others drop.$B$BOh, and it's likely that a rift will be formed!  I have no idea what, if anything, will come out of it, but be prepared for the worst." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take these scanners to the Singing Ridge. By dropping them in a pattern on the ground, you will create overlapping fields that will read the amplitude of the crystals. Stand amidst them in such a way that you're in five oscillation fields and I'll have the information that I need!$b$bYour scanners will even work with those that others drop.$b$bOh, and it's likely that a rift will be formed! I have no idea what, if anything, will come out of it, but be prepared for the worst."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '地鐵地精尼克偉恩寇要你以下列的方式來安裝震盪頻率掃瞄器。你必須在安裝完畢時同時處在五個震盪區域之中。$b$b完成之後，回到劍刃山脈的托斯利基地向地鐵地精尼克偉恩回報。', `Details` = '帶著這些掃描器到美聲山脊。當你依照地上的位置裝設它們，你會創造出彼此相疊的掃描區域來讀取水晶的振幅。但是你必須站在五個震動區域的交錯點，這樣一來我才能獲的我所需要的資料。$b$b你的掃描器同時也會與其他人放置的掃描器產生共鳴。$b$b喔對了，在過程中將會產生一個裂縫!我完全不知道會跑出什麼東西來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10594;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死葛瑞納阿拉卡取得理解烏鴉語的效果2分鐘。在法術的效果之下，你可以從四個聖物之中得知四段預言。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill Grishna arakkoa to gain Understanding Ravenspeech for 2 minutes. While under the effects of the spell, you can find and receive the prophecy from the four shrines." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill Grishna arakkoa to gain Understanding Ravenspeech for 2 minutes. While under the effects of the spell, you can find and receive the prophecy from the four shrines.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "獲知第一個預言", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Receive the First Prophecy" ; Wowhead enUS : "Receive the First Prophecy",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "獲知第二個預言", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "Receive the Second Prophecy" ; Wowhead enUS : "Receive the Second Prophecy",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "獲知第三個預言", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "Receive the Third Prophecy" ; Wowhead enUS : "Receive the Third Prophecy"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死葛瑞納阿拉卡取得理解烏鴉語的效果2分鐘。在法術的效果之下，你可以從四個聖物之中得知四段預言。當你得知四段預言之後就回來找我。', `Objectivetext1` = '獲得第一段預言', `Objectivetext2` = '獲得第二段預言', `Objectivetext3` = '獲得第三段預言', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10607;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死10個水晶鐮奪怪。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay 10 Crystal Flayers." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay 10 Crystal Flayers.",  OLD Details : "那些該死的岩石鐮奪怪阻礙了我在美聲山脊所做的研究!當我在挖掘那些歌唱水晶的時候，它們總是跑來破壞我研究那些水晶的美妙旋律。$B$B你看起來像是可以幫我解決這個問題的人。幫我去南邊殺死那些水晶鐮奪怪。", Details AC enUS : "The damned rock flayers are keeping me from my research down in the Singing Ridge!  By digging at the crystals there, with every scratch they are ruining my chances of studying the harmonics of the singing crystals.$B$BYou look like someone who can help me deal with this problem.  Head south and clear those crystal flayers out." ; Wowhead enUS : "The damned rock flayers are keeping me from my research down in the Singing Ridge! By digging at the crystals there, with every scratch they are ruining my chances of studying the harmonics of the singing crystals.$b$bYou look like someone who can help me deal with this problem. Head south and clear those crystal flayers out.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Crystal Flayer slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '地鐵地精尼克偉恩寇要你殺死10個水晶鐮奪怪然後回到劍刃山脈的托斯利基地向他回報。', `Details` = '那些該死的岩石鐮奪怪阻礙了我在美聲山脊所做的研究!當我在挖掘那些歌唱水晶的時候，它們總是跑來破壞我研究那些水晶的美妙旋律。$b$b你看起來像是可以幫我解決這個問題的人。幫我去南邊殺死那些水晶鐮奪怪。', `Objectivetext1` = '水晶鐮奪怪 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10608;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "龍生蛋，蛋生龍？", Title AC enUS : "What Came First, the Drake or the Egg?" ; Wowhead enUS : "What Came First, the Drake or the Egg?",  OLD Objectives : "收集3個原始虛空龍之精華、3個年輕的虛空龍之精華還有3個成熟的虛空龍之精華。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 3 Proto-Nether Drake Essences, 3 Adolescent Drake Essences and 3 Mature Drake Essences." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 3 Proto-Nether Drake Essences, 3 Adolescent Drake Essences and 3 Mature Drake Essences.",  OLD Details : "我在我的醫生領域裡頭研究龍之精華的用途。對於一個生病的人來說，我想它們可能是一種萬靈藥！我需要有人去南邊的美聲山脊幫我取回一些。$B$B你願意帶著我的時光相位轉換器使用在剛從虛空龍蛋孵出來的虛空幼龍嗎？不管它們會變化成什麼，幫我取回精華。$B$B關於這件事，我想補充一下，我並不確定它們變化的結果因為我們所使用的是非常不穩定、改變時間與空間的科技產品。", Details AC enUS : "I'm researching the applications of drake essences to my work as a physician.  I think they could be a panacea for a host of maladies!$B$BI need someone to go south to the Singing Ridge and get me some.$B$BWilling to take my temporal phase modulator and use it on the nether whelps that hatch from the nether drake eggs?  Retrieve the essences from whatever they turn into.$B$BWhich, I might add, I'm not certain of what that will be as we're using some pretty dicey, time  and space modifying tech here." ; Wowhead enUS : "I'm researching the applications of drake essences to my work as a physician. I think they could be a panacea for a host of maladies!$b$bI need someone to go south to the Singing Ridge and get me some.$b$bWilling to take my temporal phase modulator and use it on the nether whelps that hatch from the nether drake eggs? Retrieve the essences from whatever they turn into.$b$bWhich, I might add, I'm not certain of what that will be as we're using some pretty dicey, time and space modifying tech here."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '龍生蛋，蛋生龍?', `Objectives` = '收集3個原始虛空龍之精華、3個年輕的虛空龍之精華還有3個成熟的虛空龍之精華。交給劍刃山脈托斯利基地的費茲特「醫生」克羅克塔可。', `Details` = '我在我的醫生領域裡頭研究龍之精華的用途。對於一個生病的人來說，我想它們可能是一種萬靈藥!我需要有人去南邊的美聲山脊幫我取回一些。$b$b你願意帶著我的時光相位轉換器使用在剛從虛空龍蛋孵出來的虛空幼龍嗎?不管它們會變化成什麼，幫我取回精華。$b$b關於這件事，我想補充一下，我並不確定它們變化的結果因為我們所使用的是非常不穩定、改變時間與空間的科技產品。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10609;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到劍刃山脈的摩克納薩爾村找李歐羅克斯談談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Leoroxx at the Mok'Nathal Village in the Blade's Edge Mountains." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Leoroxx at the Mok'Nathal Village in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",  OLD Details : "我已經尋遍外域有關摩克納薩爾的謠言，但沒有任何關於它的蹤跡。最後，我們可能找到他們的家。$b$b但是既然現在就在這裡，我心裡卻充滿著不安。在我搜尋的期間，心神不安使我到深夜都無法入睡。他們會接受我嗎？$b$b我…知道他們領導人的名字:李歐羅克斯。將他找出來。這次你必須當我的眼睛。", Details AC enUS : "I have chased rumors of the Mok'Nathal across Outland with nothing to show for it. Finally, we may have found their home.$b$bBut now that the moment is here, I am filled with unease. Unease that has kept me awake deep into the nights during my search. Will they accept me?$b$bI... know their leader's name: Leoroxx. Seek him out. You must be my eyes in this." ; Wowhead enUS : "I have chased rumors of the Mok'Nathal across Outland with nothing to show for it. Finally, we may have found their home.$b$bBut now that the moment is here, I am filled with unease. Unease that has kept me awake deep into the nights during my search. Will they accept me?$b$bI... know their leader's name: Leoroxx. Seek him out. You must be my eyes in this."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '到劍刃山脈的摩克納薩爾村找到李歐羅克斯。', `Details` = '我已經尋遍外域有關摩克納薩爾的謠言，但沒有任何關於它的蹤跡。最後，我們可能找到他們的家。$b$b但是既然現在就在這裡，我心裡卻充滿著不安。在我搜尋的期間，心神不安使我到深夜都無法入睡。他們會接受我嗎?$b$b我……知道他們領導人的名字:李歐羅克斯。將他找出來。這次你必須當我的眼睛。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10614;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "從絲翼幼蟲身上收集8個絲翼之繭。$b$b在幼蟲成長成絲翼之前殺掉它，不然繭會破掉。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 8 Silkwing Cocoons from Silkwing Larva.$b$bKill the Larva quickly or they will turn into Silkwings, ruining their cocoons." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 8 Silkwing Cocoons from Silkwing Larva.$b$bKill the Larva quickly or they will turn into Silkwings, ruining their cocoons."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '摩克納薩爾村的塔爾瑞克要你從絲翼幼蟲身上收集8個絲翼之繭。$b$b在幼蟲成長成絲翼之前殺掉它，不然繭就會被破壞。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10617;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集12個彩虹之翼。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 12 Iridescent Wings." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 12 Iridescent Wings."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '摩克納薩爾村的希歐瑪納要你收集12個彩虹之翼。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10618;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死10隻山脊巡者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay 10 Ridgespine Stalkers." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay 10 Ridgespine Stalkers.",  OLD Details : "當托斯利決定搬到外域去後我們就開始幫忙，自此之後就一直幫下去。$B$B現在看來我們終於斬除了一些根源。所有瘋狂的科學家們繼續進行著他們的計畫，而我們狂騎兵是來保護他們的。$B$B我們現在需要你去北方的剃刀山脊，或是東邊的鱗翼沙洲，殺死巡者來保持淨空。他們是住在岩石礦脈間的鬼祟蜘蛛，會對沒有戒心的過路者一撲而上。", Details AC enUS : "We hired on to help Toshley when he decided to move to Outland, and we've been on the move ever since.$B$BNow it looks like we've finally put down some roots.  All of the crazy scientists have their projects going, and us Roughriders are here to protect them.$B$BWhat we need right now is for you to go north into Razor Ridge, or east to the Scalewing Shelf, and keep them clear by killing the stalkers.  They're stealthy spiders that live amongst the rock outcroppings, and jump unsuspecting passersby." ; Wowhead enUS : "We hired on to help Toshley when he decided to move to Outland, and we've been on the move ever since.$b$bNow it looks like we've finally put down some roots. All of the crazy scientists have their projects going, and us Roughriders are here to protect them.$b$bWhat we need right now is for you to go north into Razor Ridge, or east to the Scalewing Shelf, and keep them clear by killing the stalkers. They're stealthy spiders that live amongst the rock outcroppings, and jump unsuspecting passersby.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Ridgespine Stalker slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '迪希·迪娜要你殺死10隻山脊行者。任務完成後，回到劍刃山脈的托斯利基地向她回報。', `Details` = '當托斯利決定搬到外域去後我們就開始幫忙，自此之後就一直幫下去。$b$b現在看來我們終於斬除了一些根源。所有瘋狂的科學家們繼續進行著他們的計畫，而我們非正式騎兵是來保護他們的。$b$b我們現在需要你去北方的剃刀山脊，或是東邊的鱗翼沙洲，殺死行者來保持淨空。他們是住在岩石礦脈間的鬼祟蜘蛛，會對沒有戒心的過路者一撲而上。', `Objectivetext1` = '山脊行者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10620;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "取回5個特級銳利匕爪牙齒。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 5 Extra Sharp Daggermaw Teeth." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 5 Extra Sharp Daggermaw Teeth.",  OLD Details : "托斯利還有他的科學家們能夠得到你的幫助真是太好了。可惜我並沒有時間可以沉迷在「個人」嗜好上面。$B$B假如你想要幫這裡的忙，你只要聽從我的要求去做，而且是馬上，我需要一些武器。$B$B我們的槍在射程內很有殺傷力，但是當敵人靠近，我們則需要擁有一些強大的近戰武器做預備。$B$B北邊剃刀山脊的匕爪尾龍的牙齒可以做出精良的武器鋸齒劍身，連我都感到畏懼。", Details AC enUS : "It's nice that you've been helping out Toshley and his scientists.  I, however, do not have the luxury of indulging in my 'personal' interests.$B$BIf you want to make a difference around here, you'll do what I ask of you, and right now, I need weapons.$B$BOur guns are effective at range, but when the bugs get in close, we need to have powerful melee weapons as a backup.$B$BThe teeth of the daggermaw lashtails in the northern part of the Razor Ridge make for great vibro-weapon blades.  Scare me up some." ; Wowhead enUS : "It's nice that you've been helping out Toshley and his scientists. I, however, do not have the luxury of indulging in my 'personal' interests.$b$bIf you want to make a difference around here, you'll do what I ask of you, and right now, I need weapons.$b$bOur guns are effective at range, but when the bugs get in close, we need to have powerful melee weapons as a backup.$b$bThe teeth of the daggermaw lashtails in the northern part of the Razor Ridge make for great vibro-weapon blades. Scare me up some."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '洛薩克·鐵面要你取回5個特級銳利匕爪牙齒。完成後回到劍刃山脈的托斯利基地交給他。', `Details` = '托斯利還有他的科學家們能夠得到你的幫助真是太好了。可惜我並沒有時間可以沉迷在「個人」嗜好上面。$b$b假如你想要幫這裡的忙，你只要聽從我的要求去做，而且是馬上，我需要一些武器。$b$b我們的槍在射程內很有殺傷力，但是當敵人靠近，我們則需要擁有一些強大的近戰武器做預備。$b$b北邊剃刀山脊的匕爪尾龍的牙齒可以做出精良的武器鋸齒劍身，連我都感到畏懼。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10632;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "使用再極化的磁力發電機球體從鱗翼風蛇身上吸收25個閃電之擊。同時，收集5個鱗翼閃電腺。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use the Repolarized Magneto Sphere to absorb 25 lightning strikes from the Scalewing Serpents.  Also, collect 5 Scalewing Lightning Glands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use the Repolarized Magneto Sphere to absorb 25 lightning strikes from the Scalewing Serpents.  Also, collect 5 Scalewing Lightning Glands.",  OLD Details : "我們並沒有將ZC號的使用量維持在預算之內。但是，我發現剃刀山脊的鱗翼風蛇擁有閃電般的氣息還有腺體可以供我們利用。$B$B我已經重新磨光了電磁收集器好讓它可以吸收雷擊。總而言之，當它遭受雷擊的時候它的保護殼上有一個反應圈可以讓加強雷擊的能量，直到雷擊被吸收為止。喔，而且它會減慢你的速度。$B$B去吧，把收集器打開，然後幫我們帶回來一些便宜的燃料吧。", Details AC enUS : "We haven't kept the use of the Zephyrium Capacitorium under budget.  But, it occurs to me that the serpents of the Scalewing Shelf to the east have a lightning breath and glands that we can make use of.$B$BI've repolarized the magneto collector to absorb lightning strikes and I want you to head up there, activate it on yourself, and get us some cheap fuel from those serpents." ; Wowhead enUS : "We haven't kept the use of the Zephyrium Capacitorium under budget. But, it occurs to me that the serpents of the Scalewing Shelf to the east have a lightning breath and glands that we can make use of.$b$bI've repolarized the magneto collector to absorb lightning strikes and I want you to head up there, activate it on yourself, and get us some cheap fuel from those serpents."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '托斯利要你使用再極化的磁力發電機球體從鱗翼風蛇身上吸收25個閃電之擊。同時，收集5個鱗翼閃電腺。然後回到劍刃山脈的托斯利基地交給他。', `Details` = '我們並沒有將ZC號的使用量維持在預算之內。但是，我發現剃刀山脊的鱗翼風蛇擁有閃電般的氣息還有腺體可以供我們利用。$b$b我已經重新磨光了電磁收集器好讓它可以吸收雷擊。總而言之，當它遭受雷擊的時候它的保護殼上有一個反應圈可以讓加強雷擊的能量，直到雷擊被吸收為止。喔，而且它會減慢你的速度。$b$b去吧，把收集器打開，然後幫我們帶回來一些便宜的燃料吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10657;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集5個蒼穹能量肉體。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 5 Ether-Energized Flesh." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 5 Ether-Energized Flesh.",  OLD Details : "$n，我有別的事情要你去做。那些知識份子之中的一個人想要研究在雷森平台那出現像惡魔般的血肉野獸，就在剃刀山脊的北邊。$B$B更重要的是，他們想研究那邊的血肉野獸的肉。$B$B<迪希做出了一個作嘔的表情。>$B$B不過當然，他們不想把自己的手弄髒，而且他們只想要蒼穹能量肉體，這可不是所有的血肉野獸都有的。$B$B我說，拿人的手短，但是你又能怎麼辦呢？", Details AC enUS : "$N, I've got something else for you to do.  One of the eggheads wants to study the fiendling flesh beasts that can be found at Razaan's Landing, north of the Razor Ridge.$B$BMore to the point, they want to study the flesh of the flesh beasts that are there.$B$B<Dizzy makes a disgusted face.>$B$BBut, of course, they aren't willing to get their hands dirty, and they only want the ether-energized flesh, which it's not likely that all of them have.$B$BI say, beggars can't be choosers, but what can you do?" ; Wowhead enUS : "$n, I've got something else for you to do. One of the eggheads wants to study the fiendling flesh beasts that can be found at Razaan's Landing, north of the Razor Ridge.$b$bMore to the point, they want to study the flesh of the flesh beasts that are there.$b$b<Dizzy makes a disgusted face.>$b$bBut, of course, they aren't willing to get their hands dirty, and they only want the ether-energized flesh, which it's not likely that all of them have.$b$bI say, beggars can't be choosers, but what can you do?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '迪希·迪娜要你取得5個蒼穹能量肉體然後回到劍刃山脈的托斯利基地交給她。', `Details` = '$n，我有別的事情要你去做。那些知識份子之中的一個人想要研究在雷森平台那出現像惡魔般的血肉野獸，就在剃刀山脊的北邊。$b$b更重要的是，他們想研究那邊的血肉野獸的肉。$b$b<迪希做出了一個作嘔的表情。>$b$b不過當然，他們不想把自己的手弄髒，而且他們只想要蒼穹能量肉體，這可不是所有的血肉野獸都有的。$b$b我說，拿人的手短，但是你又能怎麼辦呢?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10671;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "使用聖光陷阱捕捉15個雷森光球。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use the Light Trap to collect 15 Razaani Light Orbs." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use the Light Trap to collect 15 Razaani Light Orbs.",  OLD Details : "北邊雷森平台的雷森以太族開發了一些有趣的科技產品。$B$B我相信他們不會介意你使用這個陷阱捕捉幾個他們浮在空中的粉紅色光球吧？反正那些光球八成只是裝飾品而已。$B$B這個陷阱有一個特殊的功能，當陷阱開啟時會吸引一個飄浮的光球飛向它。當然，它同時也會驚動到那些雷森關於你的到來。", Details AC enUS : "The Razaani ethereals have been playing with some interesting technology at Razaan's Landing to the north.$B$BI'm sure they won't mind if you use this trap to take a few samples of their little pink floating light orbs?  They're probably only for decoration anyway.$B$BThe trap has a special property to it that when opened should attract one of the floating balls towards it.  Of course, it'll probably also alert the Razaani to your presence." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Razaani ethereals have been playing with some interesting technology at Razaan's Landing to the north.$b$bI'm sure they won't mind if you use this trap to take a few samples of their little pink floating light orbs? They're probably only for decoration anyway.$b$bThe trap has a special property to it that when opened should attract one of the floating balls towards it. Of course, it'll probably also alert the Razaani to your presence.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "捕捉雷森光球", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Razaani Light Orbs trapped" ; Wowhead enUS : "Razaani Light Orbs trapped"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '托斯利要你使用聖光陷阱捕捉15個雷森光球。任務完成後回到劍刃山脈的托斯利基地向他回報。', `Details` = '北邊雷森平台的雷森伊斯利開發了一些有趣的科技產品。$b$b我相信他們不會介意你使用這個陷阱捕捉幾個他們浮在空中的粉紅色光球吧?反正那些光球八成只是裝飾品而已。$b$b這個陷阱有一個特殊的功能，當陷阱開啟時會吸引一個飄浮的光球飛向它。當然，它同時也會驚動到那些雷森關於你的到來。', `Objectivetext1` = '已捕捉雷森光球', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10674;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "取得靈魂收集品。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect the Collection of Souls." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect the Collection of Souls.",  OLD Details : "<血從托斯利的臉上流了下來。>$B$B這些球體是由虛空的能量還有靈魂所組成的，部分的靈魂竟然是地精的靈魂！$B$B他們真大膽！我們那些往北旅行的同伴們，就是他們殺死的嗎？！$B$B$n，你必須阻止這件事，而唯一的解決方法就是殺死他們的首領，奈薩斯王子洛薩恩。$B$B但是你必須將他從隱匿中引誘出來。我猜你只要殺死大量的雷森以太族就會引誘他現身。$B$B將他身上的靈魂收集品交給我，那東西一定在他身上。", Details AC enUS : "<The blood drains out of Toshley's face.>$B$BThese orbs are made up of both nether energy and souls, some of them gnome souls!$B$BHow dare they!  Were they the ones killing our people that traveled north?!$B$B$N, you must put a stop to this, and the only way to do that is to finish off their leader, Nexus-Prince Razaan.$B$BYou'll have to coax him out of hiding though.  I'm guessing that you can do that by killing a lot of his Razaani ethereal.$B$BBring me the collection of souls that he no doubt has." ; Wowhead enUS : "<The blood drains out of Toshley's face.>$b$bThese orbs are made up of both nether energy and souls, some of them gnome souls!$b$bHow dare they! Were they the ones killing our people that traveled north?!$b$b$n, you must put a stop to this, and the only way to do that is to finish off their leader, Nexus-Prince Razaan.$b$bYou'll have to coax him out of hiding though. I'm guessing that you can do that by killing a lot of his Razaani ethereal.$b$bBring me the collection of souls that he no doubt has."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '托斯利要你取得靈魂收集品然後回到劍刃山脈的托斯利基地交給他。', `Details` = '<血從托斯利的臉上流了下來。>$b$b這些球體是由虛空的能量還有靈魂所組成的，部分的靈魂竟然是地精的靈魂!$b$b他們真大膽!我們那些往北旅行的同伴們，就是他們殺死的嗎?!$b$b$n，你必須阻止這件事，而唯一的解決方法就是殺死他們的首領，奈薩斯王子洛薩恩。$b$b但是你必須將他從隱匿中引誘出來。我猜你只要殺死大量的雷森伊斯利就會引誘他現身。$b$b將他身上的靈魂收集品交給我，那東西一定在他身上。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10675;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "協商時間...", Title AC enUS : "A Time for Negotiation..." ; Wowhead enUS : "A Time for Negotiation...",  OLD Objectives : "與監督者奴阿爾協商。", Objectives AC enUS : "Negotiate with Overseer Nuaar." ; Wowhead enUS : "Negotiate with Overseer Nuaar.",  OLD Details : "當我們抵達魯安曠野，巨龍教徒們正集中在黑翼集會所，經由這個隧道通往西方。不過現在，它們正接近我們這裡，$B$B我需要你去找到巨龍教徒的監督者。他在魯安曠野的各個營地之間定時巡邏。$B$B與他商量一下。讓他知道有協商的空間，不過我們不會寬恕或允許大規模屠殺野生生物，包括樹林的砍伐也是一樣。", Details AC enUS : "When we arrived in the Ruuan Weald, the wyrm cultists were keeping themselves to Blackwing Coven, through the tunnel to the west.  But now, they are encroaching upon us here.$B$BI need you to find the wyrmcultists' overseer.  He's known to make a regular patrol between their various camps in the Ruuan Weald.$B$BNegotiate with him.  Let him know that there's room for compromise, but that we will not condone or allow the wholesale slaughter of the wildlife, nor the felling of all of the trees." ; Wowhead enUS : "When we arrived in the Ruuan Weald, the wyrm cultists were keeping themselves to Blackwing Coven, through the tunnel to the west. But now, they are encroaching upon us here.$b$bI need you to find the wyrmcultists' overseer. He's known to make a regular patrol between their various camps in the Ruuan Weald.$b$bNegotiate with him. Let him know that there's room for compromise, but that we will not condone or allow the wholesale slaughter of the wildlife, nor the felling of all of the trees."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '協商時間……', `Objectives` = '林木守衛蕭恩要你去與監督者奴阿爾協商。完成後回到劍刃山脈的永恆樹林找林木守衛。', `Details` = '當我們抵達魯安曠野，巨龍教徒們正集中在黑翼集會所，經由這個隧道通往西方。不過現在，它們正接近我們這裡，$b$b我需要你去找到巨龍教徒的監督者。他在魯安曠野的各個營地之間定時巡邏。$b$b與他商量一下。讓他知道有協商的空間，不過我們不會寬恕或允許大規模屠殺野生生物，包括樹林的砍伐也是一樣。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10682;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死瑞瑪。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay Rema." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay Rema.",  OLD Details : "懸賞!$B$B瑞瑪，雷霆王村南邊鋸齒山脊的獸穴之后及主要的防衛者。$B$B出到鎮外向東走，越過橫跨血槌深谷的橋找到她。她隱居在橋南邊的隧道內。$B$B帶著她死亡的消息回到希爾瓦納的指揮官天影那裡。", Details AC enUS : "WANTED!$B$BRema, the den mother and primary defender of the Jagged Ridge south of Thunderlord Stronghold.$B$BFind her by heading east out of town and across the bridge that traverses the Bloodmaul Ravine.  She keeps herself secluded in the tunnel at the southern edge of the ridge.$B$BReturn with news of her demise to Commander Skyshadow of Sylvanaar." ; Wowhead enUS : "WANTED!$b$bRema, the den mother and primary defender of the Jagged Ridge south of Thunderlord Stronghold.$b$bFind her by heading east out of town and across the bridge that traverses the Bloodmaul Ravine. She keeps herself secluded in the tunnel at the southern edge of the ridge.$b$bReturn with news of her demise to Commander Skyshadow of Sylvanaar.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Rema slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死瑞瑪然後通知在劍刃山脈之希爾瓦納的指揮官天影。', `Details` = '懸賞!$b$b瑞瑪，雷霆王村南邊鋸齒山脊的獸穴之后及主要的防衛者。$b$b出到鎮外向東走，越過橫跨血槌深谷的橋找到她。她隱居在橋南邊的隧道內。$b$b帶著她死亡的消息回到希爾瓦納的指揮官天影那裡。', `Objectivetext1` = '瑞瑪 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10690;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你發現的阿塔莫水晶中鑲有一則訊息。奈薩斯王子哈拉瑪德已經提供我們關於對抗風暴要塞非常重要的資訊。$B$B他告訴我們他們將一把鑰匙分為兩片裂片，兩者合一時可開啟要塞的亞克崔茲衛星。$B$B一半由波塔尼卡的一位古老生物叫扭曲分裂者所持有。另一半由麥克納爾裡的操縱者帕薩里歐擁有。$B$B將兩個裂片帶來給我，我會將他們合成亞克崔茲鑰匙。", Details AC enUS : "A message was embedded in the ata'mal crystal that you recovered.  Nexus-Prince Haramad has given us information vital to our campaign against Tempest Keep.$B$BHe tells us that there are two pieces, shards to a key, which, when combined, will unlock the keep's Arcatraz satellite.$B$BOne half is possessed by an ancient in the Botanica known as Warp Splinter.  The other is held by Pathaleon the Calculator inside the Mechanar.$B$BBring both shards to me and I will combine them into the Arcatraz key." ; Wowhead enUS : "A message was embedded in the ata'mal crystal that you recovered. Nexus-Prince Haramad has given us information vital to our campaign against Tempest Keep.$b$bHe tells us that there are two pieces, shards to a key, which, when combined, will unlock the keep's Arcatraz satellite.$b$bOne half is possessed by an ancient in the Botanica known as Warp Splinter. The other is held by Pathaleon the Calculator inside the Mechanar.$b$bBring both shards to me and I will combine them into the Arcatraz key."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你發現的阿塔莫水晶中鑲有一則訊息。奈薩斯王子哈拉瑪德已經提供我們關於對抗風暴要塞非常重要的資訊。$b$b他告訴我們他們將一把鑰匙分為兩片裂片，兩者合一時可開啟要塞的亞克崔茲衛星。$b$b一半由波塔尼卡的一位古老生物叫扭曲分裂者所持有。另一半由麥克納爾裡的操縱者帕薩里歐擁有。$b$b將兩個裂片帶來給我，我會將他們合成亞克崔茲鑰匙。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10704;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我希望你在我告訴你那些從我的爪牙手上取來的好幾片卡拉伯爾勳章都只是複製品時不要太震驚。$B$B<阿卡瑪打開他的手掌給你看一個完全相同的勳章。>$B$B我的死亡誓言者跟我盡可能的守住這個秘密不讓伊利丹知道。不過我們還是會懷念那最後的一片。$B$B烏達羅到我的夢裡宣稱他已找到了那最後的一片勳章。糟糕的是他正被凱爾薩斯監禁在風暴要塞的亞克崔茲裡。去找到他並看看他到底知道些什麼。", Details AC enUS : "I hope you're not shocked when I reveal to you that the pieces of the Medallion of Karabor you obtained from my minions are mere replicas.$B$B<Akama shows you an identical medallion in his open palm.>$B$BMy Deathsworn and I have kept the secret from Illidan for as long as possible.   We are however, still missing the final piece.$B$BUdalo came to me in dreams  to announce he had found it.  Unfortunately he is held by Kael'thas inside the Arcatraz in Tempest Keep.  Find him and see what he knows." ; Wowhead enUS : "I hope you're not shocked when I reveal to you that the pieces of the Medallion of Karabor you obtained from my minions are mere replicas.$b$b<Akama shows you an identical medallion in his open palm.>$b$bMy Deathsworn and I have kept the secret from Illidan for as long as possible. We are however, still missing the final piece.$b$bUdalo came to me in dreams to announce he had found it. Unfortunately he is held by Kael'thas inside the Arcatraz in Tempest Keep. Find him and see what he knows."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我希望你在我告訴你那些從我的爪牙手上取來的好幾片卡拉伯爾勳章都只是複製品時不要太震驚。$b$b<阿卡瑪打開他的手掌給你看一個完全相同的勳章。>$b$b我的死亡誓言者跟我盡可能的守住這個秘密不讓伊利丹知道。不過我們還是會懷念那最後的一片。$b$b烏達羅到我的夢裡宣稱他已找到了那最後的一片勳章。糟糕的是他正被凱爾薩斯監禁在風暴要塞的亞克崔茲裡。去找到他並看看他到底知道些什麼。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10705;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "回到劍刃山脈的雷霆王村找雷克薩交談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Rexxar at Thunderlord Stronghold in the Blade's Edge Mountains." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Rexxar at Thunderlord Stronghold in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",  OLD Details : "所以你來自傳送門外的世界嗎？並且你知道雷克薩。噢是的，我跟他很熟。$b$b其實，他是我的兒子。$b$b但他在很久以前，做出了他的選擇。他不屬於我們之中的一員，而他在這裡也不受歡迎。有這些血槌巨魔，我們的麻煩已經夠多了。$b$b要知道:身為一個混血兒並不代表你就是摩克納薩爾。", Details AC enUS : "So you come from the world beyond the Portal? And you know of Rexxar. Oh yes, I am quite familiar with him.$b$bYou see, he is my son.$b$bBut he made his choice a lifetime ago. He is not one of us, and he is not welcome here. We have enough troubles with the Bloodmaul ogres.$b$bKnow this: being born a half-breed does not make you Mok'Nathal." ; Wowhead enUS : "So you come from the world beyond the Portal? And you know of Rexxar. Oh yes, I am quite familiar with him.$b$bYou see, he is my son.$b$bBut he made his choice a lifetime ago. He is not one of us, and he is not welcome here. We have enough troubles with the Bloodmaul ogres.$b$bKnow this: being born a half-breed does not make you Mok'Nathal."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '回到劍刃山脈的雷霆王村找雷克薩。', `Details` = '所以你來自傳送門外的世界嗎?並且你知道雷克薩。噢是的，我跟他很熟。$b$b其實，他是我的兒子。$b$b但他在很久以前，做出了他的選擇。他不屬於我們之中的一員，而他在這裡也不受歡迎。有這些血槌巨魔，我們的麻煩已經夠多了。$b$b要知道:身為一個混血兒並不代表你就是摩克納薩爾。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10709;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "簽署塔利的切結書，接著與瑞利‧薩普納伯談談以使用ZC號。", Objectives AC enUS : "Sign Tally's Waiver, then speak with Rally Zapnabber to use the Zephyrium Capacitorium." ; Wowhead enUS : "Sign Tally's Waiver, then speak with Rally Zapnabber to use the Zephyrium Capacitorium.",  OLD Details : "我一直都在搬弄著ZC號，因此我準備好進行另一個測試了!你想要幫忙嗎?$B$B下一次的飛行會很短，但是很快!$B$B嗯...雖然我確定不會有危險...不過我有準備這個，呃，同意書要你簽署。這只是形式上啦，我跟你保證!$B$B祝你好運囉!要升空時跟瑞利談談，實驗結束後回來找我!", Details AC enUS : "I've been fiddling with the Zephyrium Capicitorium and I'm ready to perform another test!  Do you want to help?$B$BThis next flight should be short, but fast!$B$BUm... and although I'm sure there's no danger... I have this, uh, waiver that I'd like  you to sign.  It's just a formality, I assure you!$B$BBest of luck!  Talk to Rally to launch yourself, and come back to me after the experiment is over!" ; Wowhead enUS : "I've been fiddling with the Zephyrium Capicitorium and I'm ready to perform another test! Do you want to help?$b$bThis next flight should be short, but fast!$b$bUm... and although I'm sure there's no danger... I have this, uh, waiver that I'd like you to sign. It's just a formality, I assure you!$b$bBest of luck! Talk to Rally to launch yourself, and come back to me after the experiment is over!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '簽署塔利的切結書，接著與瑞利·薩普納伯談談以使用ZC號。完成後回到托斯利基地找塔利·薩普納伯。', `Details` = '我一直都在搬弄著ZC號，因此我準備好進行另一個測試了!你想要幫忙嗎?$b$b下一次的飛行會很短，但是很快!$b$b嗯……雖然我確定不會有危險……不過我有準備這個，呃，同意書要你簽署。這只是形式上啦，我跟你保證!$b$b祝你好運囉!要升空時跟瑞利談談，實驗結束後回來找我!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10710;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "與瑞利‧薩普納伯談談以使用ZC號。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Rally Zapnabber to use the Zephyrium Capacitorium." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Rally Zapnabber to use the Zephyrium Capacitorium.",  OLD Details : "$n，我將ZC號的效能提高了百分之三十。那將會一個等同你的體重的測試物品和風阻比率發射達到新的高度!想要驗證我的理論嗎?這個實驗應該會將你發送到接近雷森平台的地方。$B$B與瑞利談談...他會幫你準備好升空。", Details AC enUS : "$n, I raised the efficiency of the Zephyrium Capacitorium by 30 percent.  That will launch a test subject of your weight and wind drag ratio to new heights!  Want to test my theory?  This experiment ought to send you near Razaan's Landing.$B$BSpeak with Rally... he'll get you prepared for launch." ; Wowhead enUS : "$n, I raised the efficiency of the Zephyrium Capacitorium by 30 percent. That will launch a test subject of your weight and wind drag ratio to new heights! Want to test my theory? This experiment ought to send you near Razaan's Landing.$b$bSpeak with Rally... he'll get you prepared for launch."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '與瑞利·薩普納伯談談以使用ZC號。完成後回到托斯利基地找塔利·薩普納伯。', `Details` = '$n，我將ZC號的效能提高了百分之三十。那將會一個等同你的體重的測試物品和風阻比率發射達到新的高度!想要驗證我的理論嗎?這個實驗應該會將你發送到接近雷森平台的地方。$b$b與瑞利談談……他會幫你準備好升空。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10711;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "與瑞利‧薩普納伯談談以使用ZC號。飛到魯安曠野的途中，轉動虛空天氣風向儀。將旋轉的虛空天氣風向儀送到永恆樹林給歐瑪利‧贊普奈。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Rally Zapnabber to use the Zephyrium Capacitorium.  While flying to Ruuan Weald, spin the Nether-weather Vane.  Deliver the Spinning Nether-weather Vane to O'Mally Zapnabber in Evergrove." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Rally Zapnabber to use the Zephyrium Capacitorium.  While flying to Ruuan Weald, spin the Nether-weather Vane.  Deliver the Spinning Nether-weather Vane to O'Mally Zapnabber in Evergrove.",  OLD Details : "你好阿，$n。很高興又遇到你了!我有一個非常重要的任務!$B$B這是一個旋轉的虛空天氣風向儀。我需要你在飛行時帶幾個幫我閱讀上面的數據後再將它們交給我在魯安曠野的親戚。$B$B與瑞利談談後搭乘一架ZC號飛往魯安曠野去。在你飛行時，轉動這個風向儀!$B$B登陸後，帶著這個旋轉風向儀給歐瑪利‧贊普奈。$B$B祝你好運，$n。別遲到了!", Details AC enUS : "Hey, $N.  I'm glad I caught you!  I have a very important mission!$B$BHere is a nether-weather vane.  I need you to take some in flight readings for me and deliver them to my cousin in Ruuan Weald.$B$BSpeak with Rally and take a Zephyrium Capacitorium flight to Ruuan Weald.  While you're flying, spin the vane!$B$BAfter you land, bring the spinning vane to O'Mally Zabnabber.$B$BGood luck, $n.  And don't delay!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Hey, $n. I'm glad I caught you! I have a very important mission!$b$bHere is a nether-weather vane. I need you to take some in flight readings for me and deliver them to my cousin in Ruuan Weald.$b$bSpeak with Rally and take a Zephyrium Capacitorium flight to Ruuan Weald. While you're flying, spin the vane!$b$bAfter you land, bring the spinning vane to O'Mally Zabnabber.$b$bGood luck, $n. And don't delay!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '與瑞利·薩普納伯談談以使用ZC號。飛到魯安曠野的途中，轉動虛空天氣風向儀。將旋轉的虛空天氣風向儀送到魯安曠野給歐瑪利·贊普奈。', `Details` = '你好阿，$n。很高興又遇到你了!我有一個非常重要的任務!$b$b這是一個旋轉的虛空天氣風向儀。我需要你在飛行時帶幾個幫我閱讀上面的數據後再將它們交給我在魯安曠野的親戚。$b$b與瑞利談談後搭乘一架ZC號飛往魯安曠野去。在你飛行時，轉動這個風向儀!$b$b登陸後，帶著這個旋轉風向儀給歐瑪利·贊普奈。$b$b祝你好運，$n。別遲到了!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10712;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "...行動的時間到了", Title AC enUS : "...and a Time for Action" ; Wowhead enUS : "...and a Time for Action",  OLD Objectives : "殺掉10個巨龍教團砍伐者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay 10 Wyrmcult Hewers." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay 10 Wyrmcult Hewers.",  OLD Details : "我們不能袖手旁觀任由他們在我們身邊屠殺魯安曠野。我們首要的考慮一定是那些樹。$B$B$C，我要你回到曠野去幫我們傳達一個非常特別的訊息。我要你殺掉每一個你接觸到的砍伐者!$B$B如果他們不講道理，或許他們會聽從這種更武斷的勸導!", Details AC enUS : "We will not stand idly by while they decimate the Ruuan Weald around us.  Our first priority must be to the trees.$B$B$C, I want you to go back out into the Weald and deliver a very different message for us.  I want you to slay every one of their hewers that you come into contact with!$B$BIf they will not listen to reason, perhaps they will listen to a more assertive method of persuasion!" ; Wowhead enUS : "We will not stand idly by while they decimate the Ruuan Weald around us. Our first priority must be to the trees.$b$b$c, I want you to go back out into the Weald and deliver a very different message for us. I want you to slay every one of their hewers that you come into contact with!$b$bIf they will not listen to reason, perhaps they will listen to a more assertive method of persuasion!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wyrmcult Hewer slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '……行動的時間到了', `Objectives` = '到魯安曠野去殺掉10個巨龍教團砍伐者，完成後回到劍刃山脈的永恆樹林找林木守衛蕭恩。', `Details` = '我們不能袖手旁觀任由他們在我們身邊屠殺魯安曠野。我們首要的考慮一定是那些樹。$b$b$c，我要你回到曠野去幫我們傳達一個非常特別的訊息。我要你殺掉每一個你接觸到的砍伐者!$b$b如果他們不講道理，或許他們會聽從這種更武斷的勸導!', `Objectivetext1` = '巨龍教團砍伐者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10713;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "史貝瑞的翅膀上", Title AC enUS : "On Spirit's Wings" ; Wowhead enUS : "On Spirit's Wings",  OLD Objectives : "找到忙著聊天的一對血槌監工及血槌預卜者，接著使用雷克薩的哨子召喚出史貝瑞來暗中監視他們。", Objectives AC enUS : "Find a Bloodmaul Taskmaster and a Bloodmaul Soothsayer engaged in conversation, then use Rexxar's Whistle to summon Spirit to spy on them." ; Wowhead enUS : "Find a Bloodmaul Taskmaster and a Bloodmaul Soothsayer engaged in conversation, then use Rexxar's Whistle to summon Spirit to spy on them.",  OLD Details : "如果巨魔們騷擾摩克納薩爾，那麼我將制止他們及他們的跟隨者。巨魔們是一種頭腦簡單的生物，而且摩克納薩爾煩惱對他們而言也幾乎沒有好處。$b$b一定有其他原因。$n，帶著史貝瑞，我的老鷹，並刺探血槌領導人間的談話。他可以進入而不會被發現，但我們不能。", Details AC enUS : "If the Mok'Nathal are tormented by the Bloodmaul ogres, then I will stop them and their followers. Ogres are simple creatures, and there is little profit they could gain from harassing the Mok'Nathal.$b$bThere must be something more to this. $n, take Spirit, my hawk, and spy upon the conversations of the Bloodmaul's leaders. He may go undetected where we cannot." ; Wowhead enUS : "If the Mok'Nathal are tormented by the Bloodmaul ogres, then I will stop them and their followers. Ogres are simple creatures, and there is little profit they could gain from harassing the Mok'Nathal.$b$bThere must be something more to this. $n, take Spirit, my hawk, and spy upon the conversations of the Bloodmaul's leaders. He may go undetected where we cannot."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '精靈的翅膀上', `Objectives` = '找到忙著聊天的一對血槌監工及血槌預言者，接著使用雷克薩的哨子召喚出精靈來暗中監視他們。完成後，回到劍刃山脈的雷霆王村找雷克薩。', `Details` = '如果巨魔們騷擾摩克納薩爾，那麼我將制止他們及他們的跟隨者。巨魔們是一種頭腦簡單的生物，而且摩克納薩爾煩惱對他們而言也幾乎沒有好處。$b$b一定有其他原因。$n，帶著精靈，我的老鷹，並刺探血槌領導人間的談話。他可以進入而不會被發現，但我們不能。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10714;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集7個地殼穿刺者的毒腺。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collet 7 Crust Burster Venom Glands." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collet 7 Crust Burster Venom Glands.",  OLD Details : "那麼，你的雷克薩想要我為他製作一種毒藥嗎？我將給他所想要的，但是是有價格的。即使對朋友，一定也有一個價格。免費的東西破壞友誼。$B$B首先，你必須冒險一小段路程，往西南方到翻騰峽谷。$B$B在那裡的磨坊裡，有一些在整個外域，或任何地方，最毒的生物。我說的是地殼穿刺者，而做這毒劑，將需要收集它們的腺體來給我。", Details AC enUS : "So, your Rexxar would have me fashion a poison for him? I'll give him what he desires, but there will be a price. Even for friends, there must be a price. Free things destroy friendships.$B$BFirst, you must venture a short distance to the southwest to the Churning Gulch.$B$BTherein mill some of the most poisonous creatures in all of Outland, or anywhere. I speak of the crust bursters, and this poison will require gathering their glands for me." ; Wowhead enUS : "So, your Rexxar would have me fashion a poison for him? I'll give him what he desires, but there will be a price. Even for friends, there must be a price. Free things destroy friendships.$b$bFirst, you must venture a short distance to the southwest to the Churning Gulch.$b$bTherein mill some of the most poisonous creatures in all of Outland, or anywhere. I speak of the crust bursters, and this poison will require gathering their glands for me."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '沙伯邁恩男爵已經告訴你為了要做出雷克薩需要的毒藥，你必須取得7個地殼穿刺者的毒腺。一旦你完成任務，返回到劍刃山脈位於血之環的沙伯邁恩男爵處。', `Details` = '那麼，你的雷克薩想要我為他製作一種毒藥嗎?我將給他所想要的，但是是有價格的。即使對朋友，一定也有一個價格。免費的東西破壞友誼。$b$b首先，你必須冒險一小段路程，往西南方到翻騰峽谷。$b$b在那裡的磨坊裡，有一些在整個外域，或任何地方，最毒的生物。我說的是地殼穿刺者，而做這毒劑，將需要收集它們的腺體來給我。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10715;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集5個巨龍教團織網。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 5 Wyrmcult Nets." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 5 Wyrmcult Nets.",  OLD Details : "原諒我，但我無法不去偷聽你跟蕭恩的對話。我想要幫忙你。$B$B我正在研究黑翼集會所的事，並幫忙德魯伊們與他們交易。$B$B我很想要幾隻他們的幼龍;這會有助於我們藉由了解他們所尊敬事物來判斷我們真正對抗的是什麼。$B$B不過首先，我們得需要一些網子。我注意到魯安曠野外圍的巨龍教團盜獵者身上有一大堆網子。", Details AC enUS : "Pardon me, but I couldn't help but overhear your conversation with Chawn.  I'd like to help.$B$BI'm studying the Blackwing Coven, and helping the druids in their dealings with them.$B$BI am very interested in acquiring a few of their dragon whelps; it would help us to gauge exactly what we're up against by understanding that which they revere.$B$BBut first, we're going to need to acquire some nets.  I noticed that the wyrmcult poachers out in the Ruuan Weald have an abundance of them." ; Wowhead enUS : "Pardon me, but I couldn't help but overhear your conversation with Chawn. I'd like to help.$b$bI'm studying the Blackwing Coven, and helping the druids in their dealings with them.$b$bI am very interested in acquiring a few of their dragon whelps; it would help us to gauge exactly what we're up against by understanding that which they revere.$b$bBut first, we're going to need to acquire some nets. I noticed that the wyrmcult poachers out in the Ruuan Weald have an abundance of them."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '沙彌亞·暗示者要你去取得5個巨龍教團織網並帶回劍刃山脈的永恆樹林交給她。', `Details` = '原諒我，但我無法不去偷聽你跟蕭恩的對話。我想要幫忙你。$b$b我正在研究黑翼集會所的事，並幫忙德魯伊們與他們交易。$b$b我很想要幾隻他們的幼龍;這會有助於我們藉由了解他們所尊敬事物來判斷我們真正對抗的是什麼。$b$b不過首先，我們得需要一些網子。我注意到魯安曠野外圍的巨龍教團盜獵者身上有一大堆網子。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10717;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到劍刃山脈之雷霆王村找雷克薩交談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Rexxar at Thunderlord Stronghold in the Blade's Edge Mountains." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Rexxar at Thunderlord Stronghold in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",  OLD Details : "$n，既然你能看見我，有樣東西你必須告訴雷克薩。我知道他在尋找他的族人，並且我也知道他們在那裡。$B$B摩克納薩爾，正如他們被人所知道的，在剃刀山脊東方有一個村莊。$B$B去那裡，帶給雷克薩這則消息。他的人處境危險，而且我知道他將想要來幫助他們。", Details AC enUS : "$N, now that you can see me, there is something you must tell Rexxar. I know that he seeks his people, and I know where they are.$B$BThe Mok'Nathal, as they are known, have a village to the east beyond the Razor Ridge.$B$BGo, give Rexxar this news. His people are in danger, and I know that he will want to come to their aid." ; Wowhead enUS : "$n, now that you can see me, there is something you must tell Rexxar. I know that he seeks his people, and I know where they are.$b$bThe Mok'Nathal, as they are known, have a village to the east beyond the Razor Ridge.$b$bGo, give Rexxar this news. His people are in danger, and I know that he will want to come to their aid."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '嘎姆·狼伴已經告訴你摩克納薩爾，雷克薩的族人，住在那裡。對劍刃山脈之雷霆王村的雷克薩說這件事。', `Details` = '$n，既然你能看見我，有樣東西你必須告訴雷克薩。我知道他在尋找他的族人，並且我也知道他們在那裡。$b$b摩克納薩爾，正如他們被人所知道的，在剃刀山脊東方有一個村莊。$b$b去那裡，帶給雷克薩這則消息。他的人處境危險，而且我知道他將想要來幫助他們。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10718;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在土撥鼠的巢穴使用科多獸皮鼓。在控制土撥鼠後，在血槌營地的3個小桶裡下毒。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use the Kodohide Drum at the Marmot Den. While controlling the Marmot, poison the three kegs in the Bloodmaul Camp." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use the Kodohide Drum at the Marmot Den. While controlling the Marmot, poison the three kegs in the Bloodmaul Camp.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "在綠泡烈酒桶中投毒", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Poison the keg of Green Spot Grog" ; Wowhead enUS : "Poison the keg of Green Spot Grog",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "在月光陳釀酒桶中投毒", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "Poison the keg of Ripe Moonshine" ; Wowhead enUS : "Poison the keg of Ripe Moonshine"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '在土撥鼠的巢穴使用科多獸皮鼓。在控制土撥鼠後，在血槌營地的3只小桶裡下毒。當那完成時，返回劍刃山脈之雷霆王村的雷克薩那裡。', `Objectivetext1` = '對綠點烈酒桶下毒', `Objectivetext2` = '對成熟的月光酒桶下毒', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10720;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "取得葛魯洛克的袋子。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect Grulloc's Sack." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect Grulloc's Sack.",  OLD Details : "$n，我有一頭寵物野豬名字叫胡佛。他想要幫助你去整整附近戈魯爾的兒子之一。$B$B葛魯洛克居住在一個稱為詛咒之谷的地方。當你到達那裡時，放開胡佛。那個古羅將有一段時間會在附近追趕胡佛，而你就取回他看守的一只袋子，並且把它交給沙伯邁恩男爵。$B$B想去詛咒之谷就由北邊的斜坡道向下走，並向東穿過飛龍之末。詛咒之谷在東方的邊界上。", Details AC enUS : "$N, I have a pet boar named Huffer. He wants to help you to have some fun with one of the nearby sons of Gruul.$B$BGrulloc inhabits a place known as the Cursed Hollow. When you get there, let Huffer loose. The gronn will have a fine time chasing him around, and you will retrieve the bag that he guards and deliver it to Baron Sablemane.$B$BTo get to the Cursed Hollow, head down the northern ramp and east through Dragons' End. The hollow is on the eastern edge." ; Wowhead enUS : "$n, I have a pet boar named Huffer. He wants to help you to have some fun with one of the nearby sons of Gruul.$b$bGrulloc inhabits a place known as the Cursed Hollow. When you get there, let Huffer loose. The gronn will have a fine time chasing him around, and you will retrieve the bag that he guards and deliver it to Baron Sablemane.$b$bTo get to the Cursed Hollow, head down the northern ramp and east through Dragons' End. The hollow is on the eastern edge."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '取得葛魯洛克的袋子，並且將它帶到劍刃山脈的血之環交給沙伯邁恩男爵。', `Details` = '$n，我有一頭寵物野豬名字叫胡佛。他想要幫助你去整整附近戈魯爾的兒子之一。$b$b葛魯洛克居住在一個稱為詛咒之谷的地方。當你到達那裡時，放開胡佛。那個古羅將有一段時間會在附近追趕胡佛，而你就取回他看守的一只袋子，並且把它交給沙伯邁恩男爵。$b$b想去詛咒之谷就由北邊的斜坡道向下走，並向東穿過飛龍之末。詛咒之谷在東方的邊界上。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10721;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "從各個巨龍教徒身上收集足夠的戲服碎塊來做出一套監督者偽裝。然後使用這個偽裝來參加和克菲斯‧暗鱗的會議。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect enough Costume Scraps from wyrmcultists to create an Overseer Disguise.  Use the disguise to attend the meeting with Kolphis Darkscale." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect enough Costume Scraps from wyrmcultists to create an Overseer Disguise.  Use the disguise to attend the meeting with Kolphis Darkscale.",  OLD Details : "我知道該怎麼做!$n，你必須假扮成監督者奴阿爾參加這場會議!$B$B集會所裡的巨龍教徒都有一套標準的全套穿著，因此去收集他們不要的碎塊，在你湊足後，將它們拼成一個偽裝。$B$B假扮成監督者奴阿爾與克菲斯‧暗鱗談話看看他有怎麼反應，然後回去找林木守衛蕭恩。$B$B你朝著龍骨隧道的方向順著路經過烏鴉林及葛瑞許納什到盡頭就會找到這個集會所了。", Details AC enUS : "I know what must be done!  $N, you must pose as Overseer Nuaar and attend that meeting!$B$BThe wyrmcultists at the coven all have a standard outfit that they wear, so go collect scraps from them, and when you have enough, put together a disguise.$B$BPose as Overseer Nuuar and speak with Kolphis Darkscale to see what he has to say, and then return to Tree Warden Chawn.$B$BYou'll find the coven by heading through the Wyrmskull Tunnel and following the path past the Raven's Wood and Grishnath to its end." ; Wowhead enUS : "I know what must be done! $n, you must pose as Overseer Nuaar and attend that meeting!$b$bThe wyrmcultists at the coven all have a standard outfit that they wear, so go collect scraps from them, and when you have enough, put together a disguise.$b$bPose as Overseer Nuuar and speak with Kolphis Darkscale to see what he has to say, and then return to Tree Warden Chawn.$b$bYou'll find the coven by heading through the Wyrmskull Tunnel and following the path past the Raven's Wood and Grishnath to its end."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '從各個巨龍教徒身上收集足夠的戲服碎塊來做出一套監督者偽裝。使用這個偽裝來參加和克菲斯·暗鱗的會議，並將你的發現回報給劍刃山脈裡永恆樹林的林木守衛蕭恩。', `Details` = '我知道該怎麼做!$n，你必須假扮成監督者奴阿爾參加這場會議!$b$b集會所裡的巨龍教徒都有一套標準的全套穿著，因此去收集他們不要的碎塊，在你湊足後，將它們拼成一個偽裝。$b$b假扮成監督者奴阿爾與克菲斯·暗鱗談話看看他有怎麼反應，然後回去找林木守衛蕭恩。$b$b你朝著龍骨隧道的方向順著路經過烏鴉林及葛瑞許納什到盡頭就會找到這個集會所了。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10722;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "『食龍者』柯爾葛羅姆", Title AC enUS : "Gorgrom the Dragon-Eater" ; Wowhead enUS : "Gorgrom the Dragon-Eater",  OLD Objectives : "從圓面巨魔那裡收集3個可怕圖騰。於柯爾葛羅姆的祭壇使用和設置沙伯邁恩的陷阱，然後召喚並殺死『食龍者』柯爾葛羅姆。$b$b當柯爾葛羅姆死掉後，把3個可怕圖騰放置在他屍體附近。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 3 Grisly Totems from the Boulder'mok ogres. Then, use Sablemane's Trap at Gorgrom's Altar to set the trap and summon and kill Gorgrom the Dragon-Eater.$b$bWhen Gorgrom is dead, place the 3 Grisly Totems near his corpse." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 3 Grisly Totems from the Boulder'mok ogres. Then, use Sablemane's Trap at Gorgrom's Altar to set the trap and summon and kill Gorgrom the Dragon-Eater.$b$bWhen Gorgrom is dead, place the 3 Grisly Totems near his corpse.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "設置可怕圖騰", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Plant Grisly Totem" ; Wowhead enUS : "Plant Grisly Totem"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '食龍者柯爾葛羅姆', `Objectives` = '去圓面之地並且從圓面巨魔那裡收集3個可怕圖騰。於柯爾葛羅姆的祭壇使用沙伯邁恩的陷阱，並召喚及殺死食龍者，柯爾葛羅姆。$b$b當柯爾葛羅姆死掉後，把3個可怕圖騰放置在他屍體附近，然後返回劍刃山脈之雷霆王村的雷克薩那裡。', `Objectivetext1` = '放置可怕圖騰', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10723;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死劍刃巨魔取得蠍尾獅的牢籠鑰匙。取得鑰匙後，找到蠍尾獅的牢籠並且使用史貝瑞之哨召喚史貝瑞來打開籠子，讓牠來釋放里奧克。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay Bladespire ogres to get the Wyvern Cage Key. Once you have it, go to the Wyvern Cage and use Spirit's Whistle to summon Spirit, who will unlock the cage to free Leokk." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay Bladespire ogres to get the Wyvern Cage Key. Once you have it, go to the Wyvern Cage and use Spirit's Whistle to summon Spirit, who will unlock the cage to free Leokk.",  OLD Details : "在我到達這座山之後不久，我受到一隊劍刃巨魔的攻擊。$b$b雖然我在與他們戰鬥中順利逃脫，並且殺死很多巨魔，但他們帶走了我的蠍尾獅，里奧克，還把牠關了起來。史貝瑞已經找到牠，被關在戈魯爾之巢外劍刃營地中央的一個籠子裡。$b$b其中的一個巨魔身上必定帶著鑰匙。找到他，史貝瑞就能用鑰匙打開關著里奧克的籠子。$b$b你可以在下方匕爪峽谷的最北邊找到那些巨魔的營地。", Details AC enUS : "Shortly after my arrival in the mountains, I came under attack by a group of Bladespire ogres.$b$bThough I fought free of them, and slew many, they took my wyvern, Leokk, captive. Spirit has found him, locked in a cage in the heart of the Bladespire encampment outside of Gruul's lair.$b$bOne of the ogres must carry his key. Find it and Spirit can use it to unlock Leokk's cage.$B$BYou will find the encampment at the north end of the Daggermaw Canyon down below." ; Wowhead enUS : "Shortly after my arrival in the mountains, I came under attack by a group of Bladespire ogres.$b$bThough I fought free of them, and slew many, they took my wyvern, Leokk, captive. Spirit has found him, locked in a cage in the heart of the Bladespire encampment outside of Gruul's lair.$b$bOne of the ogres must carry his key. Find it and Spirit can use it to unlock Leokk's cage.$b$bYou will find the encampment at the north end of the Daggermaw Canyon down below.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "拯救裡奧克", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Rescue Leokk"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死劍刃巨魔取得雙足翼龍的牢籠鑰匙。取得鑰匙後，找到雙足翼龍的牢籠並且使用精靈之哨召喚打開籠子的精靈。在里奧克自由後，返回劍刃山脈的雷霆王村向雷克薩回報。', `Details` = '在我到達這些山之後不久，我受到一隊劍刃巨魔的攻擊。$b$b雖然我在與他們戰鬥中順利逃脫，並且殺死很多巨魔，但他們帶走了我的翼龍，里奧克，還把他關了起來。精靈們已經找到他，被關在戈魯爾之巢外劍刃營地中央的一只籠裡。$b$b其中的一個巨魔必定帶著鎖他的鑰匙。找到它，那精靈就能用它打開關里奧克籠子的鎖。$b$b你可以在下方匕爪峽谷的最北邊找到那些巨魔的營地。', `Objectivetext1` = '拯救里奧克', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10724;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在苟克祭壇上使用雷克薩的戰爭號角，接著殺掉苟克。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use Rexxar's Battle Horn at the Altar of Goc, then kill Goc." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use Rexxar's Battle Horn at the Altar of Goc, then kill Goc.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Goc slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '在苟克祭壇上使用雷克薩的戰爭號角，接著殺掉苟克。完成任務後回到劍刃山脈的雷霆王村找雷克薩。', `Objectivetext1` = '苟克 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10742;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "使用黑色幼龍網捕抓10隻巨龍教團黑色幼龍。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use the Blackwhelp Net to capture 10 Wyrmcult Blackwhelps." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use the Blackwhelp Net to capture 10 Wyrmcult Blackwhelps.",  OLD Details : "我需要檢查生長在黑翼集會所的那些幼龍。$B$B那裡有一大群幼龍在洞穴裡外飛來飛去，同樣的也有為數不少的蛋，可能你一靠近就會孵化。$B$B$n，麻煩你拿著這個網子去活抓一堆幼龍給我。$B$B朝西前進越過龍骨橋或經過龍骨隧道可以找到它們。順著路一路經過葛瑞許納什及烏鴉林到盡頭去。", Details AC enUS : "I need to examine the whelps that they are raising at the Blackwing Coven.$B$BThere should be an abundance of them flying around inside their cavernous base, as well as a number of eggs, which if you get close to them will likely hatch.$B$BPlease, $N, take the net and capture a handful of them alive for me.$B$BFind them by heading west across the Wyrmskull Bridge and heading through the Wyrmskull Tunnel.  Follow the path to its end past Grishnath and the Raven's Wood." ; Wowhead enUS : "I need to examine the whelps that they are raising at the Blackwing Coven.$b$bThere should be an abundance of them flying around inside their cavernous base, as well as a number of eggs, which if you get close to them will likely hatch.$b$bPlease, $n, take the net and capture a handful of them alive for me.$b$bFind them by heading west across the Wyrmskull Bridge and heading through the Wyrmskull Tunnel. Follow the path to its end past Grishnath and the Raven's Wood."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '沙彌亞·暗示者要你使用黑色幼龍網補抓10隻巨龍教團黑色幼龍。將這些幼龍帶到劍刃山脈的永恆樹林給她。', `Details` = '我需要檢查生長在黑翼集會所的那些幼龍。$b$b那裡有一大群幼龍在洞穴裡外飛來飛去，同樣的也有為數不少的蛋，可能你一靠近就會孵化。$b$b$n，麻煩你拿著這個網子去活抓一堆幼龍給我。$b$b朝西前進越過龍骨橋或經過龍骨隧道可以找到它們。順著路一路經過葛瑞許納什及烏鴉林到盡頭去。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10747;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺掉灰喉麥克斯納爾。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay Maxnar the Ashmaw." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay Maxnar the Ashmaw.",  OLD Details : "他們讓我們別無選擇，$n。是時候把黑翼集會所帶來的威脅做個了結了，殺掉他們的領導者，灰喉麥克斯納爾。$B$B我不知道你在那裡的時候有沒有瞥見他，但他是龍族的一員，半人半龍。而且他很強壯，所以不要低估了他!$B$B快點把它了結，幸運的話你就能保衛永恆樹林和魯安曠野的安全。", Details AC enUS : "They've left us no choice, $N.  It's time to put an end to the threat from the Blackwing Coven by taking out their leader, Maxnar the Ashmaw.$B$BI don't know if you caught a glimpse of him while you were in there, but he's one of the dragonkin, half-man, half-dragon.  And he's tough, so don't underestimate him!$B$BFinish it quickly and with any luck you'll secure the safety of Evergrove and the Ruuan Weald." ; Wowhead enUS : "They've left us no choice, $n. It's time to put an end to the threat from the Blackwing Coven by taking out their leader, Maxnar the Ashmaw.$b$bI don't know if you caught a glimpse of him while you were in there, but he's one of the dragonkin, half-man, half-dragon. And he's tough, so don't underestimate him!$b$bFinish it quickly and with any luck you'll secure the safety of Evergrove and the Ruuan Weald.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Maxnar the Ashmaw slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '代表永恆樹林的塞納里奧遠征隊的德魯伊，以及魯安曠野當地的生命，林木守衛蕭恩要你去殺掉灰喉麥克斯納爾。完成後回到劍刃山脈的永恆樹林找他。', `Details` = '他們讓我們別無選擇，$n。是時候把黑翼集會所帶來的威脅做個了結了，殺掉他們的領導者，灰喉麥克斯納爾。$b$b我不知道你在那裡的時候有沒有瞥見他，但他是龍族的一員，半人半龍。而且他很強壯，所以不要低估了他!$b$b快點把它了結，幸運的話你就能保衛永恆樹林和魯安曠野的安全。', `Objectivetext1` = '『灰喉』麥克斯納爾 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10748;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "來，把這個拿給你的主人。我確定無論理由為何，雷克薩都會好好使用它。$B$B喔，記得提醒他，他欠我一次。$B$B他知道我要什麼，因此我相信不管如何他都會把東西交給我，我們會比你想像的還要更快再次見到面。$B$B現在，當個聽話的小$g男孩:女孩;把這個送去給雷克薩吧。", Details AC enUS : "Here, take this to your master. I'm sure that whatever the reason, Rexxar will put it to good use.$B$BOh, and do be certain to remind him that he owes me.$B$BHe knows what I want, and I'm certain that however he intends to obtain it for me, I'll be seeing you again sooner than you think.$B$BNow, do be a good little $g boy : girl; and run this up to Rexxar." ; Wowhead enUS : "Here, take this to your master. I'm sure that whatever the reason, Rexxar will put it to good use.$b$bOh, and do be certain to remind him that he owes me.$b$bHe knows what I want, and I'm certain that however he intends to obtain it for me, I'll be seeing you again sooner than you think.$b$bNow, do be a good little $gboy:girl and run this up to Rexxar."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '來，把這個拿給你的主人。我確定無論理由為何，雷克薩都會好好使用它。$b$b喔，記得提醒他，他欠我一次。$b$b他知道我要什麼，因此我相信不管如何他都會把東西交給我，我們會比你想像的還要更快再次見到面。$b$b現在，當個聽話的小$g男孩:女孩把這個送去給雷克薩吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10749;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "最近萊恩·狼行者從達納蘇斯經過奧伯丁而來，朝著梣谷前進;他提到跟熊怪有關的事情。我沒有機會去問她的情況如何但是也許你可以去找她並且提供協助 $C 。順著奧伯丁的南部道路走。一旦你到達梣谷邊界繼續順著路走。你會在那邊找到阿斯特蘭納還有萊恩·狼行者。", Details AC enUS : "Recently Raene Wolfrunner came through Auberdine from Darnassus and was heading to Ashenvale; she said something about the Furbolgs. I wasn't given an opportunity to ask more about her situation but perhaps you can seek her out and lend her your aid $C. Take the southern road out of Auberdine. Once you reach Ashenvale border continue your path down the road. There you will find Astranaar and Raene Wolfrunner." ; Wowhead enUS : "Recently Raene Wolfrunner came through Auberdine from Darnassus and was heading to Ashenvale; she said something about the Furbolgs. I wasn't given an opportunity to ask more about her situation but perhaps you can seek her out and lend her your aid $c. Take the southern road out of Auberdine. Once you reach Ashenvale border continue your path down the road. There you will find Astranaar and Raene Wolfrunner."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '最近萊恩·狼行者從達納蘇斯經過奧伯丁而來，朝著梣谷前進;他提到跟熊怪有關的事情。我沒有機會去問她的情況如何但是也許你可以去找她並且提供協助$c。順著奧伯丁的南部道路走。一旦你到達梣谷邊界繼續順著路走。你會在那邊找到阿斯特蘭納還有萊恩·狼行者。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10752;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "燃燒軍團所犯下的暴行不記其數。即使在我們對話的同時，他們也派出燃燒軍團部隊對付外域的生物們。無力抵抗燃燒軍團的力量，外域的生物們一個接一個的倒下。$n，幫助我停止他們這些破壞自然的罪行。$B$B越過山丘往東邊去，你會看到燃燒軍團的破壞已經遍及整個刀刃峽谷了。殺死犯下這些罪行的元兇，惡魔墮落者，還有盡可能殺死越多的魔誓越好。", Details AC enUS : "The number of atrocities committed by the Burning Legion is countless. Even as we speak, they send their legion forces against the creatures of this land. Helpless to defend against their power, they fall one by one. $N, help me stop these crimes of nature destroy all which they corrupt. $B$BOver the hill, east of here, you will see the corruption spreading across Bladed Gulch. Kill the ones causing the crime, the Fel Corrupters, and as many Felsworn as you can." ; Wowhead enUS : "The number of atrocities committed by the Burning Legion is countless. Even as we speak, they send their legion forces against the creatures of this land. Helpless to defend against their power, they fall one by one. $n, help me stop these crimes of nature destroy all which they corrupt.$b$bOver the hill, east of here, you will see the corruption spreading across Bladed Gulch. Kill the ones causing the crime, the Fel Corrupters, and as many Felsworn as you can.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Felsworn Scalewing slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Felsworn Daggermaw slain",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Fel Corrupter slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '燃燒軍團所犯下的暴行不記其數。即使在我們對話的同時，他們也派出燃燒軍團部隊對付外域的生物們。無力抵抗燃燒軍團的力量，外域的生物們一個接一個的倒下。$n，幫助我停止他們這些破壞自然的罪行。$b$b越過山丘往東邊去，你會看到燃燒軍團的破壞已經遍及整個刀刃峽谷了。殺死犯下這些罪行的元兇，惡魔墮落者，還有盡可能殺死越多的魔誓越好。', `Objectivetext1` = '魔誓鱗翼 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '魔誓匕爪 消滅', `Objectivetext3` = '惡魔墮落者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10753;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "這裡東北方在我們上方的高原上躺著我老家之被燒盡的灰。在燃燒軍團派他們的灼熱小鬼去燒盡我們之前，有一大片森林在那些繁盛。在過了如此多個死寂的世紀後，我疲倦而老去的心甚至仍然渴望復仇。有太多敵人了以致於不能收復土地，但是你能使他們害怕。$B$B確定你願意幫助我?", Details AC enUS : "Northeast of here, on the plateau above us lies the burnt ashes of my ancient home. A great wood flourished there before the Burning Legion sent their imps to burn us away. So many died that even centuries later my tired old heart hungers for revenge. There are too many of them for us to ever reclaim the land, but you could make them afraid.$B$BSurely you will help me?" ; Wowhead enUS : "Northeast of here, on the plateau above us lies the burnt ashes of my ancient home. A great wood flourished there before the Burning Legion sent their imps to burn us away. So many died that even centuries later my tired old heart hungers for revenge. There are too many of them for us to ever reclaim the land, but you could make them afraid.$b$bSurely you will help me?",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Scorch Imp slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '這裡東北方在我們上方的高原上躺著我老家之被燒盡的灰。在燃燒軍團派他們的灼熱小鬼去燒盡我們之前，有一大片森林在那些繁盛。在過了如此多個死寂的世紀後，我疲倦而老去的心甚至仍然渴望復仇。有太多敵人了以致於不能收復土地，但是你能使他們害怕。$b$b確定你願意幫助我?', `Objectivetext1` = '灼熱小鬼 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10770;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "如果你沿著東方的道路並上到山的側面，然後轉向北方，那你將會來到我長期失去的家。曾經在那裡有一棵樹。我早已忘記它的名字了。很久以前燃燒軍團召喚灼熱小鬼和其他火焰生物。我的家就被毀滅了，而我的族人逃離了。現在只有我留下來。$B$B我已經保存了一些可以在肥沃的火山土壤種植的鐵樹根種子。他們的魔力是強大的。為我做這件事，而我將與你同享一批被遺忘已久的財寶。", Details AC enUS : "If you follow the road east and up the side of the mountain, then turn north, you will come to my long lost home.$b$bOnce there was a wood there. Its name is forgotten. Long ago the Burning Legion summoned scorched imps and other creatures of flame. My home was destroyed and my people fled. Now only I remain. $B$BI have saved some ironroot seeds that could be planted in fertile volcanic soil. Their magic is strong. Do this for me and I will share with you the treasures of a forgotten age." ; Wowhead enUS : "If you follow the road east and up the side of the mountain, then turn north, you will come to my long lost home.$b$bOnce there was a wood there. Its name is forgotten. Long ago the Burning Legion summoned scorched imps and other creatures of flame. My home was destroyed and my people fled. Now only I remain.$b$bI have saved some ironroot seeds that could be planted in fertile volcanic soil. Their magic is strong. Do this for me and I will share with you the treasures of a forgotten age."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '如果你沿著東方的道路並上到山的側面，然後轉向北方，那你將會來到我長期失去的家。曾經在那裡有一棵樹。我早已忘記它的名字了。很久以前燃燒軍團召喚灼熱小鬼和其他火焰生物。我的家就被毀滅了，而我的族人逃離了。現在只有我留下來。$b$b我已經保存了一些可以在肥沃的火山土壤種植的鐵樹根種子。他們的魔力是強大的。為我做這件事，而我將與你同享一批被遺忘已久的財寶。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10771;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到劍刃山脈的血之環找沙伯邁恩男爵談談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Baron Sablemane at the Circle of Blood in the Blade's Edge Mountains." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Baron Sablemane at the Circle of Blood in the Blade's Edge Mountains."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '與在劍刃山脈之血之環的沙伯邁恩男爵談話。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10783;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死10個血槌槌兵和5個血槌術士。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay 10 Bloodmaul Maulers and 5 Bloodmaul Warlocks." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay 10 Bloodmaul Maulers and 5 Bloodmaul Warlocks.",  OLD Details : "<吐查克傾身接近低聲地說。>$B$B$n，你到目前為止對我們所做的比與巨魔戰鬥還要自豪。而當我對雷克薩所計畫的有信心時，我將依舊要求你在返回之前，粉碎血槌營地的巨魔們。$B$B那樣我們將加倍確信結果。$B$B要到那裡，向北走，走下雷霆王村外面的斜坡道。然後，在斜坡道底部，向西走越過飛龍之末，並向北穿過翻騰峽谷和匕爪峽谷。", Details AC enUS : "<Tor'chunk leans in close to whisper.>$B$B$N, you've done us more than proud in the fight against the ogres so far.  And while I have every confidence in what Rexxar has planned, I would still ask that you crush the ogres at Bloodmaul Camp before returning.$B$BThat way we'll be doubly certain of the outcome.$B$BTo get there, head north down the ramp out of Thunderlord.  Then, at the base of the ramp, head west across Dragons' End and north through the Churning Gulch and Daggermaw Canyon." ; Wowhead enUS : "<Tor'chunk leans in close to whisper.>$b$b$n, you've done us more than proud in the fight against the ogres so far. And while I have every confidence in what Rexxar has planned, I would still ask that you crush the ogres at Bloodmaul Camp before returning.$b$bThat way we'll be doubly certain of the outcome.$b$bTo get there, head north down the ramp out of Thunderlord. Then, at the base of the ramp, head west across Dragons' End and north through the Churning Gulch and Daggermaw Canyon.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bloodmaul Mauler slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bloodmaul Warlock slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '吐查克·雙爪要求你殺死10個血槌槌兵和5個血槌術士。之後，返回到劍刃山脈之雷霆王村的他那裡。', `Details` = '<吐查克傾身接近低聲地說。>$b$b$n，你到目前為止對我們所做的比與巨魔戰鬥還要自豪。而當我對雷克薩所計畫的有信心時，我將依舊要求你在返回之前，粉碎血槌營地的巨魔們。$b$b那樣我們將加倍確信結果。$b$b要到那裡，向北走，走下雷霆王村外面的斜坡道。然後，在斜坡道底部，向西走越過飛龍之末，並向北穿過翻騰峽谷和匕爪峽谷。', `Objectivetext1` = '血槌槌兵 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '血槌術士 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10784;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "在這個世界沒有其他原因能比戈魯爾和他兒子們更能令我憎惡!他們屠殺我的族人-我的孩子-現在我將嚐到報仇的滋味!$B$B我已經利用龍火做成一個陷阱，如果你夠聰明的話，你甚至可以使用它來殺死古羅。$B$B快一點就對了，把陷阱拿給雷克薩。$B$B我渴求報仇的火焰必須要被撲滅!", Details AC enUS : "There's is no cause of fury greater in this world than that of Gruul and his sons. They slaughtered my people - my children - and now I will have revenge.$B$BI have fashioned a trap from dragon fire, and if you're clever enough, you can use it to kill even a gronn.$B$BJust hurry, take the trap to Rexxar. My thirst for revenge must be quenched." ; Wowhead enUS : "There's is no cause of fury greater in this world than that of Gruul and his sons. They slaughtered my people - my children - and now I will have revenge.$b$bI have fashioned a trap from dragon fire, and if you're clever enough, you can use it to kill even a gronn.$b$bJust hurry, take the trap to Rexxar. My thirst for revenge must be quenched."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '在這個世界沒有其他原因能比戈魯爾和他兒子們更能令我憎惡!他們屠殺我的族人-我的孩子-現在我將嚐到報仇的滋味!$b$b我已經利用龍火做成一個陷阱，如果你夠聰明的話，你甚至可以使用它來殺死古羅。$b$b快一點就對了，把陷阱拿給雷克薩。$b$b我渴求報仇的火焰必須要被撲滅!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10785;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "屠殺5個劍刃蠻卒和3個劍刃薩滿，然後返回劍刃山脈的雷霆王村找吐查克‧雙爪。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay 5 Boulder'mok Brutes and 3 Boulder'mok Shaman, and then return to Tor'chunk Twoclaws at Thunderlord Stronghold in the Blade's Edge Mountains." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay 5 Boulder'mok Brutes and 3 Boulder'mok Shaman, and then return to Tor'chunk Twoclaws at Thunderlord Stronghold in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",  OLD Details : "我知道雷克薩有計畫要你向圓面之地前進。當你到那裡時，我有一些想要你去做的事情。$B$B我們必須把握任何能打倒這些山上的巨魔的機會，否則他們將佔領我們，這樣我們就會流血並且無意義的死去!$B$B圓面之地位於西北方遠處。向北走到魯安曠野，然後從那裡走向西邊，穿過隧道並通過烏鴉林。$B$B$n，我想要你殺掉圓面之地的劍刃巨魔們。徹底消滅他們!", Details AC enUS : "I know that Rexxar has plans for you to head to Boulder'mok.  I have something that I want you to do while you are there.$B$BWe must take any chance we can get to strike down the ogres of these mountains, or they will overrun us, and all that we have bled and died for will be for nothing!$B$BBoulder'mok lies far to the northwest.  Travel north to Ruuan Weald, and from there head west through the tunnel and past the Raven's Wood.$B$B$N, I want you to kill the Bladespire ogres of Boulder'mok.  Wipe them out!" ; Wowhead enUS : "I know that Rexxar has plans for you to head to Boulder'mok. I have something that I want you to do while you are there.$b$bWe must take any chance we can get to strike down the ogres of these mountains, or they will overrun us, and all that we have bled and died for will be for nothing!$b$bBoulder'mok lies far to the northwest. Travel north to Ruuan Weald, and from there head west through the tunnel and past the Raven's Wood.$b$b$n, I want you to kill the Bladespire ogres of Boulder'mok. Wipe them out!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Boulder'mok Brute slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Boulder'mok Shaman slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '屠殺5個劍刃蠻卒和3個劍刃薩滿，然後返回劍刃山脈之雷霆王村的吐查克·雙爪那裡。', `Details` = '我知道雷克薩有計畫要你向圓面之地前進。當你到那裡時，我有一些想要你去做的事情。$b$b我們必須把握任何能打倒這些山上的巨魔的機會，否則他們將佔領我們，這樣我們就會流血並且無意義的死去!$b$b圓面之地位於西北方遠處。向北走到魯安曠野，然後從那裡走向西邊，穿過隧道並通過烏鴉林。$b$b$n，我想要你殺掉圓面之地的劍刃巨魔們。徹底消滅他們!', `Objectivetext1` = '圓面蠻卒 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '圓面薩滿 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10786;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死血槌營地的多爾哥克。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay Dorgok at Bloodmaul Camp." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay Dorgok at Bloodmaul Camp.",  OLD Details : "非常好，我已經看見你在附近，我一直有一些重要的事情想對你講。$B$B有報告說由於某些原因，血槌巨魔計畫對希爾瓦納和魯安曠野發動攻擊。我們不知道是誰或者什麼東西在催促他們做這事，但是我打算趁早摧毀他們的計畫!$B$B攻擊將從血槌營地開始。沿著魯安曠野外面斜坡道向西北走下去，你就會找到它。我要你殺死他們的領導人，多爾哥克!", Details AC enUS : "Good, I've seen you around and I've been meaning to speak to you about a matter of some importance.$B$BThere are reports coming in that for some reason the Bloodmaul ogres are planning an offensive against Sylvanaar and Ruuan Weald.  We don't know who or what is pushing them to do this, but I intend to nip their plan in the bud!$B$BBloodmaul Camp is where the attacks are to be staged from.  Head northwest down the ramp out of the Ruuan Weald and you will find it.  I want you to kill their leader, Dorgok!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Good, I've seen you around and I've been meaning to speak to you about a matter of some importance.$b$bThere are reports coming in that for some reason the Bloodmaul ogres are planning an offensive against Sylvanaar and Ruuan Weald. We don't know who or what is pushing them to do this, but I intend to nip their plan in the bud!$b$bBloodmaul Camp is where the attacks are to be staged from. Head northwest down the ramp out of the Ruuan Weald and you will find it. I want you to kill their leader, Dorgok!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Dorgok slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '指揮官海法斯·石牆要你殺死血槌營地的多爾哥克。在你完成之後，返回劍刃山脈的永恆樹林找他。', `Details` = '非常好，我已經看見你在附近，我一直有一些重要的事情想對你講。$b$b有報告說由於某些原因，血槌巨魔計畫對希爾瓦納和魯安曠野發動攻擊。我們不知道是誰或者什麼東西在催促他們做這事，但是我打算趁早摧毀他們的計畫!$b$b攻擊將從血槌營地開始。沿著魯安曠野外面斜坡道向西北走下去，你就會找到它。我要你殺死他們的領導人，多爾哥克!', `Objectivetext1` = '多爾哥克 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10795;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死10個血槌槌兵和5個血槌術士。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay 10 Bloodmaul Maulers and 5 Bloodmaul Warlocks." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay 10 Bloodmaul Maulers and 5 Bloodmaul Warlocks.",  OLD Details : "我聽說你到目前為止對我們所做的比與巨魔戰鬥還要自豪。現在，我將要求你再次面對他們。我要你摧毀血槌營地的巨魔!$B$B要去那裡，就從魯安曠野外的斜坡往西北方走下去。你將在斜坡道的底部找到他們。$B$B祝你好運，$c!", Details AC enUS : "I've heard that you've done us more than proud in the fight against the ogres thus far.  Now, I would ask that you face them again.  I want you to crush the ogres at Bloodmaul Camp!$B$BTo get down there, head northwest down the ramp out of the Ruuan Weald.  You'll find them at the base of the ramp.$B$BGood luck, $c!" ; Wowhead enUS : "I've heard that you've done us more than proud in the fight against the ogres thus far. Now, I would ask that you face them again. I want you to crush the ogres at Bloodmaul Camp!$b$bTo get down there, head northwest down the ramp out of the Ruuan Weald. You'll find them at the base of the ramp.$b$bGood luck, $c!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bloodmaul Mauler slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bloodmaul Warlock slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '中尉費爾威德要你殺死10個血槌槌兵和5個血槌術士。之後，返回劍刃山脈的永恆樹林找她。', `Details` = '我聽說你到目前為止對我們所做的比與巨魔戰鬥還要自豪。現在，我將要求你再次面對他們。我要你摧毀血槌營地的巨魔!$b$b要去那裡，就從魯安曠野外的斜坡往西北方走下去。你將在斜坡道的底部找到他們。$b$b祝你好運，$c!', `Objectivetext1` = '血槌槌兵 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '血槌術士 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10796;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將柯爾葛羅姆的徽章帶到劍刃山脈的永恆樹林交給指揮官海法斯‧石牆。", Objectives AC enUS : "Deliver Gorgrom's Favor to Commander Haephus Stonewall at Evergrove in the Blade's Edge Mountains." ; Wowhead enUS : "Deliver Gorgrom's Favor to Commander Haephus Stonewall at Evergrove in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",  OLD Details : "一個小雕像標誌從多爾哥克死亡的爪子上掉下來。它與某個古羅有明顯的相似處。$B$B想必斜坡上往東，魯安曠野的永恆樹林有個指揮官海法斯‧石牆會對這東西感興趣!", Details AC enUS : "A token in the form of a small statuette falls from Dorgok's dead clutch.  It bears a striking resemblance to one of the gronn.$B$BSurely, Commander Haephus Stonewall at Evergrove in the Ruuan Weald, up the ramp to the east, would be interested in this!" ; Wowhead enUS : "A token in the form of a small statuette falls from Dorgok's dead clutch. It bears a striking resemblance to one of the gronn.$b$bSurely, Commander Haephus Stonewall at Evergrove in the Ruuan Weald, up the ramp to the east, would be interested in this!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將柯爾葛羅姆的徽章帶到劍刃山脈的永恆樹林交給指揮官海法斯·石牆。', `Details` = '一個小雕像標誌從多爾哥克死亡的爪子上掉下來。它與某個古羅有明顯的相似處。$b$b想必斜坡上往東，魯安曠野的永恆樹林有個指揮官海法斯·石牆會對這東西感興趣!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10797;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到劍刃山脈的血之環找沙伯邁恩男爵談談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Baron Sablemane at the Circle of Blood in the Blade's Edge Mountains." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Baron Sablemane at the Circle of Blood in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",  OLD Details : "這是個壞消息。食龍者柯爾葛羅姆是最近對抗希爾瓦納血槌計畫的幕後主使者!$B$B為什麼他在操縱他們，而不只是利用劍刃，我不知道。但如果我們要對付古羅，我們就需要幫助。$B$B我認識一個精通各種奇特魔法的人。他的名字叫沙伯邁恩男爵，你可以在血之環找到他，回到西北邊的斜坡下，再往西南方通過峽谷。$B$B請他幫我們製作一個給古羅的陷阱。", Details AC enUS : "This is bad news.  Gorgrom the Dragon-Eater is behind the recent Bloodmaul plans against Sylvanaar!$B$BWhy he's manipulating them, and not just using the Bladespire, I don't know.  But if we're to deal with a gronn, we're going to need help.$B$BI know a man who is wise in the ways of all sorts of exotic magics.  Baron Sablemane is his name, and you can find him at the Circle of Blood, back down the ramp to the northwest, and then southwest through the canyon.$B$BAsk him to fashion us a trap for the gronn." ; Wowhead enUS : "This is bad news. Gorgrom the Dragon-Eater is behind the recent Bloodmaul plans against Sylvanaar!$b$bWhy he's manipulating them, and not just using the Bladespire, I don't know. But if we're to deal with a gronn, we're going to need help.$b$bI know a man who is wise in the ways of all sorts of exotic magics. Baron Sablemane is his name, and you can find him at the Circle of Blood, back down the ramp to the northwest, and then southwest through the canyon.$b$bAsk him to fashion us a trap for the gronn."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '和沙伯邁恩男爵談談關於製作陷阱的事。他就在劍刃山脈的血之環。', `Details` = '這是個壞消息。食龍者柯爾葛羅姆是最近對抗希爾瓦納血槌計畫的幕後主使者!$b$b為什麼他在操縱他們，而不只是利用劍刃，我不知道。但如果我們要對付古羅，我們就需要幫助。$b$b我認識一個精通各種奇特魔法的人。他的名字叫沙伯邁恩男爵，你可以在血之環找到他，回到西北邊的斜坡下，再往西南方通過峽谷。$b$b請他幫我們製作一個給古羅的陷阱。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10798;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "從圓面巨魔那裡收集3種可怕圖騰。接著在柯爾葛羅姆的祭壇使用沙伯邁恩的陷阱來召喚並殺死食龍者柯爾葛羅姆。$b$b當柯爾葛羅姆死掉以後，把3種可怕圖騰放置在他的屍體旁邊。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 3 Grisly Totems from Boulder'mok ogres. Then, use Sablemane's Trap at Gorgrom's Altar to summon and kill Gorgrom the Dragon-Eater.$b$bWhen Gorgrom is dead, place the 3 Grisly Totems near his corpse." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 3 Grisly Totems from Boulder'mok ogres. Then, use Sablemane's Trap at Gorgrom's Altar to summon and kill Gorgrom the Dragon-Eater.$b$bWhen Gorgrom is dead, place the 3 Grisly Totems near his corpse."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '去圓面之地從圓面巨魔那裡收集3種可怕圖騰。在柯爾葛羅姆的祭壇使用沙伯邁恩的陷阱來召喚並殺死食龍者柯爾葛羅姆。$b$b當柯爾葛羅姆死掉時，把3種可怕圖騰放置在他的屍體附近，然後返回劍刃山脈的永恆樹林找指揮官海法斯·石牆。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10802;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺掉5個圓面蠻卒和3個圓面薩滿。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slaughter 5 Boulder'mok Brutes and 3 Boulder'mok Shaman." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slaughter 5 Boulder'mok Brutes and 3 Boulder'mok Shaman.",  OLD Details : "我知道我們有讓你向圓面之地前進的計畫。你去那裡的時候，我有些事情想要你去做。$B$B我們必須掌握任何能打倒這些山裡的巨魔的機會，否則他們將征服我們，這樣我們就會流盡鮮血無意義的死去!$B$B圓面之地位於西邊。走到西南方，越過橋並穿過隧道。在烏鴉林的西邊可以找到他們。$B$B$n，我想要你清除圓面之地的劍刃巨魔。", Details AC enUS : "I know that we have plans for you to head to Boulder'mok. I have something that I want you to do while you are there.$B$BWe must take any chance we can get to strike down the ogres of these mountains, or they will overrun us, and all that we have bled and died for will be for nothing!$B$BBoulder'mok lies to the west. Travel southwest, cross the bridge and head through the tunnel. On the west side of the Raven's Wood you will find them.$B$B$N, I want you to wipe out the Bladespire ogres of Boulder'mok." ; Wowhead enUS : "I know that we have plans for you to head to Boulder'mok. I have something that I want you to do while you are there.$b$bWe must take any chance we can get to strike down the ogres of these mountains, or they will overrun us, and all that we have bled and died for will be for nothing!$b$bBoulder'mok lies to the west. Travel southwest, cross the bridge and head through the tunnel. On the west side of the Raven's Wood you will find them.$b$b$n, I want you to wipe out the Bladespire ogres of Boulder'mok.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Boulder'mok Brute slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Boulder'mok Shaman slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '屠殺5個圓面蠻卒和3個圓面薩滿，然後返回劍刃山脈的永恆樹林找中尉費爾威德。', `Details` = '我知道我們有讓你向圓面之地前進的計畫。你去那裡的時候，我有些事情想要你去做。$b$b我們必須掌握任何能打倒這些山裡的巨魔的機會，否則他們將征服我們，這樣我們就會流盡鮮血無意義的死去!$b$b圓面之地位於西邊。走到西南方，越過橋並穿過隧道。在烏鴉林的西邊可以找到他們。$b$b$n，我想要你清除圓面之地的劍刃巨魔。', `Objectivetext1` = '圓面蠻卒 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '圓面薩滿 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10803;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死10個劍刃執行者，5個劍刃戰鬥法師，5個劍刃劫毀者和他們的領導人費葛羅姆。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay 10 Bladespire Enforcers, 5 Bladespire Battlemages, 5 Bladespire Ravagers and their leader, Fingrom." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay 10 Bladespire Enforcers, 5 Bladespire Battlemages, 5 Bladespire Ravagers and their leader, Fingrom.",  OLD Details : "你已經證明你是足智多謀的，現在我想要請你加入我與戈魯爾和他的兒子間的戰鬥。$B$B劍刃家族擁護古羅，當你在別處消減他們的數量時，你還沒有對付到他們最強大的力量。$B$B戈魯爾只用最強壯的巨魔保護他的巢穴外部，而那些就是你必須殺死的人。往北走穿過匕爪峽谷，然後你就會在盡頭發現戈魯爾之巢。", Details AC enUS : "You've proven yourself resourceful, and now I think I'm going to put you to personal use in my own fight against Gruul and his sons.$B$BThe Bladespire clan are the favored of the gronn, and while you may have thinned out their numbers elsewhere, you haven't yet dealt with their strongest.$B$BGruul protects the exterior of his lair with only the toughest of ogres, and it is those that you must kill.  Head north through the Daggermaw Canyon and you will find Gruul's Lair at the end." ; Wowhead enUS : "You've proven yourself resourceful, and now I think I'm going to put you to personal use in my own fight against Gruul and his sons.$b$bThe Bladespire clan are the favored of the gronn, and while you may have thinned out their numbers elsewhere, you haven't yet dealt with their strongest.$b$bGruul protects the exterior of his lair with only the toughest of ogres, and it is those that you must kill. Head north through the Daggermaw Canyon and you will find Gruul's Lair at the end.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bladespire Enforcer slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bladespire Battlemage slain",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bladespire Ravager slain",  OLD Objectivetext4 : "", Objectivetext4 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Fingrom slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '沙伯邁恩男爵要你和你的朋友殺死10個劍刃執行者，5個劍刃戰鬥法師，5個劍刃劫毀者和他們領導人，費葛羅姆的任務。當你已經設法完成這項偉績時，返回劍刃山脈的血之環找他。', `Details` = '你已經證明你是足智多謀的，現在我想要請你加入我與戈魯爾和他的兒子間的戰鬥。$b$b劍刃家族擁護古羅，當你在別處消減他們的數量時，你還沒有對付到他們最強大的力量。$b$b戈魯爾只用最強壯的巨魔保護他的巢穴外部，而那些就是你必須殺死的人。往北走穿過匕爪峽谷，然後你就會在盡頭發現戈魯爾之巢。', `Objectivetext1` = '劍刃執行者 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '劍刃戰鬥法師 消滅', `Objectivetext3` = '劍刃劫毀者 消滅', `Objectivetext4` = '費葛羅姆 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10805;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在茍克祭壇使用沙伯邁恩的徽章，然後殺死茍克。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use Sablemane's Signet at the Altar of Goc, then kill Goc." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use Sablemane's Signet at the Altar of Goc, then kill Goc.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Goc slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '在茍克祭壇使用沙伯邁恩的徽章，然後殺死茍克。當完成時，返回劍刃山脈的血之環找沙伯邁恩男爵。', `Objectivetext1` = '苟克 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10806;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到劍刃山脈的永恆樹林，把破損的面具交給歐瑪利‧贊普奈。", Objectives AC enUS : "Deliver the Damaged Mask to O'Mally Zapnabber at Evergrove in the Blade's Edge Mountains." ; Wowhead enUS : "Deliver the Damaged Mask to O'Mally Zapnabber at Evergrove in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",  OLD Details : "當你檢視破損的面具的時候，你聽見面具發出奇怪的聲音。假如面具沒有破損的話你可以聽見更清楚的聲音。$B$B魯安曠野的歐瑪利‧贊普奈可能可以修理這個面具。", Details AC enUS : "As you examine the damaged mask, you hear strange sounds coming from within. If the mask wasn't damaged you might be able to hear the sounds more clearly.$B$BO'Mally Zapnabber in Ruuan Weald might be able to fix the mask." ; Wowhead enUS : "As you examine the damaged mask, you hear strange sounds coming from within. If the mask wasn't damaged you might be able to hear the sounds more clearly.$b$bO'Mally Zapnabber in Ruuan Weald might be able to fix the mask."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將破損的面具帶給魯安曠野的歐瑪利·贊普奈。', `Details` = '當你檢視破損的面具的時候，你聽見面具發出奇怪的聲音。假如面具沒有破損的話你可以聽見更清楚的聲音。$b$b魯安曠野的歐瑪利·贊普奈可能可以修理這個面具。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10810;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到劍刃山脈的永恆樹林，把神秘面罩交給野蠻領主安德烈利安。", Objectives AC enUS : "Deliver the Mystery Mask to Wildlord Antelarion at Evergrove in the Blade's Edge Mountains." ; Wowhead enUS : "Deliver the Mystery Mask to Wildlord Antelarion at Evergrove in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",  OLD Details : "沒問題，修好了。你問我這是什麼?哦，這是一個通訊裝置-它可以讓那些笨蛋跟彼此通訊。你知道的呀，燃燒軍團!我建議你把這個面具交給野蠻領主安德烈利安。他就在那邊走來走去。他總是不停的移動。$B$B那就快點去吧，他一直很想得到這個東西。", Details AC enUS : "Ok, it should work now. What is it, you ask? Why, it's a communication device - it allows those blockheads to communicate with each other. You know, the Burning Legion! I would suggest that you hand this mask to Wildlord Antelarion. He's over there pacing around. Always moving, he is.$B$BWell get moving, he's been trying to get his hands on one of these for sometime now." ; Wowhead enUS : "Ok, it should work now. What is it, you ask? Why, it's a communication device - it allows those blockheads to communicate with each other. You know, the Burning Legion! I would suggest that you hand this mask to Wildlord Antelarion. He's over there pacing around. Always moving, he is.$b$bWell get moving, he's been trying to get his hands on one of these for sometime now."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將神秘面罩帶給魯安曠野的野蠻領主安德烈利安。', `Details` = '沒問題，修好了。你問我這是什麼?哦，這是一個通訊裝置-它可以讓那些笨蛋跟彼此通訊。你知道的呀，燃燒軍團!我建議你把這個面具交給野蠻領主安德烈利安。他就在那邊走來走去。他總是不停的移動。$b$b那就快點去吧，他一直很想得到這個東西。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10812;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到劍刃山脈的煉冶場:怒氣，然後戴著邪誓防毒面具使用軍團通報器。", Objectives AC enUS : "Wear the Felsworn Gas Mask and use the Legion Communicator at Forge Camp: Anger in the Blade's Edge Mountains." ; Wowhead enUS : "Wear the Felsworn Gas Mask and use the Legion Communicator at Forge Camp: Anger in the Blade's Edge Mountains.$b$bProvided item: $b",  OLD Details : "我有一個非常特殊的任務要交給你，$n。我要你滲透進入東邊的煉冶場:怒氣。當你到達煉冶場你將需要戴上邪誓防毒面具然後找到軍團通報器。一旦你找到通報裝置就跟裝置另一邊的人談話，不管他是誰。$B$B假如一切順利你就可以誆騙這些惡魔做出一些不光明正大的事情!試著告訴那個惡魔，煉冶場:怒氣已經造反了。$B$B祝你好運$C。", Details AC enUS : "I have a very special mission for you, $N. I need you to infiltrate Forge Camp: Anger east of here. When you enter the camp you will need to wear the Felsworn gas mask and locate the Legion communicator. Once you have located the communication device speak with whomever is on the other side of the device.$B$BIf all works out you can trick the demon into something devious! Try telling the demon that Camp Anger has revolted.$B$BGood luck to you $C." ; Wowhead enUS : "I have a very special mission for you, $n. I need you to infiltrate Forge Camp: Anger east of here. When you enter the camp you will need to wear the Felsworn gas mask and locate the Legion communicator. Once you have located the communication device speak with whomever is on the other side of the device.$b$bIf all works out you can trick the demon into something devious! Try telling the demon that Camp Anger has revolted.$b$bGood luck to you $c."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '戴著邪誓防毒面具使用煉冶場:怒氣的軍團通報器。$b$b已提供物品：$b', `Details` = '我有一個非常特殊的任務要交給你，$n。我要你滲透進入東邊的煉冶場:怒氣。當你到達煉冶場你將需要戴上邪誓防毒面具然後找到軍團通報器。一旦你找到通報裝置就跟裝置另一邊的人談話，不管他是誰。$b$b假如一切順利你就可以誆騙這些惡魔做出一些不光明正大的事情!試著告訴那個惡魔，煉冶場:怒氣已經造反了。$b$b祝你好運$c。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10819;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死末日哀嚎者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay Doomcryer." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay Doomcryer.",  OLD Details : "末日哀嚎者沒有想辦法阻止那場叛變嗎?她真大膽!她一直以來都在質疑我的權威。不論如何，這會是她的最後一次了。你必須召喚她然後親自解決她。$B$B她的煉冶場守衛擁有可以召喚她到煉冶場:怒氣的鑰匙。取得五把鑰匙然後啟動五座軍團尖塔。那些方尖塔的啟動時間很短，所以確認要全部同時啟動。記住，煉冶場守衛擁有比較多的鑰匙。", Details AC enUS : "Doomcryer did nothing to stop the revolt? How dare she! She has been trying to undermine my authority for some time. However, this time will be her last. You must summon her and deal with her personally.$B$BHer anger guards hold the keys that summon her to Forge Camp: Anger. Retrieve the five keys and activate the five Legion obelisks. The obelisks have a short duration, so make sure they are all activated at the same time. Remember, the anger guards carry more keys." ; Wowhead enUS : "Doomcryer did nothing to stop the revolt? How dare she! She has been trying to undermine my authority for some time. However, this time will be her last. You must summon her and deal with her personally.$b$bHer anger guards hold the keys that summon her to Forge Camp: Anger. Retrieve the five keys and activate the five Legion obelisks. The obelisks have a short duration, so make sure they are all activated at the same time. Remember, the anger guards carry more keys.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Doomcryer slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死末日哀嚎者然後回到永恆樹林向野蠻領主安德烈利安回報。', `Details` = '末日哀嚎者沒有想辦法阻止那場叛變嗎?她真大膽!她一直以來都在質疑我的權威。不論如何，這會是她的最後一次了。你必須召喚她然後親自解決她。$b$b她的煉冶場守衛擁有可以召喚她到煉冶場:怒氣的鑰匙。取得五把鑰匙然後啟動五座軍團尖塔。那些方尖塔的啟動時間很短，所以確認要全部同時啟動。記住，煉冶場守衛擁有比較多的鑰匙。', `Objectivetext1` = '末日哀嚎者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10821;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "將葛瑞納寶珠送到劍刃山脈的永恆樹林給林木守衛蕭恩。", Objectives AC enUS : "Deliver the Orb of the Grishna to Tree Warden Chawn at Evergrove in the Blade's Edge Mountains." ; Wowhead enUS : "Deliver the Orb of the Grishna to Tree Warden Chawn at Evergrove in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",  OLD Details : "這個奇怪，魔法的寶珠從阿拉卡的廓羽下方落下。$B$B充滿著怪異，紫色的光輝，寶珠跟著一個聽不到的節拍跳動著。拿著它使你略感不舒服，因此你迅速地把它放到你的背包裡。$B$B或許穿過隧道越過龍骨橋，在魯安曠野西邊的林木守衛蕭恩會有興趣看看它?", Details AC enUS : "This strange, magical orb drops from beneath the contour feathers of the arakkoa.$B$BSuffused with an eerie, purple glow, the orb pulses to an unheard beat.  Holding it makes you mildly uncomfortable, and so you quickly place it within your pack.$B$BPerhaps Tree Warden Chawn at Ruuan Weald to the west, through the tunnel and across the Wyrmskull Bridge, would be interested in examining it?" ; Wowhead enUS : "This strange, magical orb drops from beneath the contour feathers of the arakkoa.$b$bSuffused with an eerie, purple glow, the orb pulses to an unheard beat. Holding it makes you mildly uncomfortable, and so you quickly place it within your pack.$b$bPerhaps Tree Warden Chawn at Ruuan Weald to the west, through the tunnel and across the Wyrmskull Bridge, would be interested in examining it?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將葛瑞納寶珠送到劍刃山脈的魯安曠野給林木守衛蕭恩。', `Details` = '這個奇怪，魔法的寶珠從阿拉卡的廓羽下方落下。$b$b充滿著怪異，紫色的光輝，寶珠跟著一個聽不到的節拍跳動著。拿著它使你略感不舒服，因此你迅速地把它放到你的背包裡。$b$b或許穿過隧道越過龍骨橋，在魯安曠野西邊的林木守衛蕭恩會有興趣看看它?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10825;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "樹佬長者必須知道", Title AC enUS : "Treebole Must Know" ; Wowhead enUS : "Treebole Must Know",  OLD Objectives : "找住在劍刃山脈烏鴉林裡的知識古樹，樹佬長者交談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Treebole, an ancient of lore who lives in the Raven's Wood of the Blade's Edge Mountains." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Treebole, an ancient of lore who lives in the Raven's Wood of the Blade's Edge Mountains.",  OLD Details : "這真麻煩!阿拉卡害長者和保衛者被邪惡靈魂附身!$B$B但是有一位長者無論如何不能被影響。他的名字是樹老長者，如果我們要拯救烏鴉林的樹木，那你必須立刻去找他!$B$B回到烏鴉林。你可在過了葛瑞許納什的道路分岔處找到他。", Details AC enUS : "This is troubling!  The arakkoa are causing the ancients and protectors to become possessed by evil spirits!$B$BBut, there is one ancient that could not possibly have been affected.  His name is Treebole, and you must go to him at once if we're to save the trees of the Raven's Wood!$B$BGo back to the Raven's Wood.  You will find him at the fork in the path just past Grishnath." ; Wowhead enUS : "This is troubling! The arakkoa are causing the ancients and protectors to become possessed by evil spirits!$b$bBut, there is one ancient that could not possibly have been affected. His name is Treebole, and you must go to him at once if we're to save the trees of the Raven's Wood!$b$bGo back to the Raven's Wood. You will find him at the fork in the path just past Grishnath."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '樹老長者必須知道', `Objectives` = '林木守衛蕭恩要你尋找並且與樹老長者交談，一位傳說住在劍刃山脈的烏鴉林裡的長者。', `Details` = '這真麻煩!阿拉卡害長者和保衛者被邪惡靈魂附身!$b$b但是有一位長者無論如何不能被影響。他的名字是樹老長者，如果我們要拯救烏鴉林的樹木，那你必須立刻去找他!$b$b回到烏鴉林。你可在過了葛瑞許納什的道路分岔處找到他。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10829;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集5個葛瑞許納什寶珠和5根凶暴幼羽，然後將它們合併成驅邪羽毛。使用這些羽毛驅除並殺掉5個佔據烏鴉林葉鬚樹人的可伊靈魂。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 5 Grishnath Orbs and 5 Dire Pinfeathers and then combine them into Exorcism Feathers.  Use these feathers to exorcise and slay 5 Koi-Koi Spirits from the Raven's Wood Leafbeards." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 5 Grishnath Orbs and 5 Dire Pinfeathers and then combine them into Exorcism Feathers.  Use these feathers to exorcise and slay 5 Koi-Koi Spirits from the Raven's Wood Leafbeards.",  OLD Details : "葛瑞納已經讓葉鬚樹人和石木樹人被邪惡的可伊靈魂佔據。$B$B我們必須拯救這些樹，否則整個烏鴉林很快將永遠消失!$B$B將葛瑞許納什找到的葛瑞許納什寶珠中的魔法，與凶暴烏鴉身上的一根凶暴幼羽結合。$B$B使用結合成的驅邪羽毛引出可伊靈魂並盡快殺了它。這個儀式不足以釋放石木樹人。但如果我們拯救了足夠的葉鬚樹人，他們也將獲得自由。", Details AC enUS : "The Grishna have caused the leafbeards and stonebarks to be inhabited by evil koi-koi spirits.$B$BWe must save the trees or soon all of the Raven's Wood will be lost forever!$B$BCombine the magic of a Grishnath orb, found throughout Grishnath, with a dire pinfeather from a dire raven.$B$BUse the resultant exorcism feather to draw out and slay the koi-koi spirit as quickly as possible.  The stonebarks are too powerful for this ritual, but if enough leafbeards are saved, they will be freed as well." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Grishna have caused the leafbeards and stonebarks to be inhabited by evil koi-koi spirits.$b$bWe must save the trees or soon all of the Raven's Wood will be lost forever!$b$bCombine the magic of a Grishnath orb, found throughout Grishnath, with a dire pinfeather from a dire raven.$b$bUse the resultant exorcism feather to draw out and slay the koi-koi spirit as quickly as possible. The stonebarks are too powerful for this ritual, but if enough leafbeards are saved, they will be freed as well.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "為葉鬚樹人驅魔", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Leafbeard Exorcised" ; Wowhead enUS : "Leafbeard Exorcised"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '收集5個葛瑞許納什寶珠和5根可怕幼羽，然後將它們合併成驅邪羽毛。使用這些羽毛驅除並殺掉5個佔據烏鴉林葉鬚樹人的可伊靈魂。等你完成，返回劍刃山脈的烏鴉林找樹老長者。', `Details` = '葛瑞納已經讓葉鬚樹人和石化樹人被邪惡的可伊靈魂佔據。$b$b我們必須拯救這些樹，否則整個烏鴉林很快將永遠消失!$b$b結合在葛瑞許納什找到的葛瑞許納什寶珠魔法，和兇暴烏鴉身上的一根可怕幼羽。$b$b使用結合成的驅邪羽毛引出可伊靈魂並盡快殺了它。石化樹人對這儀式來說太強大了，但如果我們拯救了足夠的葉鬚樹人，他們也將獲得自由。', `Objectivetext1` = '葉鬚樹人已驅魔', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10830;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "不知道從什麼時候開始...", Title AC enUS : "Since Time Forgotten..." ; Wowhead enUS : "Since Time Forgotten...",  OLD Objectives : "殺死劍刃崗哨的巨魔領導人，葛諾斯‧布羅格納。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay Gnosh Brognat, leader of the ogres at the Bladespire Outpost." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay Gnosh Brognat, leader of the ogres at the Bladespire Outpost.",  OLD Details : "不知道從什麼時候開始，我們就已經在和劍刃巨魔作戰了。$B$B我們已經設法把他們擊退，因此現在他們只微弱的掌握住劍刃崗哨。按你來的路回去，在剃刀山脊的西南邊緣。$B$B藉由殺死他們的領導人，葛諾斯‧布羅格納，向我證明你的價值。$B$B讓我們看看當你與巨魔作戰時，你是塊什麼料。", Details AC enUS : "Since time forgotten we have fought with the Bladespire ogres.$B$BWe have managed to push them back so that now they only hold a tenuous grip at Bladespire Outpost.  It's back the way that you came, on the southwestern edge of the Razor Ridge.$B$BProve your worth to me by killing their leader, Gnosh Brognat.$B$BLet us see what stuff you are made of when fighting the ogres." ; Wowhead enUS : "Since time forgotten we have fought with the Bladespire ogres.$b$bWe have managed to push them back so that now they only hold a tenuous grip at Bladespire Outpost. It's back the way that you came, on the southwestern edge of the Razor Ridge.$b$bProve your worth to me by killing their leader, Gnosh Brognat.$b$bLet us see what stuff you are made of when fighting the ogres.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Gnosh Brognat slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '不知道從什麼時候開始……', `Objectives` = '為了向摩克納薩爾證明自己，李歐羅克斯已經命令你殺死葛諾斯·布羅格納，劍刃崗哨的巨魔領導人。完成後返回劍刃山脈的摩克納薩爾村找李歐羅克斯，不然就不要回來。', `Details` = '不知道從什麼時候開始，我們就已經在和劍刃巨魔作戰了。$b$b我們已經設法把他們擊退，因此現在他們只微弱的掌握住劍刃崗哨。按你來的路回去，在剃刀山脊的西南邊緣。$b$b藉由殺死他們的領導人，葛諾斯·布羅格納，向我證明你的價值。$b$b讓我們看看當你與巨魔作戰時，你是塊什麼料。', `Objectivetext1` = '葛諾斯·布羅格納 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10843;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死魔翼 。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay Dreadwing." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay Dreadwing.",  OLD Details : "我的獵人剛完成美聲山脊的偵察任務回來。看來寄生於那些水晶的虛空龍已經大幅增加並威脅到我們。$B$B既然你已證明你是一個有能力的殺手，讓我們看看你的$c技能是否敵的過一隻成年的龍。$B$B向南方穿過鱗翼沙洲並找到美聲山脊。進入那裡並殺死他們的母親，魔翼。", Details AC enUS : "My hunters have just returned from a scouting mission to the Singing Ridge.  It seems that the nether drakes, which infest the crystals there, have increased greatly in number, and threaten to spill out into our laps.$B$BSince you have proven yourself a competent slayer, let us see if your $c skills are the match of an adult drake.$B$BFind the Singing Ridge by heading south through the Scalewing Shelf.  Enter and slay their brood mother, Dreadwing." ; Wowhead enUS : "My hunters have just returned from a scouting mission to the Singing Ridge. It seems that the nether drakes, which infest the crystals there, have increased greatly in number, and threaten to spill out into our laps.$b$bSince you have proven yourself a competent slayer, let us see if your $c skills are the match of an adult drake.$b$bFind the Singing Ridge by heading south through the Scalewing Shelf. Enter and slay their brood mother, Dreadwing.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Dreadwing slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '李歐羅克斯要你殺死魔翼 。等你殺死她再返回摩克納薩爾村找他。', `Details` = '我的獵人剛完成美聲山脊的偵察任務回來。看來寄生於那些水晶的虛空龍已經大幅增加並威脅到我們。$b$b既然你已證明你是一個有能力的殺手，讓我們看看你的$c技能是否敵的過一隻成年的龍。$b$b向南方穿過鱗翼沙洲並找到美聲山脊。進入那裡並殺死他們的母親，魔翼。', `Objectivetext1` = '魔翼 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10845;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺掉維克尼爾阿拉卡的領導者，維克。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay Vekh, leader of the Vekh'nir arakkoa." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay Vekh, leader of the Vekh'nir arakkoa.",  OLD Details : "<李歐羅克斯用一種讓你的靈魂凝結的眼神注視著你的眼睛。>$B$B你來到摩克納薩爾，但是你不了解我們。你不了解我們鬥爭以求生存。$B$B假如你要了解我們，那麼你必須忍受一次那種鬥爭的滋味。$B$B南方是維克尼爾阿拉卡。他們在一個叫做索格瑪領土的洞穴裡奴役一群巨魔，而他們的領導人，維克也在那裡。$B$B殺了他!", Details AC enUS : "<Leoroxx looks you in the eye with the kind of stare that chills your soul.>$B$BYou come to the Mok'Nathal, but you do not understand us.  You do not understand our struggle to survive.$B$BIf you would understand us, then you will have to endure a taste of that struggle.$B$BTo the south are the Vekh'nir arakkoa.  They have enslaved a group of ogres in the caverns known as Trogma's Claim and their leader, Vekh is in there.$B$BSlay him!" ; Wowhead enUS : "<Leoroxx looks you in the eye with the kind of stare that chills your soul.>$b$bYou come to the Mok'Nathal, but you do not understand us. You do not understand our struggle to survive.$b$bIf you would understand us, then you will have to endure a taste of that struggle.$b$bTo the south are the Vekh'nir arakkoa. They have enslaved a group of ogres in the caverns known as Trogma's Claim and their leader, Vekh is in there.$b$bSlay him!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Vekh slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '要開始你對摩克納薩爾的了解，就要殺掉維克，維克尼爾阿拉卡的領導者。然後，返回劍刃山脈的摩克納薩爾村找李歐羅克斯。', `Details` = '<李歐羅克斯用一種讓你的靈魂凝結的眼神注視著你的眼睛。>$b$b你來到摩克納薩爾，但是你不了解我們。你不了解我們鬥爭以求生存。$b$b假如你要了解我們，那麼你必須忍受一次那種鬥爭的滋味。$b$b南方是維克尼爾阿拉卡。他們在一個叫做索格瑪領土的洞穴裡奴役一群巨魔，而他們的領導人，維克也在那裡。$b$b殺了他!', `Objectivetext1` = '維克 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10846;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集5個劍刃氏族圖騰。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 5 Bladespire Totems." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 5 Bladespire Totems.",  OLD Details : "尊敬一個人的祖先有正確的方式，也有錯誤的方式。$B$B劍刃巨魔帶著圖騰，但是他們並非用它們來表現他們的尊敬。相反的，他們想使用它們去操作並且控制。$B$B我們應該偷取他們的圖騰，因為他們不值得擁有!我們會把它們拿來做更好的利用。$B$B去西方的劍刃崗哨，就在剃刀山脊的西南邊。殺死劍刃秘法師和粉碎者，並從他們那裡拿走圖騰!", Details AC enUS : "There is the right way to honor one's ancestors, and there is the wrong way.$B$BThe Bladespire ogres carry totems with them, but they do not use them to show their respect.  Instead, they seek to use them to manipulate and control.$B$BWe should steal their totems because they are unworthy!  We will then put them to better use.$B$BGo to the Bladespire Outpost to the west, just southwest of the Razor Ridge.  Slay the Bladespire mystics and crushers, and take their totems from them!" ; Wowhead enUS : "There is the right way to honor one's ancestors, and there is the wrong way.$b$bThe Bladespire ogres carry totems with them, but they do not use them to show their respect. Instead, they seek to use them to manipulate and control.$b$bWe should steal their totems because they are unworthy! We will then put them to better use.$b$bGo to the Bladespire Outpost to the west, just southwest of the Razor Ridge. Slay the Bladespire mystics and crushers, and take their totems from them!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '收集5個劍刃氏族圖騰交給劍刃山脈的摩克納薩爾村的招魂師多赫加。', `Details` = '尊敬一個人的祖先有正確的方式，也有錯誤的方式。$b$b劍刃巨魔帶著圖騰，但是他們並非用它們來表現他們的尊敬。相反的，他們想使用它們去操作並且控制。$b$b我們應該偷取他們的圖騰，因為他們不值得擁有!我們會把它們拿來做更好的利用。$b$b去西方的劍刃崗哨，就在剃刀山脊的西南邊。殺死劍刃秘法師和粉碎者，並從他們那裡拿走圖騰!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10851;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "使用召靈圖騰來收集8個次級虛空龍靈魂。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use the Spirit Calling Totems to collect 8 Lesser Nether Drake Spirits." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use the Spirit Calling Totems to collect 8 Lesser Nether Drake Spirits.",  OLD Details : "美聲山脊的虛空龍靈魂需要解放。$B$B虛空龍不永遠都是虛空龍。他們過去是黑龍。$B$B但是，由於這個世界的毀滅，一股虛空能量改變了一切，並且產生了改變幼龍蛋的副作用。$B$B現在他們全都是以前自身的扭曲版本。我們必須幫助他們找到平靜。$B$B要這樣做就要去殺死一隻靠近召靈圖騰的龍，然後自它身上取走它的靈魂。", Details AC enUS : "The spirits of the nether drakes in the Singing Ridge are in need of liberation.$B$BThe nether drakes were not always nether drakes.  They used to be black drakes.$B$BBut then, with the destruction of this world, a wave of nether energy washed over everything and had the side-effect of changing the drakeling eggs.$B$BNow they are all twisted versions of their former selves.  We must help them to find peace.$B$BDo this by slaying a drake near to the spirit calling totem, and then take its spirit from it." ; Wowhead enUS : "The spirits of the nether drakes in the Singing Ridge are in need of liberation.$b$bThe nether drakes were not always nether drakes. They used to be black drakes.$b$bBut then, with the destruction of this world, a wave of nether energy washed over everything and had the side-effect of changing the drakeling eggs.$b$bNow they are all twisted versions of their former selves. We must help them to find peace.$b$bDo this by slaying a drake near to the spirit calling totem, and then take its spirit from it."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '招魂師多赫加要你使用召靈圖騰收集8個次級虛空龍靈魂然後回到劍刃山脈的摩克納薩爾村交給他。', `Details` = '美聲山脊的虛空龍靈魂需要解放。$b$b虛空龍不永遠都是虛空龍。他們過去是黑龍。$b$b但是，由於這個世界的毀滅，一股虛空能量改變了一切，並且產生了改變幼龍蛋的副作用。$b$b現在他們全都是以前自身的扭曲版本。我們必須幫助他們找到平靜。$b$b要這樣做就要去殺死一隻靠近召靈圖騰的龍，然後自它身上取走它的靈魂。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10853;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "使用寶珠召集圖騰收集15個雷森光球。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use the Orb Collecting Totem to collect 15 Razaani Light Orbs." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use the Orb Collecting Totem to collect 15 Razaani Light Orbs.",  OLD Details : "雷森以太族有一種奇怪的儀器會發出微小、粉紅色光芒的飄浮光球。它們讓我想起靈魂。$B$B它們不會與以太族死亡時所釋放的大黃球相混淆，這些完全是別種東西。$B$B我要你到北方的雷森平台設置一些圖騰，這些圖騰將會吸引粉紅光球。$B$B把它們帶回來給我這樣我才能確切地判斷它們是什麼。", Details AC enUS : "The Razaani ethereals have strange devices that emit small, pink floating light orbs.  They remind me of souls.$B$BThey are not to be confused with the large yellow balls that break free of the ethereal when they die, these are something else entirely.$B$BI'd like for you to head north to Razaan's Landing and drop some totems, which will attact the pink light orbs.$B$BBring them back to me so that I might determine exactly what they are." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Razaani ethereals have strange devices that emit small, pink floating light orbs. They remind me of souls.$b$bThey are not to be confused with the large yellow balls that break free of the ethereal when they die, these are something else entirely.$b$bI'd like for you to head north to Razaan's Landing and drop some totems, which will attact the pink light orbs.$b$bBring them back to me so that I might determine exactly what they are."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '招魂師多赫加要你使用寶珠召集圖騰收集15個雷森光球。任務完成後回到劍刃山脈的摩克納薩爾村向他回報。', `Details` = '雷森伊斯利有一種奇怪的儀器會發出微小、粉紅色光芒的飄浮光球。它們讓我想起靈魂。$b$b它們不會與伊斯利死亡時所釋放的大黃球相混淆，這些完全是別種東西。$b$b我要你到北方的雷森平台設置一些圖騰，這些圖騰將會攻擊粉紅光球。$b$b把它們帶回來給我這樣我才能確切地判斷它們是什麼。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10859;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集3個迅猛龍肋骨還有3份毒蛇肉。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 3 Raptor Ribs and 3 Serpent Flesh." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 3 Raptor Ribs and 3 Serpent Flesh.",  OLD Details : "餓嗎，$r？偉大的靈魂會幫助那些自助者。如果你想要掙一頓飯，我建議你注意聽著，因為布拉格爾那裡不會給你任何免費的東西，而且也不可口！$B$B剃刀山脊和鱗翼沙洲的迅猛龍及鱗翼具有你從未嚐過之最美味的兩種佳餚中所需要的東西。把他們的迅猛龍肋骨和毒蛇肉帶來給我，我將為你做出這兩道菜。$B$B我甚至可以教你如何自己烹煮它們，如果你動作快的話。", Details AC enUS : "Hungry, $r?  The Great Spirit helps those that help themselves.  If you want to earn a meal, I suggest that you listen up, because Braagor there isn't going to give you anything for free, nor as tasty!$B$BThe raptors and scalewings of Razor Ridge and the Scalewing Shelf have everything that's needed for two of the most delicious dishes you'll ever taste.  Bring me their raptor ribs and serpent flesh, and I'll make some of each for you.$B$BI may even teach you how to cook them up for yourself, if you hurry." ; Wowhead enUS : "Hungry, $r? The Great Spirit helps those that help themselves. If you want to earn a meal, I suggest that you listen up, because Braagor there isn't going to give you anything for free, nor as tasty!$b$bThe raptors and scalewings of Razor Ridge and the Scalewing Shelf have everything that's needed for two of the most delicious dishes you'll ever taste. Bring me their raptor ribs and serpent flesh, and I'll make some of each for you.$b$bI may even teach you how to cook them up for yourself, if you hurry."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '女總管瓦拉給你一份可以製作兩道他最喜歡的菜餚的材料名單，包含了3個迅猛龍肋骨還有3份毒蛇肉。回到劍刃山脈的摩克納薩爾村的把材料交給她。', `Details` = '餓嗎，$r?偉大的靈魂會幫助那些自助者。如果你想要掙一頓飯，我建議你注意聽著，因為布拉格爾那裡不會給你任何免費的東西，而且也不可口!$b$b剃刀山脊和鱗翼沙洲的迅猛龍及鱗翼具有你從未嚐過之最美味的兩種佳餚中所需要的東西。把他們的迅猛龍肋骨和毒蛇肉帶來給我，我將為你做出這兩道菜。$b$b我甚至可以教你如何自己烹煮它們，如果你動作快的話。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10860;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "在你被那魯認可之前，你必須通過四次考驗。$B$B只剩一個障礙了，凡人。召集一支軍隊並且前往地獄火堡壘深處的瑪瑟里頓巢穴。一路殺進密室的中心，並毀滅那邪惡的腐敗者!", Details AC enUS : "Four trials you must pass before you are deemed worthy by the naaru.$B$BOnly one obstacle remains, mortal. Gather an army and travel to the lair of Magtheridon, deep inside Hellfire Citadel. Battle your way to the heart of the chamber and destroy the foul corrupter!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Four trials you must pass before you are deemed worthy by the naaru.$b$bOnly one obstacle remains, mortal. Gather an army and travel to the lair of Magtheridon, deep inside Hellfire Citadel. Battle your way to the heart of the chamber and destroy the foul corrupter!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Magtheridon slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '在你被那魯認可之前，你必須通過四次考驗。$b$b只剩一個障礙了，凡人。召集一支軍隊並且前往地獄火堡壘深處的瑪瑟里頓巢穴。一路殺進密室的中心，並毀滅那邪惡的腐敗者!', `Objectivetext1` = '瑪瑟里頓 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10888;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死龍骨隧道裡的巨龍教徒領導者，德拉卡‧長尾。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay Draaca Longtail, the leader of the wyrmcultists in the Wyrmskull Tunnel." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay Draaca Longtail, the leader of the wyrmcultists in the Wyrmskull Tunnel.",  OLD Details : "黑翼巨龍教徒都集結在隧道裡，我們很難應付這樣的局面。坦白說，他們數量比我們多太多了。$B$B雖然我們能夠應付任何太過靠近的教徒，但要是他們認真的攻打過來，我們一定會被擊敗。$B$B目前的狀況下我們需要有人穿過隧道到另一端去，並且殺掉他們的領導人，德拉卡‧長尾。打算找點樂子嗎?", Details AC enUS : "With the Blackwing wyrmcultists massing in the tunnel, we're hard pressed to deal with the situation.  Quite frankly, they have the numbers.$B$BAnd while we've been able to take care of any of their people that get too close, the fact remains that if they attack in earnest, we're going to be overrun.$B$BThe situation calls for someone to get through to the other end of the tunnel, and take out their leader, Draaca Longtail.  Up for some fun?" ; Wowhead enUS : "With the Blackwing wyrmcultists massing in the tunnel, we're hard pressed to deal with the situation. Quite frankly, they have the numbers.$b$bAnd while we've been able to take care of any of their people that get too close, the fact remains that if they attack in earnest, we're going to be overrun.$b$bThe situation calls for someone to get through to the other end of the tunnel, and take out their leader, Draaca Longtail. Up for some fun?",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Draaca Longtail slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死德拉卡·長尾，龍骨隧道裡的巨龍教徒領導者。一旦你完成，回到劍刃山脈的龍骨隧道看守者月影。', `Details` = '黑翼巨龍教徒集中在隧道裡，我們難以應付此情勢。十分坦白的，他們為數眾多。$b$b當我們有辦法注意到他們中的任何人太過接近，事實就是如果他們認真攻擊，我們就會被佔領。$b$b目前的狀況需要有人穿過隧道到另一端那兒，並且殺掉他們的領導人，德拉卡·長尾。打算找點樂子嗎?', `Objectivetext1` = '德拉卡·長尾 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10893;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "嗯，我不確定我們應該怎麼做。我不適合當軍事行動的策劃人。$B$B看守者月影會知道怎麼做。他目前正前往我們在西邊的龍骨隧道的防禦工事，就在龍骨橋的尾端。我們有部隊在那邊以防那些教徒們想搞鬼。$B$B拜託你，請以最快的速度將信件送到他手中。", Details AC enUS : "Hmm, I'm not certain what we should do.  I'm not much of a military planner.$B$BWatcher Moonshade will know what to do.  He's heading up our defensive efforts at the Wyrmskull Tunnel to the west at the end of Wyrmskull Bridge.  We have a force out there just in case the cultists try anything funny.$B$BPlease, take the note to him with all due haste." ; Wowhead enUS : "Hmm, I'm not certain what we should do. I'm not much of a military planner.$b$bWatcher Moonshade will know what to do. He's heading up our defensive efforts at the Wyrmskull Tunnel to the west at the end of Wyrmskull Bridge. We have a force out there just in case the cultists try anything funny.$b$bPlease, take the note to him with all due haste."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '嗯，我不確定我們應該怎麼做。我不適合當軍事行動的策劃人。$b$b看守者月影會知道怎麼做。他目前正前往我們在西邊的龍骨隧道的防禦工事，就在龍骨橋的尾端。我們有部隊在那邊以防那些教徒們想搞鬼。$b$b拜託你，請以最快的速度將信件送到他手中。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10894;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到死亡之門使用德魯伊信號召喚永恆樹林德魯伊，然後找他談話。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use the Druid Signal at Death's Door to call down and speak with an Evergrove Druid." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use the Druid Signal at Death's Door to call down and speak with an Evergrove Druid.$b$bProvided item: $b",  OLD Details : "現在燃燒軍團有一個更大的威脅。南邊有一個被人稱為死亡之門的傳送門，它開啟另一個可怕的世界，燃燒軍團在那邊養殖他們致命的地獄獵犬。$B$B要去那裡，就離開永恆樹林往東邊斜坡上去。沿著往南的路走，通過刀刃峽谷，雷森平台，剃刀山脊和鱗翼沙洲。然後，走下斜坡進入維克哈爾看臺，再通過摩克納薩爾南邊的隧道進入死亡之門。$B$B當你到達的時候，使用這個德魯伊信號。", Details AC enUS : "Now there is an even greater threat from the Burning Legion.  To the south is a portal known as Death's Door, which opens upon the horrific world where the Legion breeds its deadly hounds.$B$BTo get there, exit Evergrove by heading east up the ramp.  Follow the path south, through the Bladed Gulch, Razaan's Landing, Razor Ridge and the Scalewing Shelf.  Then, take the ramp down into the Vekhaar Stand and enter Death's Door through the tunnel, south of Mok'Nathal.$B$BOnce there, use this druid signal." ; Wowhead enUS : "Now there is an even greater threat from the Burning Legion. To the south is a portal known as Death's Door, which opens upon the horrific world where the Legion breeds its deadly hounds.$b$bTo get there, exit Evergrove by heading east up the ramp. Follow the path south, through the Bladed Gulch, Razaan's Landing, Razor Ridge and the Scalewing Shelf. Then, take the ramp down into the Vekhaar Stand and enter Death's Door through the tunnel, south of Mok'Nathal.$b$bOnce there, use this druid signal."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '野蠻領主安德烈利安請你到死亡之門。到達之後，使用德魯伊信號召喚一個永恆樹林德魯伊好讓你可以跟他們談話。$b$b已提供物品：$b', `Details` = '現在燃燒軍團有一個更大的威脅。南邊有一個被人稱為死亡之門的傳送門，它開啟另一個可怕的世界，燃燒軍團在那邊養殖他們致命的地獄獵犬。$b$b要去那裡，就離開永恆樹林往東邊斜坡上去。沿著往南的路走，通過刀刃峽谷，雷森平台，剃刀山脊和鱗翼沙洲。然後，走下斜坡進入維克哈爾看臺，再通過摩克納薩爾南邊的隧道進入死亡之門。$b$b當你到達的時候，使用這個德魯伊信號。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10910;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死6隻洞穴爬行者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay 6 Cavern Crawlers." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay 6 Cavern Crawlers.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Cavern Crawler slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '連接贊格沼澤和劍刃山脈隧道的哨兵月語要你殺死6隻洞穴爬行者然後回報希爾瓦納的指揮官天影。', `Objectivetext1` = '洞穴爬行者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10927;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死6隻洞穴爬行者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Slay 6 Cavern Crawlers." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay 6 Cavern Crawlers.",  OLD Details : "吐查克‧雙爪要清空這條通道以促進我們跟沼澤叛徒的交易。我不能離開我的哨站所以我把任務交到你的手上。清空這個通道然後馬上回報吐查克‧雙爪!", Details AC enUS : "Tor'chunk Twoclaws wants this tunnel cleared out so we can expedite trade with Swamp Rat. I must not leave my post here so I am leaving the task in your hands. Clear the tunnel and report to Tor'chunk Twoclaws at once!$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Tor'chunk Twoclaws wants this tunnel cleared out so we can expedite trade with Swamp Rat. I must not leave my post here so I am leaving the task in your hands. Clear the tunnel and report to Tor'chunk Twoclaws at once!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Cavern Crawler slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '連接贊格沼澤和劍刃山脈隧道的蠻兵葛拉赫要你殺死6隻洞穴爬行者然後回報雷霆王村的吐查克·雙爪。', `Details` = '吐查克·雙爪要清空這條通道以促進我們跟沼澤叛徒的交易。我不能離開我的哨站所以我把任務交到你的手上。清空這個通道然後馬上回報吐查克·雙爪!', `Objectivetext1` = '洞穴爬行者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10928;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "使用以太皇族鑰匙片 - A打開在劍刃山脈貝許爾平臺的靜止密室A。$B$B將調查密室得到的證據交給貝許爾平臺的指揮官阿密爾的影像。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use the Ethereum Key Tablet - Alpha to open Stasis Chamber Alpha at Bash'ir's Landing in Blade's Edge Mountains.$B$BReturn Evidence from Alpha to the Image of Commander Ameer at Bash'ir's Landing." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use the Ethereum Key Tablet - Alpha to open Stasis Chamber Alpha at Bash'ir's Landing in Blade's Edge Mountains.$b$bReturn Evidence from Alpha to the Image of Commander Ameer at Bash'ir's Landing.",  OLD Details : "以太皇族在劍刃山脈最北邊人稱貝許爾平臺的沙洲上有一塊領地。根據鑰匙碎片上的記載，他們在貝許爾有更大規模的監獄。我應該跟你提一下，以太皇族稱呼那些監獄為靜止密室。$B$B這個鑰匙碎片可以讓你進入其中一個特殊的靜止秘室叫做靜止密室A。帶著這個鑰匙碎片前去調查吧。$B$B調查完成以後我的幻影將會在貝許爾平臺等你，跟我交談。", Details AC enUS : "The Ethereum have a settlement on the northernmost shelf of Blade's Edge Mountains known as Bash'ir's Landing. According to the key tablet, much larger versions of the prisons are kept at Bash'ir's. It should also be noted that the Ethereum refer to those prisons as stasis chambers.$B$BThe key tablet grants access to a very specific stasis chamber at the landing known as Stasis Chamber Alpha. Take the key and investigate.$B$BMy image will be awaiting your return at Bash'ir's Landing. Speak to me there." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Ethereum have a settlement on the northernmost shelf of Blade's Edge Mountains known as Bash'ir's Landing. According to the key tablet, much larger versions of the prisons are kept at Bash'ir's. It should also be noted that the Ethereum refer to those prisons as stasis chambers.$b$bThe key tablet grants access to a very specific stasis chamber at the landing known as Stasis Chamber Alpha. Take the key and investigate.$b$bMy image will be awaiting your return at Bash'ir's Landing. Speak to me there."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '使用伊斯利恩鑰匙片 - A打開在劍刃山脈貝許爾平臺的靜止密室A。$b$b將調查密室得到的證據交給貝許爾平臺的指揮官阿密爾的影像。', `Details` = '伊斯利恩在劍刃山脈最北邊人稱貝許爾平臺的沙洲上有一塊領地。根據鑰匙碎片上的記載，他們在貝許爾有更大規模的監獄。我應該跟你提一下，伊斯利恩稱呼那些監獄為靜止密室。$b$b這個鑰匙碎片可以讓你進入其中一個特殊的靜止秘室叫做靜止密室A。帶著這個鑰匙碎片前去調查吧。$b$b調查完成以後我的幻影將會在貝許爾平臺等你，跟我交談。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10974;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我必須知道以太皇族在奧齊頓的法力墓地裡關著什麼樣的東西。$B$B在你與貝許爾的靜止密室野獸戰鬥的時候，你可能會看到一樣叫做奈薩斯王印記的東西。如果你找到這樣東西，馬上交給我!這是要製作通往法力墓地裡頭的靜止密室鑰匙所欠缺的最後一樣材料。", Details AC enUS : "What I must now know is what the Ethereum have held inside the Mana-Tombs of Auchindoun.$B$BIn your battles against the beasts of the stasis chambers of Bash'ir you may run across an item known as the Mark of the Nexus-King. Should you find such an item, return it to me immediately! It is the final piece in crafting a key that will allow access to the stasis chamber inside the Mana-Tombs." ; Wowhead enUS : "What I must now know is what the Ethereum have held inside the Mana-Tombs of Auchindoun.$b$bIn your battles against the beasts of the stasis chambers of Bash'ir you may run across an item known as the Mark of the Nexus-King. Should you find such an item, return it to me immediately! It is the final piece in crafting a key that will allow access to the stasis chamber inside the Mana-Tombs."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我必須知道伊斯利恩在奧齊頓的法力墓地裡關著什麼樣的東西。$b$b在你與貝許爾的靜止密室野獸戰鬥的時候，你可能會看到一樣叫做奈薩斯王印記的東西。如果你找到這樣東西，馬上交給我!這是要製作通往法力墓地裡頭的靜止密室鑰匙所欠缺的最後一樣材料。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10976;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "莫格多克真聰明!他派葛羅克來城市，找幫助。血槌氏族需要幫助。$B$B莫格多克說找幾個強壯的小夥子來劍刃山脈找他。他站在血之環的塔頂。莫格多克真聰明!", Details AC enUS : "Mog'dorg wise!  Him send Grok to city, look for help.  Bloodmaul clan need help.$B$BMog'dorg say, send powerful little ones to him at Blade's Edge Mountains.  Him stand on tower at Circle of Blood.  Mog'dorg wise!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Mog'dorg wise! Him send Grok to city, look for help. Bloodmaul clan need help.$b$bMog'dorg say, send powerful little ones to him at Blade's Edge Mountains. Him stand on tower at Circle of Blood. Mog'dorg wise!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '莫格多克真聰明!他派葛羅克來城市，找幫助。血槌氏族需要幫助。$b$b莫格多克說找幾個強壯的小伙子來劍刃山脈找他。他站在血之環的塔頂。莫格多克真聰明!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10983;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "前往劍刃山脈的血之環找乾癟的莫格多克。他就站在丘特看守的塔頂上。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Mog'dorg the Wizened atop the tower where Chort is standing, just outside the Circle of Blood in the Blade's Edge Mountains." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Mog'dorg the Wizened atop the tower where Chort is standing, just outside the Circle of Blood in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",  OLD Details : "乾癟的莫格多克在塔頂等你。他叫我找一個$r$c就像你這樣。你去找他說重要的事情。$B$B去吧，但是不要告訴別人。這是秘密!", Details AC enUS : "Mog'dorg the Wizened waits for you at top of da tower.  He tells me to look for a $r $c just like you.  You go speak with him about smart things.$B$BGo now, but don't tell no one.  It's a secret!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Mog'dorg the Wizened waits for you at top of da tower. He tells me to look for a $r $c just like you. You go speak with him about smart things.$b$bGo now, but don't tell no one. It's a secret!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '前往劍刃山脈的血之環找乾癟的莫格多克。他就站在劍刃山脈，血之環外的塔頂，丘特的旁邊。', `Details` = '乾癟的莫格多克在塔頂等你。他叫我找一個$r$c就像你這樣。你去找他說重要的事情。$b$b去吧，但是不要告訴別人。這是秘密!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10989;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "取得葛魯洛克的龍頭骨。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect Grulloc's Dragon Skull." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect Grulloc's Dragon Skull.",  OLD Details : "詛咒之谷位在東邊飛龍之末的邊界處。戈魯爾之子，葛魯洛克就在那邊策劃他的愚蠢計畫。$B$B我聽說他的一樣物品被人用巧妙的手法給偷走了。是你做的嗎?可惜他沒有在過程中喪失性命。$B$B如果我們想重獲自由，我要你搶走他最重要的資產，那就是他父親屠殺黑龍軍團的龍頭骨。你要取得龍頭骨的唯一方法就是殺死他。", Details AC enUS : "To the east, at the terminus of Dragons' End, is the Cursed Hollow.  Therein, Grulloc, son of Gruul, plots his dimwitted schemes.$B$BI heard that one of his possessions was stolen from him through trickery.  Was that you?  Unfortunate that he was not slain in the process.$B$BIf we are to regain our freedom, I would have you take his most prized possession, a dragon skull from when he rejoiced in his father's slaying of the black dragonflight.  The only way you'll get the skull is to vanquish him." ; Wowhead enUS : "To the east, at the terminus of Dragons' End, is the Cursed Hollow. Therein, Grulloc, son of Gruul, plots his dimwitted schemes.$b$bI heard that one of his possessions was stolen from him through trickery. Was that you? Unfortunate that he was not slain in the process.$b$bIf we are to regain our freedom, I would have you take his most prized possession, a dragon skull from when he rejoiced in his father's slaying of the black dragonflight. The only way you'll get the skull is to vanquish him."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '取得葛魯洛克的龍頭骨，帶到劍刃山脈的血之環外，交給塔頂乾癟的莫格多克。', `Details` = '詛咒之谷位在東邊飛龍之末的邊界處。戈魯爾之子，葛魯洛克就在那邊策劃他的愚蠢計劃。$b$b我聽說他的一樣物品被人用巧妙的手法給偷走了。是你做的嗎?可惜他沒有在過程中喪失性命。$b$b如果我們想重獲自由，我要你搶走他最重要的資產，那就是他父親屠殺黑龍軍團的龍頭骨。你要取得龍頭骨的唯一方法就是殺死他。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10995;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "取得瑪格歐克的寶箱。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect Maggoc's Treasure Chest." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect Maggoc's Treasure Chest.",  OLD Details : "瑪格歐克在剃刀山脊的山坡上以及東南邊巡邏。他的父親指派他為東邊山區的看守者，而他則享受著殘虐當地任何看不順眼的生物。$B$B為了我的部族生存權，身為戈魯爾之子的他必須被消滅。這就要靠你幫忙了。$B$B瑪格歐克總是隨身攜帶一個寶箱。將他的寶箱帶來給我，證明你已經殺死他。你可以拿走寶箱裡頭的任何東西。", Details AC enUS : "On the Razor Ridge, above and to the southeast, Maggoc patrols.  His father assigned him as the warden of the eastern mountain range, and he revels in terrorizing any creature that gets in his way.$B$BAs a son of Gruul, he must be done away with if my clan is to survive.  That's where you come in.$B$BMaggoc carries a treasure chest with him at all times.  Prove to me that he has been slain by bringing me his precious chest.  Feel free to keep whatever you find within it." ; Wowhead enUS : "On the Razor Ridge, above and to the southeast, Maggoc patrols. His father assigned him as the warden of the eastern mountain range, and he revels in terrorizing any creature that gets in his way.$b$bAs a son of Gruul, he must be done away with if my clan is to survive. That's where you come in.$b$bMaggoc carries a treasure chest with him at all times. Prove to me that he has been slain by bringing me his precious chest. Feel free to keep whatever you find within it."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '取得瑪格歐克的寶箱，帶到劍刃山脈的血之環，交給塔頂乾癟的莫格多克。', `Details` = '瑪格歐克在剃刀山脊的山坡上以及東南邊巡邏。他的父親指派他為東邊山區的看守者，而他則享受著殘虐當地任何看不順眼的生物。$b$b為了我的部族生存權，身為戈魯爾之子的他必須被消滅。這就要靠你幫忙了。$b$b瑪格歐克總是隨身攜帶一個寶箱。將他的寶箱帶來給我，證明你已經殺死他。你可以拿走寶箱裡頭的任何東西。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10996;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "取得史拉格的軍旗。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect Slaag's Standard." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect Slaag's Standard.",  OLD Details : "你聽說過撒塔斯城嗎，$c?它的西北邊上方有個地方叫做阻礙之丘，一個你只能藉由飛行坐騎才能到達的地方。$B$B其中一位戈魯爾之子 - 史拉格，離鄉背井到那邊並且控制當地的戈杜尼巨魔。即使距離如此遙遠，我們也不能讓他坐大，免得當他的兄弟們都被殺死之後會回來復仇。$B$B$n，你必須到那邊並且取得他的軍旗，證明他已經被擊潰了。", Details AC enUS : "Are you familiar with Shattrath City, $c?  Above it to the northwest is a place called the Barrier Hills, which you can only get to upon a flying mount.$B$BOne of Gruul's sons, Slaag, exiled himself and took control of the Gordunni ogres that reside there.  Even at such a distance, we cannot afford to leave him in peace, lest he return when the rest of his brothers have been slain.$B$B$N, you must travel there, and bring back his standard as proof that he has been dealt with." ; Wowhead enUS : "Are you familiar with Shattrath City, $c? Above it to the northwest is a place called the Barrier Hills, which you can only get to upon a flying mount.$b$bOne of Gruul's sons, Slaag, exiled himself and took control of the Gordunni ogres that reside there. Even at such a distance, we cannot afford to leave him in peace, lest he return when the rest of his brothers have been slain.$b$b$n, you must travel there, and bring back his standard as proof that he has been dealt with."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '取得史拉格的軍旗，帶到劍刃山脈的血之環，交給塔頂乾癟的莫格多克。', `Details` = '你聽說過撒塔斯城嗎，$c?它的西北邊上方有個地方叫做阻礙之丘，一個你只能藉由飛行坐騎才能到達的地方。$b$b其中一位戈魯爾之子 - 史拉格，離鄉背井到那邊並且控制當地的戈杜尼巨魔。即使距離如此遙遠，我們也不能讓他坐大，免得當他的兄弟們都被殺死之後會回來復仇。$b$b$n，你必須到那邊並且取得他的軍旗，證明他已經被擊潰了。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10997;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "取得梵戈的邪惡魔典。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect Vim'gol's Vile Grimoire." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect Vim'gol's Vile Grimoire.",  OLD Details : "還有一個古羅要殺，那就是史庫洛克‧靈魂研磨者。他的藏身處非常隱密，但是有一個辦法可以引誘他現身。$B$B一個叫做邪惡的梵戈的巨魔術士曾訓練過他，你必須取得梵戈的魔典!$B$B只有站在火焰之環內才能召喚梵戈。到東北邊的山區，靠近破碎荒野的附近尋找梵戈之環。", Details AC enUS : "There is one more gronn to be slain: Skulloc Soulgrinder. He keeps himself hidden away, but there is a way to coax him forth.$B$BHe was trained by an ogre warlock known as Vim'gol the Vile, whose grimoire you must retrieve!$B$BVim'gol must be summoned by standing within a fire ring at his circle. Find Vim'gol's Circle in the mountains, to the northeast, near the Broken Wilds.$B$B$N, if you hear Vim'gol talk about growing bigger, get people back into each of the five fire rings to interrupt his casting!" ; Wowhead enUS : "There is one more gronn to be slain: Skulloc Soulgrinder. He keeps himself hidden away, but there is a way to coax him forth.$b$bHe was trained by an ogre warlock known as Vim'gol the Vile, whose grimoire you must retrieve!$b$bVim'gol must be summoned by standing within a fire ring at his circle. Find Vim'gol's Circle in the mountains, to the northeast, near the Broken Wilds.$b$b$n, if you hear Vim'gol talk about growing bigger, get people back into each of the five fire rings to interrupt his casting!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '你必須取得梵戈的邪惡魔典。把它交給劍刃山脈血之環外塔頂的乾癟的莫格多克。', `Details` = '還有一個古羅要殺:史庫洛克·靈魂研磨者。他的藏身處非常隱密，但是有一個辦法可以引誘他現身。$b$b他曾經受過一個叫做邪惡的梵戈的巨魔術士訓練，你必須取得他的魔典!$b$b梵戈必須由你加上其他四名人員才能召喚，每個人站在一個火焰之環內。到東北邊的山區，靠近破碎荒野的附近尋找梵戈之環。$b$b還有一點，$n，假如你聽見梵戈說什麼變大之類的話，快回到你的火焰之環裡面!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 10998;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "取得史庫洛克的靈魂。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect Skulloc's Soul." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect Skulloc's Soul.",  OLD Details : "這本魔典是殺死史庫洛克的關鍵。$B$B在靈魂研磨者獸穴大聲的閱讀這本魔典以啟動儀式。接著一個叫做靈魂研磨者的東西會伴隨著許多史庫洛克的靈魂受害者出現，這些靈魂會試著破壞靈魂研磨者。你必須阻止這些靈魂這麼做，直到史庫洛克被迫在這個世界上現身為止。$B$B往北穿過匕爪峽谷，到達血之環的另一邊。$B$B獸穴的位置就在你到達戈魯爾之巢之前的右手邊。$B$B將史庫洛克的靈魂帶回來。", Details AC enUS : "The grimoire is the key to Skulloc's downfall.$B$BRead aloud from the book at Soulgrinder's Barrow to initiate the ritual.  An object known as the Soulgrinder will appear, as well as Skulloc's ghostly victims, who will try to destroy it.  You must keep them from doing so long enough to force Skulloc fully into the world.$B$BFind the barrow by heading north through the Daggermaw Canyon on the other side of the Circle of Blood.  It is on the right side before Gruul's Lair.$B$BBring back Skulloc's soul." ; Wowhead enUS : "The grimoire is the key to Skulloc's downfall.$b$bRead aloud from the book at Soulgrinder's Barrow to initiate the ritual. An object known as the Soulgrinder will appear, as well as Skulloc's ghostly victims, who will try to destroy it. You must keep them from doing so long enough to force Skulloc fully into the world.$b$bFind the barrow by heading north through the Daggermaw Canyon on the other side of the Circle of Blood. It is on the right side before Gruul's Lair.$b$bBring back Skulloc's soul."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '取得史庫洛克的靈魂並且交給劍刃山脈血之環外塔頂的乾癟的莫格多克。', `Details` = '這本魔典是殺死史庫洛克的關鍵。$b$b在靈魂研磨者獸穴大聲的閱讀這本魔典以啟動儀式。接著一個叫做靈魂研磨者的東西會伴隨著許多史庫洛克的靈魂受害者出現，這些靈魂會試著破壞靈魂研磨者。你必須阻止這些靈魂這麼做，直到史庫洛克被迫在這個世界上現身為止。$b$b往北穿過匕爪峽谷，到達血之環的另一邊。$b$b獸穴的位置就在你到達戈魯爾之巢之前的右手邊。$b$b將史庫洛克的靈魂帶回來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11000;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "感謝你還聽我瘋狂的豪言壯語。一直以來我們都想要摧毀司凱堤斯的指揮系統;我們已經探聽到他們有三個叫魔爪祭司的聖職人員，但是我們從未親眼見過。現在我們知道其中的原因。$B$B去跟瑟弗林交談以取得更多他發現的藥劑。使用藥劑找到並殺死那三個魔爪祭司:艾夏歐、史奇吉克以及札列克。據說他們住在迷霧亞拉芮克，靠近黑風湖的東邊海岸。", Details AC enUS : "Thank you for paying heed to my fevered rants.  All along we had been trying to identify and destroy the Skettis chain of command; we had learned of three clerics known as the talonpriests, but we'd never seen them with our own two eyes.  Now we know why.$B$BTalk to Severin to obtain more of the elixir he discovered.  Use the elixir to find and kill the three talonpriests: Ishaal, Skizzik and Zellek.  They're rumored to dwell in Veil Ala'rak, near the eastern shore of Blackwind Lake." ; Wowhead enUS : "Thank you for paying heed to my fevered rants. All along we had been trying to identify and destroy the Skettis chain of command; we had learned of three clerics known as the talonpriests, but we'd never seen them with our own two eyes. Now we know why.$b$bTalk to Severin to obtain more of the elixir he discovered. Use the elixir to find and kill the three talonpriests: Ishaal, Skizzik and Zellek. They're rumored to dwell in Veil Ala'rak, near the eastern shore of Blackwind Lake."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '感謝你還聽我瘋狂的豪言壯語。一直以來我們都想要摧毀司凱提斯的指揮系統;我們已經探聽到他們有三個叫魔爪祭司的聖職人員，但是我們從未親眼見過。現在我們知道其中的原因。$b$b去跟瑟弗林交談以取得更多他發現的藥劑。使用藥劑找到並殺死那三個魔爪祭司:艾夏歐、史奇吉克以及札列克。據說他們住在迷霧亞拉芮克，靠近黑風湖的東邊海岸。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11005;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectivetext1 : "摧毀巨大的卡裡瑞蛋", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Monstrous Kaliri Egg Destroyed" ; Wowhead enUS : "Monstrous Kaliri Egg Destroyed"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectivetext1` = '已摧毀巨大的卡里瑞蛋', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11008;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "既然你已經解放了我們的奴役生涯，我們可以開始重新統合整個部族。這可能要花點時間;部族之間的舊仇很難化解。$B$B但是現在有一件更迫切的事情，你必須前往位於西方上空的歐格利拉。你必須保護歐格利拉還有我們不受上方的軍隊威脅，就像之前古羅為了保護我們而對抗以太族、惡魔還有最可怕的黑龍軍團一樣。$B$B當你到達巨魔的天堂時，請教裘阿洛該如何做最好。", Details AC enUS : "Now that you have delivered us from bondage, we can begin the process of reunifying the clans.  This will take some time; old grudges are difficult to overcome.$B$BBut more pressing, you must go to Ogri'la in the heavens above to the west.  You must defend it, and us, from those forces above that the gronn used to protect us from: ethereals, demons, and worst of all, the black dragonflight.$B$BWhen you find ogre heaven, seek out the wisdom of Chu'a'lor on how best to proceed." ; Wowhead enUS : "Now that you have delivered us from bondage, we can begin the process of reunifying the clans. This will take some time; old grudges are difficult to overcome.$b$bBut more pressing, you must go to Ogri'la in the heavens above to the west. You must defend it, and us, from those forces above that the gronn used to protect us from: ethereals, demons, and worst of all, the black dragonflight.$b$bWhen you find ogre heaven, seek out the wisdom of Chu'a'lor on how best to proceed."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '既然你已經解放了我們的奴役生涯，我們可以開始重新統合整個部族。這可能要花點時間;部族之間的舊仇很難化解。$b$b但是現在有一件更迫切的事情，你必須前往位於西方上空的歐格利拉。你必須保護歐格利拉還有我們不受上方的軍隊威脅，就像之前古羅為了保護我們而對抗伊斯利、惡魔還有最可怕的黑龍軍團一樣。$b$b當你到達巨魔的天堂時，請教裘阿洛該如何做最好。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11009;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "使用禦天者炸彈摧毀15個惡魔砲彈堆。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use the Skyguard Bombs to destroy 15 Fel Cannonball Stacks." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use the Skyguard Bombs to destroy 15 Fel Cannonball Stacks.",  OLD Details : "那些高射火砲仍然對我們造成威脅，$n。$B$B你可別誤會我的意思，我認為你上次執行任務的表現非常出色。但事實上，那些該死的惡魔們補充砲彈的速度似乎比我們摧毀他們砲彈的速度還快。這同時表示我們的士兵很難通過該區域，更別提那些惡魔們對歐格利拉所造成的風險。$B$B你意下如何?想再次轟炸他們嗎?", Details AC enUS : "We're still having problems with those flak cannons, $N.$B$BDon't get me wrong -- I think that you did an outstanding job the last time out -- but, that doesn't change the fact that those damned demons seem to be replenishing their ammo supplies faster than we can knock them out.  And that means we're having a hell of a time getting our people through there, not to mention the risk those demons pose to Ogri'la.$B$BWhat do you say?  Want to take another shot at it?" ; Wowhead enUS : "We're still having problems with those flak cannons, $n.$b$bDon't get me wrong -- I think that you did an outstanding job the last time out -- but, that doesn't change the fact that those damned demons seem to be replenishing their ammo supplies faster than we can knock them out. And that means we're having a hell of a time getting our people through there, not to mention the risk those demons pose to Ogri'la.$b$bWhat do you say? Want to take another shot at it?",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "摧毀惡魔砲彈堆", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Fel Cannonball Stacks destroyed" ; Wowhead enUS : "Fel Cannonball Stacks destroyed"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '天空士官樊德麗要你炸毀15個惡魔砲彈堆。任務完成後回到劍刃山脈的禦天者崗哨向她回報。', `Details` = '那些高射火砲仍然對我們造成威脅，$n。$b$b你可別誤會我的意思，我認為你上次執行任務的表現非常出色。但事實上，那些該死的惡魔們補充砲彈的速度似乎比我們摧毀他們砲彈的速度還快。這同時表示我們的士兵很難通過該區域，更別提那些惡魔們對歐格利拉所造成的風險。$b$b你意下如何?想再次轟炸他們嗎?', `Objectivetext1` = '已摧毀惡魔砲彈堆', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11023;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "經過適當的事前準備，那些山區中的水晶就能展現出它的奇異能量，就好像我們在歐格利拉發現它有使人思緒清晰的能力。$B$B山上的生物都垂涎著那些水晶裂片，並且將其裂片使用於他們私人的用途之上。那些水晶的價值甚至還引起了一些商機。$B$B想協助我們的話，你必須先學習了解頂尖裂片。幫我找一些裂片回來。除了這裡的生物會攜帶頂尖裂片之外，有時候你也可以在鐮奪怪挖掘水晶的地方發現裂片。", Details AC enUS : "When prepared correctly, the crystals of the mountains exhibit strange powers, such as the clarity of mind that we have found here in Ogri'la.$B$BAll of the creatures atop the mountains covet the crystal shards and use them to further their own goals.  An economy has even sprung up around them.$B$BTo assist us, you must first learn about the Apexis shards.  Bring me some.  In addition to the creatures here having them, they can sometimes be found where the flayers dig at the larger crystals." ; Wowhead enUS : "When prepared correctly, the crystals of the mountains exhibit strange powers, such as the clarity of mind that we have found here in Ogri'la.$b$bAll of the creatures atop the mountains covet the crystal shards and use them to further their own goals. An economy has even sprung up around them.$b$bTo assist us, you must first learn about the Apexis shards. Bring me some. In addition to the creatures here having them, they can sometimes be found where the flayers dig at the larger crystals."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '經過適當的事前準備，那些山區中的水晶就能展現出它的奇異能量，就好像我們在歐格利拉發現它有使人思緒清晰的能力。$b$b山上的生物都垂涎著那些水晶裂片，並且將其裂片使用於他們私人的用途之上。那些水晶的價值甚至還引起了一些商機。$b$b想協助我們的話，你必須先學習了解頂尖裂片。幫我找一些裂片回來。除了這裡的生物會攜帶頂尖裂片之外，有時候你也可以在鐮奪怪挖掘水晶的地方發現裂片。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11025;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "使用驅逐水晶來放逐劍刃山脈上煉冶場:憤怒與煉冶場:驚駭中的惡魔。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use the Banishing Crystal to banish 15 demons at Forge Camp: Wrath or Forge Camp: Terror." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use the Banishing Crystal to banish 15 demons at Forge Camp: Wrath or Forge Camp: Terror.",  OLD Details : "朋友，你到達的時間真是太完美了!我們真的需要幫助。你會得到一個非常稀有的物品作為回報，這樣你我兩方都能得到好處。$B$B我們已經不再是凶暴的巨魔了，不過附近的惡魔們威脅要侵擾我們和禦天者。對抗惡魔的問題是，他們一旦被殺死，就會以一個新的軀體重新回來!$B$B不過，如果你使用這個水晶來召喚一個驅逐傳送門，當他們在傳送門附近死亡時，他們的精華就會被抽走，並且放逐回他們的老家!", Details AC enUS : "You've arrived at the perfect time, friend!  We are in need of assistance.  In return, you will receive something very rare, which will help us both in the end.$B$BWe're not a violent ogre any longer, but the demons nearby threaten to overrun us and the Skyguard.  The problem with demons is that, once killed, they come right back in new bodies!$B$BBut, if you use this crystal to summon a banishing portal, when they die near it, their essences will be drawn in and banished back from whence they came!" ; Wowhead enUS : "You've arrived at the perfect time, friend! We are in need of assistance. In return, you will receive something very rare, which will help us both in the end.$b$bWe're not a violent ogre any longer, but the demons nearby threaten to overrun us and the Skyguard. The problem with demons is that, once killed, they come right back in new bodies!$b$bBut, if you use this crystal to summon a banishing portal, when they die near it, their essences will be drawn in and banished back from whence they came!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "驅逐惡魔", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Demons banished" ; Wowhead enUS : "Demons banished"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '克朗克要求你使用驅逐水晶來放逐劍刃山脈上煉冶場:憤怒與煉冶場:驚駭中的惡魔。當你完成任務後回去找他。', `Details` = '朋友，你到達的時間真是太完美了!我們真的需要幫助。你會得到一個非常稀有的物品作為回報，這樣你我兩方都能得到好處。$b$b我們已經不再是兇暴的巨魔了，不過附近的惡魔們威脅要侵擾我們和禦天者。對抗惡魔的問題是，他們一旦被殺死，就會以一個新的軀體重新回來!$b$b不過，如果你使用這個水晶來召喚一個驅逐傳送門，當他們在傳送門附近死亡時，他們的精華就會被抽走，並且放逐回他們的老家!', `Objectivetext1` = '已驅逐惡魔', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11026;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "打開包裹，$n。這是一個偽裝。看起來沒什麼說服力對吧?$B$B我為以太族走私者製作它們以搜尋稀有的書本。有一個阿拉卡作家住在司凱堤斯的中心島嶼，泰洛克之墓;他的名字叫撒哈克。他既老又幾近全盲。$B$B利用這個偽裝來和他交談並取得那本叫敵人之血的書。小心點，$n。這個偽裝騙不了其他的阿拉卡。", Details AC enUS : "Open the package, $N.  It is a disguise.  It doesn't look very convincing, does it?$B$BI craft them for ethereal smugglers in search of rare books.  There is an arakkoa scribe who dwells in the central island in Skettis, Terokk's Rest; his name is Sahaak.  He is old and nearly blind.$B$BUse the disguise to speak with him and obtain the book known as the Adversarial Bloodlines.  Be careful, $N.  The disguise won't fool the other arakkoa." ; Wowhead enUS : "Open the package, $n. It is a disguise. It doesn't look very convincing, does it?$b$bI craft them for ethereal smugglers in search of rare books. There is an arakkoa scribe who dwells in the central island in Skettis, Terokk's Rest; his name is Sahaak. He is old and nearly blind.$b$bUse the disguise to speak with him and obtain the book known as the Adversarial Bloodlines. Be careful, $n. The disguise won't fool the other arakkoa."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '打開包裹，$n。這是一個偽裝。看起來沒什麼說服力對吧?$b$b我為伊斯利走私者製作它們以搜尋稀有的書本。有一個阿拉卡作家住在司凱堤斯的中心島嶼，泰洛克之墓;他的名字叫撒哈克。他既老又幾近全盲。$b$b利用這個偽裝來和他交談並取得那本叫敵人之血的書。小心點，$n。這個偽裝騙不了其他的阿拉卡。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11029;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到虛空風暴的52區，把罐頭水果交給火箭主管夫斯拉吉。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring the Preserved Fruit to Rocket-Chief Fuselage at Area 52 in the Netherstorm." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the Preserved Fruit to Rocket-Chief Fuselage at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",  OLD Details : "我先承認我不太清楚這個訂單是要用來幹嘛的，但火箭主管夫斯拉吉的指示非常明確 - 只要品質最好的水果，製成足夠長期航行的罐頭食品並密封它們不受自然腐壞的影響。$B$B還有其他的說明，這個要無重力那個要低壓力。我不會假裝我了解，但價錢不錯，所以他會得到他要的超級食品。把這個木箱帶到52區給他。越過了虛空風暴後，順著路走直到你看見城鎮。", Details AC enUS : "I'll be the first to admit I'm not quite sure what this order is for, but Rocket-Chief Fuselage's instructions were very specific -- only the very best fruit, preserved to survive a long voyage and sealed against the elements.$B$BThere were other specifications, zero-gravity this and low pressure that. I don't pretend to understand it, but the price is right, so he'll get his superfood. Bring this crate to him up at Area 52. After crossing into Netherstorm, keep following the road until you see the town." ; Wowhead enUS : "I'll be the first to admit I'm not quite sure what this order is for, but Rocket-Chief Fuselage's instructions were very specific -- only the very best fruit, preserved to survive a long voyage and sealed against the elements.$b$bThere were other specifications, zero-gravity this and low pressure that. I don't pretend to understand it, but the price is right, so he'll get his superfood. Bring this crate to him up at Area 52. After crossing into Netherstorm, keep following the road until you see the town."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '將罐頭水果交給52區的火箭主管夫斯拉吉。', `Details` = '我先承認我不太清楚這個訂單是要用來幹嘛的，但火箭主管夫斯拉吉的指示非常明確 - 只要品質最好的水果，製成足夠長期航行的罐頭食品並密封它們不受自然腐壞的影響。$b$b還有其他的說明，這個要無重力那個要低壓力。我不會假裝我了解，但價錢不錯，所以他會得到他要的超級食品。把這個木箱帶到52區給他。越過了虛空風暴後，順著路走直到你看見城鎮。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11036;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到虛空風暴的52區，把波西的備用零件帶給火箭主管夫斯拉吉。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring Bossi's Spare Parts to Rocket-Chief Fuselage at Area 52 in the Netherstorm." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring Bossi's Spare Parts to Rocket-Chief Fuselage at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",  OLD Details : "我和哥布林合作的次數用一隻手就數的出來。我們和他們比較像在競爭，但當我接到火箭主管夫斯拉吉的請求，我實在沒辦法拒絕他。$B$B這個木箱裝滿了我在這裡用不到的零件，但那個火箭主管或許可以用在他的工程上。如果你正要去52區的話可以幫忙運送它們嗎？$B$B誰知道，或許一些精細的地精零件可以讓他的創作免於爆炸！", Details AC enUS : "You can count on one hand the number of times I've collaborated with a goblin. We're far more likely to be in competition with them, but when I received Rocket-Chief Fuselage's request, I just couldn't refuse him.$B$BThis crate is full of parts I'm not using here, but that the rocket-chief might be able to put to use on his project. Would you be kind enough to deliver them if you're on your way to Area 52?$B$BWho knows, maybe some fine gnomish parts could keep his creation from exploding!" ; Wowhead enUS : "You can count on one hand the number of times I've collaborated with a goblin. We're far more likely to be in competition with them, but when I received Rocket-Chief Fuselage's request, I just couldn't refuse him.$b$bThis crate is full of parts I'm not using here, but that the rocket-chief might be able to put to use on his project. Would you be kind enough to deliver them if you're on your way to Area 52?$b$bWho knows, maybe some fine gnomish parts could keep his creation from exploding!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把波西的備用零件送給52區的火箭主管夫斯拉吉。', `Details` = '我和哥布林合作的次數用一隻手就數的出來。我們和他們比較像在競爭，但當我接到火箭主管夫斯拉吉的請求，我實在沒辦法拒絕他。$b$b這個木箱裝滿了我在這裡用不到的零件，但那個火箭主管或許可以用在他的工程上。如果你正要去52區的話可以幫忙運送它們嗎?$b$b誰知道，或許一些精細的地精零件可以讓他的創作免於爆炸!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11040;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到影月谷的蠻錘要塞找布朗恩‧焰鬚談話。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Brunn Flamebeard at Wildhammer Stronghold in Shadowmoon Valley." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Brunn Flamebeard at Wildhammer Stronghold in Shadowmoon Valley.",  OLD Details : "我聽說那些蠻錘矮人在影月谷的南邊要塞有一座獅鷲獸棲息處。假如你順路到那邊的話，可以幫我傳話給他們嗎？我有一些想法可以改良他們的獅鷲獸！$B$B明明可以在獅鷲獸身上裝飛行儀表板、照後鏡還有火箭，為什麼他們不武裝獅鷲獸呢？想想看裝了之後獅鷲獸可以飛的多快！我稱它為渦輪獅鷲獸8000型！", Details AC enUS : "I've heard that the Wildhammer dwarves maintain a gryphon roost at their fortress down in southern Shadowmoon Valley. If you're going down there, would you speak to them on my behalf? I have some ideas on how to improve their gryphons!$B$BWhy stop at armoring them when you could attach an altimeter, a rear view mirror, and rocket? Imagine how fast you could go with one of those babies strapped to your gryphon's back! I'll call it the TurboGryphon 8000!" ; Wowhead enUS : "I've heard that the Wildhammer dwarves maintain a gryphon roost at their fortress down in southern Shadowmoon Valley. If you're going down there, would you speak to them on my behalf? I have some ideas on how to improve their gryphons!$b$bWhy stop at armoring them when you could attach an altimeter, a rear view mirror, and rocket? Imagine how fast you could go with one of those babies strapped to your gryphon's back! I'll call it the TurboGryphon 8000!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '跟蠻錘要塞的布朗恩·焰鬚談話。', `Details` = '我聽說那些蠻錘矮人在影月谷的南邊要塞有一座獅鷲獸棲息處。假如你順路到那邊的話，可以幫我傳話給他們嗎?我有一些想法可以改良他們的獅鷲獸!$b$b明明可以在獅鷲獸身上裝飛行儀表板、照後鏡還有火箭，為什麼他們不武裝獅鷲獸呢?想想看裝了之後獅鷲獸可以飛的多快!我稱它為渦輪獅鷲獸8000型!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11043;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "到影月谷的影月村找達瑪‧蠻鬃談話。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Dama Wildmane at Shadowmoon Village in Shadowmoon Valley." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Dama Wildmane at Shadowmoon Village in Shadowmoon Valley.",  OLD Details : "身為蠍尾獅管理員的學徒，我的其中一項工作就是當牠們沒有執行飛行任務時要照顧牠們。問題是我們這邊的雙足飛龍數量太少了，牠們根本沒有休息的時間。$B$B假如我們不能補充雙足飛龍的數量的話，我怕牠們會操勞致死。影月谷西邊的影月村有一個大型的雙足飛龍獸欄。達瑪‧蠻鬃負責照顧和訓練那裡的雙足飛龍。$B$B你可以幫我們去跟她講幾句好話，同時讓她了解我們的情況嗎？", Details AC enUS : "As an apprentice wind rider master, one of my tasks is to care for the beasts when they're not flying. The problem is that we have so few here, there's very little downtime for any of them.$B$BI'm afraid we'll work them all to death if we don't receive any replacements. There's a large stable down in Shadowmoon Village, in western Shadowmoon Valley. Dama Wildmane oversees the wind rider care and training there.$B$BWould you speak with her on our behalf and let her know about our situation?" ; Wowhead enUS : "As an apprentice wind rider master, one of my tasks is to care for the beasts when they're not flying. The problem is that we have so few here, there's very little downtime for any of them.$b$bI'm afraid we'll work them all to death if we don't receive any replacements. There's a large stable down in Shadowmoon Village, in western Shadowmoon Valley. Dama Wildmane oversees the wind rider care and training there.$b$bWould you speak with her on our behalf and let her know about our situation?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '跟影月村的達瑪·野鬃談話。', `Details` = '身為雙足飛龍管理員的學徒，我的其中一項工作就是當牠們沒有執行飛行任務時要照顧牠們。問題是我們這邊的雙足飛龍數量太少了，牠們根本沒有休息的時間。$b$b假如我們不能補充雙足飛龍的數量的話，我怕牠們會操勞致死。影月谷西邊的影月村有一個大型的雙足飛龍廄。達瑪·野鬃負責照顧和訓練那裡的雙足飛龍。$b$b你可以幫我們去跟她講幾句好話，同時讓她了解我們的情況嗎?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11047;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "使用驅逐水晶來放逐劍刃山脈上煉冶場:憤怒或煉冶場:驚駭中15個惡魔。", Objectives AC enUS : "Use the Banishing Crystal to banish 15 demons at Forge Camp: Wrath or Forge Camp: Terror." ; Wowhead enUS : "Use the Banishing Crystal to banish 15 demons at Forge Camp: Wrath or Forge Camp: Terror.",  OLD Details : "如果我們了解惡魔，其實基於我們深入地研究，我們是了解他們的，他們能快速修補珍貴的轉換門上所受到的任何傷害。$B$B所以，如果你想要取得另一個暗色符文的機會，帶著我們的驅逐水晶回到那裡並消滅更多惡魔。此外，你想幫我們減輕惡魔造成的威脅，對吧?$B$B我之所以會說「機會」是因為我們使用的程序會產生不同的結果。你可能會得到一個暗色符文，或是可能得到一個完全不同的東西。", Details AC enUS : "If we know the demons, and we do because we've studied them extensively, they're fast at work repairing any damage that has been done to their precious transporter.$B$BSo, if you want a chance at another darkrune, take our banishing crystal back out there and eliminate more demons.  Besides, you want to help us to lessen the threat that the demons pose, yes?$B$BWe said "chance" because the process we use yields mixed results.  You might get a darkrune, or you might get something else entirely." ; Wowhead enUS : "If we know the demons, and we do because we've studied them extensively, they're fast at work repairing any damage that has been done to their precious transporter.$b$bSo, if you want a chance at another darkrune, take our banishing crystal back out there and eliminate more demons. Besides, you want to help us to lessen the threat that the demons pose, yes?$b$bWe said "chance" because the process we use yields mixed results. You might get a darkrune, or you might get something else entirely.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "驅逐惡魔", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Demons banished" ; Wowhead enUS : "Demons banished"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '克朗克要求你使用驅逐水晶來放逐劍刃山脈上煉冶場:憤怒或煉冶場:驚駭中15個惡魔。當你完成任務後回去找他。', `Details` = '如果我們了解惡魔，其實基於我們深入地研究，我們是了解他們的，他們能快速修補珍貴的轉換門上所受到的任何傷害。$b$b所以，如果你想要取得另一個暗色符文的機會，帶著我們的驅逐水晶回到那裡並消滅更多惡魔。此外，你想幫我們減輕惡魔造成的威脅，對吧?$b$b我之所以會說「機會」是因為我們使用的程序會產生不同的結果。你可能會得到一個暗色符文，或是可能得到一個完全不同的東西。', `Objectivetext1` = '已驅逐惡魔', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11051;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "不要讓我們的對話引來注意。艾德瑞斯不會贊同的。$B$B我是阿拉卡社會最低等級的人，$n。在泰洛克的規則裡，我早已被他的魔爪祭司崇拜的黑暗力量犧牲了。如果你說的是真的，魔爪祭司在尋求泰洛克的歸來，那麼你一定要阻止他們成功 - 不管你的領導者怎麼說!$B$B我有個對你有用的東西要給你。我在迷霧希拉克上層的舊居所有一個包裹。把它拿來給我!", Details AC enUS : "Do not draw attention to our conversation.  Adaris would not approve.$B$BI belong to the lowest caste of arakkoa, $N.  During Terokk's rule I would've been sacrificed to the dark powers worshipped by his talonpriests.  If what you say is true and the talonpriests are seeking Terokk's return, then you must prevent them from succeeding - regardless of what your leader says!$B$BI've something to offer you that you'll find useful.  There is a package at my old dwelling in Upper Veil Shil'ak.  Bring it to me!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Do not draw attention to our conversation. Adaris would not approve.$b$bI belong to the lowest caste of arakkoa, $n. During Terokk's rule I would've been sacrificed to the dark powers worshipped by his talonpriests. If what you say is true and the talonpriests are seeking Terokk's return, then you must prevent them from succeeding - regardless of what your leader says!$b$bI've something to offer you that you'll find useful. There is a package at my old dwelling in Upper Veil Shil'ak. Bring it to me!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '不要讓我們的對話引來注意。艾德瑞斯不會贊同的。$b$b我是阿拉卡社會最低等級的人，$n。在泰洛克的規則裡，我早已被他的魔爪祭司崇拜的黑暗力量犧牲了。如果你說的是真的，魔爪祭司在尋求泰洛克的歸來，那麼你一定要阻止他們成功 - 不管你的領導者怎麼說!$b$b我有個對你有用的東西要給你。我在迷霧希拉克上層的舊居所有一個包裹。把它拿來給我!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11056;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "從一個頂尖聖物獲得頂尖顫動效果。", Objectives AC enUS : "Gain Apexis Vibrations from an Apexis Relic." ; Wowhead enUS : "Gain Apexis Vibrations from an Apexis Relic.",  OLD Details : "很久以前有個已絕種的部族曾經住在這裡，一支叫頂尖的阿拉卡部族。他們文明遺物仍然存在。我們稱它們為頂尖聖物。$B$B我們只知道，適當地使用它們會帶來很多好處。每個聖物會呈現不一樣的顏色，以正確的順序去點按水晶，就會進入下一個等級，一次會比一次還要困難。$B$B要啟動聖物就需要一個頂尖裂片。等你洞悉了頂尖顫動後再來找我們。", Details AC enUS : "Long ago a now-extinct sect of the arakkoa known as the Apexis lived here.  Remnants of their civilization are still present.  We call them apexis relics.$B$BWhat we know about them is that, when properly used, they grant a boon.  Each relic presents a colored sequence which, when the crystals are pressed in the correct order, leads through a series of levels, each harder than the last.$B$BAn apexis shard is needed to power the relic.  Return when you have attained the insight of the apexis vibration." ; Wowhead enUS : "Long ago a now-extinct sect of the arakkoa known as the Apexis lived here. Remnants of their civilization are still present. We call them apexis relics.$b$bWhat we know about them is that, when properly used, they grant a boon. Each relic presents a colored sequence which, when the crystals are pressed in the correct order, leads through a series of levels, each harder than the last.$b$bAn apexis shard is needed to power the relic. Return when you have attained the insight of the apexis vibration."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '裘阿洛要你從一個頂尖聖物獲得頂尖顫動效果後回到劍刃山脈頂端的歐格利拉找他。', `Details` = '很久以前有個已絕種的部族曾經住在這裡，一支叫頂尖的阿拉卡部族。他們文明遺物仍然存在。我們稱它們為頂尖聖物。$b$b我們只知道，適當地使用它們會帶來很多好處。每個聖物會呈現不一樣的顏色，以正確的順序去點按水晶，就會進入下一個等級，一次會比一次還要困難。$b$b要啟動聖物就需要一個頂尖裂片。等你洞悉了頂尖顫動後再來找我們。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11058;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "取得頂尖守護者頭顱。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect an Apexis Guardian's Head." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect an Apexis Guardian's Head.",  OLD Details : "你已經知道怎麼使用這些單人型聖物，但如你所見，還有更大型的聖物，被單人型聖物環繞著。$B$B這些更大型的頂尖紀念碑功能差不多，但它們需要35個頂尖裂片才能啟動。$B$B我們最擔心的就是使用它們時召喚出的護衛。這些水晶結構喚醒了它們很久以前的阿拉卡主人，現在危害著歐格利拉。$B$B我們要你摧毀一個並帶來給我們做為證據。", Details AC enUS : "You've figured out how to use the single-person relics, but as you may have seen, there are bigger ones, which they surround.$B$BThese larger apexis monuments function in much the same way, but they take many more apexis shards to activate and require four persons to operate.$B$BOf greater concern to us are the guardians that are summoned through their use.  These crystal constructs turned on their arakkoan masters long ago, and now endanger Ogri'la.$B$BWe would ask that you destroy one and bring us proof." ; Wowhead enUS : "You've figured out how to use the single-person relics, but as you may have seen, there are bigger ones, which they surround.$b$bThese larger apexis monuments function in much the same way, but they take many more apexis shards to activate and require four persons to operate.$b$bOf greater concern to us are the guardians that are summoned through their use. These crystal constructs turned on their arakkoan masters long ago, and now endanger Ogri'la.$b$bWe would ask that you destroy one and bring us proof."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '裘阿洛要你取得頂尖守護者頭顱給他做為證據。完成後帶著它回到劍刃山脈頂端的歐格利拉找他。', `Details` = '你已經知道怎麼使用這些單人型聖物，但如你所見，還有更大型的聖物，被單人型聖物環繞著。$b$b這些更大型的頂尖紀念碑功能差不多，但它們需要更多的頂尖裂片來啟動，並且需要四個人來操作。$b$b我們最擔心的就是使用它們時召喚出的護衛。這些水晶結構喚醒了它們很久以前的阿拉卡主人，現在危害著歐格利拉。$b$b我們要你摧毀一個並帶來給我們做為證據。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11059;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "被司凱堤斯魔爪祭司扣留為囚犯的子嗣都列在這本書裡:女獵人吉札拉，水晶巨人葛洛克，異教徒黑暗尖叫者阿卡萊和『風怒者』瓦奇茲。殺了他們才能讓泰洛克回到這個世界。$B$B你需要時光流逝阿拉卡身上帶的卷軸，才能在司凱堤斯的召喚法陣召喚他們。幫我從他們身上各帶一個象徵物回來。你挑戰的是強大的生物;帶朋友一起去會比較好。", Details AC enUS : "The descendants held prisoner by the Skettis talonpriests are listed in this book: Gezzarak the Huntress, Karrog the crystal giant, the heretic known as Darkscreecher Akkarai and Vakkiz the Windrager.  They will all need to be slain before Terokk returns to this world.$B$BYou will need the scrolls carried by the time-lost arakkoa to call them forth at the summoning circles in Skettis.  Bring me a token from each one.  These are powerful beings you will be facing; you would do well to bring friends." ; Wowhead enUS : "The descendants held prisoner by the Skettis talonpriests are listed in this book: Gezzarak the Huntress, Karrog the crystal giant, the heretic known as Darkscreecher Akkarai and Vakkiz the Windrager. They will all need to be slain before Terokk returns to this world.$b$bYou will need the scrolls carried by the time-lost arakkoa to call them forth at the summoning circles in Skettis. Bring me a token from each one. These are powerful beings you will be facing; you would do well to bring friends."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '被司凱堤斯魔爪祭司扣留為囚犯的子嗣都列在這本書裡:女獵人吉札拉，水晶巨人葛洛克，異教徒黑暗尖叫者阿卡萊和『風怒者』瓦奇茲。殺了他們才能讓泰洛卡回到這個世界。$b$b你需要時光流逝阿拉卡身上帶的卷軸，才能在司凱堤斯的召喚法陣召喚他們。幫我從他們身上各帶一個象徵物回來。你挑戰的是強大的生物;帶朋友一起去會比較好。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11072;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Terokk slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectivetext1` = '泰洛克 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11073;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "取得龍牙。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect Dragon Teeth." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect Dragon Teeth.",  OLD Details : "你四處飛行的時候，一定注意到上方的龍群了。我相信你還沒在牠們的憤怒下成為受害者。幫我們結束牠，$n!$B$B瑞文達科和歐比希迪亞主宰這個平臺，而印希迪恩和狂怒之翼則管理東北方平臺上方的天空。他們在各自的平臺都有自己的棲所。不知道你和你的朋友是否能去其中一個棲所，$g小夥子:小姑娘;，用35塊頂尖裂片打破一顆蛋把龍引下來。$B$B將龍牙交給我做為證據。", Details AC enUS : "As ye've flown around, ye must have noticed the dragons above.  I trust ye haven't fallen victim ta their rage.  Help us put an end ta it, $N!$B$BRivendark and Obsidia lord over this terrace, while Insidion and Furywing rule the skies over yon terrace ta the northeast.  Each has a perch on their respective domains.  I be wondering if ye and yer friends will go ta one, $g lad : lass;, break open an egg and attract the dragon down.$B$BBring me some teeth as proof.  Ta rule the skies, it's either them or us." ; Wowhead enUS : "As ye've flown around, ye must have noticed the dragons above. I trust ye haven't fallen victim ta their rage. Help us put an end ta it, $n!$b$bRivendark and Obsidia lord over this terrace, while Insidion and Furywing rule the skies over yon terrace ta the northeast. Each has a perch on their respective domains. I be wondering if ye and yer friends will go ta one, $glad:lass, break open an egg and attract the dragon down.$b$bBring me some teeth as proof. Ta rule the skies, it's either them or us."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '天空指揮官凱勒要你取得龍牙，然後回到劍刃山脈頂端的禦天者崗哨交給他。', `Details` = '你四處飛行的時候，一定注意到上方的龍群了。我相信你還沒在他們的憤怒下成為受害者。幫我們結束它，$n!$b$b瑞文達科和歐比希迪亞主宰這個平臺，而印希迪恩和狂怒之翼則管理東北方平臺上方的天空。他們在各自的平臺都有自己的棲所。不知道你和你的朋友是否能去其中一個棲所，$g小伙子:小姑娘，打破一顆蛋把龍引下來。$b$b將龍牙交給我做為證據。要統治天空，不是我們死就是他們亡。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11078;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "從頂尖聖物獲得頂尖放射增益效果。", Objectives AC enUS : "Gain Apexis Emanations from an Apexis Relic." ; Wowhead enUS : "Gain Apexis Emanations from an Apexis Relic.",  OLD Details : "既然你已感受了頂尖聖物的啟發顫動，是時候讓你更了解它們的作用了。我們很希望得益於你對聖物的觀察!$B$B隨著你調合聖物的能力更進一步，你會獲得更高一層的知識。這個認知來自於聖物的放射增益。$B$B等你獲得這樣的放射增益後再來找我們。", Details AC enUS : "Now that you have felt the enlightening vibrations of the apexis relics, it is time for you to further your understanding of their workings.  We are very eager to benefit from your observations!$B$BAs you progress in your ability to attune to the relics, you will gain a higher level of knowledge.  This recognition will come in the form of an emanation from the relic.$B$BReturn to us when you have attained such an emanation." ; Wowhead enUS : "Now that you have felt the enlightening vibrations of the apexis relics, it is time for you to further your understanding of their workings. We are very eager to benefit from your observations!$b$bAs you progress in your ability to attune to the relics, you will gain a higher level of knowledge. This recognition will come in the form of an emanation from the relic.$b$bReturn to us when you have attained such an emanation."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '裘阿洛要你從頂尖聖物獲得頂尖放射增益效果再到劍刃山脈頂端的歐格利拉找他。', `Details` = '既然你已感受了頂尖聖物的啟發顫動，是時候讓你更了解它們的作用了。我們很希望得益於你對聖物的觀察!$b$b隨著你調合聖物的能力更進一步，你會獲得更高一層的知識。這個認知來自於聖物的放射增益。$b$b等你獲得這樣的放射增益後再來找我們。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11080;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "嗨，$n。謝謝你來幫我。$B$B阿拉卡的怪鳥在我進行偵察任務時把我從虛空鰭刺上擊下。$B$B我們快離開這裡，趁還來的及。", Details AC enUS : "Hail, $N.  I thank you for coming to my aid.$B$BThe arakkoa's monstrous birds knocked me from my nether ray while on a scouting mission.$B$BLet's get out of here, while we can." ; Wowhead enUS : "Hail, $n. I thank you for coming to my aid.$b$bThe arakkoa's monstrous birds knocked me from my nether ray while on a scouting mission.$b$bLet's get out of here, while we can."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '嗨，$n。謝謝你來幫我。$b$b阿拉卡的怪鳥在我進行偵察任務時把我從虛空鰭刺上擊下。$b$b我們快離開這裡，趁還來的及。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11085;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "虛空鰭刺一旦經過適當的訓練就會出奇地忠誠和順從。不幸的是司凱堤斯的戰役讓它們傷亡慘重。$B$B我們每天都有許多的突擊 - 可憐的夥伴們都很少休息。隨著最近食物短缺，如果那些可惡的鳥人不殺他們，飢餓也會把他們殺死。$B$B如果你可以幫個忙，帶一隻我們的鰭刺到南邊的樹林去。他們不喜歡扭曲追趕者的肉，除非是新鮮的。", Details AC enUS : "Nether rays are surprisingly loyal and obedient once properly trained.  Unfortunately the war on Skettis is taking a toll on them.$B$BWe have dozens of sorties a day - the poor fellows rarely get a break.  And with recent shortages on feed, if those blasted birdmen don't kill them on a mission then starvation will.$B$BIf you can lend a hand, take one of our rays to the woods in the south.  They don't mind warp chaser meat as long as it's a fresh kill." ; Wowhead enUS : "Nether rays are surprisingly loyal and obedient once properly trained. Unfortunately the war on Skettis is taking a toll on them.$b$bWe have dozens of sorties a day - the poor fellows rarely get a break. And with recent shortages on feed, if those blasted birdmen don't kill them on a mission then starvation will.$b$bIf you can lend a hand, take one of our rays to the woods in the south. They don't mind warp chaser meat as long as it's a fresh kill."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '虛空鰭刺一旦經過適當的訓練就會出奇地忠誠和順從。不幸的是司凱堤斯的戰役讓它們傷亡慘重。$b$b我們每天都有許多的突擊 - 可憐的伙伴們都很少休息。隨著最近食物短缺，如果那些可惡的鳥人不殺他們，飢餓也會把他們殺死。$b$b如果你可以幫個忙，帶一隻我們的鰭刺到南邊的樹林去。他們不喜歡扭曲追趕者的肉，除非是新鮮的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11093;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "納魯的試煉：瑪瑟裡頓", Title AC enUS : "Trial of the Naaru: (QUEST FLAG)" ; Wowhead enUS : "Trial of the Naaru: (QUEST FLAG)",  OLD Objectives : "沙塔斯城的阿達爾要求你殺死瑪瑟裡頓。", Objectives AC enUS : "A'dal in Shattrath City wants you to slay Magtheridon." ; Wowhead enUS : "A'dal in Shattrath City wants you to slay Magtheridon.",  OLD Details : "想要證明你自己擁有獲得風暴鑰匙的資格，你必須首先完成四個試煉。$B$B現在，你只需要跨越最後一個障礙了，凡人。聚集一支軍隊，轉至地獄火堡壘深處，在瑪瑟裡頓的巢穴中殺出一條血路，進入中央的密室，殺死那個邪惡的腐蝕者！$B$B完成了這個任務，你就將獲得風暴鑰匙。", Details AC enUS : "Four trials you must pass before you are deemed worthy of the Tempest key.$B$BOnly one obstacle remains, mortal. Gather an army and travel to the lair of Magtheridon, deep inside Hellfire Citadel. Battle your way to the heart of the chamber and destroy the foul corrupter!$B$BDo this and you will be granted the Tempest key." ; Wowhead enUS : "Four trials you must pass before you are deemed worthy of the Tempest key.$b$bOnly one obstacle remains, mortal. Gather an army and travel to the lair of Magtheridon, deep inside Hellfire Citadel. Battle your way to the heart of the chamber and destroy the foul corrupter!$b$bDo this and you will be granted the Tempest key.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Magtheridon slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '纳鲁的试炼：玛瑟里顿', `Objectives` = '沙塔斯城的阿达尔要求你击败玛瑟里顿。', `Details` = '想要证明你自己拥有获得风暴钥匙的资格，你必须首先完成四个试炼。$b$b现在，你只需要跨越最后一个障碍了，凡人。聚集一支军队，前往地狱火堡垒深处，在玛瑟里顿的巢穴中杀出一条血路，进入中央的密室，消灭那个邪恶的腐蚀者！$b$b完成了这个任务，你就将获得风暴钥匙。', `Objectivetext1` = '瑪瑟里頓 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11116;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "抓住野生鹿角兔！", Title AC enUS : "Catch the Wild Wolpertinger!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Catch the Wild Wolpertinger!",  OLD Objectives : "茍達克‧狙獵者要你用鹿角兔捕網幫他抓5隻昏迷的鹿角兔。他提到你必須要戴上模擬醉眼護目鏡才看得到那些鹿角兔。", Objectives AC enUS : "Goldark Snipehunter has asked you to capture 5 Stunned Wolpertingers using the Wolpertinger Net. He mentioned that you must be intoxicated or wearing Synthebrew Goggles to see them." ; Wowhead enUS : "Goldark Snipehunter has asked you to capture 5 Stunned Wolpertingers using the Wolpertinger Net. He mentioned that you must be intoxicated or wearing Synthebrew Goggles to see them.",  OLD Details : "就是現在。你聽到了嗎？從那邊的丘陵傳過來的。那是鹿角兔！被啤酒節氣味吸引過來的野生動物。我一直想抓一些，可惜我撞傷了小腿，跑不過那些兔崽子。但是你可以幫我！$b$b帶著這個網子然後用它抓住那些小傢伙。帶五隻回來給我，我會給你很不錯的報酬！還有一件事 - 你得戴上模擬醉眼護目鏡才能看到牠們，如果你需要一副的話跟我說一聲。", Details AC enUS : "Here now. Ye hear that? There be sounds in them hills. Those're the wolpertingers! Wily beasts, they are, attracted by the smells o' Brewfest. I've a mind to catch me some, but I knocked me shin and can't outrun the buggers. Ye can help me, though!$b$bTake this net and cast it over the little blighters. Bring me a good five of 'em and I'll make it worth yer while! One more thing - ye gotta see through the eyes of a drunk to spot 'em! Load up on the booze or ask me fer some Synthebrew Goggles!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Here now. Ye hear that? There be sounds in them hills. Those're the wolpertingers! Wily beasts, they are, attracted by the smells o' Brewfest. I've a mind to catch me some, but I knocked me shin and can't outrun the buggers. Ye can help me, though!$b$bTake this net and cast it over the little blighters. Bring me a good five of 'em and I'll make it worth yer while! One more thing - ye gotta see through the eyes of a drunk to spot 'em! Load up on the booze or ask me fer some Synthebrew Goggles!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '抓住野生鹿角兔!', `Objectives` = '茍達克·狙獵者要你用鹿角兔捕網幫他抓5隻昏迷的鹿角兔。他提到你必須要喝醉或戴上模擬醉眼護目鏡才看得到那些鹿角兔。', `Details` = '就是現在。你聽到了嗎?從那邊的丘陵傳過來的。那是鹿角兔!被啤酒節氣味吸引過來的野生動物。我一直想抓一些，可惜我撞傷了小腿，跑不過那些兔崽子。但是你可以幫我!$b$b帶著這個網子然後用它抓住那些小傢伙。帶五隻回來給我，我會給你很不錯的報酬!還有一件事 - 你得喝到醉眼惺忪才能看到牠們!大杯乾下去或者跟我要一副模擬醉眼護目鏡!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11117;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "前往暴風城、達納蘇斯還有艾克索達外頭的啤酒廣場，在那些地方宰掉三頭伊萊克，然後回去找茍達克‧狙獵者。你一定要戴上模擬醉眼護目鏡才看得見那些粉紅伊萊克。", Objectives AC enUS : "Visit the beer gardens outside of Stormwind, Darnassus, and the Exodar, zap three elekks at each location, and return to Goldark Snipehunter. You must be drunk or wearing Synthebrew Goggles to see the pink elekks." ; Wowhead enUS : "$b",  OLD Details : "在啤酒節時喝醉是個長久以來的優良傳統 - 是天殺的必要！問題是，我接到從艾澤拉斯各地的報告都指出，我們的慶典被幻象所騷擾！我們可不能容許這種事！$b$b這些伊萊克不能被一般武器所傷害 - 武器會直接穿過牠們 - 所以帶著這個驚人的地精裝置前往其他的啤酒廣場，讓牠們灰飛湮滅。$b$b要記得，你一定要戴上模擬醉眼護目鏡才能看到牠們！如果你需要一副的話跟我說一聲。", Details AC enUS : "Getting drunk is a time-honored tradition at Brewfest -- it's damn near required! Thing is, I'm getting reports across Azeroth saying the celebration's plagued by hallucinations!  We can't have that!$b$bThese elekks can't be harmed by normal weapons -- they pass right through 'em -- so take this fabulous piece of gnomish machinery, visit the other beer gardens, and zap 'em to oblivion. Remember, you have to be drunk or wearing Synthebrew Goggles to see 'em! Talk to me if you need a pair." ; Wowhead enUS : "Getting drunk is a time-honored tradition at Brewfest -- it's damn near required! Thing is, I'm getting reports across Azeroth saying the celebration's plagued by hallucinations! We can't have that!$b$bThese elekks can't be harmed by normal weapons -- they pass right through 'em -- so take this fabulous piece of gnomish machinery, visit the other beer gardens, and zap 'em to oblivion. Remember, you have to be drunk or wearing Synthebrew Goggles to see 'em! Talk to me if you need a pair."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '前往暴風城、達納蘇斯還有艾克索達外頭的啤酒廣場，在那些地方宰掉三頭伊萊克，然後回去找茍達克·狙獵者。你一定要喝醉或戴上模擬醉眼護目鏡才看得見那些粉紅伊萊克。', `Details` = '在啤酒節時喝醉是個長久以來的優良傳統 -- 是天殺的必要!問題是，我接到從艾澤拉斯各地的報告都指出，我們的慶典被幻像所騷擾!我們可不能容許這種事!$b$b這些伊萊克不能被一般武器所傷害 -- 武器會直接穿過牠們 -- 所以帶著這個驚人的地精裝置前往其他的啤酒廣場，讓牠們灰飛湮滅。要記得，你一定要喝醉或戴上模擬醉眼護目鏡才能看到牠們!如果你需要一副的話跟我說一聲。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11118;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "造訪銀月城、雷霆崖還有幽暗城外的啤酒廣場，在每個地方各宰掉$1oa頭粉紅伊萊克，然後回去找葛洛‧獵狙者。你得戴上模擬醉眼護目鏡才看得見那些粉紅伊萊克。", Objectives AC enUS : "Visit the beer gardens outside of Silvermoon, Thunder Bluff, and the Undercity, zap three elekks at each location, and return to Glodrak Huntsniper. You must be drunk or wearing the Synthebrew Goggles to see the pink elekks." ; Wowhead enUS : "$b",  OLD Details : "啤酒節是個行之有年的食物與飲品的慶典。但有時候人們會不勝酒力！飲酒過量可能會產生副作用…我們接獲通報，有許多人看見了幻象。 ⏎  ⏎ 大夥們一直說他們看到了粉紅伊萊克，我需要你去把伊萊克給處理掉。帶著這把哥布林工程師的光線槍前往其他的啤酒廣場，把伊萊克給宰了。為了保護你自身的安全，我建議你戴上模擬醉眼護目鏡，這樣子就可以看到你的目標，同時又保有理智了。", Details AC enUS : "Look. We're running a business here. People being drunk? It's good business. But I'll tell ya one thing that puts a cramp in the profits - hallucinations. Wouldn't ya know it, the boys are reporting that the sot- er, the loyal customers are seeing pink elekks everywhere.$b$bI don't need my customers unsettled. Look, take this ray and travel to the other beer gardens to take care of 'em for me, would ya? And be sure to get drunk or wear Synthebrew Goggles! Talk to me if ya need a pair." ; Wowhead enUS : "Look. We're running a business here. People being drunk? It's good business. But I'll tell ya one thing that puts a cramp in the profits - hallucinations. Wouldn't ya know it, the boys are reporting that the sot- er, the loyal customers are seeing pink elekks everywhere.$b$bI don't need my customers unsettled. Look, take this ray and travel to the other beer gardens to take care of 'em for me, would ya? And be sure to get drunk or wear Synthebrew Goggles! Talk to me if ya need a pair."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '造訪銀月城、雷霆崖還有幽暗城外的啤酒廣場，在每個地方各宰掉三隻伊萊克，然後回去找葛羅卓克·獵狙者。你一定要喝醉才看得見那些粉紅伊萊克。', `Details` = '聽著，我們正在此地做點生意。人們都喝醉啦?這是筆好生意，但我得告訴你有件事情在限制我們的利潤 - 那些幻覺。你不知道那個嗎?那些孩子向我報告說，我忠實的老主顧們正在四處尋找粉紅伊萊克。$b$b我可不希望我的老主顧心神不寧。聽好，帶著這隻鰭刺去其他的啤酒廣場，並且替我好好照顧牠，行嗎?記得一定要喝醉啊!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11120;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "莫高雷地區血蹄村的亞哈伯‧麥蹄希望你幫忙餵餵他寶貝的狗狗，狂亂的凱爾。$B$B餵凱爾吃嫩陸行鳥肉，然後回去找亞哈伯‧麥蹄。", Objectives AC enUS : "Ahab Wheathoof at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore wants you to feed his prized puppy, Kyle the Frenzied.$B$BFeed Kyle Tender Strider Meat and return to Ahab Wheathoof." ; Wowhead enUS : "Ahab Wheathoof at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore wants you to feed his prized puppy, Kyle the Frenzied.$b$bFeed Kyle Tender Strider Meat and return to Ahab Wheathoof.",  OLD Details : "幫幫我，$n！我最寶貝的寵物，凱爾跑丟了！我只知道牠平常會在血蹄村附近亂跑，牠現在一定是迷了路又餓著肚子。$B$B你願意幫我找到牠並且餵牠嗎？只要牠吃飽了，牠就會安靜下來並且回家來。$B$B你需要去找食物來餵牠。牠最喜歡的就是嫩陸行鳥肉了，在東邊有不少陸行鳥。你只需要獵殺一隻陸行鳥，並且拿牠那多汁的肉給凱爾。你要是看見凱爾在村子裡，將肉放在地上，牠一定會過來找你的。", Details AC enUS : "Help, $N! My prized puppy, Kyle, has run away! I just know he's running around Bloodhoof Village, lost and hungry.$B$BWill you find him and feed him? Once he eats he will settle down and come home.$B$BTo feed him you will need to find food. His favorite meal is tender strider meat. Just venture east and you should find plenty of striders. Hunt one down and take its succulent meat to Kyle. When you see Kyle in town, put the meat down and he is sure to come to you." ; Wowhead enUS : "Help, $n! My prized puppy, Kyle, has run away! I just know he's running around Bloodhoof Village, lost and hungry.$b$bWill you find him and feed him? Once he eats he will settle down and come home.$b$bTo feed him you will need to find food. His favorite meal is tender strider meat. Just venture east and you should find plenty of striders. Hunt one down and take its succulent meat to Kyle. When you see Kyle in town, put the meat down and he is sure to come to you.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "餵飽凱爾", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Kyle Fed"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '莫高雷-血蹄村的亞哈伯·麥蹄希望你幫忙找他珍貴的寵物，狂怒的凱爾。$b$b餵凱爾吃嫩陸行鳥肉，然後回去找亞哈伯·麥蹄。', `Details` = '幫幫我，$n! 我最寶貝的寵物，凱爾跑不見了!我只知道牠平常會在血蹄村附近亂跑，牠現在一定是迷了路又餓著肚子。$b$b你願意幫我找到牠並且餵牠嗎?只要牠吃飽了，牠就會安靜下來並且回家來。$b$b你需要去找食物來餵牠。牠最喜歡的就是嫩陸行鳥肉了，你只需要獵一隻並且拿那些多汁的肉給凱爾。你要是看見凱爾在村子裡，牠一定會過來找你的。', `Objectivetext1` = '凱爾被餵飽了', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11129;
