-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我們得向大家宣傳麥酒家族參加了啤酒節。你得到銀行外面、軍事區、探險者大廳以及秘法區的旗幟下大聲叫喊。不過我會讓事情簡單點，我會借你一頭競速山羊，為時4分鐘。用韁繩驅趕山羊奔跑，不過別讓牠累過頭。", Details AC enUS : "We need to get the word out about the Barleybrews at Brewfest.  You need to shout at the flags outside the bank, in the Military Ward, in the Hall of Explorers and in the Mystic Ward.  I'll make things easy though, I'll lend you some racing ram reins and a racing ram for 4 minutes.  Use the reins to let him go, but try not to tire him out." ; Wowhead enUS : "We need to get the word out about the Barleybrews at Brewfest. You need to shout at the flags outside the bank, in the Military Ward, in the Hall of Explorers and in the Mystic Ward. I'll make things easy though, I'll lend you some racing ram reins and a racing ram for 4 minutes. Use the reins to let him go, but try not to tire him out."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我們需要讓大家知道有關麥酒家族在啤酒節的事。你得到銀行外、軍事區、探險者大廳以及秘法區外的旗幟下大聲叫喊。不過我會讓事情簡單點，我會借你競速山羊韁繩和一隻競速山羊4分鐘。用馬鞭驅趕山羊奔跑，不過試著別讓牠累過頭。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11293;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "是時候讓人們知道雷酒聽見了他們對於好啤酒的渴求。你得到銀行外、軍事區、探險者大廳以及秘法區的旗幟下大聲叫喊。$b$b不過我會讓事情簡單點，我會借你一頭山羊，為時4分鐘。$b$b跑太快的時候要小心，你在鐵爐堡可找不到蘋果...我們可不想幫到麥酒的使者。", Details AC enUS : "It's time to let people know that the Thunderbrew have heard their cries for good brew.  You need to shout at the flags outside the bank, in the Military Ward, in the Hall of Explorers and in the Mystic Ward.$b$bWe'll make it easy though.  We'll lend you a ram AND some reins for 4 minutes.$b$bBe careful with going too fast though since you won't find any apple crates in Ironforge...  We can't take the chance of helping out the Barleybrew messengers." ; Wowhead enUS : "It's time to let people know that the Thunderbrew have heard their cries for good brew. You need to shout at the flags outside the bank, in the Military Ward, in the Hall of Explorers and in the Mystic Ward.$b$bWe'll make it easy though. We'll lend you a ram AND some reins for 4 minutes.$b$bBe careful with going too fast though since you won't find any apple crates in Ironforge... We can't take the chance of helping out the Barleybrew messengers."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '是時候讓人們知道雷酒聽見了他們對於好啤酒的渴求。你得到銀行外、軍事區、探險者大廳以及秘法區外的旗幟下大聲叫喊。$b$b不過我會讓事情簡單點，我會借一隻山羊和一些馬鞭給你4分鐘。$b$b跑太快的時候要小心，你在鐵爐堡可找不到蘋果......我們可不想幫到麥酒的使者。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11294;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "現在就是山羊競速...差不多。", Title AC enUS : "Now This is Ram Racing... Almost." ; Wowhead enUS : "Now This is Ram Racing... Almost.",  OLD Details : "你想要去看看競速山羊啊？但願你已經準備好面對極速挑戰了。在我放你到處跑之前，你得先向我展示你懂得駕馭這些優秀的生物。$b$b條件如下：我會借給你競速韁繩和一頭山羊。你得向我證明你能夠駕馭這些山羊。$b$b讓山羊保持在快步、慢跑與奔跑狀態各8秒鐘。如果你需要駕馭山羊的教學，就去找我的學徒保爾‧凍石聊聊。", Details AC enUS : "So you want to check out the racing rams?  Well I hope you're ready for speed.  BUT before I let you loose in the world, you'll need to show me that you can handle these fine creatures.$b$bSo here's the deal:  I'll lend you some racing reins and the use of a ram. You need to prove to me that you can handle using these rams.$b$bKeep the ram at a trot, canter and gallop for 8 seconds each.  If you need instructions how to handle the ram, talk to my apprentice, Pol Amberstill." ; Wowhead enUS : "So you want to check out the racing rams? Well I hope you're ready for speed. BUT before I let you loose in the world, you'll need to show me that you can handle these fine creatures.$b$bSo here's the deal: I'll lend you some racing reins and the use of a ram. You need to prove to me that you can handle using these rams.$b$bKeep the ram at a trot, canter and gallop for 8 seconds each. If you need instructions how to handle the ram, talk to my apprentice, Pol Amberstill."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '現在就是山羊競速…差不多。', `Details` = '所以你想瞧瞧競速山羊?希望你已經準備好面對極速挑戰了。『但是』在我讓你出發之前，你得向我證明你知道該如何操控這些良好的生物。$b$b條件如下:我會借給你一些競速韁繩還有一頭山羊。你得向我證明你會操縱這些山羊。$b$b讓山羊在疾馳、快步和慢跑的狀態下各維持8秒。假如你想知道如何駕馭這些山羊，去找我的學徒保爾·安伯斯堤爾吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11318;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在暴風之眼的戰場中獲勝，然後向任何一座聯盟主城、冬握湖、達拉然或撒塔斯的聯盟准將回報。", Objectives AC enUS : "Win an Eye of the Storm battleground match and return to an Alliance Brigadier General at any Alliance capital city, Wintergrasp, Dalaran, or Shattrath." ; Wowhead enUS : "Win an Eye of the Storm battleground match and return to an Alliance Brigadier General at any Alliance capital city, Wintergrasp, Dalaran, or Shattrath.",  OLD Details : "和部落的鬥爭沒有邊界，$n。既使在外域，領土的糾紛與古老的仇恨依舊可以挑起戰爭的烽火。$B$B前往暴風之眼吧，確保聯盟將會像在艾澤拉斯一樣地獲勝。", Details AC enUS : "The fight against the Horde knows no boundaries, $N.  Even in Outland, territorial disputes and old hatreds are enough to tip the scales in favor of war.$B$BGo into the Eye of the Storm and make sure the Alliance prevails in Outland just like it has in Azeroth." ; Wowhead enUS : "The fight against the Horde knows no boundaries, $n. Even in Outland, territorial disputes and old hatreds are enough to tip the scales in favor of war.$b$bGo into the Eye of the Storm and make sure the Alliance prevails in Outland just like it has in Azeroth."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '在暴風之眼的戰場中獲勝，然後向任何一座首都或撒塔斯的聯盟准將回報。', `Details` = '和部落的鬥爭沒有邊界，$n。既使在外域，領土的糾紛與古老的仇恨依舊可以挑起戰爭的烽火。$b$b前往暴風之眼吧，確保聯盟將會像在艾澤拉斯一樣地獲勝。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11337;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "戰鬥的召喚：風暴之眼", Title AC enUS : "Call to Arms: Eye of the Storm" ; Wowhead enUS : "Call to Arms: Eye of the Storm",  OLD Objectives : "在暴風之眼的戰場中獲勝，然後向任何一座部落主城、冬握湖、達拉然或撒塔斯的部落戰爭使者回報。", Objectives AC enUS : "Win an Eye of the Storm battleground match and return to a Horde Warbringer at any Horde capital city, Wintergrasp, Dalaran,  or Shattrath." ; Wowhead enUS : "Win an Eye of the Storm battleground match and return to a Horde Warbringer at any Horde capital city, Wintergrasp, Dalaran,  or Shattrath.",  OLD Details : "我們將會戰鬥並擊敗我們在各處發現的敵人。艾澤拉斯，外域，各地都一樣。$B$B我們不允許聯盟在暴風之眼中佔有優勢。今天就去對他們開戰...明天可能就太遲了!", Details AC enUS : "We will fight and crush the enemy wherever we find them.  Azeroth, Outland, the place makes no difference.$B$BWe cannot allow the Alliance to establish superiority in the Eye of the Storm.  Take the battle to them today... tomorrow it might be too late!" ; Wowhead enUS : "We will fight and crush the enemy wherever we find them. Azeroth, Outland, the place makes no difference.$b$bWe cannot allow the Alliance to establish superiority in the Eye of the Storm. Take the battle to them today... tomorrow it might be too late!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '戰鬥的號角:暴風之眼', `Objectives` = '在暴風之眼的戰場中獲勝，然後向任何一座首都或撒塔斯的部落戰爭使者回報。', `Details` = '我們將會戰鬥並擊敗我們在各處發現的敵人。艾澤拉斯，外域，各地都一樣。$b$b我們不允許聯盟在暴風之眼中佔有優勢。今天就去對他們開戰...明天可能就太遲了!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11341;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "懸賞：奎克米瑞之心", Title AC enUS : "Wanted: The Heart of Quagmirran" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: The Heart of Quagmirran",  OLD Objectives : "風之貿易者札令姆要你取得奎克米瑞之心。將這顆心帶回撒塔斯陰鬱城交給他以領取賞金。$B$B這個任務只能在英雄難度中完成。", Objectives AC enUS : "Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain The Heart of Quagmirran. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.$B$BThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty." ; Wowhead enUS : "Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain The Heart of Quagmirran. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.$b$bThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",  OLD Details : "我有個不尋常的任務。我接觸到一個來自異世界的有錢人，對於恐怖的東西特別有興趣。$B$B她尤其想要奎克米瑞之心。$B$B我聽說那個怪物有三顆心臟，不過一顆就足夠滿足我們的需求。據我所知，你可以在奴隸監獄的深水池中找到奎克米瑞。", Details AC enUS : "I have an unusual request. A certain wealthy individual that I am in contact with off-world is interested in a macabre piece.$B$BSpecifically, she wants the heart of Quagmirran.$B$BI hear that the beast has three, but one will suffice for our purposes. As I understand it, you can find Quagmirran resting within a deep pool of water at the Slave Pens." ; Wowhead enUS : "I have an unusual request. A certain wealthy individual that I am in contact with off-world is interested in a macabre piece.$b$bSpecifically, she wants the heart of Quagmirran.$b$bI hear that the beast has three, but one will suffice for our purposes. As I understand it, you can find Quagmirran resting within a deep pool of water at the Slave Pens."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '懸賞:奎克米瑞之心', `Objectives` = '風之貿易者札令姆要你取得奎克米瑞之心。將這顆心帶回撒塔斯陰鬱城交給他以領取賞金。$b$b這個任務只能在英雄難度下完成。', `Details` = '我有個不尋常的任務。我接觸到一個來自異世界的有錢人，對於恐怖的東西特別有興趣。$b$b她尤其想要奎克米瑞之心。$b$b我聽說那個怪物有三顆心臟，不過一顆就足夠滿足我們的需求。據我所知，你可以在奴隸監獄的深水池中找到奎克米瑞。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11368;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "懸賞：督軍的論述", Title AC enUS : "Wanted: The Warlord's Treatise" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: The Warlord's Treatise",  OLD Objectives : "風之貿易者札令姆要你取得督軍的論述。將東西帶回撒塔斯陰鬱城交給他以領取賞金。$B$B這個任務只能在英雄難度中完成。", Objectives AC enUS : "Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to acquire The Warlord's Treatise. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.$B$BThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty." ; Wowhead enUS : "Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to acquire The Warlord's Treatise. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.$b$bThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",  OLD Details : "很多人都知道納迦族中的督軍卡利斯瑞是個強大的戰士，卻很少人知道他把他的知識全都記錄下來。$B$B我有位顧客得知了此事，有很高的興趣想把論述拿到手。$B$B我想拜託你去盤牙蓄湖的蒸汽洞窟把那本書拿來給我。", Details AC enUS : "While it is known that Warlord Kalithresh of the naga is a great warrior in his own right, there are fewer who know that he has codified all of his knowledge.$B$BOne of my customers is aware of it though, and is keenly interested in obtaining his treatise.$B$BI ask that you travel to the Steamvault in Coilfang Reservoir and obtain this book for me." ; Wowhead enUS : "While it is known that Warlord Kalithresh of the naga is a great warrior in his own right, there are fewer who know that he has codified all of his knowledge.$b$bOne of my customers is aware of it though, and is keenly interested in obtaining his treatise.$b$bI ask that you travel to the Steamvault in Coilfang Reservoir and obtain this book for me."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '懸賞:督軍的論述', `Objectives` = '風之貿易者札令姆要你取得督軍的論述。將東西帶回撒塔斯陰鬱城交給他以領取賞金。$b$b這個任務只能在英雄難度下完成。', `Details` = '很多人都知道納迦族中的督軍卡利斯瑞是個強大的戰士，卻很少人知道他把他的知識全都記錄下來。$b$b我有位顧客得知了此事，有很高的興趣想把論述拿到手。$b$b我想拜託你去盤牙蓄湖的蒸汽洞窟把那本書拿來給我。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11370;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "懸賞：盤牙部屬", Title AC enUS : "Wanted: Coilfang Myrmidons" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: Coilfang Myrmidons",  OLD Objectives : "虛空巡者瑪頓恩要你殺死14名盤牙部屬。完成之後回到撒塔斯陰鬱城找他領取賞金。", Objectives AC enUS : "Nether-Stalker Mah'duun has asked you to slay 14 Coilfang Myrmidons. Return to him in Shattrath's Lower City once they all lie dead in order to collect the bounty." ; Wowhead enUS : "Nether-Stalker Mah'duun has asked you to slay 14 Coilfang Myrmidons. Return to him in Shattrath's Lower City once they all lie dead in order to collect the bounty.",  OLD Details : "瑪頓恩聆聽並且遵從，我現在希望你協助我。$B$B現在這是我的職責了，盤牙部族的部屬必須被毀滅。去那些陰暗潮濕的角落尋找他們，就在盤牙蓄湖的蒸汽洞窟中。$B$B我只接受他們終極的滅絕。", Details AC enUS : "Mah'duun hears and obeys, and I now ask you to be my instrument.$B$BIt has been related to me that the myrmidons of the coilfang tribe must be destroyed. Seek them out within the humid confines of the Steamvault underneath Coilfang Reservoir.$B$BI will accept nothing less than their utter annihilation." ; Wowhead enUS : "Mah'duun hears and obeys, and I now ask you to be my instrument.$b$bIt has been related to me that the myrmidons of the coilfang tribe must be destroyed. Seek them out within the humid confines of the Steamvault underneath Coilfang Reservoir.$b$bI will accept nothing less than their utter annihilation.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Coilfang Myrmidon slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '懸賞:盤牙侍從', `Objectives` = '虛空行者瑪頓恩要你殺死14名盤牙侍從。完成之後回到撒塔斯陰鬱城找他領取賞金。', `Details` = '瑪頓恩聆聽並且遵從，我現在希望你協助我。$b$b現在這是我的職責了，盤牙部族的侍從必須被毀滅。去那些陰暗潮濕的角落尋找他們，就在盤牙蓄湖的蒸汽洞窟中。$b$b我只接受他們終極的滅絕。', `Objectivetext1` = '盤牙侍從 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11371;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "懸賞：伊奇斯的冠羽", Title AC enUS : "Wanted: The Headfeathers of Ikiss" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: The Headfeathers of Ikiss",  OLD Objectives : "風之貿易者札令姆要你取得伊奇斯的冠羽。將東西帶回撒塔斯陰鬱城交給他以領取賞金。$B$B這個任務只能在英雄難度中完成。", Objectives AC enUS : "Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to acquire The Headfeathers of Ikiss. Deliver them to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.$B$BThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty." ; Wowhead enUS : "Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to acquire The Headfeathers of Ikiss. Deliver them to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.$b$bThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",  OLD Details : "最近有個牛頭人跟我接頭，她的丈夫最近獲選成為酋長。她想替他的頭飾增添一點花樣。$B$B她尤其想拿到卑鄙的鷹王伊奇斯的冠羽。$B$B你要是對我的賞金有興趣的話，可以前去奧齊頓的塞司克大廳。", Details AC enUS : "I've recently been approached by a tauren whose husband is about to be elevated to chieftain. She wishes to make a special addition to his headdress.$B$BSpecifically, she wants to obtain the headfeathers from the dastardly Talon King Ikiss.$B$BIf you are interested in collecting my reward, travel to Auchindoun's Sethekk Halls and find him." ; Wowhead enUS : "I've recently been approached by a tauren whose husband is about to be elevated to chieftain. She wishes to make a special addition to his headdress.$b$bSpecifically, she wants to obtain the headfeathers from the dastardly Talon King Ikiss.$b$bIf you are interested in collecting my reward, travel to Auchindoun's Sethekk Halls and find him."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '懸賞:伊奇斯的冠羽', `Objectives` = '風之貿易者札令姆要你取得伊奇斯的冠羽。將東西帶回撒塔斯陰鬱城交給他以領取賞金。$b$b這個任務只能在英雄難度下完成。', `Details` = '最近有個牛頭人向我接頭，她的丈夫最近獲選成為酋長。她想替他的頭飾增添一點花樣。$b$b她尤其想拿到卑鄙的鷹王伊奇斯的冠羽。$b$b你要是對我的賞金有興趣的話，可以前去奧齊頓的賽司克大廳。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11372;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "懸賞：薩法爾的奇妙護符", Title AC enUS : "Wanted: Shaffar's Wondrous Pendant" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: Shaffar's Wondrous Pendant",  OLD Objectives : "風之貿易者札令姆要你取得薩法爾的奇妙護符。將東西帶回撒塔斯陰鬱城交給他以領取賞金。$B$B這個任務只能在英雄難度中完成。", Objectives AC enUS : "Wind Trader Zhareem wants you to obtain Shaffar's Wondrous Amulet. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.$B$BThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty." ; Wowhead enUS : "Wind Trader Zhareem wants you to obtain Shaffar's Wondrous Amulet. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.$b$bThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",  OLD Details : "今天我有個私人的任務要拜託你，當然酬勞與它的危險度相等。$B$B我的家族和奈薩斯王子薩法爾還有他的手下，很有點『淵源』。要是他佩戴的護符落入我的手中，那就表示他已經被解決了。$B$B如果你對我提供的賞金有興趣的話，你可以前往他在奧齊頓，法力墓地的老巢。", Details AC enUS : "Today I have a personal request of you, yet the reward will certainly match the danger.$B$BMy family has a 'history', shall we say, with Nexus-Prince Shaffar and his followers. If the amulet he wears were to fall into my hands then surely that would mean that he had been dealt with.$B$BIf the bounty I am offering is of interest to you then journey to his lair within Auchindoun's Mana-Tombs." ; Wowhead enUS : "Today I have a personal request of you, yet the reward will certainly match the danger.$b$bMy family has a 'history', shall we say, with Nexus-Prince Shaffar and his followers. If the amulet he wears were to fall into my hands then surely that would mean that he had been dealt with.$b$bIf the bounty I am offering is of interest to you then journey to his lair within Auchindoun's Mana-Tombs."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '懸賞:薩法爾的奇妙護符', `Objectives` = '風之貿易者札令姆要你取得薩法爾的奇妙護符。將東西帶回撒塔斯陰鬱城交給他以領取賞金。$b$b這個任務只能在英雄難度下完成。', `Details` = '今天我有個私人的任務要拜託你，當然酬勞與它的危險度相等。$b$b我的家族和奈薩斯王子薩法爾還有他的手下，很有點『淵源』。要是他配戴的護符落入我的手中，那就表示他已經被解決了。$b$b如果你對我提供的賞金有興趣的話，你可以前往他在奧齊頓，法力墓穴的老巢。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11373;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "懸賞：莫爾墨的低語", Title AC enUS : "Wanted: Murmur's Whisper" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: Murmur's Whisper",  OLD Objectives : "風之貿易者札令姆要你取得莫爾墨的低語。把東西帶到撒塔斯陰鬱城交給他好換取賞金。$B$B這個任務只能在英雄難度中完成。", Objectives AC enUS : "Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain Murmur's Whisper. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.$B$BThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty." ; Wowhead enUS : "Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain Murmur's Whisper. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.$b$bThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",  OLD Details : "等我說完，也許你就不會接下這個任務了。$B$B我有個古怪的客人專門在研究死去的存在。謠傳說現在被稱為莫爾墨的東西摧毀了那個他原先存在的世界。教授對他的「低語」很感興趣，想知道莫爾墨是如何完成這項任務。$B$B你願意前往奧齊頓的暗影迷宮，把那個東西帶來給我嗎?", Details AC enUS : "When I'm done speaking, you may not want to take this commission.$B$BI have an eccentric client who specializes in the study of dead realities. It is rumored that the being known as Murmur destroyed the last world from which he was summoned. The professor is interested in examining his 'whisper' as he called it to understand how it is that Murmur accomplished such a feat.$B$BWill you journey to the Shadow Labyrinth within Auchindoun and retrieve it for me?" ; Wowhead enUS : "When I'm done speaking, you may not want to take this commission.$b$bI have an eccentric client who specializes in the study of dead realities. It is rumored that the being known as Murmur destroyed the last world from which he was summoned. The professor is interested in examining his 'whisper' as he called it to understand how it is that Murmur accomplished such a feat.$b$bWill you journey to the Shadow Labyrinth within Auchindoun and retrieve it for me?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '懸賞:莫爾墨的低語', `Objectives` = '風之貿易者札令姆要你取得莫爾墨的低語。把東西帶到撒塔斯陰鬱城交給他好換取賞金。$b$b這個任務只能在英雄難度下完成。', `Details` = '等我說完，也許你就不會接下這個任務了。$b$b我有個古怪的客人專門在研究死去的存在。謠傳說現在被稱為莫爾墨的東西摧毀了那個他原先存在的世界。教授對他的「低語」很感興趣，想知道莫爾墨是如何完成這項任務。$b$b你願意前往奧齊頓的暗影迷宮，把那個東西帶來給我嗎?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11375;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "懸賞：惡毒導師", Title AC enUS : "Wanted: Malicious Instructors" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: Malicious Instructors",  OLD Objectives : "虛空巡者瑪頓恩要你殺死3名惡毒導師。完成之後回到撒塔斯陰鬱城找他領取賞金。", Objectives AC enUS : "Nether-Stalker Mah'duun wants you to kill 3 Malicious Instructors. Return to him in Shattrath's Lower City once they all lie dead in order to collect the bounty." ; Wowhead enUS : "Nether-Stalker Mah'duun wants you to kill 3 Malicious Instructors. Return to him in Shattrath's Lower City once they all lie dead in order to collect the bounty.",  OLD Details : "瑪頓恩聽說沒有人比暗影迷宮中的六臂女惡魔更殘酷了。$B$B前往奧齊頓吧，那這些惡魔給揪出來，全部殺光。$B$B如果這麼簡單的任務你都無法達成，那我們彼此也沒什麼話好說了。", Details AC enUS : "Mah'duun has heard it said that none are as cruel as the six-armed demonesses inside the Shadow Labyrinth.$B$BGo to Auchindoun, seek them out, kill them all.$B$BIf you cannot accomplish so simple a task, we do not have anything further to say to one another." ; Wowhead enUS : "Mah'duun has heard it said that none are as cruel as the six-armed demonesses inside the Shadow Labyrinth.$b$bGo to Auchindoun, seek them out, kill them all.$b$bIf you cannot accomplish so simple a task, we do not have anything further to say to one another.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Malicious Instructor slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '懸賞:惡毒導師', `Objectives` = '虛空行者瑪頓恩要你殺死3名惡毒導師。完成之後回到撒塔斯陰鬱城找他領取賞金。', `Details` = '瑪頓恩聽說沒有人比暗影迷宮中的六臂女惡魔更殘酷了。$b$b前往奧齊頓吧，那這些惡魔給揪出來，全部殺光。$b$b如果這麼簡單的任務你都無法達成，那我們彼此也沒什麼話好說了。', `Objectivetext1` = '惡毒導師 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11376;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "懸賞：扭曲分裂者的剪枝", Title AC enUS : "Wanted: A Warp Splinter Clipping" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: A Warp Splinter Clipping",  OLD Objectives : "風之貿易者札令姆要你取得扭曲分裂者的剪枝。帶到撒塔斯的陰鬱城交給他以換取賞金。$B$B這個任務只能在英雄難度中完成。", Objectives AC enUS : "Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain a Warp Splinter Clipping. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.$B$BThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty." ; Wowhead enUS : "Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain a Warp Splinter Clipping. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.$b$bThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",  OLD Details : "不久之前，一個卡多雷的女德魯伊交給我一項任務。當然，還有不少的金幣!$B$B顯然達納蘇斯方面希望能夠讓一個名為扭曲分裂者的秘法古樹復原。那棵巨樹現在陷入了恍惚或是腐化中，我不是很確定，但你可以在風暴要塞的波塔尼卡深處找到它。$B$B她說他們只需要一小段剪枝來讓它重新生長。", Details AC enUS : "Not long ago, I was approached by a kaldorei druidess with a touching request. And plenty of gold, of course!$B$BIt would appear that the forces of Darnassus wish to restore an ancient of the arcane known as Warp Splinter. The giant tree has been confused or corrupted, I'm not certain, but you'll find it inside of the Botanica at Tempest Keep.$B$BShe said that all they would need to regrow him was a small clipping." ; Wowhead enUS : "Not long ago, I was approached by a kaldorei druidess with a touching request. And plenty of gold, of course!$b$bIt would appear that the forces of Darnassus wish to restore an ancient of the arcane known as Warp Splinter. The giant tree has been confused or corrupted, I'm not certain, but you'll find it inside of the Botanica at Tempest Keep.$b$bShe said that all they would need to regrow him was a small clipping."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '懸賞:扭曲分裂者的剪枝', `Objectives` = '風之貿易者札令姆要你取得扭曲分裂者的剪枝。帶到撒塔斯的陰鬱城交給他以換取賞金。$b$b這個任務只能在英雄難度下完成。', `Details` = '不久之前，一個卡多雷的女德魯伊交給我一項任務。當然，還有不少的金幣!$b$b顯然達納蘇斯方面希望能夠讓一個名為扭曲分裂者的秘法古樹復原。那棵巨樹現在陷入了恍惚或是腐化中，我不是很確定，但你可以在風暴要塞的波塔尼卡深處找到它。$b$b她說他們只需要一小段剪枝來讓它重新生長。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11384;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "懸賞：尋日導魔師", Title AC enUS : "Wanted: Sunseeker Channelers" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: Sunseeker Channelers",  OLD Objectives : "虛空巡者瑪頓恩要你殺死6名尋日導魔師。完成之後回到撒塔斯陰鬱城找他領取賞金。", Objectives AC enUS : "Nether-Stalker Mah'duun wants you to kill 6 Sunseeker Channelers. Return to him in Shattrath's Lower City once they all lie dead in order to collect the bounty." ; Wowhead enUS : "Nether-Stalker Mah'duun wants you to kill 6 Sunseeker Channelers. Return to him in Shattrath's Lower City once they all lie dead in order to collect the bounty.",  OLD Details : "風又再對瑪頓恩低語，隸屬於尋日者的導魔師今天就得被殺死。$B$B你可以在風暴要塞的波塔尼卡中找到他們。$B$B你想要賞金的話，就殺死那些導魔師。", Details AC enUS : "It has been whispered to Mah'duun that the channelers of the military unit known as the Sunseekers must be killed today.$B$BThey are to be found within the Botanica at Tempest Keep.$B$BYou want the bounty, you kill the channelers." ; Wowhead enUS : "It has been whispered to Mah'duun that the channelers of the military unit known as the Sunseekers must be killed today.$b$bThey are to be found within the Botanica at Tempest Keep.$b$bYou want the bounty, you kill the channelers.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Sunseeker Channeler slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '懸賞:尋日導魔師', `Objectives` = '虛空行者瑪頓恩要你殺死6名尋日導魔師。完成之後回到撒塔斯陰鬱城找他領取賞金。', `Details` = '風又再對瑪頓恩低語，隸屬於尋日者的導魔師今天就得被殺死。$b$b你可以在風暴要塞的波塔尼卡中找到他們。$b$b你想要賞金的話，就殺死那些導魔師。', `Objectivetext1` = '尋日導魔師 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11385;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "懸賞：帕薩里歐的投映器", Title AC enUS : "Wanted: Pathaleon's Projector" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: Pathaleon's Projector",  OLD Objectives : "風之貿易者札令姆要你取得帕薩里歐的投映器。帶到撒塔斯的陰鬱城交給他以換取賞金。$B$B這個任務只能在英雄難度中完成。", Objectives AC enUS : "Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to acquire Pathaleon's Projector. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.$B$BThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty." ; Wowhead enUS : "Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to acquire Pathaleon's Projector. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.$b$bThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",  OLD Details : "我一直以為操縱者帕薩里歐使用魔法將他的影像在外域各處投射。很顯然我錯了。$B$B我最近的一個客人告訴我，血精靈使用一種特殊的機械裝置來和凱爾薩斯王子的投影溝通。就我所知，他們是從虛空風暴的薩希斯反叛者那邊取得的。$B$B我的客戶想要那個投映器。你何不去拜訪一下帕薩里歐?他就在風暴要塞的麥克納爾。", Details AC enUS : "I always assumed that Pathaleon the Calculator used magic to project his image across Outland. Apparently I was wrong.$B$BMy latest customer tells me that the blood elf uses a mechanical device for his communication with the leaders of Prince Kael'thas's special projects. As I understand it, he acquired it from the Zaxxis rebels in the Netherstorm.$B$BMy client wishes to obtain the projector. Why don't you pay Pathaleon a visit? He can be found within the Mechanar at Tempest Keep." ; Wowhead enUS : "I always assumed that Pathaleon the Calculator used magic to project his image across Outland. Apparently I was wrong.$b$bMy latest customer tells me that the blood elf uses a mechanical device for his communication with the leaders of Prince Kael'thas's special projects. As I understand it, he acquired it from the Zaxxis rebels in the Netherstorm.$b$bMy client wishes to obtain the projector. Why don't you pay Pathaleon a visit? He can be found within the Mechanar at Tempest Keep."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '懸賞:帕薩里歐的投映器', `Objectives` = '風之貿易者札令姆要你取得帕薩里歐的投映器。帶到撒塔斯的陰鬱城交給他以換取賞金。$b$b這個任務只能在英雄難度下完成。', `Details` = '我一直以為操縱者帕薩里歐使用魔法將他的影像在外域各處投射。很顯然我錯了。$b$b我最近的一個客人告訴我，血精靈使用一種特殊的機械裝置來和凱爾薩斯王子的投影溝通。就我所知，他們是從虛空風暴的薩希斯反叛者那邊取得的。$b$b我的客戶想要那個投映器。你何不去拜訪一下帕薩里歐?他就在風暴要塞的麥克納爾。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11386;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "懸賞：風暴要塞-熔爐毀滅者", Title AC enUS : "Wanted: Tempest-Forge Destroyers" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: Tempest-Forge Destroyers",  OLD Objectives : "虛空巡者瑪頓恩要你殺死5名風暴要塞-熔爐毀滅者。完成之後回到撒塔斯陰鬱城找他領取賞金。", Objectives AC enUS : "Nether-Stalker Mah'duun wants you to destroy 5 Tempest-Forge Destroyers. Return to him in Shattrath's Lower City once they all lie dead in order to collect the bounty." ; Wowhead enUS : "Nether-Stalker Mah'duun wants you to destroy 5 Tempest-Forge Destroyers. Return to him in Shattrath's Lower City once they all lie dead in order to collect the bounty.",  OLD Details : "有些機械構裝生物在麥克納爾之中，瑪頓恩被告知它們必須被毀掉。$B$B前往風暴要塞，把那些風暴要塞-熔爐毀滅者給毀掉。$B$B然後你可以回來領取你的賞金。", Details AC enUS : "There are mechanical constructs within the Mechanar which Mah'duun has been told must be dismantled.$B$BGo to Tempest Keep, find the tempest-forge destroyers and destroy them.$B$BThen you may return to collect the bounty." ; Wowhead enUS : "There are mechanical constructs within the Mechanar which Mah'duun has been told must be dismantled.$b$bGo to Tempest Keep, find the tempest-forge destroyers and destroy them.$b$bThen you may return to collect the bounty.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Tempest-Forge Destroyer slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '懸賞:風暴要塞-熔爐毀滅者', `Objectives` = '虛空行者瑪頓恩要你殺死5名風暴要塞-熔爐毀滅者。完成之後回到撒塔斯陰鬱城找他領取賞金。', `Details` = '有些機械構裝生物在麥克納爾之中，瑪頓恩被告知它們必須被毀掉。$b$b前往風暴要塞，把那些風暴要塞-熔爐毀滅者給毀掉。$b$b然後你可以回來領取你的賞金。', `Objectivetext1` = '風暴要塞-熔爐毀滅者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11387;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "懸賞：史蓋力司卷軸", Title AC enUS : "Wanted: The Scroll of Skyriss" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: The Scroll of Skyriss",  OLD Objectives : "風之貿易者札令姆要你取得史蓋力司卷軸。帶到撒塔斯的陰鬱城交給他以換取賞金。$B$B這個任務只能在英雄難度中完成。", Objectives AC enUS : "Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain The Scroll of Skyriss. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.$B$BThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty." ; Wowhead enUS : "Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain The Scroll of Skyriss. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.$b$bThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",  OLD Details : "今天的客人想找樣真的很罕見的東西。$B$B傳說先驅者史蓋力司是上古諸神的僕人。還說他有著一個巨大的卷軸記載著他們要如何支配宇宙生命的指示。$B$B目前的這位買家希望$g他:她;能親自摸摸那個卷軸，當然$g他:她;是讀不了上頭的文字的。$B$B到風暴要塞的亞克崔茲，把東西拿來給我，好嗎，$c?", Details AC enUS : "Today's client seeks something truly unique.$B$BIt is said that Harbinger Skyriss is a servant of the Old Gods. It is also said that he carries a large scroll that contains their instructions for his domination of life in the universe on their behalf.$B$BMy current buyer wishes to get $g his : her; hands on that scroll, nevermind that $g he : she; won't be able to read the language upon it.$B$BTravel to Tempest Keep's Arcatraz and get it for me, will you, $c?" ; Wowhead enUS : "Today's client seeks something truly unique.$b$bIt is said that Harbinger Skyriss is a servant of the Old Gods. It is also said that he carries a large scroll that contains their instructions for his domination of life in the universe on their behalf.$b$bMy current buyer wishes to get $ghis:her hands on that scroll, nevermind that $ghe:she won't be able to read the language upon it.$b$bTravel to Tempest Keep's Arcatraz and get it for me, will you, $c?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '懸賞:史蓋力司卷軸', `Objectives` = '風之貿易者札令姆要你取得史蓋力司卷軸。帶到撒塔斯的陰鬱城交給他以換取賞金。$b$b這個任務只能在英雄難度下完成。', `Details` = '今天的客人想找樣真的很罕見的東西。$b$b傳說先驅者史蓋力司是上古諸神的僕人。還說他有著一個巨大的卷軸記載著他們要如何支配宇宙生命的指示。$b$b目前的這位買家希望$g他:她能親自摸摸那個卷軸，當然$g他:她是讀不了上頭的文字的。$b$b到風暴要塞的亞克崔茲，把東西拿來給我，好嗎，$c?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11388;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "懸賞：亞克崔茲哨兵", Title AC enUS : "Wanted: Arcatraz Sentinels" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: Arcatraz Sentinels",  OLD Objectives : "虛空巡者瑪頓恩要你解決5個亞克崔茲哨兵。完成之後回到撒塔斯的陰鬱城找他領取賞金。", Objectives AC enUS : "Nether-Stalker Mah'duun wants you to dismantle 5 Arcatraz Sentinels. Return to him in Shattrath's Lower City once that has been accomplished in order to collect the bounty." ; Wowhead enUS : "Nether-Stalker Mah'duun wants you to dismantle 5 Arcatraz Sentinels. Return to him in Shattrath's Lower City once that has been accomplished in order to collect the bounty.",  OLD Details : "亞克崔茲的哨兵們陷入瘋狂了。裡面的囚犯們行為全都失控了，而其他的守衛會攻擊想幫忙的人。$B$B瑪頓恩聽見了虛空之風中的細語。它說消滅那些哨兵們。$B$B完成這項任務的話，今天的賞金就屬於你的了。", Details AC enUS : "The sentinels within the Arcatraz have gone haywire. The prisoners run rampant and the guards attack those that would help.$B$BMah'duun hears the speaker on the nether winds. The speaker says to destroy the sentinels.$B$BAccomplish this and today's bounty is yours." ; Wowhead enUS : "The sentinels within the Arcatraz have gone haywire. The prisoners run rampant and the guards attack those that would help.$b$bMah'duun hears the speaker on the nether winds. The speaker says to destroy the sentinels.$b$bAccomplish this and today's bounty is yours.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Arcatraz Sentinel slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '懸賞:亞克崔茲哨兵', `Objectives` = '虛空行者瑪頓恩要你解決5個亞克崔茲哨兵。完成之後回到撒塔斯的陰鬱城找他領取賞金。', `Details` = '亞克崔茲的哨兵們陷入瘋狂了。裡面的囚犯們行為全都失控了而其他的守衛會攻擊想幫忙的人。$b$b瑪頓恩聽見了虛空之風中的細語。它說消滅那些哨兵們。$b$b完成這項任務的話，今天的賞金就屬於你的了。', `Objectivetext1` = '亞克崔茲哨兵 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11389;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你想去看看競速山羊啊？矮人們自以為很懂得駕馭這些生物，可是說老實話，他們大部分的時候都醉得一塌糊塗，你覺得騎個山羊還會有多難呢？$b$b在我讓你出發之前，你得向我證明你能駕馭這些透過合法途徑取得的優良動物。$b$b條件如下：我會借給你一頭山羊。你得向我證明你能夠駕馭這些山羊。$b$b讓山羊保持在快步、慢跑與奔跑狀態各8秒鐘。", Details AC enUS : "So you want to check out the racing rams?  The dwarves think they have got a handle on it, but let's be honest, they are drunk most of the time, so how hard can it really be?$b$bNow before I let you strut your stuff, you'll need to show me that you can handle these fine, legally obtained creatures.$b$bSo here's the deal:  I'll lend you some racing reins and the use of a ram. You need to prove to me that you can handle using these rams.$b$bKeep the ram at a trot, canter and gallop for 8 seconds each." ; Wowhead enUS : "So you want to check out the racing rams? The dwarves think they have got a handle on it, but let's be honest, they are drunk most of the time, so how hard can it really be?$b$bNow before I let you strut your stuff, you'll need to show me that you can handle these fine, legally obtained creatures.$b$bSo here's the deal: I'll lend you some racing reins and the use of a ram. You need to prove to me that you can handle using these rams.$b$bKeep the ram at a trot, canter and gallop for 8 seconds each."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '所以你想瞧瞧競速山羊?那些矮人覺得自己會駕馭山羊，但說實話，他們大部分的時候都醉得一塌糊塗，你想這能有多難?$b$b在我讓你出發之前，你得向我證明你能控制這些善良又合法的動物。$b$b條件如下:我會借給你一些競速韁繩還有一頭競速山羊。你得向我證明你會操縱這些山羊。$b$b讓山羊在快步、慢跑和疾馳的狀態下各維持8秒。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11409;
