-- AC datas : OLD Title : "抓住野生鹿角兔！", Title AC enUS : "Catch the Wild Wolpertinger!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Catch the Wild Wolpertinger!",  OLD Objectives : "葛洛‧獵狙者要求你用鹿角兔捕網去抓$1oa隻昏迷的鹿角兔。你得戴上模擬醉眼護目鏡才能看見這些鹿角兔。", Objectives AC enUS : "The "dwarf," Glodrak Huntsniper, has asked you to capture 5 Stunned Wolpertingers using the Wolpertinger Net. He mentioned that you must be intoxicated or wearing Synthebrew Goggles to see them." ; Wowhead enUS : "$b",  OLD Details : "在德拉諾，很多生物都難以獵捕。但是我在艾澤拉斯還從來沒有遇過像野生鹿角兔這樣的生物！ ⏎  ⏎ 這些野獸在一年之中很少出現，但啤酒節的聲音和氣味似乎可以引誘它們現身。如果你四處看看，可能還是會一無所獲…這個時候護目鏡就派上用場啦！ ⏎  ⏎ 活捉五隻這種鹿角兔給我，向我證明你是個夠格的獵人。如果你需要護目鏡的話，我有幾副可以給你用。", Details AC enUS : "Hey there! I'm a crazy dwarf! We dwarves believe when you get enough brew together, invisible creatures show up. In fact they are probably wandering around the Brewfest grounds right now! But you can only see them if you are really drunk.$b$bWe dwarves will come up with any excuse to drink.$b$bI bet you want a reason to drink too... So here it is, bring me 5 of those wolpertingers with this net I got from a really drunk dwarf.$b$bIf you can't see them, get some Synthebrew Goggles from me - almost as good!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Hey there! I'm a crazy dwarf! We dwarves believe when you get enough brew together, invisible creatures show up. In fact they are probably wandering around the Brewfest grounds right now! But you can only see them if you are really drunk.$b$bWe dwarves will come up with any excuse to drink.$b$bI bet you want a reason to drink too... So here it is, bring me 5 of those wolpertingers with this net I got from a really drunk dwarf.$b$bIf you can't see them, get some Synthebrew Goggles from me - almost as good!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '抓住野生鹿角兔!', `Objectives` = '『矮鬼』葛羅卓克·獵狙者要你用鹿角兔補網幫他抓5隻昏迷的鹿角兔。他提到你必須在喝醉的情況下才看得到那些鹿角兔。', `Details` = '你好啊!我是個瘋矮人!我們矮人相信只要你喝夠多啤酒，隱形的生物就會出現。事實上它們可能現在就在啤酒營地附近閒晃!但除非你喝醉不然你是看不見它們的。$b$b我們矮人想得出任何可以喝得爛醉的理由。$b$b我打賭你也想要一個喝酒的理由...所以幫我帶五隻鹿角兔回來，就用這個我從一個爛醉如泥的矮人身上弄來的網子。$b$b要是你看不見它們，那就表示你還不夠醉。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11431;
