UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectivetext1` = '染疫食腐者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11903;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "很顯然這個區域的不穩定已經對本地的生物造成影響。$b$b我對冰川古樹以及他們最近的適應性變化有特殊的興趣。我懷疑他們轉變成為『咒縛』古樹的情況，可能會有著我們目前困境的線索。$b$b為了我的研究，我需要這兩者的樣本。行動要快...", Details AC enUS : "It's become clear that the instability in the region has had an effect on its indigenous creatures.$b$bI've taken a particular interest in the Glacial Ancients and their recent adaptations. I suspect that their transformation into these 'Magic-bound' Ancients may hold clues to our predicament here.$b$bFor my studies, I'll need samples from both. Do hurry...." ; Wowhead enUS : "It's become clear that the instability in the region has had an effect on its indigenous creatures.$b$bI've taken a particular interest in the Glacial Ancients and their recent adaptations. I suspect that their transformation into these 'Magic-bound' Ancients may hold clues to our predicament here.$b$bFor my studies, I'll need samples from both. Do hurry...."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '很顯然這個區域的不穩定已經對本地的生物造成影響。$b$b我對冰川古樹以及他們最近的適應性變化有特殊的興趣。我懷疑他們轉變成為『咒縛』古樹的情況，可能會有著我們目前困境的線索。$b$b為了我的研究，我需要這兩者的樣本。行動要快……', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11910;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "跟任一個何部落主城的吞焰者大師談談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak to a Master Flame Eater in any Horde capital." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak to a Master Flame Eater in any Horde capital.",  OLD Details : "你想學點熱騰騰的新技巧嗎？$b$b我不知道你有沒有辦法學會我這種技藝，不過如果你是個夠專心的學生的話，或許能學會一兩招。去跟任何一個部落主城的吞焰者大師談談。他們應該可以協助你。", Details AC enUS : "Are you interested in learning some hot new skills?$b$bI don't know if you'll ever be able to match my own considerable skill, but you can probably pick up a trick or two if you're an attentive student. Speak to a Master Flame Eater at any Horde capital. They should be able to help you." ; Wowhead enUS : "Are you interested in learning some hot new skills?$b$bI don't know if you'll ever be able to match my own considerable skill, but you can probably pick up a trick or two if you're an attentive student. Speak to a Master Flame Eater at any Horde capital. They should be able to help you."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '跟任一個何部落主城的吞火者大師談談。', `Details` = '你想學點熱騰騰的新技巧嗎?$b$b我不知道你有沒有辦法學會我這種技藝，不過如果你是個夠專心的學生的話，或許能學會一兩招。去跟任何一個部落主城的吞火者大師談談。他們應該可以協助你。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11915;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "反攻", Title AC enUS : "Striking Back" ; Wowhead enUS : "Striking Back",  OLD Details : "我們必須以行動來維持平衡!時間對我們相當不利。$b$b回到佐拉姆海岸矗立著大型冰石的營地。他們可以利用這些東西來和元素溝通，就像是希利蘇斯那樣。雖然我不喜歡這樣，那些精靈會瞭解的 - 你必須要召喚艾胡恩手下的一個副官，並且摧毀它。或許這樣先發制人的行動會有效...", Details AC enUS : "We must act to preserve the balance! Time is against us.$b$bReturn to the camp on the Zoram Strand with the large ice stones. They use them to communicate with the elementals, as they do in Silithus. Much as I am loath to do this, the spirits will understand - you must summon one of this Ahune's lieutenants and destroy it. Perhaps this forestalling action will be enough..." ; Wowhead enUS : "We must act to preserve the balance! Time is against us.$b$bReturn to the camp on the Zoram Strand with the large ice stones. They use them to communicate with the elementals, as they do in Silithus. Much as I am loath to do this, the spirits will understand - you must summon one of this Ahune's lieutenants and destroy it. Perhaps this forestalling action will be enough..."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '反擊', `Details` = '我們必須以行動來維持平衡!時間對我們相當不利。$b$b帶著大型的冰石回到佐拉姆海岸的營地。他們可以利用這些東西來和元素溝通，就像是希利蘇斯那樣。雖然我不喜歡這樣，那些精靈會瞭解的 - 你必須要召喚艾胡恩手下的一個副官，並且摧毀它。或許這樣先發制人的行動會有效……', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11917;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "哈囉，火焰雜耍師!你玩得開心或是燒掉了什麼嗎?那就是我想聽到的事!現在，你覺得自己是個火炬投擲的專家嗎?既然這樣的話我有個測試給你...$B$B你知道規則:將火炬投擲到標記的火盆裡。不過，這一次你擁有的時間變少，你得投中的火盆更多了。$B$B準備好了嗎?", Details AC enUS : "Hello, fire juggler!  Are you having fun and making fiery mayhem?  That's what I like to hear!  Now, do you think you're an expert at torch tossing?  Then I have a test for you...$B$BYou know the rules: toss torches at the marked braziers.  This time, however, you have a little more time and a LOT more braziers to hit.$B$BReady?" ; Wowhead enUS : "Hello, fire juggler! Are you having fun and making fiery mayhem? That's what I like to hear! Now, do you think you're an expert at torch tossing? Then I have a test for you...$b$bYou know the rules: toss torches at the marked braziers. This time, however, you have a little more time and a LOT more braziers to hit.$b$bReady?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '哈囉，火焰雜耍師!你玩得開心或是燒掉了什麼嗎?那就是我想聽到的事!現在，你覺得自己是個火炬投擲的專家嗎?既然這樣的話我有個測試給你…$b$b你知道規則:將火炬投擲到標記的火盆裡。不過，這一次你擁有的時間變少，你得投中的火盆更多了。$b$b準備好了嗎?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11921;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在火炬投擲遊戲中獲勝，然後跟吞焰者大師談話。", Objectives AC enUS : "Win the torch tossing game, then speak with the Master Flame Eater." ; Wowhead enUS : "Win the torch tossing game, then speak with the Master Flame Eater.",  OLD Details : "你想當一名火焰雜耍師？你已經具備這個資格了嗎？你夠靈敏嗎？反應夠快嗎？你有勇氣嗎？假如你認為你已經具備以上的條件，那麼我們來做個小小的練習吧！$B$B拿著這些火炬，然後跑到篝火的旁邊。你會看到火盆上閃爍著標誌。對標示的火盆投擲一根火炬。動作要快！你得在標誌消失以前擲出火炬才算數！$B$B在時間結束之前擊中足夠數量的火盆，然後回到這裡…我們再來進行下一個課程。", Details AC enUS : "So you want to be a fire juggler?  Do you have what it takes?  The dexterity?  The reflexes?  ...the courage?  If you think so, then let's give you a little practice!$B$BTake these torches and run near the bonfire.  You'll see  braziers with markers flashing above them.  Toss a torch at a marked brazier.  Be quick! Do it before the mark fades if you want credit for the toss!$B$BHit enough marked braziers before the time limit, then come back here... for your next lession." ; Wowhead enUS : "So you want to be a fire juggler? Do you have what it takes? The dexterity? The reflexes? ...the courage? If you think so, then let's give you a little practice!$b$bTake these torches and run near the bonfire. You'll see braziers with markers flashing above them. Toss a torch at a marked brazier. Be quick! Do it before the mark fades if you want credit for the toss!$b$bHit enough marked braziers before the time limit, then come back here... for your next lession."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '在火炬投擲遊戲中獲勝，然後跟吞火者大師談話。', `Details` = '你想當一名火焰雜耍師?你已經具備這個資格了嗎?你夠靈敏嗎?反應夠快嗎?你有勇氣嗎?假如你認為你已經具備以上的條件，那麼我們來做個小小的練習吧!$b$b拿著這些火炬，然後跑到營火的旁邊。你會看到火盆上閃爍著標誌。對標示的火盆投擲一根火炬。動作要快!你得在標誌消失以前擲出火炬才算數!$b$b在時間結束之前擊中足夠數量的火盆，然後回到這裡……我們再來進行下一個課程。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11922;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "連續接住4根火炬，然後跟吞焰者大師談話。", Objectives AC enUS : "Catch 4 torches in a row, then speak with the Master Flame Eater." ; Wowhead enUS : "Catch 4 torches in a row, then speak with the Master Flame Eater.",  OLD Details : "既然你已經學會投擲火炬了，讓我們看看你接不接得住它！$B$B拿著這堆未點燃的火炬。去篝火那邊然後把火炬高高地丟向空中！然後在火炬落地之前接住它…然後再把它丟回去！連續接住四個後，就回來找我。$B$B小心點！如果它們掉到地上可是很危險的！所以千萬別失誤！要是你真的失誤了，那你就得回到篝火那再重新開始一次。祝你好運！", Details AC enUS : "Now that you can throw a torch, let's see if you can catch one!$B$BTake this stack of unlit torches.  Go to the bonfire and throw a torch high into the air.  Catch it before it hits the ground... then throw it back up!  Catch four in a row, then come back to me.$B$BCareful! They're dangerous if they hit the ground!  And don't miss any catches!  If you do then you'll have to go back to the bonfire and start over.  Good luck!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Now that you can throw a torch, let's see if you can catch one!$b$bTake this stack of unlit torches. Go to the bonfire and throw a torch high into the air. Catch it before it hits the ground... then throw it back up! Catch four in a row, then come back to me.$b$bCareful! They're dangerous if they hit the ground! And don't miss any catches! If you do then you'll have to go back to the bonfire and start over. Good luck!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '連續接住4根火炬，然後跟吞火者大師談話。', `Details` = '現在你會投擲火炬了，來看看你是否接得住吧!$b$b拿著這堆未點燃的火炬。到營火前去並將火炬高高丟入空中。在火炬掉落至地面前接住...然後再將它丟高!連續接住4根火炬，就回來找我。$b$b當心點!要是火炬掉到地上可是很危險的!別漏接了!如果你真得漏接了，你就得回到營火前重新再來一次。祝你好運啦!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11923;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "接火炬當然可以讓你保持清醒。你以為你可以持續很久嗎?$B$B走著瞧吧...", Details AC enUS : "Torch catching sure keeps you on your toes.  Think you can keep it up for a long time?$B$BLet's see..." ; Wowhead enUS : "Torch catching sure keeps you on your toes. Think you can keep it up for a long time?$b$bLet's see..."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '接火炬當然可以讓你保持清醒。你以為你可以持續很久嗎?$b$b走著瞧吧…', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11924;
