-- AC datas : OLD Title : "偷取艾克索達之焰", Title AC enUS : "Stealing the Exodar's Flame" ; Wowhead enUS : "Stealing the Exodar's Flame",  OLD Objectives : "將艾克索達之焰交給節慶故事使者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Return the Flame of the Exodar to the Festival Talespinner." ; Wowhead enUS : "Return the Flame of the Exodar to the Festival Talespinner.",  OLD Details : "這個從艾克索達核心偷出來的火焰，讓你感到很溫暖。這股新的力量對你而言很陌生，但故事使者或許知道更多...", Details AC enUS : "This flame, stolen from the heart of the Exodar itself, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Talespinner might know more..." ; Wowhead enUS : "This flame, stolen from the heart of the Exodar itself, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Talespinner might know more..."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '盜取艾克索達之焰', `Objectives` = '將艾克索達之焰帶回去給節慶故事使者。', `Details` = '這個從艾克索達核心偷出來的火焰，讓你感到很溫暖。這股新的力量對你而言很陌生，但故事使者或許知道更多……', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11933;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "這個從銀月城偷出來的火焰，讓你感到很溫暖。這股新的力量對你而言很陌生，但博學大師或許知道更多...", Details AC enUS : "This flame, stolen from Silvermoon, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Loremaster might know more..." ; Wowhead enUS : "This flame, stolen from Silvermoon, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Loremaster might know more..."
