-- AC datas : OLD Title : "冰片", Title AC enUS : "Ice Shards" ; Wowhead enUS : "Ice Shards",  OLD Objectives : "將冰片交給魯瑪·天母。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring the Ice Shards to Luma Skymother." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the Ice Shards to Luma Skymother.",  OLD Details : "碎片跳動著，透露出不祥的徵兆。難道其中蘊含著冰霜領主的精華？", Details AC enUS : "These shards pulse with foreboding.  Do they hold the last essence of the Frost Lord?" ; Wowhead enUS : "These shards pulse with foreboding. Do they hold the last essence of the Frost Lord?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '寒冰裂片', `Objectives` = '將寒冰裂片交給魯瑪·天空之母。', `Details` = '這些裂片不祥地震動著。它們蘊含著冰霜領主的最後精華嗎?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11976;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "西部荒野民兵團駐營的多杉‧深掘要你解讀三塊符文板。", Objectives AC enUS : "Torthen Deepdig at the Westfall Brigade Encampment wants you to decipher the three Rune Plates." ; Wowhead enUS : "Torthen Deepdig at the Westfall Brigade Encampment wants you to decipher the three Rune Plates.",  OLD Details : "我們沒有時間可以浪費了!現在我們結合了符刻拱心石 -- 嗯，大部分的 -- 就可以解讀布萊恩在逃跑前所研讀的文獻。$B$B我們不知道他是否研讀過三個金屬板，但我們可以假設他已經取得足夠的資訊，讓他前往下一個目的地。$B$B在每一塊金屬板之前，使用拱心石解讀文獻。布萊恩也許就靠我們了!", Details AC enUS : "We've no time to lose! Now that we've reassembled the runic keystone -- well, most of it -- we can decipher the contents of those very same runic plates Brann was working on before he fled.$B$BWe have no way of knowing if he managed to read the contents of all three plates, but we'll have to assume he got enough information to determine his next destination.$B$BStand before each of the plates and use the keystone to determine the contents of each. Brann may be counting on us!" ; Wowhead enUS : "We've no time to lose! Now that we've reassembled the runic keystone -- well, most of it -- we can decipher the contents of those very same runic plates Brann was working on before he fled.$b$bWe have no way of knowing if he managed to read the contents of all three plates, but we'll have to assume he got enough information to determine his next destination.$b$bStand before each of the plates and use the keystone to determine the contents of each. Brann may be counting on us!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '西荒兵團駐營的多杉·深掘要你解讀三塊符文板。', `Details` = '我們沒有時間可以浪費了!現在我們結合了符刻拱心石 -- 嗯，大部分的 -- 就可以解讀布萊恩在逃跑前所研讀的文獻。$b$b我們不知道他是否研讀過三個金屬板，但我們可以假設他已經取得足夠的資訊，讓他前往下一個目的地。$b$b在每一塊金屬板之前，使用拱心石解讀文獻。布萊恩也許就靠我們了!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 11993;
