UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectivetext1` = '德拉克瑞保衛者 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '德拉克瑞神諭者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12114;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "與勘察員崗哨的瑞加爾‧斷眉交談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Raegar Breakbrow at Prospector's Point." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Raegar Breakbrow at Prospector's Point.",  OLD Details : "在軍隊試圖穿越鐸爾莫丹的興奮之中我差點就忘了瑞加爾和他的小組還在勘察員崗哨。$B$B我派了瑞加爾和他的助理，以及一個登山家的朋友去丹亞戈附近建立了一個小哨站，就在東風水濱的南端。$B$B他們是去調查南方丘陵區鐵矮人的蹤跡的，但我至今都沒有收到任何報告。如果你要去那一帶的話，能夠找找他們嗎？", Details AC enUS : "With all the excitement about the army trying to move through Thor Modan, I'd almost forgotten about Raegar's crew down at Prospector's Point.$B$BI sent Raegar and his assistants, along with a mountaineer friend, down to establish a small post near Dun Argol, at the southern end of the Eastwind Shore.$B$BThey were to investigate the iron dwarf presence in the southern hills, but I haven't received any reports yet. Could you check up on them if you're going down that way?" ; Wowhead enUS : "With all the excitement about the army trying to move through Thor Modan, I'd almost forgotten about Raegar's crew down at Prospector's Point.$b$bI sent Raegar and his assistants, along with a mountaineer friend, down to establish a small post near Dun Argol, at the southern end of the Eastwind Shore.$b$bThey were to investigate the iron dwarf presence in the southern hills, but I haven't received any reports yet. Could you check up on them if you're going down that way?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '與勘察員崗哨的瑞加爾·斷眉交談。', `Details` = '在軍隊試圖穿越鐸爾莫丹的興奮之中我差點就忘了瑞加爾和他的小組還在勘察員崗哨。$b$b我派了瑞加爾和他的助理，以及一個登山家的朋友去丹亞戈附近建立了一個小哨站，就在東風水濱的南端。$b$b他們是去調查南方丘陵區鐵矮人的蹤跡的，但我至今都沒有收到任何報告。如果你要去那一帶的話，能夠找找他們嗎?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12128;
