-- AC datas : OLD Title : "歐利克‧真心與遺民之濱", Title AC enUS : "Orik Trueheart and the Forgotten Shore" ; Wowhead enUS : "Orik Trueheart and the Forgotten Shore",  OLD Objectives : "在龍骨荒野的黎明之境上，尋求歐利克‧真心的協助。", Objectives AC enUS : "Seek out the assistance of Orik Trueheart at Dawn's Reach in Dragonblight." ; Wowhead enUS : "Seek out the assistance of Orik Trueheart at Dawn's Reach in Dragonblight.",  OLD Details : "我凝視著寶珠、看見了你必經的道路，$n。$B$B多年以前，龍骨荒野海岸邊發生了一件慘劇。事件的本身依舊晦暗難明，但是我相信你的宿命就在南方，在遺民之濱的諸多廢墟之中。$B$B沿著東南方的路走下去，經過被蹂躪的城鎮廣場，順著路走，直到黎明之境。你會遇到我的一個老朋友，名叫歐利克‧真心。他在那兒等著你。", Details AC enUS : "I have gazed upon the orb and seen the path that you must walk, $N.$B$BMany years ago an atrocity was committed upon the shores of Dragonblight. The act itself remains shrouded in darkness, but I am certain that your destiny lies south, amidst the ruins of the Forgotten Shore.$B$BTake the road southeast through the ravaged town square. Follow the trail until you arrive at Dawn's Reach. You will meet an old friend of mine there known as Orik Trueheart. He will be expecting you." ; Wowhead enUS : "I have gazed upon the orb and seen the path that you must walk, $n.$b$bMany years ago an atrocity was committed upon the shores of Dragonblight. The act itself remains shrouded in darkness, but I am certain that your destiny lies south, amidst the ruins of the Forgotten Shore.$b$bTake the road southeast through the ravaged town square. Follow the trail until you arrive at Dawn's Reach. You will meet an old friend of mine there known as Orik Trueheart. He will be expecting you."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '歐利克·真心與遺民之濱', `Objectives` = '在龍骨荒野的黎明之境上，尋求歐利克·真心的協助。', `Details` = '我凝視著寶珠、看見了你必經的道路，$n。$b$b多年以前，龍骨荒野海岸邊發生了一件慘劇。事件的本身依舊晦暗難明，但是我相信你的宿命就在南方，在遺民之濱的諸多廢墟之中。$b$b沿著東南方的路走下去，經過被蹂躪的城鎮廣場，順著路走，直到黎明之境。你會遇到我的一個老朋友，名叫歐利克·真心。他在那兒等著你。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12287;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "帶著「每月啤酒」俱樂部會員表格交給奧格瑪裡的雷瑪。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring the "Brew of the Month" club membership form to Ray'ma in the Darkbriar Lodge in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the "Brew of the Month" club membership form to Ray'ma in the Darkbriar Lodge in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits.",  OLD Details : "$n，團結就是力量。成為「每月啤酒」俱樂部的一員，意味著你和你的同好隨時享用最青的啤酒。$b$b帶著你的「每月啤酒」俱樂部會員表格交給雷瑪，他就在奧格瑪裡。", Details AC enUS : "There is strength in numbers, $n.  Being part of the "Brew of the Month" club means knowing you and your brethren will always have access to the best brew.$b$bBring your "Brew of the Month" club membership form to Ray'ma in the Darkbriar Lodge in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits." ; Wowhead enUS : "There is strength in numbers, $n. Being part of the "Brew of the Month" club means knowing you and your brethren will always have access to the best brew.$b$bBring your "Brew of the Month" club membership form to Ray'ma in the Darkbriar Lodge in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '帶著「每月啤酒」俱樂部會員表格交給雷瑪，他就在奧格瑪精神谷的暗木小屋裡。', `Details` = '$n，團結就是力量。成為「每月啤酒」俱樂部的一員，意味著你和你的同好隨時享用最青的啤酒。$b$b帶著你的「每月啤酒」俱樂部會員表格交給雷瑪，他就在奧格瑪精神谷的暗木小屋裡。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12306;
