-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把「每月啤酒」俱樂部會員表格帶給拉金‧雷酒，他就在鐵爐堡的石火旅店中。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring the "Brew of the Month" club membership form to Larkin Thunderbrew in the Stonefire Tavern in Ironforge." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the "Brew of the Month" club membership form to Larkin Thunderbrew in the Stonefire Tavern in Ironforge.",  OLD Details : "會員享有優惠。成為「每月啤酒俱樂部」的會員，表示你有管道獲得到最新、最青的啤酒。$B$B帶著你的「每月啤酒」俱樂部會員表格給拉金‧雷酒，他就在鐵爐堡的石火旅店中。", Details AC enUS : "Membership has its privileges.  Being part of the "Brew of the Month" club means knowing where to get the latest and greatest brew.$b$bBring your "Brew of the Month" club membership form to Larkin Thunderbrew in the Stonefire Tavern in Ironforge." ; Wowhead enUS : "Membership has its privileges. Being part of the "Brew of the Month" club means knowing where to get the latest and greatest brew.$b$bBring your "Brew of the Month" club membership form to Larkin Thunderbrew in the Stonefire Tavern in Ironforge."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '把「每月啤酒」俱樂部會員表格帶給拉金·雷酒，他就在鐵爐堡的石火旅店中。', `Details` = '會員享有優惠。成為「每月啤酒俱樂部」的會員，表示你有管道獲得到最新、最青的啤酒。$b$b帶著你的「每月啤酒」俱樂部會員表格給拉金·雷酒，他就在鐵爐堡的石火旅店中。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12420;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "懸賞：克羅格‧毀誓者", Title AC enUS : "Wanted: Kreug Oathbreaker" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: Kreug Oathbreaker",  OLD Objectives : "殺死克羅格‧毀誓者，然後向大領主李奧瑞克‧馮‧澤爾迪格領取賞金，他就在龍骨荒野的溫特加德要塞。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill Kreug Oathbreaker and return to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight to collect your reward." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill Kreug Oathbreaker and return to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight to collect your reward.",  OLD Details : "公告者:伊魯希雅‧盧恩$B$B克羅格‧毀誓者，天譴軍的血肉巨人，必須為我的丈夫、小孩、與我的摯友語幕一家的死負責。具有足夠勇氣獵取這份獎金的人可以在東南方腐屍農地邊緣的懸崖找到克羅格。$B$B我要正義!殺死克羅格‧毀誓者!$B$B假使有人殺掉了克羅格‧毀誓者，我已經預先將金錢與物品交給了大領主李奧瑞克‧馮‧澤爾迪格，請他代發。$B$B請為我們復仇!", Details AC enUS : "Posted by: Illusia Lune$B$BThe Scourge flesh giant known as Kreug Oathbreaker was responsible for the deaths of my husband, children and my dear friends, the Whisperveils. Those brave enough to take on this bounty will find Kreug in the southeastern reaches of the Carrion Fields.$B$BI demand justice! Kill Kreug Oathbreaker!$B$BIn the event that Kreug is slain, I have pooled money and items together and given them to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig to give out as a reward.$B$BPlease vindicate us!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Posted by: Illusia Lune$b$bThe Scourge flesh giant known as Kreug Oathbreaker was responsible for the deaths of my husband, children and my dear friends, the Whisperveils. Those brave enough to take on this bounty will find Kreug in the southeastern reaches of the Carrion Fields.$b$bI demand justice! Kill Kreug Oathbreaker!$b$bIn the event that Kreug is slain, I have pooled money and items together and given them to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig to give out as a reward.$b$bPlease vindicate us!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '懸賞:克羅格·毀誓者', `Objectives` = '殺死克羅格·毀誓者，然後向大領主李奧瑞克·馮·澤爾迪格領取賞金，他就在龍骨荒野的溫特加德要塞。', `Details` = '公告者:伊魯希亞·盧恩$b$b克羅格·毀誓者，天譴軍的血肉巨人，必須為我的丈夫、小孩、與我的摯友語幕一家的死負責。具有足夠勇氣獵取這份獎金的人可以在東南方腐屍農地邊緣的懸崖找到克羅格。$b$b我要正義!殺死克羅格·毀誓者!$b$b假使有人殺掉了克羅格·毀誓者，我已經預先將金錢與物品交給了大領主李奧瑞克·馮·澤爾迪格，請他代發。$b$b請為我們復仇!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12438;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "懸賞：高階薩滿血掌", Title AC enUS : "Wanted: High Shaman Bloodpaw" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: High Shaman Bloodpaw",  OLD Objectives : "殺掉高階薩滿血掌，並回報給大領主李奧瑞克‧馮‧澤爾迪格以獲取你的獎賞;他就在龍骨荒野上的溫特加德要塞裡。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill High Shaman Bloodpaw and return to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight to collect your reward." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill High Shaman Bloodpaw and return to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight to collect your reward.",  OLD Details : "公佈者：德羅菲$B$B就在異法陵地之上，我的表親史克羅堤和布羅特，遭到一幫邪惡的血掌獾狼怪襲擊。我們雖然企圖脫逃，但史克羅堤和布羅特恐怕已遭不測。$B$B我要懲罰這些傢伙！是否有勇者願意冒險前往東南方，也就是龍骨荒野的邊境，異法陵地上格殺高階薩滿血掌以及他的親信？$B$B本人將提供豐渥的賞銀交付給大領主李奧瑞克‧馮‧澤爾迪格，由他發放給任何完成此任務者！", Details AC enUS : "Posted by: Drolfy$B$BWhile out in the Eldritch Heights with my cousins, Skrotee and Brote, a vicious band of wolvar from the Bloodpaw tribe attacked us. We attempted to flee, but I fear they got Skrotee and Brote.$B$BI demand retribution! Is there someone brave enough to venture to the southeastern reaches of Dragonblight, to the Eldritch Heights, and kill High Shaman Bloodpaw and his cronies?$B$BI have given a hefty sum of gold to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig to disperse to anyone that claims this bounty!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Posted by: Drolfy$b$bWhile out in the Eldritch Heights with my cousins, Skrotee and Brote, a vicious band of wolvar from the Bloodpaw tribe attacked us. We attempted to flee, but I fear they got Skrotee and Brote.$b$bI demand retribution! Is there someone brave enough to venture to the southeastern reaches of Dragonblight, to the Eldritch Heights, and kill High Shaman Bloodpaw and his cronies?$b$bI have given a hefty sum of gold to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig to disperse to anyone that claims this bounty!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '懸賞:高階薩滿血掌', `Objectives` = '殺掉高階薩滿血掌，並回報給大領主李奧瑞克·馮·澤爾迪格以獲取你的獎賞;他就在龍骨荒野上的溫特加德要塞裡。', `Details` = '公佈者:德羅菲$b$b就在異法陵地之上，我的表親史克羅堤和布羅特，遭到一幫邪惡的血掌獾狼怪襲擊。我們雖然企圖脫逃，但史克羅堤和布羅特恐怕已遭不測。$b$b我要懲罰這些傢伙!是否有勇者願意冒險前往東南方，也就是龍骨荒野的邊境，異法陵地上格殺高階薩滿血掌以及他的親信?$b$b本人將提供豐渥的賞銀交付給大領主李奧瑞克·馮·澤爾迪格，由他發放給任何完成此任務者!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12441;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "懸賞：突襲軍指揮官艾尤圖斯", Title AC enUS : "Wanted: Onslaught Commander Iustus" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: Onslaught Commander Iustus",  OLD Objectives : "殺掉突襲軍指揮官艾尤圖斯，並回報給大領主李奧瑞克‧馮‧澤爾迪格以獲取你的獎賞;他就在龍骨荒野上的溫特加德要塞裡。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill Onslaught Commander Iustus and return to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight to collect your reward.$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill Onslaught Commander Iustus and return to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight to collect your reward.",  OLD Details : "公告者:大領主李奧瑞克‧馮‧澤爾迪格$B$B第七軍團的部隊在溫特加德東北方的小徑上遭到突襲軍指揮官艾尤圖斯與一群沒大腦的血色突襲軍狂徒襲擊。面對此等冷血狡詐的行為必須以以暴制暴!$B$B溫特加德要求正義!到東北方的突襲營地找出突襲軍指揮官艾尤圖斯，終結他可悲的生命。$B$B我會獎賞任何接受這任務的勇者!", Details AC enUS : "Posted by: Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig$B$BUpon the northeastern path from Wintergarde a battalion of 7th Legion were ambushed and slain by Onslaught Commander Iustus and an army of mindless Scarlet Onslaught zealots. Such cold and calculated actions must be met with force!$B$BWintergarde demands justice! Seek out Onslaught Commander Iustus at Onslaught Base Camp to the northeast and end his miserable existence.$B$BI will hand out the reward for this bounty to any who would dare take up the task!$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Posted by: Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig$b$bUpon the northeastern path from Wintergarde a battalion of 7th Legion were ambushed and slain by Onslaught Commander Iustus and an army of mindless Scarlet Onslaught zealots. Such cold and calculated actions must be met with force!$b$bWintergarde demands justice! Seek out Onslaught Commander Iustus at Onslaught Base Camp to the northeast and end his miserable existence.$b$bI will hand out the reward for this bounty to any who would dare take up the task!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '懸賞:突襲軍指揮官艾尤圖斯', `Objectives` = '殺掉突襲軍指揮官艾尤圖斯，並回報給大領主李奧瑞克·馮·澤爾迪格以獲取你的獎賞;他就在龍骨荒野上的溫特加德要塞裡。', `Details` = '公告者:大領主李奧瑞克·馮·澤爾迪格$b$b第七軍團的部隊在溫特加德東北方的小徑上遭到突襲軍指揮官艾尤圖斯與一群沒大腦的血色突襲軍狂徒襲擊。面對此等冷血狡詐的行為必須以以暴制暴!$b$b溫特加德要求正義!到東北方的突襲營地找出突襲軍指揮官艾尤圖斯，終結他可悲的生命。$b$b我會獎賞任何接受這任務的勇者!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12442;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我能感覺到神殿尚未完全回歸平衡。青綠看守者已經被我們的舉動所觸怒，我感覺他聽不進我們任何理由。$B$B艾里史卓斯是一頭巨大的天爪，棲息在翡翠龍殿的南方，他同時控有整個龍殿的空中防禦，而恐怕我們得應付他的攻擊。$B$B拿著這些天爪蛻皮，並把蛻皮放在他視力所及的地面上，他會飛下來的。把他的長羽帶給我。", Details AC enUS : "I can feel that the shrine is not completely back in balance. The verdant keeper has been angered by our actions, and I sense that he will not listen to reason.$B$BAlystros is an immense skytalon who perches at the south end of the Emerald Dragonshrine. It is he who is in charge of the dragonshrine's aerial defenses. I fear that we will have to deal with him.$B$BTake these skytalon molts and place them on the ground where he can see them. He will come. Bring me his plume." ; Wowhead enUS : "I can feel that the shrine is not completely back in balance. The verdant keeper has been angered by our actions, and I sense that he will not listen to reason.$b$bAlystros is an immense skytalon who perches at the south end of the Emerald Dragonshrine. It is he who is in charge of the dragonshrine's aerial defenses. I fear that we will have to deal with him.$b$bTake these skytalon molts and place them on the ground where he can see them. He will come. Bring me his plume."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我能感覺到神殿尚未完全回歸平衡。青綠看守者已經被我們的舉動所觸怒，我感覺他聽不進我們任何理由。$b$b艾里史卓斯是一頭巨大的天爪，棲息在翡翠龍殿的南方，他同時控有整個龍殿的空中防禦，而恐怕我們得應付他的攻擊。$b$b拿著這些天爪蛻皮，並把蛻皮放在他視力所及的地面上，他會飛下來的。把他的長羽帶給我。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12456;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我們在晶紅龍殿需要你。$B$B龍群已經被藍龍和天譴軍團四面包圍了...他們一點也不比我們好過。情況似乎非常危急，但這也給了我們一個結交珍貴盟友的好機會。$B$B我派出了一個兵團來幫助紅龍對抗晶紅龍殿的天譴軍團，如果你願意作戰的話，請前往龍殿東方的山脊上找賽利斯塔茲，然後盡你所能的提供協助。", Details AC enUS : "We need you at the Ruby Dragonshrine.$B$BThe dragons are beset on all sides by the blue flight and the scourge... they're in no better a state than we are. The situation seems dire, but this affords us a rare opportunity to establish a valuable alliance.$B$BI secured a regiment to aid the red dragonflight against the Scourge at the Ruby Dragonshrine. If you have a fight in you, please go find Ceristrasz on the ridge east of the shrine and help him in any way that you can." ; Wowhead enUS : "We need you at the Ruby Dragonshrine.$b$bThe dragons are beset on all sides by the blue flight and the scourge... they're in no better a state than we are. The situation seems dire, but this affords us a rare opportunity to establish a valuable alliance.$b$bI secured a regiment to aid the red dragonflight against the Scourge at the Ruby Dragonshrine. If you have a fight in you, please go find Ceristrasz on the ridge east of the shrine and help him in any way that you can."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我們在晶紅龍殿需要你。$b$b龍群已經被藍龍和天譴軍團四面包圍了…他們一點也不比我們好過。情況似乎非常危急，但這也給了我們一個結交珍貴盟友的好機會。$b$b我派出了一個兵團來幫助紅龍對抗晶紅龍殿的天譴軍團，如果你願意作戰的話，請前往龍殿東方的山脊上找賽利斯塔茲，然後盡你所能的提供協助。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12460;
