-- AC datas : OLD Details : "$n，回來下面!$B$B你會找到科爾拉瑪斯的領導者，『墮落者』瑪拉斯，得意洋洋的站在墜毀的亡域頂端。$B$B殺了他，提他的腦袋來見我!", Details AC enUS : "$N, gather at least one other person and head back down there!$B$BYou'll find the leader of Kolramas, Malas the Corrupter, gloating from atop the crashed necropolis.$B$BKill him and bring me his head!" ; Wowhead enUS : "$n, gather at least one other person and head back down there!$b$bYou'll find the leader of Kolramas, Malas the Corrupter, gloating from atop the crashed necropolis.$b$bKill him and bring me his head!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '$n，至少再找一個人，然後回去那裡!$b$b你會找到科爾拉瑪斯的領導者，『墮落者』瑪拉斯，得意洋洋的站在墜毀的亡域頂端。$b$b殺了他，提他的腦袋來見我!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12554;
