-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "進入冰心洞窟殺死響鑽。如果你還帶著的話，記得要用佐特的保護藥劑來保護你自己不受蟄猛巨蟲的噴酸傷害。$B$B當你完成任務之後向水晶之鉗的『無敵』寇恰回覆。", Objectives AC enUS : "Enter the Ice Heart Cavern and slay Rattlebore.  If it is still in your possession, be sure to use Zort's Protective Elixir to protect you from the Jormungar's corrosive spit.$B$BReturn to Ko'char the Unbreakable in the Crystal Vice when the task is complete." ; Wowhead enUS : "Enter the Ice Heart Cavern and slay Rattlebore.  If it is still in your possession, be sure to use Zort's Protective Elixir to protect you from the Jormungar's corrosive spit.$b$bReturn to Ko'char the Unbreakable in the Crystal Vice when the task is complete.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Rattlebore slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '進入冰心洞窟殺死響鑽。如果你還帶著的話，記得要用佐特的保護藥劑來保護你自己不受蟄猛巨蟲的噴酸傷害。$b$b當你完成任務之後向水晶之鉗的『無敵』寇恰回覆。', `Objectivetext1` = '響鑽 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12080;
