-- AC datas : OLD Details : "藍龍軍團竟敢靠著過量流入蒼藍龍殿的法力壯膽，進而攻打龍眠神殿!$B$B我請求你騎上我們的防衛者加入戰局，並且殺死他們的巨龍與飛龍大軍，同時攻擊龍殿中湧出的地脈法力能量，破壞它的穩定。$B$B出門東西兩邊的區域有許多龍眠防衛者，和其中一頭衛士交談，騎上牠加入戰局。$B$B沒有你的幫助，$n，我們必敗無疑。", Details AC enUS : "Emboldened by the overabundance of magic now flowing through the Azure Dragonshrine, the blue dragonflight has dared to attack Wyrmrest Temple itself!$B$BI ask that you ride one of our defenders into battle to slay their dragons and drakes, and to attack the eruption of ley line energies at the dragonshrine itself in order to destabilize it.$B$BOutside on the east and west terraces are wyrmrest defenders. Speak with one to ride it into battle.$B$BWithout your help, $N, we will surely lose." ; Wowhead enUS : "Emboldened by the overabundance of magic now flowing through the Azure Dragonshrine, the blue dragonflight has dared to attack Wyrmrest Temple itself!$b$bI ask that you ride one of our defenders into battle to slay their dragons and drakes, and to attack the eruption of ley line energies at the dragonshrine itself in order to destabilize it.$b$bOutside on the east and west terraces are wyrmrest defenders. Speak with one to ride it into battle.$b$bWithout your help, $n, we will surely lose.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "擾亂蒼藍龍殿", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Azure Dragon slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Azure Drake slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '藍龍軍團竟敢靠著過量流入蒼藍龍殿的法力壯膽，進而攻打龍眠神殿!$b$b我請求你騎上我們的防衛者加入戰局，並且殺死他們的巨龍與飛龍大軍，同時攻擊龍殿中湧出的地脈法力能量，破壞它的穩定。$b$b出門東西兩邊的區域有許多龍眠防衛者，和其中一頭衛士交談，騎上牠加入戰局。$b$b沒有你的幫助，$n，我們必敗無疑。', `Objectivetext1` = '蒼藍巨龍 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '蒼藍龍 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12372;
