-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "拉莎莉爾主教要你將光明聖物交給鐵爐堡的國王麥格尼·銅須。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bishop Lazaril wants you to bring the Light-infused Artifact to King Magni Bronzebeard in Ironforge." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bishop Lazaril wants you to bring the Light-infused Artifact to King Magni Bronzebeard in Ironforge.",  OLD Details : "聖光響應了我們的祈禱！依靠沙塔斯城的納魯所賜予的聖光精華，以及虔誠信徒的祈福，我們終於創造出了神聖而強大的聖物，這些聖物將成為我們對抗巫妖王的利器。$B$B帶上這個，$n。你要仔細保護它，把它安全地送到鐵爐堡。麥格尼·銅須急於轉至諾森德參戰，這件聖物可以説明他達成目標。", Details AC enUS : "Our prayers have been answered!  Using the concentration of Light from the Naaru of Shattrath, and the shared benedictions from the faithful, we have created holy artifacts of profound power.  These artifacts will be our weapon against the Lich King's machinations.$B$BTake this, $n.  Guard it close, and secure its passage to Ironforge.  Magni Bronzebeard is eager to take the fight to Northrend, and this will bring him closer to his goal." ; Wowhead enUS : "Our prayers have been answered! Using the concentration of Light from the Naaru of Shattrath, and the shared benedictions from the faithful, we have created holy artifacts of profound power. These artifacts will be our weapon against the Lich King's machinations.$b$bTake this, $n. Guard it close, and secure its passage to Ironforge. Magni Bronzebeard is eager to take the fight to Northrend, and this will bring him closer to his goal."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '主教拉札利爾要你把聖光灌注神器送去給鐵爐堡的麥格尼‧銅鬚。', `Details` = '我們的祈禱得到了回應!我們利用來自撒塔斯那魯的聚合聖光，以及虔誠信徒所獻上的祈禱，創造了擁有深奧力量的神聖法器。這些法器將會成為我們對抗巫妖王陰謀的武器。$b$b帶著這個，$n。看緊它，然後將它送到鐵爐堡。麥格尼‧銅鬚急著想要參與北裂境的戰事，這將會讓他更接近他的目標。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12771;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "善良的$n，巫妖王以侵略和疾病毒害我們 -- 部落與聯盟都難逃一劫 。唯有結合我們兩大艾澤拉斯文明的力量才能對抗他的攻擊。$B$B在撒塔斯的聖光露臺，我們結成了新的聯盟。為了協助我們對抗巫妖王，前往聖光露臺的新聯盟駐紮地和主教拉札利爾談談。$B$B動作快，$n。", Details AC enUS : "Good $n, the Lich King plagues us --  both Horde and Alliance -- with disease and invasion.  Only by joining our strengths can the two great cultures of Azeroth survive against his assault.$B$BIn Shattrath, in the Terrace of Light, that alliance has been struck.  To aid our struggle against the Lich King, go to the new Alliance camp in the Terrace of Light and speak with Bishop Lazaril.$B$BLight speed, $n." ; Wowhead enUS : "Good $n, the Lich King plagues us -- both Horde and Alliance -- with disease and invasion. Only by joining our strengths can the two great cultures of Azeroth survive against his assault.$b$bIn Shattrath, in the Terrace of Light, that alliance has been struck. To aid our struggle against the Lich King, go to the new Alliance camp in the Terrace of Light and speak with Bishop Lazaril.$b$bLight speed, $n."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '善良的$n，巫妖王以侵略和疾病毒害我們 -- 部落與聯盟都難逃一劫 。唯有結合我們兩大艾澤拉斯文明的力量才能對抗他的攻擊。$b$b在撒塔斯的聖光露臺，我們結成了新的聯盟。為了協助我們對抗巫妖王，前往聖光露臺的新聯盟駐紮地和主教拉札利爾談談。$b$b動作快，$n。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12772;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我們的祈禱得到了回應!我們利用來自撒塔斯那魯的聚合聖光，以及虔誠信徒所獻上的祈禱，創造了擁有深奧力量的神聖法器。這些法器將會成為我們對抗巫妖王陰謀的武器。$B$B帶著這個，$n。看緊它，將之確實送抵達納蘇斯。把它送去給泰蘭妲‧語風 -- 她的牧師們將會發現這是她們與來自北方的邪惡勢力交戰的關鍵力量來源。", Details AC enUS : "Our prayers have been answered!  Using the concentration of Light from the Naaru of Shattrath, and the shared benedictions from the faithful, we have created holy artifacts of profound power.  These artifacts will be our weapon against the Lich King's machinations.$B$BTake this, $n.  Guard it close, and secure its passage to Darnassus.  Deliver it to Tyrande Whisperwind -- her priests will find it a vital source of power in their fight against the unholy forces from the North." ; Wowhead enUS : "Our prayers have been answered! Using the concentration of Light from the Naaru of Shattrath, and the shared benedictions from the faithful, we have created holy artifacts of profound power. These artifacts will be our weapon against the Lich King's machinations.$b$bTake this, $n. Guard it close, and secure its passage to Darnassus. Deliver it to Tyrande Whisperwind -- her priests will find it a vital source of power in their fight against the unholy forces from the North."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我們的祈禱得到了回應!我們利用來自撒塔斯那魯的聚合聖光，以及虔誠信徒所獻上的祈禱，創造了擁有深奧力量的神聖法器。這些法器將會成為我們對抗巫妖王陰謀的武器。$b$b帶著這個，$n。看緊它，將之確實送抵達納蘇斯。把它送去給泰蘭妲‧語風 -- 她的牧師們將會發現這是她們與來自北方的邪惡勢力交戰的關鍵力量來源。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12773;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "主教拉札利爾要你把聖光灌注神器送去給暴風城的瓦裡安‧烏瑞恩國王。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bishop Lazaril wants you to bring the Light-infused Artifact to King Varian Wrynn in Stormwind." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bishop Lazaril wants you to bring the Light-infused Artifact to King Anduin Wrynn in Stormwind.",  OLD Details : "我們的祈禱得到了回應!我們利用來自撒塔斯那魯的聚合聖光，以及虔誠信徒所獻上的祈禱，創造了擁有深奧力量的神聖法器。這些法器將會成為我們對抗巫妖王陰謀的武器。$B$B帶著這個，$n。看緊它，並安全地將它送達暴風城。暴風城之王已經回來了。我相信他會很樂於見到這個。", Details AC enUS : "Our prayers have been answered!  Using the concentration of Light from the Naaru of Shattrath, and the shared benedictions from the faithful, we have created holy artifacts of profound power.  These artifacts will be our weapon against the Lich King's machinations.$B$BTake this, $n.  Guard it close, and secure its passage to Stormwind.  The King of Stormwind has recently returned; I'm sure he will welcome this tool." ; Wowhead enUS : "Our prayers have been answered! Using the concentration of Light from the Naaru of Shattrath, and the shared benedictions from the faithful, we have created holy artifacts of profound power. These artifacts will be our weapon against the Lich King's machinations.$b$bTake this, $n. Guard it close, and secure its passage to Stormwind. The King of Stormwind has recently returned; I'm sure he will welcome this tool."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '主教拉札利爾要你把聖光灌注神器送去給暴風城的安杜因‧烏瑞恩國王。', `Details` = '我們的祈禱得到了回應!我們利用來自撒塔斯那魯的聚合聖光，以及虔誠信徒所獻上的祈禱，創造了擁有深奧力量的神聖法器。這些法器將會成為我們對抗巫妖王陰謀的武器。$b$b帶著這個，$n。看緊它，並安全地將它送達暴風城。暴風城之王已經回來了。我相信他會很樂於見到這個。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12774;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "善良的$n，巫妖王以侵略和疾病毒害我們 -- 部落與聯盟都難逃一劫 。唯有結合我們兩大艾澤拉斯文明的力量才能對抗他的攻擊。$B$B在撒塔斯的聖光露臺，我們結成了新的聯盟。為了協助我們對抗巫妖王，前往聖光露臺的新聯盟駐紮地和主教拉札利爾談談。$B$B動作快，$n。", Details AC enUS : "Good $n, the Lich King plagues us --  both Horde and Alliance -- with disease and invasion.  Only by joining our strengths can the two great cultures of Azeroth survive against his assault.$B$BIn Shattrath, in the Terrace of Light, that alliance has been struck.  To aid our struggle against the Lich King, go to the new Alliance camp in the Terrace of Light and speak with Bishop Lazaril.$B$BLight speed, $n." ; Wowhead enUS : "Good $n, the Lich King plagues us -- both Horde and Alliance -- with disease and invasion. Only by joining our strengths can the two great cultures of Azeroth survive against his assault.$b$bIn Shattrath, in the Terrace of Light, that alliance has been struck. To aid our struggle against the Lich King, go to the new Alliance camp in the Terrace of Light and speak with Bishop Lazaril.$b$bLight speed, $n."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '善良的$n，巫妖王以侵略和疾病毒害我們 -- 部落與聯盟都難逃一劫 。唯有結合我們兩大艾澤拉斯文明的力量才能對抗他的攻擊。$b$b在撒塔斯的聖光露臺，我們結成了新的聯盟。為了協助我們對抗巫妖王，前往聖光露臺的新聯盟駐紮地和主教拉札利爾談談。$b$b動作快，$n。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12775;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "埃索達", Title AC enUS : "The Exodar" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Exodar",  OLD Objectives : "拉莎莉爾主教要你將光明聖物交給埃索達的維倫。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bishop Lazaril wants you to deliver the Light-infused Artifact to Velen in the Exodar." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bishop Lazaril wants you to deliver the Light-infused Artifact to Velen in the Exodar.",  OLD Details : "聖光響應了我們的祈禱！依靠沙塔斯城的納魯所賜予的聖光精華，以及虔誠信徒的祈福，我們終於創造出了神聖而強大的聖物，這些聖物將成為我們對抗巫妖王的利器。$B$B帶上這個，$n。你要仔細保護它，把它安全地送到埃索達，交給聖光穹頂的先知維倫。他可以借用聖物的力量對抗阿爾薩斯的邪惡部隊。", Details AC enUS : "Our prayers have been answered!  Using the concentration of Light from the Naaru of Shattrath, and the shared benedictions from the faithful, we have created holy artifacts of profound power.  These artifacts will be our weapon against the Lich King's machinations.$B$BTake this, $n.  Guard it close, and secure its passage to the Exodar.  Deliver it to Prophet Velen in the Vault of Lights so that he may use its powers against the unholy forces from the North." ; Wowhead enUS : "Our prayers have been answered! Using the concentration of Light from the Naaru of Shattrath, and the shared benedictions from the faithful, we have created holy artifacts of profound power. These artifacts will be our weapon against the Lich King's machinations.$b$bTake this, $n. Guard it close, and secure its passage to the Exodar. Deliver it to Prophet Velen in the Vault of Lights so that he may use its powers against the unholy forces from the North."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '艾克索達', `Objectives` = '主教拉札利爾要你把聖光灌注神器送去給艾克索達的費倫。', `Details` = '我們的祈禱得到了回應!我們利用來自撒塔斯那魯的聚合聖光，以及虔誠信徒所獻上的祈禱，創造了擁有深奧力量的神聖法器。這些法器將會成為我們對抗巫妖王陰謀的武器。$b$b帶著這個，$n。看緊它，然後將它送到艾克索達。把它送到聖光地窖的預言者費倫手上，他才能使用這東西的力量對抗北方邪惡的力量。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12776;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "絕望的聯軍", Title AC enUS : "A Desperate Alliance" ; Wowhead enUS : "A Desperate Alliance",  OLD Objectives : "到沙塔斯城的聖光廣場去，與新聯盟營地中的拉莎莉爾主教談一談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Bishop Lazaril in the new Alliance camp at the Terrace of Light in Shattrath." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Bishop Lazaril in the new Alliance camp at the Terrace of Light in Shattrath.",  OLD Details : "親愛的$n，巫妖王在用疾病和侵略折磨著我們——部落和聯盟都深受其害。只有艾澤拉斯的這兩個偉大文明聯手，才有可能擊敗他。$B$B我們在沙塔斯城的聖光廣場結成了聯軍。$B$B為了幫助我們對抗巫妖王，請你到聖光廣場的新聯盟營地去，和拉莎莉爾主教談一談。$B$B願聖光保佑你，$n。", Details AC enUS : "Good $n, the Lich King plagues us --  both Horde and Alliance -- with disease and invasion.  Only by joining our strengths can the two great cultures of Azeroth survive against his assault.$B$BIn Shattrath, in the Terrace of Light, that alliance has been struck.  To aid our struggle against the Lich King, go to the new Alliance camp in the Terrace of Light and speak with Bishop Lazaril.$B$BLight speed, $n." ; Wowhead enUS : "Good $n, the Lich King plagues us -- both Horde and Alliance -- with disease and invasion. Only by joining our strengths can the two great cultures of Azeroth survive against his assault.$b$bIn Shattrath, in the Terrace of Light, that alliance has been struck. To aid our struggle against the Lich King, go to the new Alliance camp in the Terrace of Light and speak with Bishop Lazaril.$b$bLight speed, $n."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '孤注一擲的聯盟', `Objectives` = '與撒塔斯的主教拉札利爾談談。他就在聖光露臺的新聯盟駐紮地中。', `Details` = '善良的$n，巫妖王以侵略和疾病毒害我們 -- 部落與聯盟都難逃一劫 。唯有結合雙方的力量，艾澤拉斯的兩大文明才能夠撐過他的攻擊。$b$b在撒塔斯的聖光露臺，我們結成了新的聯盟。為了協助我們對抗巫妖王，前往聖光露臺的新聯盟駐紮地，和主教拉札利爾談談。$b$b動作快，$n。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12777;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "陷阱已經開始了，死亡騎士。壁爐谷和提里斯法的軍隊已經抵達，剛好即時來視察他們處於大火中的領土!如果他們現在回頭，他們就會轉以背對我們作戰。$B$B<莫格萊尼搖了搖頭。>$B$B不，他們只有一個選擇，唯一的結果:天啟!$B$B在我們對話的當下，他們準備進行最後一擊。$B$B巫妖王在等著你回去，勇士。他就在死亡止境俯看著我們。", Details AC enUS : "The trap has been sprung, death knight. The armies of Hearthglen and Tirisfal have arrived, just in time to see their enclave in flames! If they turn back now, they fight us with their backs turned.$B$B<Mograine shakes his head.>$B$BNo, they have only one option, which has only one outcome: APOCALYPSE!$B$BAs we speak, they prepare to make one final stand.$B$BThe Lich King awaits your return, champion. He stands watch below us, at Death's Breach." ; Wowhead enUS : "The trap has been sprung, death knight. The armies of Hearthglen and Tirisfal have arrived, just in time to see their enclave in flames! If they turn back now, they fight us with their backs turned.$b$b<Mograine shakes his head.>$b$bNo, they have only one option, which has only one outcome: APOCALYPSE!$b$bAs we speak, they prepare to make one final stand.$b$bThe Lich King awaits your return, champion. He stands watch below us, at Death's Breach."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '陷阱已經開始了，死亡騎士。壁爐谷和提里斯法的軍隊已經抵達，剛好即時來視察他們處於大火中的領土!如果他們現在回頭，他們就會轉以背對我們作戰。$b$b<莫格萊尼搖了搖頭。>$b$b不，他們只有一個選擇，唯一的結果:天啟!$b$b在我們對話的當下，他們準備進行最後一擊。$b$b巫妖王在等著你回去，勇士。他就在死亡止境俯看著我們。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12778;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "巫妖王命令你徹底滅絕血色十字軍。$B$B使用霜育號角召喚一隻霜育鎮壓者，殺死150名血色士兵和摧毀10台血色弩砲。避開他們的彈道以閃躲來襲的砲火!", Objectives AC enUS : "The Lich King has commanded you to eradicate the Scarlet Crusade.$B$BUse the Horn of the Frostbrood to call forth a Frostbrood Vanquisher and with it slay 150 Scarlet Soldiers and destroy 10 Scarlet Ballistas. Avoid incoming projectiles by moving out of their line of fire!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Lich King has commanded you to eradicate the Scarlet Crusade.$b$bUse the Horn of the Frostbrood to call forth a Frostbrood Vanquisher and with it slay 150 Scarlet Soldiers and destroy 10 Scarlet Ballistas. Avoid incoming projectiles by moving out of their line of fire!",  OLD Details : "你已經屠殺了無數的部隊，但你黑暗的心靈卻渴望著更多。你的飢渴永遠也沒有滿足的一天，$n。<巫妖王停頓了一下。>$B$B所有事物都需要終結，死亡騎士。血色十字軍對我們發動了最後的攻勢。對他們而言，已經沒有退路...沒有選擇。也因此他們會以你從未見識過兇殘來戰鬥。$B$B用這個號角來召喚我麾下的一頭巨龍。爬上它的背並指揮它進入戰鬥。靠著它你將會終結血色十字軍。", Details AC enUS : "You have slaughtered legions beyond number and still your dark heart craves more. Your hunger knows no end, $N.$B$B<The Lich King pauses.>$B$BThere must come an end to all things, death knight. The Scarlet armies make their final stand against us. For them, there is no escape... no choice. And for this reason they will fight with a ferocity that you have yet to witness.$B$BUse this horn to call forth one of my wyrms. Climb upon its back and command it into battle. With it you will end the Scarlet Crusade." ; Wowhead enUS : "You have slaughtered legions beyond number and still your dark heart craves more. Your hunger knows no end, $n.$b$b<The Lich King pauses.>$b$bThere must come an end to all things, death knight. The Scarlet armies make their final stand against us. For them, there is no escape... no choice. And for this reason they will fight with a ferocity that you have yet to witness.$b$bUse this horn to call forth one of my wyrms. Climb upon its back and command it into battle. With it you will end the Scarlet Crusade.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "殺死血色士兵", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Scarlet Soldiers slain" ; Wowhead enUS : "Hearthglen Crusader",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "摧毀血色弩砲", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "Scarlet Ballista destroyed" ; Wowhead enUS : "Tirisfal Crusader",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Scarlet Soldier Proxy",  OLD Objectivetext4 : "", Objectivetext4 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Scarlet Ballista destroyed"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '巫妖王命令你徹底滅絕血色十字軍。$b$b使用霜育號角召喚一隻霜育鎮壓者，殺死150名血色士兵和摧毀10台血色弩砲。避開他們的彈道以閃躲來襲的砲火!', `Details` = '你已經屠殺了無數的部隊，但你黑暗的心靈卻渴望著更多。你的飢渴永遠也沒有滿足的一天，$n。<巫妖王停頓了一下。>$b$b所有事物都需要終結，死亡騎士。血色十字軍對我們發動了最後的攻勢。對他們而言，已經沒有退路...沒有選擇。也因此他們會以你從未見識過兇殘來戰鬥。$b$b用這個號角來召喚我麾下的一頭巨龍。爬上它的背並指揮它進入戰鬥。靠著它你將會終結血色十字軍。', `Objectivetext1` = '壁爐谷十字軍', `Objectivetext2` = '提里斯法十字軍', `Objectivetext3` = '血色士兵代理人', `Objectivetext4` = '摧毀血色弩砲', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12779;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "敵人的敵人", Title AC enUS : "DEPRICATED>>Enemy of Our Enemy" ; Wowhead enUS : "DEPRICATED>>Enemy of Our Enemy",  OLD Objectives : "聖光止境的瑞安娜中士要你和黯黑守望的史戴芬談談，並且提供你的協助。", Objectives AC enUS : "Sergeant Riannah in Light's Breach wants you to speak with Stefan in Ebon Watch and offer your assistance." ; Wowhead enUS : "Sergeant Riannah in Light's Breach wants you to speak with Stefan in Ebon Watch and offer your assistance.",  OLD Details : "儘管和死亡騎士一起工作十分令人不快，但我們實在不適合這裡挑剔自己的盟友。$b$b我們現在夾在天譴軍團與野蠻的德拉克瑞之間，他們都恨不得毀滅我們，好讓他們可以彼此廝殺。$b$b往西方前去黯黑守望，和史戴芬談談，看看你能不能提供他協助。", Details AC enUS : "As much as we find working with death knights distasteful, we cannot afford to be picky about our allies here.$b$bWe're pinched between the Scourge and the savage Drakkari, who want nothing more than to destroy us so that they can get at one another.$b$bTravel west to Ebon Watch. Speak with Stefan and see if you can be of service to him." ; Wowhead enUS : "As much as we find working with death knights distasteful, we cannot afford to be picky about our allies here.$b$bWe're pinched between the Scourge and the savage Drakkari, who want nothing more than to destroy us so that they can get at one another.$b$bTravel west to Ebon Watch. Speak with Stefan and see if you can be of service to him."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '敌人的敌人', `Objectives` = '圣光据点的莉安娜中士要你去跟黑锋哨站的斯特凡谈一谈，并向他提供帮助。', `Details` = '虽然和死亡骑士打交道很讨厌，但在这里，我们没法对盟友太挑剔。$b$b我们被夹在了天灾军团和野蛮的达卡莱巨魔中间，两者都想干掉我们，然后合兵一处。$b$b到西边的黑锋哨站去找斯特凡谈一谈，看看你有什么能帮忙的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12780;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "歡迎！", Title AC enUS : "Welcome!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Welcome!",  OLD Objectives : "將黑鋒要塞禮品券交給黑鋒要塞的女妖希奧克絲。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring the Ebon Hold Gift Voucher to Siouxsie the Banshee in Ebon Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the Ebon Hold Gift Voucher to Siouxsie the Banshee in Ebon Hold.",  OLD Details : "歡迎來到魔獸世界！$B$B為了感謝您購買魔獸世界典藏版，請將這張禮券交給黑鋒要塞的女妖希奧克絲。您將得到一份特別的禮物：陪伴您踏上冒險旅途的小寵物！$B$B再次感謝您的支持，請盡情享受魔獸世界的樂趣吧！", Details AC enUS : "Welcome to the World of Warcraft!$B$BAs special thanks for purchasing the World of Warcraft Collector's Edition, turn in this gift voucher to Siouxsie the Banshee in Ebon Hold.  You'll then be given a gift: a little companion to join you on your quest for adventure and glory.$B$BThanks again, and enjoy your stay in the World of Warcraft!$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Welcome to the World of Warcraft!$b$bAs special thanks for purchasing the World of Warcraft Collector's Edition, turn in this gift voucher to Siouxsie the Banshee in Ebon Hold. You'll then be given a gift: a little companion to join you on your quest for adventure and glory.$b$bThanks again, and enjoy your stay in the World of Warcraft!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '歡迎!', `Objectives` = '將黯黑堡禮品券交給黯黑堡的『女妖』席厄克希。', `Details` = '歡迎來到魔獸世界!$b$b為了感謝您購買《魔獸世界》典藏版，請將這張禮券交給黯黑堡的『女妖』席厄克希。您將得到一份特別的禮物:陪伴您踏上冒險旅途的小夥伴!$b$b再次感謝您的支持，請盡情享受魔獸世界的樂趣吧!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12781;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "$n，巫妖王的侵略肆虐著我們。如果要把他趕回他的冰封王座，部落與聯盟必須同舟共濟。在撒塔斯的聖光露臺成立了一個新同盟。$B$B為了要援助和巫妖王的艱苦奮戰，前往聖光露臺的新藥劑師營地，和大藥劑師普崔司談談。他進行危急調查想辦法結束這場殭屍瘟疫。他的解藥是我們的救星。$B$B動作快，$n，每秒鐘都有一條無辜的生命喪失。", Details AC enUS : "$n, the Lich King plagues us with invasion.  To beat him back to his frozen throne, the Horde and Alliance must stand resolute together.  In Shattrath, in the Terrace of Light, that alliance has been struck.$B$BTo aid our struggle against the Lich King, go to the new apothecary camp in the Terrace of Light and speak with Grand Apothecary Putress.  He leads desperate research to end the zombie plague.  His cure is our salvation.$B$BBe swift, $n.  Each moment passed is another innocent life lost." ; Wowhead enUS : "$n, the Lich King plagues us with invasion. To beat him back to his frozen throne, the Horde and Alliance must stand resolute together. In Shattrath, in the Terrace of Light, that alliance has been struck.$b$bTo aid our struggle against the Lich King, go to the new apothecary camp in the Terrace of Light and speak with Grand Apothecary Putress. He leads desperate research to end the zombie plague. His cure is our salvation.$b$bBe swift, $n. Each moment passed is another innocent life lost."
