-- AC datas : OLD Details : "叛徒。我們海迪尼爾討厭她們。$B$B華爾基倫的居民該受的懲罰已經拖了太久了。在我們對索林姆保持忠誠的時候，她們卻成了巫妖王的走狗!$B$B她們把受到他恩賜的人稱為華爾琪。他們用長滿羽翼的雙翅飛行，就像鷹身人一樣。$B$B你可以在西北邊遠方找到華爾基倫，在風暴神殿的後方。殺死那些長翅膀的母狼，姊妹。殺死她們，我就會用我珍藏的物品來獎勵你。", Details AC enUS : "Traitors.  We Hyldnir have little love for them.$B$BThe dwellers of Valkyrion have gone unpunished for far too long.  While we remained loyal to Thorim, they became the Lich King's lapdogs!$B$BThey call the ones who receive his gift val'kyr.  They fly on feathered wings, like the harpies they are.$B$BYou will find Valkyrion far to the northwest, beyond the Temple of Storms.  Slay these winged she-wolves, sister.  Slay them and I will reward you with one of my most prized possessions." ; Wowhead enUS : "Traitors. We Hyldnir have little love for them.$b$bThe dwellers of Valkyrion have gone unpunished for far too long. While we remained loyal to Thorim, they became the Lich King's lapdogs!$b$bThey call the ones who receive his gift val'kyr. They fly on feathered wings, like the harpies they are.$b$bYou will find Valkyrion far to the northwest, beyond the Temple of Storms. Slay these winged she-wolves, sister. Slay them and I will reward you with one of my most prized possessions.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Nascent Val'kyr slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '叛徒。我們海迪尼爾討厭她們。$b$b華爾基倫的居民該受的懲罰已經拖了太久了。在我們對索林姆保持忠誠的時候，她們卻成了巫妖王的走狗!$b$b她們把受到他恩賜的人稱為華爾琪。他們用長滿羽翼的雙翅飛行，就像鷹身人一樣。$b$b你可以在西北邊遠方找到華爾基倫，在風暴神殿的後方。殺死那些長翅膀的母狼，姊妹。殺死她們，我就會用我珍藏的物品來獎勵你。', `Objectivetext1` = '初生的華爾琪 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12942;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "『強者』烏弗蘭族長坐在他的大廳裡控制著整個蠻荒岩臺。我研究過他，這位族長是個有耐性的維酷人，滿腦子都是策略與征戰。他也偏好待在後方，不想過度涉入戰鬥之中。$B$B我要他死!$B$B我已經寫下一道敕令。站在族長面前，把它大聲唸出來。$B$B<公爵富饒興味地抬起眉毛。>$B$B這應該...至少會讓他焦躁起來。", Details AC enUS : "Thane Ufrang the Mighty sits within his hall overlooking the Savage Ledge. I've studied him. The thane is a patient vrykul, with a head for strategy and warfare. He's also shown a penchant for biding his time and not wanting to overplay his hand in the ongoing battle.$B$BI need him dead!$B$BI've written a decree. Stand before the thane and read it aloud.$B$B<The duke arches his eyebrow in amusement.>$B$BIt should... unnerve him at the least." ; Wowhead enUS : "Thane Ufrang the Mighty sits within his hall overlooking the Savage Ledge. I've studied him. The thane is a patient vrykul, with a head for strategy and warfare. He's also shown a penchant for biding his time and not wanting to overplay his hand in the ongoing battle.$b$bI need him dead!$b$bI've written a decree. Stand before the thane and read it aloud.$b$b<The duke arches his eyebrow in amusement.>$b$bIt should... unnerve him at the least.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Thane Ufrang the Mighty slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '『強者』烏弗蘭族長坐在他的大廳裡控制著整個蠻荒岩臺。我研究過他，這位族長是個有耐性的維酷人，滿腦子都是策略與征戰。他也偏好待在後方，不想過度涉入戰鬥之中。$b$b我要他死!$b$b我已經寫下一道敕令。站在族長面前，把它大聲唸出來。$b$b<公爵富饒興味地抬起眉毛。>$b$b這應該...至少會讓他焦躁起來。', `Objectivetext1` = '『強者』烏弗蘭族長 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 12943;
