-- AC datas : OLD Details : "$C，鐐銬鑰匙就掛在外頭那個講師賀洛迦的脖子上。$B$B你只需要讓他的腦袋與脖子分家，就可以拿到鑰匙了對吧?", Details AC enUS : "$C, the key to my shackles is hanging around the neck of Instructor Hroegar outside.$B$BPerhaps you could retrieve it by separating his head from his shoulders?" ; Wowhead enUS : "$c, the key to my shackles is hanging around the neck of Instructor Hroegar outside.$b$bPerhaps you could retrieve it by separating his head from his shoulders?"
