-- AC datas : OLD Details : "這樣應該就行了！$b$b那些邪惡的神棍還想把更多靈魂放進他們的噁心果汁？ 我說我們就幫他們一把！$b$b來把這乾了－別擔心，我複製了很多…我幾乎敢保證這唯一的效果是當你殺掉一個教徒以後幫你找出他的靈魂菁華。$b$b等你蒐集到一定的量，就把那坨扭曲惡靈的苦痛糾結凝塊扔進任何一個鍋子$b$b讓他們嚐嚐自食惡果的滋味！", Details AC enUS : "This should do the trick!$b$bThose twisted hooligans are looking for souls to put in their crazy-juice? Then I say we help 'em out a bit!$b$bTake a swig of this - don't worry, I've diluted it plenty... Its only effect will be to detect any cultist's essence once you've defeated them.$b$bWhen you've collected a bunch of essences, throw the writhing mass of twisted souls into any of their cauldrons.$b$bLet's see how they like a taste of their own medicine!" ; Wowhead enUS : "This should do the trick!$b$bThose twisted hooligans are looking for souls to put in their crazy-juice? Then I say we help 'em out a bit!$b$bTake a swig of this - don't worry, I've diluted it plenty... Its only effect will be to detect any cultist's essence once you've defeated them.$b$bWhen you've collected a bunch of essences, throw the writhing mass of twisted souls into any of their cauldrons.$b$bLet's see how they like a taste of their own medicine!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '這樣應該就行了！$b$b那些邪惡的神棍還想把更多靈魂放進他們的噁心果汁？ 我說我們就幫他們一把！$b$b來把這乾了 - 別擔心，我複製了很多…我幾乎敢保證這唯一的效果是當你殺掉一個教徒以後幫你找出他的靈魂菁華。$b$b等你蒐集到一定的量，就把那坨扭曲惡靈的苦痛糾結凝塊扔進任何一個鍋子$b$b讓他們嚐嚐自食惡果的滋味！', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13356;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "好啦，$g朋友:小姐;，是時候安置點蟲子了。$b$b別緊張，我不是說真的蟲子，但同樣可以達到目的。$b$b在奧多薩的北部，詛咒神教的虛無召喚者奴役了一些惡魔爪牙。使用節杖來從被奴役的爪牙的屍體上吸取一些黑暗物質，然後用在天譴召喚水晶來讓我們的小間諜現身。$b$b直到它被發現之前，黑暗信差都會作為我們的眼睛，暗中地偵察敵人的一舉一動。", Details AC enUS : "Alright, $g friend:missy;, time to plant a bug.$b$bRelax, it's not a bug exactly, but it'll serve our purposes.$b$bIn the northern portion of Aldur'thar, the cult's void summoners enslave demonic minions. Use this rod to siphon the dark matter from the corpses of these enslaved minions, and then use the cultists' summoning crystal to bring our little spy into being.$b$bUntil it is discovered, the messenger will serve as our eyes and ears, discreetly observing the actions of our enemy." ; Wowhead enUS : "Alright, $gfriend:missy, time to plant a bug.$b$bRelax, it's not a bug exactly, but it'll serve our purposes.$b$bIn the northern portion of Aldur'thar, the cult's void summoners enslave demonic minions. Use this rod to siphon the dark matter from the corpses of these enslaved minions, and then use the cultists' summoning crystal to bring our little spy into being.$b$bUntil it is discovered, the messenger will serve as our eyes and ears, discreetly observing the actions of our enemy."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '好啦，$g朋友:小姐，是時候安置點蟲子了。$b$b別緊張，我不是說真的蟲子，但同樣可以達到目的。$b$b在奧多薩的北部，詛咒神教的虛無召喚者奴役了一些惡魔爪牙。使用節杖來從被奴役的爪牙的屍體上吸取一些黑暗物質，然後用在天譴召喚水晶來讓我們的小間諜現身。$b$b直到它被發現之前，黑暗信差都會作為我們的眼睛，暗中地偵察敵人的一舉一動。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13358;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "藍龍一族全數都在此隕落。但現在，一個接著一個，他們被「他」的僕從召回。$B$B他親手將最年長的一些復生。帶回一些幼龍的骨塵給我。我將告訴你他是如何辦到的。", Details AC enUS : "A whole brood of blue dragons fell here.  And now, one by one, they're being raised by his servants.$B$BHe raised the biggest of them all himself.  Bring me some bone dust from the whelps and I'll show you exactly how he did it." ; Wowhead enUS : "A whole brood of blue dragons fell here. And now, one by one, they're being raised by his servants.$b$bHe raised the biggest of them all himself. Bring me some bone dust from the whelps and I'll show you exactly how he did it."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '藍龍一族全數都在此隕落。但現在，一個接著一個，他們被「他」的僕從召回。$b$b他親手將最年長的一些復生。帶回一些幼龍的骨塵給我。我將告訴你他是如何辦到的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13359;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你有好多問題，$n。你是唯一能看到我的人，因為你曾經碰過某個原本是「他」的物品…你想得起來嗎？但我不能就這樣告訴你…那樣「他」會非常生氣。他已經不只是一個王子了…他變成了國王！$B$B到白骨之廷跟我碰面，就在冰冠城塞的北方，你可以自己看看。", Details AC enUS : "You have a lot of questions, $N.  You're the only one who can see me because you touched something that once belonged to him... don't you remember?$B$BYou don't know what it is?  Well I can't just tell you... that would make him really mad.  He's not just a prince anymore... he's the king!$B$BMeet me at the Court of Bones, north of Icecrown Citadel and you can see for yourself." ; Wowhead enUS : "You have a lot of questions, $n. You're the only one who can see me because you touched something that once belonged to him... don't you remember?$b$bYou don't know what it is? Well I can't just tell you... that would make him really mad. He's not just a prince anymore... he's the king!$b$bMeet me at the Court of Bones, north of Icecrown Citadel and you can see for yourself."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你有好多問題，$n。你是唯一能看到我的人，因為你曾經碰過某個原本是「他」的物品…你想得起來嗎？但我不能就這樣告訴你…那樣「他」會非常生氣。他已經不只是一個王子了…他變成了國王！$b$b到白骨之廷跟我碰面，就在冰冠城塞的北方，你可以自己看看。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13360;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "在王子變成國王以前。他打了好多好多仗...但唯一的一次，他差點送了命。$B$B那場戰鬥就在這裡。在你讓我展示事情的經過以後，你就全部都了解了。$B$B找一塊染血之石然後把它撿起來。然後你就會看到一切的經過...", Details AC enUS : "Before the prince became a king, he fought many battles... but only one where he came close to dying.$B$BIt was fought right here.  After you let me show you what happened, you'll understand everything.$B$BFind a bloodstained stone and pick it up from the floor.  You'll see what happened." ; Wowhead enUS : "Before the prince became a king, he fought many battles... but only one where he came close to dying.$b$bIt was fought right here. After you let me show you what happened, you'll understand everything.$b$bFind a bloodstained stone and pick it up from the floor. You'll see what happened."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '在王子變成國王以前。他打了好多好多仗...但唯一的一次，他差點送了命。$b$b那場戰鬥就在這裡。在你讓我展示事情的經過以後，你就全部都了解了。$b$b找一塊染血之石然後把它撿起來。然後你就會看到一切的經過...', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13361;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "現在你知道你要對付的是什麼，$n。一個沒有痛覺...不會後悔...喪失人性的敵人。一個為達目的不擇手段的敵人。$B$B這顆心就是他的弱點而現在他知道你發現了。$B$B如果你還要回去，你最好帶些幫手。他不會再就這樣毫無防備了。", Details AC enUS : "Now you know what you're up against, $N.  An opponent who no longer knows pain... remorse... or humanity.  An opponent who will do anything to get what he wants.$B$BThe heart was his weakness and now he knows you've found it.$B$BIf you're going to go back for it, you'd best bring help.  He will not leave it unguarded again." ; Wowhead enUS : "Now you know what you're up against, $n. An opponent who no longer knows pain... remorse... or humanity. An opponent who will do anything to get what he wants.$b$bThe heart was his weakness and now he knows you've found it.$b$bIf you're going to go back for it, you'd best bring help. He will not leave it unguarded again."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '現在你知道你要對付的是什麼，$n。一個沒有痛覺...不會後悔...喪失人性的敵人。一個為達目的不擇手段的敵人。$b$b這顆心就是他的弱點而現在他知道你發現了。$b$b如果你還要回去，你最好帶些幫手。他不會再就這樣毫無防備了。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13362;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "如你所說的傳言確實流傳在死亡騎士間。我一直以為故事會更...象徵性一點。$B$B我們得警告其他人，但必須非常小心。一旦巫妖王獲悉我們的舉動，他一定會將心臟移往他處－我們不會再得到此般的機會了$B$B聯盟與部落都曾經被詛咒神教滲透過。而黯刃騎士團則太接近天譴軍團。$B$B我們得與提里奧‧弗丁和他的銀白十字軍談談。", Details AC enUS : "There were rumors about the events you speak of among the death knights.  I always expected the story to be more... symbolic.$B$BWe must warn others, but we must be discreet.  As soon as the Lich King knows we're making our move, he'll move the location of the heart -- we'll never get a chance like this again.$B$BThe Horde and the Alliance have been infiltrated by the Cult of the Damned before.  The Ebon Blade operates too close to the Scourge.$B$BWe have to speak to Tirion Fordring and his Argent Crusade." ; Wowhead enUS : "There were rumors about the events you speak of among the death knights. I always expected the story to be more... symbolic.$b$bWe must warn others, but we must be discreet. As soon as the Lich King knows we're making our move, he'll move the location of the heart -- we'll never get a chance like this again.$b$bThe Horde and the Alliance have been infiltrated by the Cult of the Damned before. The Ebon Blade operates too close to the Scourge.$b$bWe have to speak to Tirion Fordring and his Argent Crusade."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '如你所說的傳言確實流傳在死亡騎士間。我一直以為故事會更...象徵性一點。$b$b我們得警告其他人，但必須非常小心。一旦巫妖王獲悉我們的舉動，他一定會將心臟移往他處 - 我們不會再得到此般的機會了$b$b聯盟與部落都曾經被詛咒神教滲透過。而黯刃騎士團則太接近天譴軍團。$b$b我們得與提里奧‧弗丁和他的銀白十字軍談談。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13363;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "就在今晨，我的斥候才告訴我詛咒神教的一行人，正由冰冠城塞帶著一件聖物前往黑暗大教堂。$B$B現在我知道那應該就是阿薩斯的心臟...保存著他最後剩下的一丁點人性。$B$B這是聖光給我們的預兆。只要這聖物尚存在，就表示阿薩斯‧米奈希爾有朝一日還能找回他的人性!$B$B到教堂入口見我。記得帶上教徒侍僧兜帽－我們要喬裝進去。", Details AC enUS : "Just this morning, my scouts informed me of a Cult of the Damned procession leaving from Icecrown Citadel to the Cathedral of Darkness, bearing an artifact.$B$BAnd now I learn that it might be Arthas's own heart... a thing containing the last bit of his remaining humanity.$B$BThis is a sign of the Light.  As long as such an artifact exists, there is a chance that Arthas Menethil can become a man again!$B$BMeet me at the cathedral's entrance.  Be sure to bring a cultist's hood -- we're going incognito." ; Wowhead enUS : "Just this morning, my scouts informed me of a Cult of the Damned procession leaving from Icecrown Citadel to the Cathedral of Darkness, bearing an artifact.$b$bAnd now I learn that it might be Arthas's own heart... a thing containing the last bit of his remaining humanity.$b$bThis is a sign of the Light. As long as such an artifact exists, there is a chance that Arthas Menethil can become a man again!$b$bMeet me at the cathedral's entrance. Be sure to bring a cultist's hood -- we're going incognito.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "提裡奧的決斷", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Tirion's Gambit"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '就在今晨，我的斥候才告訴我詛咒神教的一行人，正由冰冠城塞帶著一件聖物前往黑暗大教堂。$b$b現在我知道那應該就是阿薩斯的心臟...保存著他最後剩下的一丁點人性。$b$b這是聖光給我們的預兆。只要這聖物尚存在，就表示阿薩斯‧米奈希爾有朝一日還能找回他的人性!$b$b到教堂入口見我。記得帶上教徒侍僧兜帽 - 我們要喬裝進去。', `Objectivetext1` = '提里奧的決斷', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13364;
