-- AC datas : OLD Title : "首席技師考伯克拉", Title AC enUS : "Chief Engineer Copperclaw" ; Wowhead enUS : "Chief Engineer Copperclaw",  OLD Objectives : "與首席技師考伯克拉談談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Chief Engineer Copperclaw." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Chief Engineer Copperclaw.",  OLD Details : "與首席技師考伯克拉談談。", Details AC enUS : "Speak with Chief Engineer Copperclaw." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Chief Engineer Copperclaw."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '首席技师考伯克拉', `Objectives` = '与首席技师考伯克拉谈谈。', `Details` = '与首席技师考伯克拉谈谈。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13378;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "與邊緣技師塔茲拉談一談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Fringe Engineer Tezzla." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Fringe Engineer Tezzla.",  OLD Details : "你應該去見一見塔茲拉。嗯，你真的應該去見見她。她掌握了一種被稱為“綠外線”的新波長。她可以使用這種光波在天災軍團的眼皮底下隱藏行跡！距離之近，足夠轟炸他們了！$B$B我會給你綠外線視界，這樣你就可以找到她了。她就藏身在荒涼之門奧爾杜薩上面。去吧，去吧……我知道她一直在為那些急著上西天的英雄提供幫助！我是說……急著把天災軍團送上西天！$B$B另外，$N，聯盟剽竊了我們的技術，他們的隱形機場也在附近。你要繞開那座插著聯盟旗幟的圓頂！", Details AC enUS : "Tezzla is the one you want to meet, yes she is... she mastered a new wavelength, infra-green, and used it to hide herself near the Scourge!  Near enough to bomb them!$B$BI'll give you infra-green vision so you can find her hiding above Aldur'thar, the Desolation Gate.  Go, go... I know she has work for brave heroes eager to blow up!  I mean... eager to blow up the Scourge!$B$BAnd $N, the Alliance has stolen our technology and has their own hidden airport nearby.  Avoid the dome with the Alliance banners!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Tezzla is the one you want to meet, yes she is... she mastered a new wavelength, infra-green, and used it to hide herself near the Scourge! Near enough to bomb them!$b$bI'll give you infra-green vision so you can find her hiding above Aldur'thar, the Desolation Gate. Go, go... I know she has work for brave heroes eager to blow up! I mean... eager to blow up the Scourge!$b$bAnd $n, the Alliance has stolen our technology and has their own hidden airport nearby. Avoid the dome with the Alliance banners!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '與偏激工程師泰茲菈談話。', `Details` = '我想泰茲菈是你要找的人，是的，沒錯...她的專長是一種全新波長的綠外線，專門用來將她自己藏身於天譴軍團附近!近到足以轟炸他們!$b$b我會給你綠外線視覺，好讓你在「荒寂之門」奧多薩上空找到她，去吧...我知道她有些任務要給偏好被炸掉的...呃...我是說偏好炸掉那些天譴軍團的勇士們!$b$b還有$n，聯盟竊取了我們的科技，在附近建立了屬於自己的隱藏機場，總之不要靠近聯盟的旌旗!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13379;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "吉普利·基羅赫斯要你去殺死40個轟炸場步兵、8個轟炸場軍官和15只石像鬼伏擊者。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kibli Killohertz wants you to kill 40 Bombardment Infantry, 8 Bombardment Captains and 15 Gargoyle Ambushers." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kibli Killohertz wants you to kill 40 Bombardment Infantry, 8 Bombardment Captains and 15 Gargoyle Ambushers.",  OLD Details : "綠外線技術可以讓我們在天災軍團的鼻子底下大搖大擺地行動！而且，我們把這種技術應用到了專門製造的轟炸機上……但不是為了隱藏它們，完全不是那麼回事！我們用綠外線技術來保護它們！$B$B去向卡倫·諾爾要一架轟炸機，然後飛到轟炸場上空……用它的護盾和炮臺保護自己，並使用投彈器攻擊天災軍團。好好練習一下，然後再回來找我。我還有很多更重要的任務要交給你呢！", Details AC enUS : "Infra-green technology allows us to stay hidden here, right over the Scourge's nose!  What's more, we installed infra-green in specially constructed bombers... but not to hide them, no!  We use infra-green tech to shield them!$B$BSpeak with Karen No and request a bomber.  Fly it over the Bombardment... use its shields and turret to protect yourself, and use the bomb launcher to hit Scourge targets.  Practice well, then return to me and I'll have an even more vital mission for you!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Infra-green technology allows us to stay hidden here, right over the Scourge's nose! What's more, we installed infra-green in specially constructed bombers... but not to hide them, no! We use infra-green tech to shield them!$b$bSpeak with Karen No and request a bomber. Fly it over the Bombardment... use its shields and turret to protect yourself, and use the bomb launcher to hit Scourge targets. Practice well, then return to me and I'll have an even more vital mission for you!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Enraged Fleshrender",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bombardment Infantry",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Enraged Fleshrender",  OLD Objectivetext4 : "", Objectivetext4 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bombardment Captain slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '吉普利·基罗赫斯要你去杀死40个轰炸场步兵、8个轰炸场军官和15只石像鬼伏击者。', `Details` = '绿外线技术可以让我们在天灾军团的鼻子底下大摇大摆地行动！而且，我们把这种技术应用到了专门制造的轰炸机上……但不是为了隐藏它们，完全不是那么回事！我们用绿外线技术来保护它们！$b$b去向卡伦·诺尔要一架轰炸机，然后飞到轰炸场上空……用它的护盾和炮台保护自己，并使用投弹器攻击天灾军团。好好练习一下，然后再回来找我。我还有很多更重要的任务要交给你呢！', `Objectivetext1` = '狂怒的血肉撕裂者', `Objectivetext2` = '轟炸地步兵', `Objectivetext3` = '狂怒的血肉撕裂者', `Objectivetext4` = '轟炸地隊長 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13380;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "碁伯里·基羅赫茲要你殺掉轟炸地步兵、石像鬼伏擊者、霜育哨兵與天譴戰爭機器。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kibli Killohertz wants you to kill Bombardment Infantry, Gargoyle Ambushers, Frostbrood Sentries and Scourge War Machines." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kibli Killohertz wants you to kill Bombardment Infantry, Gargoyle Ambushers, Frostbrood Sentries and Scourge War Machines.",  OLD Details : "帶好你的幸運符，$n，選篇你最喜歡的禱告辭。下個任務就要測試你的反應跟耐性，好像你丈母娘要來一樣! $B$B找凱倫·諾談話再索取一架轟炸機。駕著它飛越轟炸地深入逝望山谷。這次的目標更多，天上飛的跟地上爬的都有。看好你的護盾，子彈通通上膛，$n！結束以後回來找我。", Details AC enUS : "Put on your lucky socks, $n, and say your favorite prayers.  This next mission will test your wit and fortitude like a visit from the in-laws!$B$BRequest another bomber from Karen No.  Take it beyond The Bombardment and over the Valley of Lost Hope.  You have more targets this time, both on the land an in the air.  Keep your shields charged and your ammo loaded, $n!  I'll see you when it's over." ; Wowhead enUS : "Put on your lucky socks, $n, and say your favorite prayers. This next mission will test your wit and fortitude like a visit from the in-laws!$b$bRequest another bomber from Karen No. Take it beyond The Bombardment and over the Valley of Lost Hope. You have more targets this time, both on the land an in the air. Keep your shields charged and your ammo loaded, $n! I'll see you when it's over.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Enraged Fleshrender",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bombardment Infantry",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Enraged Fleshrender",  OLD Objectivetext4 : "", Objectivetext4 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Gargoyle Ambusher slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '碁伯里‧基羅赫茲要你殺掉轟炸地步兵、石像鬼伏擊者、霜育哨兵與天譴戰爭機器。', `Details` = '帶好你的幸運符，$n，選篇你最喜歡的禱告辭。下個任務就要測試你的反應跟耐性，好像你丈母娘要來一樣!$b$b找凱倫‧諾談話再索取一架轟炸機。駕著它飛越轟炸地深入逝望山谷。這次的目標更多，天上飛的跟地上爬的都有。看好你的護盾，子彈通通上膛，$n!結束以後回來找我。', `Objectivetext1` = '狂怒的血肉撕裂者', `Objectivetext2` = '轟炸地步兵', `Objectivetext3` = '狂怒的血肉撕裂者', `Objectivetext4` = '石像鬼伏擊者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13381;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Enraged Fleshrender",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bombardment Infantry",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Enraged Fleshrender",  OLD Objectivetext4 : "", Objectivetext4 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Gargoyle Ambusher slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectivetext1` = '狂怒的血肉撕裂者', `Objectivetext2` = '轟炸地步兵', `Objectivetext3` = '狂怒的血肉撕裂者', `Objectivetext4` = '石像鬼伏擊者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13382;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "吉普利·基羅赫斯", Title AC enUS : "Killohertz" ; Wowhead enUS : "Killohertz",  OLD Objectives : "首席技師波爾維克要你轉至荒涼之門奧爾杜薩上空的聯盟隱形機場，並與吉普利·基羅赫斯談一談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Chief Engineer Boltwrench wants you to find Kibli Killohertz at the hidden Alliance airport above Aldur'thar, the Desolation Gate." ; Wowhead enUS : "Chief Engineer Boltwrench wants you to find Kibli Killohertz at the hidden Alliance airport above Aldur'thar, the Desolation Gate.",  OLD Details : "地精們幸運地發現了一種新能量。他們管這種能量叫“綠外線”。怎麼說呢……如果這些瘋子發現了一種新的金子，而它居然不是綠的，那我都能變成獨眼食人魔了。$B$B我要你去找吉普利·基羅赫斯。他在荒涼之門奧爾杜薩上空的一座規模隱形聯盟機場上，領導著綠外線的逆向工程研究。我會給你綠外線視界，這樣你就可以找到他了。到插著聯盟旗幟的那座圓頂上去吧——但是如果你飛到部落的機場附近的話，你就會遇到大麻煩了，而且還是綠色的麻煩。", Details AC enUS : "The goblins got lucky and found a new energy.  They call it infra-green, and I'll be a one-eyed ogre if those psychos didn't strike green gold.$B$BGo find Kibli Killohertz.  He's leading the reverse engineering efforts of infra-green, at a small, hidden Alliance airport above Aldur'thar, the Desolation Gate.  I'll give you infra-green vision to help you find it.  Go to the dome with our Alliance banners -- if you fly near the Horde airport then you'll be in a load of green trouble." ; Wowhead enUS : "The goblins got lucky and found a new energy. They call it infra-green, and I'll be a one-eyed ogre if those psychos didn't strike green gold.$b$bGo find Kibli Killohertz. He's leading the reverse engineering efforts of infra-green, at a small, hidden Alliance airport above Aldur'thar, the Desolation Gate. I'll give you infra-green vision to help you find it. Go to the dome with our Alliance banners -- if you fly near the Horde airport then you'll be in a load of green trouble."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '吉普利·基罗赫斯', `Objectives` = '首席技师波尔维克要你前往荒凉之门奥尔杜萨上空的联盟隐形机场，并与吉普利·基罗赫斯谈一谈。', `Details` = '地精们幸运地发现了一种新能量。他们管这种能量叫“绿外线”。怎么说呢……如果这些疯子发现了一种新的金子，而它居然不是绿的，那我都能变成独眼食人魔了。$b$b我要你去找吉普利·基罗赫斯。他在荒凉之门奥尔杜萨上空的一座小型隐形联盟机场上，领导着绿外线的逆向工程研究。我会给你绿外线视界，这样你就可以找到他了。到插着联盟旗帜的那座圆顶上去吧——但是如果你飞到部落的机场附近的话，你就会遇到大麻烦了，而且还是绿色的麻烦。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13383;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "卡薩斯，位於龍骨荒野的龍眠神殿頂端，要你帶著魔法之心回去。$B$B這個任務適用普通難度、10人的永恆之眼副本。", Objectives AC enUS : "Krasus atop Wyrmrest Temple in the Dragonblight wants you to return with the Heart of Magic.$B$BThis quest is for the Normal mode, 10-person version of The Eye of Eternity." ; Wowhead enUS : "Krasus atop Wyrmrest Temple in the Dragonblight wants you to return with the Heart of Magic.$b$bThis quest is for the Normal mode, 10-person version of The Eye of Eternity.",  OLD Details : "現你既已能夠進入聚源虹膜，也該是時候將鑰匙發揮真正的作用了。$B$B儘管我也希望生擒瑪里苟斯，但情勢似乎不容許我們這麼做。事情到了這個關頭，其餘的守護巨龍者認為『織法者』必須...被制裁。$B$B<卡薩斯的最後一句話帶著些許的不安。>$B$B$n，前往永恆之眼，迎戰瑪里苟斯並將魔法之心帶回來。", Details AC enUS : "Now that you have access to the focusing iris it's time to put that key to use.$B$BAs much as I would like to see Malygos brought back into the fold, that's just not going to happen at this point. With everything that's at stake, it is the judgment of the other Dragon Aspects that the Spell-Weaver needs to be put down.$B$B<Krasus says this last with a great deal of trepidation.>$B$B$N, travel to the Eye of Eternity, confront Malygos and return with the Heart of Magic." ; Wowhead enUS : "Now that you have access to the focusing iris it's time to put that key to use.$b$bAs much as I would like to see Malygos brought back into the fold, that's just not going to happen at this point. With everything that's at stake, it is the judgment of the other Dragon Aspects that the Spell-Weaver needs to be put down.$b$b<Krasus says this last with a great deal of trepidation.>$b$b$n, travel to the Eye of Eternity, confront Malygos and return with the Heart of Magic."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '卡薩斯，位於龍骨荒野的龍眠神殿頂端，要你帶著魔法之心回去。$b$b這個任務適用普通難度、10人的永恆之眼副本。', `Details` = '現你既已能夠進入聚源虹膜，也該是時候將鑰匙發揮真正的作用了。$b$b儘管我也希望生擒瑪里苟斯，但情勢似乎不容許我們這麼做。事情到了這個關頭，其餘的守護巨龍者認為『織法者』必須...被制裁。$b$b<卡薩斯的最後一句話帶著些許的不安。>$b$b$n，前往永恆之眼，迎戰瑪里苟斯並將魔法之心帶回來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13384;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "卡薩斯，位於龍骨荒野的龍眠神殿頂端，要你帶著魔法之心回去。$B$B這個任務適用英雄難度、25人的永恆之眼副本。", Objectives AC enUS : "Krasus atop Wyrmrest Temple in the Dragonblight wants you to return with the Heart of Magic.$B$BThis quest is for the Heroic mode, 25-person version of The Eye of Eternity." ; Wowhead enUS : "Krasus atop Wyrmrest Temple in the Dragonblight wants you to return with the Heart of Magic.$b$bThis quest is for the Heroic mode, 25-person version of The Eye of Eternity.",  OLD Details : "現你既已能夠進入聚源虹膜，也該是時候將鑰匙發揮真正的作用了。$B$B儘管我也希望生擒瑪里苟斯，但情勢似乎不容許我們這麼做。事情到了這個關頭，其餘的守護巨龍者認為『織法者』必須...被制裁。$B$B<卡薩斯的最後一句話帶著些許的不安。>$B$B$n，前往永恆之眼，迎戰瑪里苟斯並將魔法之心帶回來。", Details AC enUS : "Now that you have access to the focusing iris it's time to put that key to use.$B$BAs much as I would like to see Malygos brought back into the fold, that's just not going to happen at this point. With everything that's at stake, it is the judgment of the other Dragon Aspects that the Spell-Weaver needs to be put down.$B$B<Krasus says this last with a great deal of trepidation.>$B$B$N, travel to the Eye of Eternity, confront Malygos and return with the Heart of Magic." ; Wowhead enUS : "Now that you have access to the focusing iris it's time to put that key to use.$b$bAs much as I would like to see Malygos brought back into the fold, that's just not going to happen at this point. With everything that's at stake, it is the judgment of the other Dragon Aspects that the Spell-Weaver needs to be put down.$b$b<Krasus says this last with a great deal of trepidation.>$b$b$n, travel to the Eye of Eternity, confront Malygos and return with the Heart of Magic."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '卡薩斯，位於龍骨荒野的龍眠神殿頂端，要你帶著魔法之心回去。$b$b這個任務適用英雄難度、25人的永恆之眼副本。', `Details` = '現你既已能夠進入聚源虹膜，也該是時候將鑰匙發揮真正的作用了。$b$b儘管我也希望生擒瑪里苟斯，但情勢似乎不容許我們這麼做。事情到了這個關頭，其餘的守護巨龍者認為『織法者』必須...被制裁。$b$b<卡薩斯的最後一句話帶著些許的不安。>$b$b$n，前往永恆之眼，迎戰瑪里苟斯並將魔法之心帶回來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13385;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我有個有趣的任務要交給你，$n。假定你有興趣接受挑戰的話。$B$B我們得知冰冠城塞下方有一個缺口。我們的工程師研究了建築結構，並推定它是一個結構上的弱點。$B$B我們已經派了一些人手，帶著我們「借來」的薩鋼炸彈前往該處，由坎達爾上尉指揮。$B$B只要略施援手，我們就可以給天譴軍一記迎頭重擊。你怎麼說，$n？", Details AC enUS : "I've got an interesting assignment for you, $N.  If you're up for a challenge, that is.$B$BWe've been tipped off about an opening below Icecrown Citadel.  Our engineers have studied the layout and have decided it's a structural weakness.$B$BWe've sent some men there along with some "borrowed" saronite bombs.  They're under Captain Kendall's command.$B$BWith a little help we could deal a huge blow to the forces of the Scourge.  What do you say, $N?" ; Wowhead enUS : "I've got an interesting assignment for you, $n. If you're up for a challenge, that is.$b$bWe've been tipped off about an opening below Icecrown Citadel. Our engineers have studied the layout and have decided it's a structural weakness.$b$bWe've sent some men there along with some "borrowed" saronite bombs. They're under Captain Kendall's command.$b$bWith a little help we could deal a huge blow to the forces of the Scourge. What do you say, $n?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我有個有趣的任務要交給你，$n。假定你有興趣接受挑戰的話。$b$b我們得知冰冠城塞下方有一個缺口。我們的工程師研究了建築結構，並推定它是一個結構上的弱點。$b$b我們已經派了一些人手，帶著我們「借來」的薩鋼炸彈前往該處，由坎達爾上尉指揮。$b$b只要略施援手，我們就可以給天譴軍一記迎頭重擊。你怎麼說，$n？', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13386;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你該走了。我身後有個傳送門。它將帶你回到地表。$B$B我們會再見。「他」還在找你。$B$B等「他」找到你只是遲早的事。", Details AC enUS : "You should leave now.  You'll find a portal behind me.  It'll take you to the surface.$B$BWe'll meet again.  He'll be looking for you.$B$BIt's only a matter of time until he finds you." ; Wowhead enUS : "You should leave now. You'll find a portal behind me. It'll take you to the surface.$b$bWe'll meet again. He'll be looking for you.$b$bIt's only a matter of time until he finds you."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你該走了。我身後有個傳送門。它將帶你回到地表。$b$b我們會再見。「他」還在找你。$b$b等「他」找到你只是遲早的事。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13392;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你要用這玩意對付天譴軍團？我想你大概贏不了。$B$B我相信你能摧毀大概上百…甚至上千個天譴軍，但還是沒用的。至少在這個情況沒有用。$B$B等你玩夠了再來北邊找我，那兒有個老舊的駐軍營地。我會讓你了解你真正要面對的敵人。", Details AC enUS : "You're going to use this machine against the Scourge?  You're not going to win against them like that.$B$BYou can destroy hundreds... even thousands of them.  But you won't win.  Not out here.$B$BWhen you're done playing with your machine, meet me to the north.  There is an old army encampment.  What I will show you will teach you a little bit about who you're up against." ; Wowhead enUS : "You're going to use this machine against the Scourge? You're not going to win against them like that.$b$bYou can destroy hundreds... even thousands of them. But you won't win. Not out here.$b$bWhen you're done playing with your machine, meet me to the north. There is an old army encampment. What I will show you will teach you a little bit about who you're up against.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Decomposed Ghoul slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Frostskull Magus slain",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bone Giant slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你要用這玩意對付天譴軍團？我想你大概贏不了。$b$b我相信你能摧毀大概上百…甚至上千個天譴軍，但還是沒用的。至少在這個情況沒有用。$b$b等你玩夠了再來北邊找我，那兒有個老舊的駐軍營地。我會讓你了解你真正要面對的敵人。', `Objectivetext1` = '被分解的食屍鬼 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '霜顱魔導師 消滅', `Objectivetext3` = '骸骨巨人 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13394;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你大概以為你很厲害--打敗這些不死生物，用你的戰爭機器壓碎他們的骸骨。$B$B但這跟創造他們的力量比起來微不足道。$B$B我曾經看過王子殿下親自表演。我可以示範給你看...如果你想的話。", Details AC enUS : "You probably think you're quite strong -- fighting these undead and crushing their bones beneath your war machines.$B$BThat is nothing compared to the strength it took to create them.$B$BI saw the prince do it himself.  I can show you how it happened... if you'd like." ; Wowhead enUS : "You probably think you're quite strong -- fighting these undead and crushing their bones beneath your war machines.$b$bThat is nothing compared to the strength it took to create them.$b$bI saw the prince do it himself. I can show you how it happened... if you'd like."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你大概以為你很厲害--打敗這些不死生物，用你的戰爭機器壓碎他們的骸骨。$b$b但這跟創造他們的力量比起來微不足道。$b$b我曾經看過王子殿下親自表演。我可以示範給你看...如果你想的話。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13395;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你真的天生適合這行，$n。你瞧，通常當我指派任務給其他士兵。他們完成的機率大概一半一半，至於回來的機率...呃，大概要再少一點。$B$B但是你，永遠是使命必達。就像地精鐘錶一樣精準!$B$B總之呢，我還有任務給你。辛德拉苟莎之殞，就在山谷東邊。那邊有許多的教徒正蠢蠢欲動，更別提冰霜巨龍的紛擾。我要你去給我教訓那些傢伙。$B$B我討厭那些教徒。", Details AC enUS : "You're a real star, $N.  See, when I give one of these other soldiers an assignment, the odds of them getting it done are about fifty-fifty.  The odds of them coming back... well, slightly worse.$B$BBut with you, it's always a guaranteed thing.  Like gnomish clockwork!$B$BAnyway, I have another one for you.  Sindragosa's Fall, east of the valley.  There is some serious cultist activity, including and not limited to, the raising of frost wyrms.  I need you to go kick their teeth in.$B$BI hate cultists." ; Wowhead enUS : "You're a real star, $n. See, when I give one of these other soldiers an assignment, the odds of them getting it done are about fifty-fifty. The odds of them coming back... well, slightly worse.$b$bBut with you, it's always a guaranteed thing. Like gnomish clockwork!$b$bAnyway, I have another one for you. Sindragosa's Fall, east of the valley. There is some serious cultist activity, including and not limited to, the raising of frost wyrms. I need you to go kick their teeth in.$b$bI hate cultists.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wyrm Reanimator slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Cultist Corrupter slain",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Vrykul Necrolord slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你真的天生適合這行，$n。你瞧，通常當我指派任務給其他士兵。他們完成的機率大概一半一半，至於回來的機率...呃，大概要再少一點。$b$b但是你，永遠是使命必達。就像地精鐘錶一樣精準!$b$b總之呢，我還有任務給你。辛德拉苟莎之殞，就在山谷東邊。那邊有許多的教徒正蠢蠢欲動，更別提冰霜巨龍的紛擾。我要你去給我教訓那些傢伙。$b$b我討厭那些教徒。', `Objectivetext1` = '巨龍復生者 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '教徒墮落者 消滅', `Objectivetext3` = '維酷死靈領主 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13397;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "藍龍一族全數都在此隕落。但現在，一個接著一個，他們被「他」的僕從召回。$B$B他親手將最年長的一些復生。帶回一些幼龍的骨塵給我。我將告訴你他是如何辦到的。", Details AC enUS : "A whole brood of blue dragons fell here.  And now, one by one, they're being raised by his servants.$B$BHe raised the biggest of them all himself.  Bring me some bone dust from the whelps and I'll show you exactly how he did it." ; Wowhead enUS : "A whole brood of blue dragons fell here. And now, one by one, they're being raised by his servants.$b$bHe raised the biggest of them all himself. Bring me some bone dust from the whelps and I'll show you exactly how he did it."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '藍龍一族全數都在此隕落。但現在，一個接著一個，他們被「他」的僕從召回。$b$b他親手將最年長的一些復生。帶回一些幼龍的骨塵給我。我將告訴你他是如何辦到的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13398;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你有好多問題，$n。你是唯一能看到我的人，因為你曾經碰過某個原本是「他」的物品…你想得起來嗎？但我不能就這樣告訴你…那樣「他」會非常生氣。他已經不只是一個王子了…他變成了國王！$B$B到白骨之廷跟我碰面，就在冰冠城塞的北方，你可以自己看看。", Details AC enUS : "You have a lot of questions, $N.  You're the only one who can see me because you touched something that once belonged to him... don't you remember?$B$BYou don't know what it is?  Well I can't just tell you... that would make him really mad.  He's not just a prince anymore... he's the king!$B$BMeet me at the Court of Bones, north of Icecrown Citadel and you can see for yourself." ; Wowhead enUS : "You have a lot of questions, $n. You're the only one who can see me because you touched something that once belonged to him... don't you remember?$b$bYou don't know what it is? Well I can't just tell you... that would make him really mad. He's not just a prince anymore... he's the king!$b$bMeet me at the Court of Bones, north of Icecrown Citadel and you can see for yourself."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你有好多問題，$n。你是唯一能看到我的人，因為你曾經碰過某個原本是「他」的物品…你想得起來嗎？但我不能就這樣告訴你…那樣「他」會非常生氣。他已經不只是一個王子了…他變成了國王！$b$b到白骨之廷跟我碰面，就在冰冠城塞的北方，你可以自己看看。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13399;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "在王子變成國王以前。他打了好多好多仗...但唯一的一次，他差點送了命。$B$B那場戰鬥就在這裡。在你讓我展示事情的經過以後，你就全部都了解了。$B$B找一塊染血之石然後把它撿起來。然後你就會看到一切的經過...", Details AC enUS : "Before the prince became a king, he fought many battles... but only one where he came close to dying.$B$BIt was fought right here.  After you let me show you what happened, you'll understand everything.$B$BFind a bloodstained stone and pick it up from the floor.  You'll see what happened." ; Wowhead enUS : "Before the prince became a king, he fought many battles... but only one where he came close to dying.$b$bIt was fought right here. After you let me show you what happened, you'll understand everything.$b$bFind a bloodstained stone and pick it up from the floor. You'll see what happened."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '在王子變成國王以前。他打了好多好多仗...但唯一的一次，他差點送了命。$b$b那場戰鬥就在這裡。在你讓我展示事情的經過以後，你就全部都了解了。$b$b找一塊染血之石然後把它撿起來。然後你就會看到一切的經過...', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13400;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "現在你知道你要對付的是什麼，$n。一個沒有痛覺...不會後悔...喪失人性的敵人。一個為達目的不擇手段的敵人。$B$B這顆心就是他的弱點而現在他知道你發現了。$B$B如果你還要回去，你最好帶些幫手。他不會再就這樣毫無防備了。", Details AC enUS : "Now you know what you're up against, $N.  An opponent who no longer knows pain... remorse... or humanity.  An opponent who will do anything to get what he wants.$B$BThe heart was his weakness and now he knows you've found it.$B$BIf you're going to go back for it, you'd best bring help.  He will not leave it unguarded again." ; Wowhead enUS : "Now you know what you're up against, $n. An opponent who no longer knows pain... remorse... or humanity. An opponent who will do anything to get what he wants.$b$bThe heart was his weakness and now he knows you've found it.$b$bIf you're going to go back for it, you'd best bring help. He will not leave it unguarded again."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '現在你知道你要對付的是什麼，$n。一個沒有痛覺...不會後悔...喪失人性的敵人。一個為達目的不擇手段的敵人。$b$b這顆心就是他的弱點而現在他知道你發現了。$b$b如果你還要回去，你最好帶些幫手。他不會再就這樣毫無防備了。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13401;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "這不是我第一次聽到有關阿薩斯這顆心臟的故事...一直以為這是某些人編來吹噓的故事。$B$B我們必須立刻行動。不幸地，我們必須秘密進行。$B$B阿薩斯的眼線遍佈四周，如果他發現，那我們的計畫就會付諸流水。$B$B我們必須尋求白銀十字軍的協助。那裡每個聖騎士都是由提里奧親手挑選。如果說有哪處尚未被教徒滲透，那就是他們。", Details AC enUS : "It's not the first time I've heard that story about Arthas and his heart... always thought it was some made-up tale to impress the rank and file.$B$BWe must act on this information immediately.  Unfortunately, we must do so in secret.$B$BArthas's agents are everywhere and if he finds out, our plan is dead in the water.$B$BWe need to take this to the Argent Crusade.  Every single paladin in that order was hand-picked by Tirion himself.  If there's anyone free of cultist infiltration, it's those guys." ; Wowhead enUS : "It's not the first time I've heard that story about Arthas and his heart... always thought it was some made-up tale to impress the rank and file.$b$bWe must act on this information immediately. Unfortunately, we must do so in secret.$b$bArthas's agents are everywhere and if he finds out, our plan is dead in the water.$b$bWe need to take this to the Argent Crusade. Every single paladin in that order was hand-picked by Tirion himself. If there's anyone free of cultist infiltration, it's those guys."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '這不是我第一次聽到有關阿薩斯這顆心臟的故事...一直以為這是某些人編來吹噓的故事。$b$b我們必須立刻行動。不幸地，我們必須秘密進行。$b$b阿薩斯的眼線遍佈四周，如果他發現，那我們的計畫就會付諸流水。$b$b我們必須尋求白銀十字軍的協助。那裡每個聖騎士都是由提里奧親手挑選。如果說有哪處尚未被教徒滲透，那就是他們。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13402;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "就在今晨，我的斥候才告訴我詛咒神教的一行人，正由冰冠城塞帶著一件聖物前往黑暗大教堂。$B$B現在我知道那應該就是阿薩斯的心臟...保存著他最後剩下的一丁點人性。$B$B這是聖光給我們的預兆。只要這聖物尚存在，就表示阿薩斯‧米奈希爾有朝一日還能找回他的人性!$B$B到教堂入口見我。記得帶上教徒侍僧兜帽－我們要喬裝進去。", Details AC enUS : "Just this morning, my scouts informed me of a Cult of the Damned procession leaving from Icecrown Citadel to the Cathedral of Darkness, bearing an artifact.$B$BAnd now I learn that it might be Arthas's own heart... a thing containing the last bit of his remaining humanity.$B$BThis is a sign of the Light.  As long as such an artifact exists, there is a chance that Arthas Menethil can become a man again!$B$BMeet me at the cathedral's entrance.  Be sure to bring a cultist's hood -- we're going incognito." ; Wowhead enUS : "Just this morning, my scouts informed me of a Cult of the Damned procession leaving from Icecrown Citadel to the Cathedral of Darkness, bearing an artifact.$b$bAnd now I learn that it might be Arthas's own heart... a thing containing the last bit of his remaining humanity.$b$bThis is a sign of the Light. As long as such an artifact exists, there is a chance that Arthas Menethil can become a man again!$b$bMeet me at the cathedral's entrance. Be sure to bring a cultist's hood -- we're going incognito.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "提裡奧的決斷", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Tirion's Gambit"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '就在今晨，我的斥候才告訴我詛咒神教的一行人，正由冰冠城塞帶著一件聖物前往黑暗大教堂。$b$b現在我知道那應該就是阿薩斯的心臟...保存著他最後剩下的一丁點人性。$b$b這是聖光給我們的預兆。只要這聖物尚存在，就表示阿薩斯‧米奈希爾有朝一日還能找回他的人性!$b$b到教堂入口見我。記得帶上教徒侍僧兜帽 - 我們要喬裝進去。', `Objectivetext1` = '提里奧的決斷', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13403;
