-- AC datas : OLD Details : "嘿你!$B$B你看來就像個明理機靈的人。我們正在寒冰皇冠僱用更多有才幹的傢伙。$B$B你也許已經聽聞了傳言，說我們在冰川上吃了敗仗，但我得好好澄清。我們正要發動攻勢，自艾澤拉斯最知名，也是我們最先進的工程學成就，破天者號上發動。部落不會給我們喘息的機會，阿薩斯也不會。$B$B若你已準備好要出發，向我報到。", Details AC enUS : "You there!$B$BYou look like you have some wits about you. We could use some more able bodies in Icecrown.$B$BYou may have heard rumors of our failure in assaulting the glacier from the ground, but let me set those concerns to rest. We're now mounting our assault from one of the most advanced pieces of engineering known to Azeroth, the Skybreaker. The Horde don't stand a chance, and neither does Arthas.$B$BSpeak to me when you're ready to depart." ; Wowhead enUS : "You there!$b$bYou look like you have some wits about you. We could use some more able bodies in Icecrown.$b$bYou may have heard rumors of our failure in assaulting the glacier from the ground, but let me set those concerns to rest. We're now mounting our assault from one of the most advanced pieces of engineering known to Azeroth, the Skybreaker. The Horde don't stand a chance, and neither does Arthas.$b$bSpeak to me when you're ready to depart."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '嘿你!$b$b你看來就像個明理機靈的人。我們正在寒冰皇冠僱用更多有才幹的傢伙。$b$b你也許已經聽聞了傳言，說我們在冰川上吃了敗仗，但我得好好澄清。我們正要發動攻勢，自艾澤拉斯最知名，也是我們最先進的工程學成就，破天者號上發動。部落不會給我們喘息的機會，阿薩斯也不會。$b$b若你已準備好要出發，向我報到。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13418;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "嘿你!$B$B你看來就像個明理機靈的人。我們正在寒冰皇冠僱用更多有才幹的傢伙。$B$B聯盟的渣滓們莽莽撞撞地闖進了寒冰皇冠，結果當然是一敗塗地。我們則是蓄精養銳，靜候適當的時機。很快地，我們就要從最先進的工程學成就，名震艾澤拉斯的奧格林之錘上，發動真正的攻勢。聯盟不會給我們喘息的機會，阿薩斯也是。$B$B若你已準備好要出發，向我報到。", Details AC enUS : "You there!$B$BYou look like you have some wits about you. We could use some more able bodies in Icecrown.$B$BThe Alliance scum rushed into Icecrown ahead of us, unprepared, and got just what they deserved for their impatience. We took our time, we made ready, and soon we will mount a true assault from one of the most advanced pieces of engineering known to Azeroth - Orgrim's Hammer. The Alliance don't stand a chance, and neither does Arthas.$B$BSpeak to me when you're ready to depart and lend a hand." ; Wowhead enUS : "You there!$b$bYou look like you have some wits about you. We could use some more able bodies in Icecrown.$b$bThe Alliance scum rushed into Icecrown ahead of us, unprepared, and got just what they deserved for their impatience. We took our time, we made ready, and soon we will mount a true assault from one of the most advanced pieces of engineering known to Azeroth - Orgrim's Hammer. The Alliance don't stand a chance, and neither does Arthas.$b$bSpeak to me when you're ready to depart and lend a hand."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '嘿你!$b$b你看來就像個明理機靈的人。我們正在寒冰皇冠僱用更多有才幹的傢伙。$b$b聯盟的渣滓們莽莽撞撞地闖進了寒冰皇冠，結果當然是一敗塗地。我們則是蓄精養銳，靜候適當的時機。很快地，我們就要從最先進的工程學成就，名震艾澤拉斯的奧格林之錘上，發動真正的攻勢。聯盟不會給我們喘息的機會，阿薩斯也是。$b$b若你已準備好要出發，向我報到。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13419;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "你即將返回丹尼弗蘭詢問考德爾有關這塊永霜的訊息。", Objectives AC enUS : "You are to return to Dun Niffelem and ask Calder about the piece of Everfrost." ; Wowhead enUS : "You are to return to Dun Niffelem and ask Calder about the piece of Everfrost.$b$bProvided item: $b"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '你即將返回丹尼弗蘭詢問考德爾有關這塊永霜的訊息。$b$b已提供物品：$b', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13420;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你完成了別人做不到的事。但你萬不能就此停歇。$B$B你必須讓其他人看看何謂真正的力量與奉獻。$B$B凋落礦坑中許多維酷男工非常的不合群，必須讓他們再次學習什麼叫做紀律。讓他們看看，姐妹...讓他們看看不服從的下場是什麼。", Details AC enUS : "You've succeeded where others have failed.  Yet you cannot rest on your laurels.$B$BYou must show others what strength and commitment really mean.$B$BThe male insubordinates inside the Forlorn Mine need to be disciplined once again.  Show them sister... show them what it means to disobey us." ; Wowhead enUS : "You've succeeded where others have failed. Yet you cannot rest on your laurels.$b$bYou must show others what strength and commitment really mean.$b$bThe male insubordinates inside the Forlorn Mine need to be disciplined once again. Show them sister... show them what it means to disobey us."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你完成了別人做不到的事。但你萬不能就此停歇。$b$b你必須讓其他人看看何謂真正的力量與奉獻。$b$b凋落礦坑中許多維酷男工非常的不合群，必須讓他們再次學習什麼叫做紀律。讓他們看看，姐妹...讓他們看看不服從的下場是什麼。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13422;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "每個人都對你的表現印象深刻，姊妹。但是不要放鬆了戒心!每個迷於聲名的挑戰者都將會上前挑戰你的海茲戰后頭銜。$B$B給這些傲慢自大的傢伙一點教訓，讓她們見識一下你的戰后本色。", Details AC enUS : "Everyone's impressed by your performance, sister.  But do not let your guard down -- every new challenger with delusions of grandeur is going to come out swinging for your title of Hyldskvinnar.$B$BShow these upstarts what you're made of." ; Wowhead enUS : "Everyone's impressed by your performance, sister. But do not let your guard down -- every new challenger with delusions of grandeur is going to come out swinging for your title of Hyldskvinnar.$b$bShow these upstarts what you're made of.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Victorious Challenger slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '每個人都對你的表現印象深刻，姊妹。但是不要放鬆了戒心!每個迷於聲名的挑戰者都將會上前挑戰你的海茲戰后頭銜。$b$b給這些傲慢自大的傢伙一點教訓，讓她們見識一下你的戰后本色。', `Objectivetext1` = '凱旋的挑戰者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13423;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "要保持最好的騎術，你就得每天與其他海迪尼爾切磋。$B$B返回尖牙之淵，把你的技術展現給她們看。她們會很感激像你這樣高超的人將她們擊敗的。", Details AC enUS : "To truly stay in your best riding shape you'll want to test yourself against the other Hyldnir every day.$B$BHead back into the Pit of the Fang and show them what you're capable of.  They'll appreciate suffering defeat to one as skilled as yourself." ; Wowhead enUS : "To truly stay in your best riding shape you'll want to test yourself against the other Hyldnir every day.$b$bHead back into the Pit of the Fang and show them what you're capable of. They'll appreciate suffering defeat to one as skilled as yourself.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Hyldsmeet Warbear slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '要保持最好的騎術，你就得每天與其他海迪尼爾切磋。$b$b返回尖牙之淵，把你的技術展現給她們看。她們會很感激像你這樣高超的人將她們擊敗的。', `Objectivetext1` = '海茲競技戰熊 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13424;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "只對你的同伴展現你的本領是不夠的。你也必須對抗我們的敵人，親愛的姊妹。$B$B華爾基倫的那些叛徒還在養殖染疫的元龍，不停嘲弄我們的龍騎傳統。$B$B搶走他們持有的冰霜油，然後凍毀那些可恨的染疫龍蛋。", Details AC enUS : "It is not enough to demonstrate your prowess among your peers.  You must also fight our enemies, dear sister.$B$BThe Valkyrion traitors continue to mock our noble drake-riding traditions by rearing plagued proto-drakes.$B$BSeize the frost oil they wield and use it to freeze their abominable plagued eggs." ; Wowhead enUS : "It is not enough to demonstrate your prowess among your peers. You must also fight our enemies, dear sister.$b$bThe Valkyrion traitors continue to mock our noble drake-riding traditions by rearing plagued proto-drakes.$b$bSeize the frost oil they wield and use it to freeze their abominable plagued eggs.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Plagued Proto-Drake Egg"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '只對你的同伴展現你的本領是不夠的。你也必須對抗我們的敵人，親愛的姊妹。$b$b華爾基倫的那些叛徒還在養殖染疫的元龍，不停嘲弄我們的龍騎傳統。$b$b搶走他們持有的冰霜油，然後凍毀那些可恨的染疫龍蛋。', `Objectivetext1` = '染疫元龍蛋', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13425;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我們似乎不是唯一來到這個地方的訪客。信差傳來一封名叫札倫陶的牛頭人所留下來的訊息，上頭說他前去拜訪一座名為坦卡羅營地的坦卡族村落。信上寫的有點隱晦，不過看起來札倫陶似乎是為了研究一個坦卡族的傳奇歷史而來到風暴群山。$B$B去會會他，$n，看看他所知的一切是否對我們有所幫助。從他的描述看來，坦卡羅位於東方的遠處，在造物者殿堂的後方，丹尼弗蘭的北邊。", Details AC enUS : "It seems we're not the only visitors to this area. A courier relayed a message from a tauren named Xarantaur, who said he was visiting a taunka village called Camp Tunka'lo. The note was somewhat cryptic, but it seems this Xarantaur has come to Storm Peaks to learn the history of a taunka legend.$B$BMeet up with him, $N. See if what he knows can help us in any way. From his description, Camp Tunka'lo is far to the east, beyond the Terrace of the Makers and north of Dun Niffelem." ; Wowhead enUS : "It seems we're not the only visitors to this area. A courier relayed a message from a tauren named Xarantaur, who said he was visiting a taunka village called Camp Tunka'lo. The note was somewhat cryptic, but it seems this Xarantaur has come to Storm Peaks to learn the history of a taunka legend.$b$bMeet up with him, $n. See if what he knows can help us in any way. From his description, Camp Tunka'lo is far to the east, beyond the Terrace of the Makers and north of Dun Niffelem."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我們似乎不是唯一來到這個地方的訪客。信差傳來一封名叫札倫陶的牛頭人所留下來的訊息，上頭說他前去拜訪一座名為坦卡羅營地的坦卡族村落。信上寫的有點隱晦，不過看起來札倫陶似乎是為了研究一個坦卡族的傳奇歷史而來到風暴群山。$b$b去會會他，$n，看看他所知的一切是否對我們有所幫助。從他的描述看來，坦卡羅位於東方的遠處，在造物者殿堂的後方，丹尼弗蘭的北邊。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13426;
