-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "貴族花園商販要你收集10個貴族花園巧克力，並帶著借來的蛋籃回去找他。", Objectives AC enUS : "The Noblegarden Vendor wants you to collect 10 Noblegarden Chocolates and return them along with the Egg Basket." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 10 Noblegarden Chocolates and return them along with the Borrowed Egg Basket.",  OLD Details : "來...拿著這個蛋籃去尋找明亮的彩蛋。等你找到十個貴族花園巧克力之後再帶著籃子回來找我。", Details AC enUS : "Here... take this Egg Basket and go hunting for Brightly Colored Eggs. Return to me with the basket when you've found ten Noblegarden Chocolates." ; Wowhead enUS : "Here... take this egg basket and go hunting for brightly colored eggs. Return to me with the basket when you've found ten Noblegarden chocolates, please."
