-- AC datas : OLD Details : "冬握河的南邊有三座哨塔正在吸取堡壘的能量!$B$B摧毀影景哨塔、焰望哨塔或冬際哨塔，然後回來找我。記得，只有攻城載具才能破壞哨塔，所以要確保他們不受部落的攻擊!", Details AC enUS : "The three towers south of the Wintergrasp river are draining power from the Fortress! $B$BDestroy Shadowsight Tower, Flamewatch Tower or Winter's Edge Tower, then return to me. Remember, only siege vehicles can damage a tower, so make sure to protect them from the Horde!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The three towers south of the Wintergrasp river are draining power from the Fortress!$b$bDestroy Shadowsight Tower, Flamewatch Tower or Winter's Edge Tower, then return to me. Remember, only siege vehicles can damage a tower, so make sure to protect them from the Horde!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '冬握河的南邊有三座哨塔正在吸取堡壘的能量!$b$b摧毀影景哨塔、焰望哨塔或冬際哨塔，然後回來找我。記得，只有攻城載具才能破壞哨塔，所以要確保他們不受部落的攻擊!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13538;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "或許聯盟已經打到家門口了，但一個真正的戰術家眼光看得更遠。$B$B「攻其不備，出其不意。」$B$B$n，我需要你越過冬握河，去摧毀南方三座哨塔中的一座。我們的術士回報說那些哨塔正在吸收能量，我們可以使用那些能量來強化部隊。$B$B一旦你摧毀了其中一座哨塔，就回來找我。", Details AC enUS : "While the Alliance may be pounding on our doors, a true tactician looks beyond the obvious.$B$B"Attack him where he is unprepared, appear where you are not expected."$B$B$n, I need you to travel across the Wintergrasp River and destroy one of the three towers to the south. Our Warlocks report that the towers are draining power we could use to bolster our own troops.$B$BReturn to me once you've destroyed a tower." ; Wowhead enUS : "While the Alliance may be pounding on our doors, a true tactician looks beyond the obvious.$b$b"Attack him where he is unprepared, appear where you are not expected."$b$b$n, I need you to travel across the Wintergrasp River and destroy one of the three towers to the south. Our Warlocks report that the towers are draining power we could use to bolster our own troops.$b$bReturn to me once you've destroyed a tower."
