-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你已經贏得了我的尊敬以及你同伴們的敬重。你克服了一切挑戰並且展現出你對聯賽戰鬥的卓越技巧。無庸置疑，你已經準備好為了奧格瑪的榮譽對抗其他主城的勇士。$B$B審判者瑪瑞爾‧真心想跟你談談，$n，並且正式宣佈你加入勇士的技擊大賽。", Details AC enUS : "You have earned my respect and the respect of your peers. You defeated all who challenged you and mastered the ways of tournament combat. I have no doubt that you are ready to face down the champions of other cities for the glory of Orgrimmar!$B$BJusticar Mariel Trueheart has asked to speak with you, $N, and to formally enter you in the champions' grand melee." ; Wowhead enUS : "You have earned my respect and the respect of your peers. You defeated all who challenged you and mastered the ways of tournament combat. I have no doubt that you are ready to face down the champions of other cities for the glory of Orgrimmar!$b$bJusticar Mariel Trueheart has asked to speak with you, $n, and to formally enter you in the champions' grand melee."
