-- AC datas : OLD Details : "當我們把注意力放在這些模擬戰中，要知道我們真正的敵人依舊環伺在四周。銀白十字軍想要透過競賽找出最優秀的戰士，但我們也能知道誰從戰場上回來。讓那些聖騎士知道，就算是在聯賽準備期間，我們也願意對抗詛咒神教。$B$B前往寒冰皇冠，殺死你所遇到的任何一個教徒。他們在奧多薩和亡頌者之望人數眾多。", Details AC enUS : "While we all play at mock combat, it will do us good to remember that the real enemy surrounds us. The Argent Crusade wants to use competition to find the best fighters, but we can tell that by who returns from battle. Let's show the paladins that we are willing to take battle to the Cult of the Damned, even while making preparations for the tournament.$B$BGo forth into Icecrown and slay any of the cultists you encounter. They have a strong presence around Aldur'thar and Deathspeaker's Watch." ; Wowhead enUS : "While we all play at mock combat, it will do us good to remember that the real enemy surrounds us. The Argent Crusade wants to use competition to find the best fighters, but we can tell that by who returns from battle. Let's show the paladins that we are willing to take battle to the Cult of the Damned, even while making preparations for the tournament.$b$bGo forth into Icecrown and slay any of the cultists you encounter. They have a strong presence around Aldur'thar and Deathspeaker's Watch.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "殺死詛咒神教成員", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Cult of the Damned member slain" ; Wowhead enUS : "Shadow Cultist",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Dark Subjugator",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Shadow Channeler",  OLD Objectivetext4 : "", Objectivetext4 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Vile Torturer"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '當我們把注意力放在這些模擬戰中，要知道我們真正的敵人依舊環伺在四周。銀白十字軍想要透過競賽找出最優秀的戰士，但我們也能知道誰從戰場上回來。讓那些聖騎士知道，就算是在聯賽準備期間，我們也願意對抗詛咒神教。$b$b前往寒冰皇冠，殺死你所遇到的任何一個教徒。他們在奧多薩和亡頌者之望人數眾多。', `Objectivetext1` = '暗影教徒', `Objectivetext2` = '黑暗征服者', `Objectivetext3` = '暗影導魔師', `Objectivetext4` = '邪惡拷問者', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13813;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "帶4個勇士印記交給銀白聯賽場地的伊黎芮‧夜暮。$B$B如果你弄丟了長槍，你可以從任何一個靠近獸欄或奪日者亭閣的長槍架再拿一把。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring 4 Marks of the Champion to Illyrie Nightfall at the Argent Tournament Grounds.$B$BIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Sunreaver Pavilion." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 4 Marks of the Champion to Illyrie Nightfall at the Argent Tournament Grounds.$b$bIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Sunreaver Pavilion.",  OLD Details : "身為一名勇士，你精通騎乘作戰的技巧，擊敗了各種層級的挑戰者。你確信你會對上你先前所擊敗的人。$B$B你應該持續鍛鍊自己的技巧並且學習敵方的弱點。代表各大城市的勇士們就在獸欄附近的勇士競技場。到獸欄去，裝備你的長槍，然後跨上你的坐騎，面對其他的勇士吧。", Details AC enUS : "As a champion, you have mastered the art of mounted combat, overcoming challengers of all levels. You must make certain that you can defeat anyone you face when the tournament begins.$B$BYou should continue honing your own skills and learning more about the weaknesses of your opponents. Champions representing all cities practice in the Ring of Champions near the stables. Go to the stables, equip your lance, pick any mount you can ride, then face the champions in practice bouts." ; Wowhead enUS : "As a champion, you have mastered the art of mounted combat, overcoming challengers of all levels. You must make certain that you can defeat anyone you face when the tournament begins.$b$bYou should continue honing your own skills and learning more about the weaknesses of your opponents. Champions representing all cities practice in the Ring of Champions near the stables. Go to the stables, equip your lance, pick any mount you can ride, then face the champions in practice bouts."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '帶4個勇士印記交給銀白聯賽場地的伊黎芮‧夜暮。$b$b如果你弄丟了長槍，你可以從任何一個靠近獸欄或奪日者亭閣的長槍架再拿一把。', `Details` = '身為一名勇士，你精通騎乘作戰的技巧，擊敗了各種層級的挑戰者。你確信你會對上你先前所擊敗的人。$b$b你應該持續鍛鍊自己的技巧並且學習敵方的弱點。代表各大城市的勇士們就在獸欄附近的勇士競技場。到獸欄去，裝備你的長槍，然後跨上你的坐騎，面對其他的勇士吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13814;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "聽著，$g小夥子:小姑娘;!艾澤拉斯的命運就取決於此。$B$B我們唯一的機會就是即時趕到星穹渾天儀，找到這個艾爾加隆，並且阻止他把任何訊息傳回去給他的泰坦主人。$B$B找到星穹渾天儀，然後把你找到的所有資料都帶回來。我們或許還有點時間應付艾爾加隆的到來。", Details AC enUS : "Listen, $glad:lass;!  Azeroth's fate is at stake here.$B$BOur only chance is to get to the Celestial Planetarium in time to find this Algalon and stop him from beaming back any messages to his Titan masters.$B$BLocate the Celestial Planetarium and come back with any information you get.  We might still have some time to prepare for Algalon's arrival." ; Wowhead enUS : "Listen, $glad:lass! Azeroth's fate is at stake here.$b$bOur only chance is to get to the Celestial Planetarium in time to find this Algalon and stop him from beaming back any messages to his Titan masters.$b$bLocate the Celestial Planetarium and come back with any information you get. We might still have some time to prepare for Algalon's arrival."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '聽著，$g小夥子:小姑娘!艾澤拉斯的命運就取決於此。$b$b我們唯一的機會就是即時趕到星穹渾天儀，找到這個艾爾加隆，並且阻止他把任何訊息傳回去給他的泰坦主人。$b$b找到星穹渾天儀，然後把你找到的所有資料都帶回來。我們或許還有點時間應付艾爾加隆的到來。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13816;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "這片白金圓盤有著令人驚嘆的對稱性，沒有一點刮痕或瑕疵。清晰的符文銘刻在它的邊緣之上，寫著「大資料庫」。$B$B奧杜亞之中一個有個裝置能夠讀取這片圓盤。", Details AC enUS : "This platinum disc is surprisingly symmetrical and devoid of any scratches or imperfections.  Engraved along its edge, bold runes spell out the word "ARCHIVUM."$B$BThere must be a device inside Ulduar capable of reading the disc." ; Wowhead enUS : "This platinum disc is surprisingly symmetrical and devoid of any scratches or imperfections. Engraved along its edge, bold runes spell out the word "ARCHIVUM."$b$bThere must be a device inside Ulduar capable of reading the disc."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '這片白金圓盤有著令人驚嘆的對稱性，沒有一點刮痕或瑕疵。清晰的符文銘刻在它的邊緣之上，寫著「大資料庫」。$b$b奧杜亞之中一個有個裝置能夠讀取這片圓盤。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13817;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你真的辦到了，$n。把符印帶去給大資料庫控制臺，看你有沒有辦法獲得進入星穹渾天儀的許可。$B$B你最好動作快一點，$g小夥子:小姑娘;。時間緊迫。", Details AC enUS : "You really did it, $N.  Take the sigils to the Archivum Console and see if you can gain access to the Celestial Planetarium.$B$BYou best hurry, $g lad:lass;.  Time is of the essence." ; Wowhead enUS : "You really did it, $n. Take the sigils to the Archivum Console and see if you can gain access to the Celestial Planetarium.$b$bYou best hurry, $glad:lass. Time is of the essence."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你真的辦到了，$n。把符印帶去給大資料庫控制臺，看你有沒有辦法獲得進入星穹渾天儀的許可。$b$b你最好動作快一點，$g小夥子:小姑娘。時間緊迫。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13818;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我們最好得動作快點，$n。我們得從達拉然傳出回覆代碼。$B$B把這個交給羅甯，我在那裡跟你碰頭。", Details AC enUS : "We'd best hurry now, $N.  We're going to have to transmit the reply-code from Dalaran.$B$BTake it to Rhonin, I will meet you there." ; Wowhead enUS : "We'd best hurry now, $n. We're going to have to transmit the reply-code from Dalaran.$b$bTake it to Rhonin, I will meet you there."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我們最好得動作快點，$n。我們得從達拉然傳出回覆代碼。$b$b把這個交給羅甯，我在那裡跟你碰頭。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13819;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "大領主交代我要盡快完成大競技場。我們已經把所有的石匠全都投入工程了，但我們很快就發現我們需要更多建築材料。我雇用了一些哥布林，貝索‧爆栓和他的兄弟，波索。$B$B他們在聯賽場地東南邊監督工程。和貝索談談，看看他們兄弟兩個需要怎樣的幫忙才能弄到我們要的建材。", Details AC enUS : "The highlord has tasked me with getting that coliseum completed as soon as possible. We've put our own masons to work on the project, but we found out very quickly that we were going to need help procuring materials. I've hired a couple of goblins, Bezzle Blastbolt and his brother, Bozzle.$B$BThey're supervising construction at the southeastern end of the tournament grounds. Speak with Bezzle and see if he and his brother could use any more help getting the building materials we need." ; Wowhead enUS : "The highlord has tasked me with getting that coliseum completed as soon as possible. We've put our own masons to work on the project, but we found out very quickly that we were going to need help procuring materials. I've hired a couple of goblins, Bezzle Blastbolt and his brother, Bozzle.$b$bThey're supervising construction at the southeastern end of the tournament grounds. Speak with Bezzle and see if he and his brother could use any more help getting the building materials we need."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '大領主交代我要盡快完成大競技場。我們已經把所有的石匠全都投入工程了，但我們很快就發現我們需要更多建築材料。我雇用了一些哥布林，貝索‧爆栓和他的兄弟，波索。$b$b他們在聯賽場地東南邊監督工程。和貝索談談，看看他們兄弟兩個需要怎樣的幫忙才能弄到我們要的建材。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13820;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "奧杜亞大資料庫的勘察員洛倫要你取得芙蕾雅的符印。$B$B想知道更多關於如何取得芙蕾雅的符印，請詢問大資料庫控制臺。", Objectives AC enUS : "Prospector Loren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to obtain Freya's Sigil.$B$BFor more information on obtaining Freya's Sigil consult the Archivum Console." ; Wowhead enUS : "Prospector Loren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to obtain Freya's Sigil.$b$bFor more information on obtaining Freya's Sigil consult the Archivum Console.",  OLD Details : "如果我猜得沒錯，芙蕾雅的符印恐怕更麻煩。$B$B根據大資料庫的記錄，符印的精華與她的三個古老僕從相連，亮葉、鐵枒和石木。若是這三個長者受到傷害，就會危急符印的完整性。$B$B但放過這些長者，就表示你們在面對芙蕾雅時，她會更加強大。$B$B我能說什麼呢，$n，這是個兩難的抉擇。", Details AC enUS : "Freya's Sigil is going to be one of the tougher ones, I reckon.$B$BAccording to the Archivum, the essence of the Sigil is tied to her three elder servants, Brightleaf, Ironbranch and Stonebark.  Should any of the elders be harmed, the Sigil's integrity will be compromised.$B$BSparing the elders, however, means that Freya will be more powerful when you face her.$B$BWhat can I say, $N.  We're stuck between a rock and hard place." ; Wowhead enUS : "Freya's Sigil is going to be one of the tougher ones, I reckon.$b$bAccording to the Archivum, the essence of the Sigil is tied to her three elder servants, Brightleaf, Ironbranch and Stonebark. Should any of the elders be harmed, the Sigil's integrity will be compromised.$b$bSparing the elders, however, means that Freya will be more powerful when you face her.$b$bWhat can I say, $n. We're stuck between a rock and hard place."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '奧杜亞大資料庫的勘察員洛倫要你取得芙蕾雅的符印。$b$b想知道更多關於如何取得芙蕾雅的符印，請詢問大資料庫控制臺。', `Details` = '如果我猜得沒錯，芙蕾雅的符印恐怕更麻煩。$b$b根據大資料庫的記錄，符印的精華與她的三個古老僕從相連，亮葉、鐵枒和石木。若是這三個長者受到傷害，就會危急符印的完整性。$b$b但放過這些長者，就表示你們在面對芙蕾雅時，她會更加強大。$b$b我能說什麼呢，$n，這是個兩難的抉擇。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13821;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "奧杜亞大資料庫的勘察員洛倫要你取得霍迪爾的符印。$B$B想知道更多關於如何取得霍迪爾的符印，請詢問大資料庫控制臺。", Objectives AC enUS : "Prospector Loren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to obtain Hodir's Sigil.$B$BFor more information on obtaining Hodir's Sigil, consult the Archivum Console." ; Wowhead enUS : "Prospector Loren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to obtain Hodir's Sigil.$b$bFor more information on obtaining Hodir's Sigil, consult the Archivum Console.",  OLD Details : "霍迪爾的符印可不容易取得。你不光是得擊敗霍迪爾本人，你還得在他毀掉存放符印的箱子之前打敗他!$B$B如果需要更多資料可以去大資料庫控制臺查詢。那個東西擁有的資料比全世界所有圖書館加起來都還多!", Details AC enUS : "Hodir's Sigil won't be easy to obtain.  Not only are ye going to have to defeat Hodir himself, but yer going to have to do it before he destroys the chest that contains it!$B$BCheck the Archivum console if you need more information.  That thing contains more knowledge than all of the world's libraries put together!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Hodir's Sigil won't be easy to obtain. Not only are ye going to have to defeat Hodir himself, but yer going to have to do it before he destroys the chest that contains it!$b$bCheck the Archivum console if you need more information. That thing contains more knowledge than all of the world's libraries put together!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '奧杜亞大資料庫的勘察員洛倫要你取得霍迪爾的符印。$b$b想知道更多關於如何取得霍迪爾的符印，請詢問大資料庫控制臺。', `Details` = '霍迪爾的符印可不容易取得。你不光是得擊敗霍迪爾本人，你還得在他毀掉存放符印的箱子之前打敗他!$b$b如果需要更多資料可以去大資料庫控制臺查詢。那個東西擁有的資料比全世界所有圖書館加起來都還多!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13822;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "奧杜亞大資料庫的勘察員洛倫要你取得索林姆的符印。$B$B想知道更多關於如何取得索林姆的符印，請詢問大資料庫控制臺。", Objectives AC enUS : "Prospector Loren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to obtain Thorim's Sigil.$B$BFor more information on obtaining Thorim's Sigil consult the Archivum Console." ; Wowhead enUS : "Prospector Loren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to obtain Thorim's Sigil.$b$bFor more information on obtaining Thorim's Sigil consult the Archivum Console.",  OLD Details : "索林姆已經不再是原本那個人了，$n。他受到了一種黑暗的影響。$B$B有一種邪惡的東西偽裝成他死去的妻子，希芙。$B$B你不能讓那個冒充者的法術控制他。要是這樣的話，他符印的位置可能就永遠沒人知道了!$B$B你得要讓他回復理智，而且動作要快。$B$B跟先前一樣，大資料庫控制臺會告訴你所有殘酷的細節...你不會喜歡的。", Details AC enUS : "Thorim's not himself, $N.  He's come under a dark influence.$B$BAn evil presence under the guise of an illusion pretends to be his lost wife, Sif.$B$BYe can't let him be overcome by this impostor's spell.  If he does, the location of his sigil might forever be lost!$B$BYer going to have to beat some sense into him and yer going to have to do it quick.$B$BAs always, the Archivum Console will give ye all the gory details... even the ones ye don't like." ; Wowhead enUS : "Thorim's not himself, $n. He's come under a dark influence.$b$bAn evil presence under the guise of an illusion pretends to be his lost wife, Sif.$b$bYe can't let him be overcome by this impostor's spell. If he does, the location of his sigil might forever be lost!$b$bYer going to have to beat some sense into him and yer going to have to do it quick.$b$bAs always, the Archivum Console will give ye all the gory details... even the ones ye don't like."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '奧杜亞大資料庫的勘察員洛倫要你取得索林姆的符印。$b$b想知道更多關於如何取得索林姆的符印，請詢問大資料庫控制臺。', `Details` = '索林姆已經不再是原本那個人了，$n。他受到了一種黑暗的影響。$b$b有一種邪惡的東西偽裝成他死去的妻子，希芙。$b$b你不能讓那個冒充者的法術控制他。要是這樣的話，他符印的位置可能就永遠沒人知道了!$b$b你得要讓他回復理智，而且動作要快。$b$b跟先前一樣，大資料庫控制臺會告訴你所有殘酷的細節...你不會喜歡的。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13823;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "奧杜亞大資料庫的勘察員洛倫要你取得彌米倫的符印。$B$B想知道更多關於如何取得彌米倫的符印，請詢問大資料庫控制臺。", Objectives AC enUS : "Prospector Loren at the Ulduar Archivum wants you to obtain Mimiron's Sigil.$B$BFor more information on obtaining Mimiron's Sigil consult the Archivum Console." ; Wowhead enUS : "Prospector Loren at the Ulduar Archivum wants you to obtain Mimiron's Sigil.$b$bFor more information on obtaining Mimiron's Sigil consult the Archivum Console.",  OLD Details : "彌米倫真是個聰明的傢伙。他的整個住處都連結在某種自毀裝置上。$B$B要是你想拿到他的符印，你們就得很不幸地與自毀裝置比賽誰的動作快。如果有需要的話，可以向大資料庫控制臺查詢更多資料。", Details AC enUS : "Mimiron's a clever one.  His entire abode is rigged with some sort of self-destruction mechanism.$B$BUnfortunately yer gonna have to race against it if ye want to get his sigil.  Check the Archivum Console for more details if ye need them." ; Wowhead enUS : "Mimiron's a clever one. His entire abode is rigged with some sort of self-destruction mechanism.$b$bUnfortunately yer gonna have to race against it if ye want to get his sigil. Check the Archivum Console for more details if ye need them."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '奧杜亞大資料庫的勘察員洛倫要你取得彌米倫的符印。$b$b想知道更多關於如何取得彌米倫的符印，請詢問大資料庫控制臺。', `Details` = '彌米倫真是個聰明的傢伙。他的整個住處都連結在某種自毀裝置上。$b$b要是你想拿到他的符印，你們就得很不幸地與自毀裝置比賽誰的動作快。如果有需要的話，可以向大資料庫控制臺查詢更多資料。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13824;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "聯賽競技的核心就是騎乘近戰。拿起這把長槍，然後騎上亭閣外圈養的奎爾多雷戰駒。$B$B一旦你騎上坐騎，就去找傑倫‧鎖木。他就在聯賽場地的北部邊緣，志士競技場的東邊。傑倫會教你該怎麼樣使用防禦，確保你在近距作戰時的安全。", Details AC enUS : "The heart of tournament competition is mounted melee combat. Take this lance and mount the stabled Quel'dorei steed just outside the pavilion.$B$BOnce you're mounted, seek out Jeran Lockwood. He's on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Jeran will instruct you on how to use your defenses to keep you safe while attacking a melee target at close range." ; Wowhead enUS : "The heart of tournament competition is mounted melee combat. Take this lance and mount the stabled Quel'dorei steed just outside the pavilion.$b$bOnce you're mounted, seek out Jeran Lockwood. He's on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Jeran will instruct you on how to use your defenses to keep you safe while attacking a melee target at close range.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "對近戰標靶使用戳刺", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Jeran Lockwood's advice" ; Wowhead enUS : "Jeran Lockwood's advice"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '聯賽競技的核心就是騎乘近戰。拿起這把長槍，然後騎上亭閣外圈養的奎爾多雷戰駒。$b$b一旦你騎上坐騎，就去找傑倫‧鎖木。他就在聯賽場地的北部邊緣，志士競技場的東邊。傑倫會教你該怎麼樣使用防禦，確保你在近距作戰時的安全。', `Objectivetext1` = '傑倫‧鎖木的建議', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13828;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "聯賽競技的核心就是騎乘近戰。拿起這把長槍，然後騎上亭閣外圈養的奪日者陸行鷹。$B$B一旦你騎上坐騎，就去找傑倫‧鎖木。他就在聯賽場地的北部邊緣，志士競技場的東邊。傑倫會教你該怎麼樣使用防禦，確保你在近距作戰時的安全。", Details AC enUS : "The heart of tournament competition is mounted melee combat. Take this lance and mount the stabled Sunreaver hawkstrider just outside the pavilion.$B$BOnce you're mounted, seek out Jeran Lockwood. He's on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Jeran will instruct you on how to use your defenses to keep you safe while attacking a melee target at close range." ; Wowhead enUS : "The heart of tournament competition is mounted melee combat. Take this lance and mount the stabled Sunreaver hawkstrider just outside the pavilion.$b$bOnce you're mounted, seek out Jeran Lockwood. He's on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Jeran will instruct you on how to use your defenses to keep you safe while attacking a melee target at close range.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "對近戰標靶使用戳刺", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Jeran Lockwood's advice" ; Wowhead enUS : "Jeran Lockwood's advice"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '聯賽競技的核心就是騎乘近戰。拿起這把長槍，然後騎上亭閣外圈養的奪日者陸行鷹。$b$b一旦你騎上坐騎，就去找傑倫‧鎖木。他就在聯賽場地的北部邊緣，志士競技場的東邊。傑倫會教你該怎麼樣使用防禦，確保你在近距作戰時的安全。', `Objectivetext1` = '傑倫‧鎖木的建議', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13829;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你需要學會如何打破一個對手的防禦，才能在騎乘作戰中獲勝。拿起這把長槍，騎上亭閣外圈養的奎爾多雷戰駒。$B$B一旦你騎上坐騎，就去找瓦利斯‧逐風者。他就在聯賽場地的北部邊緣，志士競技場的東邊。瓦利斯會教你該怎麼樣使用遠距破盾攻擊，讓遠距標靶變得脆弱。", Details AC enUS : "You'll need to learn how to break through an opponent's defenses to succeed in mounted combat. Take this lance and mount the stabled Quel'dorei steed just outside the pavilion.$B$BOnce you're mounted, seek out Valis Windchaser. He'll be on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Valis will teach you the basics of using a ranged shield breaker attack to make a ranged target vulnerable." ; Wowhead enUS : "You'll need to learn how to break through an opponent's defenses to succeed in mounted combat. Take this lance and mount the stabled Quel'dorei steed just outside the pavilion.$b$bOnce you're mounted, seek out Valis Windchaser. He'll be on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Valis will teach you the basics of using a ranged shield breaker attack to make a ranged target vulnerable.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "對脆弱的遠距標靶使用破盾", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Valis Windchaser's advice" ; Wowhead enUS : "Valis Windchaser's advice"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你需要學會如何打破一個對手的防禦，才能在騎乘作戰中獲勝。拿起這把長槍，騎上亭閣外圈養的奎爾多雷戰駒。$b$b一旦你騎上坐騎，就去找瓦利斯‧逐風者。他就在聯賽場地的北部邊緣，志士競技場的東邊。瓦利斯會教你該怎麼樣使用遠距破盾攻擊，讓遠距標靶變得脆弱。', `Objectivetext1` = '瓦利斯‧逐風者的建議', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13835;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你在坐騎戰鬥時最強力的攻擊就是衝鋒。拿起這把長槍，騎上亭閣外圈養的奎爾多雷戰駒。$B$B一旦你騎上坐騎，就去找魯根‧鋼腹。他就在聯賽場地的北部邊緣，志士競技場的東邊。魯根會教你該怎麼樣使用衝鋒，並且教你一些基本戰略。", Details AC enUS : "Your strongest attack in mounted combat is undoubtedly the charge. Take this lance and mount the stabled Quel'dorei steed just outside the pavilion.$B$BOnce you're mounted, speak with Rugan Steelbelly. He's on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Rugan will tell you how to use this powerful ability and teach you some basic strategies." ; Wowhead enUS : "Your strongest attack in mounted combat is undoubtedly the charge. Take this lance and mount the stabled Quel'dorei steed just outside the pavilion.$b$bOnce you're mounted, speak with Rugan Steelbelly. He's on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Rugan will tell you how to use this powerful ability and teach you some basic strategies.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "對脆弱的衝鋒標靶使用衝鋒", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Rugan Steelbelly's advice" ; Wowhead enUS : "Rugan Steelbelly's advice"
