-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "拿一些亡者麵包給奧格瑪墓地中興奮的食人妖靈魂。$B$B使用橘色金盞花可以看見這些隱形的靈魂。", Objectives AC enUS : "Acquire some Bread of the Dead and give it to the Cheerful Troll Spirit in Orgrimmar's graveyard.$B$BUse an Orange Marigold to see the otherwise invisible spirit." ; Wowhead enUS : "Acquire some Bread of the Dead and give it to the Cheerful Troll Spirit in Orgrimmar's graveyard.$b$bUse an Orange Marigold to see the otherwise invisible spirit.",  OLD Details : "能再次看看朋友和家人的感覺真好，雖然我或許有點太超過了...我已經把他們今天給我準備的東西全吃光了!$B$B我能麻煩你幫我找些美味的亡者麵包嗎?我會非常感激...$B$B我想，那邊的小販有在賣食譜。", Details AC enUS : "It's good to visit with friends and family again, though I may have overdone it... I've already eaten everything they made for me!$B$BMight I trouble you for some more of that delicious Bread of the Dead? I'd be most grateful...$B$BChapman there sells the recipe, I think." ; Wowhead enUS : "It's good to visit with friends and family again, though I may have overdone it... I've already eaten everything they made for me!$b$bMight I trouble you for some more of that delicious Bread of the Dead? I'd be most grateful...$b$bChapman there sells the recipe, I think."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '拿一些亡者麵包給奧格瑪墓地中興奮的食人妖靈魂。$b$b使用橘色金盞花可以看見這些隱形的靈魂。', `Details` = '能再次看看朋友和家人的感覺真好，雖然我或許有點太超過了...我已經把他們今天給我準備的東西全吃光了!$b$b我能麻煩你幫我找些美味的亡者麵包嗎?我會非常感激...$b$b我想，那邊的小販有在賣食譜。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 14177;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "戰鬥的召喚：風暴之眼", Title AC enUS : "Call to Arms: Eye of the Storm" ; Wowhead enUS : "Call to Arms: Eye of the Storm",  OLD Objectives : "在風暴之眼戰場中獲得一場勝利，然後向任意聯盟主城、冬擁湖、達拉然或沙塔斯城中的聯盟準將覆命。", Objectives AC enUS : "Win an Eye of the Storm battleground match and return to an Alliance Brigadier General at any Alliance capital city, Wintergrasp, Dalaran, or Shattrath." ; Wowhead enUS : "Win an Eye of the Storm battleground match and return to an Alliance Brigadier General at any Alliance capital city, Wintergrasp, Dalaran, or Shattrath.",  OLD Details : "對抗部落的戰鬥是沒有盡頭的，$N。即使在外域，對於地盤的爭奪和世代積累的仇恨同樣引發了一場場戰鬥。$B$B現在，進入風暴之眼，為聯盟奪取輝煌的勝利，就像我們在艾澤拉斯做的一樣。", Details AC enUS : "The fight against the Horde knows no boundaries, $N.  Even in Outland, territorial disputes and old hatreds are enough to tip the scales in favor of war.$B$BGo into the Eye of the Storm and make sure the Alliance prevails in Outland just like it has in Azeroth." ; Wowhead enUS : "The fight against the Horde knows no boundaries, $n. Even in Outland, territorial disputes and old hatreds are enough to tip the scales in favor of war.$b$bGo into the Eye of the Storm and make sure the Alliance prevails in Outland just like it has in Azeroth."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '戰鬥的號角:暴風之眼', `Objectives` = '在暴風之眼的戰場中獲勝，然後向任何一座聯盟主城、冬握湖、達拉然或撒塔斯的聯盟准將回報。', `Details` = '和部落的鬥爭沒有邊界，$n。既使在外域，領土的糾紛與古老的仇恨依舊可以挑起戰爭的烽火。$b$b前往暴風之眼吧，確保聯盟將會像在艾澤拉斯一樣地獲勝。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 14179;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "謹慎的回訪", Title AC enUS : "A Cautious Return" ; Wowhead enUS : "A Cautious Return",  OLD Objectives : "將達羅斯的日記帶給身處達納蘇斯的莫丹特·永影。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring Daros' Journal to Mordent Evenshade in Darnassus." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring Daros' Journal to Mordent Evenshade in Darnassus.",  OLD Details : "佔用你一點時間，$c。$b$b世事無常。我們又一次被迫離開了埃雷薩拉斯廢墟，走入外面的世界。我是來研究這座城市的，我不想走遠，但是也許你會對這個差事感興趣。$b$b我的同事準備轉至達納蘇斯去找那裡的高階祭司談談，希望能借此與他們達成共識。帶上這本日記去找神殿中的莫丹特·永影。這東西也許會對他的外交任務有幫助。", Details AC enUS : "A moment of your time, $c.$b$bChange is coming. It has drawn us out of the ruins of Eldre'Thalas and into the wide world once more. I have come to research this city and cannot stray from it, but if you are inclined, I have an errand for you.$b$bMy colleague set out for Darnassus to speak with the High Priestess there, that we might come to an understanding. Take this journal to Mordent Evenshade in the temple. It may help in his diplomacy mission." ; Wowhead enUS : "A moment of your time, $c.$b$bChange is coming. It has drawn us out of the ruins of Eldre'Thalas and into the wide world once more. I have come to research this city and cannot stray from it, but if you are inclined, I have an errand for you.$b$bMy colleague set out for Darnassus to speak with the High Priestess there, that we might come to an understanding. Take this journal to Mordent Evenshade in the temple. It may help in his diplomacy mission."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '謹慎的回歸', `Objectives` = '將達洛斯的日誌交給達納蘇斯的摩丹特·平影。', `Details` = '暫且留步，$c。$b$b改變的時刻即將來臨了。這迫使我們步出了埃德薩拉斯廢墟，再次與廣大的世界有所接觸。我前來研究這座城市而暫時無法離開，但你不同，因此我有件差事想麻煩你。$b$b我的夥伴前來達納蘇斯與他們的高階女祭司交談，或許我們能達成某種共識。請將這本日誌交給神殿內的摩丹特·平影。這會對他的外交任務有所幫助。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 14409;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "收集5個勘察員的十字鎬。$B$B在熔爐砸爛這些勘察員的十字鎬以製造損壞的工具。$B$B將5個損壞的工具交給血蹄村的奧莫‧雷角。", Objectives AC enUS : "Collect 5 Prospector's Picks.$B$BAt a forge, smash the Prospector's Picks to create Broken Tools.$B$BBring 5 Broken Tools to Ahmo Thunderhorn in Bloodhoof Village." ; Wowhead enUS : "Collect 5 Prospector's Picks.$b$bAt a forge, smash the Prospector's Picks to create Broken Tools.$b$bBring 5 Broken Tools to Ahmo Thunderhorn in Bloodhoof Village.",  OLD Details : "有些矮人正準備在西北邊建立一個挖掘點。他們認為地底下埋藏著某些秘密，事實也的確如此，但挖空和破壞土地是不可能理解大地的教誨。$B$B收集矮人的挖掘工具，毀掉那些東西，然後把矮人損壞的工具帶來給我。$B$B你可以在熔爐邊破壞那些工具。你可以在雷霆崖找到熔爐，但任何一個熔爐 -- 甚至是矮人營地的熔爐 -- 都可以用來破壞工具。", Details AC enUS : "There are dwarves preparing a dig site to the northwest.  They think secrets lie in the earth, and that is true, but hollowing and defiling the land is no way to earn its teachings.$B$BCollect the dwarven tools of digging, smash them, and return to me with the dwarves' broken tools.$B$BYou can smash the tools at a forge.  You will find one in Thunder Bluff, but any forge -- even a forge at the dwarven camp -- will suffice." ; Wowhead enUS : "There are dwarves preparing a dig site to the northwest. They think secrets lie in the earth, and that is true, but hollowing and defiling the land is no way to earn its teachings.$b$bCollect the dwarven tools of digging, smash them, and return to me with the dwarves' broken tools.$b$bYou can smash the tools at a forge. You will find one in Thunder Bluff, but any forge -- even a forge at the dwarven camp -- will suffice."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '收集5個勘察員的十字鎬。$b$b在熔爐砸爛這些勘察員的十字鎬以製造損壞的工具。$b$b將5個損壞的工具交給血蹄村的奧莫‧雷角。', `Details` = '有些矮人正準備在西北邊建立一個挖掘點。他們認為地底下埋藏著某些秘密，事實也的確如此，但挖空和破壞土地是不可能理解大地的教誨。$b$b收集矮人的挖掘工具，毀掉那些東西，然後把矮人損壞的工具帶來給我。$b$b你可以在熔爐邊破壞那些工具。你可以在雷霆崖找到熔爐，但任何一個熔爐 -- 甚至是矮人營地的熔爐 -- 都可以用來破壞工具。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 14436;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "和雷霆崖的貝恩·血蹄談一談。", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Baine Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Baine Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff.",  OLD Details : "你的聲望已遍及我們偉大的城市。任何完成大地之母儀祭的$r都會獲得這份榮譽。$b$b你的最後一個任務便是探訪我們年輕的領袖，貝恩·血蹄，他就居住在雷霆崖的最頂層。", Details AC enUS : "You will now be revered within our great city. Any $r worthy of completing the Rites of the Earthmother earns that honor.$b$bFor your final quest, seek out our young leader, Baine Bloodhoof, who dwells atop the highest mesa in Thunder Bluff." ; Wowhead enUS : "You will now be revered within our great city. Any $r worthy of completing the Rites of the Earthmother earns that honor.$b$bFor your final quest, seek out our young leader, Baine Bloodhoof, who dwells atop the highest mesa in Thunder Bluff."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '與雷霆崖的貝恩‧血蹄交談。', `Details` = '任何能夠完成大地之母祭儀的$r都可以贏得整個雷霆崖的尊重。$b$b你的最後一個任務是去見見我們的年輕領袖貝恩‧血蹄，他就住在雷霆崖最高的那座臺地上。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 14439;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "這把老舊破碎的劍柄已經失去了往日的光輝。這劍柄在斷掉以前一定是某個工匠的精心傑作。$B$B如此優雅的徽記與劍柄上奇特的珠寶裝飾，在在顯示出這把劍的主人肯定不同凡響。白銀誓盟的人一定有興趣了解如何修復這把藝術品。到銀白聯賽場地南邊的奎爾德拉之眠去找他們的代理人。", Details AC enUS : "This battered old sword hilt has seen better days. Before the hilt was snapped from the blade, it must've been a magnificent example of the blacksmith's art.$B$BThe graceful symbols and exotic gemstones decorating the hilt suggest that the weapon may have belonged to a powerful person. Surely, the Silver Covenant members would be interested in hearing about the recovery of such an artifact. Seek out their representative at Quel'Delar's Rest, south of the Argent Tournament Grounds." ; Wowhead enUS : "This battered old sword hilt has seen better days. Before the hilt was snapped from the blade, it must've been a magnificent example of the blacksmith's art.$b$bThe graceful symbols and exotic gemstones decorating the hilt suggest that the weapon may have belonged to a powerful person. Surely, the Silver Covenant members would be interested in hearing about the recovery of such an artifact. Seek out their representative at Quel'Delar's Rest, south of the Argent Tournament Grounds."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '這把老舊破碎的劍柄已經失去了往日的光輝。這劍柄在斷掉以前一定是某個工匠的精心傑作。$b$b如此優雅的徽記與劍柄上奇特的珠寶裝飾，在在顯示出這把劍的主人肯定不同凡響。白銀誓盟的人一定有興趣了解如何修復這把藝術品。到銀白聯賽場地南邊的奎爾德拉之眠去找他們的代理人。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 14443;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "不會錯的-這劍柄是屬於一把強大且古老的武器，但會是哪一把呢？我不認為我曾見過或者聽過這把劍上的徽記，但這並不表示我們毫無頭緒。$B$B考雷斯塔茲，也就是為人所知的卡薩斯，是奎爾多雷和祈倫托的老朋友。以他豐富的知識與資源，想必能理出些頭緒。到龍眠神殿的最上層找他商議，然後回達拉然找白銀領區的秘法師泰巴林報告結果。", Details AC enUS : "There's no mistaking it - this hilt comes from a powerful, ancient weapon, but which one? I do not recall seeing or hearing of a sword with these markings, but that doesn't mean that all is lost.$B$BKorialstrasz, better known as Krasus, has long been a friend to the quel'dorei and the Kirin Tor. With his vast knowledge and resources, he's certain to know something. Travel to the top of Wyrmrest Temple and seek his counsel, then report to Arcanist Tybalin inside the Silver Enclave in Dalaran." ; Wowhead enUS : "There's no mistaking it - this hilt comes from a powerful, ancient weapon, but which one? I do not recall seeing or hearing of a sword with these markings, but that doesn't mean that all is lost.$b$bKorialstrasz, better known as Krasus, has long been a friend to the quel'dorei and the Kirin Tor. With his vast knowledge and resources, he's certain to know something. Travel to the top of Wyrmrest Temple and seek his counsel, then report to Arcanist Tybalin inside the Silver Enclave in Dalaran.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "向卡薩斯詢問劍柄的來源。", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Ask Krasus about the hilt's origins" ; Wowhead enUS : "Ask Krasus about the hilt's origins"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '不會錯的-這劍柄是屬於一把強大且古老的武器，但會是哪一把呢？我不認為我曾見過或者聽過這把劍上的徽記，但這並不表示我們毫無頭緒。$b$b考雷斯塔茲，也就是為人所知的卡薩斯，是奎爾多雷和祈倫托的老朋友。以他豐富的知識與資源，想必能理出些頭緒。到龍眠神殿的最上層找他商議，然後回達拉然找白銀領區的秘法師泰巴林報告結果。', `Objectivetext1` = '向卡薩斯詢問劍柄的來源', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 14444;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我在城底區的線民說：奪日者密探在跟黑市商人買材料。奪日者通常不會對下水道的事情感興趣，顯然另有所圖。$B$B去城底區找出密探，把他解決了，然後檢查一下密探身上有沒有任何資訊可以幫我們找出龍眠之書的下落。絕對不能讓他們搶先一步把書帶回寒冰皇冠。", Details AC enUS : "One of my contacts in the Underbelly caught sight of a Sunreaver agent buying reagents from a dealer in the Black Market area. The Sunreavers normally aren't known for their interest in what goes on down in the sewers, so that's a big indication that they're planning something.$B$BHead into the Underbelly, find this Sunreaver agent, and take care of him. Search the body for any information that might give us a lead on the location of that tome from Wyrmrest. We can't let them get it back to Icecrown first." ; Wowhead enUS : "One of my contacts in the Underbelly caught sight of a Sunreaver agent buying reagents from a dealer in the Black Market area. The Sunreavers normally aren't known for their interest in what goes on in the sewers, so that's a big indication they're planning something.$b$bHead into the Underbelly, find this Sunreaver agent, and take care of them. Search the body for any information that might give us a lead on the location of that tome from Wyrmrest. We can't let them get it back to Icecrown first."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我在城底區的線民說：奪日者密探在跟黑市商人買材料。奪日者通常不會對下水道的事情感興趣，顯然另有所圖。$b$b去城底區找出密探，把他解決了，然後檢查一下密探身上有沒有任何資訊可以幫我們找出龍眠之書的下落。絕對不能讓他們搶先一步把書帶回寒冰皇冠。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 14457;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你到了，嗯?很好。我一直在等待幫手。此時不做更待何時，對吧? $b$b帶著這個工具組，深入那個人渣化學製藥公司，把這張傳票交給他們的領導人胡默爾。傳票就在裡面。這可以保護你不被他們施展的化學伎倆給傷害。當時機來臨時，就使用其中一個中和劑，好嗎?", Details AC enUS : "You made it, huh? Good. I've been waiting for help. No time like the present to act, right?$b$bTake this kit and head deeper inside to serve papers to the leader of that scumbag chemical company, Hummel. The paper's inside. So's a little something to protect you from any chemical tricks they might pull. Use one of the neutralizers when the time comes, all right?" ; Wowhead enUS : "You made it, huh? Good. I've been waiting for help. No time like the present to act, right?$b$bTake this kit and head deeper inside to serve papers to the leader of that scumbag chemical company, Hummel. The paper's inside. So's a little something to protect you from any chemical tricks they might pull. Use one of the neutralizers when the time comes, all right?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你到了，嗯?很好。我一直在等待幫手。此時不做更待何時，對吧?$b$b帶著這個工具組，深入那個人渣化學製藥公司，把這張傳票交給他們的領導人胡默爾。傳票就在裡面。這可以保護你不被他們施展的化學伎倆給傷害。當時機來臨時，就使用其中一個中和劑，好嗎?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 14488;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "幫助你潛入奪日者聖堂可不是件簡單的差事。只有身著奪日者外袍的人才能獲准進入聖堂。假如我們可以拿到一件，再加上簡單的附魔，就可以完成後續的工作。$B$B你可以在命運織坊上方的露臺找到桑迪‧光爍 。我以前幫過他幾次，所以他欠我一個人情。他在城裡面幫各式各樣的人處理送洗的衣物。或許他有辦法把外袍『借』你一陣子。", Details AC enUS : "Getting you inside the Sunreaver's Sanctuary will be tougher than it appears. Only those who possess Sunreaver tabards are permitted entry to sanctuary. If we can get our hands on one, a simple enchantment will do the rest of the work.$B$BOn the balcony above Threads of Fate, you'll find Shandy Glossgleam. I've helped him a few times in the past, so he owes me a favor. He handles laundry for a wide variety of people in the city. Maybe he can find a way to 'lend' you a tabard for a while." ; Wowhead enUS : "Getting you inside the Sunreaver's Sanctuary will be tougher than it appears. Only those who possess Sunreaver tabards are permitted entry to sanctuary. If we can get our hands on one, a simple enchantment will do the rest of the work.$b$bOn the balcony above Threads of Fate, you'll find Shandy Glossgleam. I've helped him a few times in the past, so he owes me a favor. He handles laundry for a wide variety of people in the city. Maybe he can find a way to 'lend' you a tabard for a while."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '幫助你潛入奪日者聖堂可不是件簡單的差事。只有身著奪日者外袍的人才能獲准進入聖堂。假如我們可以拿到一件，再加上簡單的附魔，就可以完成後續的工作。$b$b你可以在命運織坊上方的露臺找到桑迪‧光爍 。我以前幫過他幾次，所以他欠我一個人情。他在城裡面幫各式各樣的人處理送洗的衣物。或許他有辦法把外袍『借』你一陣子。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 20438;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我已經在外袍上施加了魔法，這應該可讓你暫時避開奪日者聖堂的耳目。你應該有足夠的時間潛入『下流畜生酒店』，並與奪日者的聯繫人，博學者哈索瑞爾會面。$B$B在喬裝的掩護之下，設法取得他們向龍眠者借來的《上古龍鑄劍刃》，並且把書交給我。", Details AC enUS : "I've placed an enchantment on the tabard that should allow you to slip past the Sunreaver Sanctuary's defenses for a short period of time. You should have enough time to find your way into The Filthy Animal and meet up with the Sunreaver contact there, one Magister Hathorel.$B$BObtain the copy of Ancient Dragonforged Blades that his men borrowed from Wyrmrest while your disguise holds, and return it to me." ; Wowhead enUS : "I've placed an enchantment on the tabard that should allow you to slip past the Sunreaver Sanctuary's defenses for a short period of time. You should have enough time to find your way into The Filthy Animal and meet up with the Sunreaver contact there, one Magister Hathorel.$b$bObtain the copy of Ancient Dragonforged Blades that his men borrowed from Wyrmrest while your disguise holds, and return it to me."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我已經在外袍上施加了魔法，這應該可讓你暫時避開奪日者聖堂的耳目。你應該有足夠的時間潛入『下流畜生酒店』，並與奪日者的聯繫人，博學者哈索瑞爾會面。$b$b在喬裝的掩護之下，設法取得他們向龍眠者借來的《上古龍鑄劍刃》，並且把書交給我。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 20439;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我已經在外袍上施加了魔法，這應該可讓你暫時避開白銀誓盟的耳目。你應該有足夠的時間進入白銀領區的頂樓，並與白銀誓盟的聯繫人秘法師泰巴林會面。$B$B在喬裝的掩護之下，設法取得他們向龍眠者借來的《上古龍鑄劍刃》，並且把書交給我。", Details AC enUS : "I've placed an enchantment on the tabard that should allow you to slip past the Silver Enclave's defenses for a short period of time. You should have enough time to find your way up to the top level of the Silver Enclave and meet up with the Silver Covenant's man there, known as Arcanist Tybalin.$B$BWhile disguised, obtain the copy of Ancient Dragonforged Blades that his men borrowed from Wyrmrest, and return the book to me." ; Wowhead enUS : "I've placed an enchantment on the tabard that should allow you to slip past the Silver Enclave's defenses for a short period of time. You should have enough time to find your way up to the top level of the Silver Enclave and meet up with the Silver Covenant's man there, known as Arcanist Tybalin.$b$bWhile disguised, obtain the copy of Ancient Dragonforged Blades that his men borrowed from Wyrmrest, and return the book to me."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我已經在外袍上施加了魔法，這應該可讓你暫時避開白銀誓盟的耳目。你應該有足夠的時間進入白銀領區的頂樓，並與白銀誓盟的聯繫人秘法師泰巴林會面。$b$b在喬裝的掩護之下，設法取得他們向龍眠者借來的《上古龍鑄劍刃》，並且把書交給我。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24451;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我們必須盡快把書交給卡拉迪斯‧亮矛。你可以帶給他嗎？我不放心讓其他人運送這本書，而你證明了你擁有牽制奪日者的資質。$B$B帶著它前往奎爾德拉之眠，地點在寒冰皇冠的銀白聯賽場地之南。卡拉迪斯將帶著劍等你。一旦鑑定出這把劍的來歷，我們就能將其納入我們的名下。", Details AC enUS : "We must get this book to Caladis Brightspear immediately. Would you bring it to him? I cannot rely on anyone else to transport the book and you have proven adept at keeping the Sunreavers at bay.$B$BTake it with you to Quel'Delar's rest, south of the Argent Tournament Grounds in Icecrown. Caladis and the sword will be waiting. The sooner we can identify the blade, the sooner we can claim it." ; Wowhead enUS : "We must get this book to Caladis Brightspear immediately. Would you bring it to him? I cannot rely on anyone else to transport the book and you have proven adept at keeping the Sunreavers at bay.$b$bTake it with you to Quel'Delar's rest, south of the Argent Tournament Grounds in Icecrown. Caladis and the sword will be waiting. The sooner we can identify the blade, the sooner we can claim it."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我們必須盡快把書交給卡拉迪斯‧亮矛。你可以帶給他嗎？我不放心讓其他人運送這本書，而你證明了你擁有牽制奪日者的資質。$b$b帶著它前往奎爾德拉之眠，地點在寒冰皇冠的銀白聯賽場地之南。卡拉迪斯將帶著劍等你。一旦鑑定出這把劍的來歷，我們就能將其納入我們的名下。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24454;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我們不能坐視奎爾德拉如今殘破且淪喪的模樣。帶著殘缺的劍身以及破損的劍柄，前往冰冠城塞的薩倫之淵。$B$B巫妖王在那裡使喚奴隸採集、加工以及轉換薩鋼礦。這些灌能的薩鋼錠就是我們重鑄奎爾德拉所需的材料。$B$B你必須收集灌能的薩鋼錠並且奪取鍛造大師之錘，然後將這些東西帶到鍛造大師的鐵砧去重鑄劍刃。", Details AC enUS : "We cannot allow Quel'Delar to remain broken and disgraced. Take the remnants of the sword, along with the battered hilt you discovered, and venture into the Pit of Saron within Icecrown Citadel.$B$BIn the pit, the Lich King uses slaves to mine, process, and transform saronite ore. This infused saronite is what we will use to rebuild Quel'Delar.$B$BYou must gather bars of infused saronite and capture the forgemaster's hammer, then bring them to the forgemaster's anvil and reforge the sword." ; Wowhead enUS : "We cannot allow Quel'Delar to remain broken and disgraced. Take the remnants of the sword, along with the battered hilt you discovered, and venture into the Pit of Saron within Icecrown Citadel.$b$bIn the pit, the Lich King uses slaves to mine, process, and transform saronite ore. This infused saronite is what we will use to rebuild Quel'Delar.$b$bYou must gather bars of infused saronite and capture the forgemaster's hammer, then bring them to the forgemaster's anvil and reforge the sword."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我們不能坐視奎爾德拉如今殘破且淪喪的模樣。帶著殘缺的劍身以及破損的劍柄，前往冰冠城塞的薩倫之淵。$b$b巫妖王在那裡使喚奴隸採集、加工以及轉換薩鋼礦。這些灌能的薩鋼錠就是我們重鑄奎爾德拉所需的材料。$b$b你必須收集灌能的薩鋼錠並且奪取鍛造大師之錘，然後將這些東西帶到鍛造大師的鐵砧去重鑄劍刃。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24461;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "奎爾德拉的碎塊終於接合好了，整把劍現在已回歸完整的面貌，但在淬鍊之前仍無法用於戰鬥之中。這把磨損的薩鋼劍刃相當脆弱，只要擊中任何東西就會立刻粉碎。$B$B在冰冠城塞深處的眾魂熔爐是一個可以安心淬鍊劍刃的地方。帶著奎爾德拉到靈魂吞噬者的住所尋找爐缸。把劍刃放進爐缸中淬鍊，然後把它帶來冰封大廳給我。", Details AC enUS : "At last, the pieces of Quel'Delar are rejoined and the blade is whole, but it cannot see battle until you have tempered it. That jagged saronite edge is brittle and will shatter the moment it strikes anything.$B$BDeep in Icecrown Citadel's Forge of Souls is a place where the blade can safely be tempered. Take Quel'Delar with you to the abode of the Devourer of Souls and look for the crucible. Plunge the blade into the crucible to temper it and bring it back to me in The Frozen Halls." ; Wowhead enUS : "At last, the pieces of Quel'Delar are rejoined and the blade is whole, but it cannot see battle until you have tempered it. That jagged saronite edge is brittle and will shatter the moment it strikes anything.$b$bDeep in Icecrown Citadel's Forge of Souls is a place where the blade can safely be tempered. Take Quel'Delar with you to the abode of the Devourer of Souls and look for the crucible. Plunge the blade into the crucible to temper it and bring it back to me in The Frozen Halls."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '奎爾德拉的碎塊終於接合好了，整把劍現在已回歸完整的面貌，但在淬鍊之前仍無法用於戰鬥之中。這把磨損的薩鋼劍刃相當脆弱，只要擊中任何東西就會立刻粉碎。$b$b在冰冠城塞深處的眾魂熔爐是一個可以安心淬鍊劍刃的地方。帶著奎爾德拉到靈魂吞噬者的住所尋找爐缸。把劍刃放進爐缸中淬鍊，然後把它帶來冰封大廳給我。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24476;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你已經重鑄和淬鍊完劍刃了，但它依然紋風不動的插在劍鞘之中，完全未展示出它應有的力量。你說這把劍在引導著你，似乎它擁有自我的意志？$B$B你敢把它帶去它所欲之處嗎？這把劍不該如此沉寂與執著，但我擔心若你不將它帶往所欲之處，我們永遠無法查出原因。帶著它前往冰冠城塞裡的倒影大廳，但是請保持警覺！我會在冰封大廳等著你。", Details AC enUS : "You have reforged and tempered the sword, yet it sits quietly in its sheath, showing no signs of the power it should possess. You say the sword pulls you, as though it possesses a will?$B$BDare you bring it where it wishes to go? It's not right that the sword should be this silent and this insistent, yet I fear that if you do not take the sword to its destination, we will never learn why. Take it into Icecrown Citadel's Halls of Reflection, but be on your guard! I'll be waiting for you in The Frozen Halls." ; Wowhead enUS : "You have reforged and tempered the sword, yet it sits quietly in its sheath, showing no signs of the power it should possess. You say the sword pulls you, as though it possesses a will?$b$bDare you bring it where it wishes to go? It's not right that the sword should be this silent and this insistent, yet I fear that if you do not take the sword to its destination, we will never learn why. Take it into Icecrown Citadel's Halls of Reflection, but be on your guard! I'll be waiting for you in The Frozen Halls."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你已經重鑄和淬鍊完劍刃了，但它依然紋風不動的插在劍鞘之中，完全未展示出它應有的力量。你說這把劍在引導著你，似乎它擁有自我的意志？$b$b你敢把它帶去它所欲之處嗎？這把劍不該如此沉寂與執著，但我擔心若你不將它帶往所欲之處，我們永遠無法查出原因。帶著它前往冰冠城塞裡的倒影大廳，但是請保持警覺！我會在冰封大廳等著你。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24480;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "釋放15名聯盟奴隸並且殺掉鍛造大師加弗羅斯。", Objectives AC enUS : "Free 15 Alliance Slaves and kill Forgemaster Garfrost." ; Wowhead enUS : "Free 6 quarry camps and kill Forgemaster Garfrost.",  OLD Details : "他們強迫被俘虜的我方士兵在礦區工作!$B$B英雄...請殺掉俘虜他們的人，釋放那些士兵...當我們挑戰天譴領主提朗紐斯的時候，我們會需要他們的援助。", Details AC enUS : "They've put our captured soldiers to work in the quarry! Kill their captors and set them free, hero, and do it quickly. We will need their aid when we confront Scourgelord Tyrannus." ; Wowhead enUS : "They've put my captured soldiers to work in the quarry!$b$bKill their captors and set them free, hero. We will need their aid when we confront Scourgelord Tyrannus.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "釋放聯盟奴隸", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Alliance Slaves freed" ; Wowhead enUS : "Quarry camps freed",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "	鍛造大師加弗羅斯", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Forgemaster Garfrost slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '解放6個礦場營地並擊殺鍛造大師加弗羅斯。', `Details` = '他們強迫被俘虜的我方士兵在礦區工作！$b$b英雄…請殺掉俘虜他們的人，釋放那些士兵…當我們挑戰天譴領主提朗紐斯的時候，我們會需要他們的援助。', `Objectivetext1` = '解放礦場營地', `Objectivetext2` = '鍛造大師加弗羅斯 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24498;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "在我方人手嚴重不足的情況下，冒險進入城塞簡直跟送命沒什麼兩樣，但絕對不能錯過如此罕見的機會。$B$B往遠方的那頭清出一條路，鞏固薩倫之淵的入口。我們必須佔領該處，才能讓我方的人員攻入城內。", Details AC enUS : "I cannot thank you enough for coming. We're severely undermanned to be risking a venture into the citadel, but opportunities like this are too rare to pass up.$B$BI'm awaiting the arrival of champions from the coliseum, but if your reputation holds true, you should be more than equipped to fight through the forge yourself. Clear the way to the far side and secure the passage to the Pit of Saron. We will need to hold it to move our men further into the citadel.$B$BPlease hurry, $n. We're counting on you." ; Wowhead enUS : "We're severely undermanned to be risking a venture into the citadel, but opportunities like this are too rare to pass up.$b$bClear the way to the far side and secure the passage to the Pit of Saron. We will need to hold it to move our men further into the citadel.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bronjahm slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Devourer of Souls",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Devourer of Souls",  OLD Objectivetext4 : "", Objectivetext4 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Devourer of Souls"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '在我方人手嚴重不足的情況下，冒險進入城塞簡直跟送命沒什麼兩樣，但絕對不能錯過如此罕見的機會。$b$b往遠方的那頭清出一條路，鞏固薩倫之淵的入口。我們必須佔領該處，才能讓我方的人員攻入城內。', `Objectivetext1` = '布朗吉姆 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '眾魂吞噬者', `Objectivetext3` = '眾魂吞噬者', `Objectivetext4` = '眾魂吞噬者', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24499;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "真是令人難以置信，在阿薩斯的王座上，我們或許有可能擊敗他。如果巫妖王真的被擊敗了，那麼誰又該成為下一個巫妖王呢?$B$B雖然局勢仍未明朗，不過你必須找到珍娜，即時逃離巫妖王的魔爪。", Details AC enUS : "Uther knew a great deal about how Arthas might be defeated. It's hard to believe that there is much hope of defeating Arthas upon the steps of his own throne. And who will take up the crown of Lich King if it comes to that?$B$BMany questions remain, but the answers that you've uncovered may be critical to ensuring Arthas' defeat. You need to find Jaina and escape the Lich King while there's still time." ; Wowhead enUS : "It's hard to believe that there is much hope of defeating Arthas upon the steps of his own throne. And who will take up the crown of Lich King if it comes to that?$b$bMany questions remain. but you need to find Jaina and escape the Lich King while there's still time.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "逃離巫妖王", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Find Jaina Proudmoore" ; Wowhead enUS : "Find Jaina Proudmoore"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '真是令人難以置信，在阿薩斯的王座上，我們或許有可能擊敗他。如果巫妖王真的被擊敗了，那麼誰又該成為下一個巫妖王呢?$b$b雖然局勢仍未明朗，不過你必須找到珍娜，即時逃離巫妖王的魔爪。', `Objectivetext1` = '找到珍娜‧普勞德摩爾', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24500;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "$C!快來這邊，我有話要跟你說!$B$B我的女王，希瓦娜斯‧風行者女士，她在冰冠城塞的戰鬥中發現了一個洞穴，可以進入一個稱之為眾魂熔爐的地方。她在離開之前吩咐過我，要找出勇猛的戰士來支援她。我覺得你就是適當的人選。$B$B從熔爐的入口進去找她吧，$c。", Details AC enUS : "$C! Come close quickly, I must have a word!$B$BMy queen, the Lady Sylvanas Windrunner, has uncovered a hole in the defenses of Icecrown Citadel into a place she referred to as "The Forge of Souls." She sent word before she left for me to find fierce fighters to send her way. I think you'll do.$B$BGo to her within the entrance to the forge, $c." ; Wowhead enUS : "$c! Come close quickly, I must have a word!$b$bMy queen, the Lady Sylvanas Windrunner, has uncovered a hole in the defenses of Icecrown Citadel into a place she referred to as "The Forge of Souls." She sent word before she left for me to find fierce fighters to send her way. I think you'll do.$b$bGo to her within the entrance to the forge, $c."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '$c!快來這邊，我有話要跟你說!$b$b我的女王，希瓦娜斯‧風行者女士，她在冰冠城塞的戰鬥中發現了一個洞穴，可以進入一個稱之為眾魂熔爐的地方。她在離開之前吩咐過我，要找出勇猛的戰士來支援她。我覺得你就是適當的人選。$b$b從熔爐的入口進去找她吧，$c。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24506;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "釋放15名部落奴隸並且殺掉鍛造大師加弗羅斯。", Objectives AC enUS : "Free 15 Horde Slaves and kill Forgemaster Garfrost." ; Wowhead enUS : "Free 5 quarry camps and kill Forgemaster Garfrost.",  OLD Details : "他們強迫被俘虜的我方士兵在礦區工作。$B$B殺掉俘虜他們的人，釋放那些士兵，$c...當我們挑戰天譴領主提朗紐斯的時候，我們會需要他們的援助。", Details AC enUS : "They've put our captured soldiers to work in the quarry. Kill their captors and set them free, $c, and do it quickly. We will need their aid when we confront Scourgelord Tyrannus." ; Wowhead enUS : "They've put our captured soldiers to work in the quarry.$b$bKill their captors and set them free, $c. We will need their aid when we confront Scourgelord Tyrannus.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "釋放部落奴隸", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Horde Slaves freed" ; Wowhead enUS : "Quarry camps freed",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Forgemaster Garfrost slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '解放5個礦場營地並擊殺鍛造大師加弗羅斯。', `Details` = '他們強迫被俘虜的我方士兵在礦區工作。$b$b殺掉俘虜他們的人，釋放那些士兵，$c...當我們挑戰天譴領主提朗紐斯的時候，我們會需要他們的援助。', `Objectivetext1` = '解放礦場營地', `Objectivetext2` = '鍛造大師加弗羅斯 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24507;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "$C!快來這邊，我有話必須跟你說!$B$B我的主人，珍娜‧普勞德摩爾女士，她在冰冠城塞的戰鬥中發現了一個洞穴，可以進入一個稱之為眾魂熔爐的地方。她在離開前吩咐過我，要我盡量找人來幫忙...然後，這個嘛，我希望那個人就是你。$B$B拜託一下，快過去那裡找她吧。", Details AC enUS : "$C! Come close quickly, I must have a word!$B$BMy patron, the Lady Jaina Proudmoore, has uncovered a hole in the defenses of Icecrown Citadel into a place she referred to as "The Forge of Souls." She sent word before she left for me to find any help that I could... and, well, I was hoping that might be you.$B$BPlease, find her there as soon as you can." ; Wowhead enUS : "$c! Come close quickly, I must have a word!$b$bMy patron, the Lady Jaina Proudmoore, has uncovered a hole in the defenses of Icecrown Citadel into a place she referred to as "The Forge of Souls." She sent word before she left for me to find any help that I could... and, well, I was hoping that might be you.$b$bPlease, find her there as soon as you can."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '$c!快來這邊，我有話必須跟你說!$b$b我的主人，珍娜‧普勞德摩爾女士，她在冰冠城塞的戰鬥中發現了一個洞穴，可以進入一個稱之為眾魂熔爐的地方。她在離開前吩咐過我，要我盡量找人來幫忙...然後，這個嘛，我希望那個人就是你。$b$b拜託一下，快過去那裡找她吧。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24510;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "用這麼少的人手潛入城中相當冒險，但是如此罕見的機會絕對不能錯過。$B$B往遠方的那頭清出一條路，鞏固好薩倫之淵的入口。我們必須佔領那個地方，才能讓我們的人員進入城內。", Details AC enUS : "I'm glad we have someone capable to aid us in this. Delving into the citadel with so few is risky at best, but opportunities like this are too rare to pass up.$B$BI'm awaiting the arrival of champions from the coliseum, but if your reputation holds true, you should be more than equipped to fight through the forge yourself. Clear the way to the far side and secure the passage to the Pit of Saron. We will need to hold it to move our men further into the Citadel.$B$BBe quick about it, $n. Time is short." ; Wowhead enUS : "Delving into the citadel with so few is risky at best, but opportunities like this are too rare to pass up.$b$bClear the way to the far side and secure the passage to the Pit of Saron. We will need to hold it to move our men further into the Citadel.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Bronjahm slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Devourer of Souls",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Devourer of Souls",  OLD Objectivetext4 : "", Objectivetext4 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Devourer of Souls"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '用這麼少的人手潛入城中相當冒險，但是如此罕見的機會絕對不能錯過。$b$b往遠方的那頭清出一條路，鞏固好薩倫之淵的入口。我們必須佔領那個地方，才能讓我們的人員進入城內。', `Objectivetext1` = '布朗吉姆 消滅', `Objectivetext2` = '眾魂吞噬者', `Objectivetext3` = '眾魂吞噬者', `Objectivetext4` = '眾魂吞噬者', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24511;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你也注意到那些傢伙了吧，對嗎?多年來，各大節慶的商業活動一向都由熱砂企業一手包辦，突然之間，這群傢伙就這麼湧入了市場。他們可不屬於熱砂企業;公司僱用我來查明事情的真相。這件事看來並不單純，不單是香水而已。 ⏎  ⏎ 帶著我拿來的儀器，然後去分析一下守衛身上散發的香水氣息。我想知道他們在香水裡頭添加了什麼東西。事情看來不太對勁。", Details AC enUS : "Get a load of these guys, would ya? Steamwheedle's been handling the business of holidays for years, and all of a sudden, these guys bust into the market. They're not Steamwheedle; the cartel hired me to get to the bottom of this. Something stinks here and it ain't just perfume.$B$BTake this device I brought and go analyze the perfume clouds around the guards. I want to know what they're putting in that stuff. Things ain't natural." ; Wowhead enUS : "Get a load of these guys, would ya? Steamwheedle's been handling the business of holidays for years, and all of a sudden, these guys bust into the market. They're not Steamwheedle; the cartel hired me to get to the bottom of this. Something stinks here and it ain't just perfume.$b$bTake this device I brought and go analyze the perfume clouds around the guards. I want to know what they're putting in that stuff. Things ain't natural."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你也注意到那些傢伙了吧，對嗎?多年來，各大節慶的商業活動一向都由熱砂企業一手包辦，突然之間，這群傢伙就這麼湧入了市場。他們可不屬於熱砂企業;公司僱用我來查明事情的真相。這件事看來並不單純，不單是香水而已。$b$b帶著我拿來的儀器，然後去分析一下守衛身上散發的香水氣息。我想知道他們在香水裡頭添加了什麼東西。事情看來不太對勁。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24536;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我就知道他們圖謀不軌!這東西含有某種思想控制的化學成分，但光憑這種小樣本，我仍無法掌握他們的把柄。我需要的是成品。 ⏎  ⏎ 你可別大搖大擺的跑去跟他們買!我不想看你付給那些下流胚子任何一分錢。不，你必須不著痕跡的從他們的源頭下手。 ⏎  ⏎ 我會把你偽裝成一個送貨員。我看到他們僱用的惡棍在大門外看守著一批囤貨。用跑的過去那邊，記得別停下來，不然他們會逮到你!他們會丟給你一個箱子。把它帶回來這裡。", Details AC enUS : "I knew they were up to no good! There's some sort of mind-affecting chemical in here, but I can't get a handle on it with such a small sample. I need the real stuff.$B$BDon't just go over there and buy it! I don't want you giving these scumbags one copper. Nah, you gotta get it from the source, discreet-like.$B$BI'll disguise you as a package runner. I saw a stockpile guarded by their goons outside the gates. Go run by, and DON'T stop, or they'll make you! They'll toss you a crate. Bring it back here." ; Wowhead enUS : "I knew they were up to no good! There's some sort of mind-affecting chemical in here, but I can't get a handle on it with such a small sample. I need the real stuff.$b$bDon't just go over there and buy it! I don't want you giving these scumbags one copper. Nah, you gotta get it from the source, discreet-like.$b$bI'll disguise you as a package runner. I saw a stockpile guarded by their goons outside the gates. Go run by, and DON'T stop, or they'll make you! They'll toss you a crate. Bring it back here."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我就知道他們圖謀不軌!這東西含有某種思想控制的化學成分，但光憑這種小樣本，我仍無法掌握他們的把柄。我需要的是成品。$b$b你可別大搖大擺的跑去跟他們買!我不想看你付給那些下流胚子任何一分錢。不，你必須不著痕跡的從他們的源頭下手。$b$b我會把你偽裝成一個送貨員。我看到他們僱用的惡棍在大門外看守著一批囤貨。用跑的過去那邊，記得別停下來，不然他們會逮到你!他們會丟給你一個箱子。把它帶回來這裡。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24541;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "在冰冠城塞中，把『聖光報復』、25個原始薩鋼、『腐臉的酸性血液』以及『膿腸的酸性血液』放置在大領主莫格萊尼的符文熔爐。$B$B『腐臉的酸性血液』與『膿腸的酸性血液』只能在25人模式的冰冠城塞中取得。", Objectives AC enUS : "Place Light's Vengeance, 25 Primordial Saronite, Rotface's Acidic Blood, and Festergut's Acidic Blood in Highlord Mograine's runeforge in Icecrown Citadel.$B$BRotface's Acidic Blood and Festergut's Acidic Blood may only be obtained in the 25 person difficulty setting of Icecrown Citadel." ; Wowhead enUS : "Place Light's Vengeance, 25 Primordial Saronite, Rotface's Acidic Blood, and Festergut's Acidic Blood in Highlord Mograine's runeforge in Icecrown Citadel.$b$bRotface's Acidic Blood and Festergut's Acidic Blood may only be obtained in the 25 person difficulty setting of Icecrown Citadel."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '在冰冠城塞中，把『聖光報復』、25個原始薩鋼、『腐臉的酸性血液』以及『膿腸的酸性血液』放置在大領主莫格萊尼的符文熔爐。$b$b『腐臉的酸性血液』與『膿腸的酸性血液』只能在25人模式的冰冠城塞中取得。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24545;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "大領主莫格萊尼要你去收集50個暗影冰晶裂片。$B$B暗影冰晶裂片只能在25人困難模式中取得。", Objectives AC enUS : "Highlord Darion Mograine wants you to collect 50 Shadowfrost Shards.$B$BShadowfrost Shards may only be obtained in the 25 person difficulty setting." ; Wowhead enUS : "Highlord Darion Mograine wants you to collect 50 Shadowfrost Shards.$b$bShadowfrost Shards may only be obtained in the 25 person difficulty setting."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '大領主莫格萊尼要你去收集50個暗影冰晶裂片。$b$b暗影冰晶裂片只能在25人困難模式中取得。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24548;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "這把老舊破碎的劍柄已經失去了往日的光輝。這劍柄在斷掉以前一定是某個工匠的精心傑作。$B$B如此優雅的徽記與劍柄上奇特的珠寶裝飾，在在顯示出這把劍的主人肯定不同凡響。奪日者的人一定有興趣了解如何修復這把藝術品。到銀白聯賽場地南邊的奎爾德拉之眠去找他們的代理人。", Details AC enUS : "This battered old sword hilt has seen better days. Before the hilt was snapped from the blade, it must've been a magnificent example of the blacksmith's art.$B$BThe graceful symbols and exotic gemstones decorating the hilt suggest that the weapon may have belonged to a powerful person. Surely, the Sunreavers would be interested in hearing about the recovery of such an artifact. Seek out their representatives at Quel'Delar's Rest, to the south of the Argent Tournament Grounds." ; Wowhead enUS : "This battered old sword hilt has seen better days. Before the hilt was snapped from the blade, it must've been a magnificent example of the blacksmith's art.$b$bThe graceful symbols and exotic gemstones decorating the hilt suggest that the weapon may have belonged to a powerful person. Surely, the Sunreavers would be interested in hearing about the recovery of such an artifact. Seek out their representatives at Quel'Delar's Rest, to the south of the Argent Tournament Grounds."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '這把老舊破碎的劍柄已經失去了往日的光輝。這劍柄在斷掉以前一定是某個工匠的精心傑作。$b$b如此優雅的徽記與劍柄上奇特的珠寶裝飾，在在顯示出這把劍的主人肯定不同凡響。奪日者的人一定有興趣了解如何修復這把藝術品。到銀白聯賽場地南邊的奎爾德拉之眠去找他們的代理人。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24554;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "不會錯的 - 這劍柄是屬於一把強大且古老的武器，但會是哪一把呢？我無法辨識上頭的獨特徽記，不過事情還有解決的辦法。$B$B考雷斯塔茲，也就是為人所知的卡薩斯，是奎爾多雷和祈倫托的老朋友。以他豐富的知識與資源，想必能理出些頭緒。到龍眠神殿的最上層找他商議，然後回達拉然找奪日者聖堂的博學者哈索瑞爾報告結果。", Details AC enUS : "There's no mistaking it - this hilt comes from a powerful, ancient weapon, but which one? I do not recognize these particular markings, but we haven't hit a dead end yet.$B$BKorialstrasz, better known as Krasus, has long been a friend to the quel'dorei and the Kirin Tor. With his vast knowledge and resources, he's certain to know something. Travel to the top of Wyrmrest Temple and seek his counsel, then report to Magister Hathorel inside Sunreaver's Sanctuary in Dalaran." ; Wowhead enUS : "There's no mistaking it - this hilt comes from a powerful, ancient weapon, but which one? I do not recognize these particular markings, but we haven't hit a dead end yet.$b$bKorialstrasz, better known as Krasus, has long been a friend to the quel'dorei and the Kirin Tor. With his vast knowledge and resources, he's certain to know something. Travel to the top of Wyrmrest Temple and seek his counsel, then report to Magister Hathorel inside Sunreaver's Sanctuary in Dalaran.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "向卡薩斯詢問劍柄的來源。", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Ask Krasus about the hilt's origins" ; Wowhead enUS : "Ask Krasus about the hilt's origins"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '不會錯的 - 這劍柄是屬於一把強大且古老的武器，但會是哪一把呢？我無法辨識上頭的獨特徽記，不過事情還有解決的辦法。$b$b考雷斯塔茲，也就是為人所知的卡薩斯，是奎爾多雷和祈倫托的老朋友。以他豐富的知識與資源，想必能理出些頭緒。到龍眠神殿的最上層找他商議，然後回達拉然找奪日者聖堂的博學者哈索瑞爾報告結果。', `Objectivetext1` = '向卡薩斯詢問劍柄的來源', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24555;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "幫助你潛入白銀領區可不是件簡單的差事。只有身著白銀誓盟外袍的人才能獲准進入聖堂。假如我們可以拿到一件，再加上簡單的附魔，就可以完成後續的工作。$B$B你可以在命運織坊上方的露臺找到桑迪‧光爍。我以前幫過他幾次，所以他欠我一個人情。他在城裡面幫各式各樣的人處理送洗的衣物。或許他有辦法把外袍『借』你一陣子。", Details AC enUS : "Getting you inside the Silver Enclave will be tougher than it appears. Only those who possess Silver Covenant tabards are permitted entry to sanctuary. If we can get our hands on one, a simple enchantment will do the rest of the work.$B$BOn the balcony above Threads of Fate, you'll find Shandy Glossgleam. I've helped him a few times in the past, so he owes me a favor. He handles laundry for a wide variety of people in the city. Maybe he can find a way to 'lend' you a tabard for a while." ; Wowhead enUS : "Getting you inside the Silver Enclave will be tougher than it appears. Only those who possess Silver Covenant tabards are permitted entry to sanctuary. If we can get our hands on one, a simple enchantment will do the rest of the work.$b$bOn the balcony above Threads of Fate, you'll find Shandy Glossgleam. I've helped him a few times in the past, so he owes me a favor. He handles laundry for a wide variety of people in the city. Maybe he can find a way to 'lend' you a tabard for a while."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '幫助你潛入白銀領區可不是件簡單的差事。只有身著白銀誓盟外袍的人才能獲准進入聖堂。假如我們可以拿到一件，再加上簡單的附魔，就可以完成後續的工作。$b$b你可以在命運織坊上方的露臺找到桑迪‧光爍。我以前幫過他幾次，所以他欠我一個人情。他在城裡面幫各式各樣的人處理送洗的衣物。或許他有辦法把外袍『借』你一陣子。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24556;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我在城底區的線民發現有白銀誓盟的密探在咒語與烏鴉酒店蒐集情報。白銀誓盟的人通常不會在下水道出沒，所以他們一定在密謀些什麼。$B$B前去城底區找出這個密探，並解決他。檢查一下他身上有沒有任何資訊可以幫我們找出龍眠之書的下落。我們不能讓那些白銀誓盟的傻瓜搶先一步把書帶回寒冰皇冠。", Details AC enUS : "One of my contacts in the Underbelly caught sight of a Silver Covenant agent gathering information at the Cantrips and Crows Tavern. Silver Covenant members aren't normally found in the sewers, so they must be plotting something.$B$BGo into the Underbelly, find this Silver Covenant agent, and eliminate him. Search the body for any information that might give us a lead on the location of that tome from Wyrmrest. We can't let those simpering Silver Covenant weaklings get it back to Icecrown before we do." ; Wowhead enUS : "One of my contacts in the Underbelly caught sight of a Silver Covenant agent gathering information at the Cantrips and Crows Tavern. Silver Covenant members aren't normally found in the sewers, so they must be plotting something.$b$bGo into the Underbelly, find this Silver Covenant agent, and eliminate him. Search the body for any information that might give us a lead on the location of that tome from Wyrmrest. We can't let those simpering Silver Covenant weaklings get it back to Icecrown before we do."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我在城底區的線民發現有白銀誓盟的密探在咒語與烏鴉酒店蒐集情報。白銀誓盟的人通常不會在下水道出沒，所以他們一定在密謀些什麼。$b$b前去城底區找出這個密探，並解決他。檢查一下他身上有沒有任何資訊可以幫我們找出龍眠之書的下落。我們不能讓那些白銀誓盟的傻瓜搶先一步把書帶回寒冰皇冠。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24557;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我們必須盡快把書交給米拉連恩‧日炎。你可以帶給他嗎？我不放心讓其他人運送這本書，而你證明了你擁有牽制白銀誓盟的資質。$B$B帶著它前往奎爾德拉之眠，地點在寒冰皇冠的銀白聯賽場地之南。米拉連恩將等待著你。如果他能鑑定出這把劍的來歷，我們就能將其納入埃薩‧奪日者的名下，並且讓達拉然以及聯盟們看到，我們將一馬當先對抗巫妖王。", Details AC enUS : "We must get this book to Myralion Sunblade. Would you bring it to him? I cannot rely on anyone else to transport the book and you have proven adept at evading the Silver Covenant's men.$B$BTake it with you to Quel'Delar's Rest, south of the Argent Tournament Grounds in Icecrown. Myralion will be waiting for you. If he can identify that blade, we may be able to claim it in the name of Aethas Sunreaver and show Dalaran and the Alliance that we will lead the charge against the Lich King." ; Wowhead enUS : "We must get this book to Myralion Sunblade. Would you bring it to him? I cannot rely on anyone else to transport the book and you have proven adept at evading the Silver Covenant's men.$b$bTake it with you to Quel'Delar's Rest, south of the Argent Tournament Grounds in Icecrown. Myralion will be waiting for you. If he can identify that blade, we may be able to claim it in the name of Aethas Sunreaver and show Dalaran and the Alliance that we will lead the charge against the Lich King."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我們必須盡快把書交給米拉連恩‧日炎。你可以帶給他嗎？我不放心讓其他人運送這本書，而你證明了你擁有牽制白銀誓盟的資質。$b$b帶著它前往奎爾德拉之眠，地點在寒冰皇冠的銀白聯賽場地之南。米拉連恩將等待著你。如果他能鑑定出這把劍的來歷，我們就能將其納入埃薩‧奪日者的名下，並且讓達拉然以及聯盟們看到，我們將一馬當先對抗巫妖王。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24558;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "我們不能坐視奎爾德拉如今殘破且淪喪的模樣。帶著殘缺的劍身以及破損的劍柄，前往冰冠城塞的薩倫之淵。$B$B巫妖王在那裡使喚奴隸採集、加工以及轉換薩鋼礦。這些灌能的薩鋼錠就是我們重鑄奎爾德拉所需的材料。$B$B你必須收集灌能的薩鋼錠並且奪取鍛造大師之錘，然後將這些東西帶到鍛造大師的鐵砧去重鑄劍刃。", Details AC enUS : "We cannot allow Quel'Delar to remain broken and disgraced. Take the remnants of the sword, along with the battered hilt you discovered, and venture into the Pit of Saron within Icecrown Citadel.$B$BIn the pit, the Lich King uses slaves to mine, process, and transform saronite ore. This infused saronite is what we will use to rebuild Quel'Delar.$B$BYou must gather bars of infused saronite and capture the forgemaster's hammer, then bring them to the forgemaster's anvil and reforge the sword." ; Wowhead enUS : "We cannot allow Quel'Delar to remain broken and disgraced. Take the remnants of the sword, along with the battered hilt you discovered, and venture into the Pit of Saron within Icecrown Citadel.$b$bIn the pit, the Lich King uses slaves to mine, process, and transform saronite ore. This infused saronite is what we will use to rebuild Quel'Delar.$b$bYou must gather bars of infused saronite and capture the forgemaster's hammer, then bring them to the forgemaster's anvil and reforge the sword."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '我們不能坐視奎爾德拉如今殘破且淪喪的模樣。帶著殘缺的劍身以及破損的劍柄，前往冰冠城塞的薩倫之淵。$b$b巫妖王在那裡使喚奴隸採集、加工以及轉換薩鋼礦。這些灌能的薩鋼錠就是我們重鑄奎爾德拉所需的材料。$b$b你必須收集灌能的薩鋼錠並且奪取鍛造大師之錘，然後將這些東西帶到鍛造大師的鐵砧去重鑄劍刃。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24559;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "奎爾德拉的碎塊終於接合好了，整把劍現在已回歸完整的面貌，但在淬鍊之前仍無法用於戰鬥之中。這把磨損的薩鋼劍刃相當脆弱，只要擊中任何東西就會立刻粉碎。$B$B在冰冠城塞深處的眾魂熔爐是一個可以安心淬鍊劍刃的地方。帶著奎爾德拉到靈魂吞噬者的住所尋找爐缸。把劍刃放進爐缸中淬鍊，我會在冰封大廳等著你。", Details AC enUS : "At last, the pieces of Quel'Delar are rejoined and the blade is whole, but it cannot see battle until you have tempered it. That jagged saronite edge is brittle and will shatter the moment it strikes anything.$B$BDeep in Icecrown Citadel's Forge of Souls is a place where the blade can safely be tempered. Take Quel'Delar with you to the abode of the Devourer of Souls and look for the crucible. Plunge the blade into the crucible to temper it and bring it back to me. I'll be waiting in The Frozen Halls." ; Wowhead enUS : "At last, the pieces of Quel'Delar are rejoined and the blade is whole, but it cannot see battle until you have tempered it. That jagged saronite edge is brittle and will shatter the moment it strikes anything.$b$bDeep in Icecrown Citadel's Forge of Souls is a place where the blade can safely be tempered. Take Quel'Delar with you to the abode of the Devourer of Souls and look for the crucible. Plunge the blade into the crucible to temper it and bring it back to me. I'll be waiting in The Frozen Halls."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '奎爾德拉的碎塊終於接合好了，整把劍現在已回歸完整的面貌，但在淬鍊之前仍無法用於戰鬥之中。這把磨損的薩鋼劍刃相當脆弱，只要擊中任何東西就會立刻粉碎。$b$b在冰冠城塞深處的眾魂熔爐是一個可以安心淬鍊劍刃的地方。帶著奎爾德拉到靈魂吞噬者的住所尋找爐缸。把劍刃放進爐缸中淬鍊，我會在冰封大廳等著你。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24560;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你已經重鑄和淬鍊完劍刃了，但它依然紋風不動的插在劍鞘之中，跟一般的劍沒什麼兩樣。你說這把劍在引導著你，似乎它擁有自我的意志？$B$B你敢把它帶去它所欲之處嗎？這把劍不該如此沉寂與執著，但我擔心若你不將它帶往所欲之處，我們永遠無法查出原因。帶著它前往冰冠城塞裡的倒影大廳，但是請保持警覺。我會在冰封大廳等著你。", Details AC enUS : "You have re-forged and tempered the sword, yet it sits quietly in its sheath, little different from a mundane blade. You say the sword pulls you, as though it possesses a will?$B$BDare you bring it where it wishes to go? It is not right that the sword should be this silent and this insistent, yet I fear that if you do not take the sword to its destination, we will never learn why. Bear it with you to Icecrown Citadel's Halls of Reflection, but be on your guard. I will wait for you in The Frozen Halls." ; Wowhead enUS : "You have re-forged and tempered the sword, yet it sits quietly in its sheath, little different from a mundane blade. You say the sword pulls you, as though it possesses a will?$b$bDare you bring it where it wishes to go? It is not right that the sword should be this silent and this insistent, yet I fear that if you do not take the sword to its destination, we will never learn why. Bear it with you to Icecrown Citadel's Halls of Reflection, but be on your guard. I will wait for you in The Frozen Halls."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你已經重鑄和淬鍊完劍刃了，但它依然紋風不動的插在劍鞘之中，跟一般的劍沒什麼兩樣。你說這把劍在引導著你，似乎它擁有自我的意志？$b$b你敢把它帶去它所欲之處嗎？這把劍不該如此沉寂與執著，但我擔心若你不將它帶往所欲之處，我們永遠無法查出原因。帶著它前往冰冠城塞裡的倒影大廳，但是請保持警覺。我會在冰封大廳等著你。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24561;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "帶著奎爾德拉盡快前往太陽之井，$n。相信烏瑟的話吧，他說只要這把劍仍受巫妖王的邪惡所影響，你遲早會喪失操控它的權力。你必須前往奎爾達納斯之島，尋找太陽之井的入口，你可以在那裡淨化這把劍。$B$B守衛不會讓你進入太陽之井高地，但是你可以去認識一下赫杜倫‧亮翼，在那裡視察守衛的人。", Details AC enUS : "Take Quel'Delar to the Sunwell as quickly as possible, $N. Trust in Uther's words when he says that you will not always be able to control the blade while it is subject to the evil of the Lich King's influence. You must travel to the Isle of Quel'Danas, and there, seek entry to the Sunwell itself, where you can cleanse the sword.$B$BThe guardians will try to stop you from entering the Sunwell Plateau, but make yourself known to Halduron Brightwing, who will be inspecting the guards there." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take Quel'Delar to the Sunwell as quickly as possible, $n. Trust in Uther's words when he says that you will not always be able to control the blade while it is subject to the evil of the Lich King's influence. You must travel to the Isle of Quel'Danas, and there, seek entry to the Sunwell itself, where you can cleanse the sword.$b$bThe guardians will try to stop you from entering the Sunwell Plateau, but make yourself known to Halduron Brightwing, who will be inspecting the guards there."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '帶著奎爾德拉盡快前往太陽之井，$n。相信烏瑟的話吧，他說只要這把劍仍受巫妖王的邪惡所影響，你遲早會喪失操控它的權力。你必須前往奎爾達納斯之島，尋找太陽之井的入口，你可以在那裡淨化這把劍。$b$b守衛不會讓你進入太陽之井高地，但是你可以去認識一下赫杜倫‧亮翼，在那裡視察守衛的人。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24562;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你就是跟米拉連恩‧日炎合作的人嗎？我知道一個方法，可以讓我們測試劍刃。$B$B如果你清楚這把劍的來歷，你就會回想起，它曾經是薩洛瑞安‧曦尋者在抵抗天譴軍團入侵太陽之井時的佩劍。他拼死奮戰為同袍爭取準備的時間，而他倒下的地方如今稱作死亡之痕。你可以在這座小島上的死亡之痕最南邊找到他的遺骸。去那個地方看看，如果他的亡魂給你祝福的話，我就會允許你進入太陽之井。", Details AC enUS : "You are the one working with Myralion Sunblaze, arent you? I know of a way we can test the sword.$B$BIf you know the blade's history, you recall that it was borne by Thalorien Dawnseeker in defense of the Sunwell against the Scourge. He fell in what is now the Dead Scar, buying time for his men to make their own preparations. You will find his remains near the southern end of the Dead Scar on this isle. Visit them, and if his spirit gives you its blessing, I will allow you to enter the Sunwell." ; Wowhead enUS : "You are the one working with Myralion Sunblaze, arent you? I know of a way we can test the sword.$b$bIf you know the blade's history, you recall that it was borne by Thalorien Dawnseeker in defense of the Sunwell against the Scourge. He fell in what is now the Dead Scar, buying time for his men to make their own preparations. You will find his remains near the southern end of the Dead Scar on this isle. Visit them, and if his spirit gives you its blessing, I will allow you to enter the Sunwell.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "取得薩洛里安的祝福", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Thalorien's Blessing obtained" ; Wowhead enUS : "Thalorien's Blessing obtained"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '你就是跟米拉連恩‧日炎合作的人嗎？我知道一個方法，可以讓我們測試劍刃。$b$b如果你清楚這把劍的來歷，你就會回想起，它曾經是薩洛瑞安‧曦尋者在抵抗天譴軍團入侵太陽之井時的佩劍。他拼死奮戰為同袍爭取準備的時間，而他倒下的地方如今稱作死亡之痕。你可以在這座小島上的死亡之痕最南邊找到他的遺骸。去那個地方看看，如果他的亡魂給你祝福的話，我就會允許你進入太陽之井。', `Objectivetext1` = '取得薩洛瑞安的祝福', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24563;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "<蘿卡聽你述說追捕史尼佛的原因，臉上浮現著厭惡的表情。>$B$B你的意思是說，這陣子我是被鍊金師下了咒?我真不敢相信我愛上那種大騙子!如果再讓我見到那個偷雞摸狗的小哥布林，我絕對會把他撕成碎片! $B$B達成任務之後，他就會前往奧格瑪城門外的東部飛艇塔!$n，無論如何，你都不能讓他就這樣搭上飛艇逃跑!$B$B趕快前往飛艇塔，不然你會錯失逮到他的機會!", Details AC enUS : "<Roka listens with disgust as you tell her why you're trying to track down Snivel.>$B$BYou mean I've been under the spell of an alchemist all this time? I can't believe I fell for that fraud! If I ever get my hands on that conniving little goblin, I'll tear him apart!$B$BIf he's finished his errands, he's on his way down to the zeppelin tower east of Orgrimmar's gates! Whatever you do, $N, you can't let him board that zeppelin and get away with all this!$B$BHurry to the zeppelin tower before you miss him!" ; Wowhead enUS : "<Roka listens with disgust as you tell her why you're trying to track down Snivel.>$b$bYou mean I've been under the spell of an alchemist all this time? I can't believe I fell for that fraud! If I ever get my hands on that conniving little goblin, I'll tear him apart!$b$bIf he's finished his errands, he's on his way down to the zeppelin tower in the middle of Orgrimmar! Whatever you do, $n, you can't let him board that zeppelin and get away with all this!$b$bHurry to the zeppelin tower before you miss him!"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '<蘿卡聽你述說追捕史尼佛的原因，臉上浮現著厭惡的表情。>$b$b你的意思是說，這陣子我是被鍊金師下了咒?我真不敢相信我愛上那種大騙子!如果再讓我見到那個偷雞摸狗的小哥布林，我絕對會把他撕成碎片!$b$b達成任務之後，他就會前往奧格瑪城門外的東部飛艇塔!$n，無論如何，你都不能讓他就這樣搭上飛艇逃跑!$b$b趕快前往飛艇塔，不然你會錯失逮到他的機會!', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24576;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死撒爾薩里安。$B$B此任務可於任何難度或任何規模的團隊中完成。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill Sartharion.$B$BThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill Sartharion.$b$bThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",  OLD Details : "『黑曜守護者』撒爾薩里安，守護著暮光飛龍的龍蛋。他居住在黑曜聖所的守護巨龍之間，其位於龍眠神殿下方。$B$B六法議會已經頒布法令，要取撒爾薩里安的命!", Details AC enUS : "Sartharion, the Onyx Guardian, watches over the eggs of the Twilight Dragonflight. He rests within the Obsidian Sanctum in the Chamber of the Aspects underneath Wyrmrest Temple.$B$BThe Council of Six has decreed that Sartharion must die!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Sartharion, the Onyx Guardian, watches over the eggs of the Twilight Dragonflight. He rests within the Obsidian Sanctum in the Chamber of the Aspects underneath Wyrmrest Temple.$b$bThe Council of Six has decreed that Sartharion must die!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Sartharion slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死撒爾薩里安。$b$b此任務可於任何難度或任何規模的團隊中完成。', `Details` = '『黑曜守護者』撒爾薩里安，守護著暮光飛龍的龍蛋。他居住在黑曜聖所的守護巨龍之間，其位於龍眠神殿下方。$b$b六法議會已經頒布法令，要取撒爾薩里安的命!', `Objectivetext1` = '撒爾薩里安 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24579;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死瑪里苟斯。$B$B此任務可於任何難度或任何規模的團隊中完成。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill Malygos.$B$BThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill Malygos.$b$bThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",  OLD Details : "我們的資源遭到濫用了。號稱織法者的瑪里苟斯正在吸取這世上所有的魔法，並且把魔法凝聚在永恆之眼。少了魔法的力量，我們就完蛋了。$B$B$C，該把奧核之戰畫下句點了。六法議會已經下令，要取瑪里苟斯的命!", Details AC enUS : "Our resources are strained. Malygos, the Spell-Weaver, is draining all of the magic out of the world, consolidating it in the Eye of Eternity. Without magic, we are doomed.$B$B$C, the Nexus War must be brought to an end. The Council of Six has decreed that Malygos must die!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Our resources are strained. Malygos, the Spell-Weaver, is draining all of the magic out of the world, consolidating it in the Eye of Eternity. Without magic, we are doomed.$b$b$c, the Nexus War must be brought to an end. The Council of Six has decreed that Malygos must die!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Malygos slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死瑪里苟斯。$b$b此任務可於任何難度或任何規模的團隊中完成。', `Details` = '我們的資源遭到濫用了。號稱織法者的瑪里苟斯正在吸取這世上所有的魔法，並且把魔法凝聚在永恆之眼。少了魔法的力量，我們就完蛋了。$b$b$c，該把奧核之戰畫下句點了。六法議會已經下令，要取瑪里苟斯的命!', `Objectivetext1` = '瑪里苟斯 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24584;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死烈焰戰輪。$B$B此任務可於任何難度或任何規模的團隊中完成。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill Flame Leviathan.$B$BThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill Flame Leviathan.$b$bThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",  OLD Details : "在構築之地坐落著奧杜亞的第一道防線:烈焰戰輪。$B$B祈倫托得到了一個消息，指出這個由守護者製造的機器即將被運送到一個不明的地點，然後放出來毀滅艾澤拉斯上的凡人們。$B$B這種事情不能發生。六法議會已經下令，要取烈焰戰輪的命!", Details AC enUS : "Within the Formation Grounds sits Ulduar's first line of defense: Flame Leviathan.$B$BThe Kirin Tor have been provided with information suggesting that this Keeper-created machine is soon to be transported to an undisclosed location and let loose to wreak havoc upon the mortals of Azeroth.$B$BThis must not come to pass. The Council of Six has decreed that Flame Leviathan must die!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Within the Formation Grounds sits Ulduar's first line of defense: Flame Leviathan.$b$bThe Kirin Tor have been provided with information suggesting that this Keeper-created machine is soon to be transported to an undisclosed location and let loose to wreak havoc upon the mortals of Azeroth.$b$bThis must not come to pass. The Council of Six has decreed that Flame Leviathan must die!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Flame Leviathan slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死烈焰戰輪。$b$b此任務可於任何難度或任何規模的團隊中完成。', `Details` = '在構築之地坐落著奧杜亞的第一道防線:烈焰戰輪。$b$b祈倫托得到了一個消息，指出這個由守護者製造的機器即將被運送到一個不明的地點，然後放出來毀滅艾澤拉斯上的凡人們。$b$b這種事情不能發生。六法議會已經下令，要取烈焰戰輪的命!', `Objectivetext1` = '烈焰戰輪 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24585;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死銳鱗。$B$B此任務可於任何難度或任何規模的團隊中完成。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill Razorscale.$B$BThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill Razorscale.$b$bThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",  OLD Details : "銳鱗通常蟠踞在奧杜亞的巨熔爐附近。然而，最近她一直對著泰坦建築群外頭的地面上噴火。$B$B雖然育母的故事是場悲劇，但是她對北裂境眾生造成的威脅迫在眉睫。六法議會已經下令，要取銳鱗的命!", Details AC enUS : "Razorscale normally keeps to her aerie near the Colossal Forge in Ulduar. Of late, however, she has been spotted reigning fire down upon lands outside of the titan complex.$B$BThough the broodmother's is a sad tale, she poses an imminent threat to all of Northrend. The Council of Six has decreed that Razorscale must die!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Razorscale normally keeps to her aerie near the Colossal Forge in Ulduar. Of late, however, she has been spotted raining fire down upon lands outside of the titan complex.$b$bThough the broodmother's is a sad tale, she poses an imminent threat to all of Northrend. The Council of Six has decreed that Razorscale must die!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Razorscale slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死銳鱗。$b$b此任務可於任何難度或任何規模的團隊中完成。', `Details` = '銳鱗通常蟠踞在奧杜亞的巨熔爐附近。然而，最近她一直對著泰坦建築群外頭的地面上噴火。$b$b雖然育母的故事是場悲劇，但是她對北裂境眾生造成的威脅迫在眉睫。六法議會已經下令，要取銳鱗的命!', `Objectivetext1` = '銳鱗 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24586;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死『火爐之主』伊格尼司。$B$B此任務可於任何難度或任何規模的團隊中完成。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill Ignis the Furnace Master.$B$BThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill Ignis the Furnace Master.$b$bThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",  OLD Details : "偉大的火巨人，『火爐之主』伊格尼司在奧杜亞巨熔爐內辛勤的工作著。在洛肯的命令下，伊格尼司製造的武器有著恐怖的威力。$B$B六法議會已經下令，要取伊格尼司的命!", Details AC enUS : "The great fire giant, Ignis the Furnace Master toils away inside of Ulduar's Colossal Forge. Under orders from Loken, Ignis creates weapons that are terrifying in their power.$B$BThe Council of Six has decreed that Ignis must die!" ; Wowhead enUS : "The great fire giant, Ignis the Furnace Master toils away inside of Ulduar's Colossal Forge. Under orders from Loken, Ignis creates weapons that are terrifying in their power.$b$bThe Council of Six has decreed that Ignis must die!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Ignis the Furnace Master slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死『火爐之主』伊格尼司。$b$b此任務可於任何難度或任何規模的團隊中完成。', `Details` = '偉大的火巨人，『火爐之主』伊格尼司在奧杜亞巨熔爐內辛勤的工作著。在洛肯的命令下，伊格尼司製造的武器有著恐怖的威力。$b$b六法議會已經下令，要取伊格尼司的命!', `Objectivetext1` = '『火爐之主』伊格尼司 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24587;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死XT-002拆解者。$B$B此任務可於任何難度或任何規模的團隊中完成。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill XT-002 Deconstructor.$B$BThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill XT-002 Deconstructor.$b$bThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",  OLD Details : "身為彌米倫的另一個奇作，XT-002拆解者竟然認為它就是守護者之子。別被它天真無邪的偽裝給騙了。它是一台殺人機器!$B$B你可以在奧杜亞的廢料場找到拆解者。六法議會已經下令，要取XT-002拆解者的命!", Details AC enUS : "Yet another strange construct of Mimiron, the XT-002 Deconstructor actually thinks that it is the keeper's son. Do not be fooled by its feigned innocence. It is a deadly machine!$B$BYou will find the Deconstructor within Ulduar's Scrapyard. The Council of Six has decreed that XT-002 Deconstructor must die!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Yet another strange construct of Mimiron, the XT-002 Deconstructor actually thinks that it is the keeper's son. Do not be fooled by its feigned innocence. It is a deadly machine!$b$bYou will find the Deconstructor within Ulduar's Scrapyard. The Council of Six has decreed that XT-002 Deconstructor must die!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "XT-002 Deconstructor slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死XT-002拆解者。$b$b此任務可於任何難度或任何規模的團隊中完成。', `Details` = '身為彌米倫的另一個奇作，XT-002拆解者竟然認為它就是守護者之子。別被它天真無邪的偽裝給騙了。它是一台殺人機器!$b$b你可以在奧杜亞的廢料場找到拆解者。六法議會已經下令，要取XT-002拆解者的命!', `Objectivetext1` = 'XT-002拆解者 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24588;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "殺死賈拉克瑟斯領主。$B$B此任務可於任何難度或任何規模的團隊中完成。", Objectives AC enUS : "Kill Lord Jaraxxus.$B$BThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid." ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill Lord Jaraxxus.$b$bThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",  OLD Details : "大法師泰彌亞預見了一個駭人的事件即將發生。在十字軍試煉中，有一個愚蠢的地精將意外地召喚出燃燒軍團的埃雷達爾領主。$B$B當事情發生的時候你必須在場，$c。如果賈拉克瑟斯領主逃走了，他將會打開傳送門，並且把燃燒軍團再次送進我們的世界。$B$B六法議會已經下令，要取賈拉克瑟斯領主的命!", Details AC enUS : "Archmage Timear has foreseen a horrible event, which is about to transpire. A foolish gnome warlock is about to accidentally summon an Eredar lord of the Burning Legion into the middle of the Trial of the Crusader.$B$BYou must be there when it happens, $c. If Lord Jaraxxus escapes, he will open a portal and the Burning Legion will spill forth into our world once more.$B$BThe Council of Six has decreed that Lord Jaraxxus must die!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Archmage Timear has foreseen a horrible event, which is about to transpire. A foolish gnome warlock is about to accidentally summon an Eredar lord of the Burning Legion into the middle of the Trial of the Crusader.$b$bYou must be there when it happens, $c. If Lord Jaraxxus escapes, he will open a portal and the Burning Legion will spill forth into our world once more.$b$bThe Council of Six has decreed that Lord Jaraxxus must die!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Lord Jaraxxus slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = '殺死賈拉克瑟斯領主。$b$b此任務可於任何難度或任何規模的團隊中完成。', `Details` = '大法師泰彌亞預見了一個駭人的事件即將發生。在十字軍試煉中，有一個愚蠢的地精將意外地召喚出燃燒軍團的埃雷達爾領主。$b$b當事情發生的時候你必須在場，$c。如果賈拉克瑟斯領主逃走了，他將會打開傳送門，並且把燃燒軍團再次送進我們的世界。$b$b六法議會已經下令，要取賈拉克瑟斯領主的命!', `Objectivetext1` = '賈拉克瑟斯領主 消滅', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24589;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "太陽之井和奎爾德拉流浪的終點正等待著你，$n。$B$B你會發現奎爾薩拉斯的攝政王洛索瑪‧塞隆和大博學者洛摩斯站在一起。請提防他們，別讓他們的政治陰謀陷害了你。$B$B反言之，把焦點一直放在你的任務上。當你準備好進入太陽之井高地的時候，請找一名太陽之井守望者談話。然後將奎爾德拉浸泡在太陽之井中來完成復原劍刃的工作。然後回到奎爾德拉之眠，把劍刃拿給米拉連恩‧日炎看。", Details AC enUS : "The Sunwell and the end of Quel'Delar's exile await, $N.$B$BYou will find Lor'themar Theron, the regent of Quel'Thalas, and Grand Magister Rommath standing within. Be wary of them and do not allow them to entrap you in their political scheming.$B$BInstead, remain focused on your task here. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell to enter the Sunwell Plateau. Immerse the reformed Quel'Delar in the Sunwell to complete the restoration. Show the blade to Myralion Sunblaze at Quel'Delar's Rest once it is restored." ; Wowhead enUS : "The Sunwell and the end of Quel'Delar's exile await, $n.$b$bYou will find Lor'themar Theron, the regent of Quel'Thalas, and Grand Magister Rommath standing within. Be wary of them and do not allow them to entrap you in their political scheming.$b$bInstead, remain focused on your task here. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell to enter the Sunwell Plateau. Immerse the reformed Quel'Delar in the Sunwell to complete the restoration. Show the blade to Myralion Sunblaze at Quel'Delar's Rest once it is restored."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '太陽之井和奎爾德拉流浪的終點正等待著你，$n。$b$b你會發現奎爾薩拉斯的攝政王洛索瑪‧塞隆和大博學者洛摩斯站在一起。請提防他們，別讓他們的政治陰謀陷害了你。$b$b反言之，把焦點一直放在你的任務上。當你準備好進入太陽之井高地的時候，請找一名太陽之井守望者談話。然後將奎爾德拉浸泡在太陽之井中來完成復原劍刃的工作。然後回到奎爾德拉之眠，把劍刃拿給米拉連恩‧日炎看。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24594;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "給暴風城國王的禮物", Title AC enUS : "A Gift for the King of Stormwind" ; Wowhead enUS : "A Gift for the Emissary of Stormwind",  OLD Objectives : "將可愛符咒手鐲獻給暴風城的安杜因‧烏瑞恩國王。", Objectives AC enUS : "Present a Lovely Charm Bracelet to King Varian Wrynn in Stormwind." ; Wowhead enUS : "Present a Lovely Charm Bracelet to Emissary Audwin Alston in Stormwind.",  OLD Details : "你想做一個可愛符咒手鐲送給暴風城的國王嗎？我相信他會大吃一驚的。$B$B你已經有可愛符咒收集工具組了嗎？", Details AC enUS : "Did you want to make a Lovely Charm Bracelet for the king of Stormwind? I'm sure he'd be thrilled.$B$BDo you already have a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit?" ; Wowhead enUS : "Did you want to make a Lovely Charm Bracelet for the Emissary of Stormwind? I'm sure he'd be thrilled.$b$bDo you already have a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '給暴風城特使的禮物', `Objectives` = '將可愛符咒手鐲獻給暴風城的特使歐德溫‧艾爾斯頓。', `Details` = '你想為暴風城的特使製作可愛符咒手鐲嗎？我相信他一定會很開心。$b$b你已經有可愛符咒收集工具組了嗎？', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 24597;
