-- AC datas : OLD Details : "你看起來就是一個真正的行動家，$c。想不想一起搞個雙贏的生意？$B$B王冠公司要把節日主題商品的試用品，儘可能地提供給所有的潛在客戶。只要幫我們分享這份愛心，在購買一些優質的王冠公司商品時，就可以享有折扣！$B$B朋友，你出時間，我們賺錢。意下如何？", Details AC enUS : "You look like a real go-getter, $c. How about we work out a little win-win scenario?$B$BCrown's looking to offer samples of our latest holiday-themed products to as many potential customers as possible. Help us share the love, and we'll give you discounts on some great Crown merchandise!$B$BYour time, our money, friend. What do you say?" ; Wowhead enUS : "You look like a real go-getter, $c. How about we work out a little win-win scenario?$b$bCrown's looking to offer samples of our latest holiday-themed products to as many potential customers as possible. Help us share the love, and we'll give you discounts on some great Crown merchandise!$b$bYour time, our money, friend. What do you say?"
