-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "把密封的箱子帶給在冰冠城塞的大領主達瑞安‧莫格萊尼。", Objectives AC enUS : "Bring the Sealed Chest to Highlord Darion Mograine in Icecrown Citadel." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the Sealed Chest to Highlord Darion Mograine in Icecrown Citadel.$b$bProvided item: $b"
